values
  ('716617863186727698', 'Retribution', 2023, 'Thriller, Action, Adventure', 'Flavio Martínez Labiano, Scott Kirby, Dennis Becker', 'Alberto Marini', 'Liam Neeson, Lilly Aspell, Jack Champion, Matthew Modine, Noma Dumezweni, Embeth Davidtz, Arian Moayed, Emily Kusche', 'R', 'When a mysterious caller plants a bomb under his car seat, a bank executive begins a high-speed chase across the city to complete a specific series of tasks — all with his kids trapped in the back seat.', 'When a mysterious caller plants a bomb under his car seat, a bank executive begins a high-speed chase across the city to complete a specific series of tasks — all with his kids trapped in the back seat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oUmmY7QWWn7OhKlcPOnirHJpP1F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:762430'),
  ('551502765062086166', 'Retro', 2025, 'Romance, Action, Drama, Crime', 'Karthik Subbaraj, Shreyaas Krishna, Srinivasan Elangovan', 'Karthik Subbaraj', 'Suriya, Pooja Hegde, Joju George, Jayaram, Vidhu, Nassar, Prakash Raj, Sujith Sankar', 'NR', 'A man with a violent past seeks a fresh start, but the life he left behind resurfaces, forcing him to face old conflicts and redefine his future.', 'A man with a violent past seeks a fresh start, but the life he left behind resurfaces, forcing him to face old conflicts and redefine his future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pJPK57REXsaLydpOPgHwWAQMdqz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1265827'),
  ('887540748928629967', 'Retro Puppetmaster', 1999, 'Horror, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'David DeCoteau, Viorel Sergovici, Cristian Ciurea', 'Neal Marshall Stevens', 'Greg Sestero, Brigitta Dau, Stephen Blackehart, Jack Donner, Guy Rolfe, Robert Radoveanu, Vitalie Bantas, Sando Teodor', 'PG-13', 'Andre Toulon, living a peaceful life as a puppeteer in pre-WWI Paris, encounters the renegade sorcerer Afzel, who has stolen the mysterious secrets of life from the dark god Sutekh.', 'Andre Toulon, living a peaceful life as a puppeteer in pre-WWI Paris, encounters the renegade sorcerer Afzel, who has stolen the mysterious secrets of life from the dark god Sutekh.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6GcFdyBCKyx2zXvoCsrmNUCvpHN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26960'),
  ('442067938491512385', 'Retroactive', 1997, 'Science Fiction, Thriller, Action, Crime, Drama, Adventure', 'Louis Morneau, George Mooradian, Marco Black', 'Michael Hamilton-Wright, Robert Strauss, Phillip Badger', 'Jim Belushi, Kylie Travis, Shannon Whirry, Frank Whaley, Jesse Borrego, M. Emmet Walsh, Roger Clinton, Jr., Sherman Howard', 'R', 'A psychiatrist makes multiple trips through time to save a woman that was murdered by her brutal husband.', 'A psychiatrist makes multiple trips through time to save a woman that was murdered by her brutal husband.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7kOHEXDUTyyQQmI1VES1JofgPbj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26689'),
  ('485764042608292710', 'Retrograde', 2004, 'Action, Science Fiction', 'Christopher Kulikowski', 'Christopher Kulikowski', 'Dolph Lundgren, Silvia De Santis, Joe Montana, Gary Daniels, Joey Sagal, Ken Samuels, David Jean Thomas, Jamie Treacher', 'R', 'Two time travelers with opposing views are sent back to the present aboard a research ship in the Antarctic to prevent a global biological disaster from occuring', 'Two time travelers with opposing views are sent back to the present aboard a research ship in the Antarctic to prevent a global biological disaster from occuring', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9O7V4YN9WRxCeYCr7Hj9ZyU0jzs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38046'),
  ('222469490552975223', 'Retrograde', 2022, 'Documentary, War, History', 'Matthew Heineman, Tim Grucza, Olivier Sarbil', null, 'Sammi Sadat', 'R', 'The story of the last months of the 20-year war in Afghanistan through the intimate relationship between American Green Berets and the Afghan officers they trained.', 'The story of the last months of the 20-year war in Afghanistan through the intimate relationship between American Green Berets and the Afghan officers they trained.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nAGQeVriV1LqAFKdIPr3QxceTJH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1019391'),
  ('436367664654569547', 'Return', null, null, 'Selman Deniz', null, null, null, 'Eyüp decides to cross mount Ararat looking for his aunt in Yerevan after following a madman''s words. His aunt has also been expecting someone to come from behind this mount for many years. Eyüp cannot be sure about the woman he finds behind the blue door, whether it is his aunt or not because they can''t understand each other.', 'Eyüp decides to cross mount Ararat looking for his aunt in Yerevan after following a madman''s words. His aunt has also been expecting someone to come from behind this mount for many years. Eyüp cannot be sure about the woman he finds behind the blue door, whether it is his aunt or not because they can''t understand each other.', null, 'tmdb:movie:733668'),
  ('538887181954729409', 'Return', 1972, 'Drama', 'Arman Manaryan, Roman Zhamgaryan, Levon Atoyants', 'Arnold Aghababov', 'Vladimir Mrsyan, Anait Topchyan, Karen Jangiryan, Hakob Azizyan, Yervand Manaryan, Efim Kopelyan, Paruyr Santrosyan, Stepan Harutyunyan', null, 'The main character of the film is an outstanding physicist who was invited to Armenia from Russia to head a lab. He comes across many troubles in his homeland, but nevertheless finds his true love there.', 'The main character of the film is an outstanding physicist who was invited to Armenia from Russia to head a lab. He comes across many troubles in his homeland, but nevertheless finds his true love there.', null, 'tmdb:movie:1086372'),
  ('172346778458403022', 'Return', 1975, null, 'Bill Viola', 'Bill Viola', 'Bill Viola', null, 'Return is a methodical construction of the approach of an individual towards an unseen goal, which assumes metaphorical significance. Viola moves toward the camera/viewer, pausing every few steps to ring a bell, at which point he is momentarily thrust back to his starting place, and then advanced again. Finally reaching his destination, he is taken through all of the previous stages in a single instant and returned to the source of his journey.', 'Return is a methodical construction of the approach of an individual towards an unseen goal, which assumes metaphorical significance. Viola moves toward the camera/viewer, pausing every few steps to ring a bell, at which point he is momentarily thrust back to his starting place, and then advanced again. Finally reaching his destination, he is taken through all of the previous stages in a single instant and returned to the source of his journey.', null, 'tmdb:movie:357953'),
  ('203431820254995840', 'Return', 1977, 'Drama', 'Ramaz Sharabidze, Givi Rachvelishvili', 'Ramaz Sharabidze, Merab Eliozishvili', 'Zurab Kapianidze, Givi Berikashvili, Ketevan Bochorishvili, Ia Khobua, Radion Khelashvili, Lia Kapanadze, Nestan Kveidze, Olga Janiashvili', null, 'Vazha served his sentence for stealing a cow and returned to the village. Upon his return, he decided to repair the house. His friends promised to help, but then everyone had their own business.', 'Vazha served his sentence for stealing a cow and returned to the village. Upon his return, he decided to repair the house. His friends promised to help, but then everyone had their own business.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vPrl7O49dwa8eB8zbLT48HJz12t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1459059'),
  ('591162835047209922', 'Return', 1985, 'Horror, Fantasy, Romance', 'Andrew Silver', 'Andrew Silver', 'Ariel Aberg-Riger, Lee Stetson, Karlene Crockett, Lenore Zann, Tom Rolapp, Dennis Hoerter, Lisa Blake Richards, Frederic Forrest', null, 'After reading an article about hypnotic regression, a woman whose maternal grandfather died when she was only three years old contacts the hypnotic subject named in the article believing that he is the reincarnation of her grandfather, and hoping that she can learn the truth about how he died.', 'After reading an article about hypnotic regression, a woman whose maternal grandfather died when she was only three years old contacts the hypnotic subject named in the article believing that he is the reincarnation of her grandfather, and hoping that she can learn the truth about how he died.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/54QOkHWUnn3gDZKfGojPiFqTHJD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:403587'),
  ('304402724558540829', 'Return', 2008, 'Animation, Science Fiction', 'Anna Błaszczyk', null, null, null, 'Polish animator Anna Błaszczyk’s humorous short—a collage of drawing, cut-out, and computer animation—was inspired by Stanisław Lem’s 1961 novel Return from the Stars, a time-paradox tale of an astronaut who returns to Earth after many years away.', 'Polish animator Anna Błaszczyk’s humorous short—a collage of drawing, cut-out, and computer animation—was inspired by Stanisław Lem’s 1961 novel Return from the Stars, a time-paradox tale of an astronaut who returns to Earth after many years away.', null, 'tmdb:movie:839321'),
  ('515620216369989686', 'Return', 2011, 'Drama', 'Liza Johnson, Anne Etheridge', 'Liza Johnson', 'Linda Cardellini, Michael Shannon, John Slattery, Talia Balsam, Emma Rayne Lyle, Paul Sparks, Louisa Krause, Rosie Benton', 'NR', 'Back from a tour of duty, Kelli struggles to find her place in her family and the rust-belt town she no longer recognizes.', 'Back from a tour of duty, Kelli struggles to find her place in her family and the rust-belt town she no longer recognizes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xAuR564U2njKKcXSbfbq36rZLeA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82520'),
  ('658223233522031218', 'Return', 2015, 'Drama', 'Haqi Ali', 'Haqi Ali', 'Julie Thursham, Dave Kukadia, Roger Camden, Predentia Dixon, Sarah Gordon, Gary Durrant, Tess Darby, Adrian Varney', null, 'A tale of terror. Cathy Reed has been institutionalized most of her life because of Schizophrenia, as a child her parents thought she was possessed by demons and had her exercised by priests. Medical science saw different. Now decades later Cathy is freed, relocated to her own flat and given a chance to be independent. Once alone things are not what they all seem and when her nightmares turn real she questions her state of mind before she is left to face her demons.', 'A tale of terror. Cathy Reed has been institutionalized most of her life because of Schizophrenia, as a child her parents thought she was possessed by demons and had her exercised by priests. Medical science saw different. Now decades later Cathy is freed, relocated to her own flat and given a chance to be independent. Once alone things are not what they all seem and when her nightmares turn real she questions her state of mind before she is left to face her demons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a3fhJx8oVTC1Mh9QraF1z2K1Wr1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:320367'),
  ('975417565944425866', 'Return', 2017, 'Documentary', 'Huang Pang-chuan, Huang Pang-chuan', 'Huang Pang-chuan', null, null, 'Two journeys take place in two different periods. One is a train journey across two continents. The other follows an old family photograph back to life during wartime. The rhythmic swaying of the train reveals a forgotten memory.', 'Two journeys take place in two different periods. One is a train journey across two continents. The other follows an old family photograph back to life during wartime. The rhythmic swaying of the train reveals a forgotten memory.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vBaWmLT13GtBAGkQUPHlx9nLrq7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:490737'),
  ('344069882014355032', 'Return', 2018, 'Documentary', 'Javier Ríos', null, null, null, 'This is a documentary linking ecological and political problems. The planet has come to be less important than the multinational earnings, and with it politicians earnings as well. With this project we bring foreward this problem, witch not only affects the third world, but is a worldwide situation witch needs to be adressed.', 'This is a documentary linking ecological and political problems. The planet has come to be less important than the multinational earnings, and with it politicians earnings as well. With this project we bring foreward this problem, witch not only affects the third world, but is a worldwide situation witch needs to be adressed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xWjw5JBMuce6Wv33dDUfmzVVaAL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:828508'),
  ('977235641631416087', 'Return', 2020, 'Animation', 'Jonathan Delgado Herrera', null, null, null, 'A single man has worked most of his life in a supermarket. One night, he unexpectedly meets with his father, and the two are faced with the question of the reasons for their separation.', 'A single man has worked most of his life in a supermarket. One night, he unexpectedly meets with his father, and the two are faced with the question of the reasons for their separation.', null, 'tmdb:movie:836466'),
  ('1129420195083072130', 'Return', 2023, 'Documentary', 'Stan Parker, Trần Hồng Quảng, Pete Tolton', null, 'Jim Markel Sr., Jim Markel Jr.', null, 'RETURN tells the story of a retired Green Beret who embarks on a healing journey from Montana to Vietnam. There he retraces his steps, shares his wartime experiences with his son, treats his Post-Traumatic Stress Disorder, and seeks out the mountain tribespeople he once lived with and fought alongside as a Special Forces officer.', 'RETURN tells the story of a retired Green Beret who embarks on a healing journey from Montana to Vietnam. There he retraces his steps, shares his wartime experiences with his son, treats his Post-Traumatic Stress Disorder, and seeks out the mountain tribespeople he once lived with and fought alongside as a Special Forces officer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/opYp1lkbVHVJil8N0c5HRSB5D96.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1091834'),
  ('300870827786069544', 'RETURN', 2024, 'Documentary', 'Torstein Horgmo', 'Torstein Horgmo', 'Torstein Horgmo, Mikey Ciccarelli, Mons Røisland, Brandon Cocard, Brandon Davis, Raibu Katayama, Celia Miller', 'G', '‘RETURN’ follows Torstein Horgmo, Mikey Ciccarelli, Mons Røisland, Brandon Cocard, Brandon Davis, and Raibu Katayama as they push the boundaries of what can be accomplished snowboarding when innovative minds join forces.', '‘RETURN’ follows Torstein Horgmo, Mikey Ciccarelli, Mons Røisland, Brandon Cocard, Brandon Davis, and Raibu Katayama as they push the boundaries of what can be accomplished snowboarding when innovative minds join forces.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qbWCYsz0PTTV468J3bQ8pQBa6KS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1384231'),
  ('231323554762740881', 'Return from Africa', 1973, 'Drama', 'Alain Tanner, Renato Berta', 'Alain Tanner', 'Josée Destoop, François Marthouret, Juliet Berto, Anne Wiazemsky, Roger Ibáñez, Roger Jendly, François Roulet, Séverine Bujard', null, 'A young Swiss couple, Vincent and Françoise, plan to leave Geneva and settle in Africa: a friend of theirs living in Algeria promises to give them a job there.', 'A young Swiss couple, Vincent and Françoise, plan to leave Geneva and settle in Africa: a friend of theirs living in Algeria promises to give them a job there.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tyjQNC38sJridJGEY4lpmV0lLOK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:134252'),
  ('814424987700926786', 'Return from Death: Frankenstein 2000', 1991, 'Horror', 'Joe D''Amato, Joe D''Amato, Filippo Fassetta', 'Michele Soavi', 'Donald O''Brien, Cinzia Monreale, Robin Tazusky, Richard Harsh, Dun Dustman, Mark Frank, Mark Quail, Maurice Poli', null, 'When a woman is beaten into a coma and saved from being raped by her handyman (Donald O''Brien), the local security force does a cover-up to save the town''s reputation and frames the saviour. After he hangs himself, the woman''s strange comatose psi-powers revive him from the dead to exact revenge.', 'When a woman is beaten into a coma and saved from being raped by her handyman (Donald O''Brien), the local security force does a cover-up to save the town''s reputation and frames the saviour. After he hangs himself, the woman''s strange comatose psi-powers revive him from the dead to exact revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6zZKpFuzfO8ELyovhlHpVPNxQgK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3412'),
  ('646138634257710291', 'Return from Orbit', 1984, 'Science Fiction', 'Serhiy Stasenko, Aleksandr Surin', 'Yevgeni Mesyatsev', 'Juozas Budraitis, Vitali Solomin, Aleksandr Porokhovshchikov, Tamara Akulova, Igor Vasilev, Valeri Yurchenko, Mikhail Chigaryov, Lyubov Sokolova', null, 'An accident occurs on an orbital space station, as a result of which the ship''s commander is seriously injured. He must be urgently delivered to Earth and testing must be continued. It can only be done by the crew of Kuznetsov-Mukhin.', 'An accident occurs on an orbital space station, as a result of which the ship''s commander is seriously injured. He must be urgently delivered to Earth and testing must be continued. It can only be done by the crew of Kuznetsov-Mukhin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yen6400kXTObbeUb1SbybvJGUzN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:331791'),
  ('717194067660065475', 'Return from the Ashes', 1965, 'Thriller, Drama', 'J. Lee Thompson, Christopher Challis, Kip Gowans', 'Julius J. Epstein', 'Maximilian Schell, Samantha Eggar, Ingrid Thulin, Herbert Lom, Talitha Pol, Vladek Sheybal, Viviane Ventura, Jacques Cey', 'NR', 'A Jewish woman, Dr. Michele Wolf, interred in a Nazi concentration camp during WWII returns to her Paris home after the war''s end. She''s unaware that her husband, the handsome gigolo and chess master Stanislaw Pilgrin, has been having an affair with her stepdaughter Fabi in her absence.', 'A Jewish woman, Dr. Michele Wolf, interred in a Nazi concentration camp during WWII returns to her Paris home after the war''s end. She''s unaware that her husband, the handsome gigolo and chess master Stanislaw Pilgrin, has been having an affair with her stepdaughter Fabi in her absence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/El4j2xBo33LCGMdaEkrJ3LFCy4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91796'),
  ('452260717583417322', 'Return from the River Kwai', 1989, 'War', 'Andrew V. McLaglen, Arthur Wooster', 'Sargon Tamimi, Paul Mayersberg', 'Edward Fox, George Takei, Chris Penn, Denholm Elliott, Timothy Bottoms, Nick Tate, Richard Graham, Paul Holme', null, 'A group of war prisoners has spilt blood, sweat and tears to construct a bridge over the river Kwai in Thailand. Just when the bridge is ready, an American bomber arrives and destroys it. Camp commander Tanaka wants to set an example and orders that some of the prisoners must be executed. Just in time major Harada arrives with orders that the healthiest prisoners must be transported to Japan by train and boat. A treacherous journey since the allied forces keep a close eye on railroads and practically own the seas.', 'A group of war prisoners has spilt blood, sweat and tears to construct a bridge over the river Kwai in Thailand. Just when the bridge is ready, an American bomber arrives and destroys it. Camp commander Tanaka wants to set an example and orders that some of the prisoners must be executed. Just in time major Harada arrives with orders that the healthiest prisoners must be transported to Japan by train and boat. A treacherous journey since the allied forces keep a close eye on railroads and practically own the seas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xUj8c4yEQrWkj17bwoZARqgc9KM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59487'),
  ('650451537642498457', 'Return from Witch Mountain', 1978, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Science Fiction, Family', 'John Hough, Frank V. Phillips', 'Malcolm Marmorstein', 'Bette Davis, Christopher Lee, Kim Richards, Ike Eisenmann, Jack Soo, Anthony James, Richard Bakalyan, Ward Costello', 'G', 'Tony and Tia are other-worldly twins endowed with telekinesis. When their Uncle Bene drops them off in Los Angeles for an earthbound vacation, a display of their supernatural skill catches the eye of the nefarious Dr. Gannon and his partner in crime, Letha, who see rich possibilities in harnessing the children''s gifts. They kidnap Tony, and Tia gives chase only to find Gannon is using her brother''s powers against her.', 'Tony and Tia are other-worldly twins endowed with telekinesis. When their Uncle Bene drops them off in Los Angeles for an earthbound vacation, a display of their supernatural skill catches the eye of the nefarious Dr. Gannon and his partner in crime, Letha, who see rich possibilities in harnessing the children''s gifts. They kidnap Tony, and Tia gives chase only to find Gannon is using her brother''s powers against her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2bnmbL5YkqfR3OkQRzgoCf3vs4V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14822'),
  ('603026002456706859', 'Return in Red', 2007, 'Horror', 'Tyler Tharpe', 'Tyler Tharpe', 'J.J. Huckin, Amy Paliganoff, Keelan Rushing, Linda McCormick, Becky Niccum, Michael Ray Reed', 'R', 'Certain electromagnetic frequencies can cause mental disruption in human beings... and now someone has decided to put that to the test on the people of a small town. Used as guinea pigs, the citizens find their lives turned upside down in a terrifying nightmare that will haunt your mind long after the chilling climax.', 'Certain electromagnetic frequencies can cause mental disruption in human beings... and now someone has decided to put that to the test on the people of a small town. Used as guinea pigs, the citizens find their lives turned upside down in a terrifying nightmare that will haunt your mind long after the chilling climax.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sbuxjd9Y6dTTTBZCPrBRH6Q4ih9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69773'),
  ('46430427794649395', 'Return of Bastard Swordsman', 1984, 'Action', 'Tony Lou Chun-Ku, Philip Ma Kam-Cheung', 'Tony Lou Chun-Ku, Cheung Kwok-Yuen', 'Norman Tsui Siu-Keung, Alex Man Chi-Leung, Tony Liu Tian-jue, Chen Kuan-Tai, Eddie Koo Koon Chung, Leanne Liu, Chiang Tao, Lau Siu-Kwan', null, 'Wudang is in trouble again, with both Dugu Wu Di planning to attack the Wudang temple and an interloping group of martial artists from Japan waiting in the background.', 'Wudang is in trouble again, with both Dugu Wu Di planning to attack the Wudang temple and an interloping group of martial artists from Japan waiting in the background.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l8wbRCR7rXOLYTFgNjzz2ZuLzqV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107714'),
  ('694646892209230914', 'Return of Brownie', 1987, 'Animation', 'Aida Zyablikova', 'Marina Vishnevetskaya', 'Georgiy Vitsin, Tatyana Pelttser, Svetlana Travkina, Georgiy Gorbachyov, Grigory Bolshakov, Andrei Kryukov', null, 'It is the last film in series "Little Brownie Kuzya".', 'It is the last film in series "Little Brownie Kuzya".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tJqEv7LFT76HdNOLSc8Wo8qV93Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:469450'),
  ('931378425641459473', 'Return of Giant Majin', 1966, 'Drama, Fantasy, Horror', 'Kenji Misumi, Shozo Tanaka, Fujio Morita', 'Tetsurō Yoshida', 'Kōjirō Hongō, Shiho Fujimura, Taro Marui, Takashi Kanda, Kōji Fujiyama, Chikara Hashimoto, Sei Hiraizumi, Jutarō Hōjō', 'PG', 'The tyrannical Lord Danjo Mikoshiba covets the rich, fertile lands surrounding Lake Yakumo. During a memorial ceremony for the late Chigusa lord, Mikoshiba launches an attack, overthrowing the honorable Lord Juro. Just when all seems lost, Daimajin rises from Lake Yakumo to settle a score of his own.', 'The tyrannical Lord Danjo Mikoshiba covets the rich, fertile lands surrounding Lake Yakumo. During a memorial ceremony for the late Chigusa lord, Mikoshiba launches an attack, overthrowing the honorable Lord Juro. Just when all seems lost, Daimajin rises from Lake Yakumo to settle a score of his own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x2roQy33sv5Bv203RxJnoVEcN1e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28857'),
  ('1009416650179908878', 'Return Of Hanuman', 2007, 'Animation, Family, Action, Adventure', 'Anurag Kashyap', null, 'Malak Shah, Suraj, Akshatha, Archie Maitra, Aditya Rao, Ayesha Raza Mishra, Pratibha Sharma, Rajeev Raj', null, 'A young boy, Minku, ridiculed by his friends, begs the gods to send him down to Earth, and his wish is granted.', 'A young boy, Minku, ridiculed by his friends, begs the gods to send him down to Earth, and his wish is granted.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sBPYBOiyYnlCZdTKZvi4FLdWFh6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117361'),
  ('570608647566840261', 'Return of Punch and Judy', 2023, 'Horror', 'Ben J. Williams, Louisa Warren', 'Sam Bentham', 'Chris Cordell, Samantha Cull, Ben J. Williams, Mike Kelson, Fiona Thompson, Christabel Clark, Stella Segalerba, Susan Lee Burton', null, 'Val, plagued with memories of the past, becomes convinced that a demon entity has possessed her puppets "Punch and Judy." She becomes sick, and her family thinks that she is close to death and losing her mind. Celebrating Val''s birthday, the family begins to disappear, and those that remain have horrifying experiences with the puppets- and they soon learn the true story of Punch and Judy.', 'Val, plagued with memories of the past, becomes convinced that a demon entity has possessed her puppets "Punch and Judy." She becomes sick, and her family thinks that she is close to death and losing her mind. Celebrating Val''s birthday, the family begins to disappear, and those that remain have horrifying experiences with the puppets- and they soon learn the true story of Punch and Judy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qAzn9ZOK518mUq4MVnjO1D1RYOC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1006769'),
  ('153460213175128027', 'Return of Sabata', 1971, 'Western', 'Gianfranco Parolini, Sandro Mancori, Ignazio Dolce', 'Gianfranco Parolini, Renato Izzo', 'Lee Van Cleef, Reiner Schöne, Giampiero Albertini, Ignazio Spalla, Annabella Incontrera, Vassili Karis, Steffen Zacharias, John Bartha', null, 'Master gunslinger Sabata arrives in Hobsonville, a town completely owned by McIntock, a robber baron who is taxing the inhabitants for the cost of future improvements to the town. Or that''s what McIntock says he''ll do with the money...', 'Master gunslinger Sabata arrives in Hobsonville, a town completely owned by McIntock, a robber baron who is taxing the inhabitants for the cost of future improvements to the town. Or that''s what McIntock says he''ll do with the money...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dI2IU9a69lk7DwJ2aAsbDoNOfuX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72032'),
  ('1080735972459067279', 'Return of Special Forces 5', 2021, 'Action', 'Jie Hou', null, 'Fu Chengpeng, Zhao Xun, Sun Anqi, Yang Tongshu, Emile Amro, Fei Liqi, Lan Sun, Wang Guanqi', null, 'After Long Wei and his men finished their operation in Fuji, they received a distress message from his ex-wife, Leng Yun. Long Wei immediately rushes to Southeast Asia alone to look for his ex-wife. With his excellent ability to fight alone, Long Wei and his daughter break through all the dangers they encounter one by one, will they be able to rescue his ex-wife successfully?', 'After Long Wei and his men finished their operation in Fuji, they received a distress message from his ex-wife, Leng Yun. Long Wei immediately rushes to Southeast Asia alone to look for his ex-wife. With his excellent ability to fight alone, Long Wei and his daughter break through all the dangers they encounter one by one, will they be able to rescue his ex-wife successfully?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uuueIYuCc8g4cTn0XxxnAUZbqfP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:865921'),
  ('63039195510111938', 'Return of the 18 Bronzemen', 1976, 'Action, Adventure, War', 'Joseph Kuo, Chiang Nan, Chien Chin', 'Kwok Ting-Hung', 'Carter Huang Chia-Ta, Tien Peng, Cheung Mei-Yee, Chang Pao-Shan, Chiu Ting, Polly Shang-Kuan Ling-Feng, Ko Yu-Min, Chen Chiu', null, 'Despite the national resistance, the Manchurians have taken over China, but the Ching Emperor fears that the Shaolin Temple disciples would overthrow the dynasty. So he disguises himself as a disciple, in order to become a kung fu master and control the Shaolin monks. But according to custom, he must pass the test of the legendary 18 Bronzemen before he can leave the Temple.', 'Despite the national resistance, the Manchurians have taken over China, but the Ching Emperor fears that the Shaolin Temple disciples would overthrow the dynasty. So he disguises himself as a disciple, in order to become a kung fu master and control the Shaolin monks. But according to custom, he must pass the test of the legendary 18 Bronzemen before he can leave the Temple.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lb0SurPQqNbzW7HaCYYcCBTzzW8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64267'),
