  ('65271987330717867', 'Return of the Dead', 1979, 'Horror, Fantasy', 'Li Han-Hsiang', 'Li Han-Hsiang', 'Choh Seung-Wan, Ku Feng, Chan Wai-Ying, Chun Wong, Lau Luk-Wah, Lau Wai-Ling, Elliot Ngok Wah, Si Wai', null, 'Three inmates in an asylum tell their stories. Story 1, a husband and wife discover they should be careful what they wish for. Story 2, a naked female ghost gets revenge from her watery grave. Story 3, a dead prostitute returns as a ghost.', 'Three inmates in an asylum tell their stories. Story 1, a husband and wife discover they should be careful what they wish for. Story 2, a naked female ghost gets revenge from her watery grave. Story 3, a dead prostitute returns as a ghost.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eKkJVP0ZTGQ0yJu1cBAIbiLQN8h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:178121'),
