  ('243737911230357769', 'Return of the Islander', 1970, 'Documentary', 'Alan Blowey, Val Ennis, James Mulkerns', 'James Mulkerns', 'Richard Harris, Michael Conneely, Maura Burke, Diarmuid O. Goill, Maire Dirrane, Riobard O. Goill, Mairtin Sharry', null, 'Through economic necessity, an Aran Islander is forced to travel to England to work on building sites so that he can earn money to support his family back on the Islands.', 'Through economic necessity, an Aran Islander is forced to travel to England to work on building sites so that he can earn money to support his family back on the Islands.', null, 'tmdb:movie:295913'),
