  ('858753690271604940', 'Return of the King: The Fall and Rise of Elvis Presley', 2024, 'Documentary, Music', 'Jason Hehir', 'Jason Hehir', 'Elvis Presley, Priscilla Presley, Darlene Love, Jerry Schilling, Bruce Springsteen, Billy Corgan, Conan O''Brien, Baz Luhrmann', 'R', 'He had one chance to show the world he was still the King of Rock ''n'' Roll. Discover the story behind Elvis Presley''s triumphant ''68 comeback special.', 'He had one chance to show the world he was still the King of Rock ''n'' Roll. Discover the story behind Elvis Presley''s triumphant ''68 comeback special.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eijfr4QiMu1ZK2XfBNd9KjoRmau.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1372795'),
  ('831736005156857280', 'Return of the Kung Fu Dragon', 1978, 'Action, Fantasy', 'Yu Chik-Lim, Wong Chun', 'Ge-Sun Lee', 'Li Chung-Chien, Chan Sing, Nick Cheung Lik, Tao Chen, Wen Ho Chen, Ma Li Chu, Yeung Fong, Hsiao Wang', null, 'The complicated story involves the military conquest of a peaceful island-nation by an evil despot and his sorcerer ally. His victory leaves the island''s three heroic protectors dead, but, their young children are hidden away to grow to adulthood with different identities, unaware of their heritage, in hope that, in time, they might challenge and defeat the evil ruler. The charming Polly Kuan stars as one of these children who has been adopted by the conquerer himself, initially as an insult to the defeated hero, later as his protégé.', 'The complicated story involves the military conquest of a peaceful island-nation by an evil despot and his sorcerer ally. His victory leaves the island''s three heroic protectors dead, but, their young children are hidden away to grow to adulthood with different identities, unaware of their heritage, in hope that, in time, they might challenge and defeat the evil ruler. The charming Polly Kuan stars as one of these children who has been adopted by the conquerer himself, initially as an insult to the defeated hero, later as his protégé.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4g0lLrwxBiXeDUURaEUEb6rO7vO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:129456'),
  ('690805444471564938', 'Return of the Living Dead III', 1993, 'Horror, Romance', 'Gerry Lively, Brian Yuzna, Gary Schmoeller', 'John Penney', 'Melinda Clarke, J. Trevor Edmond, Kent McCord, Sarah Douglas, James T. Callahan, Basil Wallace, Mike Moroff, Julian Scott Urena', 'R', 'Having recently witnessed the horrific results of a top secret project to bring the dead back to life, a distraught teenager performs the operation on his girlfriend after she''s killed in a motorcycle accident.', 'Having recently witnessed the horrific results of a top secret project to bring the dead back to life, a distraught teenager performs the operation on his girlfriend after she''s killed in a motorcycle accident.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lu4Eit7pR5I8hGHJmy3K9Re8FPo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28260'),
  ('232830057657513059', 'Return of the Living Dead Part II', 1988, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Robert Elswit, Ken Wiederhorn, William M. Elvin', 'Ken Wiederhorn', 'Michael Kenworthy, Thor Van Lingen, Jason Hogan, James Karen, Thom Mathews, Suzanne Snyder, Marsha Dietlein, Hanala Sagal', 'R', 'A group of kids discover one of the drums containing a rotting corpse and release the 2-4-5 Trioxin gas into the air, causing the dead to once again rise from the grave and seek out brains.', 'A group of kids discover one of the drums containing a rotting corpse and release the 2-4-5 Trioxin gas into the air, causing the dead to once again rise from the grave and seek out brains.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2zY8kt1HnQ8p8mjKcqBp9yQEC8x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24929'),
  ('928861521722498345', 'Return of the Living Dead: Necropolis', 2005, 'Action, Horror, TV Movie', 'Ellory Elkayem, Gabriel Kosuth, Adrian Conerth', 'William Butler, Aaron Strongoni', 'Aimee-Lynn Chadwick, Cory Hardrict, John Keefe, Jana Kramer, Peter Coyote, Elvin Dandel, Alexandru Geoana, Toma Dănilă', null, 'In an attempt to rescue their friend from an evil corporation, a group of teenagers end up releasing a horde of bloodthirsty zombies.', 'In an attempt to rescue their friend from an evil corporation, a group of teenagers end up releasing a horde of bloodthirsty zombies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yJZZthnvnJ7l4kMWud9BpTvopdn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24935'),
  ('1117830478299649903', 'Return of the Living Dead: Rave to the Grave', 2005, 'Action, Horror, TV Movie', 'Ellory Elkayem, Cornelia Stefan, Toni Cartu', 'William Butler, Aaron Strongoni', 'John Keefe, Jenny Mollen, Cory Hardrict, Aimee-Lynn Chadwick, Peter Coyote, Claudiu Bleonţ, Sorin Cociș, Jace Manoli', 'R', 'A student creates and sells a drug called ''Z'' which has the unexpected side effect of resurrecting the dead as flesh-eating zombies, who proceed to wreak havoc at a Halloween rave.', 'A student creates and sells a drug called ''Z'' which has the unexpected side effect of resurrecting the dead as flesh-eating zombies, who proceed to wreak havoc at a Halloween rave.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dDmrNvttYmbRT3sZbiCXDmXvyyf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24939'),
  ('637997693053164003', 'Return of the Lucky Stars', 1989, 'Comedy, Action', 'Stanley Fung Shui-Fan, Cub Chin Kong-Hon, David Choi Wa-Sing', 'Stanley Fung Shui-Fan, Wong Jing', 'Richard Ng Yiu-Hon, Eric Tsang Chi-Wai, Stanley Fung Shui-Fan, Michael Miu Kiu-Wai, Carina Lau, Lo Hoi-Pang, Joan Tong Lai-Kau, Wong Ching', null, 'Hong Kong Police Supt. Walter Tso arrests Big Dai, the reformed leader of a criminal corporation. When Dai asked his brother Richard Mao to turn himself in to the police, he betrays him and decides to take over the corporation. Dai is imprisoned and an informant is murdered by one of Mao''s men. With no evidence against Mao and the corporation, Tso coerced four of the "Five Lucky Stars" to go undercover in the prison, rescue Dai, and help nab Mao and bring down the corporation', 'Hong Kong Police Supt. Walter Tso arrests Big Dai, the reformed leader of a criminal corporation. When Dai asked his brother Richard Mao to turn himself in to the police, he betrays him and decides to take over the corporation. Dai is imprisoned and an informant is murdered by one of Mao''s men. With no evidence against Mao and the corporation, Tso coerced four of the "Five Lucky Stars" to go undercover in the prison, rescue Dai, and help nab Mao and bring down the corporation', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3LxmDIOVbuYFXWs8aXhwRPAKNWC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63031'),
  ('970286136578426481', 'Return of the Mafia', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Jeong Yong-ki', 'Son Geun-joo, Chung Tae-won', 'Jung Jun-ho, Kim Min-joung, Sung Dong-il, Yoo Dong-geun, Park Keun-hyong, Park Sang-wook, Kim Do-young, Yoon Doo-joon', null, '10 years ago, the mafia family Three-J welcomed into their family Dae-suh, the graduate of a prestigious university and a successful entrepreneur. 10 years later, the Three-J clan leaves their calling as a mafia family and takes a sound path in life, establishing construction company. However, the circle of trust is breached when Dae-suh, and not the three brothers of Three-J clan, becomes the president of the company. Threatened that he might take over the entire company later on, the three brothers plot an conspiracy against Dae-suh, just like 10 years ago when they tried to get Dae-suh to marry their sister.', '10 years ago, the mafia family Three-J welcomed into their family Dae-suh, the graduate of a prestigious university and a successful entrepreneur. 10 years later, the Three-J clan leaves their calling as a mafia family and takes a sound path in life, establishing construction company. However, the circle of trust is breached when Dae-suh, and not the three brothers of Three-J clan, becomes the president of the company. Threatened that he might take over the entire company later on, the three brothers plot an conspiracy against Dae-suh, just like 10 years ago when they tried to get Dae-suh to marry their sister.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3DRUtAxc6vPeo4dafojY38rwNWU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:249826'),
  ('165621428246407126', 'Return of the One-Armed Swordsman', 1969, 'Action, Adventure', 'Chang Cheh, Wu Ma, Kung Mu-To', 'Chang Cheh', 'Jimmy Wang Yu, Lisa Chiao Chiao, Essie Lin Chia, Tsung Hua, Cheng Lui, Hoh Ban, Tien Feng, Ku Feng', null, 'Eight demon swordsmen and their gang have spread menace across many sword teaching schools. The students seek the help of Fang who alone can combat them. Will Fang take up the challenge.', 'Eight demon swordsmen and their gang have spread menace across many sword teaching schools. The students seek the help of Fang who alone can combat them. Will Fang take up the challenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qupi6LGWSMSTaZHWPYUyAyVplLx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48300'),
  ('166168066809505554', 'Return of the Prodigal Son', 1976, 'Drama, Music', 'Youssef Chahine, Farouk Beloufa, Asmaa El Bakry', 'Youssef Chahine, Farouk Beloufa', 'Hesham Selim, Majida El Roumi, Ahmed Mehrez, Shoukry Sarhan, Huda Sultan, Mahmoud El Meligy, Soheir El Morshedy, Sid Ali Kouiret', null, 'Freed after spending years in prison, an activist''s homecoming turns into a dark affair as his disillusion clashes with his family''s expectations. Demonstrating Chahine’s eclecticism, this is an elegant melodrama, exuberant musical, layered allegory, and profound portrait of personal and political disillusionment.', 'Freed after spending years in prison, an activist''s homecoming turns into a dark affair as his disillusion clashes with his family''s expectations. Demonstrating Chahine’s eclecticism, this is an elegant melodrama, exuberant musical, layered allegory, and profound portrait of personal and political disillusionment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/LjVHoJvHEaAiK7TgPra8hW6fjM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115233'),
  ('920376391096819072', 'Return of the Scarlet Pimpernel', 1937, 'Action, Romance', 'Hanns Schwarz', 'Lajos Biró, Adrian Brunel, Arthur Wimperis', 'Barry K. Barnes, Sophie Stewart, Margaretta Scott, James Mason, Francis Lister, Anthony Bushell, Patrick Barr, John Abbott', null, 'Sir Percy is forced to return to France one last time, to rescue his wife from the clutches of the sinister Robespierre. It''s clearly a trap, but nothing will keep the good Pimpernel from carrying out his mission.', 'Sir Percy is forced to return to France one last time, to rescue his wife from the clutches of the sinister Robespierre. It''s clearly a trap, but nothing will keep the good Pimpernel from carrying out his mission.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iVHWOVqCTNpdaG18CYX8MVOj8A4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:207662'),
  ('8856384705628336', 'Return of the Secaucus Seven', 1980, 'Drama', 'John Sayles, Austin De Besche', 'John Sayles', 'Bruce MacDonald, Maggie Renzi, Adam LeFevre, Maggie Cousineau, Gordon Clapp, Jean Passanante, Karen Trott, Mark Arnott', null, 'Seven former college friends, along with a few new friends, gather for a weekend reunion at a summer house in New Hampshire to reminisce about the good old days, when they got arrested on the way to a protest in Washington, D.C.', 'Seven former college friends, along with a few new friends, gather for a weekend reunion at a summer house in New Hampshire to reminisce about the good old days, when they got arrested on the way to a protest in Washington, D.C.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bBo5W9RcFZepBDU6NZL0z8ycNyt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42750'),
  ('754302002522064303', 'Return of the Sentimental Swordsman', 1981, 'Action, Drama', 'Chor Yuen, Wong Chit', 'Chor Yuen', 'Ti Lung, Alexander Fu Sheng, Derek Yee, Ching Li, Lo Lieh, Ku Feng, Choh Seung-Wan, Eddie Koo Koon Chung', null, 'Li Xunhuan comes back to his home after three years of wandering. He had decided to have a normal life, but a group of skilled martial arts fighters and leaders are bent on killing him, so they can be ranked top by Bai Xiaosheng in his renowned list of the best warriors in the martial arts world. Li Xunhuan battles them as he searches for his estranged friend A''fei, who is now married and living in seclusion. Li asks A''fei to join forces and fight against a new threat that wants to rule the world: the Money Clan.', 'Li Xunhuan comes back to his home after three years of wandering. He had decided to have a normal life, but a group of skilled martial arts fighters and leaders are bent on killing him, so they can be ranked top by Bai Xiaosheng in his renowned list of the best warriors in the martial arts world. Li Xunhuan battles them as he searches for his estranged friend A''fei, who is now married and living in seclusion. Li asks A''fei to join forces and fight against a new threat that wants to rule the world: the Money Clan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lQjmt2zdalYueGJwBYFhKoIJpwo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:179631'),
  ('516418068586208737', 'Return of the Seven', 1966, 'Western', 'Burt Kennedy, Paul Vogel, José López Rodero', 'Larry Cohen', 'Yul Brynner, Robert Fuller, Julián Mateos, Warren Oates, Claude Akins, Elisa Montés, Fernando Rey, Emilio Fernández', 'NR', 'Chico, one of the remaining members of The Magnificent Seven, now lives in the town that they (The Seven) helped. One day someone comes and takes most of the men prisoner. His wife seeks out Chris, the leader of The Seven for help. Chris also meets Vin another member of The Seven. They find four other men and they go to help Chico.', 'Chico, one of the remaining members of The Magnificent Seven, now lives in the town that they (The Seven) helped. One day someone comes and takes most of the men prisoner. His wife seeks out Chris, the leader of The Seven for help. Chris also meets Vin another member of The Seven. They find four other men and they go to help Chico.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xO3cPFFzXa7zZ704dOwgws5duFK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12639'),
  ('1146733925271608282', 'Return of the Street Fighter', 1974, 'Action, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Shigehiro Ozawa, Kazuo Noda, Sadaji Yoshida', 'Hajime Takaiwa, Shigehiro Ozawa', 'Sonny Chiba, Yōko Ichiji, Hiroshi Tanaka, Masashi Ishibashi, Claude Gagnon, Kazuyuki Saito, Keisuke Handa, Ryoichi Koike', null, 'Martial artist Takuma Tsurugi returns to take on a Yakuza family that may be embezzling money from charities to finance their own operations. Both the police and the Yakuza find themselves battling Tsurugi, but Tsurugi''s fight ultimately is with the mob, and he concentrates on them.', 'Martial artist Takuma Tsurugi returns to take on a Yakuza family that may be embezzling money from charities to finance their own operations. Both the police and the Yakuza find themselves battling Tsurugi, but Tsurugi''s fight ultimately is with the mob, and he concentrates on them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7JnWHCgLmpKEkdCdAZZQnLS2CjE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40812'),
  ('654368256253490087', 'Return of the Tooth Fairy', 2020, 'Horror', 'Simon James Anderson, Louisa Warren', 'Tom Jolliffe', 'Jake Watkins, Katie McKenna, Gus Fithen, Chelsea Greenwood, Simon Manley, AJ Blackwell, Venetia Cook, Amy Blackthorne', null, 'The Tooth Fairy is back. 15 years after the events of the first movie, Corey, now grown up but mentally scarred has gone to a class reunion. However, the Tooth Fairy is back, and this time - You better have flossed properly.', 'The Tooth Fairy is back. 15 years after the events of the first movie, Corey, now grown up but mentally scarred has gone to a class reunion. However, the Tooth Fairy is back, and this time - You better have flossed properly.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n8XFS2FVStaBPS2vLqUuH2bAjVf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:708336'),
