  ('89632770281521519', 'Return Ticket', 1997, 'Drama', 'György Illés, György Palásthy', 'György Palásthy', 'Gábor Agárdy, Imre Sinkovits, György Bárdy, Zoltán Gera, Ervin Kibédi, Loránd Lohinszky, István Sztankay, Tibor Gáspár', null, 'Five old men and a kid are travelling in a train''s cabin without purpose. They travel because it''s free and they don''t have another place to stay. From their conversations we learn the tragedies of their lives. Also the hidden interlockings of their faith will out slowly.', 'Five old men and a kid are travelling in a train''s cabin without purpose. They travel because it''s free and they don''t have another place to stay. From their conversations we learn the tragedies of their lives. Also the hidden interlockings of their faith will out slowly.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fU1wodV3btZF61Z9uCQk8IBZs7A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:479669'),
  ('773274634860771147', 'Return Ticket', 2011, 'Drama', 'Teng Yung-Shing', 'Elsa Yang, Teng Yung-Shing, Qin Hailu', 'Qin Hailu, Tang Qun, Li Bin Bin', null, 'All the way, Cao Li has come alone. From Fuyang to Shenzhen. From Shenzhen to Shanghai. From Shanghai to home? Leaving hometown is her choice, the choice out of no choice. Returning home is her dream, the dream getting blinded by the neon lights in the city.--', 'All the way, Cao Li has come alone. From Fuyang to Shenzhen. From Shenzhen to Shanghai. From Shanghai to home? Leaving hometown is her choice, the choice out of no choice. Returning home is her dream, the dream getting blinded by the neon lights in the city.--', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oJ7IeI3NjhJWVsxEO06jrmMzc6w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:263003'),
  ('142494193148103682', 'Return to a Better Tomorrow', 1994, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Wong Jing, Cheng Siu-Keung', 'Wong Jing', 'Sean Lau Ching-wan, Ekin Cheng Yee-Kin, Chingmy Yau Suk-Ching, Ben Lam Kwok-Bun, Collin Chou, James Wong Jim, Michael Wong, Paul Chun Pui', null, 'An adventure that delves into the dark caverns of the underworld and tells the tale of three chivalrous gangsters who attempt to escape the powerful clutch of their gang leader.', 'An adventure that delves into the dark caverns of the underworld and tells the tale of three chivalrous gangsters who attempt to escape the powerful clutch of their gang leader.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y8aPlCJmAK4v3H2Aqju2ebH9Xha.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45508'),
  ('1088834034278988485', 'Return to Aztlán', 1990, 'Drama, History', 'Juan Mora Catlett, Toni Kuhn', 'Juan Mora Catlett', 'Rodrigo Puebla, Rafael Cortés, Socorro Avelar, Soledad Ruíz, Amado Zumaya, Marco Antonio Novelo, José Chávez, Martín Palomares', null, 'When King Motecuzoma dies in 1468, a drought sets upon the Mexicas'' land. The younger Motecuzoma sends a retinue to collect tributes from the peasants and make an offering to Coatlicue at Aztlán, the home of their ancestors. The peasant Ollin finds a discarded tribute and makes his own journey to Aztlán to appease his rulers.', 'When King Motecuzoma dies in 1468, a drought sets upon the Mexicas'' land. The younger Motecuzoma sends a retinue to collect tributes from the peasants and make an offering to Coatlicue at Aztlán, the home of their ancestors. The peasant Ollin finds a discarded tribute and makes his own journey to Aztlán to appease his rulers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hFUnF2BL0ep8KJcfAUCkuLc3Lxa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:261202'),
  ('91247432448256508', 'Return to Boggy Creek', 1977, 'Adventure, Mystery, Family, Horror', 'Tom Moore', 'John David Woody', 'Dawn Wells, Dana Plato, David Sobiesk, Ray Gaspard, Marcus Claudel', 'PG', 'Three children and two adults become trapped in the woods during a hurricane and it is up to a Bigfoot-like creature called ''Big Bay-Ty'' to come to their rescue.', 'Three children and two adults become trapped in the woods during a hurricane and it is up to a Bigfoot-like creature called ''Big Bay-Ty'' to come to their rescue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2FAyhCbx2x735gM10aVhTY7kryi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:283885'),
  ('494209702636702998', 'Return to Bollene', 2018, 'Drama', 'Saïd Hamich', 'Saïd Hamich', 'Saïd Benchnafa, Kate Colebrook, Anas El Baz, Bénédicte-Lala Ernoult, Jamila Charik, Lamia Menioui', null, 'Nassim, in his early thirties, lives in Abu Dhabi with his American fiancée, Elisabeth. After several years of absence, he returns with her to Bollene, a town in the South of France where he grew up. But Nassim must face his past: a dead city now governed by the far right party, a complex relationship with his family, and a father, he no longer speaks to.', 'Nassim, in his early thirties, lives in Abu Dhabi with his American fiancée, Elisabeth. After several years of absence, he returns with her to Bollene, a town in the South of France where he grew up. But Nassim must face his past: a dead city now governed by the far right party, a complex relationship with his family, and a father, he no longer speaks to.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6GcrMunEAmWZlPIY0sJs62OGPf0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:483489'),
  ('226032762138469024', 'Return to Cabin by the Lake', 2001, 'Mystery, Horror, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Leong Po-Chih, Stephen M. Katz', 'Jeffrey Reddick', 'Judd Nelson, Brian Krause, Dahlia Salem, Claudette Mink, JR Bourne, Andrew Moxham, Kandyse McClure, Will Sanderson', null, 'Murderous screenwriter Stanley Caldwell, who incidentally is thought to be dead, returns to the scenes of his crimes.', 'Murderous screenwriter Stanley Caldwell, who incidentally is thought to be dead, returns to the scenes of his crimes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aPbcJT5V5OdAhMT4aMd8Z0bU9Mq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30781'),
  ('79962857301275696', 'Return to Campus', 1975, 'Comedy', 'Harold Cornsweet', 'Harold Cornsweet', 'John Barner, Robert Gutin, Tom Harmon, Norma Joseph, Earl Keyes, Helen Killinger, Connie O''Connell, Arnold Palmer', null, 'A 55-year-old former high school football player finally gets to fulfill his life-long dream and play in the big game in this autobiographical fantasy.', 'A 55-year-old former high school football player finally gets to fulfill his life-long dream and play in the big game in this autobiographical fantasy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xIUnLh4bU4GvdO3JqvTFrU2adgT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:622521'),
  ('487429767399061591', 'Return to Christmas Creek', 2018, 'Romance, Family, TV Movie', 'Don McBrearty, Russ Goozee', null, 'Tori Anderson, Stephen Huszar, Steven Weber, Kari Matchett, Byron Abalos, Janet Porter, Zach Smadu, Stuart Hughes', null, 'As Christmas approaches, Amelia Hughes, a career-focused Chicago app developer lacking in holiday spirit, returns to her small hometown of Christmas Creek to rediscover the meaning of Christmas. There, she reunites with her childhood best friend Mike and her estranged uncle Harry, whose mysterious rift with Amelia’s father divided her family during the holiday season when she was a child.', 'As Christmas approaches, Amelia Hughes, a career-focused Chicago app developer lacking in holiday spirit, returns to her small hometown of Christmas Creek to rediscover the meaning of Christmas. There, she reunites with her childhood best friend Mike and her estranged uncle Harry, whose mysterious rift with Amelia’s father divided her family during the holiday season when she was a child.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gCdjZCWM9x9vAbtkvZiIIYL7tOB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:554279'),
  ('919688676297673379', 'Return to Dust', 2022, 'Drama, Romance', 'Wang Weihua, Daiqing Li, Li Ruijun', 'Li Ruijun', 'Wu Renlin, Hai Qing, Yang Guangrui, Dengfeng Zhao, Cailan Wang, Jiangui Zeng, Wu Yunzhi, Zhanhong Ma', 'NR', 'Humble, unassuming Ma and timid Cao have been cast off by their families and forced into an arranged marriage. They have to combine their strength and build a home to survive. In the face of much adversity, an unexpected bond begins to blossom, as both Ma and Cao, uniting with Earth''s cycles, create a haven for themselves in which they can thrive.', 'Humble, unassuming Ma and timid Cao have been cast off by their families and forced into an arranged marriage. They have to combine their strength and build a home to survive. In the face of much adversity, an unexpected bond begins to blossom, as both Ma and Cao, uniting with Earth''s cycles, create a haven for themselves in which they can thrive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wUf7BWSN16KOdO70P3UOy5FRWRg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:928720'),
  ('276429933984596856', 'Return To Earth', 2023, 'Science Fiction', 'Angela En-Yu Lao', 'Johan Karlberg', 'Johan Karlberg, Lily Ge, Xie Yun Kun, Yao Ningning, Tanuki Sugino, Angela En-Yu Lao, Rika Kishida', null, 'At the 26th century, Earths core exploded in a mysterious way, humanity was forced to evacuate earth. 65 years later, one of the last survivors spent money on operation return to earth, which has discovered earth is back in shape but in difference by look, other planets gathered around it to give earth air. 2565 is the year we will return to earth. Three pilots from the new Terran confederation space force unit has signed up for the mission to investigate earth. One of the pilots name Li Shuai, on board TCS Macau, discovers a jump point that of some sort of space tunnel that leads directly to earths core. After a brutal attack on the pilots, Li Shuai managed to escape through the tunnel and crash land on an unknown planet, with no idea where he is, at the same time a convoy of 200 passengers waiting for a signal to land on earth. But unknowingly there might be a traitor among them.', 'At the 26th century, Earths core exploded in a mysterious way, humanity was forced to evacuate earth. 65 years later, one of the last survivors spent money on operation return to earth, which has discovered earth is back in shape but in difference by look, other planets gathered around it to give earth air. 2565 is the year we will return to earth. Three pilots from the new Terran confederation space force unit has signed up for the mission to investigate earth. One of the pilots name Li Shuai, on board TCS Macau, discovers a jump point that of some sort of space tunnel that leads directly to earths core. After a brutal attack on the pilots, Li Shuai managed to escape through the tunnel and crash land on an unknown planet, with no idea where he is, at the same time a convoy of 200 passengers waiting for a signal to land on earth. But unknowingly there might be a traitor among them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ck53clcii214dBhYFySHMn1yN2g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1102192'),
  ('191697001712160627', 'Return to Glennascaul', 1953, 'Horror, Drama', 'Hilton Edwards, Digby Jones, Georg Fleischmann', 'Hilton Edwards', 'Orson Welles, Michael Laurence, Shelah Richards, Helena Hughes, John Dunne, Isobel Couser, Ann Clery', null, 'Orson Welles, taking a break from the filming of "Othello," is driving in the Irish countryside one night when he offers a ride to a man with car trouble. The man relays to Welles a strange tale of an encounter he had once before at the same isolated location.', 'Orson Welles, taking a break from the filming of "Othello," is driving in the Irish countryside one night when he offers a ride to a man with car trouble. The man relays to Welles a strange tale of an encounter he had once before at the same isolated location.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uAImJthnukKD8AJ2IOB4T07CJJv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:183841'),
  ('681724327997267968', 'Return to Halloweentown', 2006, 'Family, Fantasy, Comedy, TV Movie, Action', 'David Jackson, Denis Maloney', null, 'Sara Paxton, Judith Hoag, Lucas Grabeel, Joey Zimmerman, Kristy Wu, Keone Young, Millicent Martin, Summer Bishil', 'G', 'As Halloweentown prepares to celebrate its 1,000th anniversary, Marnie Piper and her brother Dylan return to Witch University, where trouble is in session from the Sinister Sisters and from someone who''s plotting to use Marnie''s powers for evil.', 'As Halloweentown prepares to celebrate its 1,000th anniversary, Marnie Piper and her brother Dylan return to Witch University, where trouble is in session from the Sinister Sisters and from someone who''s plotting to use Marnie''s powers for evil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9lkAYfaaUf46lkXKEWq94wuUs3m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34204'),
  ('97033165820177552', 'Return to Hansala', 2008, 'Drama, Crime', 'Chus Gutiérrez, Kiko de la Rica', 'Chus Gutiérrez, Juan Carlos Rubio', 'Farah Hamed, José Luis García Pérez, Adam Bounnouacha, Antonio de la Torre, Cuca Escribano, Antonio Dechent, César Vea, Miguel Alcíbar', null, 'A woman loses her brother in an illegal immigration attempt and must return his body to their homeland.', 'A woman loses her brother in an illegal immigration attempt and must return his body to their homeland.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AomaFfCxApVECA2LEbMRcO18uAd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:174861'),
  ('883246965383471890', 'Return to Homs', 2013, 'Documentary', 'Talal Derki', 'Talal Derki', 'abdolbaseit al sarut', null, 'Filmed over 3 years in Homs, accompanying 2 outstanding young men from the time they were only dreaming of freedom to the time when they are forced to change course. Basset, the 19yo national football team goalkeeper, who became an outspoken demonstration leader in the city, then an icon revolution singer, till he becomes a fighter... a militia leader. Ossama, his 24yo friend, renowned citizen journalist, cynical pacifist... as his views are forced to change, until he is detained by army secret service. It is the story of a city, of which the world have heard a lot, but never really got closer than news, never really had the chance to experience how a war erupted. a modern times epic of youth in war time.', 'Filmed over 3 years in Homs, accompanying 2 outstanding young men from the time they were only dreaming of freedom to the time when they are forced to change course. Basset, the 19yo national football team goalkeeper, who became an outspoken demonstration leader in the city, then an icon revolution singer, till he becomes a fighter... a militia leader. Ossama, his 24yo friend, renowned citizen journalist, cynical pacifist... as his views are forced to change, until he is detained by army secret service. It is the story of a city, of which the world have heard a lot, but never really got closer than news, never really had the chance to experience how a war erupted. a modern times epic of youth in war time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lhc7zDOgv4lqV3WlEHmDvnlQpdI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:238561'),
  ('823974298135274250', 'Return to Horror High', 1987, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Rachel Talalay, Roy H. Wagner, Bill Froehlich', 'Mark Lisson, Bill Froehlich, Dana Escalante', 'Lori Lethin, George Clooney, Brendan Hughes, Alex Rocco, Scott Jacoby, Andy Romano, Richard Brestoff, Al Fann', 'R', 'A few years ago, a mysterious serial-killer caused panic on Crippen High School. The killer was never caught. A movie company, Cosmic Pictures, has decided to make a feature movie about these events - on location, at the now abandoned school. Since members of cast and crew disappear without a trace, it seems as if history is repeating itself...', 'A few years ago, a mysterious serial-killer caused panic on Crippen High School. The killer was never caught. A movie company, Cosmic Pictures, has decided to make a feature movie about these events - on location, at the now abandoned school. Since members of cast and crew disappear without a trace, it seems as if history is repeating itself...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/glZ0Wz5u2Vr7TzM6Kj1f4e6EliU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45878'),
  ('589859788867093727', 'Return to Horror Hotel', 2019, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Comedy', 'Ricky Hess, Brandon Thaxton', 'Al Hess', 'Baby Norman, Jeremy Michael Grey, R.C. Sayyah, Stephanie Stevens, James Edward Thomas, Ann Marie Gideon, Katrina Rarick, Jason Will Gaglione', null, 'Return to Horror Hotel is an anthology feature with 4 segments. One is about giant a bedbugs, one is about a magical charm that turns girls beautiful, one is about a WWII sailor who hasn''t aged and one is about a terrorizing severed hand.', 'Return to Horror Hotel is an anthology feature with 4 segments. One is about giant a bedbugs, one is about a magical charm that turns girls beautiful, one is about a WWII sailor who hasn''t aged and one is about a terrorizing severed hand.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/neZSuPSMJjOo2mEiufHqM8wqXyS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:616073'),
  ('456011002860882261', 'Return to House on Haunted Hill', 2007, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Víctor García, Lorenzo Senatore, Ivo Peitchev', null, 'Amanda Righetti, Cerina Vincent, Erik Palladino, Jeffrey Combs, Andrew Pleavin, Andrew-Lee Potts, Gil Kolirin, Emil Markov', 'R', 'Eight years have passed since Sara Wolfe and Eddie Baker escaped the House on Haunted Hill. Now the kidnapped Ariel, Sara''s sister, goes inside the house with a group of treasure hunters to find the statue of Baphomet, worth millions and believed to be the cause of the House''s evil.', 'Eight years have passed since Sara Wolfe and Eddie Baker escaped the House on Haunted Hill. Now the kidnapped Ariel, Sara''s sister, goes inside the house with a group of treasure hunters to find the statue of Baphomet, worth millions and believed to be the cause of the House''s evil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ipBiyifbFqY0ZduO3R9OPBjc2pH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13564'),
  ('499583758445481886', 'Return to Innocence', 2001, 'Drama', 'Rocky Costanzo, Steve Rowe', 'Gary M. Frazier', 'Andrew Martin, Steve De Forest, Richard Meese, Cynthia Downey, Shawn Berry, Lou Franson, Jeff Harman, Joseph Ragusa', 'NR', 'A searing legal drama that centers on a highly credentialed child psychologist whose life is shattered when he''s accused of sexually assaulting a young boy he''s been treating.', 'A searing legal drama that centers on a highly credentialed child psychologist whose life is shattered when he''s accused of sexually assaulting a young boy he''s been treating.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wnEwqCD3Q36Dzogk3i8MIFd7r8T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:274523'),
  ('1062692538392586039', 'Return to Ithaca', 2014, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Laurent Cantet, Diego Dussuel', 'Leonardo Padura, Laurent Cantet', 'Jorge Perugorría, Pedro Julio Díaz Ferrán, Néstor Jiménez Rodríguez, Fernando Hechavarria, Isabel Santos', null, 'Sun is setting on Havana. Five friends are gathered to celebrate the return of Amadeo after 16 years of exile in Madrid.', 'Sun is setting on Havana. Five friends are gathered to celebrate the return of Amadeo after 16 years of exile in Madrid.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eAiuMR29v9SL6j2YQ1CM71dC7Tj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:284290'),
  ('367807981153285374', 'Return to Jurassic Park', 2011, 'Documentary', 'Laurent Bouzereau', null, 'Steven Spielberg, Jeff Goldblum, Sam Neill, Laura Dern, Fay Wray, Michael Crichton, Joseph Mazzello, Ariana Richards', null, 'A multi-part documentary about the making of the Jurassic Park trilogy. Each part walks through the making of part of one of the films, including the hurricane during the shooting of the first film, and how advances in CGI for Jurassic Park helped change the world of special effects forever. All interviews for these retrospective documentaries come with comments from Spielberg, Johnston, Neill, Dern, Goldblum, the effects crews, the child actors, and Peter Stormare. This documentary is broken into six parts: Dawn of a New Era (25 min), Making Prehistory (20 min), The Next Step in Evolution (15 min), Finding the Lost World (28 min), Something Survived (16 min), and The Third Adventure (25 min).', 'A multi-part documentary about the making of the Jurassic Park trilogy. Each part walks through the making of part of one of the films, including the hurricane during the shooting of the first film, and how advances in CGI for Jurassic Park helped change the world of special effects forever. All interviews for these retrospective documentaries come with comments from Spielberg, Johnston, Neill, Dern, Goldblum, the effects crews, the child actors, and Peter Stormare. This documentary is broken into six parts: Dawn of a New Era (25 min), Making Prehistory (20 min), The Next Step in Evolution (15 min), Finding the Lost World (28 min), Something Survived (16 min), and The Third Adventure (25 min).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mPyu59cDdmMDDW9IOtfjVlM0THd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:503210'),
  ('240446648472376574', 'Return to Life', 1949, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Georges Lampin, Henri-Georges Clouzot, André Cayatte', 'Henri-Georges Clouzot, Jean Ferry, Charles Spaak', 'Bernard Blier, Jane Marken, François Périer, Patricia Roc, Louis Jouvet, Noël Roquevert, Noël-Noël, Madeleine Gérôme', null, 'In France in 1946, the difficult return to civilian life of five deportees and prisoners of war after having lived through the hell of the Second World War.', 'In France in 1946, the difficult return to civilian life of five deportees and prisoners of war after having lived through the hell of the Second World War.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9yu3RXfaqUHu9ZJY82EHz51AaLO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63688'),
  ('1151233819350515173', 'Return to Macon County', 1975, 'Drama', 'Richard Compton, Jacques R. Marquette', 'Richard Compton', 'Nick Nolte, Don Johnson, Robin Mattson, Robert Viharo, Matt Greene, Devon Ericson, Philip Crews, Walt Guthrie', 'PG', 'In 1958, two teenagers take their pride and joy, a hopped-up Chevy, and start a cross-country journey to enter it in the National Championship drag races in California. Along the way they hook up with a pretty but dingy waitress who quits her job and hops in their car--and turns out to be more trouble than they thought--drag-race a gang of town punks who lose to to them and then accuse them of cheating, and come up against a local cop who is obsessed with putting these two "juvenile delinquents" in jail.', 'In 1958, two teenagers take their pride and joy, a hopped-up Chevy, and start a cross-country journey to enter it in the National Championship drag races in California. Along the way they hook up with a pretty but dingy waitress who quits her job and hops in their car--and turns out to be more trouble than they thought--drag-race a gang of town punks who lose to to them and then accuse them of cheating, and come up against a local cop who is obsessed with putting these two "juvenile delinquents" in jail.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/19ZsR52KSHdgHA4kjiWPNHVKx5L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42263'),
  ('252011276776830164', 'Return to Mayberry', 1986, 'TV Movie, Comedy', 'Bob Sweeney, Ray Marsh, Nilo Otero', 'Everett Greenbaum, Harvey Bullock', 'Andy Griffith, Ron Howard, Don Knotts, Jim Nabors, Hal Smith, Janet Waldo, Aneta Corsaut, Jack Dodson', 'G', 'After being away for awhile, Andy Taylor returns home to Mayberry to visit Opie, now an expectant father. While there he ends up helping Barney Fife mount a campaign for sheriff.', 'After being away for awhile, Andy Taylor returns home to Mayberry to visit Opie, now an expectant father. While there he ends up helping Barney Fife mount a campaign for sheriff.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cn6O2M0C4C0LqT9iyfwmOxKgtCd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:151937'),
  ('548456680307711477', 'Return to Me', 2000, 'Romance, Comedy', 'László Kovács, Bonnie Hunt', 'Bonnie Hunt, Don Lake', 'David Duchovny, Minnie Driver, Carroll O''Connor, Robert Loggia, Jim Belushi, Bonnie Hunt, David Alan Grier, Joely Richardson', 'PG', 'It took a lot of cajoling to get Bob, a recently widowed architect, to go on a blind date at a quirky Irish-Italian eatery. Once there, he''s smitten instantly not with his date but with the sharp-witted waitress. Everything seems to be going great until an unbelievable truth is revealed, one that could easily break both of their hearts for good.', 'It took a lot of cajoling to get Bob, a recently widowed architect, to go on a blind date at a quirky Irish-Italian eatery. Once there, he''s smitten instantly not with his date but with the sharp-witted waitress. Everything seems to be going great until an unbelievable truth is revealed, one that could easily break both of their hearts for good.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mtYZyZh7hSiTq3gAU0C8FlcMC5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2621'),
  ('45274724559632374', 'Return to Montauk', 2017, 'Drama, Romance', 'Jérôme Alméras, Volker Schlöndorff', 'Volker Schlöndorff, Colm Tóibín', 'Stellan Skarsgård, Nina Hoss, Bronagh Gallagher, Niels Arestrup, Susanne Wolff, Isi Laborde, Robert Seeliger, Rebecca Knox', null, 'Author Max Zorn, now in his early 60s, is on a promotional book tour in New York when he encounters the woman he could never forget. They spend a weekend together, seventeen years have passed. Can there be a future for their past?', 'Author Max Zorn, now in his early 60s, is on a promotional book tour in New York when he encounters the woman he could never forget. They spend a weekend together, seventeen years have passed. Can there be a future for their past?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rwKRbh71rLljCXEmtnglooyefnU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:436352'),
  ('285837362808152991', 'Return to Never Land', 2002, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Animation, Family', 'Donovan Cook, Ian Harrowell, Robin Budd', 'Temple Mathews', 'Harriet Owen, Blayne Weaver, Jeff Bennett, Kath Soucie, Corey Burton, Andrew McDonough, Roger Rees, Spencer Breslin', 'G', 'In 1940, the world is besieged by World War II. Wendy, all grown up, has two children; including Jane, who does not believe Wendy''s stories about Peter Pan.', 'In 1940, the world is besieged by World War II. Wendy, all grown up, has two children; including Jane, who does not believe Wendy''s stories about Peter Pan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wB3r2b8sxUZspqNyr8copMlt7se.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16690'),
  ('1039456828787282138', 'Return to Nim''s Island', 2013, 'Family, Adventure', 'Brendan Maher, Marieke Spence, Judd Overton', 'Cathy Randall, Ray Boseley', 'Matthew Lillard, Bindi Irwin, Andrea Moor, Jack Pearson, Toby Wallace, Sebastian Gregory, Nathan Derrick, John Waters', 'PG', 'Fourteen year old Nim, more determined than ever to protect her island and all the wildlife that call it home, faces off against resort developers and animal poachers. Soon she realizes she can’t depend on her animal cohorts alone and must make her first human friend – Edmund, who’s run away to the island from the mainland – to save her home.', 'Fourteen year old Nim, more determined than ever to protect her island and all the wildlife that call it home, faces off against resort developers and animal poachers. Soon she realizes she can’t depend on her animal cohorts alone and must make her first human friend – Edmund, who’s run away to the island from the mainland – to save her home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9LPDKDZQyGlQQphTna5kRHe4nrE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:172386'),
  ('329883694743163396', 'Return to Nuke ''Em High Volume 1', 2013, 'Comedy, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Lloyd Kaufman, Justin Duval', 'Lloyd Kaufman, Derek Dressler', 'Asta Paredes, Catherine Corcoran, Brenda Rickert, Lloyd Kaufman, Stan Lee, Leesa Rowland, Lemmy Kilmister, Zac Amico', 'NR', 'Return to the Class of Nuke ''Em High follows a young couple that are up against the school glee club. Unfortunately, the glee club has mutated into a gang called The Cretins. When the other students begin to undergo mutations, our couple must solve the mystery and save Tromaville High School', 'Return to the Class of Nuke ''Em High follows a young couple that are up against the school glee club. Unfortunately, the glee club has mutated into a gang called The Cretins. When the other students begin to undergo mutations, our couple must solve the mystery and save Tromaville High School', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/elpbF2qmAh6T9U0vYDjFTt4BHy6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:136585'),
  ('861523378188624230', 'Return to Office', 2025, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance', 'Peter Benson', null, 'Janel Parrish, Scott Michael Foster, Erik Gow, Christopher Shyer, Sarah Formosa, Dylan McEwan, Brandon McEwan, Miranda MacDougall', null, 'After making the return to the office on a hybrid schedule, two coworkers known to each other only as Ms. Monday and Mr. Tuesday start sending friendly notes, sparking an office romance.', 'After making the return to the office on a hybrid schedule, two coworkers known to each other only as Ms. Monday and Mr. Tuesday start sending friendly notes, sparking an office romance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kOeZY4KhapLxPT9oAAVvZu80DTN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1414166'),
  ('807692688768634770', 'Return to Oz', 1985, 'Adventure, Family, Fantasy', 'Walter Murch, David Watkin, Ian Hickinbotham', 'Gill Dennis, Walter Murch', 'Fairuza Balk, Nicol Williamson, Jean Marsh, Piper Laurie, Matt Clark, Michael Sundin, Tim Rose, Sean Barrett', 'PG', 'Dorothy, saved from a psychiatric experiment by a mysterious girl, finds herself back in the land of her dreams, and makes delightful new friends, and dangerous new enemies.', 'Dorothy, saved from a psychiatric experiment by a mysterious girl, finds herself back in the land of her dreams, and makes delightful new friends, and dangerous new enemies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zKaH6CbrgxNLw9lsEinLxx173Tw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13155'),
  ('440823427700670747', 'Return to Paradise', 1953, 'Drama', 'Mark Robson', 'Charles Kaufman', 'Gary Cooper, Barry Jones, Roberta Haynes, Moira Walker, John Hudson, Mamea Matatumua, Hans Kruse, Maylia Fong', 'NR', 'An American drifter comes to a remote Polynesian island controlled by a Puritanical missionary and turns the social life of the island upside-down.', 'An American drifter comes to a remote Polynesian island controlled by a Puritanical missionary and turns the social life of the island upside-down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u2g9hI9G3gTgZU4Hf5HxwbUJfEi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:116932'),
  ('193366285671310614', 'Return to Paradise', 1998, 'Drama, Thriller, Romance', 'Joseph Ruben, Reynaldo Villalobos, Michael E. Steele', 'Wesley Strick, Bruce Robinson', 'Vince Vaughn, Anne Heche, Joaquin Phoenix, David Conrad, Jada Pinkett Smith, Vera Farmiga, Nick Sandow, Elizabeth Rodriguez', 'R', 'Lewis, Sheriff and Tony are three friends vacationing in Malaysia. Sheriff and Tony eventually leave to pursue careers in New York, but Lewis stays behind to work with orangutans. Two years later, Sheriff and Tony learn that, because of their past actions, Lewis has been arrested for drug possession. With Lewis facing a death sentence, the friends are left with a difficult decision: return to Malaysia and split Lewis'' sentence, or let him die.', 'Lewis, Sheriff and Tony are three friends vacationing in Malaysia. Sheriff and Tony eventually leave to pursue careers in New York, but Lewis stays behind to work with orangutans. Two years later, Sheriff and Tony learn that, because of their past actions, Lewis has been arrested for drug possession. With Lewis facing a death sentence, the friends are left with a difficult decision: return to Malaysia and split Lewis'' sentence, or let him die.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t4lmZtx1zLUijwO2oHHEbUQ7j41.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10278'),
  ('21564852056783488', 'Return to Peyton Place', 1961, 'Drama, Romance', 'José Ferrer, Charles G. Clarke', 'Ronald Alexander', 'Carol Lynley, Jeff Chandler, Eleanor Parker, Mary Astor, Robert Sterling, Luciana Paluzzi, Brett Halsey, Gunnar Hellström', null, 'Residents of the small town of Peyton Place aren''t pleased when they realize they''re the characters in local writer Allison MacKenzie''s controversial first novel. A sequel to the hit 1957 film.', 'Residents of the small town of Peyton Place aren''t pleased when they realize they''re the characters in local writer Allison MacKenzie''s controversial first novel. A sequel to the hit 1957 film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p4TVDg0Q4TkuDi0q8k4x89kTyTA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:111017'),
  ('61676731632936768', 'Return to Rajapur', 2006, 'Drama, Romance', 'Nanda Anand, Harlan Bosmajian', 'Nanda Anand', 'Lynn Collins, Kelli Garner, Justin Theroux, Manoj Bajpayee, Frank Langella, Bhanu Goswami, Rita Joshi, Yusuf Hussain', null, 'A doomed love affair blooms against the beautiful and exotic backdrop of the deserts of India in this romantic drama. Samantha Hartley (Kelli Garner) is a woman in her early twenties who travels to Rajapur in India to visit a resort where her mother stayed years ago. While tracing the steps of her mother, Sara (Lynn Collins), Samantha learns the true story about her mother''s stormy marriage to Jeremy (Justin Theroux), a charming but moody alcoholic. Only a few days after their wedding, Sara began to wonder if marrying Jeremy was a mistake, and while visiting India on their honeymoon, Sara met Jai Singh (Manoj Bajpai), a handsome and sensitive widower living in Rajapur. Jai Singh, who speaks fluent English, soon strikes up a friendship with Sara that quickly grows into a romance, but both are aware of the transgressive nature of their love, and their affair takes a tragic turn, leaving its scars on all parties involved.', 'A doomed love affair blooms against the beautiful and exotic backdrop of the deserts of India in this romantic drama. Samantha Hartley (Kelli Garner) is a woman in her early twenties who travels to Rajapur in India to visit a resort where her mother stayed years ago. While tracing the steps of her mother, Sara (Lynn Collins), Samantha learns the true story about her mother''s stormy marriage to Jeremy (Justin Theroux), a charming but moody alcoholic. Only a few days after their wedding, Sara began to wonder if marrying Jeremy was a mistake, and while visiting India on their honeymoon, Sara met Jai Singh (Manoj Bajpai), a handsome and sensitive widower living in Rajapur. Jai Singh, who speaks fluent English, soon strikes up a friendship with Sara that quickly grows into a romance, but both are aware of the transgressive nature of their love, and their affair takes a tragic turn, leaving its scars on all parties involved.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/evmAVlioTgPJ14fl7FbhC2CnO3F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80261'),
  ('1117202401667218782', 'Return to Reason', 1923, 'Drama', 'Man Ray', null, 'Kiki of Montparnasse', null, 'Experimental film, white specks and shapes gyrating over a black background, the light-striped torso of Kiki of Montparnasse (Alice Prin), a gyrating eggcrate. One of the first Dadaist films.', 'Experimental film, white specks and shapes gyrating over a black background, the light-striped torso of Kiki of Montparnasse (Alice Prin), a gyrating eggcrate. One of the first Dadaist films.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8ioFoJSHZKXirDm5DknoaQybNrE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:138752'),
  ('996455733682875538', 'Return to Sender', 2004, 'Drama', 'Bille August', 'Robert Wade, Neal Purvis', 'Connie Nielsen, Aidan Quinn, Kelly Preston, Tim Daly, Mark Ryan, Mark Holton, Sara-Marie Maltha, Randy Colton', 'R', 'While fighting for a woman who sits on death row, a lawyer happens upon new information which brings into question the motives of a man associated with her client', 'While fighting for a woman who sits on death row, a lawyer happens upon new information which brings into question the motives of a man associated with her client', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2OZj98sFBQYYS48uIAWTP5siCkT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25460'),
  ('607976020482501734', 'Return to Sender', 2015, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Russell Carpenter, Fouad Mikati', 'Patricia Beauchamp, Joe Gossett', 'Rosamund Pike, Shiloh Fernandez, Nick Nolte, Rumer Willis, Keir O''Donnell, Scout Taylor-Compton, Illeana Douglas, Camryn Manheim', 'NR', 'A nurse mistakes a stranger who pays her a visit for her blind date and soon, the man rapes her and turns her life upside down. The woman works to reclaim her life and exact revenge on her assailant after he''s paroled from prison.', 'A nurse mistakes a stranger who pays her a visit for her blind date and soon, the man rapes her and turns her life upside down. The woman works to reclaim her life and exact revenge on her assailant after he''s paroled from prison.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mBIRSvt2ebgdztuX7F7GwR0iPM0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:333381'),
  ('871661059167862392', 'Return to Seoul', 2022, 'Drama', 'Davy Chou, Thomas Favel, Camille Fleury', 'Davy Chou', 'Park Ji-min, Oh Kwang-rok, Guka Han, Kim Sun-young, Yoann Zimmer, Louis-Do de Lencquesaing, Heo Jin, Son Seung-beom', 'R', 'After an impulsive travel decision to visit friends, Freddie, 25, returns to South Korea for the first time, where she was born before being adopted and raised in France. Freddie suddenly finds herself embarking on an unexpected journey in a country she knows so little about, taking her life in new and unexpected directions.', 'After an impulsive travel decision to visit friends, Freddie, 25, returns to South Korea for the first time, where she was born before being adopted and raised in France. Freddie suddenly finds herself embarking on an unexpected journey in a country she knows so little about, taking her life in new and unexpected directions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uEz1pAW2r1tECDI8ipttabaLHhW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:952701'),
  ('23911057498802643', 'Return to Silent Hill', 2026, 'Mystery, Drama, Horror', 'Pablo Rosso, Christophe Gans', 'Christophe Gans, Sandra Vo-Anh, William Josef Schneider', 'Jeremy Irvine, Hannah Emily Anderson, Evie Templeton, Pearse Egan, Nicola Alexis, Robert Strange, Emily Carding, Eve Macklin', 'R', 'When James receives a mysterious letter from his lost love Mary, he is drawn to Silent Hill—a once-familiar town now consumed by darkness. As he searches for her, James faces monstrous creatures and unravels a terrifying truth that will push him to the edge of his sanity.', 'When James receives a mysterious letter from his lost love Mary, he is drawn to Silent Hill—a once-familiar town now consumed by darkness. As he searches for her, James faces monstrous creatures and unravels a terrifying truth that will push him to the edge of his sanity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fqAGFN2K2kDL0EHxvJaXzaMUkkt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:680493'),
  ('54577406984337378', 'Return to Sleepaway Camp', 2008, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Robert Hiltzik, Alan Davison, Luke Doolan', 'Robert Hiltzik', 'Vincent Pastore, Jackie Tohn, Jonathan Tiersten, Paul DeAngelo, Isaac Hayes, Michael Gibney, Felissa Rose, Lenny Venito', 'R', 'When campers and staff at Camp Manabe mysteriously begin disappearing and turning into gruesome corpses, paranoid Ronnie can''t shake the memory of a series of grisly murders that took place at Camp Arawak two decades earlier.', 'When campers and staff at Camp Manabe mysteriously begin disappearing and turning into gruesome corpses, paranoid Ronnie can''t shake the memory of a series of grisly murders that took place at Camp Arawak two decades earlier.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p6V97pjGwN0fENR6mlBeUoAT73z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35626'),
  ('171617322970388378', 'Return to Space', 2022, 'Documentary', 'Elizabeth Chai Vasarhelyi, Jimmy Chin', null, 'Elon Musk, Douglas Hurley, Robert Behnken, James Bridenstine, Tim Dodd, Hans-Jörg Koenigsmann, Gwynne Shotwell, Lars Blackmore', null, 'The inspirational rise of SpaceX as well as Elon Musk''s two-decade effort to resurrect America’s space travel ambitions.', 'The inspirational rise of SpaceX as well as Elon Musk''s two-decade effort to resurrect America’s space travel ambitions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yUN0g7gJwr2JhqNZBYJS2obkxU2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:950445'),
  ('433330547435158174', 'Return to the 36th Chamber', 1980, 'Action, Comedy', 'Lau Kar-Leung, Lee Tai-Hang, Huang Pa-Ching', 'Ni Kuang', 'Gordon Liu Chia-Hui, Kara Hui Ying-Hung, Hsiao Ho, Wong Ching-Ho, Wa Lun, King Lee King-Chu, Yau Chui-Ling, Chen Szu-Chia', null, 'The workers of a dye factory have their pay cut by 20% when the factory owner brings in some Manchu thugs to try and increase production. Desperate to reclaim their full wages, the workers hire an actor to impersonate a priest and kung-fu expert from the temple of Shaolin. The factory owner proves the actor a fraud, and punishes all those involved. The young actor feels he has let the workers down, and promises to atone. He sets out for Shaolin, determined to be accepted as a kung-fu pupil at the elite temple.', 'The workers of a dye factory have their pay cut by 20% when the factory owner brings in some Manchu thugs to try and increase production. Desperate to reclaim their full wages, the workers hire an actor to impersonate a priest and kung-fu expert from the temple of Shaolin. The factory owner proves the actor a fraud, and punishes all those involved. The young actor feels he has let the workers down, and promises to atone. He sets out for Shaolin, determined to be accepted as a kung-fu pupil at the elite temple.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4eZz8xkIiGDpt7Q4TLzu7wfY7U4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48301'),
  ('206156673484511926', 'Return to the Batcave: The Misadventures of Adam and Burt', 2003, 'Comedy, Action, Mystery, TV Movie', 'Paul A. Kaufman, James Glennon', 'Duane Poole', 'Adam West, Burt Ward, Jack Brewer, Jason Marsden, Amy Acker, Lee Meriwether, Frank Gorshin, Julie Newmar', null, 'Adam West and Burt Ward are taken on a crazy adventure when the Batmobile is stolen from a car museum and they must track down the thief and return it. After solving a puzzle, they realize that the clues to finding the fiend who stole the Batmobile are hidden in their past. During the search, they flashback to their three seasons in tights, including their many sexual escapades.', 'Adam West and Burt Ward are taken on a crazy adventure when the Batmobile is stolen from a car museum and they must track down the thief and return it. After solving a puzzle, they realize that the clues to finding the fiend who stole the Batmobile are hidden in their past. During the search, they flashback to their three seasons in tights, including their many sexual escapades.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9jWkvwp9DNpUGAi57MiRwp3iYLJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20776'),
  ('921690514256426438', 'Return to the Beloved', 1979, 'Drama, Romance', 'Jean-François Adam, Claire Denis, Claudine Taulère', 'Jean-Claude Carrière, Jean-François Adam, Georges Perec', 'Isabelle Huppert, Jacques Dutronc, Bruno Ganz, Christian Rist, Aline Bertrand, Rodolphe Schacher, Axelle Bernard, Jean-François Adam', null, 'Julien seeks to reconquer Jeanne, his ex-wife, of whom he is separated and who lives with another man. He is prepared to go far to make it happen.', 'Julien seeks to reconquer Jeanne, his ex-wife, of whom he is separated and who lives with another man. He is prepared to go far to make it happen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j5pGx3CYVixO5hdiHxu9uy3xAoT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65702'),
  ('38856443072932219', 'Return to the Blue Lagoon', 1991, 'Adventure, Drama', 'William A. Graham, Paul Grinder, Bob Roe', 'Leslie Stevens', 'Milla Jovovich, Brian Krause, Lisa Pelikan, Courtney Barilla, Garette Ratliff Henson, Brian Blain, Emma James, Jackson Barton', 'PG-13', 'In this sequel to the 1980 classic, two children are stranded on a beautiful island in the South Pacific. With no adults to guide them, the two make a simple life together and eventually become tanned teenagers in love.', 'In this sequel to the 1980 classic, two children are stranded on a beautiful island in the South Pacific. With no adults to guide them, the two make a simple life together and eventually become tanned teenagers in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jhUTLuPgc3Qcvr5xtji8oiWSfYy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13888'),
  ('802675164131504007', 'Return to the Lost World', 1992, 'Action, Fantasy, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Timothy Bond, Paul Beeson', 'Harry Alan Towers', 'John Rhys-Davies, David Warner, Eric McCormack, Nathania Stanford, Tamara Gorski, Kate Egan, Mary Ann Mandishina, Patricia Sanders', null, 'A young journalist and his two travel mates, both professors, embark on an expedition to return to a lost world of dinosaurs and primitive men.', 'A young journalist and his two travel mates, both professors, embark on an expedition to return to a lost world of dinosaurs and primitive men.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qwmXy2tMIX0Jq7pc1P9MD3WNEsa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50808'),
  ('469369947837933357', 'Return to Two Moon Junction', 1994, 'Drama, Romance', 'Frank Byers, Farhad Mann, James M. Freitag', 'Dyanne Asimow', 'Melinda Clarke, John Clayton Schafer, Wendy Davis, Yorgo Constantine, Molly Shannon, Montrose Hagins, Louise Fletcher, Bill Hollis', 'R', 'There''s a special place in Georgia called Two Moon Junction. It''s known for its power of seduction and for awakening the sense with an unquenchable sexual passion. It''s no wonder overworked supermodel Savannah Delongpre longs to retun to her home town. She''s at the height of her success, with fame, fortune, and everything the fast lane has to offer, including a lover who''s sleeping with her best friend. Disillusioned with the high life, Savannah retreats to the estate of her grandmother, and the sanctuary of the family''s riverfront hideaway - Two Moon Junction. There, Savannah meets her match, a handsome local sculptor named Jake GIlbert who unleashes her passion. However, Jake and Savannah''s future is marred by the past. Her torrid affair is further complicated by her manipulative boyfriend who tries to seduce her back to New York. Savannah has to choose between all that Two Moon Junction can offer and her body and soul, and the rich and glamorous New York life she left behind.', 'There''s a special place in Georgia called Two Moon Junction. It''s known for its power of seduction and for awakening the sense with an unquenchable sexual passion. It''s no wonder overworked supermodel Savannah Delongpre longs to retun to her home town. She''s at the height of her success, with fame, fortune, and everything the fast lane has to offer, including a lover who''s sleeping with her best friend. Disillusioned with the high life, Savannah retreats to the estate of her grandmother, and the sanctuary of the family''s riverfront hideaway - Two Moon Junction. There, Savannah meets her match, a handsome local sculptor named Jake GIlbert who unleashes her passion. However, Jake and Savannah''s future is marred by the past. Her torrid affair is further complicated by her manipulative boyfriend who tries to seduce her back to New York. Savannah has to choose between all that Two Moon Junction can offer and her body and soul, and the rich and glamorous New York life she left behind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7PNVrXFKBHjSVC4QSxTWO2clc92.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88191'),
