  ('1135215363349886201', 'Return to Youth', 1954, 'Mystery, Fantasy, Horror, Romance', 'Juan Bustillo Oro', 'Juan Bustillo Oro', 'Enrique Rambal, Rosario Granados, Carlos López Moctezuma, Andrés Soler, Queta Lavat, Carlos Riquelme, José Muñoz', null, 'An old professor in love with one of his students is rejected by her because of his advanced age. He then sells his soul in return for youth and a chance at love but things don''t go as he planned.', 'An old professor in love with one of his students is rejected by her because of his advanced age. He then sells his soul in return for youth and a chance at love but things don''t go as he planned.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mBwZdCJ3KbtFVAYPx60wdJOOS6J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:425378'),
