  ('528428694169833370', 'Return with Honor', 1999, 'Documentary', 'Freida Lee Mock, Terry Sanders', 'Terry Sanders, Christine Z. Wiser, Freida Lee Mock', 'Everett Alvarez, Ron Bliss, Fred Cherry, Tom Hanks, George Day, Jeremiah Denton, Jerry Denton, Paul Galanti', 'PG', 'The story of U.S. fighter pilots shot down over North Vietnam who became POWs for up to 8 and a half years.', 'The story of U.S. fighter pilots shot down over North Vietnam who became POWs for up to 8 and a half years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/89289dPlOMOIWTZtIhy4qHhBQpb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56235'),
