  ('1014383859587360514', 'Reunion', 1989, 'Drama, History', 'Jerry Schatzberg, Bruno de Keyzer', 'Harold Pinter', 'Jason Robards, Christien Anholt, Samuel West, Françoise Fabian, Maureen Kerwin, Dorothea Alexander, Frank Baker, Tim Barker', 'PG-13', 'Attorney Henry Strauss grew up in Germany, but left the country with his Jewish family during the rise of the Third Reich. Still wondering about what happened to his boyhood friend Konradin Von Lohenburg, Strauss travels back to Germany for the first time since he was a young man, bringing up some painful memories.', 'Attorney Henry Strauss grew up in Germany, but left the country with his Jewish family during the rise of the Third Reich. Still wondering about what happened to his boyhood friend Konradin Von Lohenburg, Strauss travels back to Germany for the first time since he was a young man, bringing up some painful memories.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6aSormMNBabQ5Eju369WMZI4G5y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73931'),
