  ('963691531928104564', 'Revanche', 2008, 'Crime, Drama, Romance, Thriller', 'Götz Spielmann, Martin Gschlacht', 'Götz Spielmann', 'Johannes Krisch, Irina Potapenko, Andreas Lust, Ursula Strauss, Hanno Pöschl, Johannes Thanheiser, Linde Prelog, Michael-Joachim Heiss', null, 'Alex, an ex-con working as muscle in a Vienna brothel, dreams of escaping with his girlfriend Tamara, who also works there. Their attempt to break free sets off a chain of events that links their fate with a rural police officer and his troubled marriage. As their lives intersect, a quiet struggle unfolds between guilt, grief, and the desire for redemption.', 'Alex, an ex-con working as muscle in a Vienna brothel, dreams of escaping with his girlfriend Tamara, who also works there. Their attempt to break free sets off a chain of events that links their fate with a rural police officer and his troubled marriage. As their lives intersect, a quiet struggle unfolds between guilt, grief, and the desire for redemption.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7EQ7EOXWwPirccqVfp6QoJV19UY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15451'),
  ('1016153132313849011', 'Revealer', 2022, 'Horror', 'Luke Boyce', 'Tim Seeley, Michael Moreci', 'Caito Aase, Shaina Schrooten, Bishop Stevens, Phil Bogdan, Buzz Leer, Sammy DelPurgatorio', null, 'Tensions rise when a stripper and religious protester are trapped together in a peep show booth and must come together to survive the apocalypse in 1980s Chicago.', 'Tensions rise when a stripper and religious protester are trapped together in a peep show booth and must come together to survive the apocalypse in 1980s Chicago.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6tYWNhSHgA1gQDeNcoCIL1LGyKj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:884882'),
  ('1148535038836908768', 'Revelation', 1999, 'Action, Horror, Thriller', 'André van Heerden', 'Paul Lalonde, Peter Lalonde', 'Jeff Fahey, Tony Nappo, Carol Alt, Leigh Lewis, Nick Mancuso, Marium Carvell, Rothaford Gray, David Roddis', 'PG-13', 'Thorold Stone, a police officer in search for answers, joins a rebel group of Christians to thwart the Antichrist''s plan to use virtual reality to solidify its power.', 'Thorold Stone, a police officer in search for answers, joins a rebel group of Christians to thwart the Antichrist''s plan to use virtual reality to solidify its power.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4ndHjMDONKjRQToowiYs1MtIKK3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46009'),
  ('1134588610633456771', 'Revelation', 2001, 'Fantasy, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Stuart Urban, Simon Emanuel, Matthew Hanson', 'Stuart Urban', 'James D''Arcy, Natasha Wightman, Terence Stamp, Charlotte Weston, Udo Kier, Liam Cunningham, Ron Moody, Derek Jacobi', null, 'Since A.D. 50, a mysterious sacred artifact known as the Loculus has been at the center of a bloody clandestine war. Missing for a few hundred years, the puzzling relic has suddenly reappeared in the present day, bringing with it a terrible secret that could spell doom for all of mankind. Now it''s up to Magnus Martel to subvert a murderous secret society and uncover the truth behind the ancient treasure.', 'Since A.D. 50, a mysterious sacred artifact known as the Loculus has been at the center of a bloody clandestine war. Missing for a few hundred years, the puzzling relic has suddenly reappeared in the present day, bringing with it a terrible secret that could spell doom for all of mankind. Now it''s up to Magnus Martel to subvert a murderous secret society and uncover the truth behind the ancient treasure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3nTh4bfl8OLk3UwX6RFgti0ZVd6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59095'),
  ('516736216190445667', 'Revelations', 2025, 'Thriller, Crime, Mystery', 'Yeon Sang-ho, Byun Bong-sun, Song Hyun-suk', 'Yeon Sang-ho, Choi Gyu-seok', 'Ryu Jun-yeol, Shin Hyun-been, Shin Min-jae, Han Ji-hyeon, Do Yeong-seo, Kim Do-young, Moon Joo-yeon, Bae Yoon-gyu', 'R', 'A pastor who believes in divine revelation and a detective haunted by visions pursue a missing person case — exposing their own demons in the process.', 'A pastor who believes in divine revelation and a detective haunted by visions pursue a missing person case — exposing their own demons in the process.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ak0HlRVsVzh8mvwIUZpZr0z6uqW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1210938'),
  ('413374520888570386', 'Revenge', 1964, 'Drama, Thriller, Action', 'Tadashi Imai, Tōru Hirayama, Shunichirō Nakao', 'Shinobu Hashimoto', 'Kinnosuke Nakamura, Takahiro Tamura, Tetsuro Tamba, Yoshiko Mita, Ai Sasaki, Eitarō Shindō, Shoichi Ozawa, Ken Mitsuda', null, 'An innocuous comment during a weapon inspection wounds the pride of low-ranking samurai Shinpachi, leading to an argument with his superior. The situation snowballs out of control, leading to a deadly duel and political fallout which threatens the entire clan. Declared mentally unstable by the corrupt authority, Shinpachi begins his descent into true insanity…', 'An innocuous comment during a weapon inspection wounds the pride of low-ranking samurai Shinpachi, leading to an argument with his superior. The situation snowballs out of control, leading to a deadly duel and political fallout which threatens the entire clan. Declared mentally unstable by the corrupt authority, Shinpachi begins his descent into true insanity…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l6DxFp7UTC405i7zOwjaK1kyDcM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:93442'),
  ('78245683450737579', 'Revenge', 1971, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Sidney Hayers', 'John Kruse', 'Joan Collins, James Booth, Ray Barrett, Sinéad Cusack, Kenneth Griffith, Tom Marshall, Zuleika Robson, Donald Morley', null, 'A British family takes revenge into its own hands in avenging their recently slain daughter.', 'A British family takes revenge into its own hands in avenging their recently slain daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cT1SpFlks4oLd4GXpR0VnNvysPZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87789'),
  ('109046899609977415', 'Revenge', 1978, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Sergiu Nicolaescu', 'Eugen Burada, Vintilă Corbul, Sergiu Nicolaescu', 'Sergiu Nicolaescu, Gheorghe Dinică, Jean Constantin, Amza Pellea, Ion Besoiu, Mircea Albulescu, Emanoil Petruţ, Iurie Darie', null, '"Revansa" (Revenge) appeared not so long after the preview movie of the series, "Un comisar acuza" (The Police Inspector Calls). In this sequel we meet up with police inspector Tudor Moldovan, once again, who wasn''t actually killed and who has returned to put an end to Paraipan''s actions once and for all. When Paraipan kidnaps Moldovan''s kid, the police inspector makes up his mind to punish Paraipan and his bosses and to finish off the fascist movement, lead by Zavoianu and his allies. Together with the communist that fight to gain power, Moldovan takes out his enemies one by one.', '"Revansa" (Revenge) appeared not so long after the preview movie of the series, "Un comisar acuza" (The Police Inspector Calls). In this sequel we meet up with police inspector Tudor Moldovan, once again, who wasn''t actually killed and who has returned to put an end to Paraipan''s actions once and for all. When Paraipan kidnaps Moldovan''s kid, the police inspector makes up his mind to punish Paraipan and his bosses and to finish off the fascist movement, lead by Zavoianu and his allies. Together with the communist that fight to gain power, Moldovan takes out his enemies one by one.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bIy8S38aheMjRjq9iYYJttOwFKZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:224079'),
  ('805144587996550830', 'Revenge', 1990, 'Thriller, Romance, Drama', 'Tony Scott, Jeffrey L. Kimball', 'Jim Harrison, Jeffrey Alan Fiskin', 'Kevin Costner, Anthony Quinn, Madeleine Stowe, Miguel Ferrer, Tomas Milian, Joaquín Martínez, James Gammon, Jesse Corti', 'R', 'Michael ‘Jay’ Cochran has just left the Navy after 12 years and he''s not quite sure what he''s going to do, except that he knows he wants a holiday. He decides to visit Tiburon Mendez, a powerful but shady Mexican businessman who he once flew to Alaska for a hunting trip. Arriving at the Mendez mansion in Mexico, he is immediately surprised by the beauty and youth of Mendez’s wife, Miryea.', 'Michael ‘Jay’ Cochran has just left the Navy after 12 years and he''s not quite sure what he''s going to do, except that he knows he wants a holiday. He decides to visit Tiburon Mendez, a powerful but shady Mexican businessman who he once flew to Alaska for a hunting trip. Arriving at the Mendez mansion in Mexico, he is immediately surprised by the beauty and youth of Mendez’s wife, Miryea.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/83diOZcg6ZiY8voNy2k4BX9TsMf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14249'),
  ('17455204849206413', 'Revenge', 2007, 'Action, Drama, Mystery', 'Anton Megerdichev, Svetlana Nikoporovich, Aleksandr Abramov', 'Aleksand Dorbinian', 'Denis Nikiforov, Andrei Panin, Elena Panova, Ivan Makarevich, Dmitriy Shevchenko, Pavel Derevyanko, Mikhail Gorevoy, Sergey Polyakov', null, 'When Artem Kolchin, Denis Nikiforov, arrives in the U.S. to fight for the championship, he soon finds himself fighting for his life after he sends a young, aggressive boxer, who provokes him into sparring, into a coma and ultimately killing him. That is when Artem finds out that the young boxer was none other than the only son of Felix Mendez, the powerful Mexican mafia kingpin, played masterfully by Victor Herminio Lopez, and when the real fight begins.', 'When Artem Kolchin, Denis Nikiforov, arrives in the U.S. to fight for the championship, he soon finds himself fighting for his life after he sends a young, aggressive boxer, who provokes him into sparring, into a coma and ultimately killing him. That is when Artem finds out that the young boxer was none other than the only son of Felix Mendez, the powerful Mexican mafia kingpin, played masterfully by Victor Herminio Lopez, and when the real fight begins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aGNFlrzLgxjPhpNHKlrzdpcRFY0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56525'),
  ('738448809202043753', 'Revenge', 2017, 'Action, Horror, Thriller, Drama', 'Coralie Fargeat, Valentin Rodriguez, Amin Rharda', 'Coralie Fargeat', 'Matilda Lutz, Kevin Janssens, Vincent Colombe, Guillaume Bouchède, Jean-Louis Tribes, Barbara Gateau, Avant Strangel', 'R', 'Jen''s romantic getaway with her wealthy married boyfriend is disrupted when his friends arrive for an impromptu hunting trip. Tension mounts at the house until the situation culminates in an unexpected way.', 'Jen''s romantic getaway with her wealthy married boyfriend is disrupted when his friends arrive for an impromptu hunting trip. Tension mounts at the house until the situation culminates in an unexpected way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AbWKFxt459cWYTNPTcbpB0i2hQp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:467938'),
  ('273815432696944849', 'Revenge', 2026, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Rodrigo Valdes, Kenji Katori', 'Daniel Krauze, Matt Bosack, Yalun Tu', 'Alejandro Speitzer, Paola Nuñez, Natalia Solián, Luis Alberti, Iazua Larios', null, 'The brutal murder of the wife of “Toro,” a military hero in the special forces, turns him into a man with a single purpose: revenge. After a stroke of fate makes him a millionaire, Carlos transforms his fortune into an arsenal and, together with his closest soldiers, sets out to hunt down those responsible.', 'The brutal murder of the wife of “Toro,” a military hero in the special forces, turns him into a man with a single purpose: revenge. After a stroke of fate makes him a millionaire, Carlos transforms his fortune into an arsenal and, together with his closest soldiers, sets out to hunt down those responsible.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FggJGx8fwwy21gEIXYusIlHcUn8z.jpg', 'plex:movie:revenge-2026'),
  ('454162254730884559', 'Revenge Delivered', 2021, 'TV Movie, Thriller', 'Bill Corcoran, Michel Bisson', 'Jordan Robinson', 'Oluniké Adeliyi, Mary Antonini, Samantha Brown, Tamara Almeida, Jefferson Brown, Tom Melissis, Ucal Shillingford, Shadia Ali', null, 'A dark truth comes to light when renowned obstetrician Dr. Victoria Brooks suspects that one of her student residents is secretly the vengeful daughter of someone from her past.', 'A dark truth comes to light when renowned obstetrician Dr. Victoria Brooks suspects that one of her student residents is secretly the vengeful daughter of someone from her past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rXncRi6iD9PKbpH26QzBudrFvx3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:830471'),
  ('166853033796354461', 'Revenge for Jolly!', 2012, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Chadd Harbold, Daniel Katz', 'Brian Petsos', 'Brian Petsos, Oscar Isaac, Elijah Wood, Kristen Wiig, Adam Brody, Ryan Phillippe, Garret Dillahunt, Amy Seimetz', 'R', 'Harry is having a very, very bad day. He returns home from an all-night drinking binge with his cousin Cecil, to discover that his little dog Jolly...Harry''s one true love and the source of light in his dark, solitary life-has been murdered. Brokenhearted and beyond consolation, he vows to track down the dog''s murderer at any cost. Armed with a stockpile of firepower in the trunk of his car, he and Cecil embark on a frenzied, alcohol-fueled wild-goose chase, leaving a bloody path of destruction in their wake.', 'Harry is having a very, very bad day. He returns home from an all-night drinking binge with his cousin Cecil, to discover that his little dog Jolly...Harry''s one true love and the source of light in his dark, solitary life-has been murdered. Brokenhearted and beyond consolation, he vows to track down the dog''s murderer at any cost. Armed with a stockpile of firepower in the trunk of his car, he and Cecil embark on a frenzied, alcohol-fueled wild-goose chase, leaving a bloody path of destruction in their wake.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3LDh44NHhTa27TfO0ntWiilogKo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:192126'),
  ('975727531626707105', 'Revenge Girl', 2017, 'Romance, Comedy, Action', 'Koichiro Miki', 'Satoko Okazaki', 'Mirei Kiritani, Nobuyuki Suzuki, Sho Kiyohara, Fumika Baba, Aimi Satsukawa, Shin''ya Ohwada, Aisa Takeuchi, Shiho Sasaki', null, 'Miki Takaraishi is a smart and beautiful 24-year-old woman, but her personality is not as good. She falls in love with Yuga Saito who is handsome and comes from a politician family. They see each other romantically, but Yugo Saito dumps Miki Takaraishi. To get revenge on Yuga Saito, she decides to run for prime minister. For her election campaign, she hires Toshiya Kadowaki as her campaign strategist.', 'Miki Takaraishi is a smart and beautiful 24-year-old woman, but her personality is not as good. She falls in love with Yuga Saito who is handsome and comes from a politician family. They see each other romantically, but Yugo Saito dumps Miki Takaraishi. To get revenge on Yuga Saito, she decides to run for prime minister. For her election campaign, she hires Toshiya Kadowaki as her campaign strategist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/id6cc0rA5FxT2h1EYzOxuydTJsq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:489634'),
  ('436260466737603064', 'Revenge in the House of Usher', 1983, 'Horror', 'Jesús Franco, Alain Hardy', 'Jesús Franco', 'Howard Vernon, Daniel White, Jean Tolzac, Analía Ivars, Françoise Blanchard, Olivier Mathot, Antonio Mayans, Lina Romay', null, 'Upon arriving at the dilapidated estate of his mentor, Dr. Harker finds his former professor, Dr. Usher, radically changed. Instead of the reasoned scholar he once knew, a paranoid man is in his place and he''s spiraling into madness.', 'Upon arriving at the dilapidated estate of his mentor, Dr. Harker finds his former professor, Dr. Usher, radically changed. Instead of the reasoned scholar he once knew, a paranoid man is in his place and he''s spiraling into madness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g8cNMwb7NR4l7l6TROOc71BZ5zu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30799'),
  ('317863461992456867', 'Revenge of a Blonde', 1994, 'Comedy', 'Jeannot Szwarc', null, 'Christian Clavier, Clémentine Célarié, Marie-Anne Chazel, Annie Cordy, Philippe Khorsand, Antoine Duléry, Franck de la Personne, Marc de Jonge', null, 'An upstanding provincial reporter becomes presenter of the TV news on a commercial network owned by an influential Italian businessman. He soon outgrows his family and neglects them terribly. Investigating a fascist terrorist cell, the reporter''s integrity is called into doubt by the police. Soon after, his jealous wife unleashes her wrath live in TV. It goes from bad to worse until his wife''s anger brings him back to his senses and back home.', 'An upstanding provincial reporter becomes presenter of the TV news on a commercial network owned by an influential Italian businessman. He soon outgrows his family and neglects them terribly. Investigating a fascist terrorist cell, the reporter''s integrity is called into doubt by the police. Soon after, his jealous wife unleashes her wrath live in TV. It goes from bad to worse until his wife''s anger brings him back to his senses and back home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8ciT8i5BFIkB5aSBjAuyY0Qncto.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51196'),
  ('716143793849793822', 'Revenge of Drunken Master', 1981, 'Action', 'Kang Beom-gu, Kim Yeong-Il', 'Lee Jung-Heon', 'David Wang Dae-Wi, Bruce Jang Il-Sik, Kwon Seong-yeong, Kim Yeong-Il, Lee Mi-ji, Han Myeong-hwan, Kim Ki-joo, Eom Ju-Hyeon', null, 'Accidentally discovering the operations of the Blood Ninja gangsters, a mischievous young man masters the skills of the Drunk Fist and proceeds to fight against them. But the gangsters join forces, vowing to kill him before the young master destroys them all.', 'Accidentally discovering the operations of the Blood Ninja gangsters, a mischievous young man masters the skills of the Drunk Fist and proceeds to fight against them. But the gangsters join forces, vowing to kill him before the young master destroys them all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/quKBcuiESLMORZfwEXslr40SpCp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40032'),
