  ('71489197130083245', 'Revenge of the Pink Panther', 1978, 'Comedy, Crime, Mystery', 'Ernest Day, Blake Edwards, Anthony Squire', 'Ron Clark, Blake Edwards, Frank Waldman', 'Peter Sellers, Herbert Lom, Dyan Cannon, Robert Webber, Robert Loggia, Paul Stewart, Adrienne Corri, Douglas Wilmer', 'PG', 'Chief Inspector Jacques Clouseau is dead. At least that is what the world—and Charles Dreyfus—believe when a dead body is discovered in Clouseau''s car after being shot off the road. Naturally, Clouseau knows differently and, taking advantage of not being alive, sets out to discover why an attempt was made on his life.', 'Chief Inspector Jacques Clouseau is dead. At least that is what the world—and Charles Dreyfus—believe when a dead body is discovered in Clouseau''s car after being shot off the road. Naturally, Clouseau knows differently and, taking advantage of not being alive, sets out to discover why an attempt was made on his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pvFiI8Kkq6JIf9uxDUU5FEvet7f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6081'),
  ('1017948506366108391', 'Revenge of the Snakes', 1962, 'Drama, Crime, Western', 'Metin Erksan', 'Metin Erksan', 'Fikret Hakan, Nurhan Nur, Aliye Rona, Erol Taş, Sadiye Arcıman, Kadir Savun, Ali Şen, Tevfik Fikret Uçak', null, 'The film follows the life of a poor, old woman defying the hierarchy in the village. Irazca is an old woman who lives with her son Kara Bayram, her daughter-in-law Hatice, and three grandchildren. The headman of the village sells a lot from the common land of the village to Haceli. The family does not want a house to be built in front of their house and struggles against the tricks of the headman and Haceli.', 'The film follows the life of a poor, old woman defying the hierarchy in the village. Irazca is an old woman who lives with her son Kara Bayram, her daughter-in-law Hatice, and three grandchildren. The headman of the village sells a lot from the common land of the village to Haceli. The family does not want a house to be built in front of their house and struggles against the tricks of the headman and Haceli.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t0mRMkLpFUnSUOhvdbxRI6pWjuT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:270406'),
  ('491704162032834089', 'Revenge of the Snakes', 1985, 'Drama', 'Şerif Gören', 'Yavuzer Çetinkaya, Fakir Baykurt', 'Kadir İnanır, Fatma Girik, Serpil Çakmaklı, Nur Sürer, Erdal Özyağcılar, Savaş Yurttaş, İhsan Yüce, Ahmet Evintan', null, 'Kara Bayram is a poor farmer living in a Turkish village with his wife, 3 kids (4th on the way) and his old mother Irazca Ana. They live on their own until another villager, Haceli who is backed up by the Mukhtar (local administrator of the Village) starts to build a new house right in front of their''s. Kara Bayram and Irazca Ana do not accept these uninvited neighboors from the first day and unwanted events start right away.', 'Kara Bayram is a poor farmer living in a Turkish village with his wife, 3 kids (4th on the way) and his old mother Irazca Ana. They live on their own until another villager, Haceli who is backed up by the Mukhtar (local administrator of the Village) starts to build a new house right in front of their''s. Kara Bayram and Irazca Ana do not accept these uninvited neighboors from the first day and unwanted events start right away.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9CZt7StiS5Y58m3GCffgktRjt0O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:692105'),
  ('716040949405143229', 'Revenge of the Stepford Wives', 1980, 'Horror, Thriller, TV Movie, Science Fiction', 'Robert Fuest, Ric Waite', 'David Wiltse', 'Sharon Gless, Julie Kavner, Audra Lindley, Don Johnson, Mason Adams, Arthur Hiller, Ellen Weston, Thomas Hill', null, 'A TV reporter arrives in the quiet town of Stepford to launch an investigation into why the town has the lowest divorce and crime rates in America. However, she begins to notice some bizarre behavior in the women of the town, discovering that Stepford is not as clean-cut as it seems.', 'A TV reporter arrives in the quiet town of Stepford to launch an investigation into why the town has the lowest divorce and crime rates in America. However, she begins to notice some bizarre behavior in the women of the town, discovering that Stepford is not as clean-cut as it seems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c05VnCHInpIbbSzsLrtmZxz8J53.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:137533'),
  ('165624279130473611', 'Revenge of the Virgins', 1959, 'Western', 'Peter Perry Jr., Gene Gropper, Vilis Lapenieks', 'Edward D. Wood Jr.', 'Charles Veltmann Jr., Jodean Lawrence, Stanton Pritchard, Hank Delgado, Louis Massad, Jewell Morgan, Ralph Cookson, Betty Shay', null, 'When settlers start to move in on their sacred grounds, a tribe of female Indians vow to do anything they can to stop them.', 'When settlers start to move in on their sacred grounds, a tribe of female Indians vow to do anything they can to stop them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vzWcEubimQ6U0r5uoX6czl8flar.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:188219'),
  ('589202460071691890', 'Revenge of the Zombies', 1943, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Steve Sekely, Edward J. Kay, Mack Stengler', 'Van Norcross, Edmond Kelso', 'John Carradine, Robert Lowery, Gale Storm, Mauritz Hugo, Sybil Lewis, James Baskett, Veda Ann Borg, Madame Sul-Te-Wan', null, 'When Dr. Von Altermann''s wife Lila dies mysteriously at his spooky mansion her relations suspect murder. They also suspect the doctor is turning her into a zombie, to join the army of living dead he hopes to devote to the Nazi cause. However, Lila, though dead, has developed a will of her own.', 'When Dr. Von Altermann''s wife Lila dies mysteriously at his spooky mansion her relations suspect murder. They also suspect the doctor is turning her into a zombie, to join the army of living dead he hopes to devote to the Nazi cause. However, Lila, though dead, has developed a will of her own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tFx5BAqWTaZfCvWy8LQ5OOMdz1R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32862'),
