  ('1054667300462826319', 'Reverse', 2009, 'Comedy, Drama, Thriller, Romance', 'Borys Lankosz, Marcin Koszałka', 'Andrzej Bart', 'Agata Buzek, Krystyna Janda, Marcin Dorociński, Anna Polony, Adam Woronowicz, Bronisław Wrocławski, Łukasz Konopka, Błażej Wójcik', null, 'A story about women, set in the present and in 1950s Warsaw. Sabina, a quiet, shy woman who has just turned thirty lacks a man in her life. Her mother knows all about it and tries at all costs to find her daughter a good candidate for a husband. The whole situation is controlled by the grandmother, an eccentric lady with a sharp tongue from whom no secrets can be kept.', 'A story about women, set in the present and in 1950s Warsaw. Sabina, a quiet, shy woman who has just turned thirty lacks a man in her life. Her mother knows all about it and tries at all costs to find her daughter a good candidate for a husband. The whole situation is controlled by the grandmother, an eccentric lady with a sharp tongue from whom no secrets can be kept.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t3dWyZ5HAhdXp3p6P1ZDRqbQxp1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36405'),
  ('650794336978002451', 'Reversion', 2025, 'Mystery, Thriller', 'Jacob Santana, David Azcano, Jose Cerqueda', 'Frank Ariza, Marco Lagarde, Jacob Santana', 'Jaime Lorente, Manuel Vega, Belén Rueda, Fernando Cayo, Manny Perez, Roger Wasserman, Víc Gómez, Gerardo Mercedes', null, 'Mario sees his brother David''s kidnapping. When David returns 19 days later with no memory, Mario suspects the returnee isn''t really his brother. His investigation challenges his grip on reality.', 'Mario sees his brother David''s kidnapping. When David returns 19 days later with no memory, Mario suspects the returnee isn''t really his brother. His investigation challenges his grip on reality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ebjesXVbxvqWzYw9PqOXsTsgNfx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1526519'),
