  ('33976894215497760', 'Revival of Evangelion', 1998, 'Action, Animation, Drama, Science Fiction', 'Masayuki, Kazuya Tsurumaki, Masahiko Otsuka', 'Akio Satsukawa', 'Megumi Ogata, Kotono Mitsuishi, Megumi Hayashibara, Yuko Miyamura, Akira Ishida, Fumihiko Tachiki, Koichi Yamadera, Yuriko Yamaguchi', null, 'Revival of Evangelion is a re-edit of the Neon Genesis Evangelion films , released in 1998. It consists of Evangelion: Death (which was essentially a clip show that summarized the entire regular series) and The End of Evangelion , re-edited together to make a version that tells the entire story of Evangelion. It is considered to be the final form of the Evangelion films.', 'Revival of Evangelion is a re-edit of the Neon Genesis Evangelion films , released in 1998. It consists of Evangelion: Death (which was essentially a clip show that summarized the entire regular series) and The End of Evangelion , re-edited together to make a version that tells the entire story of Evangelion. It is considered to be the final form of the Evangelion films.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gQx6E4roKZ7UAAKCYDMDNdYdMeo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54270'),
  ('345666726021618855', 'Revivre', 2014, 'Drama', 'Im Kwon-taek, Kim Hyung-koo, Jung Young-min', 'Song Yoon-hee', 'Ahn Sung-ki, Kim Gyu-ri, Kim Ho-jung, Jeon Hye-jin, Yeon Woo-jin, Kim Yeong-hun, Cha Chung-hwa, Ahn Suk-hwan', null, 'A middle-aged man who has recently lost his wife to cancer indulges in fantasies about a young woman at his work, in the new film from Korean master Im Kwon-taek.', 'A middle-aged man who has recently lost his wife to cancer indulges in fantasies about a young woman at his work, in the new film from Korean master Im Kwon-taek.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/inRvhh5Tl7UKG8IS6PKuzjjfOc0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:284301'),
  ('769479708396492935', 'Revoir Paris', 2022, 'Drama', 'Stéphane Fontaine, Luc Bricault, Marie Usannaz-Joris', 'Jean-Stéphane Bron, Marcia Romano', 'Virginie Efira, Benoît Magimel, Grégoire Colin, Maya Sansa, Nastya Golubeva Carax, Amadou Mbow, Souleymane Touré, Ema Zampa', null, 'Three months after surviving a terrorist attack in a bistro, Mia is still traumatized and unable to recall the events of that night. In an effort to move forward, she investigates her memories and retraces her steps.', 'Three months after surviving a terrorist attack in a bistro, Mia is still traumatized and unable to recall the events of that night. In an effort to move forward, she investigates her memories and retraces her steps.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zaNVTXH3woUs1LGUEeMMntDs3oM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:915931'),
  ('1014614882528112084', 'Revolt', 2017, 'Science Fiction, Action', 'Joe Miale, Karl Walter Lindenlaub', 'Rowan Athale, Joe Miale', 'Lee Pace, Bérénice Marlohe, Jason Flemyng, Sibulele Gcilitshana, Wandile Molebatsi, Sekoati Tsubane, Leroy Gopal, Welile Nzuza', 'R', 'The story of humankind''s last stand against a cataclysmic alien invasion. Set in the war-ravaged African countryside, a U.S. soldier and a French foreign aid worker team up to survive the alien onslaught. Their bond will be tested as they search for refuge across a crumbling world.', 'The story of humankind''s last stand against a cataclysmic alien invasion. Set in the war-ravaged African countryside, a U.S. soldier and a French foreign aid worker team up to survive the alien onslaught. Their bond will be tested as they search for refuge across a crumbling world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eM2zipCkAXhp0BZF2noDp7bRFgV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:313943'),
  ('21213401209290114', 'Revolt at Fort Laramie', 1957, 'Action, War, Western', 'Lesley Selander', 'Robert C. Dennis', 'John Dehner, Gregg Palmer, Frances Helm, Don Gordon, Robert Keys, Robert Knapp, Eddie Little Sky, Harry Dean Stanton', null, 'At the breaking of the Civil War the garrison of Fort Laramie splits between the sympathezers of the two different factions, but when the fort is attacked by the Sioux, they unite their forces to fight them.', 'At the breaking of the Civil War the garrison of Fort Laramie splits between the sympathezers of the two different factions, but when the fort is attacked by the Sioux, they unite their forces to fight them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3AcwSy5YGxzbZJZHpJx0ydPkviI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:102966'),
  ('1111037779209928669', 'Revolt of the Zombies', 1936, 'Horror', 'Victor Halperin, Arthur Martinelli', 'Howard Higgin, Victor Halperin, Rollo Lloyd', 'Dean Jagger, Dorothy Stone, Roy D''Arcy, Robert Noland, George Cleveland, E. Alyn Warren, Carl Stockdale, William Crowell', 'NR', 'The story is set in Cambodia in the years following WWI. An evil count has come into possession of the secret methods by which men can be transformed into walking zombies and uses these unholy powers to create a race of slave laborers. An expedition is sent to the ruins of Angkor Wat, in hopes of ending the count''s activities once and for all. Unfortunately, one of the members of the expedition has his own agenda.', 'The story is set in Cambodia in the years following WWI. An evil count has come into possession of the secret methods by which men can be transformed into walking zombies and uses these unholy powers to create a race of slave laborers. An expedition is sent to the ruins of Angkor Wat, in hopes of ending the count''s activities once and for all. Unfortunately, one of the members of the expedition has his own agenda.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/37LMhQ3wk95yxhhhMdHGzkT5lHw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23389'),
  ('324689217001891691', 'Revolting Rhymes', 2017, 'Family, Animation, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Jan Lachauer, Jakob Schuh, Bin-Han To', 'Jan Lachauer, Quentin Blake, Jakob Schuh', 'Dominic West, Gemma Chan, Rose Leslie, Tamsin Greig, Bertie Carvel, Rob Brydon, Amelie Forester-Evans, Isaac Hempstead Wright', null, 'Two half-hour animated films based on the much-loved rhymes written by Roald Dahl and illustrated by Quentin Blake.', 'Two half-hour animated films based on the much-loved rhymes written by Roald Dahl and illustrated by Quentin Blake.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cAbP9VEq0JlIngr9DzKIPBz0HY7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:430162'),
  ('318766739514673379', 'Revolución', 2010, null, 'Mariana Chenillo, Fernando Eimbcke, Amat Escalante', 'Mauricio Katz', 'Adriana Barraza, Mónica Bejarano, Ari Brickman, Yolanda Abbud L., Carmen Corral, Jeannine Derbez, Javier Lacroix, Robert M. Martínez', null, 'Made up of 10 short films, ''Revolucion'' analyzes through the eyes of the directors what is the revolution today and what it means to the young minds of Mexico.', 'Made up of 10 short films, ''Revolucion'' analyzes through the eyes of the directors what is the revolution today and what it means to the young minds of Mexico.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1nnB85qJj68vygVH4GOOm0zSDag.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69357'),
  ('28893571996553700', 'Revolution', 1968, 'Documentary, Music, History', 'Jack O''Connell, Bil Godsey', 'Jack O''Connell, Norman Martin', 'Today Malone, Herb Caen, Ronnie Davis, Louis Gottlieb, Ellis D. Sox, J. Barry Decker, Thomas J. Cahill, Quicksilver Messenger Service', 'NR', 'The San Francisco scene in 1967-68. Documentary about hippies shot during the height of the movement . Viewpoints from many kinds of people. Music by Steve Miller Band, Mother Earth, Quicksilver Messenger Service and others.', 'The San Francisco scene in 1967-68. Documentary about hippies shot during the height of the movement . Viewpoints from many kinds of people. Music by Steve Miller Band, Mother Earth, Quicksilver Messenger Service and others.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iSfwuLIEcWUJKFDvzgHkCX8cfHu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:191413'),
  ('676321515223173247', 'Revolution', 1985, 'Adventure, Drama, History, War', 'Hugh Hudson, Bernard Lutic', 'Robert Dillon', 'Al Pacino, Donald Sutherland, Nastassja Kinski, Joan Plowright, Dave King, Dexter Fletcher, Sid Owen, Richard O''Brien', null, 'New York trapper Tom Dobb becomes an unwilling participant in the American Revolution after his son Ned is drafted into the Army by the villainous Sergeant Major Peasy. Tom attempts to find his son, and eventually becomes convinced that he must take a stand and fight for the freedom of the Colonies, alongside the aristocratic rebel Daisy McConnahay. As Tom undergoes his change of heart, the events of the war unfold in large-scale grandeur.', 'New York trapper Tom Dobb becomes an unwilling participant in the American Revolution after his son Ned is drafted into the Army by the villainous Sergeant Major Peasy. Tom attempts to find his son, and eventually becomes convinced that he must take a stand and fight for the freedom of the Colonies, alongside the aristocratic rebel Daisy McConnahay. As Tom undergoes his change of heart, the events of the war unfold in large-scale grandeur.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m4LPxSJ8G8KVtySaleJhlTJqKBF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12701'),
  ('856245838813460147', 'Revolution and Land', 2019, 'Documentary, History', 'Willy Ilizarbe, Elard Robles, Gonzalo Benavente Secco', 'Gonzalo Benavente Secco', 'Hugo Blanco, Ricardo Bedoya, Juan Velasco Alvarado, Alexander Huerta-Mercado', null, 'The long fight over the land, which demolished the wall between master and serf, continues to divide Peru to this day. But the 1969 agrarian reform marked a before and after in the country''s story - a profound change that Peruvian cinema reflected and encapsulated, creating great imagination we continue to discover today. 50 years after the social experiments of the revolution, we ask ourselves whether Peru really messed up or not with Juan Velasco Alvarado.', 'The long fight over the land, which demolished the wall between master and serf, continues to divide Peru to this day. But the 1969 agrarian reform marked a before and after in the country''s story - a profound change that Peruvian cinema reflected and encapsulated, creating great imagination we continue to discover today. 50 years after the social experiments of the revolution, we ask ourselves whether Peru really messed up or not with Juan Velasco Alvarado.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pI8Fwx2CZhyApeMbbipoDiPO8VS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:638623'),
  ('665642104250123451', 'Revolution in Russia', 1905, 'History, Drama', 'Lucien Nonguet', null, null, null, 'A dramatization of the uprising in Odessa, Russia in 1905: A ship''s crew, tired of being mistreated, mutinies and takes over their ship. When they reach land, a sailor who died during the mutiny is made a martyr, inspiring an uprising in the city. Then the authorities decide to repress the revolt with a brutal show of force.', 'A dramatization of the uprising in Odessa, Russia in 1905: A ship''s crew, tired of being mistreated, mutinies and takes over their ship. When they reach land, a sailor who died during the mutiny is made a martyr, inspiring an uprising in the city. Then the authorities decide to repress the revolt with a brutal show of force.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ed9QC0usvOdv9CUUgDJ1ZtGEWNk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:185220'),
  ('304405319163499187', 'Revolution of Our Times', 2021, 'Documentary', 'Kiwi Chow Kwun-Wai', null, 'Hongkongers, Benny Tai Yiu-ting, Gwyneth Ho', null, 'Throughout Hong Kong’s history, Hongkongers have fought for freedom and democracy but have yet to succeed. In 2019, a controversial extradition bill was introduced that would allow Hongkongers to be tried in mainland China. This decision spurred massive protests, riots, and resistance against heavy-handed Chinese rule over the City-State. Award-winning director Kiwi Chow documents the events to tell the story of the movement, with both a macro view of its historical context and footage and interviews from protestors on the front lines.', 'Throughout Hong Kong’s history, Hongkongers have fought for freedom and democracy but have yet to succeed. In 2019, a controversial extradition bill was introduced that would allow Hongkongers to be tried in mainland China. This decision spurred massive protests, riots, and resistance against heavy-handed Chinese rule over the City-State. Award-winning director Kiwi Chow documents the events to tell the story of the movement, with both a macro view of its historical context and footage and interviews from protestors on the front lines.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aalqZbr1yAAoDU9996Qyaw4U63k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:850884'),
  ('781681632387883831', 'Revolution OS', 2001, 'Documentary', 'J.T.S. Moore', 'J.T.S. Moore', 'Susan Egan, Linus Torvalds, Richard M. Stallman, Eric S. Raymond, Bruce Perens, Larry Augustin, Michael Tiemann, Brian Behlendorf', 'PG', 'REVOLUTION OS tells the inside story of the hackers who rebelled against the proprietary software model and Microsoft to create GNU/Linux and the Open Source movement.', 'REVOLUTION OS tells the inside story of the hackers who rebelled against the proprietary software model and Microsoft to create GNU/Linux and the Open Source movement.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h7oBhsEsiHUgZ1uflyqBafB6SoB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19433'),
  ('280736034930423400', 'Revolutionary Girl Utena: The Movie', 1999, 'Animation, Drama, Fantasy, Romance', 'Kunihiko Ikuhara, Shinya Hasegawa, Keiko Kawashima', 'Yoji Enokido', 'Tomoko Kawakami, Yuriko Fuchizaki, Mitsuhiro Oikawa, Kotono Mitsuishi, Aya Hisakawa, Takehito Koyasu, Takeshi Kusao, Yuri Shiratori', null, 'In a loose retelling of the Revolutionary Girl Utena TV series, Utena Tenjou arrives at Ohtori Academy, only to be immediately swept up in a series of duels for the hand of her classmate Anthy Himemiya and the power she supposedly holds. At the same time, Utena reunites with Touga Kiryuu, a friend from her childhood who seems to know the secrets behind the duels. Utena must discover those secrets for herself, before the power that rules Ohtori claims her and her friends, new and old.', 'In a loose retelling of the Revolutionary Girl Utena TV series, Utena Tenjou arrives at Ohtori Academy, only to be immediately swept up in a series of duels for the hand of her classmate Anthy Himemiya and the power she supposedly holds. At the same time, Utena reunites with Touga Kiryuu, a friend from her childhood who seems to know the secrets behind the duels. Utena must discover those secrets for herself, before the power that rules Ohtori claims her and her friends, new and old.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4gEuxmg7OTc9Nxbg5pj5cVTaKCh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19738'),
  ('166345328276879514', 'Revolutionary Road', 2008, 'Drama, Romance', 'Sam Mendes, Roger Deakins', 'Justin Haythe', 'Leonardo DiCaprio, Kate Winslet, Kathy Bates, Michael Shannon, Kathryn Hahn, David Harbour, Dylan Baker, Richard Easton', 'R', 'A young couple living in a Connecticut suburb during the mid-1950s struggle to come to terms with their personal problems while trying to raise their two children. Based on a novel by Richard Yates.', 'A young couple living in a Connecticut suburb during the mid-1950s struggle to come to terms with their personal problems while trying to raise their two children. Based on a novel by Richard Yates.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cvkD3yiVXLg3as8EAG3LaTycONQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4148'),
  ('502923143270771783', 'Revolver', 1973, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Sergio Sollima, Aldo Scavarda, Fabrizio Sergenti Castellani', 'Massimo De Rita, Dino Maiuri, Sergio Sollima', 'Fabio Testi, Oliver Reed, Paola Pitagora, Agostina Belli, Frédéric de Pasquale, Bernard Giraudeau, Reinhard Kolldehoff, Peter Berling', 'R', 'An Italian prison official''s wife is kidnapped, and the kidnappers demand that a notorious prisoner be released in order for the man to get his wife back. He gets the man released - but then kidnaps him himself, in order to ensure that the man''s colleagues don''t kill his wife. Enraged, the gang sets out to free their compatriot and kill the man who took him.', 'An Italian prison official''s wife is kidnapped, and the kidnappers demand that a notorious prisoner be released in order for the man to get his wife back. He gets the man released - but then kidnaps him himself, in order to ensure that the man''s colleagues don''t kill his wife. Enraged, the gang sets out to free their compatriot and kill the man who took him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pXCblJ5ucPV9KC1lhVCHqkchGkz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4788'),
  ('239586524506801822', 'Revolver', 2005, 'Drama, Thriller, Crime, Mystery', 'Guy Ritchie, Tim Maurice-Jones, Max Keene', 'Guy Ritchie', 'Jason Statham, Ray Liotta, Vincent Pastore, André 3000, Terence Maynard, Andrew Howard, Mark Strong, Francesca Annis', 'R', 'Hotshot gambler Jake Green is long on bravado and seriously short of common sense. Rarely is he allowed in any casino because he''s a bona fide winner and, in fact, has taken so much money over the years that he''s the sole client of his accountant elder brother, Billy. Invited to a private game, Jake is in fear of losing his life.', 'Hotshot gambler Jake Green is long on bravado and seriously short of common sense. Rarely is he allowed in any casino because he''s a bona fide winner and, in fact, has taken so much money over the years that he''s the sole client of his accountant elder brother, Billy. Invited to a private game, Jake is in fear of losing his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cXJYFEIGNxiNTCekP1A68ICzJen.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10851'),
  ('692630562525732119', 'Revolver', 2024, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Oh Seung-uk, Kang Gook-hyun, Kim Yong-tae', 'Oh Seung-uk, Joo Byeol', 'Jeon Do-yeon, Ji Chang-wook, Lim Ji-yeon, Kim Jun-han, Kim Jong-soo, Jeong Man-sik, Jeon Hye-jin, Lee Jung-jae', null, 'Su-young, a police detective who went to prison for someone else, is surprised when a mysterious woman named Yoon-sun arrives to collect her on her day of release. As she discovers that the promised compensation for her time behind bars has vanished, Su-young embarks on a mission to reclaim what rightfully belongs to her.', 'Su-young, a police detective who went to prison for someone else, is surprised when a mysterious woman named Yoon-sun arrives to collect her on her day of release. As she discovers that the promised compensation for her time behind bars has vanished, Su-young embarks on a mission to reclaim what rightfully belongs to her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hOYoIVY2DQdOkcLw0sEt9jFLvUj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1089223'),
  ('473653618564467920', 'Revolver Lily', 2023, 'Action', 'Isao Yukisada, Keisuke Imamura', 'Isao Yukisada, Tatsuo Kobayashi', 'Haruka Ayase, Hiroki Hasegawa, Kavka Shishido, Kotone Furukawa, Hiroya Shimizu, Jesse, Jiro Sato, Mitsuru Fukikoshi', 'NR', 'In 1924 Yuri killed 57 people as a spy before going underground as the madam of a small brothel. There, she encounters an orphan whose family was murdered and holds the key to finding a large sum of money reported missing by the Imperial Japanese Army. But with an army of soldiers after them, they must fight to survive.', 'In 1924 Yuri killed 57 people as a spy before going underground as the madam of a small brothel. There, she encounters an orphan whose family was murdered and holds the key to finding a large sum of money reported missing by the Imperial Japanese Army. But with an army of soldiers after them, they must fight to survive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mcNkWMvBoBIwLESbuufpb1zuUg1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1067406'),
  ('170022865712875487', 'Revue à Longchamp: Arrivée de M. le président Félix Faure', 1898, 'Documentary', 'Gabriel Veyre', null, 'Félix François Faure', null, 'President Félix Faure, escorted by horsemen, marching past the troops at Longchamp.', 'President Félix Faure, escorted by horsemen, marching past the troops at Longchamp.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ne8FIdIgL4leaa76Nuyl5Ab1Yq9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:265032'),
  ('718221135157907087', 'Revue à Longchamp: charge finale et départ de M. le Président', 1898, null, 'Gabriel Veyre', null, null, null, 'The end of the Longchamp parade and departure of the President, filmed by the Lumière brothers.', 'The end of the Longchamp parade and departure of the President, filmed by the Lumière brothers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zcsUXFiwzGSFYxUBctbYUCMLiCP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:265049'),
  ('62374524237715445', 'Revue à Longchamp: Défilé de la Garde Républicaine et des pompiers', 1898, 'Documentary', 'Gabriel Veyre', null, null, null, 'A review of the Republican Guard and firemen at Longchamp filmed by the Lumière brothers.', 'A review of the Republican Guard and firemen at Longchamp filmed by the Lumière brothers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/atmy2Ha5FvgkyoiagnjAnpCe1eN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:265039'),
  ('966626079981452885', 'Revue Starlight: Rondo Rondo Rondo', 2020, 'Animation, Drama, Action, Fantasy', 'Hisashi Akimoto, Tomohiro Furukawa, Haru Yamada', 'Tatsuto Higuchi', 'Momoyo Koyama, Suzuko Mimori, Moeka Koizumi, Maho Tomita, Aina Aiba, Haruki Iwata, Hinata Sato, Ayasa Ito', null, 'The franchise centers on "Starlight," a dance and dance troupe beloved the world over. Karen and Hikari promised each other when they were little that one day they would perform together on that stage. Time passes and now they are both 16 years old. Karen is very excited about the dance lessons she takes every day, keeping her promise close to her heart. Hikari changed schools and now lives far away from Karen. But the gears of fate bring them together again, destined to meet again. The two, along with other hopefuls, will compete in a mysterious audition to become part of this great company.', 'The franchise centers on "Starlight," a dance and dance troupe beloved the world over. Karen and Hikari promised each other when they were little that one day they would perform together on that stage. Time passes and now they are both 16 years old. Karen is very excited about the dance lessons she takes every day, keeping her promise close to her heart. Hikari changed schools and now lives far away from Karen. But the gears of fate bring them together again, destined to meet again. The two, along with other hopefuls, will compete in a mysterious audition to become part of this great company.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aThbMkFyjAwT0CQreu9sxSkiBcv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:645439'),
  ('293840758306883992', 'Revue Starlight: The Movie', 2021, 'Animation, Drama, Fantasy, Action, Music', 'Tomoko Sato, Shoko Yasuda, Takushi Koide', 'Tatsuto Higuchi', 'Momoyo Koyama, Suzuko Mimori, Moeka Koizumi, Maho Tomita, Aina Aiba, Haruki Iwata, Hinata Sato, Ayasa Ito', null, 'The stage emulates life and compresses it, setting free skills learned over lifetimes in brief but dazzling displays for the amusement and judgment of others. For the performers, it is the ultimate risk, and some will rise while others must fall. Nowhere is this truer than at the Seisho Music Academy, where music, dance and real weapons all come into play in the creation of the next great Star. Karen and Hikari’s destinies have been linked since a childhood promise, but their journeys here have taken very different paths. Now, after Hikari leaves, Karen must discover who she is without her opposite, while Hikari must rediscover her own course. Nor are they the only girls who must reassess and change if they want to achieve their dreams, as the dance, magic, and swordplay continue!', 'The stage emulates life and compresses it, setting free skills learned over lifetimes in brief but dazzling displays for the amusement and judgment of others. For the performers, it is the ultimate risk, and some will rise while others must fall. Nowhere is this truer than at the Seisho Music Academy, where music, dance and real weapons all come into play in the creation of the next great Star. Karen and Hikari’s destinies have been linked since a childhood promise, but their journeys here have taken very different paths. Now, after Hikari leaves, Karen must discover who she is without her opposite, while Hikari must rediscover her own course. Nor are they the only girls who must reassess and change if they want to achieve their dreams, as the dance, magic, and swordplay continue!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fQS5v2gglHPfx4BLjPhkuBqSntm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:645440'),
  ('340423812201427260', 'REW-FFWD', 1994, 'Drama, Documentary', 'Denis Villeneuve, Martin Leclerc', 'Denis Villeneuve', 'Lorne Brass, Stephan Cloutier', null, 'A young photographer is on assignment in Jamaica. It''s a cultural shock! First anguished, he later becomes quite fascinated by the people he meets, their neighbourhood and their music.', 'A young photographer is on assignment in Jamaica. It''s a cultural shock! First anguished, he later becomes quite fascinated by the people he meets, their neighbourhood and their music.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cH8j2bgb9fnTH5V6kwOfpAGnSEp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:239122'),
  ('741821447562172342', 'Rewind', 2023, 'Drama, Romance, Science Fiction', 'Jyothika Sahoo, Judy Ann Carino, Mae Cruz-Alviar', 'Enrico C. Santos', 'Dingdong Dantes, Marian Rivera, Coney Reyes, Ariel Ureta, Ina Feleo, Joross Gamboa, Via Antonio, Lito Pimentel', null, 'Mary loves John for as long as she can remember. But after years of marriage, John''s priorities shift, leading to a strained relationship with Mary, which causes a tragic accident that takes away Mary''s life. Until one day, John gets an extraordinary proposition - to rewind time and save the life of the woman he loves.', 'Mary loves John for as long as she can remember. But after years of marriage, John''s priorities shift, leading to a strained relationship with Mary, which causes a tragic accident that takes away Mary''s life. Until one day, John gets an extraordinary proposition - to rewind time and save the life of the woman he loves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i8UjdAwezeFHHR4opNb3LxDCQWC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1143183'),
  ('293233504075026752', 'Rewind & Play', 2023, 'Documentary, Music', 'Alain Gomis', 'Alain Gomis', 'Thelonious Monk, Henri Renaud, Nellie Monk', null, 'The lack of respect with which the Black musician Thelonious Monk was treated in Autumn, 1969. At the end of his European tour, legendary jazz musician Thelonious Monk appears on an interview show in Paris for French state television.', 'The lack of respect with which the Black musician Thelonious Monk was treated in Autumn, 1969. At the end of his European tour, legendary jazz musician Thelonious Monk appears on an interview show in Paris for French state television.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/utDrnApBBmMPttvc1a4PfDgVamB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:928004'),
  ('689158249106143957', 'Rewind This!', 2013, 'Documentary', 'Josh Johnson, Christopher Palmer', null, 'Atom Egoyan, Cassandra Peterson, Lloyd Kaufman, Jason Eisener, Mamoru Oshii, Frank Henenlotter, Kevin Tenney, Charles Band', null, 'Home video changed the world. The cultural and historical impact of the VHS tape was enormous. This film traces the ripples of that impact by examining the myriad aspects of society that were altered by the creation of videotape.', 'Home video changed the world. The cultural and historical impact of the VHS tape was enormous. This film traces the ripples of that impact by examining the myriad aspects of society that were altered by the creation of videotape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4iOjFXiU1QyoqeKF3Eq5IyxtzjP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:173484'),
  ('701798457010822298', 'Rewind: Die zweite Chance', 2018, 'Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Johannes Sievert, Hendrik A. Kley', 'Johannes Sievert', 'Àlex Brendemühl, Maximilian von Pufendorf, İdil Üner, Simon Licht, Uwe Preuss, Siri Nase, Sascha Alexander Geršak, Sylvia Hoeks', null, 'While investigating of a murder case, widowed police commissioner Lenders makes a confusing discovery; one of the victims comes from a different time. Did an implanted chip make this time travel possible? More victims follow. What is the motive behind the murders? And what is the connection between the victims? Can he use the chip to change his own life story?', 'While investigating of a murder case, widowed police commissioner Lenders makes a confusing discovery; one of the victims comes from a different time. Did an implanted chip make this time travel possible? More victims follow. What is the motive behind the murders? And what is the connection between the victims? Can he use the chip to change his own life story?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xZySEmIassKyhJP6ecTwWMYWlBp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:379282'),
  ('996575690846184280', 'Rex: A Dinosaur''s Story', 1993, 'Family, Adventure', 'Haruki Kadokawa, Masahiko Iimura', 'Shōichi Maruyama, Haruki Kadokawa, Bill Bannerman', 'Yumi Adachi, Shinobu Otake, Tsunehiko Watase, Yuta Yamazaki, Mitsuko Kusabue, Toki Shiozawa, Masanobu Ando, Haruka Suenaga', null, 'A young girl befriends an infant T-rex after her paleontologist father nurtures a lair of lost dinosaur eggs.', 'A young girl befriends an infant T-rex after her paleontologist father nurtures a lair of lost dinosaur eggs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f7EsJ9YCIslx2pf4AGOGe8GfqgJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:627110'),
  ('158171899810222040', 'Rey', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Ryan Chamley', 'Luke Saliba', 'John Tui, Luke Saliba, Erin Saliba, Ronn Kurtz, Dominik Shields, Ashleyrose Gilham, James Pratt, Robb Angus', null, 'Rey is a 2017 comedy drama that follows the character Rey. He works in a small cubical surrounded by dirty windows and wilted plants. After the death of a work colleague he quits his job and is hit by a car, soon after his life takes a major turn driven by the events that cant be changed. He meets a girl and faces his fears all at the same time. But there is a fact about Rey that is still untold.', 'Rey is a 2017 comedy drama that follows the character Rey. He works in a small cubical surrounded by dirty windows and wilted plants. After the death of a work colleague he quits his job and is hit by a car, soon after his life takes a major turn driven by the events that cant be changed. He meets a girl and faces his fears all at the same time. But there is a fact about Rey that is still untold.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tx9fUFFjRgyflbQEks4IlWBirKe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:801776'),
  ('567392789915787126', 'Rey gitano', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Juanma Bajo Ulloa, Álvaro de Armiñán', 'Juanma Bajo Ulloa', 'Manuel Manquiña, Karra Elejalde, Arturo Valls, María León, Rosa María Sardà, Charo López, Pilar Bardem, Albert Pla', null, 'Two unemployed detectives with conflicting ideologies meet a rogue and seductive gypsy who proposes them a crazy mission. After that, their luck will change for the worse.', 'Two unemployed detectives with conflicting ideologies meet a rogue and seductive gypsy who proposes them a crazy mission. After that, their luck will change for the worse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yN6T2xOZpicOHNp4Yr5xa2aCA6R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:332354'),
  ('1021458644356996798', 'Reykjavik Whale Watching Massacre', 2009, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Júlíus Kemp, Jean-Noël Mustonen', 'Sjón', 'Gunnar Hansen, Pihla Viitala, Nae Yuuki, Terence Anderson, Miranda Hennessy, Aymen Hamdouchi, Carlos Takeshi, Miwa Yanagizawa', 'R', 'An epic tale about a group of whale watchers, whose ship breaks down and they get picked up by a whale fisher vessel. The Fishbillies on the vessel has just gone bust, and everything goes out of control.', 'An epic tale about a group of whale watchers, whose ship breaks down and they get picked up by a whale fisher vessel. The Fishbillies on the vessel has just gone bust, and everything goes out of control.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n6RoIohCmo2xfBVG855fUq9REw4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30388'),
  ('511470216603338756', 'Reykjavik-Rotterdam', 2008, 'Action, Thriller', 'Óskar Jónasson, Bergsteinn Björgúlfsson', 'Óskar Jónasson, Arnaldur Indriðason', 'Baltasar Kormákur, Ingvar E. Sigurðsson, Lilja Nótt Þórarinsdóttir, Þröstur Leó Gunnarsson, Victor Löw, Jörundur Ragnarsson, Ólafur Darri Ólafsson, Theodór Júlíusson', null, 'A former sailor who has served prison sentences for alcohol smuggling fights to keep his family afloat. He is offered pay for a last tour of cargo between Reykjavik and Rotterdam. He agrees, in the hope to get out of debt, but unexpected events occur.', 'A former sailor who has served prison sentences for alcohol smuggling fights to keep his family afloat. He is offered pay for a last tour of cargo between Reykjavik and Rotterdam. He agrees, in the hope to get out of debt, but unexpected events occur.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zDohZKlkQSJk6sNWI4CqFmgLVzf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63907'),
  ('235439568745290633', 'Rez Ball', 2024, 'Drama', 'Sydney Freeland, Kira Kelly', 'Sydney Freeland, Sterlin Harjo', 'Jessica Matten, Kauchani Bratt, Amber Midthunder, Julia Jones, Cody Lightning, Dallas Goldtooth, Ernest Tsosie III, Zoey Reyes', 'PG-13', 'After losing their star player, a high school basketball team rooted in Native American culture must unite to keep their state championship dreams alive.', 'After losing their star player, a high school basketball team rooted in Native American culture must unite to keep their state championship dreams alive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5MKpjuiCTk8nYnsUf5QegiPKEDh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:858414'),
  ('1145172689941737394', 'Rezeta', 2012, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Luis Fernando Frías de la Parra, Fernanda de la Peza, Emilio Valdés', 'Luis Fernando Frías de la Parra', 'Rezeta Veliu, Roger Mendoza, Emiliano Becerríl, Sebastián Córdova, Paulina Dávila, Renato Ornelas, Hector Lozano Dávila, Santiago Paredes', null, 'A jet-setting model leads a freewheeling life in Mexico City until she falls in love with an artist.', 'A jet-setting model leads a freewheeling life in Mexico City until she falls in love with an artist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x4Lgc21QJ787IXOdtIwuZWEtGt2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:188194'),
  ('330286062925964963', 'Rhapsody', 1954, 'Drama, Music, Romance', 'Charles Vidor, Harry Jackson', 'Michael Kanin, Fay Kanin', 'Elizabeth Taylor, Vittorio Gassman, John Ericson, Louis Calhern, Michael Chekhov, Barbara Bates, Richard Hageman, Richard Lupino', 'NR', 'A rich, young beauty, Louise Durant, follows the man she loves and hopes to marry to Zurich where he studies violin at the conservatory. A piano student at the conservatory falls madly in love with Louise. The violinist loves his music first and Louise second. The pianist loves Louise first and his music second. Louise must ultimately choose which man she wants.', 'A rich, young beauty, Louise Durant, follows the man she loves and hopes to marry to Zurich where he studies violin at the conservatory. A piano student at the conservatory falls madly in love with Louise. The violinist loves his music first and Louise second. The pianist loves Louise first and his music second. Louise must ultimately choose which man she wants.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hlCoTzHXiv9zPjux1z6DvLe6ZgH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109898'),
  ('528192472226889810', 'Rhapsody in August', 1991, 'Drama', 'Akira Kurosawa, Shoji Ueda, Naohito Sakai', 'Ishirō Honda, Akira Kurosawa', 'Sachiko Murase, Hidetaka Yoshioka, Tomoko Otakara, Mieko Suzuki, Mitsunori Isaki, Hisashi Igawa, Toshie Negishi, Chōichirō Kawarasaki', 'PG', 'An elderly Nagasaki hibakusha spends a summer caring for her four grandchildren, whose curiosity about the 1945 bombing stirs buried memories and moral questions. When an American nephew from Hawaii visits, the family confronts grief, guilt, and the possibility of reconciliation across generations.', 'An elderly Nagasaki hibakusha spends a summer caring for her four grandchildren, whose curiosity about the 1945 bombing stirs buried memories and moral questions. When an American nephew from Hawaii visits, the family confronts grief, guilt, and the possibility of reconciliation across generations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/413NqJ8Oz5hTNzz2APjHQxFEw6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20645'),
  ('467035873888629323', 'Rhapsody in Blue', 1945, 'Music, Romance, Drama', 'Irving Rapper, Sol Polito', 'Elliot Paul, Howard Koch', 'Robert Alda, Joan Leslie, Alexis Smith, Charles Coburn, Julie Bishop, Albert Bassermann, Morris Carnovsky, Rosemary DeCamp', 'NR', 'Fictionalized biography of George Gershwin and his fight to bring serious music to Broadway.', 'Fictionalized biography of George Gershwin and his fight to bring serious music to Broadway.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iJGYugztSu3YQFvdRMGKWlK0NFk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43491'),
  ('1128921265189407463', 'Rhapsody in Rivets', 1941, 'Animation, Comedy, Music', 'Friz Freleng', null, null, null, 'A construction foreman conducts his workers like a symphony orchestra as they build a skyscraper to Franz Liszt''s "Hungarian Rhapsody No. 2."', 'A construction foreman conducts his workers like a symphony orchestra as they build a skyscraper to Franz Liszt''s "Hungarian Rhapsody No. 2."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rHLdiw138KHOslSO9vGPUS74VQj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:163052'),
