  ('355030434997255245', 'Rhea Gall Force', 1989, 'Science Fiction, Animation, Action, Adventure, War', 'Katsuhito Akiyama', 'Hideki Kakinuma', 'Eriko Hara, Hiromi Tsuru, Michie Tomizawa, Naoko Matsui, Maria Kawamura, Yuko Mizutani, Kazuhiko Inoue, Masaharu Sato', null, 'The last remaining human soldiers of a devastated Earth fight against the machines for one last chance for their species to escape and survive.', 'The last remaining human soldiers of a devastated Earth fight against the machines for one last chance for their species to escape and survive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mlTBM0AtHlzcxYv5guMPi1Hm3yM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:300773'),
  ('373648122883181102', 'Rhine Virgin', 1953, 'Drama, Crime', 'Gilles Grangier, Marc Fossard', null, 'Jean Gabin, Nadia Gray, Andrée Clément, Élina Labourdette, Albert Dinan, Olivier Hussenot, Renaud Mary, Robert Mercier', null, 'Reported missing in 1940, Jacques Ledru comes back to Strasbourg as Martin Schmidt. He tracks down his wife Genevieve, but she''s remarried and has taken the head of his shipping company. She and her husband will do anything to get rid of Jacques and keep his company.', 'Reported missing in 1940, Jacques Ledru comes back to Strasbourg as Martin Schmidt. He tracks down his wife Genevieve, but she''s remarried and has taken the head of his shipping company. She and her husband will do anything to get rid of Jacques and keep his company.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8YDyQQhible9TUVSOSRYjd2s5nD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76639'),
  ('217254715210377490', 'Rhinegold', 2022, 'History, Drama, Crime, Music', 'Rainer Klausmann, Fatih Akin, Taha Drissi', 'Fatih Akin', 'Emilio Sakraya, Kardo Razzazi, Mona Pirzad, Majid Bakhtiari, Julia Goldberg, Karim Günes, Doğa Gürer, Marlon Heidel', null, 'Xatar’s way from the ghetto to the top of the charts is as dramatic as it is daring. From the hell of an Iraqi jail, Giwar Hajabi emigrated to Germany as a young boy with his family in the mid-1980s and has to start right at the bottom. There are opportunities, but far more obstacles. Giwar’s rise from petty criminal to major dealer is swift. Until one shipment goes missing. In order to clear his debts with the cartel, he plans a legendary gold heist. But just as everything goes wrong, another door opens for Giwar thanks to his passion for music …', 'Xatar’s way from the ghetto to the top of the charts is as dramatic as it is daring. From the hell of an Iraqi jail, Giwar Hajabi emigrated to Germany as a young boy with his family in the mid-1980s and has to start right at the bottom. There are opportunities, but far more obstacles. Giwar’s rise from petty criminal to major dealer is swift. Until one shipment goes missing. In order to clear his debts with the cartel, he plans a legendary gold heist. But just as everything goes wrong, another door opens for Giwar thanks to his passion for music …', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aUtbh1sFpCWEZlABXNjOugCbt88.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:912726'),
  ('1078192220128839925', 'Rhinestone', 1984, 'Comedy', 'Bob Clark, Duncan Henderson, Janet G. Knutsen', 'Phil Alden Robinson, Sylvester Stallone', 'Sylvester Stallone, Dolly Parton, Richard Farnsworth, Ron Leibman, Tim Thomerson, Steve Peck, Penny Santon, Russell Buchanan', 'PG', 'After a big-time country singer brags that she can turn anybody in to a country-singin'' star, she''s out to prove she can live up to her talk when she recruits a cab-driver as a country singer. He''s scheduled to sing at a big-time NYC country night club and she puts her ample powers to work in preparing her protege.', 'After a big-time country singer brags that she can turn anybody in to a country-singin'' star, she''s out to prove she can live up to her talk when she recruits a cab-driver as a country singer. He''s scheduled to sing at a big-time NYC country night club and she puts her ample powers to work in preparing her protege.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sEptnLBR09J87sR6d67QJzvnif3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16551'),
  ('929931885699277916', 'Rhino', 2021, 'Drama, Crime, Thriller', 'Oleh Sentsov, Bogumił Godfrejów, Alex Osadchenko', 'Oleh Sentsov', 'Serhii Filimonov, Yevhen Chernykov, Yevhenii Hryhoriev, Alina Zievakova, Mariia Shtofa, Iryna Mak, Serhii Smeian, Dmytro Lozovskyi', null, 'Ukraine, 1990s. Young Vova, cruel and tenacious, struggles to find his place among the ruthless members of the underworld in a city where crime and corruption reign.', 'Ukraine, 1990s. Young Vova, cruel and tenacious, struggles to find his place among the ruthless members of the underworld in a city where crime and corruption reign.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wFxS2vvXJFGCCVWlPYzpCcLQagf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:807888'),
  ('943327679371140931', 'Rhino Full Throttle', 2013, 'Animation, Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Erik Schmitt', null, 'Tino Mewes, Marleen Lohse, Folke Renken', null, 'Bruno is making his way through the city searching for its soul. Driven by his curiosity, a challenging imagination and his wild reflection on reality he is lifting the old dusty curtain on the city''s crusted perception.', 'Bruno is making his way through the city searching for its soul. Driven by his curiosity, a challenging imagination and his wild reflection on reality he is lifting the old dusty curtain on the city''s crusted perception.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i3gIOiP0m2UC84C5w2G4rUeyKnc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:223709'),
  ('684528753791914238', 'Rhino Season', 2012, 'Drama, Thriller, History', 'Bahman Ghobadi, Ali Farkhonde, Erim Gayretli', 'Bahman Ghobadi', 'Behrouz Vossoughi, Monica Bellucci, Caner Cindoruk, Yılmaz Erdoğan, Belçim Bilgin, Arash Labaf, Ali Pourtash, Beren Saat', null, 'Kurdish-Iranian poet Sahel has just been released from a thirty-year prison sentence in Iran. Now the one thing keeping him going is the thought of finding his wife, who thinks he''s been dead for over twenty years.', 'Kurdish-Iranian poet Sahel has just been released from a thirty-year prison sentence in Iran. Now the one thing keeping him going is the thought of finding his wife, who thinks he''s been dead for over twenty years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1d7hDJnzEzrBjsWg3ad8Fq69j2O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110391'),
  ('979342557250395823', 'Rhinoceros', 1964, 'Animation', 'Jan Lenica', 'Jan Lenica', null, null, 'Based on Eugene Ionesco’s play, this is an animated film warning that by conforming to patterns and living en masse, people will become rhinoceroses.', 'Based on Eugene Ionesco’s play, this is an animated film warning that by conforming to patterns and living en masse, people will become rhinoceroses.', null, 'tmdb:movie:240636'),
  ('167555659931569809', 'Rhinoceros', 1974, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Tom O''Horgan, Robert Enrietto, R. Robert Rosenbaum', 'Julian Barry', 'Gene Wilder, Zero Mostel, Karen Black, Joe Silver, Robert Weil, Marilyn Chris, Percy Rodriguez, Robert Fields', 'PG', 'A boozing young man in love with his co-worker finds that everyone around him, even his pompous and condescending best friend, is changing into a rhinoceros.', 'A boozing young man in love with his co-worker finds that everyone around him, even his pompous and condescending best friend, is changing into a rhinoceros.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/snbaUumISQKX1uMrEziKXqOjxMF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39194'),
  ('411447060048377652', 'Rhyme & Reason', 1997, 'Documentary, Music', 'Peter Spirer', null, 'Dr. Dre, Nas, RZA, Method Man, Ice-T, Too $hort, Q-Tip, B-Real', 'R', 'A study in the world of hip-hop, done mostly with interviews, in order to see why it is as popular as it is today and what the future holds.', 'A study in the world of hip-hop, done mostly with interviews, in order to see why it is as popular as it is today and what the future holds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a7WsScJGSIV1sArdQdpGCYHXN54.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90928'),
  ('668850180701865362', 'Rhythm', 1957, 'Documentary', 'Len Lye', null, null, null, 'Intended as a publicity film for Chrysler, Rhythm uses rapid editing to speed up the assembly of a car, synchronizing it to African drum music. The sponsor was horrified by the music and suspicious of the way a worker was shown winking at the camera; although Rhythm won first prize at a New York advertising festival, it was disqualified because Chrysler had never given it a television screening. P. Adams Sitney wrote, “Although his reputation has been sustained by the invention of direct painting on film, Lye deserves equal credit as one of the great masters of montage.” And in Film Culture, Jonas Mekas said to Peter Kubelka, “Have you seen Len Lye’s 50-second automobile commercial? Nothing happens there…except that it’s filled with some kind of secret action of cinema.” - Harvard Film Archive', 'Intended as a publicity film for Chrysler, Rhythm uses rapid editing to speed up the assembly of a car, synchronizing it to African drum music. The sponsor was horrified by the music and suspicious of the way a worker was shown winking at the camera; although Rhythm won first prize at a New York advertising festival, it was disqualified because Chrysler had never given it a television screening. P. Adams Sitney wrote, “Although his reputation has been sustained by the invention of direct painting on film, Lye deserves equal credit as one of the great masters of montage.” And in Film Culture, Jonas Mekas said to Peter Kubelka, “Have you seen Len Lye’s 50-second automobile commercial? Nothing happens there…except that it’s filled with some kind of secret action of cinema.” - Harvard Film Archive', null, 'tmdb:movie:203093'),
  ('622112802016174005', 'Rhythm 21', 1921, 'Animation', 'Hans Richter', null, null, null, 'Abstract animated short film. Grey and white squares change size and shape on a black background.', 'Abstract animated short film. Grey and white squares change size and shape on a black background.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9ABnQLyk32sk5wgRgWTqCuXtDUv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105715'),
  ('302285011292103389', 'Rhythm 23', 1923, 'Animation', 'Hans Richter', null, null, null, 'We watch white shapes dancing on black background, which changes when the white shape fills up the screen completely, and black lines and figures bounce around on the now white background.', 'We watch white shapes dancing on black background, which changes when the white shape fills up the screen completely, and black lines and figures bounce around on the now white background.', null, 'tmdb:movie:105716'),
  ('640885903512958494', 'Ri¢hie Ri¢h', 1994, 'Comedy, Family', 'Don Burgess, Donald Petrie, Michael Samson', 'Tom S. Parker, Jim Jennewein', 'Macaulay Culkin, John Larroquette, Edward Herrmann, Christine Ebersole, Jonathan Hyde, Michael Maccarone, Joel Robinson, Jonathan Hilario', 'PG', 'Billionaire heir Richie Rich has it all, including Reggie Jackson as a batting coach and Claudia Schiffer as a personal trainer -- but no playmates. What''s more, scoundrel Laurence Van Dough is scheming to take over the family empire. Uh-oh! Enter faithful butler Cadbury to save the day.', 'Billionaire heir Richie Rich has it all, including Reggie Jackson as a batting coach and Claudia Schiffer as a personal trainer -- but no playmates. What''s more, scoundrel Laurence Van Dough is scheming to take over the family empire. Uh-oh! Enter faithful butler Cadbury to save the day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qgGh5d0IHAZRlHIdFS3XWVygumR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11011'),
  ('1095724556357314493', 'Rialto', 2020, 'Drama', 'Peter Mackie Burns, Adam Scarth', 'Mark O''Halloran', 'Tom Vaughan-Lawlor, Tom Glynn-Carney, Monica Dolan, Sophie Jo Wasson, Michael Smiley, Scott Graham, Kervin Soobrayen, Eileen Walsh', null, 'Colm is in his mid-forties, married, with two teenage children. Still grieving the death of his father, a destructive figure in his life, Colm struggles with his relationship to his own son, whilst at work a recent takeover threatens his job. Unable to share his vulnerability with his wife, Colm’s world is falling apart around him. In the midst of this crisis, Colm finds a comfort that no one else can provide but Jay.', 'Colm is in his mid-forties, married, with two teenage children. Still grieving the death of his father, a destructive figure in his life, Colm struggles with his relationship to his own son, whilst at work a recent takeover threatens his job. Unable to share his vulnerability with his wife, Colm’s world is falling apart around him. In the midst of this crisis, Colm finds a comfort that no one else can provide but Jay.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3N74fTMOI74GuLvK0TkXZtQrfde.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:618229'),
  ('1145972211248297655', 'Ricardo Arjona, Circo Soledad En Vivo', 2019, 'Music', null, null, null, null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/udhX7GZGnarL8odloJslkbatul7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:671643'),
  ('236517853710340358', 'Ricco', 1973, 'Action, Crime', 'Tulio Demicheli, Francisco Fraile, Félix Fernández', 'José Gutiérrez Maesso, Santiago Moncada, Mario Di Nardo', 'Christopher Mitchum, Barbara Bouchet, Malisa Longo, Eduardo Fajardo, Manuel Zarzo, José María Caffarel, Ángel Álvarez, Arthur Kennedy', 'R', 'Fresh out of the joint, young Ricco is eager to get home to see his family. He was cut loose a year early for good behavior, but it certainly wasn''t good behavior that got him in the big house in the first place. Two years prior, Ricco took it upon himself to go after Don Avito, the man who killed his pappy and took his girlfriend. Yet Ricco came out of prison a changed man. He had a lot of time to think, and the anger and thirst for revenge is no longer there, much to his mother''s chagrin. She is quite upset that her son is not interested in paying back Don Avito for his deeds, and she needles Ricco relentlessly until he reluctantly gives in to her demands.', 'Fresh out of the joint, young Ricco is eager to get home to see his family. He was cut loose a year early for good behavior, but it certainly wasn''t good behavior that got him in the big house in the first place. Two years prior, Ricco took it upon himself to go after Don Avito, the man who killed his pappy and took his girlfriend. Yet Ricco came out of prison a changed man. He had a lot of time to think, and the anger and thirst for revenge is no longer there, much to his mother''s chagrin. She is quite upset that her son is not interested in paying back Don Avito for his deeds, and she needles Ricco relentlessly until he reluctantly gives in to her demands.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uHj6CTY1NIrpJgzCOp0yNmH2TjE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86637'),
  ('769812221106533119', 'Rice', 1957, 'Drama', 'Tadashi Imai, Shunichirō Nakao', 'Yasutaro Yagi', 'Shinjirō Ehara, Eijirō Tōno, Yūko Mochizuki, Masako Nakamura, Izumi Hara, Isao Kimura, Hitomi Nakahara, Yoshiko Okada', null, 'A touching story depicting the harsh lives of farmers in Kasumigaura. An attempt to start a fishery business to revive an ailing farming community creates friction amongst the proud residents.', 'A touching story depicting the harsh lives of farmers in Kasumigaura. An attempt to start a fishery business to revive an ailing farming community creates friction amongst the proud residents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m7zrVglnSG6pkNZkpS2Ggr1u6sN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:199203'),
  ('134638286154521873', 'Rice Girl', 1956, 'Drama', 'Raffaello Matarazzo, Silvio Amadio, Luciano Trasatti', 'Aldo De Benedetti, Ennio De Concini, Carlo Musso', 'Elsa Martinelli, Folco Lulli, Michel Auclair, Rik Battaglia, Vivi Gioi, Lilla Brignone, Gianni Santuccio, Susanne Lévesy', null, 'The 19-year-old Elena, who is as pretty as she is bright, works as a rice girl for the landlord Guerrini. Having become aware of her name, he finds out that she is his illegitimate daughter of whom he knew nothing. He tries to secretly help Elena, who has fallen in love with the car mechanic Gianni. But that only creates mistrust. When Guerrini''s worthless nephew harasses the girl, the situation is dramatically worse.', 'The 19-year-old Elena, who is as pretty as she is bright, works as a rice girl for the landlord Guerrini. Having become aware of her name, he finds out that she is his illegitimate daughter of whom he knew nothing. He tries to secretly help Elena, who has fallen in love with the car mechanic Gianni. But that only creates mistrust. When Guerrini''s worthless nephew harasses the girl, the situation is dramatically worse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eM1V96Mkkm8mV1lyQxzx4dWmGPr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:169720'),
  ('948927130224183303', 'Rice Rhapsody', 2005, 'Drama, Romance', 'Kenneth Bi, Lam Wah-Chuen', 'Kenneth Bi', 'Sylvia Chang, Martin Yan, Mélanie Laurent, LePham Tan , Craig Toh , Ivy Ling Po, Chin Han, Maggie Q', null, 'With her elder two sons being gay, a traditionally-minded mother fears her youngest son could be too, thereby losing her last chance to have any grandchildren. With help from a friend she takes in a female French foreign exchange student, who ends up teaching the family a lot about life, acceptance, and love.', 'With her elder two sons being gay, a traditionally-minded mother fears her youngest son could be too, thereby losing her last chance to have any grandchildren. With help from a friend she takes in a female French foreign exchange student, who ends up teaching the family a lot about life, acceptance, and love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/YIGEulOZxB6g4Q4kSa0FUPaPaP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:97520'),
  ('264153132232944320', 'Riceboy Sleeps', 2023, 'Drama', 'Anthony Shim, Christopher Lew, Su Kim', 'Anthony Shim', 'Choi Seung-yoon, Ethan Hwang, Dohyun Noel Hwang, Anthony Shim, Hunter Dillon, Jerina Son, Kang In-sung, Choi Jong-ryul', 'NR', 'In the 1990s, an immigrant single mother raises her teenage son in the Canadian suburbs, determined to provide a better life for him than the one she left behind in South Korea.', 'In the 1990s, an immigrant single mother raises her teenage son in the Canadian suburbs, determined to provide a better life for him than the one she left behind in South Korea.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/344oy01RDIpTQd6Pw43iOYP3bjT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1008038'),
  ('955767735880964718', 'Rich and Famous', 1981, 'Drama', 'George Cukor, Donald Peterman', 'Gerald Ayres', 'Jacqueline Bisset, Candice Bergen, David Selby, Hart Bochner, Steven Hill, Meg Ryan, Matt Lattanzi, Daniel Faraldo', 'R', 'Two literary women compete for 20 years: one writes for the critics; the other one, to get rich.', 'Two literary women compete for 20 years: one writes for the critics; the other one, to get rich.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9nuZSHfHoZquBBd9RBJDQmldj9D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109962'),
  ('1011970211234163661', 'Rich and Famous', 1987, 'Action, Crime', 'Taylor Wong Tai-Loi, Derek Wan Man-Kit, Abdul M. Rumjahn', 'Manfred Wong Man-Chun, Stephen Shiu Yeuk-Yuen', 'Chow Yun-Fat, Alex Man Chi-Leung, Ko Chun-Hsiung, Andy Lau, Alan Tam, Pauline Wong, Peter Yang Kwan, Carina Lau', null, 'To pay off his debt as a gambler, a man drags his sister and step-brother into a life of crime and a violent war between rival gang lords.', 'To pay off his debt as a gambler, a man drags his sister and step-brother into a life of crime and a violent war between rival gang lords.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s8sLn3ayvGPY1AllbUwW3FSE3OJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:240477'),
  ('32226874607786766', 'Rich and Poor', 1983, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Pasquale Festa Campanile, Maria Pia Rocco, Franco Di Giacomo', 'Renato Pozzetto', 'Renato Pozzetto, Ornella Muti, Piero Mazzarella, Patrizia Fontana, Nanni Svampa, Corrado Olmi, Antonio Marsina, Dino Cassio', null, 'Pozzetto is a rich man obsessed by the idea of becoming poor. So, his psychiatric suggests him to leave home and live just like a poor man for some days. He will then become familiar with this way of living, and fear less the idea of becoming poor. So he does, and his old family & friends soon forget about him. They don''t miss him at all.', 'Pozzetto is a rich man obsessed by the idea of becoming poor. So, his psychiatric suggests him to leave home and live just like a poor man for some days. He will then become familiar with this way of living, and fear less the idea of becoming poor. So he does, and his old family & friends soon forget about him. They don''t miss him at all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3CQOegNJTTj7UXmf1CLBu8m463D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43571'),
  ('797521202753687224', 'Rich and Strange', 1931, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama, Adventure', 'Alfred Hitchcock, Charles Martin, Jack E. Cox', 'Val Valentine, Alma Reville', 'Henry Kendall, Joan Barry, Percy Marmont, Betty Amann, Elsie Randolph, Aubrey Dexter, Hannah Jones, Arty Ash', null, 'After receiving an advance inheritance, a bored London couple set off on a world cruise hoping to rejuvenate their marriage and escape their dull routine. But newfound wealth and freedom only expose deeper cracks in their relationship, as each becomes infatuated with someone else. Their journey through exotic ports and mounting disillusionment ultimately brings them face to face with the fragility—and resilience—of love.', 'After receiving an advance inheritance, a bored London couple set off on a world cruise hoping to rejuvenate their marriage and escape their dull routine. But newfound wealth and freedom only expose deeper cracks in their relationship, as each becomes infatuated with someone else. Their journey through exotic ports and mounting disillusionment ultimately brings them face to face with the fragility—and resilience—of love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8uELURwfZlQBsy26VUk7ap0v3ZS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36049'),
  ('378150403025442067', 'Rich Flu', 2024, 'Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Galder Gaztelu-Urrutia, Jon D. Domínguez', 'Galder Gaztelu-Urrutia, Pedro Rivero, David Desola', 'Mary Elizabeth Winstead, Rafe Spall, Lorraine Bracco, Dixie Egerickx, César Domboy, Timothy Spall, Jonah Hauer-King, Dayana Esebe', null, 'A strange disease kills off some of the richest and most influential people on the planet. First it was the billionaires, then the multi-millionaires and so on progressively... Then it threatens to strike anyone with any sort of fortune. With the whole world panicking, people try to flood the market with assets the world no longer wants.', 'A strange disease kills off some of the richest and most influential people on the planet. First it was the billionaires, then the multi-millionaires and so on progressively... Then it threatens to strike anyone with any sort of fortune. With the whole world panicking, people try to flood the market with assets the world no longer wants.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fKmn4SrS41loy8gMzyxups69Xof.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:934584'),
  ('782077843561814225', 'Rich Hill', 2014, 'Documentary', 'Tracy Droz Tragos, Andrew Droz Palermo, Andrew Droz Palermo', null, 'Alyssa Jewell, Andrew Jewell, Elizabeth Jewell, Willie Jewell', null, 'If you ever find yourself traveling down Interstate 49 through Missouri, try not to blink—you may miss Rich Hill, population 1,396. Rich Hill is easy to overlook, but its inhabitants are as woven into the fabric of America as those living in any small town in the country. This movie intimately chronicles the turbulent lives of three boys living in said Midwestern town and the fragile family bonds that sustain them.', 'If you ever find yourself traveling down Interstate 49 through Missouri, try not to blink—you may miss Rich Hill, population 1,396. Rich Hill is easy to overlook, but its inhabitants are as woven into the fabric of America as those living in any small town in the country. This movie intimately chronicles the turbulent lives of three boys living in said Midwestern town and the fragile family bonds that sustain them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uREVXf7LXUZuadZ4Ne20b5XB6IU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:250668'),
  ('331878641615111033', 'Rich in Love', 1992, 'Drama', 'Bruce Beresford, Peter James, Katterli Frauenfelder', 'Alfred Uhry', 'Albert Finney, Jill Clayburgh, Kathryn Erbe, Kyle MacLachlan, Piper Laurie, Ethan Hawke, Suzy Amis, Alfre Woodard', 'PG-13', 'Warren Odom, a rich Southern gentleman, is left in a state of shock when his wife, Helen, leaves him unexpectedly. With Helen gone, Warren''s kindhearted teenage daughter, Lucille, cares for him and tries to cheer him up. Warren slowly starts to recover, and begins a relationship with another woman, Vera Delmage. However, his life is complicated when his older daughter, Rae, arrives in town pregnant.', 'Warren Odom, a rich Southern gentleman, is left in a state of shock when his wife, Helen, leaves him unexpectedly. With Helen gone, Warren''s kindhearted teenage daughter, Lucille, cares for him and tries to cheer him up. Warren slowly starts to recover, and begins a relationship with another woman, Vera Delmage. However, his life is complicated when his older daughter, Rae, arrives in town pregnant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wNz2pIVeFze8gYubn0iEgSyZ5dj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:180576'),
  ('282912459225318494', 'Rich in Love 2', 2023, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Bruno Garotti, Natália Duarte, Jamile Marinho', 'Sylvio Gonçalves, Bruno Garotti, Maíra Oliveira', 'Danilo Mesquita, Giovanna Lancellotti, Jaffar Bambirra, Lellê, Fernanda Paes Leme, Ernani Moraes, Aline Dias, Kay Sara', null, 'When the idealistic Paula resumes her work as a volunteer doctor in the Amazon, Teto convinces his partners to establish their tomato cooperative in a village in the region. But to win back Paula''s heart and save the company from bankruptcy, Teto must definitely overcome his spoiled playboy habits and face the interests of a powerful farmer, who stands in his way.', 'When the idealistic Paula resumes her work as a volunteer doctor in the Amazon, Teto convinces his partners to establish their tomato cooperative in a village in the region. But to win back Paula''s heart and save the company from bankruptcy, Teto must definitely overcome his spoiled playboy habits and face the interests of a powerful farmer, who stands in his way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gA2emLQTNb8XS1646Nmhp91NNgv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1126852'),
  ('494659048398163873', 'Rich Kids', 1979, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Robert M. Young, Ralf D. Bode, Michael Hausman', 'Judith Ross', 'Trini Alvarado, Jeremy Levy, Kathryn Walker, John Lithgow, Terry Kiser, David Selby, Roberta Maxwell, Paul Dooley', 'PG', 'Two 12-year-olds, the products of Upper West Side broken homes, struggle to make sense of their parents lives and their own adolescent feelings.', 'Two 12-year-olds, the products of Upper West Side broken homes, struggle to make sense of their parents lives and their own adolescent feelings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9lDxqIY0yUcaxpivbd5LY9p2Ho3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85327'),
  ('981404220928111565', 'Rich Little''s Christmas Carol', 1978, 'Comedy, TV Movie', 'Trevor Evans', 'Rich Little', 'Rich Little', null, 'In this one-man show starring Rich Little, Ebenezer Scrooge hates Christmas, and it''s up to the Ghosts of Christmas Past, Present and Future to convince him otherwise.', 'In this one-man show starring Rich Little, Ebenezer Scrooge hates Christmas, and it''s up to the Ghosts of Christmas Past, Present and Future to convince him otherwise.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z42w0BclMvX8DqJVMIMIOLzr6cq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52515'),
  ('945516751758466776', 'Richard III', 1955, 'Drama, History', 'Laurence Olivier, Otto Heller, Jack N. Green', 'Colley Cibber, David Garrick', 'Laurence Olivier, Cedric Hardwicke, Nicholas Hannen, Ralph Richardson, John Gielgud, Mary Kerridge, Pamela Brown, Paul Huson', 'NR', 'Having helped his brother King Edward IV take the throne of England, the jealous hunchback Richard, Duke of Gloucester, plots to seize power for himself. Masterfully deceiving and plotting against nearly everyone in the royal court, including his eventual wife, Lady Anne, and his brother George, Duke of Clarence, Richard orchestrates a bloody rise to power before finding all his gains jeopardized by those he betrayed.', 'Having helped his brother King Edward IV take the throne of England, the jealous hunchback Richard, Duke of Gloucester, plots to seize power for himself. Masterfully deceiving and plotting against nearly everyone in the royal court, including his eventual wife, Lady Anne, and his brother George, Duke of Clarence, Richard orchestrates a bloody rise to power before finding all his gains jeopardized by those he betrayed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3zp2Kg5bvlFkKmWiQLmuWQAIEgG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43323'),
  ('124146958213049047', 'Richard III', 1995, 'Drama, War', 'Richard Loncraine, Mark Layton, Ken Tuohy', 'Ian McKellen, Richard Loncraine', 'Ian McKellen, Annette Bening, Jim Broadbent, Robert Downey Jr., Kristin Scott Thomas, Adrian Dunbar, Maggie Smith, Tim McInnerny', 'R', 'A murderous lust for the British throne sees Richard III descend into madness. Though the setting is transposed to the 1930s, England is torn by civil war, split between the rivaling houses of York and Lancaster. Richard aspires to a fascist dictatorship, but must first remove the obstacles to his ascension—among them his brother, his nephews and his brother''s wife. When the Duke of Buckingham deserts him, Richard''s plans are compromised.', 'A murderous lust for the British throne sees Richard III descend into madness. Though the setting is transposed to the 1930s, England is torn by civil war, split between the rivaling houses of York and Lancaster. Richard aspires to a fascist dictatorship, but must first remove the obstacles to his ascension—among them his brother, his nephews and his brother''s wife. When the Duke of Buckingham deserts him, Richard''s plans are compromised.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cBg1AMH1ucPsDlNMfcHlrreQXQX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31174'),
  ('648414302388771998', 'Richard Jewell', 2019, 'Drama, History', 'Clint Eastwood, Yves Bélanger, Priscilla Elliott', 'Marie Brenner', 'Paul Walter Hauser, Jon Hamm, Kathy Bates, Sam Rockwell, Olivia Wilde, Nina Arianda, Ian Gomez, Wayne Duvall', 'R', 'Richard Jewell thinks quick, works fast, and saves hundreds, perhaps thousands, of lives after a domestic terrorist plants several pipe bombs and they explode during a concert, only to be falsely suspected of the crime by sloppy FBI work and sensational media coverage.', 'Richard Jewell thinks quick, works fast, and saves hundreds, perhaps thousands, of lives after a domestic terrorist plants several pipe bombs and they explode during a concert, only to be falsely suspected of the crime by sloppy FBI work and sensational media coverage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Lgkm8jt4roAFPZQ52fKMhVmDaZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:292011'),
  ('616022147834366296', 'Richard Pryor: Here and Now', 1983, 'Comedy, Documentary, TV Movie', 'Richard Pryor', 'Richard Pryor, Paul Mooney', 'Richard Pryor, Paul Mooney', 'R', 'One of comedian Richard Pryor''s later stand-up performances. As foul-mouthed as ever, Pryor touches on most of the same topics as in his previous live shows. Filmed at the Saenger Theatre in New Orleans.', 'One of comedian Richard Pryor''s later stand-up performances. As foul-mouthed as ever, Pryor touches on most of the same topics as in his previous live shows. Filmed at the Saenger Theatre in New Orleans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rgTgRmiMVbpWp9asrEvjj8Xdhwx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21921'),
  ('1096269345119991021', 'Richard Pryor: Live and Smokin''', 1971, 'Comedy, Documentary, TV Movie', 'Michael Blum, Michael Blum', 'Richard Pryor', 'Richard Pryor', 'R', 'Richard Pryor: Live &amp; Smokin'' is the first stand-up act of Richard Pryor to be filmed out of the four that were released in total. This film was filmed in 1971 but not released until 1985, on VHS. This was the first stand-up act that Pryor did before he hit the mainstream audience. With only 48 minutes of footage, it is the shortest of Pryor''s stand-up routines.', 'Richard Pryor: Live &amp; Smokin'' is the first stand-up act of Richard Pryor to be filmed out of the four that were released in total. This film was filmed in 1971 but not released until 1985, on VHS. This was the first stand-up act that Pryor did before he hit the mainstream audience. With only 48 minutes of footage, it is the shortest of Pryor''s stand-up routines.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pdq8rXPK7vMLGL7124HVxioaggZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45103'),
  ('694138473481844251', 'Richard Pryor: Live in Concert', 1979, 'Comedy', 'Jeff Margolis, Tom Schamp', 'Richard Pryor, Paul Mooney', 'Richard Pryor, Jennifer Lee Pryor', 'R', 'Richard Pryor delivers monologues on race, sex, family and his favorite target—himself, live at the Terrace Theatre in Long Beach, California.', 'Richard Pryor delivers monologues on race, sex, family and his favorite target—himself, live at the Terrace Theatre in Long Beach, California.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zguG43yzPkiiNOyR9P1HglVNYOl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22975'),
  ('705531939312119271', 'Richard Pryor: Live on the Sunset Strip', 1982, 'Comedy, Documentary', 'Joe Layton, Haskell Wexler', 'Richard Pryor', 'Richard Pryor, Gene Cross, Julie Hampton, Jesse Jackson', 'R', 'Richard Pryor''s stand-up act includes his frank discussion about his freebasing addiction, as well as the infamous night on June 9, 1980 that he caught on fire.', 'Richard Pryor''s stand-up act includes his frank discussion about his freebasing addiction, as well as the infamous night on June 9, 1980 that he caught on fire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rK9eAYCr68dwv1mw4weaJu6Lx3W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21923'),
  ('517281438966949987', 'Richard Pryor: Omit the Logic', 2013, 'Documentary', 'Marina Zenovich, Christine Burrill', 'P.G. Morgan, Chris A. Peterson, Marina Zenovich', 'Richard Pryor, Mel Brooks, Dave Chappelle, Mike Epps, Whoopi Goldberg, Jesse Jackson, George López, Paul Mooney', 'R', 'Mike Epps, Richard Pryor Jr. and others recount the culture-defining influence of Richard Pryor - one of America''s most brilliant, iconic comic minds.', 'Mike Epps, Richard Pryor Jr. and others recount the culture-defining influence of Richard Pryor - one of America''s most brilliant, iconic comic minds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sCuj6Whfe0dmv0WDDBtONTX2Vxk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:174340'),
