  ('811371721188869412', 'Richelieu', 2023, 'Drama', 'Pier-Philippe Chevigny, Gabriel Brault-Tardif', 'Pier-Philippe Chevigny', 'Ariane Castellanos, Marc-André Grondin, Nelson Coronado, Ève Duranceau, Gerardo Miranda, Micheline Bernard, Luis Oliva, Antonio Ortega', null, 'A French-to-Spanish interpreter working for a food processing plant that hires seasonal workers from Guatemala is, at first determined to obey the sometimes excessive directives of the young boss, but she befriends the workers and tries to defend them against the exploitation they suffer.', 'A French-to-Spanish interpreter working for a food processing plant that hires seasonal workers from Guatemala is, at first determined to obey the sometimes excessive directives of the young boss, but she befriends the workers and tries to defend them against the exploitation they suffer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wklyn8Dq5a8d0mIWL2RNNPmOOJJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:958734'),
  ('1036166627187659138', 'Richie Rich''s Christmas Wish', 1998, 'Family, Comedy, Fantasy', 'John Murlowski, Christian Sebaldt, Todd Barron', 'Jason Feffer, Mark Furey, Rob Kerchner', 'David Gallagher, Eugene Levy, Keene Curtis, Jake Richardson, Martin Mull, Lesley Ann Warren, Richard Fancy, Marla Maples', 'G', 'After getting blamed for spoiling Christmas, the richest kid in the world wishes he''d never been born. Unfortunately, a wishing machine, invented by professor Keenbean, picked up the wish and made it come true. Now Richie finds himself in a parallel world where his only hope is to find professor Keenbean and the wishing machine so he can wish things back to normal.', 'After getting blamed for spoiling Christmas, the richest kid in the world wishes he''d never been born. Unfortunately, a wishing machine, invented by professor Keenbean, picked up the wish and made it come true. Now Richie finds himself in a parallel world where his only hope is to find professor Keenbean and the wishing machine so he can wish things back to normal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dELsdRZDsIvMwVkayiYZszk6V3P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73961'),
  ('693090222015646740', 'Richness of Internal Space', 2013, 'Drama', 'Kai Parlange Tessman, Juan José Saravia', 'Pierre Favreau, Kai Parlange Tessman', 'Kuno Becker, Gerardo Taracena, Ana Serradilla, Marina de Tavira, Juan Pablo Medina, Rocío Verdejo, Juan Carlos Colombo, Hernán Mendoza', null, 'Locked up and isolated, constantly exposed and threatened to be killed, for the first time in his life Lazaro understood that he was a free man.', 'Locked up and isolated, constantly exposed and threatened to be killed, for the first time in his life Lazaro understood that he was a free man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2z3dkv9lGRBD8zYSL23tWt0a2RW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:208447'),
  ('339848045621203129', 'Richy Guitar', 1985, 'Music, Comedy', 'Michael Laux, Thomas Meewes', 'Michael Laux', 'Farin Urlaub, Bela B., Hans Runge, Nena, Kristina Raschen, Ingrid van Bergen, Horst Pinnow, Dan van Husen', null, 'Richy Guitar is actually called Richard, but is only called like this by his parents. The young man finds it difficult to find work in Berlin, and when he finally does, he is bullied by his boss. When he meets drummer Igor and bassist Hans, a new rock band is immediately formed. While the trio dreams of a gig at the Avus racetrack, Richy''s relationship breaks down...', 'Richy Guitar is actually called Richard, but is only called like this by his parents. The young man finds it difficult to find work in Berlin, and when he finally does, he is bullied by his boss. When he meets drummer Igor and bassist Hans, a new rock band is immediately formed. While the trio dreams of a gig at the Avus racetrack, Richy''s relationship breaks down...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zBThn2K182iGeNtvcGrm2iPfYzx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2206'),
  ('1116675929077140854', 'Rickerl', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Adrian Goiginger, Paul Sprinz', 'Adrian Goiginger', 'Voodoo Jürgens, Ben Winkler, Agnes Hausmann, Clemens Aap Lindenberg, Linde Prelog, Nicole Beutler, Simon Morzé, Alina Schaller', null, 'Erich „Rickerl“ Bohacek is a likeable loser who on the one hand tries to build up a music career and on the other still wants to be a good father for his little son.', 'Erich „Rickerl“ Bohacek is a likeable loser who on the one hand tries to build up a music career and on the other still wants to be a good father for his little son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AexZ1VL8IHS0sZ3SZTPQJCc8Pwe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1180196'),
  ('1006464045440623070', 'Ricki and the Flash', 2015, 'Comedy, Drama, Music', 'Jonathan Demme, Declan Quinn, H.H. Cooper', 'Diablo Cody', 'Meryl Streep, Kevin Kline, Mamie Gummer, Sebastian Stan, Audra McDonald, Ben Platt, Rick Springfield, Charlotte Rae', 'PG-13', 'Meryl Streep stars as Ricki Rendazzo, a guitar heroine who made a world of mistakes as she followed her dreams of rock-and-roll stardom. Returning home, Ricki gets a shot at redemption and a chance to make things right as she faces the music with her family.', 'Meryl Streep stars as Ricki Rendazzo, a guitar heroine who made a world of mistakes as she followed her dreams of rock-and-roll stardom. Returning home, Ricki gets a shot at redemption and a chance to make things right as she faces the music with her family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y9hw9XSk8uVgLRfq3cweiAEJtU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:275601'),
  ('483830614775091109', 'Rickshaw Boy', 1982, 'Drama', 'Ling Zifeng, Wu Shenghan, Xu Xiaoxing', 'Ling Zifeng', 'Guan Zongxiang, Siqin Gaowa, Zhang Fengyi, Yan Bide, Xin Yin, Tang Li, Yan Han, Gao Fang', null, 'Xiang Zi is a rickshaw boy who has always had a desire to excel and a thirst for freedom. He married Hu Niu who died of dystocia later. After her death, another girl, Xiao Fuzi, falls in love with Xiang Zi but they are separated by poverty. Xiang Zi works very hard in order to change his life, only to find that Xiao Fuzi is dead just as he begins to be hopeful for their future. Finally, Xiang Zi, an unflinching man, surrenders to that dark society.', 'Xiang Zi is a rickshaw boy who has always had a desire to excel and a thirst for freedom. He married Hu Niu who died of dystocia later. After her death, another girl, Xiao Fuzi, falls in love with Xiang Zi but they are separated by poverty. Xiang Zi works very hard in order to change his life, only to find that Xiao Fuzi is dead just as he begins to be hopeful for their future. Finally, Xiang Zi, an unflinching man, surrenders to that dark society.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kV7GvVtcDEERhIYYTSfaiZXS0Ax.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:246545'),
  ('1083289593707836065', 'Ricky', 2009, 'Fantasy, Comedy, Drama, Mystery, Romance', 'François Ozon, Jeanne Lapoirie', 'Emmanuèle Bernheim, François Ozon', 'Sergi López, Alexandra Lamy, Mélusine Mayance, Arthur Peyret, André Wilms, Jean-Claude Bolle-Reddat, Julien Haurant, Eric Forterre', 'NR', 'When Katie meets Paco, they fall in love. From this an extraordinary child is born; Ricky, who quickly develops into something wonderful and not so normal.', 'When Katie meets Paco, they fall in love. From this an extraordinary child is born; Ricky, who quickly develops into something wonderful and not so normal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2n3UNhg9GhDK9aymmR2anM9rR3h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22136'),
