  ('840392545061619546', 'Ricky Gervais: SuperNature', 2022, 'Comedy', 'John L. Spencer', 'Ricky Gervais', 'Ricky Gervais', 'R', 'With his signature pitch-black sense of humor, Ricky Gervais takes the stage at the London Palladium in this provocative stand-up comedy special.', 'With his signature pitch-black sense of humor, Ricky Gervais takes the stage at the London Palladium in this provocative stand-up comedy special.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ry2HDP5KyEV3R7htXlFAeQbbXgf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:973164'),
  ('103512571891413388', 'Ricky Stanicky', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Peter Farrelly, John Brawley, Clare Plueckhahn', 'Brian Jarvis, Jeffrey Bushell, Jim Freeman', 'Zac Efron, John Cena, Andrew Santino, Jermaine Fowler, Lex Scott Davis, Anja Savcic, William H. Macy, Heather Mitchell', 'R', 'When three childhood best friends pull a prank gone wrong, they invent the imaginary Ricky Stanicky to get them out of trouble. Twenty years later, the trio still uses the nonexistent Ricky as a handy alibi for their immature behavior. But when their spouses and partners get suspicious and demand to finally meet the fabled Mr. Stanicky, the guilty trio decide to hire a washed-up actor and raunchy celebrity impersonator to bring him to life.', 'When three childhood best friends pull a prank gone wrong, they invent the imaginary Ricky Stanicky to get them out of trouble. Twenty years later, the trio still uses the nonexistent Ricky as a handy alibi for their immature behavior. But when their spouses and partners get suspicious and demand to finally meet the fabled Mr. Stanicky, the guilty trio decide to hire a washed-up actor and raunchy celebrity impersonator to bring him to life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oJQdLfrpl4CQsHAKIxd3DJqYTVq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1022690'),
  ('239725775875886403', 'Ricochet', 1991, 'Crime, Thriller, Action, Drama', 'Russell Mulcahy, Peter Levy, Robert Leveen', 'Steven E. de Souza', 'Denzel Washington, John Lithgow, Ice-T, Kevin Pollak, Lindsay Wagner, Mary Ellen Trainor, Josh Evans, Victoria Dillard', 'R', 'An attorney is terrorized by the criminal he put away years ago when he was a cop.', 'An attorney is terrorized by the criminal he put away years ago when he was a cop.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5isHYEcUY0nE90uMhkGrs1nnal.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9546'),
  ('882906504317636459', 'Ricomincio da TAAAC', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Pietro Belfiore, Davide Bonacina, Andrea Fadenti', 'Andrea Fadenti, Andrea Mazzarella, Davide Bonacina', 'Germano Lanzoni, Brenda Lodigiani, Maurizio Bousso, Valerio Airò, Laura Locatelli, Leonardo Uslengo, Renato Avallone, Martina Sammarco', null, 'After his highly successful escape to Sardinia, Mr. Imbruttito returns to his native Milan, but within a short time, the company he has always worked for is acquired by a powerful American multinational, Blacksun. The new owners also promote a business model that is highly inclusive and sustainable. Mr. Imbruttito will lose his job, his home, and his family, finding himself forced to make ends meet by working as a delivery driver—precisely the very thing he always despised as a manager.', 'After his highly successful escape to Sardinia, Mr. Imbruttito returns to his native Milan, but within a short time, the company he has always worked for is acquired by a powerful American multinational, Blacksun. The new owners also promote a business model that is highly inclusive and sustainable. Mr. Imbruttito will lose his job, his home, and his family, finding himself forced to make ends meet by working as a delivery driver—precisely the very thing he always despised as a manager.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/go79upPfpYuzEMDZCfyRs2BkIfK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1212211'),
  ('678484697357862314', 'Ricordi?', 2019, 'Drama, Romance', 'Michele Barbagallo, Armando De Vincentis, Federico Nuti', 'Valerio Mieli', 'Luca Marinelli, Linda Caridi, Giovanni Anzaldo, Camilla Diana, Anna Manuelli, Eliana Bosi, David Brandon, Benedetta Cimatti', null, 'A long love story, seen through the memories of one young couple. The journey through the years of two individuals, united, divided, happy, unhappy, deeply in love, or in love with others, in a single stream of emotions and shades of feeling. Over the course of the film, he learns that love can indeed last, while she learns to live with nostalgia.', 'A long love story, seen through the memories of one young couple. The journey through the years of two individuals, united, divided, happy, unhappy, deeply in love, or in love with others, in a single stream of emotions and shades of feeling. Over the course of the film, he learns that love can indeed last, while she learns to live with nostalgia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/evQ1bmZSS8cNoyK6lyIKIm4J8KC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:539136'),
  ('178026610640779002', 'Riddick', 2013, 'Science Fiction, Action, Thriller', 'David Eggby, David Twohy, Emile Ghorayeb', 'David Twohy', 'Vin Diesel, Nolan Gerard Funk, Matt Nable, Katee Sackhoff, Jordi Mollà, Dave Bautista, Karl Urban, Bokeem Woodbine', 'R', 'Betrayed by his own kind and left for dead on a desolate planet, Riddick fights for survival against alien predators and becomes more powerful and dangerous than ever before. Soon bounty hunters from throughout the galaxy descend on Riddick only to find themselves pawns in his greater scheme for revenge. With his enemies right where he wants them, Riddick unleashes a vicious attack of vengeance before returning to his home planet of Furya to save it from destruction.', 'Betrayed by his own kind and left for dead on a desolate planet, Riddick fights for survival against alien predators and becomes more powerful and dangerous than ever before. Soon bounty hunters from throughout the galaxy descend on Riddick only to find themselves pawns in his greater scheme for revenge. With his enemies right where he wants them, Riddick unleashes a vicious attack of vengeance before returning to his home planet of Furya to save it from destruction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pUul9pGWOKT7X0smkTvsIEIQxcP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87421'),
  ('596860993938609408', 'Riddick: Blindsided', 2013, 'Action, Animation, Science Fiction', 'Bonner Bellew', 'David Twohy', 'Vin Diesel, Karl Urban', null, 'This motion comic gaps the bridge between 2004''s The Chronicles of Riddick, and 2013''s Riddick. A new attempt on Lord Marshal Riddick''s life is made on the Necromongers'' ship. It''s time for Riddick to end the years long meandering through space and go back to his roots.', 'This motion comic gaps the bridge between 2004''s The Chronicles of Riddick, and 2013''s Riddick. A new attempt on Lord Marshal Riddick''s life is made on the Necromongers'' ship. It''s time for Riddick to end the years long meandering through space and go back to his roots.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8c4JUt0YJPw6Z6pIQyNnx0kf27l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:211449'),
  ('357054389407872515', 'Riddle', 2013, 'Mystery, Thriller', 'John O. Hartman, Nicholas Mross', 'John O. Hartman, Brian Hartman', 'Elisabeth Harnois, Val Kilmer, Diora Baird, Ryan Malgarini, William Sadler, Bryan Lillis, Jack Erdie, Ben Bledsoe', 'PG-13', 'Holly &amp; Nathan Teller live in a small town in Pennsylvania. Holly is on the cheerleading team and has a close relationship with her younger brother Nathan, who is subjected to bullying at school. Nathan is taken for a car ride one day by the bullies, whose intent about what they are going to do with Nathan is not clear. He gives them the slip, but disappears and is still missing after three years.', 'Holly &amp; Nathan Teller live in a small town in Pennsylvania. Holly is on the cheerleading team and has a close relationship with her younger brother Nathan, who is subjected to bullying at school. Nathan is taken for a car ride one day by the bullies, whose intent about what they are going to do with Nathan is not clear. He gives them the slip, but disappears and is still missing after three years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/umS2K9OvTLT7Encz4DCPeIlkVmi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:170194'),
  ('985368742116879821', 'Riddle Me This: Why Is Batman Forever?', 1995, 'Documentary, TV Movie', 'Randy Rogers', 'Michael Meadows', 'Chris O''Donnell, Val Kilmer, Bob Kane, Jim Carrey, John Dykstra, Boyd Shermis, Barbara Ling, Tommy Lee Jones', null, 'How a new director and cast created a new version of Gotham''s classic good and bad guys.', 'How a new director and cast created a new version of Gotham''s classic good and bad guys.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y3S1f7LuJd6UmndmyVFJ1NVaBwn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:294656'),
  ('160423738689764241', 'Riddle of Fire', 2024, 'Fantasy, Adventure, Comedy', 'Weston Razooli, Aspen Baldwin, Kili Maile', 'Weston Razooli', 'Lio Tipton, Charles Halford, Charlie Stover, Skyler Peters, Phoebe Ferro, Lorelei Olivia Mote, Andrea Browne, Rachel Browne', 'PG-13', 'Three mischievous children embark on a woodland odyssey when their mother sends them on an errand.', 'Three mischievous children embark on a woodland odyssey when their mother sends them on an errand.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yjBbl4iLk3Zj5erRq4FjlyyTrWu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1114873'),
  ('1058960050868425297', 'Riddled with Deceit: A Martha''s Vineyard Mystery', 2020, 'Mystery, Drama, Crime, TV Movie', 'Andy Mikita, William McKnight, Wendy Ord', 'John Christian Plummer', 'Jesse Metcalfe, Sarah Lind, Chelsea Hobbs, Sunita Prasad, Eric Keenleyside, Cameron Bancroft, Adam Thomas, Johannah Newmarch', null, 'Former detective Jeff Jackson teams up with Dr. Zee Madieras to track down their friend''s missing emerald brooch, a thief, and also... a murderer.', 'Former detective Jeff Jackson teams up with Dr. Zee Madieras to track down their friend''s missing emerald brooch, a thief, and also... a murderer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p6XxEalyrxAaXEWrBP7ZUxq9sbS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:661329'),
  ('691516250746371568', 'Riddles for a Candy', 1978, 'Fantasy, Animation', 'Jiří Barta', null, null, null, 'In Jiří Barta’s imaginative debut, a magic book poses three riddles to an anteater-like creature. His reward for answering, a wrapped piece of candy, proves elusive. Barta''s animation revels in the possibilities of transformation and symbolic logic.', 'In Jiří Barta’s imaginative debut, a magic book poses three riddles to an anteater-like creature. His reward for answering, a wrapped piece of candy, proves elusive. Barta''s animation revels in the possibilities of transformation and symbolic logic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1O3NqlVjdPDcrykXf8yeKkid8zD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:280007'),
  ('455487464330970158', 'Riddles of the Sphinx', 1977, 'Drama', 'Laura Mulvey, Peter Wollen, Diane Tammes', 'Peter Wollen, Laura Mulvey', 'Dinah Stabb, Clive Merrison, Laura Mulvey, Carole James, Merdelle Jordine, Riannon Tise, Marie Green, Paula Melbourne', null, 'In this avant-garde classic, protagonist Louise deals with a change in her lifestyle in which she must learn to negotiate domestic life and motherhood.', 'In this avant-garde classic, protagonist Louise deals with a change in her lifestyle in which she must learn to negotiate domestic life and motherhood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8RkPbV6uFVEAZHwsIHOmMPeZmJt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:206222'),
  ('734362270886041049', 'Riddles of the Sphinx', 2008, 'Science Fiction, Fantasy, TV Movie', 'George Mendeluk, Anthony C. Metchie, Kevin Leslie', 'Brook Durham, Kevin Leeson', 'Dina Meyer, Lochlyn Munro, Emily Tennant, Mackenzie Gray, Donnelly Rhodes, Dario Delacio, Donovan Cerminara, John J. Gulayets', null, 'An astronomer and a cryptographer uncover a series of ancient tunnels, unwittingly unleashing a deadly Sphinx. In order to trap the Sphinx back in its tomb and stop impending destruction, our explorers must solve a series of complicated and possibly deadly riddles.', 'An astronomer and a cryptographer uncover a series of ancient tunnels, unwittingly unleashing a deadly Sphinx. In order to trap the Sphinx back in its tomb and stop impending destruction, our explorers must solve a series of complicated and possibly deadly riddles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/84IvM7ALInZRvOidYjcmxXcKcAI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52571'),
  ('249419442102283711', 'Ride', 1998, 'Comedy', 'Millicent Shelton, Frank Byers', 'Millicent Shelton', 'Malik Yoba, Melissa De Sousa, John Witherspoon, Fredro Starr, Cedric the Entertainer, Sticky Fingaz, Idalis DeLeon, Guy Torry', 'R', 'A group of young people leave Harlem for a bus trip down to Miami. The voyage starts off with problems, but it ends up becoming a learning experience, as they end up finding things out about each other they had not previously known.', 'A group of young people leave Harlem for a bus trip down to Miami. The voyage starts off with problems, but it ends up becoming a learning experience, as they end up finding things out about each other they had not previously known.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e4G3p4ehqdbTv4HuqDZax9P77QK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66894'),
  ('150482132646203035', 'Ride', 2014, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Helen Hunt, Jas Shelton, John Lind', 'Helen Hunt', 'Helen Hunt, Brenton Thwaites, Luke Wilson, David Zayas, Elizabeth Jayne Stillwell, Robert Knepper, Leonor Varela, Callum Keith Rennie', 'R', 'Overbearing mom, Jackie, travels cross-country to be with her son, Angelo, after he drops out of college to become a surfer. She meets a surf instructor who convinces her to try to accept her son''s wishes and allow him to follow his dreams.', 'Overbearing mom, Jackie, travels cross-country to be with her son, Angelo, after he drops out of college to become a surfer. She meets a surf instructor who convinces her to try to accept her son''s wishes and allow him to follow his dreams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vozQNEvIKWkQIIiaMPvTOArxGkH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:330115'),
  ('229855609875594257', 'Ride', 2018, 'Action, Thriller', 'Jacopo Rondinelli, Paolo Bellan', 'Fabio Guaglione, Fabio Resinaro, Marco Sani', 'Lorenzo Richelmy, Ludovic Hughes, Simone Labarga, Nathalie Rapti Gomez', null, 'Kyle and Max are two extreme sports athletes, two riders in continuous challenge and search for money. When they find out of the enigmatic proposal for a mysterious contest by an unknown organization, Black Babylon, they can’t turn down the $ 150,000 prize. But the “contest” will turn out to be much darker and deadlier than expected.', 'Kyle and Max are two extreme sports athletes, two riders in continuous challenge and search for money. When they find out of the enigmatic proposal for a mysterious contest by an unknown organization, Black Babylon, they can’t turn down the $ 150,000 prize. But the “contest” will turn out to be much darker and deadlier than expected.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fscXXptgTFhipdd3DJBEWfuUJUe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:535561'),
  ('215699698648369043', 'Ride ''Em Cowboy', 1941, 'Comedy, Western', 'John W. Boyle, Arthur Lubin, Charles Previn', 'John Grant, True Eames Boardman', 'Bud Abbott, Lou Costello, Dick Foran, Anne Gwynne, Johnny Mack Brown, Judd McMichael, Ted McMichael, Joe McMichael', 'NR', 'Two peanut vendors at a rodeo show get in trouble with their boss and hide out on a railroad train heading west. They get jobs as cowboys on a dude ranch, despite the fact that neither of them knows anything about cowboys, horses, or anything else.', 'Two peanut vendors at a rodeo show get in trouble with their boss and hide out on a railroad train heading west. They get jobs as cowboys on a dude ranch, despite the fact that neither of them knows anything about cowboys, horses, or anything else.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6S2ijGwVcomOMml4YkHuNDU14WR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33541'),
  ('520573225931961153', 'Ride a Crooked Trail', 1958, 'Romance, Western', 'Jesse Hibbs, Harold Lipstein, William Holland', 'Borden Chase', 'Audie Murphy, Gia Scala, Walter Matthau, Henry Silva, Joanna Moore, Eddie Little, Mary Field, Leo Gordon', 'NR', 'After robbing a bank Murphy assumes the identity of his pursuer, a famous US Marshal, when he stumbles into a town and is confronted by the local judge, Matthau. Murphy is forced to remain as the new Marshal; an old flame, Scala, nearly unmasks him by accident, only to be forced to assume the ruse of being Murphy''s wife. The "couple" given a house and respectability, which neither has had before. They maintain the charade to avoid hurting a young orphan boy, Matthau''s ward. Scala is torn by her loyalty to boyfriend planning to rob the bank and growing feelings for Murphy', 'After robbing a bank Murphy assumes the identity of his pursuer, a famous US Marshal, when he stumbles into a town and is confronted by the local judge, Matthau. Murphy is forced to remain as the new Marshal; an old flame, Scala, nearly unmasks him by accident, only to be forced to assume the ruse of being Murphy''s wife. The "couple" given a house and respectability, which neither has had before. They maintain the charade to avoid hurting a young orphan boy, Matthau''s ward. Scala is torn by her loyalty to boyfriend planning to rob the bank and growing feelings for Murphy', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gVAAvYIneqRgybXHEFyl4iHUONb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38659'),
  ('991400570330591265', 'Ride a Wild Pony', 1975, 'Adventure', 'Don Chaffey, Jack Cardiff', null, 'Michael Craig, John Meillon, Robert Bettles, Graham Rouse, Alfred Bell, Eva Griffith, John Meillon Jr., Roy Haddrick', null, 'Scott, a poor farm boy, is given a wild pony from a wealthy ranch owner''s herd to ride to and from school. Scott and his pony soon become an inseparable team, until one day the pony suddenly disappears. Soon after, the ranch owner''s handicapped daughter Josie has a wild pony especially trained to pull her cart. But Scott is convinced that Josie''s pony is actually his, which leads to a court battle that divides their small Australian town. One child must ultimately lose the pony when true ownership is decided.', 'Scott, a poor farm boy, is given a wild pony from a wealthy ranch owner''s herd to ride to and from school. Scott and his pony soon become an inseparable team, until one day the pony suddenly disappears. Soon after, the ranch owner''s handicapped daughter Josie has a wild pony especially trained to pull her cart. But Scott is convinced that Josie''s pony is actually his, which leads to a court battle that divides their small Australian town. One child must ultimately lose the pony when true ownership is decided.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a4reYhc8NUi9MM1BYOc8GNEjFVd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:103765'),
  ('688771333119450143', 'Ride Above', 2022, 'Drama', 'Christophe Graillot, Stéphane Gluck, Christian Duguay', 'Christian Duguay, Lilou Fogli', 'Mélanie Laurent, Pio Marmaï, Kacey Mottet Klein, Carmen Kassovitz, Charlie Paulet, June Benard, Carole Bouquet, Danny Huston', null, 'Growing up among horses at her parents'' stud farm, Zoé dreams of becoming a jockey and forms a deep bond with a young horse. A terrible accident threatens to end their racing careers, but they fight to reach victory together.', 'Growing up among horses at her parents'' stud farm, Zoé dreams of becoming a jockey and forms a deep bond with a young horse. A terrible accident threatens to end their racing careers, but they fight to reach victory together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iVcQVrdtslCekI4NkWJWIFpZcF5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:894246'),
  ('610970237493124179', 'Ride Along', 2014, 'Action, Comedy', 'Tim Story, Larry Blanford, Jack Gill', 'Phil Hay, Matt Manfredi, Greg Coolidge', 'Ice Cube, Kevin Hart, John Leguizamo, Bruce McGill, Tika Sumpter, Bryan Callen, Laurence Fishburne, Dwayne L. Brown', 'PG-13', 'For the past two years, high-school security guard Ben has been trying to show decorated APD detective James that he''s more than just a video-game junkie who''s unworthy of James'' sister, Angela. When Ben finally gets accepted into the academy, he thinks he''s earned the seasoned policeman''s respect and asks for his blessing to marry Angela. Knowing that a ride along will demonstrate if Ben has what it takes to take care of his sister, James invites him on a shift designed to scare the hell out of the trainee. But when the wild night leads them to the most notorious criminal in the city, James will find that his new partner''s rapid-fire mouth is just as dangerous as the bullets speeding at it.', 'For the past two years, high-school security guard Ben has been trying to show decorated APD detective James that he''s more than just a video-game junkie who''s unworthy of James'' sister, Angela. When Ben finally gets accepted into the academy, he thinks he''s earned the seasoned policeman''s respect and asks for his blessing to marry Angela. Knowing that a ride along will demonstrate if Ben has what it takes to take care of his sister, James invites him on a shift designed to scare the hell out of the trainee. But when the wild night leads them to the most notorious criminal in the city, James will find that his new partner''s rapid-fire mouth is just as dangerous as the bullets speeding at it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qrt65VVaP5DEEBZgB5XYctA82Qv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:168530'),
  ('596772947388581398', 'Ride Along 2', 2016, 'Action, Comedy', 'Paul Hughen, Tim Story, Mitchell Amundsen', 'Matt Manfredi, Phil Hay', 'Kevin Hart, Ice Cube, Olivia Munn, Tika Sumpter, Ken Jeong, Tyrese Gibson, Nadine Velazquez, Benjamin Bratt', 'PG-13', 'As his wedding day approaches, Ben heads to Miami with his soon-to-be brother-in-law James to bring down a drug dealer who''s supplying the dealers of Atlanta with product.', 'As his wedding day approaches, Ben heads to Miami with his soon-to-be brother-in-law James to bring down a drug dealer who''s supplying the dealers of Atlanta with product.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qKvVUHdiwqkXdlRsW4fHO7SAZef.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:323675'),
  ('508866160478427635', 'Ride Away', 2025, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Mathias Mlekuz, Florent Sabatier, Julien Houeix', 'Mathias Mlekuz, Philippe Rebbot', 'Mathias Mlekuz, Philippe Rebbot, Josef Mlekuz, Adriane Gradziel, Marziyeh Rezaei, Laurent Jouault, Lucky, Romane Bohringer', null, 'From the Atlantic to the Black Sea, Mathias and Philippe, two old friends, embark on a bicycle journey that Mathias’s son made before his tragic death. The two men ride through the ordeals with tenderness, humor and emotion.', 'From the Atlantic to the Black Sea, Mathias and Philippe, two old friends, embark on a bicycle journey that Mathias’s son made before his tragic death. The two men ride through the ordeals with tenderness, humor and emotion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/84j57nt48tBB2521lEBfQq9HARQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1321412'),
  ('726113376880895423', 'Ride Beyond Vengeance', 1966, 'Western, Action', 'Bernard McEveety, Lester Shorr, Lee H. Katzin', 'Andrew J. Fenady', 'Chuck Connors, Michael Rennie, Kathryn Hays, Joan Blondell, Gloria Grahame, Bill Bixby, Claude Akins, Paul Fix', 'PG', 'Jonas Trapp falls in love with the beautiful Jessie, a wealthy girl out of his humble class. Against the wishes of her snobbish aunt, she marries him, later faking a pregnancy to win her aunt''s consent. But Jonas tires of living off of his wife''s family, and eventually deserts her to become a buffalo hunter. 11 years later, with his self-made fortune, he sets out to return home, only to be set upon by three sadistic marauders, who steal his money and leave him for dead. Rescued by a farmer who nurses him back to health, Jonas becomes consumed by the desire for revenge. As fate would have it, all three men live close to Jonas'' former home. Matters quickly get worse when Jonas reunites with his wife, only to discover that she is now engaged to Renne.', 'Jonas Trapp falls in love with the beautiful Jessie, a wealthy girl out of his humble class. Against the wishes of her snobbish aunt, she marries him, later faking a pregnancy to win her aunt''s consent. But Jonas tires of living off of his wife''s family, and eventually deserts her to become a buffalo hunter. 11 years later, with his self-made fortune, he sets out to return home, only to be set upon by three sadistic marauders, who steal his money and leave him for dead. Rescued by a farmer who nurses him back to health, Jonas becomes consumed by the desire for revenge. As fate would have it, all three men live close to Jonas'' former home. Matters quickly get worse when Jonas reunites with his wife, only to discover that she is now engaged to Renne.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qO3XemtoN9e7AjSW2kA9EkZ7Mf7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:101308'),
  ('455406294646475413', 'Ride Clear of Diablo', 1954, 'Western', 'Irving Glassberg, Jesse Hibbs, Joseph Gershenson', 'George Zuckerman', 'Audie Murphy, Susan Cabot, Dan Duryea, Abbe Lane, Russell Johnson, Paul Birch, William Pullen, Jack Elam', 'NR', 'A young railroad surveyor returns to his hometown to find the man who murdered his father and brother.', 'A young railroad surveyor returns to his hometown to find the man who murdered his father and brother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7mwxmt4Fn1Nw2teLLjhJd4bcZQV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:138086'),
  ('76978997728596401', 'Ride Him, Bosko', 1932, 'Animation, Comedy, Western', 'Hugh Harman', null, 'Johnny Murray, Rochelle Hudson, Hugh Harman, Rudolf Ising', null, 'Ride Him, Bosko! is a western-flavored cartoon with lots of shooting gags involving body reduction, and card characters singing! There''s also an alcohol gag that has a really strong one turning a male piano player into a woman instantly!', 'Ride Him, Bosko! is a western-flavored cartoon with lots of shooting gags involving body reduction, and card characters singing! There''s also an alcohol gag that has a really strong one turning a male piano player into a woman instantly!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cZGfd5wC66k1ikG4SToDWgTEig4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:161632'),
