  ('967770276961681644', 'Ride the Wild Surf', 1964, 'Comedy', 'Don Taylor, Phil Karlson, Joseph F. Biroc', 'Art Napoleon, Jo Napoleon', 'Fabian, Shelley Fabares, Peter Brown, Barbara Eden, Tab Hunter, Susan Hart, James Mitchum, John Anthony Hayes', 'G', 'A group of friends go to Hawaii during the height of surfing season, to compete with other surf bums and find girlfriends along the way.', 'A group of friends go to Hawaii during the height of surfing season, to compete with other surf bums and find girlfriends along the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5cqRxM6KeUQaK2LDMRtAZPpH3nh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42789'),
  ('836959383472440685', 'Ride with the Devil', 1999, 'Drama, War, Romance, Western', 'Ang Lee, Frederick Elmes, David R. Ellis', 'James Schamus', 'Skeet Ulrich, Tobey Maguire, Jewel, Jeffrey Wright, Simon Baker, Jonathan Rhys Meyers, Tom Wilkinson, Jim Caviezel', 'R', 'Ride with the Devil follows four people who are fighting for truth and justice amidst the turmoil of the American Civil War. Director Ang Lee takes us to a no man''s land on the Missouri/Kansas border where a staunch loyalist, an immigrant''s son, a freed slave, and a young widow form an unlikely friendship as they learn how to survive in an uncertain time. In a place without rules and redefine the meaning of bravery and honor.', 'Ride with the Devil follows four people who are fighting for truth and justice amidst the turmoil of the American Civil War. Director Ang Lee takes us to a no man''s land on the Missouri/Kansas border where a staunch loyalist, an immigrant''s son, a freed slave, and a young widow form an unlikely friendship as they learn how to survive in an uncertain time. In a place without rules and redefine the meaning of bravery and honor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pH3J5IUzho4ZVaRuTuErzqHHovb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22267'),
