  ('72678238617246806', 'Ride, Vaquero!', 1953, 'Western, Drama', 'John Farrow, Robert Surtees, Jerry Thorpe', 'Frank Fenton', 'Robert Taylor, Ava Gardner, Howard Keel, Anthony Quinn, Kurt Kasznar, Ted de Corsia, Charlita, Walter Baldwin', 'NR', 'Two Mexican outlaws, Rio and Esqueda, raised as stepbrothers, have a showdown over the issue of whether to evict new settlers from their Texas border territory.', 'Two Mexican outlaws, Rio and Esqueda, raised as stepbrothers, have a showdown over the issue of whether to evict new settlers from their Texas border territory.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pA9t01y8BvWMal5MwSIozinASu3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46193'),
