  ('337618847095797434', 'Riders of Destiny', 1933, 'Action, Western', 'Robert N. Bradbury, Archie Stout', 'Robert N. Bradbury', 'John Wayne, Cecilia Parker, Forrest Taylor, George ''Gabby'' Hayes, Al St. John, Heinie Conklin, Earl Dwire, Lafe McKee', 'NR', 'James Kincaid controls the local water supply and plans to do away with the other ranchers. Government agent Sandy Saunders arrives undercover to investigate Kincaid''s land swindle scheme, and win the heart of one of his victims, Fay Denton.', 'James Kincaid controls the local water supply and plans to do away with the other ranchers. Government agent Sandy Saunders arrives undercover to investigate Kincaid''s land swindle scheme, and win the heart of one of his victims, Fay Denton.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aZCgQuRhDpWjjJgVYTDxWwcJ08i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23391'),
  ('195321454815182917', 'Riders of Justice', 2020, 'Action, Comedy, Drama, Thriller', 'Kasper Tuxen, Anders Thomas Jensen, Mikkel Andreas Smidt', 'Anders Thomas Jensen', 'Mads Mikkelsen, Nikolaj Lie Kaas, Lars Brygmann, Nicolas Bro, Andrea Heick Gadeberg, Gustav Lindh, Roland Møller, Albert Rudbeck Lindhardt', 'NR', 'Markus returns home to care for his daughter when his wife dies in a tragic train accident. However, when a survivor of the wreck surfaces and claims foul play, Markus suspects his wife was murdered and embarks on a mission to find those responsible.', 'Markus returns home to care for his daughter when his wife dies in a tragic train accident. However, when a survivor of the wreck surfaces and claims foul play, Markus suspects his wife was murdered and embarks on a mission to find those responsible.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sshNnwmQLk720iBQ0dZg3GVGKfK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:663870'),
  ('978761956867860085', 'Riders to the Stars', 1954, 'Drama, Science Fiction', 'Richard Carlson, Stanley Cortez, Herbert L. Strock', 'Curt Siodmak', 'William Lundigan, Herbert Marshall, Richard Carlson, Martha Hyer, Dawn Addams, Robert Karnes, Lawrence Dobkin, George Eldredge', null, 'Three men gamble their lives in space to change the history of the world', 'Three men gamble their lives in space to change the history of the world', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/20OJPqXxJP46sYkthxGWexzRw2m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:96876'),
  ('131002481600247845', 'Ridicule', 1996, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Thierry Arbogast, Patrice Leconte', 'Michel Fessler, Rémi Waterhouse, Eric Vicaut', 'Charles Berling, Jean Rochefort, Fanny Ardant, Judith Godrèche, Bernard Giraudeau, Bernard Dhéran, Carlo Brandt, Jacques Mathou', null, 'To get royal backing on a needed drainage project, a poor French lord must learn to play the delicate games of wit at court at Versailles.', 'To get royal backing on a needed drainage project, a poor French lord must learn to play the delicate games of wit at court at Versailles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j78rRskAapKtILalcxAmdskGtzb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12709'),
  ('586082941564322402', 'Riding a Tricycle', 1928, 'Documentary', 'Josefina Barrera Fuentes, Antonio Rodríguez Fuentes', null, null, null, 'This 1920s home movie, shot by longtime Corpus Christi resident Antonio Rodríguez Fuentes, may well represent some of the earliest produced by a Mexican-American filmmaker about the Mexican-American community in Texas. The footage first shows Fuentes, his wife Josefina, and four of their children exiting their home. Then, Fuentes steps behind the camera to capture his son Antonio Jr. riding a tricycle.', 'This 1920s home movie, shot by longtime Corpus Christi resident Antonio Rodríguez Fuentes, may well represent some of the earliest produced by a Mexican-American filmmaker about the Mexican-American community in Texas. The footage first shows Fuentes, his wife Josefina, and four of their children exiting their home. Then, Fuentes steps behind the camera to capture his son Antonio Jr. riding a tricycle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3i4UJ7XujEfESvAXcZeeegpB49N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:496547'),
  ('858317494305290624', 'Riding Alone for Thousands of Miles', 2005, 'Drama', 'Zhang Yimou, Zhao Xiaoding', 'Zou Jingzhi', 'Ken Takakura, Shinobu Terajima, Kiichi Nakai, Ken Nakamoto, Li Jia-Min, Jiang Wen, Lin Qiu', null, 'Takada, a Japanese fisherman has been estranged from his son for many years, but when the son is diagnosed with terminal cancer his daughter-in-law, Rie, summons him to the hospital. Through a series of obstacles and relationships, he is brought unexpectedly closer to both an understanding of himself and of his son.', 'Takada, a Japanese fisherman has been estranged from his son for many years, but when the son is diagnosed with terminal cancer his daughter-in-law, Rie, summons him to the hospital. Through a series of obstacles and relationships, he is brought unexpectedly closer to both an understanding of himself and of his son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/shA3I9K9bjNVyFsefq73CxXsauQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14226'),
  ('267443789819475777', 'Riding Bean', 1989, 'Animation, Action, Adventure, Crime, Comedy', 'Noriyoshi Matsuura, Atsushi Okuda, Kazuhiro Konishi', 'Kenichi Sonoda', 'Megumi Hayashibara, Michitaka Kobayashi, Jurota Kosugi, Mami Koyama, Tomoko Maruo, Naoko Matsui, Kozo Shioya, Hideyuki Tanaka', null, 'Bean Bandit and his partner Rally Vincent are couriers for hire - transporting clients and delivering goods in his custom sports car "Roadbuster" for a hefty price. But when they are hired to escort a kidnapped girl named Chelsea to her home, they don''t realize they''re being framed for kidnapping as their former clients Semmerling and Carrie plan their escape with Chelsea''s father and the ransom money.', 'Bean Bandit and his partner Rally Vincent are couriers for hire - transporting clients and delivering goods in his custom sports car "Roadbuster" for a hefty price. But when they are hired to escort a kidnapped girl named Chelsea to her home, they don''t realize they''re being framed for kidnapping as their former clients Semmerling and Carrie plan their escape with Chelsea''s father and the ransom money.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bZyuxz1dosJpmdmHhs9KdTEzrQx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55374'),
  ('294457599538104495', 'Riding Giants', 2004, 'Documentary', 'Stacy Peralta, Peter Pilafian', 'Stacy Peralta, Sam George', 'Jeff Clark, Darrick Doerner, Laird Hamilton, Dave Kalama, David H. Kalama Jr., Brian Keaulana, Buzzy Kerbox, Titus Kinimaka', 'PG-13', 'Riding Giants is story about big wave surfers who have become heroes and legends in their sport. Directed by the skateboard guru Stacy Peralta.', 'Riding Giants is story about big wave surfers who have become heroes and legends in their sport. Directed by the skateboard guru Stacy Peralta.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8L3ir0KNqSqpps2oVAeCUPVTPhr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:291'),
  ('492945186932474735', 'Riding in Cars with Boys', 2001, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Miroslav Ondříček, Penny Marshall, Stephen H. Carter', 'Morgan Ward', 'Drew Barrymore, Steve Zahn, Adam Garcia, Brittany Murphy, James Woods, Lorraine Bracco, Rosie Perez, Sara Gilbert', 'PG-13', 'In 1965, a young woman with dreams of becoming a writer has a son at the age of 15 and struggles to make things work with the drug-addicted father.', 'In 1965, a young woman with dreams of becoming a writer has a son at the age of 15 and struggles to make things work with the drug-addicted father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lz8FCZAzfr2gzju6YM4s7UCZugL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11091'),
  ('314309268818937646', 'Riding Shotgun', 1954, 'Western', 'André de Toth, Bert Glennon, James McMahon', 'Thomas W. Blackburn', 'Randolph Scott, Wayne Morris, Joan Weldon, Joe Sawyer, James Millican, Charles Bronson, James Bell, Fritz Feld', 'NR', 'When a stagecoach guard tries to warn a town of an imminent raid by a band of outlaws, the people mistake him for one of the gang.', 'When a stagecoach guard tries to warn a town of an imminent raid by a band of outlaws, the people mistake him for one of the gang.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2xX8Rk8gRe4GqxMwSd2xKRlPx0u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:154093'),
  ('269199448203339624', 'Riding the Bullet', 2004, 'Drama, Horror, Thriller', 'Robert C. New, Mick Garris', 'Mick Garris', 'Jonathan Jackson, Barbara Hershey, David Arquette, Erika Christensen, Cliff Robertson, Nicky Katt, Matt Frewer, Barry W. Levy', 'R', 'In 1969, while studying at the University of Maine, artist Alan Parker becomes obsessed with death. Believing he is losing his girlfriend, he tries to commit suicide on his birthday but his friends manage to stop him. He receives news that his mother has had a stroke and decides to hitchhike to visit her at the hospital.', 'In 1969, while studying at the University of Maine, artist Alan Parker becomes obsessed with death. Believing he is losing his girlfriend, he tries to commit suicide on his birthday but his friends manage to stop him. He receives news that his mother has had a stroke and decides to hitchhike to visit her at the hospital.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oM9X7NvJ0Ses0thXu70Wuar9Afd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12483'),
  ('355019140145721710', 'Riding the Rails', 1997, 'Documentary', 'Lexy Lovell, Michael Uys, Sam Henriques', null, 'Richard Thomas', null, 'Riding the Rails offers a visionary perspective on the presumed romanticism of the road and cautionary legacy of the Great Depression. The filmmakers relay the experiences and painful recollections of these now-elderly survivors of the rails. Forced to travel more by economic necessity than the spirit of adventure, the film''s subjects dispel romantic myths of a hobo existence and its corresponding veneer of freedom. Riding the Rails recounts the hoboes'' trade secrets for survival and accounts of dank miseries, loneliness, imprisonment, death, and dispossession. Sixty years later, the filmmakers transport their subjects back to the tracks, where the surging impact of sound and movement resuscitates memories of a shattered adolescence and devastating rite of passage.', 'Riding the Rails offers a visionary perspective on the presumed romanticism of the road and cautionary legacy of the Great Depression. The filmmakers relay the experiences and painful recollections of these now-elderly survivors of the rails. Forced to travel more by economic necessity than the spirit of adventure, the film''s subjects dispel romantic myths of a hobo existence and its corresponding veneer of freedom. Riding the Rails recounts the hoboes'' trade secrets for survival and accounts of dank miseries, loneliness, imprisonment, death, and dispossession. Sixty years later, the filmmakers transport their subjects back to the tracks, where the surging impact of sound and movement resuscitates memories of a shattered adolescence and devastating rite of passage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yn1DaqiyLa34lxDPveS9LmSUSgr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36666'),
  ('1046680438266645524', 'Riding with Death', 1976, 'Science Fiction, TV Movie, Action, Thriller', 'Don McDougall, Alan J. Levi, Enzo A. Martinelli', 'Steven Bochco, Harve Bennett, Frank Telford', 'Ben Murphy, Richard Dysart, William Sylvester, Andrew Prine, Alan Oppenheimer, Ed Nelson, Katherine Crawford, John Milford', 'NR', 'Agent Sam Casey is in a satellite explosion and the radiation turns him invisible. He gets a watch that keeps him visible, and he uses it to switch from visible to invisible. He is assigned to transport a chemical called Tripolydine, which is purported to be the most efficient fuel; when the cover is blown on that and he uncovers and stops the Tripolydine fraud, he must then stop a terrorist from blowing up race cars.', 'Agent Sam Casey is in a satellite explosion and the radiation turns him invisible. He gets a watch that keeps him visible, and he uses it to switch from visible to invisible. He is assigned to transport a chemical called Tripolydine, which is purported to be the most efficient fuel; when the cover is blown on that and he uncovers and stops the Tripolydine fraud, he must then stop a terrorist from blowing up race cars.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s0AF31hJxRrsrtbyPfylYJfIA4e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:162042'),
  ('174401398476509024', 'Riefenstahl', 2024, 'Documentary', 'Andres Veiel, Toby Cornish', 'Andres Veiel', 'Leni Riefenstahl, Horst Kettner, Adolf Hitler, Joseph Goebbels, Albert Speer, Rudolf Hess, Hansjürgen Rosenbauer, Elfriede Kretschmer', null, 'Explores Leni Riefenstahl''s artistic legacy and her complex ties to the Nazi regime, juxtaposing her self-portrayal with evidence suggesting awareness of the regime''s atrocities.', 'Explores Leni Riefenstahl''s artistic legacy and her complex ties to the Nazi regime, juxtaposing her self-portrayal with evidence suggesting awareness of the regime''s atrocities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yl4AbKmwXR8bPVsbPyldD50yN8Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1081077'),
  ('281330919666146711', 'Riff Raff', 2025, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'Dito Montiel, Xavier Grobet', 'John Pollono', 'Jennifer Coolidge, Ed Harris, Gabrielle Union, Miles J. Harvey, Emanuela Postacchini, Lewis Pullman, Bill Murray, Pete Davidson', 'R', 'A retired hitman''s life is turned upside down when his ex-wife and son arrive unannounced during the holidays because they are on the run from his former mob associates.', 'A retired hitman''s life is turned upside down when his ex-wife and son arrive unannounced during the holidays because they are on the run from his former mob associates.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xPSur71bxvFVdQ6RdKv0yaVKT2n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1127767'),
  ('503194127512892762', 'Riff Raffy Daffy', 1948, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Arthur Davis, Carl W. Stalling', null, 'Mel Blanc', null, 'No matter where vagabond Daffy Duck goes to sleep, policeman Porky Pig is there to toss him out. Finally, Porky kicks him out the city park entirely, and it starts snowing. Daffy decides to take shelter at the closed Macys department store. When Porky catches him, he''s determined to be rid of Daffy once and for all.', 'No matter where vagabond Daffy Duck goes to sleep, policeman Porky Pig is there to toss him out. Finally, Porky kicks him out the city park entirely, and it starts snowing. Daffy decides to take shelter at the closed Macys department store. When Porky catches him, he''s determined to be rid of Daffy once and for all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3QCoZHvI6hacURtYL2ZzUcaGUkM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:237294'),
  ('111763620497902311', 'Riff-Raff', 1947, 'Drama, Adventure, Thriller', 'George E. Diskant, Ted Tetzlaff, Maxwell O. Henry', 'Martin Rackin', 'Pat O''Brien, Anne Jeffreys, Walter Slezak, Percy Kilbride, Jerome Cowan, George Givot, Jason Robards Sr., Marc Krah', 'NR', 'A private detective foils the plans of villains attempting to take over Panamanian oil fields while he searches for a valuable map hidden in plain sight.', 'A private detective foils the plans of villains attempting to take over Panamanian oil fields while he searches for a valuable map hidden in plain sight.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vyUntnvKshhFOBrVaFvnBMSATHU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25407'),
  ('1135249879571184007', 'Riff-Raff', 1991, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Ken Loach, Barry Ackroyd', 'Bill Jesse', 'Robert Carlyle, Emer McCourt, George Moss, Jimmy Coleman, Ricky Tomlinson, David Finch, Peter Mullan, Richard Belgrave', null, 'Stevie, fresh from prison in Scotland, finds a job on a London construction site. The working conditions are poor and most of the men are working under aliases, due to immigration status and to not conflict with their "signing on" for unemployment benefits. Some coworkers help Stevie secure housing, squatting in a council estate. Then Stevie meets Susan, from Ireland, who''s struggling to be a professional singer.', 'Stevie, fresh from prison in Scotland, finds a job on a London construction site. The working conditions are poor and most of the men are working under aliases, due to immigration status and to not conflict with their "signing on" for unemployment benefits. Some coworkers help Stevie secure housing, squatting in a council estate. Then Stevie meets Susan, from Ireland, who''s struggling to be a professional singer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4IMy908JxRDw9xYPuJ0OLFy0cjK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59058'),
  ('601077316173907578', 'Riffraff', 1936, 'Crime, Drama', 'Stan Rogers, Edwin B. Willis, J. Walter Ruben', 'Anita Loos, Frances Marion, H.W. Hanemann', 'Jean Harlow, Spencer Tracy, Una Merkel, Joseph Calleia, Victor Kilian, Mickey Rooney, J. Farrell MacDonald, Roger Imhof', null, 'Fisherman Dutch marries cannery worker Hattie. After he is kicked out of his union and fired from his job he leaves Hattie who steals money for him and goes to jail. He gets a new job, foils a plot to dynamite the ship, and promises to wait for Hattie.', 'Fisherman Dutch marries cannery worker Hattie. After he is kicked out of his union and fired from his job he leaves Hattie who steals money for him and goes to jail. He gets a new job, foils a plot to dynamite the ship, and promises to wait for Hattie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w6yg0o9x4dIXQsptF7ROQlEZeuX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121006'),
  ('289445000053093912', 'Rififi in Tokyo', 1963, 'Adventure, Crime, Drama', 'Jacques Deray', null, 'Karlheinz Böhm, Charles Vanel, Barbara Lass, Keiko Kishi, Eiji Okada, Masao Oda, Dante Maggio, Hideki Suzuki', null, 'Van Hekken, an old gangster, arrives in Tokyo to direct a bank hold-up in order to get a very valuable diamond.', 'Van Hekken, an old gangster, arrives in Tokyo to direct a bank hold-up in order to get a very valuable diamond.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gwycrcr7HLKflBrTcxctra7Up2S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:245580'),
  ('961695855984419456', 'Rifkin’s Festival', 2020, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Danielle Rigby, Daniela Forn, Anna Rua', 'Woody Allen', 'Wallace Shawn, Gina Gershon, Louis Garrel, Elena Anaya, Enrique Arce, Steve Guttenberg, Christoph Waltz, Sergi López', 'PG-13', 'The story of a married American couple who go to the San Sebastian Film Festival. They get caught up in the magic of the festival, the beauty and charm of Spain and the fantasy of movies. She has an affair with a brilliant French movie director, and he falls in love with a beautiful Spanish woman who lives there.', 'The story of a married American couple who go to the San Sebastian Film Festival. They get caught up in the magic of the festival, the beauty and charm of Spain and the fantasy of movies. She has an affair with a brilliant French movie director, and he falls in love with a beautiful Spanish woman who lives there.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5kTkLEheDmXdnHHRJiAkd4Vuato.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:606876'),
  ('274712487799603443', 'Rigged', 2008, 'Drama, Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Jonathan M. Dillon, Hanuman Brown-Eagle', 'Ian Shorr', 'Rebecca Neuenswander, Chad Ortis, Kurt Hanover, John Wilson, Larry Peterson, Alicia Cabrera, Kate Forristall, Allison Poccia', 'R', 'In the seedy underground of illegal prizefighting, a corrupt boxing promoter is embroiled in a dangerous fight-fixing scheme with his female prizefighter.', 'In the seedy underground of illegal prizefighting, a corrupt boxing promoter is embroiled in a dangerous fight-fixing scheme with his female prizefighter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jcYC9IslYvaZuUOvw7A0Q6CzIhQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14216'),
  ('775935719650891519', 'Right at Your Door', 2006, 'Drama, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Chris Gorak, Tom Richmond, Jim Simone', 'Chris Gorak', 'Mary McCormack, Rory Cochrane, Tony Perez, Scotty Noyd Jr., Max Kasch, Jon Huertas, Will McCormack, Soledad St. Hilaire', 'R', 'A dirty bomb goes off in Los Angeles, jamming freeways and spreading a toxic cloud.', 'A dirty bomb goes off in Los Angeles, jamming freeways and spreading a toxic cloud.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sBkCtdpkWRiisQ3vzyNOZ72biCB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15664'),
  ('193154919963193920', 'Right Here Right Now', 2016, 'Drama', 'Pascal Bonitzer, Julien Hirsch', 'Pascal Bonitzer, Agnès de Sacy', 'Agathe Bonitzer, Vincent Lacoste, Lambert Wilson, Isabelle Huppert, Jean-Pierre Bacri, Julia Faure, Pascal Greggory, Virgil Vernier', null, 'Nora is a bright young professional whose new job at a financial firm turns out to be a trial by fire when she learns that her bosses share a tumultuous history with her prickly mathematician father. Meanwhile, an interoffice romance with a competitive colleague leads to even more complications, leaving Nora to navigate a minefield of delicate relationships as she climbs the corporate ladder.', 'Nora is a bright young professional whose new job at a financial firm turns out to be a trial by fire when she learns that her bosses share a tumultuous history with her prickly mathematician father. Meanwhile, an interoffice romance with a competitive colleague leads to even more complications, leaving Nora to navigate a minefield of delicate relationships as she climbs the corporate ladder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7huMqd0QJRrCBB3e22tYxkPMAR5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:392124'),
  ('588682858522273377', 'Right Here Right Now', 2018, 'Drama', 'Jakob Lass, Teresa Althen, Oliver Knorr', 'Jakob Lass, Hannah Schopf', 'Corinna Harfouch, Bela B., Martina Schöne-Radunski, Johannes Haas, Mathias Bloech, Niklas Bruhn, Lana Cooper, David Schütter', null, 'Hamburg, St. Pauli, New Year''s Eve. Oskar Wrobel runs a music club in an old hospital at the edge of the Reeperbahn. While fireworks go off in the streets of St. Pauli, he prepares the big final party - the club has to close. Thankfully there is no time to think about it because the chaos is breaking into his living room, all while hell break loose at the club. The film, based on the novel by Tino Hanekamp, was filmed with hundreds of extras attending a real-life three-night-long party.', 'Hamburg, St. Pauli, New Year''s Eve. Oskar Wrobel runs a music club in an old hospital at the edge of the Reeperbahn. While fireworks go off in the streets of St. Pauli, he prepares the big final party - the club has to close. Thankfully there is no time to think about it because the chaos is breaking into his living room, all while hell break loose at the club. The film, based on the novel by Tino Hanekamp, was filmed with hundreds of extras attending a real-life three-night-long party.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sCo1excKlzhKas681CTSe1ujcOa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:423189'),
  ('20065077375994722', 'Right in Front of Me', 2021, 'TV Movie, Romance, Comedy', 'Adam Sliwinski, Scooby Vincent, Jason Pratt', 'Julie Sherman Wolfe', 'Janel Parrish, Marco Grazzini, Hilary Jardine, Brandi Alexander, Jason Cermak, Clayton James, Anthony Konechny, Clare Filipow', 'G', 'Carly gets a second chance at romance with her college crush but isn’t sure how to impress him until her new friend Nick starts giving her advice. Soon she learns who the right man for her really is.', 'Carly gets a second chance at romance with her college crush but isn’t sure how to impress him until her new friend Nick starts giving her advice. Soon she learns who the right man for her really is.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vzn6d9w3PqHLiTYXsfqlB4KQtsB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:796000'),
  ('479094264031027476', 'Right Now, Wrong Then', 2015, 'Drama, Romance', 'Hong Sang-soo, Park Hong-yeol, Lee Eui-haeng', 'Hong Sang-soo', 'Jung Jae-young, Kim Min-hee, Youn Yuh-jung, Ki Joo-bong, Choi Hwa-jeong, Yu Jun-sang, Seo Young-hwa, Ko A-sung', null, 'By mistake, film director Ham Chunsu arrives in Suwon a day early. With time to kill before his lecture the next day, Chunsu stops by a restored, old palace and meets an artist named Yoon Heejung. Together, they go to Heejung''s workshop to look at her paintings, have Sushi with Soju for dinner, and get close. Later, they go to another café and have more drinks with Heejung''s acquaintances. When asked if he is married, Chunsu is forced to reveal the fact that he is, and Heejung gets deeply disappointed...', 'By mistake, film director Ham Chunsu arrives in Suwon a day early. With time to kill before his lecture the next day, Chunsu stops by a restored, old palace and meets an artist named Yoon Heejung. Together, they go to Heejung''s workshop to look at her paintings, have Sushi with Soju for dinner, and get close. Later, they go to another café and have more drinks with Heejung''s acquaintances. When asked if he is married, Chunsu is forced to reveal the fact that he is, and Heejung gets deeply disappointed...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hATTFb4eTiEWfKK6e1mX0zcfSLb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:354275'),
  ('91929589200181057', 'Right of Way', 1983, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'George Schaefer, Howard Schwartz', 'Richard Lees', 'Bette Davis, James Stewart, Melinda Dillon, Priscilla Morrill, John Harkins, Jacque Lynn Colton, Louis Schaefer, Charles Walker', 'NR', 'Miniature Dwyer is named after her mother, who was making miniature doll houses when Minnie was born. Minnie, too, has built doll houses for years, and when she learns that she is terminally ill, she and her husband Teddy begin planning their joint suicide. She makes sure that her dolls are placed with people who will appreciate and cherish them. The couple refuse to allow their grief-stricken daughter or the solicitous social worker or anyone else to forestall the death they are determined is right for them', 'Miniature Dwyer is named after her mother, who was making miniature doll houses when Minnie was born. Minnie, too, has built doll houses for years, and when she learns that she is terminally ill, she and her husband Teddy begin planning their joint suicide. She makes sure that her dolls are placed with people who will appreciate and cherish them. The couple refuse to allow their grief-stricken daughter or the solicitous social worker or anyone else to forestall the death they are determined is right for them', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hel0m0W8aBLAW0FBPgs5WfnTRxg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:195036'),
  ('722835558127622622', 'Right on Track', 2003, 'Drama, Family, TV Movie', 'Duwayne Dunham, Miriam Footer, Robert Seaman', 'Sally Nemeth, Bruce Graham', 'Beverley Mitchell, Brie Larson, Jon Lindstrom, Jodi Russell, Marcus Toji, Ruby Chase O''Neil, Eric Jacobs, Briana Shipley', 'G', 'Based a on a true story about two sisters who came out on top of a man''s sport. The story is based on Erica and Courtney Enders, two sisters who get in to junior drag racing and make it all the way to the top. The two sisters fight a battle of fellow racers who are against having girls race with them therefore it pushes them harder to compete against their competition. Erica becomes stressed when her racing life becomes mixed with her social life and academic goals, and decided to quit racing, until she realizes racing is what she truly wants to do. Finally towards the end of their teen years the Enders sisters come out on top to win the junior drag racing national title. They continue to race throughout high school and college, and still do so today.', 'Based a on a true story about two sisters who came out on top of a man''s sport. The story is based on Erica and Courtney Enders, two sisters who get in to junior drag racing and make it all the way to the top. The two sisters fight a battle of fellow racers who are against having girls race with them therefore it pushes them harder to compete against their competition. Erica becomes stressed when her racing life becomes mixed with her social life and academic goals, and decided to quit racing, until she realizes racing is what she truly wants to do. Finally towards the end of their teen years the Enders sisters come out on top to win the junior drag racing national title. They continue to race throughout high school and college, and still do so today.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cPfAqTFenHPXgC4eAU1qIjywVbI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77606'),
  ('1018674013293684935', 'Right Place', 2005, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Kosai Sekine', null, 'Tsuyoshi Ohisi, Megumi Komatsu, Risa Mizutani, Kouji Yashiro, Shintaro Ashanuma, Tatsuya Hashimoto, Takayuki Kobayashi, Atsuko Igari', null, 'It is the story of a compulsive Japanese worker obsessed with order; for everything there is a site, but he realizes that he can not finds his site.', 'It is the story of a compulsive Japanese worker obsessed with order; for everything there is a site, but he realizes that he can not finds his site.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pu2HJZtfQlsC0vnv9x4DdajxQda.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:354239'),
  ('1119288094713925054', 'Right to Die', 2007, 'Thriller, Horror, TV Movie', 'Rob Schmidt, Attila Szalay', 'John Esposito', 'Martin Donovan, Julia Benson, Robin Sydney, Anna Galvin, Corbin Bernsen, Xantha Radley, Derek Green, Norman Misura', null, 'When a grisly car accident put his wife into a coma, a man reluctantly pulls the plug only to realize her spirit has turned vengeful against the living.', 'When a grisly car accident put his wife into a coma, a man reluctantly pulls the plug only to realize her spirit has turned vengeful against the living.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nRrDXuIjMd7uUaeU9X30JOSsjjM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:319302'),
  ('288135301613460757', 'Righteous Kill', 2008, 'Crime, Thriller, Mystery', 'Jon Avnet, Linda Montanti, Denis Lenoir', 'Russell Gewirtz', 'Robert De Niro, Al Pacino, 50 Cent, Carla Gugino, John Leguizamo, Donnie Wahlberg, Brian Dennehy, Trilby Glover', 'R', 'Two veteran New York City detectives work to identify the possible connection between a recent murder and a case they believe they solved years ago; is there a serial killer on the loose, and did they perhaps put the wrong person behind bars?', 'Two veteran New York City detectives work to identify the possible connection between a recent murder and a case they believe they solved years ago; is there a serial killer on the loose, and did they perhaps put the wrong person behind bars?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uriFxRT3eIxGwoo4SgAeMHFfLu8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13389'),
  ('547505976444331809', 'Righteous Thieves', 2023, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Anthony Nardolillo, Robert Benavides, Giovanni Cotto-Ortiz', 'Michael Corcoran', 'Lisa Vidal, Cam Gigandet, Jaina Lee Ortiz, Carlos Miranda, Sasha Merci, Brian Cousins, Melissa Marty, Mitch Poulos', 'R', 'Annabel, the leader of a secret organization engaged in the recovery of priceless artwork, assembles a ragtag crew of art thieves to recover a Monet, Picasso, Degas, and Van Gogh stolen by Nazis during WWII and now in the possession of neo-Nazi billionaire oligarch Otto Huizen. As the planned heist approaches, loyalties are tested when the crew learns the real reason behind Annabel’s search for the long-lost paintings.', 'Annabel, the leader of a secret organization engaged in the recovery of priceless artwork, assembles a ragtag crew of art thieves to recover a Monet, Picasso, Degas, and Van Gogh stolen by Nazis during WWII and now in the possession of neo-Nazi billionaire oligarch Otto Huizen. As the planned heist approaches, loyalties are tested when the crew learns the real reason behind Annabel’s search for the long-lost paintings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lVDlngnmhQiG8GbnQBnFOAzpXLh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:845890'),
  ('469454048046570289', 'Righteous Ties', 2006, 'Crime, Drama, Comedy', 'Jang Jin, Lee Byeong-hoon, Choi Sang-ho', 'Jang Jin', 'Jung Jae-young, Jung Jun-ho, Ryu Seung-ryong, Ju Jin-mo, Gong Ho-seok, Yun Yoo-sun, Jang Jin, Shin Gu', null, 'After learning his boss betrayed him, a mob lackey plans to break out of prison and take revenge.', 'After learning his boss betrayed him, a mob lackey plans to break out of prison and take revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tkdfgT6KyE5Ga4g4vbykI0cZVWR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55765'),
  ('759482656298656336', 'Righting Wrongs', 1986, 'Action, Comedy, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Corey Yuen, James Tien Chun, Tom Lau Moon-Tong', 'Sze-To Cheuk-Hon, Barry Wong Ping-Yiu', 'Yuen Biao, Cynthia Rothrock, Melvin Wong, Corey Yuen, Wu Ma, Louis Fan Siu-Wong, Lau Siu-Ming, Tai Bo', null, 'Jason Chan, a Hong Kong lawyer, is angry at the way the law protects criminals and decides to take the law into his own hands, dishing out vigilante justice when a key witness and his entire family are murdered. But hotshot cop Cindy Si is soon on Chan''s case, and the situation unravels into a fight that only a few will survive.', 'Jason Chan, a Hong Kong lawyer, is angry at the way the law protects criminals and decides to take the law into his own hands, dishing out vigilante justice when a key witness and his entire family are murdered. But hotshot cop Cindy Si is soon on Chan''s case, and the situation unravels into a fight that only a few will survive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/diXiT68DC6mIlzv3WsOS2iYkl36.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66212'),
  ('885710762600963813', 'Rigoletto', 1993, 'Drama', 'Leo D. Paur, T.C. Christensen', null, 'Joseph Paur, Ivey Lloyd, Cynthia Jump, John Huntington, Dalin Christiansen, Frank Gerrish, Sarah Jayne Jensen, Tom Nibley', null, 'Things are not going well in the depression-era town of Castle Gate. Mr. Ribaldi, a mysterious rich man with a disfigured face and an abrasive personality, has just bought and moved into a long-vacant mansion. Bonnie, an adolescent girl who loves to sing, ends up working for Ribaldi so that her family can stay in their house. But Ribaldi is quite an accomplished musician himself, and he is soon giving Bonnie voice lessons. Meanwhile, local businesses are being shut down by foreclosures, and the townspeople suspect Ribaldi is responsible.', 'Things are not going well in the depression-era town of Castle Gate. Mr. Ribaldi, a mysterious rich man with a disfigured face and an abrasive personality, has just bought and moved into a long-vacant mansion. Bonnie, an adolescent girl who loves to sing, ends up working for Ribaldi so that her family can stay in their house. But Ribaldi is quite an accomplished musician himself, and he is soon giving Bonnie voice lessons. Meanwhile, local businesses are being shut down by foreclosures, and the townspeople suspect Ribaldi is responsible.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tGMxcrf0iwqN1zSm5a2KI4hTHwN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39902'),
  ('626438715136124680', 'Rigor Mortis', 2013, 'Horror, Action, Drama', 'Juno Mak, Ng Man-Ching', 'Jill Leung, Philip Yung Chi-Kwong', 'Chin Siu-Ho, Anthony Chan Yau, Kara Hui Ying-Hung, Nina Paw Hei-Ching, Lo Hoi-Pang, Richard Ng Yiu-Hon, Paul Chung Fat, Billy Lau Nam-Kwong', null, 'When a former actor moves into an apartment building with the intention of commiting suicide, he is saved by a Taoist priest who used to specialize in hunting Chinese hopping vampires: or Jiāngshī. Elsewhere in the building, a woman turns to a specialist in black magic to bring her husband back to life.', 'When a former actor moves into an apartment building with the intention of commiting suicide, he is saved by a Taoist priest who used to specialize in hunting Chinese hopping vampires: or Jiāngshī. Elsewhere in the building, a woman turns to a specialist in black magic to bring her husband back to life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/13XrW84O4HBagKQ3mvJTQcVjCVu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:210911'),
  ('1107975368569341464', 'Rik Mayall Presents: Dancing Queen', 1993, 'Comedy, Romance, TV Movie', 'Nick Hamm, David Odd', 'Nick Vivian', 'Rik Mayall, Helena Bonham Carter, Serena Gordon, Dorothy Tutin, Nathaniel Parker, Martin Clunes, Bill Cashmore, Judith Barker', null, 'Dancing Queen is a 1993 British romantic comedy film starring Rik Mayall and Helena Bonham Carter. It follows the misfortune of Neil (Mayall), a bridegroom trying to get back to his bride with the help of his newfound friend Pandora/Julie (Bonham Carter) the stripper. It was the third episode of the first series of the Granada Television series Rik Mayall Presents.', 'Dancing Queen is a 1993 British romantic comedy film starring Rik Mayall and Helena Bonham Carter. It follows the misfortune of Neil (Mayall), a bridegroom trying to get back to his bride with the help of his newfound friend Pandora/Julie (Bonham Carter) the stripper. It was the third episode of the first series of the Granada Television series Rik Mayall Presents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5eP72RHRgvAvv1meM2vcEzyKO5A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:362029'),
  ('797420014482398340', 'Rika: The Mixed-Blood Girl', 1972, 'Drama, Action, Crime', 'Kō Nakahira, Aguri Sugita, Toshinori Hishiguchi', 'Kaneto Shindō', 'Rika Aoki, Kazuko Nagamoto, Masami Souda, Michi Nono, Fuminori Sato, Ryōhei Uchida, Masane Tsukayama, Yasuo Arakawa', null, 'First film of a trilogy following the dramatic life of Rika, a half-Japanese/half-American woman who becomes the tough-as-nails leader of an all-girl crime gang.', 'First film of a trilogy following the dramatic life of Rika, a half-Japanese/half-American woman who becomes the tough-as-nails leader of an all-girl crime gang.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hby7mwzlZWDhIoDpZCXZbSuQZca.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64667'),
  ('375432017837704315', 'Riki-Oh 2: Child of Destruction', 1990, 'Action, Animation, Drama, Fantasy', 'Satoshi Dezaki', 'Kazumi Koide', 'Bin Shimada, Ryuuzaburou Ootomo, Shuichi Ikeda, Tomomichi Nishimura, Hisako Kyoda, Kazue Ikura, Ken Yamaguchi, Kenichi Ono', null, 'Riki finds himself in the town of Misaki, dotted with illegal nuclear power plants and run by a religious fanatic military organization called "God''s Judgment." He is taken prisoner and made to fight in gladiatorial matches in a sprawling arena. He finds his brother, whose special powers have given him the name of "Savior," but his reunion with his resentful sibling turns sour rather quickly.', 'Riki finds himself in the town of Misaki, dotted with illegal nuclear power plants and run by a religious fanatic military organization called "God''s Judgment." He is taken prisoner and made to fight in gladiatorial matches in a sprawling arena. He finds his brother, whose special powers have given him the name of "Savior," but his reunion with his resentful sibling turns sour rather quickly.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a7c5hMmkTnzmFhjHQUVziCh4bu3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:308810'),
  ('1107750760401068282', 'Riki-Oh: The Story of Ricky', 1991, 'Action, Crime, Comedy, Thriller', 'Lam Nai-Choi, Mak Hoi-Man', 'Lam Nai-Choi', 'Louis Fan Siu-Wong, Fan Mei-Sheng, William Ho, Gloria Yip Wan-Yee, Yukari Ôshima, Frankie Chan Chi-Leung, Kôichi Sugisaki, Wong Kwai-Hung', null, 'In 2001, where all correctional facilities have been privatized, martial artist Ricky finds himself victim to the corrupt system, found "guilty" of the manslaughter of an infamous crime boss.', 'In 2001, where all correctional facilities have been privatized, martial artist Ricky finds himself victim to the corrupt system, found "guilty" of the manslaughter of an infamous crime boss.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dzG0PAbBDLbJSYuv2SM2Mjxw2MH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17467'),
  ('83445469764067519', 'Riki-Oh: The Wall of Hell', 1989, 'Action, Animation, Drama, Fantasy', 'Yasuhiro Seo, Satoshi Dezaki', 'Kazumi Koide', 'Bin Shimada, Satomi Korogi, Ryuuzaburou Ootomo, Akio Otsuka, Tessyo Genda, Yasunori Matsumoto', null, 'In the late 1990s, society is descending into ecological collapse and totalitarianism. Saiga Riki-Oh, a mysterious man with a six-pointed star on his fist, finds himself at the privately-owned Tokyo State Prison. Serving a term of three years due to assault, his first offense, Riki-Oh openly antagonizes The Four Emperors, four powerful prisoners that control the prison and keep the rest of the inmates in line...', 'In the late 1990s, society is descending into ecological collapse and totalitarianism. Saiga Riki-Oh, a mysterious man with a six-pointed star on his fist, finds himself at the privately-owned Tokyo State Prison. Serving a term of three years due to assault, his first offense, Riki-Oh openly antagonizes The Four Emperors, four powerful prisoners that control the prison and keep the rest of the inmates in line...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gR86g3D9DBJ7KueVJ4v59ymehqh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:282915'),
  ('1002341635115683554', 'Rikidozan: A Hero Extraordinaire', 2004, 'Drama', 'Song Hae-sung, Kim Hyung-koo, Jung Young-min', 'Song Hae-sung', 'Sul Kyung-gu, Miki Nakatani, Tatsuya Fuji, Masato Hagiwara, Masakatsu Funaki, Shinya Hashimoto, Keiji Muto, Mike Polchlopek', null, 'Story of Rikidozan, a sumo wrestler who can only achieve limited success in Japan because he''s half Korean. But when Rikidozan goes to the United States and discovers professional wrestling, he becomes a hero back home.', 'Story of Rikidozan, a sumo wrestler who can only achieve limited success in Japan because he''s half Korean. But when Rikidozan goes to the United States and discovers professional wrestling, he becomes a hero back home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/agC9ccvtK5bZJh2GBJqOUdcRoZc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:209341'),
