  ('296044262006207616', 'Rim of the World', 2019, 'Science Fiction, Adventure, Comedy', 'Tim Trella, Robert W. Joseph, Matthew Trotter', 'Zack Stentz', 'Jack Gore, Miya Cech, Benjamin Flores Jr., Alessio Scalzotto, Andrew Bachelor, Annabeth Gish, Scott MacArthur, Dean S. Jagger', 'PG-13', 'Stranded at a summer camp when aliens attack the planet, four teens with nothing in common embark on a perilous mission to save the world.', 'Stranded at a summer camp when aliens attack the planet, four teens with nothing in common embark on a perilous mission to save the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yhzTeZU5OULn3ePGF58Rc5oIocZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:531306'),
  ('186738342844365849', 'Rimini', 2022, 'Drama, Music', 'Ulrich Seidl, Wolfgang Thaler', 'Veronika Franz, Ulrich Seidl', 'Michael Thomas, Tessa Göttlicher, Hans-Michael Rehberg, Inge Maux, Claudia Martini, Georg Friedrich, Natalija Baranova, Moumen Abd El Rahman', null, 'Richie Bravo, once upon a time a successful pop star, chases after his faded fame in wintry Rimini. Trapped between permanent intoxication and concerts for busloads of tourists, his world starts to collapse when his adult daughter breaks into his life.', 'Richie Bravo, once upon a time a successful pop star, chases after his faded fame in wintry Rimini. Trapped between permanent intoxication and concerts for busloads of tourists, his world starts to collapse when his adult daughter breaks into his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2QYFVzsu5dXZuttR2Gk40SpwTEe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:505570'),
