  ('926131474502912534', 'Rimini, Rimini: A Year Later', 1988, 'Comedy', 'Bruno Corbucci, Carlo Corbucci, Giorgio Capitani', 'Bruno Corbucci, Mario Amendola', 'Corinne Cléry, Gianfranco D''Angelo, Eva Grimaldi, Maurizio Micheli, Renzo Montagnani, Gastone Moschin, Adriano Pappalardo, Isabel Russinova', null, 'Four episodes set on the beaches of Rimini: a womanizer pretends to be homosexual in order to gain the favors of a beautiful woman who ignores him. A mature beachgoer suffers from indigestion. A businessman unknowingly finances his wife''s infidelities. Two wives from the south are forced to exchange partners.', 'Four episodes set on the beaches of Rimini: a womanizer pretends to be homosexual in order to gain the favors of a beautiful woman who ignores him. A mature beachgoer suffers from indigestion. A businessman unknowingly finances his wife''s infidelities. Two wives from the south are forced to exchange partners.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1TJ9HNTQaxzEddl8AEPGGNjBl0O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82083'),
  ('613614998399001376', 'Rinascere', 2022, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Umberto Marino', 'Umberto Marino, Michela Straniero', 'Giancarlo Commare, Alessio Boni, Gea Dall''Orto, Salvatore Nicolella, David Coco, Francesca Beggio, Pietro Giannini, Giorgia Frank', null, 'Manuel is a young swimmer who seems one step away from realizing his dreams: he has time to join the Olympics, he''s falling in love and his family support him. But in a second his life changes. A brutal unexpected event forces him on a wheelchair and he must seek for all his strength to react, to "be born again".', 'Manuel is a young swimmer who seems one step away from realizing his dreams: he has time to join the Olympics, he''s falling in love and his family support him. But in a second his life changes. A brutal unexpected event forces him on a wheelchair and he must seek for all his strength to react, to "be born again".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v7UTgiREqmgTrVhJj980v0GpgbK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:970218'),
  ('413583456691125644', 'Ring', 1995, 'Horror, TV Movie, Mystery', 'Chisui Takigawa, Kazumi Iwata', null, 'Katsunori Takahashi, Ayane Miura, Mai Tachihara, Maha Hamada, Tomorowo Taguchi, Akiko Hinagata, Takayuki Godai, Shigeyuki Nakamura', null, 'In different parts of Tokyo, four young and seemingly healthy people suddenly die of heart failure at exactly the same moment. Reporter Kazuyuki Asakawa decides to investigate the deaths, and discovers that the four had stayed at a rural inn together just a week earlier. At the inn, he comes across a strange video that ends with a message saying that anyone who watches it will die exactly seven days later. Now the clock is ticking for Asakawa. Can he break the curse in time?', 'In different parts of Tokyo, four young and seemingly healthy people suddenly die of heart failure at exactly the same moment. Reporter Kazuyuki Asakawa decides to investigate the deaths, and discovers that the four had stayed at a rural inn together just a week earlier. At the inn, he comes across a strange video that ends with a message saying that anyone who watches it will die exactly seven days later. Now the clock is ticking for Asakawa. Can he break the curse in time?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rtnYQmTtvpeS3uCphNOkimZBVs5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:139937'),
  ('534257897563345402', 'Ring', 1998, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Hideo Nakata, Junichiro Hayashi', 'Hiroshi Takahashi', 'Nanako Matsushima, Hiroyuki Sanada, Rikiya Ôtaka, Miki Nakatani, Yuko Takeuchi, Hitomi Sato, Yutaka Matsushige, Yōichi Numata', 'NR', 'A mysterious video has been linked to a number of deaths, and when an inquisitive journalist finds the tape and views it herself, she sets in motion a chain of events that puts her own life in danger.', 'A mysterious video has been linked to a number of deaths, and when an inquisitive journalist finds the tape and views it herself, she sets in motion a chain of events that puts her own life in danger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1YINof6kN5yRdePEbcU5360ejoq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2671'),
  ('150923589139513299', 'Ring 0', 2000, 'Horror, Thriller, Drama', 'Norio Tsuruta, Takahide Shibanushi', null, 'Yukie Nakama, Seiichi Tanabe, Kumiko Aso, Yoshiko Tanaka, Takeshi Wakamatsu, Ryushi Mizukami, Kaoru Okunuki, Yasushi Kimura', 'NR', 'Taking place thirty years before the events of Ringu, Ringu 0 provides the shocking background story of how the girl on the video became a deadly, vengeful spirit.', 'Taking place thirty years before the events of Ringu, Ringu 0 provides the shocking background story of how the girl on the video became a deadly, vengeful spirit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nuhEWlaoMD00rTDCiYxdEc7d1tD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9674'),
  ('320596579065777023', 'Ring 2', 1999, 'Horror, Mystery, Science Fiction', 'Hideo Nakata, Hideo Yamamoto', 'Hiroshi Takahashi', 'Miki Nakatani, Hitomi Sato, Kyoko Fukada, Fumiyo Kohinata, Kenjirou Ishimaru, Yûrei Yanagi, Rikiya Ôtaka, Yōichi Numata', 'NR', 'While investigating the horrifying death of her boyfriend, Mai Takano learns about a videotape haunted by the spirit of a disturbing girl named Sadako, which kills anyone who watches it exactly one week later. When her boyfriend’s son, Yoichi, starts to develop the same psychic abilities as Sadako, Takano must find a way to keep the boy and herself from becoming the next victims.', 'While investigating the horrifying death of her boyfriend, Mai Takano learns about a videotape haunted by the spirit of a disturbing girl named Sadako, which kills anyone who watches it exactly one week later. When her boyfriend’s son, Yoichi, starts to develop the same psychic abilities as Sadako, Takano must find a way to keep the boy and herself from becoming the next victims.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/HREqYQWkGnH2viRQEXupCSX7ID.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9669'),
  ('1095564218044774224', 'Ring Around the Rosie', 2006, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Mark Woods, Rubi Zack', 'Alex Barder, Michael Tabb, Rubi Zack', 'Gina Philips, Tom Sizemore, Randall Batinkoff, Jenny Mollen, Frances Bay, Krystal Rohrer, Marc Lynn, Hayley McFarland', null, 'While spending time at her grandparent''s secluded summerhouse to clean up the place after her grandmother''s death, a young woman is plagued by horrible visions and dreams of tragic past events.', 'While spending time at her grandparent''s secluded summerhouse to clean up the place after her grandmother''s death, a young woman is plagued by horrible visions and dreams of tragic past events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vmhwrJu6kTNrEXZM6qzztN6ikeF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10114'),
  ('1015849999969649188', 'Ring of Bright Water', 1969, 'Drama, Family', 'Jack Couffer, Wolfgang Suschitzky', 'Jack Couffer, Bill Travers', 'Bill Travers, Virginia McKenna, Peter Jeffrey, Jameson Clark, Helena Gloag, Willie Joss, Roddy McMillan, Jean Taylor Smith', 'G', 'Stuck in a dead-end job, Graham Merrill adopts an otter, Mij, as a pet and then moves to an isolated village in western Scotland. Together they set out to explore the curious and magnificent natural wonders that surround their seaside home. Soon, Graham finds himself falling in love with the beautiful town doctor, Mary. Before long, the three become inseparable friends.', 'Stuck in a dead-end job, Graham Merrill adopts an otter, Mij, as a pet and then moves to an isolated village in western Scotland. Together they set out to explore the curious and magnificent natural wonders that surround their seaside home. Soon, Graham finds himself falling in love with the beautiful town doctor, Mary. Before long, the three become inseparable friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sUI7ZkpgjzB8wTFP6ezn3u8FWjV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59427'),
  ('1081954707849132542', 'Ring of Curse', 2011, 'Horror', 'Mari Asato, Tsukasa Tanabe', 'Mari Asato, Yôichi Minamikawa', 'Airi Suzuki, Miyabi Natsuyaki, Momoko Tsugunaga, Chisato Okai, Itsuki Sagara, Karen Ishida, Tomomi Miyashita, Riko Matsumura', null, 'In observing a solitary classmate, a student begins to suspect that the loner has the ability to write words that will kill those who read them.', 'In observing a solitary classmate, a student begins to suspect that the loner has the ability to write words that will kill those who read them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aX88jCiChMUUInXGeHjqMpSW10Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90942'),
