  ('681855587120110258', 'Ring of Fire', 1961, 'Crime, Action, Adventure', 'Andrew L. Stone, William H. Clothier', 'Andrew L. Stone', 'David Janssen, Joyce Taylor, Frank Gorshin, Joel Marston, James Johnson, Ron Myron, Marshall Kent, Doodles Weaver', 'NR', 'In Oregon, two sheriff deputies arrest three teenagers for robbery but are overpowered and taken hostage while forest fires rage all around them.', 'In Oregon, two sheriff deputies arrest three teenagers for robbery but are overpowered and taken hostage while forest fires rage all around them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k4CWmGwrxZroRELw5wmxx7IHmLK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109203'),
  ('812270425904363644', 'Ring of Fire', 1991, 'Action, Drama', 'Richard Pepin, Richard W. Munchkin, Jake Jacobs', 'Jake Jacobs, Richard W. Munchkin', 'Don Wilson, Maria Ford, Vince Murdocco, Dale Jacoby, Steven Vincent Leigh, Michael Delano, Eric Lee, Gary Daniels', 'R', 'Johnny Woo is a Chinese doctor who has given up fighting in the ring. His brother is a teacher at a kickboxing club. When Johnny falls in love with Julie, whose brother is a teacher in a rival kickboxing club, tension begins to build...', 'Johnny Woo is a Chinese doctor who has given up fighting in the ring. His brother is a teacher at a kickboxing club. When Johnny falls in love with Julie, whose brother is a teacher in a rival kickboxing club, tension begins to build...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gnb8il4XAO7BmMVKtBjfwQRrUPl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68479'),
  ('165429627991234240', 'Ring of Fire II: Blood and Steel', 1993, 'Action, Drama', 'Richard W. Munchkin, Jerry P. Jacobs, Tommy Bull', 'Richard W. Munchkin, Steve Tymon', 'Don Wilson, Maria Ford, Sy Richardson, Dale Jacoby, Vince Murdocco, Ian Jacklin, Evan Lurie, Eric Lee', null, 'Johnny Woo and Julie play an enduring couple who survive all sorts of interference from rival kick-box gangs in their effort to put a little romance in their lives.', 'Johnny Woo and Julie play an enduring couple who survive all sorts of interference from rival kick-box gangs in their effort to put a little romance in their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rU3BdfmatHPsKBTHVGyuMxcqcQx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91548'),
  ('1087468873917941454', 'Ring of Fire III: Lion Strike', 1995, 'Action', 'Rick Jacobson, Garett Griffin, Jerry P. Jacobs', 'Joseph John Barmettler', 'Don Wilson, Bobbie Phillips, Robert Costanzo, Art Camacho, Michael Delano, Chris Nelson Norris, Carl Ciarfalio, Michael Jai White', null, 'Dr. Johnny Woo becomes involved in a global Mafia arms cartel when they kidnap his son Bobby. The cartel, made-up of underworld leaders from around the world, become aware that he stumbled onto valuable information on a computer disk he possesses. Louie and his Russian counterpart Vladimir Kruskev use every bit of their cunning to trap Johnny and retrieve the disk.', 'Dr. Johnny Woo becomes involved in a global Mafia arms cartel when they kidnap his son Bobby. The cartel, made-up of underworld leaders from around the world, become aware that he stumbled onto valuable information on a computer disk he possesses. Louie and his Russian counterpart Vladimir Kruskev use every bit of their cunning to trap Johnny and retrieve the disk.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tUYbL7fXp3zDA8BYpOCidfVJ8ic.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68478'),
  ('980667357144746766', 'Ring of Spies', 1964, 'Drama, Crime, Thriller', 'Robert Tronson, Arthur Lavis, Derek Cracknell', 'Peter Barnes, Frank Launder', 'Bernard Lee, William Sylvester, Margaret Tyzack, David Kossoff, Nancy Nevinson, Thorley Walters, Gillian Lewis, Newton Blick', null, 'The film is based on the actual events of the Portland Spy Ring trial in the U.K. A disgruntled Navy Clerk is transferred to a secret research establishment and is subsequently black-mailed/paid by Czech intelligence to procure secrets for them. He seduces the secretary who controls the most secret documents, and they enjoy the fruits of their treachery until the British authorities begin to close in on them.', 'The film is based on the actual events of the Portland Spy Ring trial in the U.K. A disgruntled Navy Clerk is transferred to a secret research establishment and is subsequently black-mailed/paid by Czech intelligence to procure secrets for them. He seduces the secretary who controls the most secret documents, and they enjoy the fruits of their treachery until the British authorities begin to close in on them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/BoTlj10nA7ktxIGGAA6ijCzO9V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:292792'),
  ('394674326545321187', 'Ring of Steel', 1994, 'Action, Drama', 'MacKenzie Waggaman, David Frost', 'Robert Chapin, David Frost', 'Robert Chapin, Wil Darwin Adams, Carol Alt, Mark Arnott, Michael Blanks, Henry Brown, Melvin Jones, Joe Don Baker', 'R', 'A champion fencer accidentally kills an opponent in a match. Disgraced, he is blackballed from the fencing community, until a mysterious stranger saves his life one night from a gang of muggers. He soon finds himself caught up in the world of underground illegal swordfights, where combatants fight to the death.', 'A champion fencer accidentally kills an opponent in a match. Disgraced, he is blackballed from the fencing community, until a mysterious stranger saves his life one night from a gang of muggers. He soon finds himself caught up in the world of underground illegal swordfights, where combatants fight to the death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4KKYFi7ULHZ2HwL4rORijP4THZp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73967'),
  ('330710347358731244', 'Ring of Terror', 1961, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Clark L. Paylow, Brydon Baker III', 'Lewis Simeon, G.J. Zinnerman', 'George E. Mather, Esther Furst, Norman Ollestad, Pamela Raymond, Lomax Study, Austin Green, Joseph Conway, Ollie O''Toole', null, 'A group of medical students undertake some silly and frightening endeavors in order to pledge a fraternity.', 'A group of medical students undertake some silly and frightening endeavors in order to pledge a fraternity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hVuVppiIntAR5Sf01nWCBinnWHL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:113739'),
  ('175946311201844225', 'Ring of the Nibelungs', 2004, 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy, TV Movie', 'Uli Edel, Elemér Ragályi, Jon-Luke Lourens', 'Peter Morwood, Diane Duane, Uli Edel', 'Benno Fürmann, Alicia Witt, Kristanna Loken, Julian Sands, Samuel West, Max von Sydow, Robert Pattinson, Mavie Hörbiger', 'PG-13', 'In this swords-and-sorcery tale, good-hearted blacksmith Eyvind hides away infant Prince Siegfried after two malevolent kings murder his father. But a fiery meteor sent by the gods reveals Siegfried''s destiny, sending him on the quest of a lifetime. To save a crumbling kingdom claim the heart of his true love, he''ll have to slay the nefarious dragon, Fafnir.', 'In this swords-and-sorcery tale, good-hearted blacksmith Eyvind hides away infant Prince Siegfried after two malevolent kings murder his father. But a fiery meteor sent by the gods reveals Siegfried''s destiny, sending him on the quest of a lifetime. To save a crumbling kingdom claim the heart of his true love, he''ll have to slay the nefarious dragon, Fafnir.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jQEOhDR05dhGcRQA4TIGVs0Q46d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11188'),
  ('946997136656298031', 'Ringing Bell', 1978, 'Animation, Drama, Family', 'Masami Hata, Iwao Yamaki', null, 'Akira Kamiya, Minori Matsushima, Seizo Kato, Hitoshi Takagi, Taeko Nakanishi', 'PG-13', 'Chirin is an innocent though adventurous young lamb whose carefree life on the farm comes to an abrupt end when a wolf murders his mother. Confused and angry, Chirin pursues the wolf into the mountains, seeking revenge. The laws of nature are brutal, however, and hatred alone won''t be enough to avenge the loss of his mother. Only the strong survive in the wild, and obtaining that strength may change Chirin forever.', 'Chirin is an innocent though adventurous young lamb whose carefree life on the farm comes to an abrupt end when a wolf murders his mother. Confused and angry, Chirin pursues the wolf into the mountains, seeking revenge. The laws of nature are brutal, however, and hatred alone won''t be enough to avenge the loss of his mother. Only the strong survive in the wild, and obtaining that strength may change Chirin forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/28gMUOzWtWSR4N9nE4AMTO9OzUt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77859'),
  ('481972696949190338', 'Ringkämpfer', 1895, 'Documentary', 'Emil Skladanowsky, Max Skladanowsky', null, 'Eugen Sandow, Greiner', null, 'Two men in white leotards and tights, and black slips over it, wrestle on a theatre stage.', 'Two men in white leotards and tights, and black slips over it, wrestle on a theatre stage.', null, 'tmdb:movie:189575'),
  ('196452756756963445', 'Ringmaster', 1998, 'Comedy', 'Neil Abramson, Russell J. Lyster', 'Jon Bernstein', 'Jerry Springer, Jaime Pressly, Molly Hagan, William McNamara, Michael Dudikoff, Wendy Raquel Robinson, Michael Jai White, Ashley Holbrook', 'R', 'Jerry Springer stars as more or less himself, the host of a raunchy, controversial and popular Los Angeles talk show which features everyday people with problems and who frequently vent their problems on the air.', 'Jerry Springer stars as more or less himself, the host of a raunchy, controversial and popular Los Angeles talk show which features everyday people with problems and who frequently vent their problems on the air.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9QNqeKB4XodrvEiYewOTG9WEka5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37536'),
  ('699914833488239230', 'Ringo and His Golden Pistol', 1966, 'Western', 'Sergio Corbucci, Ruggero Deodato, Nino Fruscella', 'Franco Rossetti, Adriano Bolzoni', 'Mark Damon, Valeria Fabrizi, Franco De Rosa, Giulia Rubini, Loris Loddi, Andrea Aureli, Ettore Manni, Pippo Starnazza', null, 'A Mexican bandit teams up with a band of renegade Native Americans to avenge his older brothers when they are killed by a prankster, gold-obsessed bounty hunter.', 'A Mexican bandit teams up with a band of renegade Native Americans to avenge his older brothers when they are killed by a prankster, gold-obsessed bounty hunter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k86U4f3a8y3DiGKmo6sTBiMH8av.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128513'),
  ('862230897311085060', 'Ringo, the Mark of Vengeance', 1966, 'Western', 'Mario Caiano, Mariano Canales, Angelo Sangermano', 'Eduardo Manzanos', 'Frank Wolff, Anthony Steffen, Eduardo Fajardo, Armando Calvo, Alejandra Nilo, Alfonso Godá, Manuel Bermúdez ''Boliche'', Ricardo Canales', null, 'Story of two friends who rescue bumbling bandit Fidel from a shootout. While patching him up, they discover half of a treasure map tattooed on his back. Learning that the other half is tattooed on the back of someone else, they set about trying to put the two halves together while being joined by card sharp and all round trickster who discovers their secret and wants in on the deal.', 'Story of two friends who rescue bumbling bandit Fidel from a shootout. While patching him up, they discover half of a treasure map tattooed on his back. Learning that the other half is tattooed on the back of someone else, they set about trying to put the two halves together while being joined by card sharp and all round trickster who discovers their secret and wants in on the deal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mRb2uis5sX649H2CKnT3hdFMynU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:143756'),
  ('724661104434347943', 'Rings', 2005, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Jonathan Liebesman, Gabriel Olson, Toby Wilkins', 'Jonathan Liebesman, Ehren Kruger', 'Ryan Merriman, Emily VanCamp, Kelly Stables, Alexandra Breckenridge, Josh Wise, Justin Allen, Andrew D''Amico, Dusty Sorg', 'PG-13', 'Some time after the events of The Ring, a subculture of people voluntarily watch Samara Morgan''s video and wait to see how close to the seven-day deadline they can get before showing it to the next person. They record everything they see and share their experiences on a secret website dedicated to the videotape. No one has ever recorded a day seven.', 'Some time after the events of The Ring, a subculture of people voluntarily watch Samara Morgan''s video and wait to see how close to the seven-day deadline they can get before showing it to the next person. They record everything they see and share their experiences on a secret website dedicated to the videotape. No one has ever recorded a day seven.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mjtAYGglfOO6T1jRov35jH46J6Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91908'),
  ('681120920238141405', 'Rings', 2017, 'Horror', 'David Waters, F. Javier Gutiérrez, Sharone Meir', 'Jacob Aaron Estes, Akiva Goldsman, David Loucka', 'Matilda Lutz, Alex Roe, Johnny Galecki, Vincent D''Onofrio, Zach Roerig, Aimee Teegarden, Bonnie Morgan, Chuck David Willis', 'PG-13', 'Julia becomes worried about her boyfriend Holt when he explores the dark urban legend of a mysterious videotape said to kill the watcher seven days after viewing. She sacrifices herself to save her boyfriend and in doing so makes a horrifying discovery: there is a "movie within the movie" that no one has ever seen before.', 'Julia becomes worried about her boyfriend Holt when he explores the dark urban legend of a mysterious videotape said to kill the watcher seven days after viewing. She sacrifices herself to save her boyfriend and in doing so makes a horrifying discovery: there is a "movie within the movie" that no one has ever seen before.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yp4CDOVpVmNwiPoZKQeFCpW8CFo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14564'),
  ('312472533199441856', 'Rings of Fear', 1978, 'Mystery, Thriller, Horror', 'Marcello Tagliaferri, Andrés Vich, Eduardo Noé', 'Massimo Dallamano, Alberto Negrin, Marcello Coscia', 'Fabio Testi, Christine Kaufmann, Ivan Desny, Jack Taylor, Bruno Alessandro, María Asquerino, Helga Liné, Silvia Aguilar', null, 'Angela Russo, a sixteen-year-old girl, is found dead in a river, having been fatally violated with a large blunt instrument. Inspector Di Salvo is assigned to the case and focuses his investigations on St. Theresa''s, the exclusive school where Angela boarded. Three of the murdered girl''s classmates, Franca, Paola and Virginia (who call themselves "The Inseparables"), receive threatening poems from an individual using the name "Nemesis." Bizarre "accidents" start to befall the girls: Franca is injured when someone causes her horse to bolt and Virginia nearly breaks her neck on marbles left at the top of a staircase. But Di Salvo is determined to find the killer, even if it means using unorthodox methods. He is aided by Angela Russo''s little sister Emily, whose helpful clues lead to a boutique owned by a dubious character and a vice ring where "rich influential men pay well for teenage favours..."', 'Angela Russo, a sixteen-year-old girl, is found dead in a river, having been fatally violated with a large blunt instrument. Inspector Di Salvo is assigned to the case and focuses his investigations on St. Theresa''s, the exclusive school where Angela boarded. Three of the murdered girl''s classmates, Franca, Paola and Virginia (who call themselves "The Inseparables"), receive threatening poems from an individual using the name "Nemesis." Bizarre "accidents" start to befall the girls: Franca is injured when someone causes her horse to bolt and Virginia nearly breaks her neck on marbles left at the top of a staircase. But Di Salvo is determined to find the killer, even if it means using unorthodox methods. He is aided by Angela Russo''s little sister Emily, whose helpful clues lead to a boutique owned by a dubious character and a vice ring where "rich influential men pay well for teenage favours..."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dulbCIxaSeWePtdu2O1c0qyujbZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29530'),
  ('1034441593676497277', 'Rings on Her Fingers', 1942, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Rouben Mamoulian', 'Ken Englund, Emeric Pressburger', 'Gene Tierney, Henry Fonda, Spring Byington, Laird Cregar, Shepperd Strudwick, Frank Orth, Henry Stephenson, Marjorie Gateson', 'NR', 'Susan Miller works behind the girdle counter in a department store and dreams about the beautiful clothes and glamour she can never hope to have. Enter May Worthington and Warren, a pair of con artists who pose as the mother and uncle of a pretty girl in order to separate millionaires from their money. They convince Susan she has an opportunity to fulfill all her dreams, and the trio heads for Palm Beach. Susan meets John Wheeler who says he is shopping for a sailboat. Believing that he is a millionaire, Warren and May sell him a boat that doesn''t belong to them, and make off with his $15,000 life savings. Looking for greener pastures, they work themselves into the family of wealthy Tod Fenwick, who falls for Sue, posing as "Linda Worthington". But John shows up as a guest of Fenwick and he tells "Linda", not knowing she was part of the scam, that he has a detective after the fake captain that sold him the boat...', 'Susan Miller works behind the girdle counter in a department store and dreams about the beautiful clothes and glamour she can never hope to have. Enter May Worthington and Warren, a pair of con artists who pose as the mother and uncle of a pretty girl in order to separate millionaires from their money. They convince Susan she has an opportunity to fulfill all her dreams, and the trio heads for Palm Beach. Susan meets John Wheeler who says he is shopping for a sailboat. Believing that he is a millionaire, Warren and May sell him a boat that doesn''t belong to them, and make off with his $15,000 life savings. Looking for greener pastures, they work themselves into the family of wealthy Tod Fenwick, who falls for Sue, posing as "Linda Worthington". But John shows up as a guest of Fenwick and he tells "Linda", not knowing she was part of the scam, that he has a detective after the fake captain that sold him the boat...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/edZcMANN5TI77l6d2aGPXVIYnbC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79887'),
  ('863089652544828523', 'Rino Gaetano - Ma il cielo è sempre più blu', 2007, 'Drama, Music', 'Marco Turco', 'Marco Turco, Marco Alessi, Umberto Contarello', 'Claudio Santamaria, Laura Chiatti, Kasia Smutniak, Thomas Trabacchi, Giorgio Colangeli, Vitalba Andrea, Francesca Antonelli, Francesco Apolloni', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cRG9GPxGJ1F2KGuNofBU6LecxU0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:241127'),
  ('1085909696758645911', 'Rio', 1939, 'Crime, Romance', 'John Brahm, Hal Mohr, Charles Previn', 'Aben Kandel, Edwin Justus Mayer, Stephen Morehouse Avery', 'Basil Rathbone, Victor McLaglen, Sigrid Gurie, Robert Cummings, Leo Carrillo, Billy Gilbert, Maurice Moscovitch, Irving Bacon', 'NR', 'Diabolical French capitalist Paul Reynard is forced to leave Irene, his bride of one year, when he is arrested for the crimes of forgery and embezzlement and sentenced to a penal colony off the coast of South America.', 'Diabolical French capitalist Paul Reynard is forced to leave Irene, his bride of one year, when he is arrested for the crimes of forgery and embezzlement and sentenced to a penal colony off the coast of South America.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yjWts1yxMTndGwbwqu9AMS2fgss.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27638'),
  ('160533737579426647', 'Rio', 2011, 'Animation, Adventure, Comedy, Family', 'Carlos Saldanha, Renato Falcão, Ignacio Barrios', 'Sam Harper, Don Rhymer, Joshua Sternin', 'Jesse Eisenberg, Anne Hathaway, Leslie Mann, Jane Lynch, will.i.am, George López, Wanda Sykes, Jamie Foxx', 'G', 'Captured by smugglers when he was just a hatchling, a macaw named Blu never learned to fly and lives a happily domesticated life in Minnesota with his human friend, Linda. Blu is thought to be the last of his kind, but when word comes that Jewel, a lone female, lives in Rio de Janeiro, Blu and Linda go to meet her. Animal smugglers kidnap Blu and Jewel, but the pair soon escape and begin a perilous adventure back to freedom -- and Linda.', 'Captured by smugglers when he was just a hatchling, a macaw named Blu never learned to fly and lives a happily domesticated life in Minnesota with his human friend, Linda. Blu is thought to be the last of his kind, but when word comes that Jewel, a lone female, lives in Rio de Janeiro, Blu and Linda go to meet her. Animal smugglers kidnap Blu and Jewel, but the pair soon escape and begin a perilous adventure back to freedom -- and Linda.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4nJxhUknKV8Gqdhov8pU1YWDYfb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46195'),
  ('793878513190399228', 'Rio 2', 2014, 'Animation, Adventure, Comedy, Family', 'Carlos Saldanha, Renato Falcão, Marin Petrov', 'Yoni Brenner, Jenny Bicks, Don Rhymer', 'Jesse Eisenberg, Anne Hathaway, will.i.am, Jamie Foxx, Leslie Mann, George López, Andy Garcia, Bruno Mars', 'G', 'It''s a jungle out there for Blu, Jewel and their three kids after they''re hurtled from Rio de Janeiro to the wilds of the Amazon. As Blu tries to fit in, he goes beak-to-beak with the vengeful Nigel, and meets the most fearsome adversary of all: his father-in-law.', 'It''s a jungle out there for Blu, Jewel and their three kids after they''re hurtled from Rio de Janeiro to the wilds of the Amazon. As Blu tries to fit in, he goes beak-to-beak with the vengeful Nigel, and meets the most fearsome adversary of all: his father-in-law.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gVNTBrjxh2YRmQFjlaqrNbHVvrd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:172385'),
  ('47042656680538063', 'Rio 2096: A Story of Love and Fury', 2013, 'Animation, Drama, History, Romance, Science Fiction, Fantasy', 'Luiz Bolognesi, Anna Caiado', 'Luiz Bolognesi', 'Selton Mello, Camila Pitanga, Rodrigo Santoro, Marcos Cesana, Bemvindo Sequeira, Sérgio Moreno, André Frateschi, Jiddú Pinheiro', 'PG-13', '“Rio 2096 – A Story of Love and Fury” is an animated film that portrays the love between an immortal hero and Janaína, the woman he has been in love with for 600 years. As a backdrop to the romance, the feature highlights four phases of Brazilian history: colonization, slavery, the Military Regime and the future, in 2096, when there will be a war for water.', '“Rio 2096 – A Story of Love and Fury” is an animated film that portrays the love between an immortal hero and Janaína, the woman he has been in love with for 600 years. As a backdrop to the romance, the feature highlights four phases of Brazilian history: colonization, slavery, the Military Regime and the future, in 2096, when there will be a war for water.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aqvJxBR3Tpj9semsPYgCZ2tE3UZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:173443'),
  ('1115686542288674874', 'Rio Babilonia', 1982, 'Drama, Crime', 'Liège Monteiro, Marco Antonio Cury, Jirges Ristum', 'João Carlos Rodrigues, Ezequiel Neves, Neville D''Almeida', 'Joel Barcellos, Christiane Torloni, Jardel Filho, Paulo Villaça, Denise Dumont, Pedro Aguinaga, Tania Boscoli, Antônio Pitanga', null, 'A public relations man is invited to guide an American millionaire during his stay in Rio de Janeiro. He gets involved in the most bizarre situations, from orgiastic mega-parties to confrontations with the police, meetings with drug dealers and movie stars, facing corruption and even murder.', 'A public relations man is invited to guide an American millionaire during his stay in Rio de Janeiro. He gets involved in the most bizarre situations, from orgiastic mega-parties to confrontations with the police, meetings with drug dealers and movie stars, facing corruption and even murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oEKmpE8E1fQDISKWnWVnyNeZqn0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:152242'),
  ('428904494299996488', 'Rio Bravo', 1959, 'Western, Drama', 'Howard Hawks, Russell Harlan, Paul Helmick', 'Jules Furthman, Leigh Brackett', 'John Wayne, Dean Martin, Ricky Nelson, Angie Dickinson, Walter Brennan, Ward Bond, John Russell, Pedro Gonzalez Gonzalez', null, 'A small-town sheriff in the American West enlists the help of a disabled man, a drunk, and a young gunfighter in his efforts to hold in jail the brother of the local bad guy.', 'A small-town sheriff in the American West enlists the help of a disabled man, a drunk, and a young gunfighter in his efforts to hold in jail the brother of the local bad guy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4gI4KKmoi0d3yfsF71YU3S0I5t8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:301'),
  ('388417638354911052', 'Rio Conchos', 1964, 'Western', 'Gordon Douglas, Joseph MacDonald, Joseph E. Rickards', 'Clair Huffaker, Joseph Landon', 'Richard Boone, Stuart Whitman, Anthony Franciosa, Wende Wagner, Warner Anderson, Jim Brown, Rodolfo Acosta, Barry Kelley', 'NR', 'Two Army officers, an alcoholic ex-Confederate soldier and a womanizing Mexican travel to Mexico on a secret mission to prevent a megalomaniacal ex-Confederate colonel from selling a cache of stolen rifles to a band of murderous Apaches.', 'Two Army officers, an alcoholic ex-Confederate soldier and a womanizing Mexican travel to Mexico on a secret mission to prevent a megalomaniacal ex-Confederate colonel from selling a cache of stolen rifles to a band of murderous Apaches.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/becKk2SAvZMEz7IAaxy0hCVIhfO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32560'),
  ('672663469699032565', 'Rio das Mortes', 1971, 'Comedy, TV Movie', 'Rainer Werner Fassbinder, Dietrich Lohmann', 'Rainer Werner Fassbinder', 'Hanna Schygulla, Günther Kaufmann, Michael König, Harry Baer, Katrin Schaake, Ulli Lommel, Ingrid Caven, Lilo Pempeit', null, 'Michel and Guenther, working in dead-end jobs, are obsessed with going to Peru to find buried treasure, using a map of the Rio das Mortes. Michel''s girlfriend, Hanna, humors their plan, but really just wants to get married.', 'Michel and Guenther, working in dead-end jobs, are obsessed with going to Peru to find buried treasure, using a map of the Rio das Mortes. Michel''s girlfriend, Hanna, humors their plan, but really just wants to get married.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h9fLFCncQPYwAk6j0ySQuUS82hG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:197175'),
  ('1108925229464380063', 'Rio Grande', 1950, 'Western', 'Bert Glennon, John Ford, Cliff Lyons', 'James Kevin McGuinness', 'John Wayne, Maureen O''Hara, Ben Johnson, Claude Jarman Jr., Harry Carey, Jr., Chill Wills, J. Carrol Naish, Victor McLaglen', null, 'Lt. Col. Kirby Yorke is posted on the Texas frontier to defend settlers against depredations of marauding Apaches. Col. Yorke is under considerable stress by a serious shortage of troops of his command. Tension is added when Yorke''s son (whom he hasn''t seen in fifteen years), Trooper Jeff Yorke, is one of 18 recruits sent to the regiment.', 'Lt. Col. Kirby Yorke is posted on the Texas frontier to defend settlers against depredations of marauding Apaches. Col. Yorke is under considerable stress by a serious shortage of troops of his command. Tension is added when Yorke''s son (whom he hasn''t seen in fifteen years), Trooper Jeff Yorke, is one of 18 recruits sent to the regiment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zYoK2RkBCmyhIV6UUb6EZLqxmZq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11617'),
  ('124356169527053547', 'Rio Lobo', 1970, 'Western', 'Howard Hawks, William H. Clothier, Yakima Canutt', 'Burton Wohl, Leigh Brackett', 'John Wayne, Jorge Rivero, Jennifer O''Neill, Jack Elam, Christopher Mitchum, Victor French, Susana Dosamantes, Sherry Lansing', 'G', 'After the Civil War, a former Union colonel searches for the two traitors whose perfidy led to the loss of a close friend.', 'After the Civil War, a former Union colonel searches for the two traitors whose perfidy led to the loss of a close friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2vlpjEE5GxJr7CiURQ4e2DWybkw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26593'),
  ('137694288045033467', 'Rio Rita', 1942, 'Comedy, Music', 'S. Sylvan Simon, George J. Folsey', 'Richard Connell, Gladys Lehman', 'Bud Abbott, Lou Costello, Kathryn Grayson, John Carroll, Patricia Dane, Tom Conway, Peter Whitney, Barry Nelson', 'NR', 'Doc and Wishey run into some Nazi-agents, who want to smuggle bombs into the USA from a Mexican border hotel.', 'Doc and Wishey run into some Nazi-agents, who want to smuggle bombs into the USA from a Mexican border hotel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lOpfzO7rlF1nH51YZQR3p3F9Trg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52853'),
  ('809970659387114718', 'Rio, 100 Degrees F°', 1955, 'Drama', 'Nelson Pereira dos Santos, Jece Valadão', 'Nelson Pereira dos Santos', 'Jece Valadão, Glauce Rocha, Roberto Batalin, Zé Keti, Modesto de Souza, Sadi Cabral, Mauro Mendonça, Jackson de Souza', null, 'On a scorching summer day in Rio de Janeiro, five impoverished black boys venture out of their favela to peddle peanuts throughout the bustling city. As they navigate the various districts of Rio, they bear witness to a series of unfortunate events and encounters, unfolding a vivid tapestry of urban life in Rio de Janeiro during that period. These true misadventures shed light on the gritty reality of the city, unveiling its vibrant urban tapestry.', 'On a scorching summer day in Rio de Janeiro, five impoverished black boys venture out of their favela to peddle peanuts throughout the bustling city. As they navigate the various districts of Rio, they bear witness to a series of unfortunate events and encounters, unfolding a vivid tapestry of urban life in Rio de Janeiro during that period. These true misadventures shed light on the gritty reality of the city, unveiling its vibrant urban tapestry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bgNYhX1hFFhp4IMjcVlIWomtipl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:146075'),
  ('1044880569098421966', 'Rio, I Love You', 2014, 'Romance, Drama', 'José Padilha, Guillermo Arriaga, Fernando Meirelles', 'Otavio Leonidio, Antonio Prata, Chico Mattoso', 'Vincent Cassel, Fernanda Montenegro, Eduardo Sterblitch, Basil Hoffman, Emily Mortimer, Harvey Keitel, Ryan Kwanten, John Turturro', null, 'The third episode of the Cities of Love franchise, Rio, I Love You is an anthology, created by 10 visionary directors from across the globe. The story line of each segment focuses on an encounter of love in a different neighborhood of the city, demonstrating the distinctive qualities and character of that location. The film serves to bridge gaps between cultures, educating and entertaining the audience, while celebrating unique and universal expressions of love.', 'The third episode of the Cities of Love franchise, Rio, I Love You is an anthology, created by 10 visionary directors from across the globe. The story line of each segment focuses on an encounter of love in a different neighborhood of the city, demonstrating the distinctive qualities and character of that location. The film serves to bridge gaps between cultures, educating and entertaining the audience, while celebrating unique and universal expressions of love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e4MEGQlEE7VojlBpwaJvjMcXJPg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:211166'),
  ('443787956043032161', 'Rio, Northern Zone', 1957, 'Drama, Music', 'Nelson Pereira dos Santos, Guido Araújo, Hélio Silva', 'Nelson Pereira dos Santos', 'Grande Otelo, Jece Valadão, Paulo Goulart, Maria Petar, Malu Maia, Haroldo de Oliveira, Artur Vargas Jr., Carlos Aquino', null, 'A talented songwriter of sambas is forced to face the social injustices of the city around him.', 'A talented songwriter of sambas is forced to face the social injustices of the city around him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mX5CdIwI5RRgL7qmLAlfPHvDhcr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:146904'),
