  ('23812612136045715', 'Riot', 1996, 'Action', 'Joseph Merhi, Ken Blakey, Adeeb K. Samhat', 'William Applegate Jr., Joseph John Barmettler', 'Gary Daniels, Sugar Ray Leonard, Paige Rowland, Charles Napier, Patrick Kilpatrick, Kenneth Tigar, Dex Elliott Sanders, Scott Shepard', null, 'An heiress is kidnapped during the chaos of a riot on Christmas Eve.', 'An heiress is kidnapped during the chaos of a riot on Christmas Eve.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xL7hNPqYgbe5qGOKSfdS29BHC0d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74832'),
  ('422639363820828614', 'Riot', 1997, 'Drama', 'Richard Di Lello, David C. Johnson, Galen Yuen', 'Richard Di Lello, Joseph B. Vasquez, Galen Yuen', 'Luke Perry, Dante Basco, Mario Van Peebles, Kieu Chinh, Alexis Cruz, Yelba Osorio, John Ortiz, Douglas Spain', null, 'In April 1992, following the notorious Rodney King verdict, the streets of Los Angeles became a battlefield, the backdrop to four personal intertwined stories.', 'In April 1992, following the notorious Rodney King verdict, the streets of Los Angeles became a battlefield, the backdrop to four personal intertwined stories.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ulprH2PdL6COSlvxMBdqXhWVGTf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:237723'),
  ('141725120022610101', 'Riot', 2015, 'Action', 'John Lyde, John Lyde', 'Spanky Dustin Ward', 'Matthew Reese, Dolph Lundgren, Danielle Chuchran, Chuck Liddell, Michael Flynn, Renny Grames, Eve Mauro, Melanie Stone', null, 'Copper Jack Stone purposefully orchestrates a bank robbery in order to be thrown into prison with the notorious Russian kingpin Balam. Balam is more than just a mob criminal; he''s a very cunning and dangerous lord who controls the police force from behind bars. Balam lives in prison as a cover for his real power, which is King of the city. His cell is a lavish private room built specifically for him, inaccessible to most in the depths of the prison structure. Even the warden fears venturing into his area of the prison. However, even surrounded by his loyal henchmen and guards in his sectioned off fortress, Balam doesn''t know Jack is coming for him to avenge his family, who Balam murdered in cold blood. Balam is tough... but Jack is tougher.', 'Copper Jack Stone purposefully orchestrates a bank robbery in order to be thrown into prison with the notorious Russian kingpin Balam. Balam is more than just a mob criminal; he''s a very cunning and dangerous lord who controls the police force from behind bars. Balam lives in prison as a cover for his real power, which is King of the city. His cell is a lavish private room built specifically for him, inaccessible to most in the depths of the prison structure. Even the warden fears venturing into his area of the prison. However, even surrounded by his loyal henchmen and guards in his sectioned off fortress, Balam doesn''t know Jack is coming for him to avenge his family, who Balam murdered in cold blood. Balam is tough... but Jack is tougher.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Q2pHzDfJ8QlUA2vx2yAXWJkof7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:360055'),
  ('87565866284484618', 'Riot in a Women''s Prison', 1974, 'Drama', 'Brunello Rondi, Gino Santini', 'Leila Buongiorno, Leslie Daniels', 'Martine Brochard, Marilù Tolo, Erna Schürer, Katia Christine, Cristina Galbó, Isabelle De Valvert, Aliza Adar, Luciana Turina', null, 'This film traces the prison life of a group of women who-rather than being prepared to reenter society-are brought to the limits of depravity. Martine, wrongly imprisoned will bear the scars of a prison system wrongly based on punishment rather than rehabilitation.', 'This film traces the prison life of a group of women who-rather than being prepared to reenter society-are brought to the limits of depravity. Martine, wrongly imprisoned will bear the scars of a prison system wrongly based on punishment rather than rehabilitation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2YH7zIr7NtggGJw9MGgpvi2GolK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:141213'),
  ('1067741697190940120', 'Riot in Cell Block 11', 1954, 'Crime, Drama', 'Don Siegel, Russell Harlan', 'Richard Collins', 'Neville Brand, Emile Meyer, Frank Faylen, Leo Gordon, Robert Osterloh, Paul Frees, Don Keefer, Alvy Moore', null, 'A prisoner leads his counterparts in a protest for better living conditions which turns violent and ugly.', 'A prisoner leads his counterparts in a protest for better living conditions which turns violent and ugly.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Odm3v1TZuH2JogmJhvQYvCD2Gl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28023'),
  ('1077422649024582315', 'Riot: From Rebellion to Redemption', 2026, 'Biography, Documentary, History, News', 'Kevin McLaughlin', 'Kevin McLaughlin', 'Andre Braugher, Cory Booker, Marshall Curry, Ras Baraka, Sharpe James', null, 'This updated documentary has residents, politicians, scholars and first-responders recount the story of Newark, NJ. For over 50 years, people there have lived with the specter of 5 days of unrest that left 26 people dead.', 'This updated documentary has residents, politicians, scholars and first-responders recount the story of Newark, NJ. For over 50 years, people there have lived with the specter of 5 days of unrest that left 26 people dead.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fm.media-amazon.com%2Fimages%2FM%2FMV5BYzI5MjNmOWQtY2RmNy00NTA4LThmMmUtYzY2ZTc4ZjQwMzM2XkEyXkFqcGc%40._V1_.jpg', 'plex:movie:riot-from-rebellion-to-redemption'),
  ('348088691414406507', 'Rip Girls', 2000, 'Drama, Family, Romance, TV Movie', 'Joyce Chopra, David Eggby', 'Jeanne Rosenberg', 'Camilla Belle, Dwier Brown, Stacie Hess, Brian Stark, Jeanne Mori, Lauren Sinclair, Keone Young, Kanoa Chung', 'G', 'A teen-age girl and her father come to an island on Hawaii, they find a closer relationship to each other and think about changing the island. During her adventures, Sydney finds friends, a new hobby with her fantastic photography, and the truth about her mother.', 'A teen-age girl and her father come to an island on Hawaii, they find a closer relationship to each other and think about changing the island. During her adventures, Sydney finds friends, a new hobby with her fantastic photography, and the truth about her mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f4xSVmC6O8UjlfVtupCIGlIMV1S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64269'),
  ('275883192003816828', 'Rip in Time', 2022, 'TV Movie, Drama, Fantasy, Romance', 'Jessica Harmon, William McKnight, Matthew Blecha', 'C. Jay Cox', 'Torrey DeVitto, Niall Matter, Casey Manderson, Eric Keenleyside, Greg Rogers, Françoise Yip, Benjamin Wilkinson, Joshua Black', null, 'Sarah is an organic farmer who meets a man named Rip Van Winkle Jr., who claims to be from 1787. Soon, she discovers old-fashioned romantic feelings that might be just as crazy as his story.', 'Sarah is an organic farmer who meets a man named Rip Van Winkle Jr., who claims to be from 1787. Soon, she discovers old-fashioned romantic feelings that might be just as crazy as his story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fgFpbUPC4YH9TUT0Zbji8pNVYXd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:958612'),
  ('1061516450906779285', 'Rip Tide', 2017, 'Family, Drama', 'Rhiannon Bannenberg', 'Georgia Harrison', 'Debby Ryan, Genevieve Hegney, Andrew Creer, Danielle Carter, Naomi Sequeira, Valerie Bader, Aaron Jeffery, Jeremy Lindsay Taylor', 'NR', 'There comes a point in everyone’s life when you have to make a decision about the direction you’re going to take. For newly-18 American fashion model Cora, that time is now. She’s moved to an Australian coastal town to be with her favourite aunt, after a ''fashion faux pas’ back home.', 'There comes a point in everyone’s life when you have to make a decision about the direction you’re going to take. For newly-18 American fashion model Cora, that time is now. She’s moved to an Australian coastal town to be with her favourite aunt, after a ''fashion faux pas’ back home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zQZJPhjLGxQWdxDlrtgagUa4Fak.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:457262'),
  ('960406104702140693', 'Rip Van Winkle', 1921, 'Fantasy', 'Edward Ludwig', 'Dion Boucicault, Edward Ludwig, Agnes Parsons', 'Thomas Jefferson, Milla Davenport, Daisy Jefferson, Gertrude Messinger, Pietro Sosso, Max Asher, Francis Carpenter, Ted Billings', null, 'The story shows the development of the united state in divergent fields : Political, social and even economic field.', 'The story shows the development of the united state in divergent fields : Political, social and even economic field.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5uFbEJ0Jp2w1nUQTmnZJ2eULPqd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:363746'),
