  ('715789056169953918', 'Rip''s Dream', 1905, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Georges Méliès', 'Georges Méliès', 'Georges Méliès, André Méliès', null, 'The Melies version of the old Rip Van Winkle tale.', 'The Melies version of the old Rip Van Winkle tale.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cVugPVR4TgYoXSwFBzTQXrm4bX0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:196300'),
  ('388727464162817154', 'Ripe', 1996, 'Drama', 'Mo Ogrodnik, Wolfgang Held', 'Mo Ogrodnik', 'Monica Keena, Daisy Eagan, Gordon Currie, Ron Brice, Karen Lynn Gorney, Vincent Laresca, Scott Sowers, Erik Jensen', null, 'When their abusive parents are killed in a car crash, twin sisters Rosie and Violet vow to run away to Kentucky in search of a better life. While on the road, the girls meet up with Pete, a drifter working as a grounds keeper on a derelict army base, who takes them in. While Violet falls for him, Rosie becomes increasingly angry and hostile, and the sisters'' childhood bond is eventually destroyed forever.', 'When their abusive parents are killed in a car crash, twin sisters Rosie and Violet vow to run away to Kentucky in search of a better life. While on the road, the girls meet up with Pete, a drifter working as a grounds keeper on a derelict army base, who takes them in. While Violet falls for him, Rosie becomes increasingly angry and hostile, and the sisters'' childhood bond is eventually destroyed forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xoQmibPIqwIN4cTlohDVNZwAi2y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:124843'),
  ('1130126686944422005', 'Riphagen the Untouchable', 2016, 'Drama, History, Thriller', 'Pieter Kuijpers, Bert Pot, Wouter Severijn', 'Paul Jan Nelissen, Thomas van der Ree', 'Jeroen van Koningsbrugge, Kay Greidanus, Lisa Zweerman, Anna Raadsveld, Antoinette Jelgersma, Sigrid ten Napel, Michel Sluysmans, Sieger Sloot', null, 'Amsterdam, Netherlands, 1944, during World War II. Andries Riphagen, a powerful underworld boss, has made his fortune by putting his many criminal talents at the service of the Nazi occupiers. But the long battle is about to end and the freedom fighters, who have been persecuted and murdered for years, are abandoning their hideouts to mercilessly hunt down those who have collaborated with the killers.', 'Amsterdam, Netherlands, 1944, during World War II. Andries Riphagen, a powerful underworld boss, has made his fortune by putting his many criminal talents at the service of the Nazi occupiers. But the long battle is about to end and the freedom fighters, who have been persecuted and murdered for years, are abandoning their hideouts to mercilessly hunt down those who have collaborated with the killers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u8OWkOvW6p31QsmQ4j32ZphPL24.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:400387'),
  ('126520922997605248', 'Ripley Under Ground', 2005, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Roger Spottiswoode, Paul Sarossy', 'Donald E. Westlake, William Blake Herron', 'Barry Pepper, Jacinda Barrett, Ian Hart, Claire Forlani, Alan Cumming, Tom Wilkinson, François Marthouret, Douglas Henshall', null, 'After his friend, a hot young artist, is killed, a resourceful American man living in London covers up the crime and tries to keep the friend''s name alive in order to exploit his legacy and reap millions in the process.', 'After his friend, a hot young artist, is killed, a resourceful American man living in London covers up the crime and tries to keep the friend''s name alive in order to exploit his legacy and reap millions in the process.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/alNFel4KW4wQepQsFpGHfyW9O7n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39127'),
  ('1138707996541397511', 'Ripley''s Game', 2002, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Liliana Cavani, Alfio Contini, Ludovica Barbieri', 'Liliana Cavani, Charles McKeown', 'John Malkovich, Dougray Scott, Ray Winstone, Lena Headey, Chiara Caselli, Uwe Mansshardt, Hanns Zischler, Paolo Paoloni', 'R', 'Tom Ripley - cool, urbane, wealthy, and murderous - lives in a villa in the Veneto with Luisa, his harpsichord-playing girlfriend. A former business associate from Berlin''s underworld pays a call asking Ripley''s help in killing a rival. Ripley - ever a student of human nature - initiates a game to turn a mild and innocent local picture framer into a hit man. The artisan, Jonathan Trevanny, who''s dying of cancer, has a wife, young son, and little to leave them. If Ripley draws Jonathan into the game, can Ripley maintain control? Does it stop at one killing? What if Ripley develops a conscience?', 'Tom Ripley - cool, urbane, wealthy, and murderous - lives in a villa in the Veneto with Luisa, his harpsichord-playing girlfriend. A former business associate from Berlin''s underworld pays a call asking Ripley''s help in killing a rival. Ripley - ever a student of human nature - initiates a game to turn a mild and innocent local picture framer into a hit man. The artisan, Jonathan Trevanny, who''s dying of cancer, has a wife, young son, and little to leave them. If Ripley draws Jonathan into the game, can Ripley maintain control? Does it stop at one killing? What if Ripley develops a conscience?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eVhycD9GBWPwnttygKYDi9hllAy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10955'),
  ('441082317857019626', 'Ripper Untold', 2021, 'Horror', 'Steve Lawson, Jon O''Neill, Grace Croxall', 'Steve Lawson', 'Jonathan Hansler, Phil Molloy, Dawn Butler, Chris Bell, Sylvia Robson, Barry Shannon, Jacob Anderton, Shady Murphy', null, 'A detective and a medical examiner join forces to solve a series of horrific murders in Victorian London - but one of them harbors a deadly secret.', 'A detective and a medical examiner join forces to solve a series of horrific murders in Victorian London - but one of them harbors a deadly secret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eJ0q6GIac00TvanshEDREQ79mpz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:820511'),
  ('362165995787777448', 'Ripper: Letter from Hell', 2001, 'Horror', 'John Eyres, Thomas M. Harting', 'Pat Bermel', 'A. J. Cook, Bruce Payne, Ryan Northcott, Emmanuelle Vaugier, Claire Keim, Derek Hamilton, Daniella Evangelista, Kelly Brook', null, 'A massacre survivor studies serial killers under a famous expert, but her classmates soon start dying at the hands of a Jack the Ripper copycat.', 'A massacre survivor studies serial killers under a famous expert, but her classmates soon start dying at the hands of a Jack the Ripper copycat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c1aFQpsaPC2nUxHdDKu0YkSq3Sh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28314'),
  ('1054551376351031068', 'Ripper''s Revenge', 2023, 'Thriller, Horror, History', 'Steve Lawson, Jon O''Neill', 'Steve Lawson', 'Chris Bell, Rachel Warren, Ayvianna Snow, Carl Wharton, Vicki Glover, Cassandra French, Marcus Langford, Rafe Bird', null, 'One year on from the notorious Ripper murders, London is terrorised once again by a series of brutal killings. When gruesome letters from the Ripper begin landing on his desk, an innocent reporter finds himself drawn into a deadly mystery, threatening the lives of everyone around him.', 'One year on from the notorious Ripper murders, London is terrorised once again by a series of brutal killings. When gruesome letters from the Ripper begin landing on his desk, an innocent reporter finds himself drawn into a deadly mystery, threatening the lives of everyone around him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cuEIBHTWAvaYkhhS8HfOkhce2MB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1105014'),
  ('340660802418938624', 'Ripples', 2023, 'Drama', 'Naoko Ogigami, Hideo Yamamoto', 'Naoko Ogigami', 'Mariko Tsutsui, Ken Mitsuishi, Hayato Isomura, Tamae Ando, Noriko Eguchi, Kami Hiraiwa, Akira Emoto, Hana Kino', null, 'Yoriko Sudo believes in a new religious group Midoriinochikai, that worships water. She lives peacefully, devoting herself to the group daily.', 'Yoriko Sudo believes in a new religious group Midoriinochikai, that worships water. She lives peacefully, devoting herself to the group daily.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4IACLLtynQafw0MohoAiurIYtyH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1062910'),
  ('721572833644615308', 'Ripples of Life', 2023, 'Drama', 'Wei Shujun, Li Xingbo', 'Kang Chunlei, Wei Shujun', 'Huang Miyi, Yang Pingdao, Yang Zishan, Kang Chunlei, Liu Yang, Wang Jiajia, Liang Ming, Jin Yang', null, 'Follows a big star who brings a film crew to her remote hometown for a shoot, and while the production is afflicted by disagreements between the crew, a bored local restaurant owner finds excitement to be the stand-in for the star.', 'Follows a big star who brings a film crew to her remote hometown for a shoot, and while the production is afflicted by disagreements between the crew, a bored local restaurant owner finds excitement to be the stand-in for the star.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yy6LOszNZ3ehIbmppZ4TKHzMyew.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:838167'),
  ('825484523297311970', 'Rippy', 2024, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Ryan Coonan, Chris Bland, Travis Akbar', 'Richard Barcaricchio, Ryan Coonan', 'Michael Biehn, Tess Haubrich, Aaron Pedersen, Angie Milliken, Mungo McKay, Nancy Rizk, Don Bridges, Molly Belle Wright', 'R', 'Young police officer Maddy is determined to live up to her deceased father''s legacy. Her courage is put to the test when locals are found brutally ripped to shreds by the zombie kangaroo. As the undead beast leaves a trail of carnage, Maddy, with the help of her eccentric Uncle Schmitty and resilient Aunt Donna, must embark on a high-stakes battle to save the town.', 'Young police officer Maddy is determined to live up to her deceased father''s legacy. Her courage is put to the test when locals are found brutally ripped to shreds by the zombie kangaroo. As the undead beast leaves a trail of carnage, Maddy, with the help of her eccentric Uncle Schmitty and resilient Aunt Donna, must embark on a high-stakes battle to save the town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cZ5U4Ae74g29E02JR5oR98RQhiR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1249532'),
  ('826430812228726789', 'Riprendimi', 2008, 'Comedy', 'Anna Negri, Gian Enrico Bianchi', 'Giovanna Mori, Anna Negri', 'Alba Rohrwacher, Marco Foschi, Valentina Lodovini, Stefano Fresi, Alessandro Averone, Marina Rocco, Cristina Odasso, Francesca Cutolo', null, 'The marriage of an actor and a freelance film editor breaks up unexpectedly in front of two filmmakers'' camera.', 'The marriage of an actor and a freelance film editor breaks up unexpectedly in front of two filmmakers'' camera.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Ps0JmM8qHOoibOlqrbTvlx9pJA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100527'),
  ('65556831620281204', 'Rise', 2022, 'Drama', 'Kabelo Thathe, Akin Omotoso', 'Arash Amel', 'Uche Agada, Dayo Okeniyi, Yetide Badaki, Ral Agada, Jaden Osimuwa, Elijah Sholanke, Taylor Nichols, Panos Koronis', 'PG', 'After emigrating to Greece from Nigeria, Vera and Charles Antetokounmpo struggled to survive and provide for their five children, while living under the daily threat of deportation. Desperate to obtain Greek citizenship but undermined by a system that blocked them at every turn, the family''s vision, determination and faith lifted them out of obscurity to launch the careers of three NBA champions.', 'After emigrating to Greece from Nigeria, Vera and Charles Antetokounmpo struggled to survive and provide for their five children, while living under the daily threat of deportation. Desperate to obtain Greek citizenship but undermined by a system that blocked them at every turn, the family''s vision, determination and faith lifted them out of obscurity to launch the careers of three NBA champions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/slkVQhehnP3h40y7mfbYDfv8sWB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:759054'),
  ('864502742541564801', 'Rise and Fall of a Small Film Company', 1986, 'TV Movie, Drama', 'Jean-Luc Godard, Marie-Christine Barrière, Reynald Calcagni', 'Jean-Luc Godard', 'Jean-Pierre Mocky, Marie Valera, Jean-Pierre Léaud, Caroline Champetier, Anne Carrel, Françoise Desprote, Jean-Pierre Delamour, Jacques Pena', null, 'Director Gaspard Bazin is working on a new feature film. For now, he''s still looking at the fundraising and casting stage of the process. He calls upon Jean Almereyda, a once-fashionable producer who is now going through a bad patch, finding it increasingly difficult to raise the capital he needs for his ventures. His wife Eurydice dreams of being a movie star. A perverse game between the two men ensues, with Almereyda wanting to please his wife, but reluctant to demand a role for Eurydice because of Bazin''s reputation as an incorrigible seducer.', 'Director Gaspard Bazin is working on a new feature film. For now, he''s still looking at the fundraising and casting stage of the process. He calls upon Jean Almereyda, a once-fashionable producer who is now going through a bad patch, finding it increasingly difficult to raise the capital he needs for his ventures. His wife Eurydice dreams of being a movie star. A perverse game between the two men ensues, with Almereyda wanting to please his wife, but reluctant to demand a role for Eurydice because of Bazin''s reputation as an incorrigible seducer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3CmVcJhPYWcJCue3fs38SaiFyoi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:271799'),
  ('689432875387689579', 'Rise of the Conqueror', 2026, 'History, Action, Adventure, War', 'Jacob Schwarz', 'Matthew Greene', 'Christian Mortensen, Mahesh Jadu, Yulduz Rajabova, Joshua Jo, Sanzhar Madi, Arazou Baker, Paul Marlon, Dulguun Odkhuu', 'NR', 'In the 14th-century, as the Silk Road crumbles and rival factions tear the land apart, fearless warrior Timur emerges from exile. Stripped of everything, he fights to unite the fractured kingdoms, using strategy and sheer will to carve an empire from chaos. Undefeated in battle and widely regarded as one of history’s greatest military leaders and tacticians, not to mention one of its most brutal, Timur would found the Timurid Empire, which ruled over modern-day Afghanistan, Iran and Central Asia.', 'In the 14th-century, as the Silk Road crumbles and rival factions tear the land apart, fearless warrior Timur emerges from exile. Stripped of everything, he fights to unite the fractured kingdoms, using strategy and sheer will to carve an empire from chaos. Undefeated in battle and widely regarded as one of history’s greatest military leaders and tacticians, not to mention one of its most brutal, Timur would found the Timurid Empire, which ruled over modern-day Afghanistan, Iran and Central Asia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9cRE0DsM6CNIiY9Ah3cd8oc3n1Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1207162'),
  ('860781456400725973', 'Rise of the Footsoldier', 2007, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Julian Gilbey, Scott Bates, Ali Asad', 'Julian Gilbey, Will Gilbey', 'Ricci Harnett, Terry Stone, Craig Fairbrass, Roland Manookian, Coralie Rose, Neil Maskell, Billy Murray, Ian Virgo', 'R', 'Rise of the Footsoldier follows the inexorable rise of Carlton Leach from one of the most feared generals of the football terraces to becoming a member of a notorious gang of criminals who rampaged their way through London and Essex in the late eighties and early nineties.', 'Rise of the Footsoldier follows the inexorable rise of Carlton Leach from one of the most feared generals of the football terraces to becoming a member of a notorious gang of criminals who rampaged their way through London and Essex in the late eighties and early nineties.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k8lbsM0Nl0c1Qp7NnARWjS6TTRA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13054'),
  ('506358698723440496', 'Rise of the Footsoldier: Ibiza', null, 'Action, Crime', 'Nick Nevern', 'Nick Nevern, Andrew Loveday', 'Craig Fairbrass, Tamer Hassan, Andrew Loveday, Jamie Foreman, Nick Nevern, Leo Gregory, Byron Gibson', null, 'TATE heads to Ibiza track down the villains responsible for a friend’s murder.', 'TATE heads to Ibiza track down the villains responsible for a friend’s murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c7uKqCPe3Boi0w2YRqdh5dohN5j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1383750'),
  ('1006125543767917932', 'Rise of the Footsoldier: Origins', 2021, 'Crime, Drama, Action', 'Nick Nevern', 'Andrew Loveday', 'Terry Stone, Vinnie Jones, Roland Manookian, George Russo, Craig Fairbrass, Keith Allen, P.H. Moriarty, Billy Murray', null, 'A brutal account of how real-life, hard-as-nails Falklands War veteran Tony Tucker came to be involved in one of the most notorious gangland murders in British history.', 'A brutal account of how real-life, hard-as-nails Falklands War veteran Tony Tucker came to be involved in one of the most notorious gangland murders in British history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gHgr6BIYFXhwyjBugQRiNw2h19h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:854732'),
  ('1093092531559865684', 'Rise of the Footsoldier: Vengeance', 2023, 'Action, Drama, Thriller', 'Nick Nevern, James Butler', 'Andrew Loveday, Jason Maza', 'Craig Fairbrass, Phil Davis, Geoff Bell, Jamie Foreman, Stephen McCole, Anthony Skordi, Emily Wyatt, Josh Myers', null, 'Pat Tate embarks on a rampage to avenge his loyal and trusted footsoldier''s violent death, venturing beyond his comfort zone of Essex into the dark side of 90s Soho to track down the villain responsible. Set to execute his revenge, Tate will stop at nothing even as the world around him starts to explode.', 'Pat Tate embarks on a rampage to avenge his loyal and trusted footsoldier''s violent death, venturing beyond his comfort zone of Essex into the dark side of 90s Soho to track down the villain responsible. Set to execute his revenge, Tate will stop at nothing even as the world around him starts to explode.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ejQVG3vDAT1V2oCEpH6Ujz8uE8q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1034065'),
  ('574031536400405471', 'Rise of the Gargoyles', 2009, 'Horror, Action, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Bill Corcoran, Pierre Jodoin', 'Andy Briggs, Steve Horvath', 'Eric Balfour, Caroline Néron, Justin Salinger, Ifan Huw Dafydd, Nick Mancuso, Tanya Clarke, Alexandra Buza, Constantin Bărbulescu', 'PG-13', 'Workers involuntarily release a gargoyle that proceeds to behead those who took her eggs (and some who didn''t!).', 'Workers involuntarily release a gargoyle that proceeds to behead those who took her eggs (and some who didn''t!).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/36W2GCXwbJZJIkGig5TbmxGi3e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24921'),
  ('1042057388898030173', 'Rise of the Guardians', 2012, 'Animation, Family, Fantasy, Action, Adventure', 'Peter Ramsey, Alena Bejenarou, Stephen Candell', 'David Lindsay-Abaire', 'Chris Pine, Alec Baldwin, Jude Law, Isla Fisher, Hugh Jackman, Dakota Goyo, Isabella Blake-Thomas, Jacob Bertrand', 'PG', 'When an evil spirit known as Pitch lays down the gauntlet to take over the world, the immortal Guardians must join forces for the first time to protect the hopes, beliefs and imagination of children all over the world.', 'When an evil spirit known as Pitch lays down the gauntlet to take over the world, the immortal Guardians must join forces for the first time to protect the hopes, beliefs and imagination of children all over the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yfzmfWGjcmyugH6FZ13WcsUGiNj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81188'),
  ('1010391283596736966', 'Rise of the Legend', 2014, 'Drama, Action', 'Roy Chow Hin-Yeung, Ng Man-Ching', 'Christine To Chi-Long', 'Eddie Peng Yu-Yan, AngelaBaby, Sammo Hung Kam-Bo, Tony Leung Ka-fai, Jing Boran, Wong Cho-Lam, Max Zhang, Feng Jiayi', null, 'In 1868 during the late Qing Dynasty, rampant corruption on the Imperial Court inflicts much suffering in people''s lives. For years, the Black Tiger’s fearsome boss Lei Gong has been trying to get rid of the leader of the Northern Sea. One of his latest recruits is Fei, a fearless fighter who takes the Northern Sea leader’s head after a fierce fight. Just as Lei Gong believes he has total control of the port, a new gang called the Orphans rises in power. Led by Fei’s childhood friend Huo, the Orphans are out to eliminate all the criminal power from the port…', 'In 1868 during the late Qing Dynasty, rampant corruption on the Imperial Court inflicts much suffering in people''s lives. For years, the Black Tiger’s fearsome boss Lei Gong has been trying to get rid of the leader of the Northern Sea. One of his latest recruits is Fei, a fearless fighter who takes the Northern Sea leader’s head after a fierce fight. Just as Lei Gong believes he has total control of the port, a new gang called the Orphans rises in power. Led by Fei’s childhood friend Huo, the Orphans are out to eliminate all the criminal power from the port…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rQLhQytqw27NHUlmrArOIs4yQl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:294993'),
  ('239870620178539272', 'Rise of the Machine Girls', 2019, 'Action, Horror, Science Fiction, Comedy', 'Tsuyoshi Kazuno, Hiroshi Ota, Yuki Kobayashi', 'Yuki Kobayashi', 'Yamada Himina, Kanon Hanakage, Tak Sakaguchi, Rie Kitahara, Toshie Negishi, Kokone Sasaki, Taro Yabe, Ryûju Sumikawa', null, 'Living in the lawless Ishinari District in a future Japan, sisters Ami (Hina Nagimiya) and Yoshie (Hanakage Kanon) who sold their bodies to help their parents, try to earn a living performing as an idol group in the area. When their performance causes stranger Matsukata (Tak Sakaguchi) a notorious hitman, to notice their condition, the three realize their worth to each other in the fight against Aoyama Dharma (Kimono Negishi), the female boss of a notorious organ harvesting ring in the area. Realizing that even their skills are no match for her army of goons and henchmen, the two are outfitted with special homemade weaponry to their bodies and become the ultimate killers.', 'Living in the lawless Ishinari District in a future Japan, sisters Ami (Hina Nagimiya) and Yoshie (Hanakage Kanon) who sold their bodies to help their parents, try to earn a living performing as an idol group in the area. When their performance causes stranger Matsukata (Tak Sakaguchi) a notorious hitman, to notice their condition, the three realize their worth to each other in the fight against Aoyama Dharma (Kimono Negishi), the female boss of a notorious organ harvesting ring in the area. Realizing that even their skills are no match for her army of goons and henchmen, the two are outfitted with special homemade weaponry to their bodies and become the ultimate killers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nxp70IYpQGxfnOR8z8wLIFJIcb3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:610074'),
  ('368826949242056630', 'Rise of the Mummy', 2021, 'Fantasy, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Jack Peter Mundy, Antonia Johnstone', 'Shannon Holiday', 'Abi Casson Thompson, Arthur Boan, Amanda-Jade Tyler, Stephanie Lodge, Megan Purvis, Mya Brown, Barbara Dabson, Antonia Johnstone', null, 'A group of archaeology students awaken an ancient mummy. After being trapped in a time loop, the only way they can escape, is to defeat the mummy. As the body count rises, it seems the Mummy has to collect the souls of those who woke him to be able to walk the earth - for good.', 'A group of archaeology students awaken an ancient mummy. After being trapped in a time loop, the only way they can escape, is to defeat the mummy. As the body count rises, it seems the Mummy has to collect the souls of those who woke him to be able to walk the earth - for good.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qahz9340FEDIo4FsNK3aFwzcw9C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:791910'),
  ('951675406224391138', 'Rise of the Planet of the Apes', 2011, 'Thriller, Action, Drama, Science Fiction', 'Rupert Wyatt, Andrew Lesnie, Taylor Carrasco', 'Amanda Silver, Rick Jaffa', 'Andy Serkis, James Franco, Freida Pinto, John Lithgow, Brian Cox, Tom Felton, Tyler Labine, Karin Konoval', 'PG-13', 'A highly intelligent chimpanzee named Caesar has been living a peaceful suburban life ever since he was born. But when he gets taken to a cruel primate facility, Caesar decides to revolt against those who have harmed him.', 'A highly intelligent chimpanzee named Caesar has been living a peaceful suburban life ever since he was born. But when he gets taken to a cruel primate facility, Caesar decides to revolt against those who have harmed him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oqA45qMyyo1TtrnVEBKxqmTPhbN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61791'),
  ('1122803135075626528', 'Rise of the Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles: The Movie', 2022, 'Animation, Action, Science Fiction, Comedy', 'Andy Suriano, Thomas Barkel, Ant Ward', 'Rebecca May, Tony Gama-Lobo', 'Ben Schwartz, Omar Benson Miller, Brandon Mychal Smith, Josh Brener, Haley Joel Osment, Eric Bauza, Kat Graham, Jim Pirri', 'PG', 'When a mysterious stranger arrives from the future with a dire warning, Leo is forced to rise and lead his brothers, Raph, Donnie, and Mikey in a fight to save the world from a terrifying alien species.', 'When a mysterious stranger arrives from the future with a dire warning, Leo is forced to rise and lead his brothers, Raph, Donnie, and Mikey in a fight to save the world from a terrifying alien species.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rSmTqtb7gICeRwvsEmq0uJxR4XU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:765172'),
  ('332459152876694872', 'Rise of the Zombie', 2013, 'Thriller, Horror, Drama', 'Devaki Singh, Luke Kenny', null, 'Benjamin Gilani, Luke Kenny, Kirti Kulhari, Ashwin Mushran, Prem Thapa', null, 'Neil Parker is a passionate wildlife photographer who pays more attention to his wildlife than his human life. as a result his relationships with the real world suffer. When his girlfriend walks out on him he resigns himself to isolation and nature. But a chance occurrence changes all that. Changes that he can''t seem to handle, changes that seem to take his humanity away... changes that seem unable to change back? The story follow his journey into a darkness that has to be seen to be believed. A monster that seems to be rising out of the depths of desolation and agony... soulless, depraved and out of control.', 'Neil Parker is a passionate wildlife photographer who pays more attention to his wildlife than his human life. as a result his relationships with the real world suffer. When his girlfriend walks out on him he resigns himself to isolation and nature. But a chance occurrence changes all that. Changes that he can''t seem to handle, changes that seem to take his humanity away... changes that seem unable to change back? The story follow his journey into a darkness that has to be seen to be believed. A monster that seems to be rising out of the depths of desolation and agony... soulless, depraved and out of control.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A6xx4IqOquGnUYqI61yvgR4irLP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:192736'),
  ('1106824170362703955', 'Rise of the Zombies', 2012, 'Action, Horror, Thriller', 'Nick Lyon, Alexander Yellen', 'Keith Allan, Delondra Williams', 'Mariel Hemingway, LeVar Burton, Ethan Suplee, Chad Lindberg, Heather Hemmens, Danny Trejo, Madonna Young Magee, Hector Luis Bustamante', null, 'When zombies overrun San Francisco, a desperate group survives by locking themselves inside Alcatraz Prison. When the undead breach the island, our heroes are forced to return to the mainland overrun with the undead.', 'When zombies overrun San Francisco, a desperate group survives by locking themselves inside Alcatraz Prison. When the undead breach the island, our heroes are forced to return to the mainland overrun with the undead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aGyeGL033oG4eVaf0CiXNqdUTbH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:140174'),
  ('190560822975349531', 'Rise: Blood Hunter', 2007, 'Action, Adventure, Horror, Thriller', 'Sebastian Gutierrez, John Toll, Philip Lee', 'Sebastian Gutierrez', 'Carla Gugino, Michael Chiklis, Samaire Armstrong, Lucy Liu, James D''Arcy, Marilyn Manson, Robert Forster, Cameron Richardson', 'R', 'A reporter on the trail of a sinister cult wakes up in a morgue to find herself a member of the undead. She goes on a personal vendetta against a group a cultists who are responsible for her death.', 'A reporter on the trail of a sinister cult wakes up in a morgue to find herself a member of the undead. She goes on a personal vendetta against a group a cultists who are responsible for her death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h4QNqFITPXjRrWGELtbifg34T1V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1872'),
  ('547885649542477722', 'Risen', 2016, 'Action, Adventure, Drama, History, Mystery', 'Kevin Reynolds, Lorenzo Senatore', 'Kevin Reynolds, Paul Aiello', 'Joseph Fiennes, Peter Firth, Cliff Curtis, Tom Felton, Mark Killeen, María Botto, Mish Boyko, Selva Rasalingam', 'PG-13', 'Clavius, a powerful Roman military tribune, and his aide, Lucius, are tasked with solving the mystery of what happened to Jesus in the weeks following the crucifixion, in order to disprove the rumors of a risen Messiah and prevent an uprising in Jerusalem.', 'Clavius, a powerful Roman military tribune, and his aide, Lucius, are tasked with solving the mystery of what happened to Jesus in the weeks following the crucifixion, in order to disprove the rumors of a risen Messiah and prevent an uprising in Jerusalem.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6hGh4z503k8wA8mLlmvwhTSGja.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:335778'),
  ('534613452016335913', 'Risen', 2021, 'Science Fiction, Drama, Thriller', 'Eddie Arya', 'Eddie Arya', 'Nicole Schalmo, Jack Campbell, Caroline McQuade, Kenneth Trujillo, Buffy Anne Littaua, Nicole Sharrock, Melissa Brattoni, Anthony Moisset', null, 'Disaster unfolds when a meteor strikes a small town, turning the environment uninhabitable and killing everything in the surrounding area. Exobiologist Lauren Stone is called to find answers to the unearthly event. As she begins to uncover the truth, imminent danger awakens and it becomes a race against time to save mankind.', 'Disaster unfolds when a meteor strikes a small town, turning the environment uninhabitable and killing everything in the surrounding area. Exobiologist Lauren Stone is called to find answers to the unearthly event. As she begins to uncover the truth, imminent danger awakens and it becomes a race against time to save mankind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hSmJrx26NLttonxQmO3hvjHa1gF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:850099'),
  ('140987838814386937', 'Rishtey', 2002, 'Action, Drama', 'Indra Kumar', 'Rajeev Kaul, Praful Parekh', 'Anil Kapoor, Karisma Kapoor, Shilpa Shetty Kundra, Amrish Puri, Sadashiv Amrapurkar, Alok Nath, Jagdeep, Sharat Saxena', null, 'Suraj Singh is a wrestler by profession and has the misfortune of falling in love with wealthy Yashpaul Chaudhary''s daughter Komal. When Yashpaul learns of there relationship he arrogantly disagrees of his daughter''s choice but Komal refuses to accept her dad''s word and gets married to Suraj without the blessings of Yashpaul. Aggravated by his daughter''s act Yashpaul connote some negative scenes which spoil Suraj''s character in the eyes of Komal resulting in the couple''s separation. Before separation, Komal has given birth to a baby boy, which Yashpaul had wanted to kill but Suraj escapes with the child and single-handily brings him up in a poor environment. Years later Komal will return and demand that her child is handed over to her even if having to appeal to the judicial system.', 'Suraj Singh is a wrestler by profession and has the misfortune of falling in love with wealthy Yashpaul Chaudhary''s daughter Komal. When Yashpaul learns of there relationship he arrogantly disagrees of his daughter''s choice but Komal refuses to accept her dad''s word and gets married to Suraj without the blessings of Yashpaul. Aggravated by his daughter''s act Yashpaul connote some negative scenes which spoil Suraj''s character in the eyes of Komal resulting in the couple''s separation. Before separation, Komal has given birth to a baby boy, which Yashpaul had wanted to kill but Suraj escapes with the child and single-handily brings him up in a poor environment. Years later Komal will return and demand that her child is handed over to her even if having to appeal to the judicial system.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Apm7IbwR26Q1kl1yUckPPmAZEUZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:215322'),
  ('215917598858848326', 'Rising Damp', 1980, 'Comedy', 'Joseph McGrath, Roger Simons', 'Eric Chappell', 'Leonard Rossiter, Frances de la Tour, Don Warrington, Christopher Strauli, Denholm Elliott, Carrie Jones, Glynn Edwards, John Cater', null, 'Stingy landlord Rigsby manages to scam his lodgers John, an art student, and Philip, an African medical student, making both pay for a room they must share. However Rigsby''s favorite lodger, Miss Jones, flirts with Philip rather than him, despite his pitiful attempts at seduction.', 'Stingy landlord Rigsby manages to scam his lodgers John, an art student, and Philip, an African medical student, making both pay for a room they must share. However Rigsby''s favorite lodger, Miss Jones, flirts with Philip rather than him, despite his pitiful attempts at seduction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dCH1IMoIFhKw8Ud0WnLu2k5e1Lr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24577'),
  ('48342997806939934', 'Rising High', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Cüneyt Kaya, Sebastian Bäumler', 'Cüneyt Kaya', 'David Kross, Frederick Lau, Janina Uhse, Anne Schäfer, Robert Schupp, Silvina Buchbauer, Sophia Thomalla, Uwe Preuss', null, 'Charting the rise and fall of three corrupt real estate agents who accumulate absurd wealth in no time but fall into a vortex of fraud, greed and drugs.', 'Charting the rise and fall of three corrupt real estate agents who accumulate absurd wealth in no time but fall into a vortex of fraud, greed and drugs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6r83qslpsERzHzCroFSp6X4eUse.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:658751'),
  ('282428179920043205', 'Rising Phoenix', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Ian Bonhôte, Peter Ettedgui, Will Pugh', null, 'Bebe Vio, Tatyana McFadden, Jonnie Peacock, Jean-Babtiste Alaize, Prince Harry, Duke of Sussex, Ellie Cole, Eva Loeffler, Cui Zhe', 'PG-13', 'Elite athletes and insiders reflect on the Paralympic Games and examine how they impact a global understanding of disability, diversity and excellence.', 'Elite athletes and insiders reflect on the Paralympic Games and examine how they impact a global understanding of disability, diversity and excellence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oso09gID2bFk9q3Cni8GNOuzTWZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:726887'),
  ('584202120526246875', 'Rising Sun', 1993, 'Action, Drama, Thriller', 'Michael Chapman, Philip Kaufman, Frank Davis', 'Michael Crichton, Michael Backes, Philip Kaufman', 'Sean Connery, Wesley Snipes, Tia Carrere, Cary-Hiroyuki Tagawa, Harvey Keitel, Mako, Stan Egi, Kevin Anderson', 'R', 'When a prostitute is found dead in a Los Angeles skyscraper occupied by a large Japanese corporation, detectives John Connor and Web Smith are called in to investigate. Although Connor has previous experience working in Japan, cultural differences make their progress difficult until a security disc showing the murder turns up. Close scrutiny proves the disc has been doctored, and the detectives realize they''re dealing with a cover-up as well.', 'When a prostitute is found dead in a Los Angeles skyscraper occupied by a large Japanese corporation, detectives John Connor and Web Smith are called in to investigate. Although Connor has previous experience working in Japan, cultural differences make their progress difficult until a security disc showing the murder turns up. Close scrutiny proves the disc has been doctored, and the detectives realize they''re dealing with a cover-up as well.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jVWEeZ383peKxwE284AdyHqq6GH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:7007'),
  ('171787311037687340', 'Risk', 2007, 'Action', 'Vishram Sawant', null, 'Randeep Hooda, Tanushree Dutta, Vinod Khanna, Yashpal Sharma, Zakir Hussain, Anant Jog, Seema Biswas, Ganesh Yadav', null, '"Ek crore meh laitha hai RISK!". Risk! is a movie about a police inspector named Suryakanth who vows to clean up the Mumbai underworld. The police have been trying for 11 years to arrest the biggest don of the underworld, Khalid Bin Jamal. But Khalid isn''t in Mumbai. He is living in Bangkok, free from the Mumbai police. Suryakanth starts killing Khalid''s men in Mumbai. This alarms Khalid and he entraps Suryakanth in a bad scheme. How much risk is Suryakanth willing to take in order to catch Khalid? Watch Risk! and find out.', '"Ek crore meh laitha hai RISK!". Risk! is a movie about a police inspector named Suryakanth who vows to clean up the Mumbai underworld. The police have been trying for 11 years to arrest the biggest don of the underworld, Khalid Bin Jamal. But Khalid isn''t in Mumbai. He is living in Bangkok, free from the Mumbai police. Suryakanth starts killing Khalid''s men in Mumbai. This alarms Khalid and he entraps Suryakanth in a bad scheme. How much risk is Suryakanth willing to take in order to catch Khalid? Watch Risk! and find out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t7XR3iEokWFbpgTf4CR7fc66HXC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59364'),
  ('1074640499123387034', 'Risk', 2017, 'Documentary, Crime', 'Laura Poitras, Laura Poitras, Katy Scoggin', null, 'Julian Assange, Sarah Harrison, Jacob Appelbaum, Joseph Farrell, Renata Avila, Jennifer Robinson, Erinn Clark, Laura Poitras', 'NR', 'Capturing the story of WikiLeaks founder Julian Assange with unprecedented access, director Laura Poitras finds herself caught between the motives and contradictions of Assange and his inner circle in a documentary portrait of power, betrayal, truth and sacrifice.', 'Capturing the story of WikiLeaks founder Julian Assange with unprecedented access, director Laura Poitras finds herself caught between the motives and contradictions of Assange and his inner circle in a documentary portrait of power, betrayal, truth and sacrifice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rxrkcyNNughClOL8j8qwNgY9xI5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:393561'),
  ('1072165361258219935', 'Risks + Side Effects', 2021, 'Comedy', 'Wolfgang Thaler, Michael Kreihsl', 'Michael Kreihsl', 'Samuel Finzi, Inka Friedrich, Thomas Mraz, Pia Hierzegger, Michaela Kis, Tijan Marei, Thomas Schubert, August Zirner', null, 'A routine check-up reveals that the Pilates trainer Kathrin is suffering from kidney disease and needs a transplant. Her husband Arnold is a successful architect in the middle of a large project and is afraid of donating one of his kidneys. Götz, a friend of the couple''s, would undergo the operation immediately if it means saving Kathrin''s life - even though this causes problems with his partner Diana. Confronted by issues of life and death, the fragility of the relationships within and between the couples is laid bare. Eventually, the question can no longer be avoided: what is true love?', 'A routine check-up reveals that the Pilates trainer Kathrin is suffering from kidney disease and needs a transplant. Her husband Arnold is a successful architect in the middle of a large project and is afraid of donating one of his kidneys. Götz, a friend of the couple''s, would undergo the operation immediately if it means saving Kathrin''s life - even though this causes problems with his partner Diana. Confronted by issues of life and death, the fragility of the relationships within and between the couples is laid bare. Eventually, the question can no longer be avoided: what is true love?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ojIbP5UPgUCJ7bUO0sjjP81WayO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:801968'),
  ('359116106478228380', 'Risky Business', 1967, 'Drama', 'André Cayatte, Christian Matras', 'André Cayatte', 'Jacques Brel, Emmanuelle Riva, René Dary, Nadine Alari, Christine Fabréga, Gabriel Gobin, Muriel Baptiste, Christine Simon', null, 'A teenage girl accuses her primary schoolteacher, Jean Doucet (Jacques Brel), of trying to rape her. The police and the mayor investigate, but Doucet denies the charges. Two other students come forward to reveal more of Doucet''s misconduct – one confessing to be his mistress. Doucet faces trial and hard labor if convicted.', 'A teenage girl accuses her primary schoolteacher, Jean Doucet (Jacques Brel), of trying to rape her. The police and the mayor investigate, but Doucet denies the charges. Two other students come forward to reveal more of Doucet''s misconduct – one confessing to be his mistress. Doucet faces trial and hard labor if convicted.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xCt8O9Vcy4gkwBxR0XedcqynroN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4410'),
  ('1143107391951797117', 'Risky Business', 1983, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Bruce Surtees, Paul Brickman, Jerry Grandey', 'Paul Brickman', 'Tom Cruise, Rebecca De Mornay, Joe Pantoliano, Richard Masur, Bronson Pinchot, Curtis Armstrong, Nicholas Pryor, Janet Carroll', 'R', 'Meet Joel Goodson, an industrious, college-bound 17-year-old and a responsible, trustworthy son. However, when his parents go away and leave him home alone in the wealthy Chicago suburbs with the Porsche at his disposal he quickly decides he has been good for too long and it is time to enjoy himself. After an unfortunate incident with the Porsche Joel must raise some cash, in a risky way.', 'Meet Joel Goodson, an industrious, college-bound 17-year-old and a responsible, trustworthy son. However, when his parents go away and leave him home alone in the wealthy Chicago suburbs with the Porsche at his disposal he quickly decides he has been good for too long and it is time to enjoy himself. After an unfortunate incident with the Porsche Joel must raise some cash, in a risky way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/82KOHShH9raGhkcAN3TztVjqjj3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9346'),
  ('353278495765116913', 'Risqué', 2025, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Tony Dean Smith, Ivan Vatsov, Fern Champion', 'Gary Preisler, Noah Blake', 'Leah Gibson, Eloise Lovell Anderson, Silvia Orduna, Rex Adams, Julia Strowski, David Thomas Newman, Alexsandria Ralev', 'R', 'Fired from a strip club, a vengeful dancer masterminds a high-stakes heist with fellow strippers to take down the corrupt boss and the men who underestimate them.', 'Fired from a strip club, a vengeful dancer masterminds a high-stakes heist with fellow strippers to take down the corrupt boss and the men who underestimate them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h6OsRrDwbspLnKMvlFl57QFDP7d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1512623'),
  ('969527684665741186', 'Rita', 2024, 'Drama', 'Paz Vega, Eva Díaz, Sandra Rodríguez', 'Paz Vega', 'Sofía Allepuz, Alejandro Escamilla, Paz Vega, Roberto Álamo, Paz de Alarcón, Amada Santos, Daniel Navarro, Cindy Fuentes', null, 'Set in 1984 during the UEFA Euro craze, 7-year-old Rita wants to go to the beach. Unfortunately, her father makes watching the match his priority, and what her father says goes. For the first time in her life, Rita sees and realises that her home is not safe, especially for her mother.', 'Set in 1984 during the UEFA Euro craze, 7-year-old Rita wants to go to the beach. Unfortunately, her father makes watching the match his priority, and what her father says goes. For the first time in her life, Rita sees and realises that her home is not safe, especially for her mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mYB8UM4Bc4XRPsGEL7PfynMPy8w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1141126'),
  ('828959099158498346', 'RITA', 2026, 'Documentary', 'Tomás Teixeira da Fonseca, Tomás Teixeira da Fonseca', null, 'Rita Azinheira, Sebastião Oliveira, Susana Azinheira', null, 'RITA portrays the journey of a young artistic roller skating athlete shortly after becoming world champion, focusing less on victory and more on the work, discipline and family structure that sustain high-performance sport.', 'RITA portrays the journey of a young artistic roller skating athlete shortly after becoming world champion, focusing less on victory and more on the work, discipline and family structure that sustain high-performance sport.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bajFPp8M05fqmvDb7BsY3fHG906.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1621393'),
  ('691856697647339725', 'Rita Cadillac: The Lady of the People', 2010, 'Documentary', 'Toni Venturi', 'Daniel Chaia, Toni Venturi', 'Rita Cadillac, Luís Andrade, Héctor Babenco, Leleco Barbosa, Djalma Limongi Batista', null, 'This revealing documentary about the Brazilian sex symbol goes deep into her career as she pivoted from dancer to singer to adult film star.', 'This revealing documentary about the Brazilian sex symbol goes deep into her career as she pivoted from dancer to singer to adult film star.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j1ISOw8N2qUd67URblHiwtAEKpE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:241993'),
  ('651030567004656219', 'Rita Lee: Mania de Você', 2025, 'Documentary', 'Guido Goldberg, Matías Nicolás', 'Guido Goldberg, Julián Troksberg, Iair Kon', 'Rita Lee, Roberto de Carvalho, Hebe Camargo, Moogie Canazio, Luis Sérgio Carlini, Walter Casagrande Júnior, André Faccioli, Alexandre Fontanetti', null, 'Just before her departure, Rita Lee writes a farewell letter to her three children and her husband and musical partner, Roberto de Carvalho, in which she reflects on her life and joyfully celebrates her family. Her final moments also mark the time to look back and review a career full of unforgettable successes, which led her to sell more than 55 million records. But it is also a time to reveal her downfalls, her vulnerable side, and her excesses as the queen of rock. With completely unseen personal archives and exclusive testimonies from her own family, as well as producers, journalists, musicians, and celebrities such as Gilberto Gil and Ney Matogrosso, "Rita Lee: Mania de Você" presents her definitive legacy.', 'Just before her departure, Rita Lee writes a farewell letter to her three children and her husband and musical partner, Roberto de Carvalho, in which she reflects on her life and joyfully celebrates her family. Her final moments also mark the time to look back and review a career full of unforgettable successes, which led her to sell more than 55 million records. But it is also a time to reveal her downfalls, her vulnerable side, and her excesses as the queen of rock. With completely unseen personal archives and exclusive testimonies from her own family, as well as producers, journalists, musicians, and celebrities such as Gilberto Gil and Ney Matogrosso, "Rita Lee: Mania de Você" presents her definitive legacy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7bD5lOOfWCcrlav2U8IzbEfETp0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1458708'),
  ('184759901244241281', 'Rita Levi-Montalcini', 2020, 'History, TV Movie', 'Stefano Ricciotti, Giovanni Paolucci, Giacomo Giuppone', 'Alberto Negrin, Roberto Iannone, Francesco Massaro', 'Elena Sofia Ricci, Luca Angeletti, Ernesto D''Argenio, Carolina Sala, Francesco Procopio, Katia Greco, Elisa Carletti, Dora Romano', null, 'In 1986, Rita Levi-Montalcini receives the Nobel Prize, but something is missing. After meeting a young violinist, the scientist faces a difficult choice: take refuge in fame or get back in the game.', 'In 1986, Rita Levi-Montalcini receives the Nobel Prize, but something is missing. After meeting a young violinist, the scientist faces a difficult choice: take refuge in fame or get back in the game.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AglfrLV0Y3AcXmYcaznQgF4fNJX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:768107'),
  ('59886199604921914', 'Rita the American Girl', 1965, 'Comedy', 'Piero Vivarelli, Mario Castellani, Giancarlo Di Fonzo', 'Tito Carpi, Ugo Gregoretti, Ugo Moretti', 'Totò, Rita Pavone, Fabrizio Capucci, Lina Volonghi, Umberto D''Orsi, Nino Fuscagni, Nino Nini', null, 'Professor Serafino Benvenuti is a master of classical music who has the passion of the orchestra director. However, the young audience of the 60 does not appreciate classical composers like Mozart or Beethoven, and so Serafino is likely to have compromised his image as a director. One day Serafino receives the news that his adopted daughter Rita is about to return to Italy from America, where she is studying. Serafino is very happy, because at least he can teach her the real music. However, Rita is deeply grown and changed: she follows the musical patterns of her time: the rock music and blues. Serafino gets very angry, especially when he discovers that his daughter falls in love with a young man, a member of a band called "The Rockets.', 'Professor Serafino Benvenuti is a master of classical music who has the passion of the orchestra director. However, the young audience of the 60 does not appreciate classical composers like Mozart or Beethoven, and so Serafino is likely to have compromised his image as a director. One day Serafino receives the news that his adopted daughter Rita is about to return to Italy from America, where she is studying. Serafino is very happy, because at least he can teach her the real music. However, Rita is deeply grown and changed: she follows the musical patterns of her time: the rock music and blues. Serafino gets very angry, especially when he discovers that his daughter falls in love with a young man, a member of a band called "The Rockets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m1FthuSJRZdBkdPxKQNi3UBNapm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:193179'),
  ('288555566569258914', 'Rita the Field Marshal', 1967, 'War, Comedy', 'Steno, Riccardo Pallottini, Romano Scandariato', 'Pipolo, Castellano', 'Rita Pavone, Francis Blanche, Terence Hill, Aroldo Tieri, Jess Hahn, Michel Modo, Teddy Reno, Giampiero Littera', null, 'A waitress helps a scientist flee the Nazis.', 'A waitress helps a scientist flee the Nazis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j6uZE9NsumFnlUTmiFaUXWQF2Yp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54166'),
  ('431397771447814303', 'Rita, Sue and Bob Too', 1987, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Alan Clarke, Ivan Strasburg, Mike Gowans', 'Andrea Dunbar', 'Michelle Holmes, Siobhan Finneran, George Costigan, Lesley Sharp, Kulvinder Ghir, Willie Ross, Danny O''Dea, Maureen Long', 'R', 'Rita and Sue are two teenagers living on a run-down council estate in Bradford, who both share a job babysitting for Bob and Michelle''s children. Whilst giving them a lift home one night, Bob decides to take Rita and Sue up to a deserted, country-side landscape. Clearly knowing what he has in mind, Rita and Sue are only too happy to oblige and both have a sexual encounter with him that becomes a regular occurrence.', 'Rita and Sue are two teenagers living on a run-down council estate in Bradford, who both share a job babysitting for Bob and Michelle''s children. Whilst giving them a lift home one night, Bob decides to take Rita and Sue up to a deserted, country-side landscape. Clearly knowing what he has in mind, Rita and Sue are only too happy to oblige and both have a sexual encounter with him that becomes a regular occurrence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bNofq5QmwFeFTILeUOzwG9hPe1X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18125'),
  ('410632088931882256', 'Rite Here Rite Now', 2024, 'Music, Documentary', 'Tobias Forge, Alex Ross Perry, Robert Kolodny', 'Tobias Forge', 'Tobias Forge, Hayden C Scott, Per Eriksson, Cosmo Sniderman, Justin Taylor, Laura Scarborough, Mad Gallica, Olivia Morreale', 'NR', 'Whether you’re a devoted disciple looking to relive treasured memories of the GHOST live spectacle or among the curious uninitiated, RITE HERE RITE NOW will put you right there: putting your phones down and living in the moment—as a shadow of uncertainty looms—completely spellbound and in the thrall of this bombastic yet intimate cinematic portrait of GHOST.', 'Whether you’re a devoted disciple looking to relive treasured memories of the GHOST live spectacle or among the curious uninitiated, RITE HERE RITE NOW will put you right there: putting your phones down and living in the moment—as a shadow of uncertainty looms—completely spellbound and in the thrall of this bombastic yet intimate cinematic portrait of GHOST.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w3xJNhW5ZYuK3BySbsJiGDmKEiV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1203397'),
