  ('755185760301892309', 'River', 2023, 'Comedy, Science Fiction, Fantasy', 'Junta Yamaguchi, Kazunari Kawagoe', 'Makoto Ueda', 'Riko Fujitani, Yuki Torigoe, Munenori Nagano, Takashi Sumita, Masashi Suwa, Gota Ishida, Haruki Nakagawa, Kazunari Tosa', 'NR', 'The one-hundred-year-old Fujiya inn stands in the quiet region of Kyoto. Mikoto is standing in front of the Kibune river at the back of the building when she is called back to work. But two minutes later, she finds herself back at the river again. The whole inn seems to be stuck in a time loop!', 'The one-hundred-year-old Fujiya inn stands in the quiet region of Kyoto. Mikoto is standing in front of the Kibune river at the back of the building when she is called back to work. But two minutes later, she finds herself back at the river again. The whole inn seems to be stuck in a time loop!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zfjxvpyNK3EX6etv8vhZgzMQIA5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1138476'),
  ('392256073671584512', 'River Made to Drown In', 1997, 'Drama', 'James Merendino, Thomas L. Callaway, Todd Barron', 'Paul Marius', 'Richard Chamberlain, Michael Imperioli, Ute Lemper, James Duval, Mike Starr, Richard Riehle, Michael Saucedo, James Karen', 'NR', 'Thaddeus Mackenzie, a wealthy lawyer, learns that he is dying and decides to sell all of his property and visit his old friend Allen Hayden. Allen is a struggling artist with a passion for life who once survived by working the streets, but now is romantically involved with Eva, a wealthy European gallery owner living in L.A. Thaddeus implores Allen to find Jamie, a young street hustler that Thaddeus had once tried to rescue. Allen returns to the streets to face the dark corners of his past where he must choose between what he left behind and the uncertainty that lies ahead.', 'Thaddeus Mackenzie, a wealthy lawyer, learns that he is dying and decides to sell all of his property and visit his old friend Allen Hayden. Allen is a struggling artist with a passion for life who once survived by working the streets, but now is romantically involved with Eva, a wealthy European gallery owner living in L.A. Thaddeus implores Allen to find Jamie, a young street hustler that Thaddeus had once tried to rescue. Allen returns to the streets to face the dark corners of his past where he must choose between what he left behind and the uncertainty that lies ahead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s5MyIr5uF5WdNyD4Ax5Mh0UxGhF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3588'),
