  ('1133251581503801731', 'River, el más grande siempre', 2019, 'Documentary', 'Luis Alberto Scalella, Diego Monk, Marcelo Altmark', 'Mariano Mucci, Enrique Albistur, Marcelo Altmark', 'Amadeo Carrizo, Daniel Onega, Ariel Ortega, Pablo Aimar, Ramón Díaz, Norberto Alonso, Enzo Francescoli, Marcelo Gallardo', null, 'Documentary that tells the history of River from its beginnings, and its development as an institution, the Monumental, the club, its social work, and the sporting successes, from its beginnings until these last two years and five cups.', 'Documentary that tells the history of River from its beginnings, and its development as an institution, the Monumental, the club, its social work, and the sporting successes, from its beginnings until these last two years and five cups.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i6iIX4t7IKJ7vflAdWuZSaGmoZ9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:601781'),
  ('420221862028329708', 'River''s Edge', 1986, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Tim Hunter, Nancy King, Richard Hawley', 'Neal Jimenez', 'Crispin Glover, Keanu Reeves, Ione Skye, Roxana Zal, Daniel Roebuck, Dennis Hopper, Joshua John Miller, Tom Bower', 'R', 'A group of high-school friends must come to terms with the fact that one of them, Samson, killed another, Jamie. Faced with the brutality of death, each must decide whether to turn their friend in to the police, or to help him escape the consequences of his dreadful deed.', 'A group of high-school friends must come to terms with the fact that one of them, Samson, killed another, Jamie. Faced with the brutality of death, each must decide whether to turn their friend in to the police, or to help him escape the consequences of his dreadful deed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bT68aKa9d7zDF7Z8MaskbWBRqzb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21309'),
  ('402402955247037827', 'Riverboom', 2024, 'Documentary, Comedy', 'Claude Baechtold, Claude Baechtold', 'Claude Baechtold, Kevin Schlosser, Katia Monla Guisolan', 'Claude Baechtold, Paolo Woods, Serge Michel', null, 'In the year following the 9/11 terrorist attacks, young journalist Claude Baechtold finds himself in the war zone of Afghanistan. Not entirely voluntarily, the avowed anti-militarist is dragged by two fearless reporters on a round trip through the entire country.', 'In the year following the 9/11 terrorist attacks, young journalist Claude Baechtold finds himself in the war zone of Afghanistan. Not entirely voluntarily, the avowed anti-militarist is dragged by two fearless reporters on a round trip through the entire country.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o2Qh8gbt1efpTXCwuuHDR4N4mde.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1175235'),
  ('409072230959470341', 'Riverdance: The Animated Adventure', 2021, 'Animation, Fantasy, Music, Adventure, Comedy, Family', 'Eamonn Butler, Dave Rosenbaum', 'Dave Rosenbaum, Tyler Werrin', 'Pierce Brosnan, Sam Hardy, Hannah Herman Cortes, Lilly Singh, Jermaine Fowler, John Kavanagh, Pauline McLynn, Aisling Bea', null, 'A young Irish boy named Keegan and Spanish girl named Moya journey into a magical world of the Megaloceros Giganteus who teach them to appreciate Riverdance as a celebration of life. Based on the stage show phenomenon of the same name and featuring Bill Whelan’s multi-platinum Grammy Award-winning music.', 'A young Irish boy named Keegan and Spanish girl named Moya journey into a magical world of the Megaloceros Giganteus who teach them to appreciate Riverdance as a celebration of life. Based on the stage show phenomenon of the same name and featuring Bill Whelan’s multi-platinum Grammy Award-winning music.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i6TRDlVuuEXMyLSlIkDd8YhBN0r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:756403'),
