  ('170890152117960357', 'Road', 2002, 'Thriller', 'Rajat Mukherjee, Sudeep Chatterjee', null, 'Vivek Oberoi, Antara Mali, Manoj Bajpayee, Makrand Deshpande, Sayaji Shinde, Rajpal Yadav, Raj Zutshi, Ganesh Yadav', 'NR', 'Arvind Chauhan and Lakhsmi are in love with each other. Lakhsmi''s dad, a senior police inspector, hates Arvind, and so Arvind and Lakshmi decide to elope', 'Arvind Chauhan and Lakhsmi are in love with each other. Lakhsmi''s dad, a senior police inspector, hates Arvind, and so Arvind and Lakshmi decide to elope', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7tl9yuCM9VxphiPJHgtYQDNd7sK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:166258'),
  ('9464691832467522', 'Road', 2014, 'Documentary', 'Dermot Lavery, Michael Hewitt, Mark Garrett', 'Dermot Lavery, Michael Hewitt', 'Liam Neeson, Joey Dunlop, Robert Dunlop, Michael Dunlop, William Dunlop, Liam Beckett, John McGuinness, Stephen Davidson', null, 'Brothers addicted to speed at any price. Documentary following the motorcycle road racing careers, and fate, of the Dunlop family.', 'Brothers addicted to speed at any price. Documentary following the motorcycle road racing careers, and fate, of the Dunlop family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fEDWUQyG1jvd3SbD8pwzEoVuWRA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:276137'),
  ('592229067801204495', 'Road 47', 2014, 'War, History, Drama', 'Vicente Ferraz, Carlos Arango De Montis', 'Vicente Ferraz', 'Daniel de Oliveira, Francisco Gaspar, Júlio Andrade, Thogun Teixeira, Ivo Canelas, Richard Sammel, Sergio Rubini, Cesare Apolito', null, 'During World War II, looking up the Mountain, in Italy, a Brazilian Expeditionary Force - FEB - mines weeping platoon is hit by a panic-attack that sets them running aimlessly right in the middle of ''no man''s land''. Desperate cold and hungry, the ill-prepared soldiers have to choose between facing military court or delve deeper into enemy lines. After a tense discussion, they decide to save their faces with the Brazilian Army by tackling a daring military objective: to disarm the most feared minefield in Italy. On their way there, they end meeting two others deserters; a remorseful Italian soldier trying to join the Partigianos and German officer who is just simply tired of war. with unexpected help of their ex-enemy, the soldiers are set to accomplish a mission that so far had been deemed impossible.', 'During World War II, looking up the Mountain, in Italy, a Brazilian Expeditionary Force - FEB - mines weeping platoon is hit by a panic-attack that sets them running aimlessly right in the middle of ''no man''s land''. Desperate cold and hungry, the ill-prepared soldiers have to choose between facing military court or delve deeper into enemy lines. After a tense discussion, they decide to save their faces with the Brazilian Army by tackling a daring military objective: to disarm the most feared minefield in Italy. On their way there, they end meeting two others deserters; a remorseful Italian soldier trying to join the Partigianos and German officer who is just simply tired of war. with unexpected help of their ex-enemy, the soldiers are set to accomplish a mission that so far had been deemed impossible.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xQCtUSUOiNIRuj0gaGR6Rku7rD6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:253020'),
  ('608860849720840254', 'Road Games', 2015, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Abner Pastoll, Eben Bolter', 'Abner Pastoll', 'Andrew Simpson, Joséphine de la Baume, Frédéric Pierrot, Barbara Crampton, Féodor Atkine, Pierre Boulanger, Susanna Cappellaro, Edward Hogg', null, 'When hitchhiker Jack rescues Véronique from a road rage altercation, the twosome decide to travel together for safety’s sake after learning a serial killer is cutting a murderous swathe through the region. Tired and hungry, they decide against their better judgment to take up an offer to stay the night at a mysterious elderly couple’s mansion…', 'When hitchhiker Jack rescues Véronique from a road rage altercation, the twosome decide to travel together for safety’s sake after learning a serial killer is cutting a murderous swathe through the region. Tired and hungry, they decide against their better judgment to take up an offer to stay the night at a mysterious elderly couple’s mansion…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8GUcycwM3qE1KTxtkvbRtjzd84m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:347752'),
  ('350491250877505280', 'Road House', 1948, 'Thriller, Drama, Romance', 'Joseph LaShelle, Jean Negulesco', 'Edward Chodorov', 'Ida Lupino, Cornel Wilde, Celeste Holm, Richard Widmark, O.Z. Whitehead, Robert Karnes, George Beranger, Ian MacDonald', 'NR', 'A night club owner becomes infatuated with a torch singer and frames his best friend/manager for embezzlement when the chanteuse falls in love with him.', 'A night club owner becomes infatuated with a torch singer and frames his best friend/manager for embezzlement when the chanteuse falls in love with him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wCH0AtTWpwr4YpIftfl1wVydokZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30624'),
  ('13575904490556383', 'Road House', 1989, 'Action, Thriller', 'Rowdy Herrington, Dean Cundey, Charlie Picerni', 'R. Lance Hill, Hilary Henkin', 'Patrick Swayze, Kelly Lynch, Sam Elliott, Ben Gazzara, Marshall R. Teague, Julie Michaels, Red West, Sunshine Parker', 'R', 'The Double Deuce is the meanest, loudest and rowdiest bar south of the Mason-Dixon Line, and Dalton has been hired to clean it up. He might not look like much, but the Ph.D.-educated bouncer proves he''s more than capable – busting the heads of troublemakers and turning the roadhouse into a jumping hot spot. But Dalton''s romance with the gorgeous Dr. Clay puts him on the bad side of cutthroat local big shot Brad Wesley.', 'The Double Deuce is the meanest, loudest and rowdiest bar south of the Mason-Dixon Line, and Dalton has been hired to clean it up. He might not look like much, but the Ph.D.-educated bouncer proves he''s more than capable – busting the heads of troublemakers and turning the roadhouse into a jumping hot spot. But Dalton''s romance with the gorgeous Dr. Clay puts him on the bad side of cutthroat local big shot Brad Wesley.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/60VHW8heV11uLSCnkjk6iGRQatA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10135'),
  ('916666965322934579', 'Road House', 2024, 'Action, Thriller, Drama', 'Kit Conners, Nadeem Ashayer, María Fernanda Muñoz', 'Hilary Henkin, R. Lance Hill', 'Jake Gyllenhaal, Conor McGregor, Billy Magnussen, Travis Van Winkle, Darren Barnet, Daniela Melchior, Jessica Williams, Joaquim de Almeida', 'R', 'Ex-UFC fighter Dalton takes a job as a bouncer at a Florida Keys roadhouse, only to discover that this paradise is not all it seems.', 'Ex-UFC fighter Dalton takes a job as a bouncer at a Florida Keys roadhouse, only to discover that this paradise is not all it seems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fDEdtS4P0gJsxHDIt8dG8TR5dx1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:359410'),
  ('1037901318012791375', 'Road House 2: Last Call', 2006, 'Adventure, Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Thomas L. Callaway, Scott Ziehl, James Roque Jr.', 'Johnathon Schaech, Richard Chizmar', 'Johnathon Schaech, Ellen Hollman, Richard Norton, Jake Busey, Will Patton, Marisa Quinn, Larnell Stovall, Jeff Galpin', 'R', 'Shane Tanner, the son of a legendary cooler named Dalton, learns that his uncle Nate got beat up by a group of men because he doesn''t want to sell his bar, The Black Pelican, to a bunch of drug dealers. To help out his uncle, Shane teams up with local school teacher Beau Hampton, who is a regular at the Black Pelican, and takes down the baddies.', 'Shane Tanner, the son of a legendary cooler named Dalton, learns that his uncle Nate got beat up by a group of men because he doesn''t want to sell his bar, The Black Pelican, to a bunch of drug dealers. To help out his uncle, Shane teams up with local school teacher Beau Hampton, who is a regular at the Black Pelican, and takes down the baddies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aiLwHT8KfEGMx4YB38UBhAn9pku.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27732'),
  ('431415131441488828', 'Road Kill', 2026, 'Horror', 'Nicholas Carr', 'Nicholas Carr', 'Laia Amor, Alyson Blankenship, Royal Bridges', null, 'While helping his sister Iris plan their younger sister Juju''s wedding, Devin takes a wrong turn after picking up the cake and ends up on a deserted back road where his car is suddenly disabled. Devin begins to realize he''s not alone.', 'While helping his sister Iris plan their younger sister Juju''s wedding, Devin takes a wrong turn after picking up the cake and ends up on a deserted back road where his car is suddenly disabled. Devin begins to realize he''s not alone.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2Fwph9NZUaUsWAAfFEarRm0FTdEw3.jpg', 'plex:movie:road-kill-2026'),
  ('605028412948504203', 'Road Movie', 2002, 'Drama, Romance', 'Kim In-shik, Kim Jae-Ho', 'Kim In-shik', 'Hwang Jung-min, Jung Chan, Rin Seo, Jeong Hyeong-gi, Pang Eun-jin, Do Yong-gu, Yoo Seung-hyeon, Kim Ki-cheon', null, 'Suk-won, a trader who loses all of his money and his wife in a market downturn is left homeless until Dae-shik, a homeless loner, rescues him. Together the two travel across the country and Dae-shik falls in love with Suk-won. Joining them in their journey is Il-joo, a wacky hooker who falls in love with Dae-shik.', 'Suk-won, a trader who loses all of his money and his wife in a market downturn is left homeless until Dae-shik, a homeless loner, rescues him. Together the two travel across the country and Dae-shik falls in love with Suk-won. Joining them in their journey is Il-joo, a wacky hooker who falls in love with Dae-shik.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nLqBMXmh1ackQL1cIYrKeiOuBYP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125951'),
  ('663912914452333766', 'Road of No Return', 2009, 'Action, Drama, Thriller', 'Parviz Saghizadeh', 'Parviz Saghizadeh', 'Michael Madsen, David Carradine, Michael Blain-Rozgay, Ernest Anthony, Shane Woodson, Carlie Westerman, Sandy Kanan, Tommy Little', 'R', 'Road of no Return follows the final nine days in the lives of four atypical hit men who are secretly brought together in a covert operation to fight the drug trafficking epidemic in the country.', 'Road of no Return follows the final nine days in the lives of four atypical hit men who are secretly brought together in a covert operation to fight the drug trafficking epidemic in the country.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k6gQweSzZgMDJGx1kh0FWMjfnRu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20782'),
  ('263894714626941018', 'Road Rage', 2000, 'Drama, Action, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Sidney J. Furie, Curtis Petersen', 'Greg Mellott', 'Casper Van Dien, Danielle Brett, Joseph Griffin, Catherine Oxenberg, Anthony Tullo, James Millington, James Binkley, Chuck Byrn', 'R', 'The highway to hell runs straight through a college campus in this compelling thriller about a killer truck. After helping a pretty co-ed out of a nasty domestic situation, Jim Travis gives the girl a lift home. But once on the road, the situation takes a white-knuckle twist as Jim gets into a frightening duel with a crazy truck driver.', 'The highway to hell runs straight through a college campus in this compelling thriller about a killer truck. After helping a pretty co-ed out of a nasty domestic situation, Jim Travis gives the girl a lift home. But once on the road, the situation takes a white-knuckle twist as Jim gets into a frightening duel with a crazy truck driver.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vxt7TprDJ1Rqx1HIZi1tURw7pdD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52833'),
  ('690396415586819157', 'Road Show', 1941, 'Comedy, Music', 'Hal Roach, Norbert Brodine', 'Mickell Novack, Arnold Belgard, Harry Langdon', 'Adolphe Menjou, Carole Landis, John Hubbard, Charles Butterworth, Patsy Kelly, George E. Stone, Margaret Roach, Polly Ann Young', null, 'Rich playboy Drogo Gaines is in imminent danger of marrying a gold digger, and escapes by feigning insanity. The joke''s on him when he wakes up in an asylum full of comical lunatics. There he befriends Colonel Carraway, and together they escape, catching a ride with a beautiful blonde who proves to be Penguin Moore, carnival owner.', 'Rich playboy Drogo Gaines is in imminent danger of marrying a gold digger, and escapes by feigning insanity. The joke''s on him when he wakes up in an asylum full of comical lunatics. There he befriends Colonel Carraway, and together they escape, catching a ride with a beautiful blonde who proves to be Penguin Moore, carnival owner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2b2tYGJP9jpYys2CpxLAhThQEft.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117533'),
  ('919082816396347340', 'Road to Bali', 1952, 'Comedy, Adventure, Music, Romance', 'Hal Walker, George Barnes, John R. Coonan', 'Frank Butler, Hal Kanter, William Morrow', 'Bing Crosby, Bob Hope, Dorothy Lamour, Murvyn Vye, Peter Coe, Ralph Moody, Leon Askin, Larri Thomas', null, 'Having to leave Melbourne in a hurry to avoid various marriage proposals, two song-and-dance men sign on for work as divers. This takes them to an idyllic island on the way to Bali where they vie with each other for the favours of Princess Lala. The hazardous dive produces a chest of priceless jewels which arouses the less romantic interest of some shady locals.', 'Having to leave Melbourne in a hurry to avoid various marriage proposals, two song-and-dance men sign on for work as divers. This takes them to an idyllic island on the way to Bali where they vie with each other for the favours of Princess Lala. The hazardous dive produces a chest of priceless jewels which arouses the less romantic interest of some shady locals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qOaOWAk0vtjr4enTUx04cw0zmlV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34082'),
  ('99836684046960386', 'Road to Boston', 2023, 'Drama', 'Choi Chan-min, Lee Sang-hun, Breanna Milliken', 'Lee Sang-hyeon, Son Kwang-soo', 'Ha Jung-woo, Yim Si-wan, Bae Sung-woo, Kim Sang-ho, Park Eun-bin, Park Hyo-ju, Kim Jung-chul, Lee Seung-joon', null, 'A rousing tale of the Korean athletes who ran the 1947 Boston International Marathon, the first international marathon held since World War II.', 'A rousing tale of the Korean athletes who ran the 1947 Boston International Marathon, the first international marathon held since World War II.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pNHfEmRp8vtK2TZCUOtTmIlmTmD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:581394'),
  ('539291597279000095', 'Road to Christmas', 2018, 'Family, Romance, TV Movie', 'Allan Harmon', 'Zac Hug', 'Jessy Schram, Chad Michael Murray, Teryl Rothery, Matreya Scarrwener, Jeff Gonek, Cardi Wong, Rebekah Asselstine, Marlie Collins', null, 'Los Angeles television producer Maggie Baker unwittingly falls for Danny Wise, the son and former producer of his mother’s popular annual Christmas special Julia Wise Lifestyle. When Maggie’s secret plan to reunite Danny and his two brothers with Julia during the live broadcast in Vermont goes awry, Maggie is reminded that above all, it is the love for family and friends that makes the merriest of Christmas.', 'Los Angeles television producer Maggie Baker unwittingly falls for Danny Wise, the son and former producer of his mother’s popular annual Christmas special Julia Wise Lifestyle. When Maggie’s secret plan to reunite Danny and his two brothers with Julia during the live broadcast in Vermont goes awry, Maggie is reminded that above all, it is the love for family and friends that makes the merriest of Christmas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7F46Dl9oHsVjdCxQtNReXrD4PUq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:550017'),
  ('308020180805788782', 'Road to Hell', 2018, 'Action, Horror, Crime', 'Alex D''Antona, Stefano Pollastro, Roberto D''Antona', 'Roberto D''Antona', 'Roberto D''Antona, Francesco Emulo, Annamaria Lorusso, Mirko D''Antona, Michael Segal, Kavita Albizzati, Alessandro Carnevale Pellino, Giada Robin', 'R', 'Three robbers on the run to a new life cross their way with a woman and her son and with the tragic curse they''re bringing. On their trail, the mob boss they worked for and a mysterious secret organization of unscrupulous men. During this crazy epic ride to hell, a jealous girlfriend and an former-cop and his brisk methods will join them. At stake, the child''s life and the future of the world.', 'Three robbers on the run to a new life cross their way with a woman and her son and with the tragic curse they''re bringing. On their trail, the mob boss they worked for and a mysterious secret organization of unscrupulous men. During this crazy epic ride to hell, a jealous girlfriend and an former-cop and his brisk methods will join them. At stake, the child''s life and the future of the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r5wz0km6HaZYQdaT6IP38oLKahC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:507112'),
  ('1119124901818477830', 'Road to Istanbul', 2016, 'Drama', 'Rachid Bouchareb, Benoît Chamaillard', 'Yasmina Khadra, Rachid Bouchareb, Zoé Galeron', 'Astrid Whettnall, Pauline Burlet, Bilal Aya, Patricia Ide, Fawzi B. Saichi, Karim Hamzaoui, Abel Jafri, Bernard Boudru', null, 'Elisabeth lives a quiet live in the Belgian countryside with her young adult daughter Elodie. After the divorce from her husband Elisabeth took care of her daughter on her own. When Elodie disappears over night and Elisabeth discovers that she travelled to Syria to join the Islamic State, she begins her journey to find her daughter.', 'Elisabeth lives a quiet live in the Belgian countryside with her young adult daughter Elodie. After the divorce from her husband Elisabeth took care of her daughter on her own. When Elodie disappears over night and Elisabeth discovers that she travelled to Syria to join the Islamic State, she begins her journey to find her daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/js8dDZrHOEIyUNvGNSOwF67dR0C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:383064'),
  ('219296242144395886', 'Road to La Paz', 2015, 'Drama', 'Christian Cottet, Francisco Varone', 'Francisco Varone', 'Rodrigo de la Serna, Ernesto Suarez, Elisa Carricajo, María Canale, Alicia Palmes, Juan Alari, Khaled Hallar, Vanesa Maja', null, 'Sebastian is unemployed, finding pleasure only in his old Peugeot. He got married to his girlfriend Jazmin and having no income, he starts a job of a private ride service. One day, a regular customer, Jalil, an old Arab man suggests a long distance drive. During the ride from Buenos Aires of Argentina to La Paz of Bolivia, the two are in conflict with each other constantly. With a series of unexpected accidents, the journey brings a small but important change to both of their lives.', 'Sebastian is unemployed, finding pleasure only in his old Peugeot. He got married to his girlfriend Jazmin and having no income, he starts a job of a private ride service. One day, a regular customer, Jalil, an old Arab man suggests a long distance drive. During the ride from Buenos Aires of Argentina to La Paz of Bolivia, the two are in conflict with each other constantly. With a series of unexpected accidents, the journey brings a small but important change to both of their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lJrFZ3k6T2OIpKa46lK2wYrgnbd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:361251'),
  ('645739650628265975', 'Road to Life', 1931, 'Drama', 'Nikolai Ekk, Vasily Pronin', 'Aleksandr Stolper, Nikolai Ekk, Regina Yanushkevich', 'Nikolai Batalov, Yvan Kyrlya, Mikhail Zharov, Vladimir Uralskiy, Rina Zelyonaya, Georgi Zhzhyonov, Vasiliy Kachalov, Aleksander Novikov', null, 'Young hobos are taken to a new camp to become good Soviet citizens. This camp works without any guards, and it works well. But crooks kill one of the young people when they try to damage the newly built railroad to the camp.', 'Young hobos are taken to a new camp to become good Soviet citizens. This camp works without any guards, and it works well. But crooks kill one of the young people when they try to damage the newly built railroad to the camp.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/liWglXCrtP6GUsbDQYfvuFg58mW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:156316'),
  ('1040776531827484675', 'Road to Mars', 2017, 'Science Fiction, Comedy, Drama', 'Humberto Hinojosa, Guillermo Garza', 'Humberto Hinojosa, Antón de Goenechea', 'Luis Gerardo Méndez, Tessa Ía, Camila Sodi, Andrés Almeida, Rodrigo Corea', null, 'Emilia, who suffers from a terminal illness, embarks on a journey with her best friend Violeta. On their way they meet Mark, who claims to be an alien on a mission to destroy the planet for considering humanity (and love) a virus. However, Mark begins to doubt his mission falling in love with Emilia.', 'Emilia, who suffers from a terminal illness, embarks on a journey with her best friend Violeta. On their way they meet Mark, who claims to be an alien on a mission to destroy the planet for considering humanity (and love) a virus. However, Mark begins to doubt his mission falling in love with Emilia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4qmY1j68ghpYz3s2C5kozEI1oSr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:420278'),
  ('552264322161029408', 'Road to Morocco', 1942, 'Comedy, Music, Adventure, Romance', 'David Butler, William C. Mellor', 'Frank Butler, Don Hartman', 'Bing Crosby, Bob Hope, Dorothy Lamour, Anthony Quinn, Dona Drake, Vladimir Sokoloff, Mikhail Rasumny, George Givot', 'NR', 'Two carefree castaways on a desert shore find an Arabian Nights city, where they compete for the luscious Princess Shalmar.', 'Two carefree castaways on a desert shore find an Arabian Nights city, where they compete for the luscious Princess Shalmar.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nECM25OC4iJHV1AHPa4CHnzYgyk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31805'),
  ('927407160932756349', 'Road to Ninja: Naruto the Movie', 2012, 'Animation, Fantasy, Action', 'Hayato Date, Yoshiharu Shimizu, Masayuki Fujita', 'Masahiro Hikokubo, Junki Takegami', 'Junko Takeuchi, Chie Nakamura, Toshiyuki Morikawa, Emi Shinohara, Kazuhiko Inoue, Naoya Uchida, Noriaki Sugiyama, Nana Mizuki', 'PG-13', 'Sixteen years ago, a mysterious masked ninja unleashes a powerful creature known as the Nine-Tailed Demon Fox on the Hidden Leaf Village Konoha, killing many people. In response, the Fourth Hokage Minato Namikaze and his wife Kushina Uzumaki, the Demon Fox''s living prison or Jinchūriki, manage to seal the creature inside their newborn son Naruto Uzumaki. With the Tailed Beast sealed, things continued as normal. However, in the present day, peace ended when a group of ninja called the Akatsuki attack Konoha under the guidance of Tobi, the mysterious masked man behind Fox''s rampage years ago who intends on executing his plan to rule the world by shrouding it in illusions.', 'Sixteen years ago, a mysterious masked ninja unleashes a powerful creature known as the Nine-Tailed Demon Fox on the Hidden Leaf Village Konoha, killing many people. In response, the Fourth Hokage Minato Namikaze and his wife Kushina Uzumaki, the Demon Fox''s living prison or Jinchūriki, manage to seal the creature inside their newborn son Naruto Uzumaki. With the Tailed Beast sealed, things continued as normal. However, in the present day, peace ended when a group of ninja called the Akatsuki attack Konoha under the guidance of Tobi, the mysterious masked man behind Fox''s rampage years ago who intends on executing his plan to rule the world by shrouding it in illusions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xLal6fXNtiJN6Zw6qk21xAtdOeN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118406'),
  ('64229395819646700', 'Road to Paloma', 2014, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Jason Momoa, Brian Andrew Mendoza', 'Jason Momoa, Robert Homer Mollohan, Jonathan Hirschbein', 'Jason Momoa, Robert Homer Mollohan, Lisa Bonet, Michael Raymond-James, Chris Browning, Timothy V. Murphy, Sarah Shahi, Wes Studi', 'R', 'While Native American Wolf is being pursued by the FBI for having taken the law into his own hands, when his mother was raped and killed on their reservation he crosses paths with Cash, a down and out musician who is coping with the end of his marriage. An unlikely friendship develops, as they ride together towards the Teton mountain range, where Wolf will spread his mothers ashes.', 'While Native American Wolf is being pursued by the FBI for having taken the law into his own hands, when his mother was raped and killed on their reservation he crosses paths with Cash, a down and out musician who is coping with the end of his marriage. An unlikely friendship develops, as they ride together towards the Teton mountain range, where Wolf will spread his mothers ashes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cM0IitlIIS5kzdUPqyGTvl79TOY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:268060'),
  ('1050124004772426216', 'Road to Perdition', 2002, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Sam Mendes, Conrad Hall, Jann K. Engel', 'David Self', 'Tom Hanks, Paul Newman, Jude Law, Tyler Hoechlin, Daniel Craig, Stanley Tucci, Jennifer Jason Leigh, Liam Aiken', 'R', 'Mike Sullivan works as a hit man for crime boss John Rooney. Sullivan views Rooney as a father figure, however after his son is witness to a killing, Mike Sullivan finds himself on the run in attempt to save the life of his son and at the same time looking for revenge on those who wronged him.', 'Mike Sullivan works as a hit man for crime boss John Rooney. Sullivan views Rooney as a father figure, however after his son is witness to a killing, Mike Sullivan finds himself on the run in attempt to save the life of his son and at the same time looking for revenge on those who wronged him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/loSpBeirRfTPJ3cMIqpQArstGhh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4147'),
  ('1090952052158592806', 'Road to Rio', 1947, 'Comedy, Adventure, Music, Romance', 'Norman Z. McLeod, Oscar Rudolph, Ernest Laszlo', 'Jack Rose, Edmund Beloin', 'Bing Crosby, Bob Hope, Dorothy Lamour, Gale Sondergaard, Frank Faylen, Joseph Vitale, George Meeker, Frank Puglia', 'NR', 'Scat Sweeney and Hot Lips Barton, two out of work musicians, stow away onboard a ship bound for Rio, after accidentally setting fire to the big top of a circus. They then get mixed up with a potential suicide Lucia, who first thanks them, then unexpectedly turns them over to the ship''s captain. When they find out that she has been hypnotized, to go through a marriage of convenience, when the ship reaches Rio, the boys turn up at the ceremony, in order to stop the wedding, and to help catch the crooks.', 'Scat Sweeney and Hot Lips Barton, two out of work musicians, stow away onboard a ship bound for Rio, after accidentally setting fire to the big top of a circus. They then get mixed up with a potential suicide Lucia, who first thanks them, then unexpectedly turns them over to the ship''s captain. When they find out that she has been hypnotized, to go through a marriage of convenience, when the ship reaches Rio, the boys turn up at the ceremony, in order to stop the wedding, and to help catch the crooks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9xUeOjK6sTkhjwv1MuaUE2o2sLt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31980'),
  ('789761554387715334', 'Road to Roma', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Andrés Clariond, Gabriel Nuncio, Marcelo Galan', 'Pedro G. García', 'Alfonso Cuarón, Eugenio Caballero, Yalitza Aparicio, Marina de Tavira, Diego Cortina Autrey, Carlos Peralta, Marco Graf, Daniela Demesa', null, 'Director Alfonso Cuarón reflects on the childhood memories, period details and creative choices that shaped his Academy Award-winning film ''ROMA.''', 'Director Alfonso Cuarón reflects on the childhood memories, period details and creative choices that shaped his Academy Award-winning film ''ROMA.''', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h0hO0MzC7F6cyqysL4neoAguf0u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:649368'),
  ('929338885448575771', 'Road to Salina', 1970, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Maurice Fellous, Georges Lautner', 'Georges Lautner', 'Mimsy Farmer, Robert Walker Jr., Rita Hayworth, Ed Begley, Sophie Hardy, Marc Porel, Bruce Pecheur, Ivano Staccioli', 'R', 'Jonas, a young drifter, is wandering in a deserted area on the road to Salina, Mexico. He stops at a desolate roadside service station when Mara, the owner, identifies him as her son Rocky, who disappeared four years ago. Feeling sorry for Mara, he decides to stay on and meets Mara''s friend Warren and Rocky''s sister Billie, but dark facts are to be revealed about the disappearance of Rocky.', 'Jonas, a young drifter, is wandering in a deserted area on the road to Salina, Mexico. He stops at a desolate roadside service station when Mara, the owner, identifies him as her son Rocky, who disappeared four years ago. Feeling sorry for Mara, he decides to stay on and meets Mara''s friend Warren and Rocky''s sister Billie, but dark facts are to be revealed about the disappearance of Rocky.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/32955FEmC7LZNBrmjCaQjDMEauw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79717'),
  ('431284865914420951', 'Road to Singapore', 1940, 'Comedy, Music, Romance', 'Victor Schertzinger, William C. Mellor', 'Barney Dean', 'Bing Crosby, Dorothy Lamour, Bob Hope, Charles Coburn, Judith Barrett, Anthony Quinn, Jerry Colonna, Elvia Allman', 'NR', 'Two playboys try to forget previous romances in Singapore – until they meet a beautiful dancer.', 'Two playboys try to forget previous romances in Singapore – until they meet a beautiful dancer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jlIR7N9SHTIma89uJ8y8Ze40zOW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13861'),
  ('1042840947668201516', 'Road to the Stars', 1957, 'Documentary, Science Fiction', 'Pavel Klushantsev, Mikhail Galper', 'Vasiliy Solovyov, Boris Lyapunov', 'Georgi Solovyov, Georgi Kulbush', null, 'This film consists of three parts. The first dramatizes the life of the founder of Soviet astronautics, Konstantin Tsiolkovsky; the second describes the development of rocket technology; and the third visualizes the future with enactments of the first manned spaceflight, spacewalk, space station construction and humans on the moon.', 'This film consists of three parts. The first dramatizes the life of the founder of Soviet astronautics, Konstantin Tsiolkovsky; the second describes the development of rocket technology; and the third visualizes the future with enactments of the first manned spaceflight, spacewalk, space station construction and humans on the moon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9t9J0iynum6bGin4MXwCaCmsKmR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:261562'),
  ('886973546921298351', 'Road to Utopia', 1946, 'Adventure, Comedy, Music, Family', 'Hal Walker, Lionel Lindon', 'Norman Panama, Melvin Frank', 'Bing Crosby, Bob Hope, Dorothy Lamour, Hillary Brooke, Douglass Dumbrille, Jack La Rue, Robert Barrat, Nestor Paiva', 'NR', 'While on a ship to Skagway, Alaska, Duke and Chester find a map to a secret gold mine, which had been ''stolen'' by thugs. In Alaska to recover her father''s map, Sal Van Hoyden falls in with Ace Larson, who secretly wants to steal the gold mine for himself. Duke, Chester, the thugs, Ace and his henchman chase each other all over the countryside—for the map.', 'While on a ship to Skagway, Alaska, Duke and Chester find a map to a secret gold mine, which had been ''stolen'' by thugs. In Alaska to recover her father''s map, Sal Van Hoyden falls in with Ace Larson, who secretly wants to steal the gold mine for himself. Duke, Chester, the thugs, Ace and his henchman chase each other all over the countryside—for the map.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3N5YNjkwSJxppBCilUZZjMdCyI5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29021'),
  ('651215665383491337', 'Road to Ythaca', 2010, 'Documentary', 'Pedro Diógenes, Ricardo Pretti, Luiz Pretti', 'Guto Parente, Luiz Pretti, Pedro Diógenes', 'Guto Parente, Luiz Pretti, Pedro Diógenes, Ricardo Pretti, Rodrigo Capistrano, Uirá dos Reis, Ythallo Rodrigues', null, '“Always keep Ythaca on your mind. To arrive there is your ultimate goal. But do not hurry the voyage at all. It is better to let it last for many years; and to anchor at the island when you are old, rich with all you have gained on the way, not expecting that Ythaca will offer you riches. Ythaca has given you the beautiful voyage. Without her you would have never set out on the road. She has nothing more to give you. And if you find her poor, Ythaca has not deceived you. Wise as you have become, with so much experience, you must already have understood what Ythaca mean.” Konstantínos Kaváfis', '“Always keep Ythaca on your mind. To arrive there is your ultimate goal. But do not hurry the voyage at all. It is better to let it last for many years; and to anchor at the island when you are old, rich with all you have gained on the way, not expecting that Ythaca will offer you riches. Ythaca has given you the beautiful voyage. Without her you would have never set out on the road. She has nothing more to give you. And if you find her poor, Ythaca has not deceived you. Wise as you have become, with so much experience, you must already have understood what Ythaca mean.” Konstantínos Kaváfis', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8sgl6QCinZUF5WX28y8ne0td3M9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:213636'),
  ('541727333364884764', 'Road to Zanzibar', 1941, 'Adventure, Comedy, Romance', 'Victor Schertzinger, Ted Tetzlaff', 'Barney Dean', 'Bing Crosby, Bob Hope, Dorothy Lamour, Una Merkel, Eric Blore, Douglass Dumbrille, Iris Adrian, Lionel Royce', 'NR', 'Stranded in Africa, Chuck and his pal Fearless have comic versions of jungle adventures, featuring two attractive con-women.', 'Stranded in Africa, Chuck and his pal Fearless have comic versions of jungle adventures, featuring two attractive con-women.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A4jyOSlBmalVm0dm498Af8WBGvO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31812'),
  ('1119430364410989825', 'Road Train', 2010, 'Horror, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Dean Francis, Carl Robertson, Ian Astridge', 'Clive Hopkins', 'Xavier Samuel, Bob Morley, Georgina Haig, Sophie Lowe, David Argue', 'R', 'A supernatural thriller about a group of teenagers menaced by a driver-less train in the Australian outback.', 'A supernatural thriller about a group of teenagers menaced by a driver-less train in the Australian outback.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aWcdGw3rO6ZMFepZR90urEisQ7U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42307'),
  ('787015826512974875', 'Road Trip', 2000, 'Comedy, Adventure', 'Michael Neumann, Frank Davis, Melanie Grefé', 'Todd Phillips, Scot Armstrong', 'Breckin Meyer, Seann William Scott, Amy Smart, Paulo Costanzo, DJ Qualls, Rachel Blanchard, Anthony Rapp, Fred Ward', 'R', 'After a student at the University of Ithaca films his one-night stand with a beautiful sorority girl, he discovers one of his friends has accidentally mailed the homemade sex tape to his girlfriend in Austin. In a frenzy, he must borrow a car and hit the road in a desperate bid to intercept the tape.', 'After a student at the University of Ithaca films his one-night stand with a beautiful sorority girl, he discovers one of his friends has accidentally mailed the homemade sex tape to his girlfriend in Austin. In a frenzy, he must borrow a car and hit the road in a desperate bid to intercept the tape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jee4eY5tZprI0V18S6PXUloBzSk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9285'),
  ('1026204977486163165', 'Road Trip Romance', 2022, 'TV Movie, Romance, Comedy', 'Samantha Wan, Michael Tien', 'J.B. White, Steve N. White', 'Natalie Hall, Corey Sevier, Elana Dunkelman, Julia Borsellino, Dave Rosenbaum, Dave Rose, George Krissa, Wendy German', 'G', 'An escalating series of unfortunate events keeps delaying a young woman’s journey to her sister’s wedding – a journey she is forced to take with the guy who was her biggest rival in high school.', 'An escalating series of unfortunate events keeps delaying a young woman’s journey to her sister’s wedding – a journey she is forced to take with the guy who was her biggest rival in high school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4910h7UiRsIISw7WUvq7IwuLs3X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:958585'),
