  ('95212499228530699', 'Roadhouse Romance', 2021, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Paul Ziller, Dan Dumouchel', 'Sally Robinson', 'Lauren Alaina, Tyler Hynes, Michael Teigen, Lauren K. Robek, Sarah Edmondson, Rachelle Goulding, Danny Wattley, Adil Zaidi', 'G', 'When Callie returns home, she finds her hometown has changed - her first love has a new girl and her family''s BBQ restaurant has hit hard times. She clashes with a marooned bigshot director who might hold the key to saving the restaurant.', 'When Callie returns home, she finds her hometown has changed - her first love has a new girl and her family''s BBQ restaurant has hit hard times. She clashes with a marooned bigshot director who might hold the key to saving the restaurant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xGHgfijWsugNI2pK4qM3lIg5dbk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:842795'),
  ('177825645122408628', 'Roadie', 1980, 'Comedy, Music', 'Alan Rudolph, David Myers', 'Michael Ventura, Big Boy Medlin', 'Meat Loaf, Kaki Hunter, Art Carney, Gailard Sartain, Rhonda Bates, Don Cornelius, Sonny Carl Davis, Joe Spano', 'PG', 'A young Texas good ol'' boy has a knack with electronic equipment, and that talent gets him a job as a roadie with a raucous traveling rock-and-roll show.', 'A young Texas good ol'' boy has a knack with electronic equipment, and that talent gets him a job as a roadie with a raucous traveling rock-and-roll show.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4vAzTfw0g70BM1dAx7vdRNIhKMm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21024'),
  ('479849561334746262', 'Roadkill', 1989, 'Adventure, Comedy, Drama', 'Mirosław Baszak, Bruce McDonald', 'Don McKellar', 'Valerie Buhagiar, Gerry Quigley, Larry Hudson, Bruce McDonald, Shaun Bowring, Don McKellar, Mark Tarantino, Jamie Rooney', null, 'A music promoter sends a young woman on a road trip in search of a band who hasn''t been showing up for their gigs.', 'A music promoter sends a young woman on a road trip in search of a band who hasn''t been showing up for their gigs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eyLVfzDh8dFtaXXPinppQuDlw41.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41940'),
  ('93409519359131143', 'Roadkill', 2011, 'Horror, Thriller, TV Movie, Action', 'Johannes Roberts, Peter Robertson', 'Rick Suvalle', 'Kacey Barnfield, Stephen Rea, Eliza Bennett, Oliver James, Ned Dennehy, Diarmuid Noyes, Eve Macklin, Roisin Murphy', 'R', 'Six young friends on a road trip in Ireland run afoul of gypsies who curse them for accidentally running down an old woman. The curse takes the form of a terrifying flying beast that tries killing them all.', 'Six young friends on a road trip in Ireland run afoul of gypsies who curse them for accidentally running down an old woman. The curse takes the form of a terrifying flying beast that tries killing them all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6ZQUotw157KJDRLRKuxa42UYSqz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71628'),
  ('36867333338242214', 'Roadkill: The Last Days of John Martin', 1994, 'Horror', 'Jim Van Bebber, Mike King', 'Jim Van Bebber, Mark Gillespie', 'Mark Gillespie, Marc Pitman, Maureen Allisse', 'NR', 'A man named John Martin offers a couple with a broken-down car a ride to the nearest gas station, little do they know he’s actually taking them back to his place for dinner.', 'A man named John Martin offers a couple with a broken-down car a ride to the nearest gas station, little do they know he’s actually taking them back to his place for dinner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1CLGeBQlvg5Bqrjou1xtvS1KGQ2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104327'),
  ('1117046798054185564', 'Roadracers', 1994, 'Action, Crime, Drama, TV Movie', 'Robert Rodriguez, Roberto Schaefer', 'Tommy Nix, Robert Rodriguez', 'David Arquette, Salma Hayek Pinault, John Hawkes, Jason Wiles, O''Neal Compton, Kevin McCarthy, William Sadler, Tommy Nix', null, 'In the 1950s, guitar-playing drifter Dude Delaney wanders into a quiet town looking to play music and generally cause trouble, much to the chagrin of the local sheriff, known as Sarge. While palling around with his B-movie-obsessed friend Nixer, Dude meets the beautiful Donna, and is offered a position in a rockabilly band, but the sheriff is intent on getting rid of him by any means necessary.', 'In the 1950s, guitar-playing drifter Dude Delaney wanders into a quiet town looking to play music and generally cause trouble, much to the chagrin of the local sheriff, known as Sarge. While palling around with his B-movie-obsessed friend Nixer, Dude meets the beautiful Donna, and is offered a position in a rockabilly band, but the sheriff is intent on getting rid of him by any means necessary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oPU1900ifMJMxjtBYFZytuyjitK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26682'),
  ('1009571906966016758', 'Roadrunner: A Film About Anthony Bourdain', 2021, 'Documentary', 'Adam Beckman, Graham Willoughby, Antonio Cisneros', null, 'Anthony Bourdain, Nancy Bourdain, Joel Rose, Karen Rinaldi, Kim Witherspoon, Philippe Lajaunie, Tracey Westmoreland, Lydia Tenaglia', 'R', 'An intimate, behind-the-scenes look at how an anonymous chef became a world-renowned cultural icon. This unflinching look at Anthony Bourdain reverberates with his presence, in his own voice and in the way he indelibly impacted the world around him.', 'An intimate, behind-the-scenes look at how an anonymous chef became a world-renowned cultural icon. This unflinching look at Anthony Bourdain reverberates with his presence, in his own voice and in the way he indelibly impacted the world around him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ec9iSMX6k3YNmkIIsVBjdc3guCC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:642732'),
  ('939543344029978420', 'Roads of Fear', 2022, 'Crime, Action, Thriller, Drama', 'Christophe Lenoir, Emmanuel Saez, Hervé Zaccaro', 'Emmanuel Saez', 'Adrien Stoclet, Vincent Andres, Laurent Cerulli, Manuel Gonçalves, Vanessa Aiffe, Elodie Miramont, Florent Hugon, Brice Lemaire', null, 'Elon, who suffers bipolar disorders, wants to please his dad, head of a southern France mafia, and reluctantly commit crimes. However, each of his acts have consequences, and a heavy price to pay.', 'Elon, who suffers bipolar disorders, wants to please his dad, head of a southern France mafia, and reluctantly commit crimes. However, each of his acts have consequences, and a heavy price to pay.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6ENZDuwRQBP5KQlANnCS0HDb4GF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1019637'),
  ('275515274347801750', 'Roads to Koktebel', 2003, 'Drama', 'Boris Khlebnikov, Alexey Popogrebsky, Shandor Berkeshi', 'Alexey Popogrebsky, Boris Khlebnikov', 'Gleb Puskepalis, Igor Chernevich, Yevgeni Syty, Вера Сандрыкина, Vladimir Kucherenko, Anna Frolovtseva, Любовь Розанова, Aleksandr Poslovskiy', null, 'A widowed aeronautics engineer, who has lost his job, travels with his son hopping freight trains from Moscow to Koktebel, a town by the Black Sea, to start a new life with the father''s sister.', 'A widowed aeronautics engineer, who has lost his job, travels with his son hopping freight trains from Moscow to Koktebel, a town by the Black Sea, to start a new life with the father''s sister.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Sacy3mxqVRhR793WKaHSewyGwe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49653'),
  ('446147609049354236', 'Roads to the South', 1978, 'Drama', 'Joseph Losey, Gerry Fisher, Carlo Lastricati', 'Jorge Semprún', 'Yves Montand, Miou-Miou, Laurent Malet, José Luis Gómez, Claire Bretécher, Roger Planchon, Jeannine Mestre, France Lambiotte', null, 'France, 1975. Jean, an exiled Spanish Communist, is a successful screenwriter who, after a tragic event, struggles with his political commitment, his love for his country, under the boot of General Franco, whose death he and his comrades have waited for years, and his complicated relationship with his son. (A sequel to “The War Is Over,” 1966.)', 'France, 1975. Jean, an exiled Spanish Communist, is a successful screenwriter who, after a tragic event, struggles with his political commitment, his love for his country, under the boot of General Franco, whose death he and his comrades have waited for years, and his complicated relationship with his son. (A sequel to “The War Is Over,” 1966.)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tugRZDWV3L1PEZ39V3YmpUGT0To.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:327103'),
  ('120364592365325697', 'Roadside Prophets', 1992, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Drama', 'Abbe Wool, Tom Richmond', 'Abbe Wool', 'John Doe, Adam Horovitz, Jennifer Balgobin, David Anthony Marshall, David Carradine, Arlo Guthrie, Don Cheadle, John Cusack', 'R', 'On a quest to fulfill a friend''s last wish, Joe takes to the desert road on his 1957 Harley-Davidson. Joined by wannabe biker Sam, Joe journeys from Los Angeles to Nevada, meeting all sorts of characters along the way.', 'On a quest to fulfill a friend''s last wish, Joe takes to the desert road on his 1957 Harley-Davidson. Joined by wannabe biker Sam, Joe journeys from Los Angeles to Nevada, meeting all sorts of characters along the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8KkFF5voIohrkjUzLY7eNnW10hR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40841'),
  ('936253420465627091', 'Roadside Romeo', 2008, 'Animation, Family, Adventure, Comedy', 'Jen Rudin, Jugal Hansraj', null, 'Saif Ali Khan, Kareena Kapoor Khan, Javed Jaffrey, Tannaz Irani, Vrajesh Hirjee, Kiku Sharda, Vicki Lewis', null, 'This is the story of Romeo. A dude who was living the life. He had the works - the mansion to live in, the chicks to party with and the cars to be driven around in. Until one day, the family he was the favourite pet of, decided to move and left him back, abandoned on the mean streets of Mumbai. Romeo is now faced with situations he has never been in before. He encounters four strays, who scare the daylights out of him. But soon, he smooth talks his way into their hearts and he makes friends. Then, Romeo finds love! He encounters the beautiful, ravishing Laila, the most beautiful girl he has ever seen - and he loses his heart to her at first sight. Finally, he encounters a villain! The dreaded Don of the area - Charlie Anna. The Don who everyone is scared of. So hop on to the adventure as Romeo, wins friendship, love and a new life - in spite of Charlie Anna and his gang!', 'This is the story of Romeo. A dude who was living the life. He had the works - the mansion to live in, the chicks to party with and the cars to be driven around in. Until one day, the family he was the favourite pet of, decided to move and left him back, abandoned on the mean streets of Mumbai. Romeo is now faced with situations he has never been in before. He encounters four strays, who scare the daylights out of him. But soon, he smooth talks his way into their hearts and he makes friends. Then, Romeo finds love! He encounters the beautiful, ravishing Laila, the most beautiful girl he has ever seen - and he loses his heart to her at first sight. Finally, he encounters a villain! The dreaded Don of the area - Charlie Anna. The Don who everyone is scared of. So hop on to the adventure as Romeo, wins friendship, love and a new life - in spite of Charlie Anna and his gang!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p2CBDCVzTPjnXaKXN21bEoPWBeQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20653'),
  ('106156886921983884', 'Roald Dahl''s Esio Trot', 2015, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Dearbhla Walsh, Ben Smithard, Caroline Harper', 'Richard Curtis, Paul Mayhew-Archer', 'James Corden, Dustin Hoffman, Judi Dench, Salo Gardner, Lara Rossi, Jimmy Akingbola, Katie Lyons, Pixie Davies', null, 'Retired bachelor Mr Hoppy is hopelessly in love with his neighbour Mrs Silver, but she is only interested in her pet tortoise Alfie - until Mr Hoppy hatches an audacious plan.', 'Retired bachelor Mr Hoppy is hopelessly in love with his neighbour Mrs Silver, but she is only interested in her pet tortoise Alfie - until Mr Hoppy hatches an audacious plan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zr3VIk1jWxuEuECbEg2IyG7YuDb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:313867'),
  ('197272898089362989', 'Roald Dahl''s Matilda the Musical', 2022, 'Family, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Tat Radcliffe, Matthew Warchus, Alex Oakley', 'Dennis Kelly', 'Alisha Weir, Emma Thompson, Lashana Lynch, Stephen Graham, Andrea Riseborough, Sindhu Vee, Carl Spencer, Lauren Alexandra', 'PG', 'An extraordinary young girl discovers her superpower and summons the remarkable courage, against all odds, to help others change their stories, whilst also taking charge of her own destiny. Standing up for what''s right, she''s met with miraculous results.', 'An extraordinary young girl discovers her superpower and summons the remarkable courage, against all odds, to help others change their stories, whilst also taking charge of her own destiny. Standing up for what''s right, she''s met with miraculous results.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ga8R3OiOMMgSvZ4cOj8x7prUNYZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:668482'),
  ('786331575563787221', 'Roald Dahl''s The Witches', 2020, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Family, Horror', 'Robert Zemeckis, Don Burgess, Lee Grumett', 'Robert Zemeckis, Kenya Barris, Guillermo del Toro', 'Anne Hathaway, Octavia Spencer, Stanley Tucci, Jahzir Bruno, Chris Rock, Codie-Lei Eastick, Kristin Chenoweth, Charles Edwards', 'PG', 'In late 1967, a young orphaned boy goes to live with his loving grandma in the rural Alabama town of Demopolis. As the boy and his grandmother encounter some deceptively glamorous but thoroughly diabolical witches, she wisely whisks him away to a seaside resort. Regrettably, they arrive at precisely the same time that the world''s Grand High Witch has gathered.', 'In late 1967, a young orphaned boy goes to live with his loving grandma in the rural Alabama town of Demopolis. As the boy and his grandmother encounter some deceptively glamorous but thoroughly diabolical witches, she wisely whisks him away to a seaside resort. Regrettably, they arrive at precisely the same time that the world''s Grand High Witch has gathered.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ht6EfsM5hrsUPSR4ReJQFDVU71F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:531219'),
  ('174936728105852583', 'Roar', 1981, 'Adventure, Comedy, Horror, Thriller', 'Noel Marshall, Jan de Bont, James Allen', 'Noel Marshall', 'Tippi Hedren, Melanie Griffith, John Marshall, Jerry Marshall, Kyalo Mativo, Frank Tom, Steve Miller, Rick Glassey', null, 'Roar follows a family who are attacked by various African animals at the secluded home of their keeper.', 'Roar follows a family who are attacked by various African animals at the secluded home of their keeper.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oN7FZe6qNAAb46MpgbIyua8fJy7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2989'),
  ('638940171896870960', 'Roaring Across the Horizon', 1999, 'Drama, History', 'Chen Guoxing, 池小宁, Zhang Li', 'Huaiguo Chen, Jichao Peng', 'Li Xuejian, Li Youbin, Gao Ming, Chen Jin, Teng Rujun, Zhang Yongshou, Liu Lin, Tao Hai', null, 'After the Korean War, General Feng Shi leads a heroic army into the Gobi Desert on a mission from the Central Committee. At the same time, scientist Lu Guangda returns from the U.S. and says goodbye to his wife. As talented individuals from scientific institutions join the effort, they face harsh conditions—scarce resources, outdated technology, and frequent natural disasters—but work together toward a common goal.', 'After the Korean War, General Feng Shi leads a heroic army into the Gobi Desert on a mission from the Central Committee. At the same time, scientist Lu Guangda returns from the U.S. and says goodbye to his wife. As talented individuals from scientific institutions join the effort, they face harsh conditions—scarce resources, outdated technology, and frequent natural disasters—but work together toward a common goal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6dINOOqXHjRwHHX0gDq2PE2irp5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:364544'),
  ('732691898036111565', 'Roaring Fire', 1981, 'Action, Crime, Drama, Comedy', 'Norifumi Suzuki, Kiyoshi Kitasaka', 'Shinsuke Inoue, Norifumi Suzuki, Seiko Shimura', 'Hiroyuki Sanada, Sonny Chiba, Etsuko Shihomi, Mikio Narita, Larry Shreve, Toshiaki Minami, Tatsuo Endō, Shōtarō Hayashi', 'R', 'On his death bed the man who raised Joji reveals that he is not his real father and that Joji’s real parents died tragically in a plane crash. Shortly thereafter Joji goes to Japan is search of his sister and his twin brother Toru. Joji’s quickly finds his sister Chihiro who is now blind and lives with their uncle. Joji one evening accidently over hears his uncle who has ties to the criminal underworld discussing his various illegal operations. Joji ‘s eavesdropping is discovered by his uncle who offers him a chance to join the organization. Joji promptly turns his uncle’s offer down which immediately puts his life in danger.', 'On his death bed the man who raised Joji reveals that he is not his real father and that Joji’s real parents died tragically in a plane crash. Shortly thereafter Joji goes to Japan is search of his sister and his twin brother Toru. Joji’s quickly finds his sister Chihiro who is now blind and lives with their uncle. Joji one evening accidently over hears his uncle who has ties to the criminal underworld discussing his various illegal operations. Joji ‘s eavesdropping is discovered by his uncle who offers him a chance to join the organization. Joji promptly turns his uncle’s offer down which immediately puts his life in danger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mM6Y20D4Pn8wCEi1tEgEDX6Nxw4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64563'),
  ('620267009277605371', 'Roaring Years', 1962, 'Comedy', 'Luigi Zampa, Carlo Carlini, Paolo Bianchini', 'Luigi Zampa, Ettore Scola, Ruggero Maccari', 'Nino Manfredi, Gino Cervi, Michèle Mercier, Gastone Moschin, Salvo Randone, Angela Luce, Rosalia Maggio, Giuseppe Ianigro', null, 'In this satire inspired by Nikolai Gogol’s The Government Inspector (aka The Inspector General) and transported to fascist era Italy, the (supposed) incognito visit of a Roman fascist official to a tiny country town shakes deeply the ruling class and their lack of integrity.', 'In this satire inspired by Nikolai Gogol’s The Government Inspector (aka The Inspector General) and transported to fascist era Italy, the (supposed) incognito visit of a Roman fascist official to a tiny country town shakes deeply the ruling class and their lack of integrity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ixC9mNfY9PhFda4RaE1mLTGRcgm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42414'),
  ('464921592744605151', 'ROB', 2026, 'Comedy, Documentary, Drama', 'Andrew Sanchez', 'Robert Angel Lopez, Andrew Sanchez', 'Robert Angel Lopez, Palesa Mogapi, Andrew Sanchez, Daniel Plascencia, Cal Jordan', 'PG-13', 'ROB, a young LA native, moves to Portland for school, only to drop out almost immediately and settle into a comfortable routine of doing absolutely nothing. What follows is a mostly self-inflicted journey through failure, small awakenings, and the long road to becoming a barely functional adult.', 'ROB, a young LA native, moves to Portland for school, only to drop out almost immediately and settle into a comfortable routine of doing absolutely nothing. What follows is a mostly self-inflicted journey through failure, small awakenings, and the long road to becoming a barely functional adult.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5iuwxsuZ4sQDVMRv5raW1UdcTVr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1666512'),
  ('410526469689262018', 'Rob N Roll', 2024, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Albert Mak Kai-Kwong, Davy Tsou Lin-Yau, Chow Long Ting', 'Albert Mak Kai-Kwong, Ryker Chan, Man Uen-Ching', 'Aaron Kwok, Gordon Lam Ka-Tung, Richie Jen, Maggie Cheung Ho-Yee, Nancy Wu, Lam Suet, Leung Chung-Hang, Calvert Fu Ka-Tsun', null, 'A fierce robber has plotted a major heist. But unfortunately, his plan was unintentionally foiled by two dispirited middle-aged best friends, and the stolen cash disappears.', 'A fierce robber has plotted a major heist. But unfortunately, his plan was unintentionally foiled by two dispirited middle-aged best friends, and the stolen cash disappears.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3yZx8wV4YtrgJI6O0vPtDKIDXWh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:991197'),
  ('541187561522113882', 'Rob Peace', 2024, 'Drama, History', 'Stephanie Fox, Ksenia Sereda, Kit Bland', 'Chiwetel Ejiofor', 'Jay Will, Mary J. Blige, Chiwetel Ejiofor, Camila Cabello, Michael Kelly, Mare Winningham, Gbenga Akinnagbe, Juan Castano', 'R', 'An underprivileged, gifted young black man from Newark reaches Yale University, only for shadows and injustices from his past to threaten his future.', 'An underprivileged, gifted young black man from Newark reaches Yale University, only for shadows and injustices from his past to threaten his future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1BwKbTidW5QaEKb1pVY3p4u9cVg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1084514'),
  ('234102582474973946', 'Rob Roy', 1995, 'Adventure, History, Drama, Action, War', 'Karl Walter Lindenlaub, Michael Caton-Jones', 'Alan Sharp', 'Liam Neeson, Jessica Lange, John Hurt, Tim Roth, Eric Stoltz, Brian Cox, Jason Flemyng, Andrew Keir', 'R', 'In the highlands of Scotland in the 1700s, Rob Roy tries to lead his small town to a better future, by borrowing money from the local nobility to buy cattle to herd to market. When the money is stolen, Rob is forced into a Robin Hood lifestyle to defend his family and honour.', 'In the highlands of Scotland in the 1700s, Rob Roy tries to lead his small town to a better future, by borrowing money from the local nobility to buy cattle to herd to market. When the money is stolen, Rob is forced into a Robin Hood lifestyle to defend his family and honour.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kWI2rF6RAnRtEjfBlZgsXumgOm5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11780'),
  ('1134788227224523311', 'Rob Roy, The Highland Rogue', 1953, 'Action, Adventure, War', 'Harold French, Guy Green', 'Lawrence Edward Watkin', 'Richard Todd, Glynis Johns, James Robertson Justice, Michael Gough, Finlay Currie, Jean Taylor Smith, Geoffrey Keen, Archie Duncan', 'NR', 'After the 1715 defeat of the clans, one of the highland leaders, Rob Roy MacGregor escapes, has lots of adventures, gets married, and eventually becomes enough of a nuisance to George I to be outlawed, and hunted by the English', 'After the 1715 defeat of the clans, one of the highland leaders, Rob Roy MacGregor escapes, has lots of adventures, gets married, and eventually becomes enough of a nuisance to George I to be outlawed, and hunted by the English', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ebNAkZDzKFj0cfpqcJdeY5R6hzS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59180'),
  ('230199286466335080', 'Rob the Mob', 2014, 'Crime, Drama', 'Raymond De Felitta, Christopher Norr', 'Jonathan Fernandez', 'Michael Pitt, Nina Arianda, Andy Garcia, Ray Romano, Griffin Dunne, Michael Rispoli, Yul Vazquez, Frank Whaley', 'R', 'The true-life story of a crazy-in-love Queens couple who robbed a series of mafia social clubs and got away with it… for a while… until they stumble upon a score bigger than they ever planned and become targets of both the mob and the FBI.', 'The true-life story of a crazy-in-love Queens couple who robbed a series of mafia social clubs and got away with it… for a while… until they stumble upon a score bigger than they ever planned and become targets of both the mob and the FBI.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9wAHoj1yEkbWkLWR3IH6kxsUzgm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:243935'),
  ('202030208342686949', 'Rob-B-Hood', 2006, 'Drama, Action, Comedy', 'Benny Chan Muk-Sing, Anthony Pun Yiu-Ming', 'Benny Chan Muk-Sing, Jackie Chan, Alan Yuen Kam-Lun', 'Jackie Chan, Louis Koo, Michael Hui Koon-Man, Teresa Carpio, Yuen Biao, Gao Yuanyuan, Charlene Choi Chuek-Yin, Terence Yin Chi-Wai', null, 'For never-do-well compulsive gambler Fong, there''s only one thing more fearsome than debtors at his doorstep - having to coax a crying baby. But what if the baby becomes his golden goose to fend off his debtors? Can he overcome his phobia of diapers, milk bottles, and cloying lullabies?', 'For never-do-well compulsive gambler Fong, there''s only one thing more fearsome than debtors at his doorstep - having to coax a crying baby. But what if the baby becomes his golden goose to fend off his debtors? Can he overcome his phobia of diapers, milk bottles, and cloying lullabies?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aJZ8i1KEy5Kdc6hXNlLiHOlhdTA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25676'),
  ('245455059060834260', 'Rob1n', 2025, 'Horror, Thriller, Drama', 'Lawrence Fowler', 'Lawrence Fowler', 'Ethan Taylor, Leona Clarke, Simon Davies, Michaela Longden, Luke James, Maximillian Cherry, Lucas Edwards, Gareth Tidball', 'NR', 'When a robotics expert channels the grief of losing his 11 year-old son into building ''Robin'', a fully functioning robotic doll, a series of horrific events makes it clear Robin will do whatever it takes to have his creator all to himself.', 'When a robotics expert channels the grief of losing his 11 year-old son into building ''Robin'', a fully functioning robotic doll, a series of horrific events makes it clear Robin will do whatever it takes to have his creator all to himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5lJ2ftNE18iYGCdOQsQirzHHtnX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1443260'),
  ('266307269231998934', 'Robbers'' Roost', 1955, 'Action, Drama, Romance, Western', 'Sidney Salkow, Jack Draper, Jaime Contreras', 'John O''Dea, Sidney Salkow, Maurice Geraghty', 'George Montgomery, Richard Boone, Sylvia Findley, Bruce Bennett, Peter Graves, Tony Romano, Warren Stevens, William Hopper', 'PG-13', 'Jim "Tex" Wall, searching for the last of the three men who raped and killed his wife, joins a gang of cattle rustlers led by Hank Hays. Both Hays'' outlaws and a rival gang headed by Heesman, have been hired as ranch hands by "Bull" Herrick, a cripple who owns a large cattle ranch and wants to get his large herd to market. He theorizes that the two gangs will be kept busy watching each other and neither will rustle his cattle. Helen has little faith in her brother''s contrived plan, and hates and distrusts both groups. She begins to soften toward Jim, but abruptly changes when she sees a reward poster which says he has killed two men.', 'Jim "Tex" Wall, searching for the last of the three men who raped and killed his wife, joins a gang of cattle rustlers led by Hank Hays. Both Hays'' outlaws and a rival gang headed by Heesman, have been hired as ranch hands by "Bull" Herrick, a cripple who owns a large cattle ranch and wants to get his large herd to market. He theorizes that the two gangs will be kept busy watching each other and neither will rustle his cattle. Helen has little faith in her brother''s contrived plan, and hates and distrusts both groups. She begins to soften toward Jim, but abruptly changes when she sees a reward poster which says he has killed two men.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o1GB79FPUYDdadBqUMN5rBbfJHN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:241819'),
  ('872521820450147334', 'Robbery', 1967, 'Crime, Thriller, Drama', 'Peter Yates, Douglas Slocombe, Derek Cracknell', 'George Markstein', 'Stanley Baker, Joanna Pettet, James Booth, Frank Finlay, Barry Foster, William Marlowe, George Sewell, Glynn Edwards', null, 'In this fictionalised account of the Great Train Robbery, career criminal Paul Clifton plans an audacious crime: the robbery of a mail train carrying millions in cash.', 'In this fictionalised account of the Great Train Robbery, career criminal Paul Clifton plans an audacious crime: the robbery of a mail train carrying millions in cash.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jgxfBWr94Ykw8KM3Fg7EInr813U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73208'),
  ('383121508000586564', 'Robbery Alla Turca', 2005, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Crime', 'Oğuzhan Tercan', 'Haluk Özenç', 'Haluk Bilginer, Mehmet Ali Erbil, Gamze Özçelik, Birol Ünel, Gülse Birsel, Fatih Akin, Dost Elver, Mustafa Turan', null, 'With the death of a billionaire engaged in illegal practices, his billion-dollar fortune is up for the grabs. As his art collection is being prepared to be sold at an auction, two Turkish thieves from Germany are hired to steal valuable paintings from the art collection. Meanwhile, Seckin the fashioner designer - also the brother of Binnur, wife of the late billionaire - prepares for a fashion show in the same hotel that the robbery is going to take place. With the intervention of police, the beautiful model and her ex-lover, a hip papparazi, the two "Laz" mafia bosses seeking revenge, and the getaway driver straight out of Selcuk Erdem caricatures, the robbery is bound to go wrong. Prepare for a twist at the end as the plot unfolds towards a climactic ending...', 'With the death of a billionaire engaged in illegal practices, his billion-dollar fortune is up for the grabs. As his art collection is being prepared to be sold at an auction, two Turkish thieves from Germany are hired to steal valuable paintings from the art collection. Meanwhile, Seckin the fashioner designer - also the brother of Binnur, wife of the late billionaire - prepares for a fashion show in the same hotel that the robbery is going to take place. With the intervention of police, the beautiful model and her ex-lover, a hip papparazi, the two "Laz" mafia bosses seeking revenge, and the getaway driver straight out of Selcuk Erdem caricatures, the robbery is bound to go wrong. Prepare for a twist at the end as the plot unfolds towards a climactic ending...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k33lqXh6wFjYpTSRtDPE7y0Axn6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49891'),
  ('500519963257169484', 'Robbery at 3 O''clock', 1962, 'Comedy', 'José María Forqué', 'Rafael J. Salvia, Pedro Masó', 'José Luis López Vázquez, Cassen, Gracita Morales, Manuel Alexandre, Manuel Díaz González, Katia Loritz, José Orjas, Agustín González', null, 'When their beloved boss is ousted for a tyrannical one, a group of bank employees plot to rob the bank themselves.', 'When their beloved boss is ousted for a tyrannical one, a group of bank employees plot to rob the bank themselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yGKTy8zwl9ixwTuONzR28MyD1AM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71767'),
  ('616676833536246416', 'Robbie the Reindeer: Hooves of Fire', 1999, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, TV Movie', 'Richard Starzak, Fred Reed', 'Kevin Cecil, Richard Curtis, Andy Riley', 'Ardal O''Hanlon, Steve Coogan, Jane Horrocks, Harry Enfield, Alistair McGowan, Caroline Quentin, Paul Whitehouse, Ricky Tomlinson', null, 'Robbie the Reindeer arrives at the North Pole, ready to take his place as navigator on Santa''s Christmas sleigh team. However, Robbie is soon plagued by doubt regarding his ability, and sets out to regain his self-respect and the admiration of his team-mates.', 'Robbie the Reindeer arrives at the North Pole, ready to take his place as navigator on Santa''s Christmas sleigh team. However, Robbie is soon plagued by doubt regarding his ability, and sets out to regain his self-respect and the admiration of his team-mates.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r0xVWX3pNNscD9YMn0qXBMl11wl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13399'),
  ('580787452874308834', 'Robbing Mussolini', 2022, 'Action, Crime, Comedy', 'Renato De Maria, Gian Filippo Corticelli', 'Renato De Maria, Valentina Strada, Federico Gnesini', 'Pietro Castellitto, Matilda De Angelis, Tommaso Ragno, Isabella Ferrari, Filippo Timi, Alberto Astorri, Maccio Capatonda, Luigi Fedele', null, 'Near the end of WWII, a young bootlegger and his nightclub-singing girlfriend assemble a ragtag team for an dangerous heist: to steal Mussolini''s treasure right from his headquarters.', 'Near the end of WWII, a young bootlegger and his nightclub-singing girlfriend assemble a ragtag team for an dangerous heist: to steal Mussolini''s treasure right from his headquarters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cbdHqb0kZTgF7jQbUw41KEYVInb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:873125'),
  ('334850843176083853', 'Robby', 1968, 'Family, Adventure, Drama', 'Ralph C. Bluemke, Jeff Mullin', 'Ralph C. Bluemke', 'Warren Raum, Ryp Siani, John Garces, Rita Elliot, John Woodbridge, Ralph C. Bluemke, Norvin Baskerville', null, 'Shipwrecked on a tropical island, a young boy befriends an abandoned native youth, forcing him to reevaluate societal prejudice about race, religion and nudity.', 'Shipwrecked on a tropical island, a young boy befriends an abandoned native youth, forcing him to reevaluate societal prejudice about race, religion and nudity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kJLQOvwyg5CcZyOplq7HGv5JtF9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:137520'),
  ('116887874535019953', 'Robby and Toby''s Fantastic Voyager', 2016, 'Adventure, Family, Comedy', 'Wolfgang Groos, Armin Golisano, Lars Parlaska', 'Jan Berger', 'Arsseni Bultmann, Alexandra Maria Lara, Sam Riley, Friedrich Mücke, Bjarne Mädel, Ralph Caspers, Jördis Triebel, Melina Mardini', null, 'One day, robot Robby enters into a life of the most creative little boy, Toby. Robby had been separated from his robot parents when his spaceship crashed. Toby decides to offer his help and the two of them become friends.', 'One day, robot Robby enters into a life of the most creative little boy, Toby. Robby had been separated from his robot parents when his spaceship crashed. Toby decides to offer his help and the two of them become friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ssCEE0bfj5gawzwZeGfqrGQtU3f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:394823'),
  ('132304696075783984', 'Robert', 2015, 'Horror', 'Jonathan McLaughlin, Andrew Jones', 'Andrew Jones', 'Suzie Frances Garton, Lee Bane, Flynn Allen, Judith Haley, Cyd Casados, Samuel Hutchison, Megan Lockhurst, Ryan Michaels', null, 'A family is terrorized by an evil doll named Robert, which seems to come to life after an elderly housekeeper is dismissed. As the attacks grow more intense, the parents struggle with their disbelief and fear while trying to break the curse before it''s too late.', 'A family is terrorized by an evil doll named Robert, which seems to come to life after an elderly housekeeper is dismissed. As the attacks grow more intense, the parents struggle with their disbelief and fear while trying to break the curse before it''s too late.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cP3giyle6Dq2Ii9hqps5c44h0Aa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:356149'),
  ('1078357035533590716', 'Robert et Robert', 1978, 'Comedy', 'Claude Lelouch', 'Claude Lelouch', 'Charles Denner, Jacques Villeret, Jean-Claude Brialy, Francis Perrin, Mohamed Zinet, Régine, Macha Méril, Germaine Montero', null, 'Robert #1 is played by Charles Denner, while Robert #2 is played by Jacques Villeret. Beyond their common name, the two Roberts are as different as night and day. Oh, there is one more resemblance: both Roberts are lonely, and both hope to meet suitable mates through a computer dating service. As they await the arrival of their new dates, Robert et Robert become fast friends. Of the three favorite film subjects of writer/director Claude Lelouch--romance, crime, and politics--Robert et Robert falls firmly into the first category.', 'Robert #1 is played by Charles Denner, while Robert #2 is played by Jacques Villeret. Beyond their common name, the two Roberts are as different as night and day. Oh, there is one more resemblance: both Roberts are lonely, and both hope to meet suitable mates through a computer dating service. As they await the arrival of their new dates, Robert et Robert become fast friends. Of the three favorite film subjects of writer/director Claude Lelouch--romance, crime, and politics--Robert et Robert falls firmly into the first category.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aRXMIOtypXrN2zQWHcAVp6QjGUh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:265582'),
  ('1089510773003533378', 'Robert the Bruce', 2019, 'Drama, History', 'Cameron Nugent, Richard Gray, John Garrett', 'Angus Macfadyen, Eric Belgau', 'Angus Macfadyen, Anna Hutchison, Zach McGowan, Gabriel Bateman, Talitha Eliana Bateman, Brandon Lessard, Diarmaid Murtagh, Emma Kenney', null, 'In 1306, Scottish King Robert the Bruce turns a defeated outlaw when his country is invaded. But before to free his sacred land, he must manage to regain his will to fight back and survive the persecution of those who want take his head and the English gold.', 'In 1306, Scottish King Robert the Bruce turns a defeated outlaw when his country is invaded. But before to free his sacred land, he must manage to regain his will to fight back and survive the persecution of those who want take his head and the English gold.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e6eNN4EpGtbXAbsR97QgjnjHs6s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:532812'),
  ('186264993540069450', 'Robert Zimmermann Is Tangled Up in Love', 2008, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Leander Haußmann', 'Gernot Gricksch', 'Tom Schilling, Maruschka Detmers, Christian Sengewald, Julia Dietze, Peter Jordan, David Gruschka, Aaron Le, James Garfunkel', null, 'Robert works as a gamedev in Hamburg and, together with his team, which includes his best friend and flatmate Ole and his girlfriend Lorna, is on the verge of completing an innovative first-person shooter. Before the Chinese businessmen arrive, Robert goes to the nearby sausage stand with Ole and messes up his gray suit with ketchup. On the spur of the moment, he goes to a nearby dry cleaner and asks the ladies working there for quick help. Normally he would have to wait a day, but Monika promises to clean the suit within two hours. Robert''s reaction seems a little strange, but no one can yet suspect that he has just fallen head over heels in love with the attractive woman in her mid-forties.', 'Robert works as a gamedev in Hamburg and, together with his team, which includes his best friend and flatmate Ole and his girlfriend Lorna, is on the verge of completing an innovative first-person shooter. Before the Chinese businessmen arrive, Robert goes to the nearby sausage stand with Ole and messes up his gray suit with ketchup. On the spur of the moment, he goes to a nearby dry cleaner and asks the ladies working there for quick help. Normally he would have to wait a day, but Monika promises to clean the suit within two hours. Robert''s reaction seems a little strange, but no one can yet suspect that he has just fallen head over heels in love with the attractive woman in her mid-forties.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8KPwYjCiRU5y69w9rDUceXGiL8P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51916'),
  ('83801909746131929', 'Robert. A Fortunate Life', 1997, 'Documentary, History', 'Aleksandr Sokurov, Alexey Fedorov', 'Aleksandr Sokurov', 'Aleksandr Sokurov', null, 'Aleksander Sokurov brings the treasures of the Hermitage back into the light by making films about artists and their paintings. He has chosen the painter Hubert Robert, who spent a long time in Italy, and whose preference was for creating ancient ruined landscapes and naturalistic portrayals of times past. He was successful with the wealthy, who bought his works from him. The camera pans across the paintings while Sokurov speaks of a happy era, when the artist was at one with the spirit of the times, and agreed with the taste of his clients. Just how far removed from us this is, is shown by pictures of a "Nô" performance which are inter-cut on the screen. No words are necessary to describe what everybody knows today.', 'Aleksander Sokurov brings the treasures of the Hermitage back into the light by making films about artists and their paintings. He has chosen the painter Hubert Robert, who spent a long time in Italy, and whose preference was for creating ancient ruined landscapes and naturalistic portrayals of times past. He was successful with the wealthy, who bought his works from him. The camera pans across the paintings while Sokurov speaks of a happy era, when the artist was at one with the spirit of the times, and agreed with the taste of his clients. Just how far removed from us this is, is shown by pictures of a "Nô" performance which are inter-cut on the screen. No words are necessary to describe what everybody knows today.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Bou66bgiURuh49T0WC3ZfBUTmN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:142404'),
  ('689153067105272566', 'Roberta', 1935, 'Comedy, Music, Romance', 'William A. Seiter, Edward Cronjager, Carroll Clark', 'Allan Scott, Sam Mintz, Jane Murfin', 'Irene Dunne, Fred Astaire, Ginger Rogers, Randolph Scott, Helen Westley, Claire Dodd, Victor Varconi, Luis Alberni', 'NR', 'Football player John Kent tags along as Huck Haines and the Wabash Indianians travel to an engagement in Paris, only to lose it immediately. John and company visit his aunt, owner of a posh fashion house run by her assistant, Stephanie. There they meet the singer Scharwenka (alias Huck''s old friend Lizzie), who gets the band a job. Meanwhile, Madame Roberta passes away and leaves the business to John and he goes into partnership with Stephanie.', 'Football player John Kent tags along as Huck Haines and the Wabash Indianians travel to an engagement in Paris, only to lose it immediately. John and company visit his aunt, owner of a posh fashion house run by her assistant, Stephanie. There they meet the singer Scharwenka (alias Huck''s old friend Lizzie), who gets the band a job. Meanwhile, Madame Roberta passes away and leaves the business to John and he goes into partnership with Stephanie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i4apYC87andlqfn5IhbxZN3b8Up.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31798'),
  ('44650301741952207', 'Roberto Benigni: TuttoBenigni', 1983, 'Comedy, Documentary', 'Giuseppe Bertolucci, Renato Tafuri, Stefano Consiglio', 'Roberto Benigni, Giuseppe Bertolucci', 'Roberto Benigni', null, 'The film presents many clips taken from the television and theatrical shows of the Tuscan comedian who makes fun of the habits of the Italians and of the governing politics of the eighties.', 'The film presents many clips taken from the television and theatrical shows of the Tuscan comedian who makes fun of the habits of the Italians and of the governing politics of the eighties.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lvIHZPhP1UQCKS5zMi3jhHdW6fS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:252477'),
  ('816882205956237809', 'Roberto Carlos e o Diamante Cor-de-Rosa', 1970, 'Music, Adventure', 'Roberto Farias, José Medeiros', 'Roberto Farias', 'Roberto Carlos, Erasmo Carlos, Wanderléa, José Lewgoy, Paulo Porto', null, 'A statuette bought in an antique shop in Tokyo may lead to the discovery of a great treasure.', 'A statuette bought in an antique shop in Tokyo may lead to the discovery of a great treasure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nqnyaTxneUAVbKkbbCHMNr0mSbr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:233815'),
  ('286457393236293680', 'Roberto Carlos, Looking for Adventure', 1968, 'Adventure, Music, Science Fiction', 'Roberto Farias, Reginaldo Faria, David Havt', 'Paulo Mendes Campos, Roberto Farias', 'Roberto Carlos, José Lewgoy, Reginaldo Faria, David Cardoso, Rose Passini, Jorge de Oliveira, Wanderléa, Márcia Gonçalves', null, 'While making a movie in Rio de Janeiro, the singer Roberto Carlos is kidnapped by an international gang that wants to make money with his songs in a computer, together with Pierre, the villain of the movie, and sent to New York.', 'While making a movie in Rio de Janeiro, the singer Roberto Carlos is kidnapped by an international gang that wants to make money with his songs in a computer, together with Pierre, the villain of the movie, and sent to New York.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jeOYLAiznVAyNgLokTMMGEdijPt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:191384'),
  ('91579056580725459', 'Roberto Saviano: Writing Under Police Protection', 2016, 'Documentary, TV Movie', 'Pif', 'Pif, Luca Monarca, Federica Campana', 'Pif, Roberto Saviano, Rosaria Capacchione, Raimondo Di Maio, Mirella Pignataro', null, 'An upbeat and humorous account of the hard life under police protection led by Italian writer Roberto Saviano since the publication in 2006 of Gomorrah, his controversial book about the Camorra, the ruthless organization that has dominated the criminal underground in Naples for centuries.', 'An upbeat and humorous account of the hard life under police protection led by Italian writer Roberto Saviano since the publication in 2006 of Gomorrah, his controversial book about the Camorra, the ruthless organization that has dominated the criminal underground in Naples for centuries.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m5SVkiAOzzl4h1M9BI9CiGMmDm0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:521867'),
  ('102492574506875863', 'Roberto Succo', 2001, 'Drama', 'Cédric Kahn, Pascal Marti, Valérie Ménard', 'Cédric Kahn', 'Stefano Cassetti, Isild Le Besco, Patrick Dell''Isola, Viviana Aliberti, Estelle Perron, Leyla Sassi, Catherine Decastel, Olivia Carbonini', null, '''Kurt'' claims to be a sales rep. He also claims to be English in spite of his heavy Italian accent. Kurt is an habitual liar and a dangerous driver, at the very least. In the south of France he meets Léa, age 16. Between his increasingly strange dates with Léa, Kurt engages in a number of armed robberies, some successful, some not... The police are perplexed by a series of crimes including disappearances and a murder. They conclude that they are dealing with a madman... After he proposes, Léa breaks up with Kurt. The attempt to find a new girlfriend leads to a shooting by Kurt, now calling himself André. Léa''s information identifies Kurt/André as Roberto Succo, psychiatric patient and parental murderer. The police hunt for Roberto covers three countries.', '''Kurt'' claims to be a sales rep. He also claims to be English in spite of his heavy Italian accent. Kurt is an habitual liar and a dangerous driver, at the very least. In the south of France he meets Léa, age 16. Between his increasingly strange dates with Léa, Kurt engages in a number of armed robberies, some successful, some not... The police are perplexed by a series of crimes including disappearances and a murder. They conclude that they are dealing with a madman... After he proposes, Léa breaks up with Kurt. The attempt to find a new girlfriend leads to a shooting by Kurt, now calling himself André. Léa''s information identifies Kurt/André as Roberto Succo, psychiatric patient and parental murderer. The police hunt for Roberto covers three countries.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2NIZzWvJJv97bmRFFpxEyFfFBVf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82550'),
  ('887251536942382096', 'Robin and Marian', 1976, 'Adventure, Romance', 'David Watkin, Richard Lester, José López Rodero', 'James Goldman', 'Sean Connery, Audrey Hepburn, Robert Shaw, Richard Harris, Nicol Williamson, Denholm Elliott, Ronnie Barker, Ian Holm', 'PG', 'Robin Hood, aging none too gracefully, returns exhausted from the Crusades to woo and win Maid Marian one last time.', 'Robin Hood, aging none too gracefully, returns exhausted from the Crusades to woo and win Maid Marian one last time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y2UlVt6U8mFeegVL42rZjD5y6c7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10786'),
  ('395178614920192251', 'Robin and the 7 Hoods', 1964, 'Music, Comedy, Crime', 'Gordon Douglas, William H. Daniels, Michael Daves', 'David R. Schwartz', 'Frank Sinatra, Dean Martin, Sammy Davis Jr., Bing Crosby, Peter Falk, Barbara Rush, Victor Buono, Edward G. Robinson', 'NR', 'Set in Prohibition era Chicago, bootlegger Robbo and his cronies refuse to pay the greedy Guy Gisborne a cut of their profits after Guy shoots mob boss Big Jim and takes over. When Big Jim''s daughter, Marian, gives Robbo a large sum, believing he has avenged her father''s death, the gangster donates to an orphanage, cementing his reputation as a softhearted hood.', 'Set in Prohibition era Chicago, bootlegger Robbo and his cronies refuse to pay the greedy Guy Gisborne a cut of their profits after Guy shoots mob boss Big Jim and takes over. When Big Jim''s daughter, Marian, gives Robbo a large sum, believing he has avenged her father''s death, the gangster donates to an orphanage, cementing his reputation as a softhearted hood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1jqQdHnuIDaHB3owOb3BcD5xZgX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17696'),
  ('686819415934851213', 'Robin Hood', 1922, 'Adventure, Romance', 'Allan Dwan, Arthur Edeson, Charles Richardson', 'Kenneth Davenport, Allan Dwan, Edward Knoblock', 'Douglas Fairbanks, Enid Bennett, Wallace Beery, Sam De Grasse, Alan Hale, Bud Geary, Willard Louis, Lloyd Talman', null, 'Amid big-budget medieval pageantry, King Richard goes on the Crusades leaving his brother Prince John as regent, who promptly emerges as a cruel, grasping, treacherous tyrant. Apprised of England''s peril by message from his lady-love Marian, the dashing Earl of Huntingdon endangers his life and honor by returning to oppose John, but finds himself and his friends outlawed, with Marian apparently dead. Enter Robin Hood, acrobatic champion of the oppressed, laboring to set things right through swashbuckling feats and cliffhanging perils!', 'Amid big-budget medieval pageantry, King Richard goes on the Crusades leaving his brother Prince John as regent, who promptly emerges as a cruel, grasping, treacherous tyrant. Apprised of England''s peril by message from his lady-love Marian, the dashing Earl of Huntingdon endangers his life and honor by returning to oppose John, but finds himself and his friends outlawed, with Marian apparently dead. Enter Robin Hood, acrobatic champion of the oppressed, laboring to set things right through swashbuckling feats and cliffhanging perils!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/baqMnZbAFPsfbaAOPRU1eJlCRdj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71066'),
  ('295000366277391441', 'Robin Hood', 1973, 'Animation, Family, Adventure', 'Herb Taylor, Wolfgang Reitherman', 'Ken Anderson', 'Brian Bedford, Phil Harris, Andy Devine, Monica Evans, Peter Ustinov, Terry-Thomas, Pat Buttram, Carole Shelley', 'G', 'With King Richard off to the Crusades, Prince John and his slithering minion, Sir Hiss, set about taxing Nottingham''s citizens with support from the corrupt sheriff - and staunch opposition by the wily Robin Hood and his band of merry men.', 'With King Richard off to the Crusades, Prince John and his slithering minion, Sir Hiss, set about taxing Nottingham''s citizens with support from the corrupt sheriff - and staunch opposition by the wily Robin Hood and his band of merry men.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x9AvkYek0bGdxQSZ8W3lAjGrREm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11886'),
  ('675945211840652920', 'Robin Hood', 1991, 'Adventure, TV Movie', 'John Irvin, Jason Lehel, Tim Lewis', 'Sam Resnick, John McGrath', 'Patrick Bergin, Uma Thurman, Jürgen Prochnow, Edward Fox, Jeroen Krabbé, Owen Teale, Danny Webb, David Morrissey', 'PG-13', 'The Swashbuckling legend of Robin Hood unfolds in the 12th century when the mighty Normans ruled England with an iron fist.', 'The Swashbuckling legend of Robin Hood unfolds in the 12th century when the mighty Normans ruled England with an iron fist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3wvHxskniqALjqFBjHn6xPbUvzj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30840'),
  ('499376099542517331', 'Robin Hood', 2010, 'Action, Adventure, History', 'Ridley Scott, John Mathieson, Max Keene', 'Brian Helgeland', 'Russell Crowe, Cate Blanchett, Max von Sydow, William Hurt, Mark Strong, Oscar Isaac, Danny Huston, Eileen Atkins', 'PG-13', 'When soldier Robin happens upon the dying Robert of Loxley, he promises to return the man''s sword to his family in Nottingham. There, he assumes Robert''s identity; romances his widow, Marion; and draws the ire of the town''s sheriff and King John''s henchman, Godfrey.', 'When soldier Robin happens upon the dying Robert of Loxley, he promises to return the man''s sword to his family in Nottingham. There, he assumes Robert''s identity; romances his widow, Marion; and draws the ire of the town''s sheriff and King John''s henchman, Godfrey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ldOLoEroWISvPvqTY2IgnuEUWTq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20662'),
  ('429913402918674773', 'Robin Hood', 2018, 'Adventure, Action, Thriller, Fantasy', 'Dan Channing-Williams, Simon Crane, Otto Bathurst', 'David James Kelly, Ben Chandler', 'Taron Egerton, Jamie Foxx, Ben Mendelsohn, Eve Hewson, Jamie Dornan, Tim Minchin, Paul Anderson, F. Murray Abraham', 'PG-13', 'A war-hardened Crusader and his Moorish commander mount an audacious revolt against the corrupt English crown.', 'A war-hardened Crusader and his Moorish commander mount an audacious revolt against the corrupt English crown.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AiRfixFcfTkNbn2A73qVJPlpkUo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:375588'),
  ('727478928052952508', 'Robin Hood - The Trapalhão of the Forest', 1974, 'Adventure, Comedy, Family', 'J.B. Tanko, Antônio Gonçalves', 'Gilvan Pereira, J.B. Tanko', 'Renato Aragão, Dedé Santana, Monique Lafond, Jorge Cherques, Milton Vilar, Olívia Pineschi, Mário Cardoso, Francisco Dantas', null, 'The Robin Hood from the movie The Trapalhões and his pack ruin the plans of a farmer named João Climério. He wanted to take the lands of his deceased brother and leave his niece Catherine with nothing. During a showdown, Robin Hood is injured and needs to be replaced at the helm of the group. And then the funny confusions begin! As a substitute is chosen Zé Grilo, a modest and at the same time confused pawn, who in the end manages to unmask Climero and save the beautiful Catherine for which he has a passion. In this mission it is aided by the companion Willie and also by a magic wand and a protective pen, provided by an Indian sorcerer.', 'The Robin Hood from the movie The Trapalhões and his pack ruin the plans of a farmer named João Climério. He wanted to take the lands of his deceased brother and leave his niece Catherine with nothing. During a showdown, Robin Hood is injured and needs to be replaced at the helm of the group. And then the funny confusions begin! As a substitute is chosen Zé Grilo, a modest and at the same time confused pawn, who in the end manages to unmask Climero and save the beautiful Catherine for which he has a passion. In this mission it is aided by the companion Willie and also by a magic wand and a protective pen, provided by an Indian sorcerer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pj0Sl8OEtCpQlhoJsCHQb8PMMqh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:407528'),
  ('568435121257144214', 'Robin Hood – The Musical Spectacle', 2014, 'Family, Music', 'Yves Aucoin, Michel Laprise, Karim Ouaret', null, 'M. Pokora, Stéphanie Bédard, Dominique Mattei (Dumè), Caroline Costa, Sacha Tran, Nyco Lilliu, Marc-Antoine Jr', null, 'A live recording of an amended version of the Robin Hood story, staged at the Palaís des congrès de Paris in January 2014.', 'A live recording of an amended version of the Robin Hood story, staged at the Palaís des congrès de Paris in January 2014.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fDo8uZvckempo1RF63Tr0knyVQb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:302329'),
  ('265998707376410432', 'Robin Hood Daffy', 1958, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Chuck Jones', null, 'Mel Blanc', 'NR', 'Daffy attempts to convince Porky, as Friar Tuck, that he really is Robin Hood.', 'Daffy attempts to convince Porky, as Friar Tuck, that he really is Robin Hood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jlWl85dTRxjZnOOr6jD9g4u0dY6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88765'),
  ('613047353031425240', 'Robin Hood Makes Good', 1939, 'Animation', 'Chuck Jones', null, 'Mel Blanc, Bernice Hansen', null, 'A fox captures two young squirrels while they''re playing "Robin Hood". Their small younger friend uses his ingenuity to try to rescue them.', 'A fox captures two young squirrels while they''re playing "Robin Hood". Their small younger friend uses his ingenuity to try to rescue them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nveepFtO9PRd24pdN6lzWzf3qQQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:188382'),
  ('732702986223820134', 'Robin Hood: Men in Tights', 1993, 'Comedy', 'Mel Brooks, Michael D. O''Shea, Gregg Goldstone', 'Mel Brooks, J.D. Shapiro, Evan Chandler', 'Cary Elwes, Richard Lewis, Roger Rees, Amy Yasbeck, Dave Chappelle, Isaac Hayes, Mark Blankfield, Eric Allan Kramer', 'PG-13', 'Robin Hood comes home after fighting in the Crusades to learn that the noble King Richard is in exile and that the despotic King John now rules England, with the help of the Sheriff of Rottingham. Robin Hood assembles a band of fellow patriots to do battle with King John and the Sheriff.', 'Robin Hood comes home after fighting in the Crusades to learn that the noble King Richard is in exile and that the despotic King John now rules England, with the help of the Sheriff of Rottingham. Robin Hood assembles a band of fellow patriots to do battle with King John and the Sheriff.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/woexOLEkUlYsPLLuZRK6LjZaF38.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8005'),
  ('455276624415539728', 'Robin Hood: Prince of Thieves', 1991, 'Action, Adventure, Drama', 'Douglas Milsome, Kevin Reynolds, David Tringham', 'John Watson, Pen Densham', 'Kevin Costner, Morgan Freeman, Mary Elizabeth Mastrantonio, Christian Slater, Alan Rickman, Geraldine McEwan, Michael McShane, Brian Blessed', 'PG-13', 'Nobleman crusader Robin of Locksley breaks out of a Jerusalem prison with the help of Moorish fellow prisoner Azeem and travels back home to England. But upon arrival he discovers his dead father in the ruins of his family estate, killed by the vicious sheriff of Nottingham, Robin and Azeem join forces with outlaws Little John and Will Scarlett to save the kingdom from the sheriff''s villainy.', 'Nobleman crusader Robin of Locksley breaks out of a Jerusalem prison with the help of Moorish fellow prisoner Azeem and travels back home to England. But upon arrival he discovers his dead father in the ruins of his family estate, killed by the vicious sheriff of Nottingham, Robin and Azeem join forces with outlaws Little John and Will Scarlett to save the kingdom from the sheriff''s villainy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hbRnWUNJkKKVN5mkcuC5ooqjE4e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8367'),
  ('235771789094225382', 'Robin Hood: The Rebellion', 2018, 'Adventure, History, Action', 'Nicholas Winter', 'Nicholas Winter', 'Ben Freeman, Brian Blessed, Marie Everett, Jamie Kenna, James G. Nunn, James Oliver Wheatley, James Groom, Charlie Hiett', null, 'With his true love captured by the villainous Sheriff of Nottingham, the legendary Robin Hood and his crew of outlaws execute a daring rescue to save her.', 'With his true love captured by the villainous Sheriff of Nottingham, the legendary Robin Hood and his crew of outlaws execute a daring rescue to save her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yYbJl9D2woKQTXVOaQs01Qs7CCa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:549165'),
  ('218754618488334149', 'Robin Hood: The True Story', 2015, 'Comedy, Adventure', 'Anthony Marciano, Jean-Paul Agostini', 'Anthony Marciano, Max Boublil', 'Max Boublil, Gérard Darmon, Patrick Timsit, Géraldine Nakache, Ary Abittan, Eric Metzger, Quentin Margot, Malik Bentalha', null, 'Robin des Bois, with his friend Tuck, are bad guy: they only steal poor, women and old people. They dream to get they own brothel in town, like the Pussycat. They decide to rob Nottingham''s tax office, but they meet the Sherwood gang - who steal to rich to feed the poors - with the same idea in mind: Robbing the Nottingham sherif. The true story of Robin des Bois can finally begins!', 'Robin des Bois, with his friend Tuck, are bad guy: they only steal poor, women and old people. They dream to get they own brothel in town, like the Pussycat. They decide to rob Nottingham''s tax office, but they meet the Sherwood gang - who steal to rich to feed the poors - with the same idea in mind: Robbing the Nottingham sherif. The true story of Robin des Bois can finally begins!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vPLiA275R1xeg7RhkTLFO0WXGpy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:325516'),
  ('84056705477154793', 'Robin Hoodwinked', 1958, 'Animation, Comedy, Adventure', 'William Hanna, Joseph Barbera', null, 'Bill Thompson, Lucille Bliss', 'NR', 'Jerry and a friend overhear that Robin Hood is imprisoned; they set off to free him, but first they have to contend with his guard, Tom.', 'Jerry and a friend overhear that Robin Hood is imprisoned; they set off to free him, but first they have to contend with his guard, Tom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lhmWA9rKrkD1kgnfGkx7DVu90rn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77053'),
  ('751788349657910612', 'Robin of Locksley', 1996, 'Adventure, Drama, TV Movie', 'Mark Irwin, Michael Kennedy', 'Larry Sugar, William T. Conway', 'Devon Sawa, Sarah Chalke, Billy O''Sullivan, Tyler Labine, Colin Cunningham, Joshua Jackson, Tom Butler, Chad Todhunter', 'PG', 'Teenage Robin and his family move from Kansas City to Seattle after winning the lottery. Robin attends Locksley Academy, a wealthy private school, where he – alongside some new friends – concocts a plan to help an injured friend whose surgery money is stolen by the head of a very wealthy corporation.', 'Teenage Robin and his family move from Kansas City to Seattle after winning the lottery. Robin attends Locksley Academy, a wealthy private school, where he – alongside some new friends – concocts a plan to help an injured friend whose surgery money is stolen by the head of a very wealthy corporation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tKwWL6nSIp9juvYESKiW4AWiXLd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:113175'),
  ('142430733855292767', 'Robin Redbreast', 1970, 'Horror, Mystery, TV Movie', 'James MacTaggart, Brian Tufano', 'John Bowen', 'Anna Cropper, Amanda Walker, Julian Holloway, Freda Bamford, Bernard Hepton, Andy Bradford, Cyril Cross, Robin Wentworth', null, 'After the break-up of a long-term relationship, urban sophisticate Norah seeks refuge in a remote house in the country.', 'After the break-up of a long-term relationship, urban sophisticate Norah seeks refuge in a remote house in the country.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mxpcU2ByrlX0lhRT4aXE1BdR3Kv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:233383'),
  ('237502845397223517', 'Robin Robin', 2021, 'Animation, Adventure, Family', 'Mikey Please, Dave Alex Riddet, Daniel Ojari', 'Mikey Please, Sam Morrison, Daniel Ojari', 'Bronte Carmichael, Richard E. Grant, Gillian Anderson, Adeel Akhtar, Amira Macey-Michael, Tom Pegler, Endeavour Clutterbuck, Megan Harris', 'G', 'A bird raised by mice begins to question where she belongs and sets off on a daring journey of self-discovery.', 'A bird raised by mice begins to question where she belongs and sets off on a daring journey of self-discovery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bKIdlJbd17rrIm4oZzhXTbmqpon.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:649928'),
  ('2833139713699220', 'Robin Williams: An Evening at the Met', 1986, 'Comedy, TV Movie', 'Bruce Gowers', 'Robin Williams', 'Robin Williams', null, 'In this hilarious stand up comedy, Robin Williams is energetic, witty and again hilarious. It''s the number one stand up comedy of all time.', 'In this hilarious stand up comedy, Robin Williams is energetic, witty and again hilarious. It''s the number one stand up comedy of all time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5adS4LUGL9xi6XudEZt2vOd4rqq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21586'),
  ('257953007967465807', 'Robin Williams: Come Inside My Mind', 2018, 'Documentary', 'Marina Zenovich, Jenna Rosher, Wolfgang Held', null, 'Robin Williams, Mark Rasmussen, Stan Wilson, Valerie Velardi, David Letterman, Bennett Tramer, McLaurin Smith-Williams, Frankie Williams', null, 'A funny, intimate and heartbreaking portrait of one of the world’s most beloved and inventive comedians, Robin Williams, told largely through his own words. Celebrates what he brought to comedy and to the culture at large, from the wild days of late-1970s L.A. to his death in 2014.', 'A funny, intimate and heartbreaking portrait of one of the world’s most beloved and inventive comedians, Robin Williams, told largely through his own words. Celebrates what he brought to comedy and to the culture at large, from the wild days of late-1970s L.A. to his death in 2014.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ak9DZnzInl9oIUlXxsFsUd37ueh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:493100'),
  ('693610114273846101', 'Robin Williams: Live on Broadway', 2002, 'Comedy, TV Movie, Documentary', 'Marty Callner', 'Robin Williams', 'Robin Williams', 'R', '2002 HBO Stand-up Special starring Robin Williams. Recorded and broadcast live from New Your City''s Broadway Theater at the culmination of his historic 2002 sold-out tour, this special finds the Oscar-winning actor/writer/comedian returning after 16 years to his stand-up roots to deliver what the Washington Post calls "...in its madcap way, a seminal cultural event."', '2002 HBO Stand-up Special starring Robin Williams. Recorded and broadcast live from New Your City''s Broadway Theater at the culmination of his historic 2002 sold-out tour, this special finds the Oscar-winning actor/writer/comedian returning after 16 years to his stand-up roots to deliver what the Washington Post calls "...in its madcap way, a seminal cultural event."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/omCkeQubfAtjJetFV2edOC3yhRB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20211'),
  ('326823907439192547', 'Robin Williams: Weapons of Self Destruction', 2009, 'Comedy, Documentary, TV Movie', 'Marty Callner', 'Robin Williams', 'Robin Williams', 'R', 'HBO presents one of the most gifted and revered performers of our time, Academy-Award winning Robin Williams, starring in his fifth exclusive HBO special, taped before a live audience at Washington''s Constitution Hall.', 'HBO presents one of the most gifted and revered performers of our time, Academy-Award winning Robin Williams, starring in his fifth exclusive HBO special, taped before a live audience at Washington''s Constitution Hall.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kjEElgEFtAtyadUt8JayBLUw5Sf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26621'),
  ('146231418768445833', 'Robin''s Wish', 2021, 'Documentary', 'Tylor Norwood', null, 'Robin Williams, Susan Schneider Williams, Shawn Levy, John R. Montgomery, David E. Kelley, Rick Overton', 'NR', 'The final word in the story of what really happened to Robin Williams at the end of his life, focusing on his fight against a deadly neurodegenerative disorder known as Lewy body dementia.', 'The final word in the story of what really happened to Robin Williams at the end of his life, focusing on his fight against a deadly neurodegenerative disorder known as Lewy body dementia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eLmuW6tlMbTDnOOYJB94AOnf1GI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:729798'),
  ('115520744453600056', 'Robinson Crusoe', 1902, 'Adventure', 'Georges Méliès', 'Georges Méliès', 'Georges Méliès, André Deed', null, 'Georges Méliès adaptation of Robinson Crusoe, the first film adaptation of the story. Filmed in black & white, Méliès would then paint the film by hand to colour it. Originally a 15 minute film, twelve and a half minutes of painted film have been found and have been restored.', 'Georges Méliès adaptation of Robinson Crusoe, the first film adaptation of the story. Filmed in black & white, Méliès would then paint the film by hand to colour it. Originally a 15 minute film, twelve and a half minutes of painted film have been found and have been restored.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nQJSJGYG1ALZP9Hlw21ZijHUWhX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:137388'),
  ('432716921829828681', 'Robinson Crusoe', 1954, 'Adventure, Drama', 'Luis Buñuel, Alex Phillips, Ignacio Villareal', 'Luis Buñuel, Hugo Butler, Luis Alcoriza', 'Dan O''Herlihy, Jaime Fernández, Felipe de Alba, Chel López, José Chávez, Emilio Garibay', 'PG', 'The titular adventurer, after defying his parents to go to sea, survives a shipwreck and becomes a castaway on a deserted island for nearly thirty years, learning to build a new life from scratch, discovering companionship with a native man he names Friday, and eventually returning to civilisation a changed man, finding wealth and new challenges.', 'The titular adventurer, after defying his parents to go to sea, survives a shipwreck and becomes a castaway on a deserted island for nearly thirty years, learning to build a new life from scratch, discovering companionship with a native man he names Friday, and eventually returning to civilisation a changed man, finding wealth and new challenges.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jZU3j6mVlidq5G1Hr6wpfS1Pwlj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54979'),
  ('559175954214195072', 'Robinson Crusoe', 1970, 'Adventure, Drama, Family', 'René Cardona Jr., José Ortiz Ramos', 'René Cardona Jr., Mario A. Zacarías', 'Hugo Stiglitz, Ahui Camacho, Carlos Agostí, Al Coster, Victor Eberg', null, 'The classic Daniel Defoe tale as told by a narrating tiger that witnesses castaway Robinson Crusoe''s struggles to survive the man-eating cannibals on the tropical island', 'The classic Daniel Defoe tale as told by a narrating tiger that witnesses castaway Robinson Crusoe''s struggles to survive the man-eating cannibals on the tropical island', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n43LOFDWeP9r0YdsYE7xSgeLhn3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:265590'),
  ('513501540729815119', 'Robinson Crusoe', 1997, 'Adventure, Drama', 'George T. Miller, Rod Hardy, David Connell', 'Christopher Lofton, Tracy Keenan Wynn, Christopher Canaan', 'Pierce Brosnan, Polly Walker, Ian Hart, James Frain, Damian Lewis, William Takaku, Ben Robertson, Martin Grace', 'PG-13', 'Robinson Crusoe flees Britain on a ship after killing his friend over the love of Mary. A fierce ocean storm wrecks his ship and leaves him stranded by himself on an uncharted island. Left to fend for himself, Crusoe seeks out a tentative survival on the island, until he meets Friday, a tribesman whom he saves from being sacrificed. Initially, Crusoe is thrilled to finally have a friend, but he has to defend himself against the tribe who uses the island to sacrifice tribesman to their gods. During time their relationship changes from master-slave to a mutual respected friendship despite their difference in culture and religion.', 'Robinson Crusoe flees Britain on a ship after killing his friend over the love of Mary. A fierce ocean storm wrecks his ship and leaves him stranded by himself on an uncharted island. Left to fend for himself, Crusoe seeks out a tentative survival on the island, until he meets Friday, a tribesman whom he saves from being sacrificed. Initially, Crusoe is thrilled to finally have a friend, but he has to defend himself against the tribe who uses the island to sacrifice tribesman to their gods. During time their relationship changes from master-slave to a mutual respected friendship despite their difference in culture and religion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/93uRPzVpf4ZVjDfswmpsrAmBS4w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11210'),
  ('1064994193228469458', 'Robinson Crusoe', 2003, 'Adventure, Drama, Family', 'Thierry Chabert', 'Frédéric Vitoux', 'Pierre Richard, Nicolas Cazalé, Jean-Claude Leguay, Marie Béraud, Aurora Basnuevo, Ulyk Anello, Jennifer Lauret, Stéphane Demers', null, 'The classical story of Robinson Crusoe, a man who is dragged to a desert island after a shipwreck.', 'The classical story of Robinson Crusoe, a man who is dragged to a desert island after a shipwreck.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/isMmsoWhN0ebhOpbiM82Rc2kkH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62119'),
  ('136689621255698786', 'Robinson Crusoe', 2016, 'Animation, Adventure, Family', 'Vincent Kesteloot', 'Domonic Paris', 'Ilka Bessin, Dieter Hallervorden, Matthias Schweighöfer, Aylin Tezel, Kaya Yanar, Ron Allen, Tommy Morgenstern, Melanie Hinze', 'PG', 'On a tiny exotic island, Tuesday, an outgoing parrot lives with his quirky animal friends in paradise. However, Tuesday can''t stop dreaming about discovering the world. After a violent storm, Tuesday and his friends wake up to find a strange creature on the beach: Robinson Crusoe. Tuesday immediately views Crusoe as his ticket off the island to explore new lands. Likewise, Crusoe soon realizes that the key to surviving on the island is through the help of Tuesday and the other animals. It isn''t always easy at first, as the animals don''t speak "human." Slowly but surely, they all start living together in harmony, until one day, when their comfortable life is overturned by two savage cats, who wish to take control of the island. A battle ensues between the cats and the group of friends but Crusoe and the animals soon discover the true power of friendship up against all odds (even savage cats).', 'On a tiny exotic island, Tuesday, an outgoing parrot lives with his quirky animal friends in paradise. However, Tuesday can''t stop dreaming about discovering the world. After a violent storm, Tuesday and his friends wake up to find a strange creature on the beach: Robinson Crusoe. Tuesday immediately views Crusoe as his ticket off the island to explore new lands. Likewise, Crusoe soon realizes that the key to surviving on the island is through the help of Tuesday and the other animals. It isn''t always easy at first, as the animals don''t speak "human." Slowly but surely, they all start living together in harmony, until one day, when their comfortable life is overturned by two savage cats, who wish to take control of the island. A battle ensues between the cats and the group of friends but Crusoe and the animals soon discover the true power of friendship up against all odds (even savage cats).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oW2CeCoFJKD57iyml0vWGRKKPaI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:368940'),
  ('1106897772311759602', 'Robinson Crusoe and Friday', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Gürcan Yurt', 'Gürcan Yurt', 'Serhat Kılıç, John Nyambi, Beyti Engin, Damla Debre, Ebru Yücel, Emre Karayel, Devin Özgür Çınar, Hakan Bulut', null, 'The film, adapted from the "Robinson Crusoe & Friday" comic book series written by Gürcan Yurt. Robinson Crusoe and Cuma, who celebrate the 15th anniversary of ending up on a desert island, see a ship approaching shore when their troubles about loneliness come out. An adventurer man whose name is Viktor has run away from retrogressive world together with his animals in the ship and has been looking for a new place to survive. Furthermore, he did not come alone to the island. His two beautiful daughters, one of them is stepchild, made this journey with him. Donelya and Yanarin who grew up in abbey discipline are two young and attractive girls. Robinson and Cuma embrace this guests and their ordinary life starts to be more exciting. The buddies who fall in love with girls before long try all the ways to score. However, Viktor "a conservative dad" is an important obstacle for them. Even so Robinson and Cuma try to struggle determinedly for their love.', 'The film, adapted from the "Robinson Crusoe & Friday" comic book series written by Gürcan Yurt. Robinson Crusoe and Cuma, who celebrate the 15th anniversary of ending up on a desert island, see a ship approaching shore when their troubles about loneliness come out. An adventurer man whose name is Viktor has run away from retrogressive world together with his animals in the ship and has been looking for a new place to survive. Furthermore, he did not come alone to the island. His two beautiful daughters, one of them is stepchild, made this journey with him. Donelya and Yanarin who grew up in abbey discipline are two young and attractive girls. Robinson and Cuma embrace this guests and their ordinary life starts to be more exciting. The buddies who fall in love with girls before long try all the ways to score. However, Viktor "a conservative dad" is an important obstacle for them. Even so Robinson and Cuma try to struggle determinedly for their love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qjhKAtvHADmQAYQNoSugpqyx6Qq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:375625'),
  ('335897912209234669', 'Robinson Crusoe on Mars', 1964, 'Science Fiction, Adventure', 'Byron Haskin, Winton C. Hoch, Robert Goodstein', 'John C. Higgins, Ib Melchior', 'Paul Mantee, Victor Lundin, Adam West, The Woolly Monkey', 'NR', 'Stranded on Mars with only a monkey as a companion, an astronaut must figure out how to find oxygen, water, and food and companionship on the lifeless planet.', 'Stranded on Mars with only a monkey as a companion, an astronaut must figure out how to find oxygen, water, and food and companionship on the lifeless planet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a3MBNEoquGKZT5UYbq9o509dzTV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:7348'),
  ('791404153913105765', 'Robinson Crusoeland', 1951, 'Comedy', 'Léo Joannon, John Berry, Alfred J. Goulding', 'Frederick Kohner, René Wheeler, Piero Tellini', 'Stan Laurel, Oliver Hardy, Suzy Delair, Max Elloy, Félix Oudart, Adriano Rimoldi, Robert Murzeau, Luigi Tosi', 'NR', 'Stan and Ollie are marooned on an island in the south pacific ocean.', 'Stan and Ollie are marooned on an island in the south pacific ocean.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/86XVqC144ERq5AVxmSmYhF9bmRw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70106'),
  ('727178832948794053', 'Robinsonade, or My English Grandfather', 1987, 'Comedy', 'Nana Jorjadze, Levan Paatashvili', 'Irakli Kvirikadze', 'Zhanri Lolashvili, Nineli Chankvetadze, Guram Pirtskhalava, Elguja Burduli, Rusudan Bolqvadze, Tiko Eliosidze, Shalva Kherkheulidze, Giorgi Dadiani', null, 'The film tells a strange story, in flashback, about a British Telegraph Company’s engineer named Hughes appearing in a distant Guria village. Falling in love with the beautiful Anna, the Englishman became the enemy of her brother, Bolshevik Nestor. Both Hughes and Nestor were shot dead by Lavrenty Mgeladze, who had once had everything, but later was dispossessed and driven out of the village. The old Anna told that story to a young composer who recorded the music: “My dear homeland, why are you weeping?…”', 'The film tells a strange story, in flashback, about a British Telegraph Company’s engineer named Hughes appearing in a distant Guria village. Falling in love with the beautiful Anna, the Englishman became the enemy of her brother, Bolshevik Nestor. Both Hughes and Nestor were shot dead by Lavrenty Mgeladze, who had once had everything, but later was dispossessed and driven out of the village. The old Anna told that story to a young composer who recorded the music: “My dear homeland, why are you weeping?…”', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9s3lFQjhdnfC6a6wCTTyjCMlaX6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:149835'),
  ('890804421703010324', 'Robinù', 2016, 'Documentary', 'Michele Santoro', null, null, null, 'Child soldiers in Naples, known as the “paranza dei bambini,” have been involved in a violent gang war using Kalashnikovs, resulting in over 60 deaths. These young rebels have established a new Camorra law to control the drug market, operating in areas like Forcella, Decumani, Tribunali, and Porta Capuana, where tourists and locals coexist during the day, but drug dealing thrives at night.', 'Child soldiers in Naples, known as the “paranza dei bambini,” have been involved in a violent gang war using Kalashnikovs, resulting in over 60 deaths. These young rebels have established a new Camorra law to control the drug market, operating in areas like Forcella, Decumani, Tribunali, and Porta Capuana, where tourists and locals coexist during the day, but drug dealing thrives at night.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6rBCWnBDeM1mZVWiiFTZ6mG2qLg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:427965'),
  ('307439611680044797', 'Robo Vampire', 1988, 'Horror, Action, Thriller, Crime, Science Fiction', 'Anthony Mang, Joe Livingstone, Chang Seng-Kwong', 'William Palmer', 'Robin Mackay, Nian Watts, Harry Myles, Joe Browne, Nick Norman, George Tripos, David Borg, Diana Byrne', null, 'Narcotics agent Tom Wilde is given a second chance at life after being shot and killed. In a futuristic experiment, agent Wilde is returned to life as an Android Robot. He is sent on a very dangerous mission into the depths of the golden Triangle to rescue Sophie, a beautiful undercover agent who has been captured by the evil drug warlord Mr. Young and his inhuman creation the Vampire Beast.', 'Narcotics agent Tom Wilde is given a second chance at life after being shot and killed. In a futuristic experiment, agent Wilde is returned to life as an Android Robot. He is sent on a very dangerous mission into the depths of the golden Triangle to rescue Sophie, a beautiful undercover agent who has been captured by the evil drug warlord Mr. Young and his inhuman creation the Vampire Beast.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aOCqnXdg2J32pphIZZlSOnlVoV0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88377'),
  ('728729470080594571', 'Robo Warriors', 1996, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Ian Barry, John Stokes', 'Michael Berlin, Stuart Gordon', 'Kyle Howard, James Remar, Terry Markwell, James Lew, James With, Shielu Bharwani, James Tolkan, Dennis Creaghan', null, 'The year is 2036 and Earth has been invaded: hope lies with the last Robo Warrior - a towering fighting machine.', 'The year is 2036 and Earth has been invaded: hope lies with the last Robo Warrior - a towering fighting machine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pNIdiXE3gFnRqDjXwrgo8ZSscTZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38237'),
  ('830009188143615865', 'Robo-G', 2012, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Shinobu Yaguchi, Katsumi Yanagijima', 'Shinobu Yaguchi', 'Mickey Curtis, Gaku Hamada, Jyunya Kawashima, Yuriko Yoshitaka, Tomoko Tabata, Takehiko Ono, Emi Wakui, Seia Yasuda', null, 'Three engineers cannot make a robot work in time for a science show, and hire a man to inhabit the robot''s shell to save their jobs. The robot''s performance at the show attracts media attention and scrutiny from a science student.', 'Three engineers cannot make a robot work in time for a science show, and hire a man to inhabit the robot''s shell to save their jobs. The robot''s performance at the show attracts media attention and scrutiny from a science student.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4JwAEy4tBFb9mx4xdgE2hOwF9Pg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:123873'),
  ('646648245312737019', 'RoboCop', 1987, 'Action, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Jost Vacano, Paul Verhoeven, Mark Goldblatt', 'Michael Miner, Edward Neumeier', 'Peter Weller, Nancy Allen, Dan O''Herlihy, Ronny Cox, Kurtwood Smith, Miguel Ferrer, Robert DoQui, Ray Wise', 'R', 'In a violent, near-apocalyptic Detroit, evil corporation Omni Consumer Products wins a contract from the city government to privatize the police force. To test their crime-eradicating cyborgs, the company leads street cop Alex Murphy into an armed confrontation with crime lord Boddicker so they can use his body to support their untested RoboCop prototype. But when RoboCop learns of the company''s nefarious plans, he turns on his masters.', 'In a violent, near-apocalyptic Detroit, evil corporation Omni Consumer Products wins a contract from the city government to privatize the police force. To test their crime-eradicating cyborgs, the company leads street cop Alex Murphy into an armed confrontation with crime lord Boddicker so they can use his body to support their untested RoboCop prototype. But when RoboCop learns of the company''s nefarious plans, he turns on his masters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/esmAU0fCO28FbS6bUBKLAzJrohZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5548'),
  ('11720189144323696', 'RoboCop', 2014, 'Action, Adventure, Crime, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Jeff J.J. Authors, Penny Charter, George Marshall Ruge', 'Joshua Zetumer', 'Joel Kinnaman, Gary Oldman, Michael Keaton, Abbie Cornish, Jackie Earle Haley, Michael Kenneth Williams, Jennifer Ehle, Jay Baruchel', 'PG-13', 'In RoboCop, the year is 2028 and multinational conglomerate OmniCorp is at the center of robot technology. Overseas, their drones have been used by the military for years, but have been forbidden for law enforcement in America. Now OmniCorp wants to bring their controversial technology to the home front, and they see a golden opportunity to do it. When Alex Murphy – a loving husband, father and good cop doing his best to stem the tide of crime and corruption in Detroit – is critically injured, OmniCorp sees their chance to build a part-man, part-robot police officer. OmniCorp envisions a RoboCop in every city and even more billions for their shareholders, but they never counted on one thing: there is still a man inside the machine.', 'In RoboCop, the year is 2028 and multinational conglomerate OmniCorp is at the center of robot technology. Overseas, their drones have been used by the military for years, but have been forbidden for law enforcement in America. Now OmniCorp wants to bring their controversial technology to the home front, and they see a golden opportunity to do it. When Alex Murphy – a loving husband, father and good cop doing his best to stem the tide of crime and corruption in Detroit – is critically injured, OmniCorp sees their chance to build a part-man, part-robot police officer. OmniCorp envisions a RoboCop in every city and even more billions for their shareholders, but they never counted on one thing: there is still a man inside the machine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gM5ql3BKYmHG3WtZ0buKXN7xY8O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:97020'),
  ('997145118747266817', 'RoboCop 2', 1990, 'Action, Adventure, Crime, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Mark Irwin, Irvin Kershner, Conrad E. Palmisano', 'Frank Miller, Walon Green', 'Peter Weller, Nancy Allen, Tom Noonan, Belinda Bauer, Willard E. Pugh, Dan O''Herlihy, Felton Perry, Gabriel Damon', 'R', 'After a successful deployment of the RoboCop Law Enforcement unit, OCP sees its goal of urban pacification come closer and closer, but as this develops, a new narcotic known as "Nuke" invades the streets led by God-delirious leader Cane. As this menace grows, it may prove to be too much for Murphy to handle. OCP tries to replicate the success of the first unit, but ends up with failed prototypes with suicidal issues... until Dr. Faxx, a scientist straying away from OCP''s path, uses Cane as the new subject for the RoboCop 2 project, a living God.', 'After a successful deployment of the RoboCop Law Enforcement unit, OCP sees its goal of urban pacification come closer and closer, but as this develops, a new narcotic known as "Nuke" invades the streets led by God-delirious leader Cane. As this menace grows, it may prove to be too much for Murphy to handle. OCP tries to replicate the success of the first unit, but ends up with failed prototypes with suicidal issues... until Dr. Faxx, a scientist straying away from OCP''s path, uses Cane as the new subject for the RoboCop 2 project, a living God.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nhqBxhOJXUJeFsyLxTFkctH9H5F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5549'),
  ('851482962934947413', 'RoboCop 3', 1993, 'Action, Adventure, Crime, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Gary B. Kibbe, Fred Dekker, John Wildermuth', 'Fred Dekker, Frank Miller', 'Robert John Burke, Nancy Allen, Rip Torn, John Castle, Jill Hennessy, CCH Pounder, Mako, Robert DoQui', 'PG-13', 'The mega corporation Omni Consumer Products is still bent on creating their pet project, Delta City, to replace the rotting city of Detroit. Unfortunately, the inhabitants of the area have no intention of abandoning their homes simply for desires of the company. To this end, OCP have decided to force them to leave by employing a ruthless mercenary army to attack and harass them. An underground resistance begins and in this fight, RoboCop must decide where his loyalties lie.', 'The mega corporation Omni Consumer Products is still bent on creating their pet project, Delta City, to replace the rotting city of Detroit. Unfortunately, the inhabitants of the area have no intention of abandoning their homes simply for desires of the company. To this end, OCP have decided to force them to leave by employing a ruthless mercenary army to attack and harass them. An underground resistance begins and in this fight, RoboCop must decide where his loyalties lie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ppLSSwCuC5ERRWbu9H3R8SPL9AM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5550'),
  ('1107116950055052175', 'RoboCop: Prime Directives', 2001, 'Action, Thriller, Crime, Science Fiction', 'Julian Grant', 'Joseph O''Brien, Brad Abraham', 'Page Fletcher, Maurice Dean Wint, Maria del Mar, Geraint Wyn Davies, Leslie Hope, Anthony Lemke, Anthony J. Mifsud, Rebeka Coles-Budrys', 'R', 'Thirteen years after the original Robocop, Delta City, considered to be "The Safest Place On Earth!", has become a futuristic city owned and operated by OCP, and RoboCop, Alex Murphy has begun to feel his age. Murphy finds himself nearly obsolete, and must deal with the fact that his now-grown son James is an OCP executive, unaware that his father is still alive. Also, Murphy''s former partner, John Cable, has returned to Delta City as its new Security Commander. But slowly, new enemies arise, and Murphy and Cable begin an investigation into a mysterious villain known as the Bone Machine, unaware that they are coming dangerously close to exposing an evil group of OCP executives known as The Trust... which James Murphy is a part of. Desperate to prevent their sinister plans from being revealed, The Trust programs Murphy to kill John Cable...', 'Thirteen years after the original Robocop, Delta City, considered to be "The Safest Place On Earth!", has become a futuristic city owned and operated by OCP, and RoboCop, Alex Murphy has begun to feel his age. Murphy finds himself nearly obsolete, and must deal with the fact that his now-grown son James is an OCP executive, unaware that his father is still alive. Also, Murphy''s former partner, John Cable, has returned to Delta City as its new Security Commander. But slowly, new enemies arise, and Murphy and Cable begin an investigation into a mysterious villain known as the Bone Machine, unaware that they are coming dangerously close to exposing an evil group of OCP executives known as The Trust... which James Murphy is a part of. Desperate to prevent their sinister plans from being revealed, The Trust programs Murphy to kill John Cable...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z5SU0GNhcIVPYaahJtqKzKqAb6T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74236'),
  ('792161717664762373', 'RoboCop: The Future of Law Enforcement', 1994, 'Action, Science Fiction, Adventure, Crime, Fantasy, Thriller', 'Paul Lynch', 'Michael Miner, Edward Neumeier', 'Richard Eden, Andrea Roth, Cliff DeYoung, Sarah Campbell, Yvette Nipar, Blu Mankuma, Calvin Jung, Chris Kennedy', null, 'While tracking a ruthless killer, RoboCop and Madigan uncover a conspiracy between insane genius Dr. Cray Mallardo and ruthless OCP executive Chip Chayken, to develop a computer system linked to a human brain. Neuro-brain is created, a system capable of running the public services of the entire city. There''s just one glitch: a ghost named Diana inhabits the machine. As RoboCop gets too close to this kindred spirit, Chayken enlists the aid of a homicidal psychopath Pudface Morgan to kill him off.', 'While tracking a ruthless killer, RoboCop and Madigan uncover a conspiracy between insane genius Dr. Cray Mallardo and ruthless OCP executive Chip Chayken, to develop a computer system linked to a human brain. Neuro-brain is created, a system capable of running the public services of the entire city. There''s just one glitch: a ghost named Diana inhabits the machine. As RoboCop gets too close to this kindred spirit, Chayken enlists the aid of a homicidal psychopath Pudface Morgan to kill him off.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8wQzAAMhO0kEhJMdkfsh7HKBO7P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:552497'),
  ('857052222425178460', 'RoboCroc', 2013, 'Horror, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Alexander Krumov, Arthur Sinclair', 'Berkeley Anderson', 'Corin Nemec, Dee Wallace, Lisa McAllister, Florence Brudenell-Bruce, Atanas Srebrev, Steven Hartley, Jackson Bews, Quinlan Hill', null, 'A rocket carrying nano robots crash lands shortly after takeoff into a zoo. The bots are released and find their way into a massive crocodile. The croc, now programmed to kill, will target anything and anyone for its next meal.', 'A rocket carrying nano robots crash lands shortly after takeoff into a zoo. The bots are released and find their way into a massive crocodile. The croc, now programmed to kill, will target anything and anyone for its next meal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gsurzan9Ml5OyUR7ybzhqw60yz5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:221737'),
  ('519017880820712591', 'RoboDoc', 2009, 'Comedy', 'Stephen Maddocks', 'Doug Gordon, Scott Gordon', 'Alan Thicke, David Faustino, Corin Nemec, David DeLuise, Michael Winslow, William Haze, Brooke Newton, Andrea Faustino', 'R', 'Plagued by uninsured patients, greedy insurance companies, heartless health care conglomerates, and stressed out doctors, the health care delivery system is on the verge of a total breakdown - and Jake Gorman couldn''t be happier as suing doctors has made Jake a famous and very wealthy man. Jake never met a doctor he couldn''t sue, until now.', 'Plagued by uninsured patients, greedy insurance companies, heartless health care conglomerates, and stressed out doctors, the health care delivery system is on the verge of a total breakdown - and Jake Gorman couldn''t be happier as suing doctors has made Jake a famous and very wealthy man. Jake never met a doctor he couldn''t sue, until now.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7QODKUCUYUyWyliyIwQKpdQWE5M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25990'),
  ('893882808860772111', 'RoboGeisha', 2009, 'Action, Comedy, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Noboru Iguchi, Tsuyoshi Kazuno, Yasutaka Nagano', 'Noboru Iguchi', 'Aya Kiguchi, Hitomi Hasebe, Takumi Saitoh, Tarō Shigaki, Etsuko Ikuta, Suzuki Matsuo, Naoto Takenaka, Asami', null, 'Sisters Yoshie and Kikue are two Geisha who are abducted by a mysterious organization to be transformed into murderous cyborg assassins.', 'Sisters Yoshie and Kikue are two Geisha who are abducted by a mysterious organization to be transformed into murderous cyborg assassins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7fN1ZDG7sumIgndF8KfzEAvzkL8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39260'),
  ('755300390339598294', 'Robosapien: Rebooted', 2013, 'Adventure, Family, Science Fiction', 'Sean McNamara, Christian Sebaldt', 'Max Botkin, Jason Bourque', 'Penelope Ann Miller, David Eigenberg, Bobby Coleman, Kim Coates, Joaquim de Almeida, Jae Head, Buddy Lewis, Holliston Coleman', 'PG', 'A robotic boy and a human boy join forces to save their parents from the organization that funded the robot''s creator.', 'A robotic boy and a human boy join forces to save their parents from the organization that funded the robot''s creator.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gaqSskw7kNNpyZjtW5QA8nnKQUn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:187462'),
  ('13592955249031060', 'Robot & Frank', 2012, 'Science Fiction, Comedy, Drama, Crime', 'Jake Schreier, Matthew J. Lloyd', 'Christopher Ford', 'Frank Langella, Liv Tyler, James Marsden, Susan Sarandon, Peter Sarsgaard, Jeremy Strong, Jeremy Sisto, Bonnie Bentley', 'PG-13', 'Curmudgeonly old Frank lives by himself. His routine involves daily visits to his local library, where he has a twinkle in his eye for the librarian. His grown children are concerned about their father’s well-being and buy him a caretaker robot. Initially resistant to the idea, Frank soon appreciates the benefits of robotic support – like nutritious meals and a clean house – and eventually begins to treat his robot like a true companion. With his robot’s assistance, Frank’s passion for his old, unlawful profession is reignited, for better or worse.', 'Curmudgeonly old Frank lives by himself. His routine involves daily visits to his local library, where he has a twinkle in his eye for the librarian. His grown children are concerned about their father’s well-being and buy him a caretaker robot. Initially resistant to the idea, Frank soon appreciates the benefits of robotic support – like nutritious meals and a clean house – and eventually begins to treat his robot like a true companion. With his robot’s assistance, Frank’s passion for his old, unlawful profession is reignited, for better or worse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/602vUwe1GPmaRvcrT3OQWqH1Nm1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84329'),
  ('650256235266439398', 'Robot Apocalypse', 2021, 'Science Fiction, Action', 'Richard Chapelle, Marcus Friedlander', 'Lauren Pritchard, Joe Roche', 'Tito Ortiz, Katalina Viteri, DeAngelo Davis, Jessica Chancellor, Noah Jay Wood, Barry Piacente, Olivia Crosby, Jeff Marchelletta', null, 'An expert hacker is targeted by a sentient AI after she realizes the threat it poses, and she must try to stay off its radar long enough to stop it.', 'An expert hacker is targeted by a sentient AI after she realizes the threat it poses, and she must try to stay off its radar long enough to stop it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zpbgktIR7GkOS83PBAzLlzLSQ5W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:854648'),
  ('881814686986200822', 'Robot Chicken: Star Wars', 2007, 'Animation, Comedy, Science Fiction, Action, TV Movie, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Seth Green, Jeff Gardner, Bryan Gardner', 'Seth Green, Jordan Allen-Dutton, Mike Fasolo', 'Seth Green, Abraham Benrubi, Keith Ferguson, Candace Bailey, Bob Bergen, Ahmed Best, Mark Hamill, Tom Kane', 'NR', 'A series of 30 sketches, following the hilarious antics of various characters from a galaxy, far, far away.', 'A series of 30 sketches, following the hilarious antics of various characters from a galaxy, far, far away.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h44WN4mVJ6wEpJgLaaNoFjv0NAo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42979'),
  ('771806777418727127', 'Robot Chicken: Star Wars Episode II', 2008, 'Science Fiction, Animation, Comedy, Action, Adventure, Fantasy, TV Movie', 'Seth Green', 'Mike Fasolo, Hugh Davidson, Seth Green', 'Seth Green, Abraham Benrubi, Bob Bergen, Ahmed Best, Breckin Meyer, Seth MacFarlane, Rachael Leigh Cook, Hugh Davidson', 'NR', 'Seth Green and Matthew Senreich serve up more hilarious Star Wars-inspired satire in this second compilation of sketches featuring the zany stop-motion animation of Adult Swim''s "Robot Chicken." Gary the stormtrooper deals with irascible boss Darth Vader on Take Your Daughter to Work Day, while Anakin babysits a certain up-and-coming Jedi.', 'Seth Green and Matthew Senreich serve up more hilarious Star Wars-inspired satire in this second compilation of sketches featuring the zany stop-motion animation of Adult Swim''s "Robot Chicken." Gary the stormtrooper deals with irascible boss Darth Vader on Take Your Daughter to Work Day, while Anakin babysits a certain up-and-coming Jedi.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dM5eCurdAXYd3Dvyr9Rz2YSj3rJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42982'),
  ('873903340885579613', 'Robot Chicken: Star Wars Episode III', 2010, 'Comedy, Science Fiction, Animation, TV Movie, Action, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Chris McKay, Christopher Covel', 'Seth Green, Breckin Meyer, Kevin Shinick', 'Seth Green, Abraham Benrubi, Zac Efron, Seth MacFarlane, Carrie Fisher, Donald Faison, Donald Glover, Breckin Meyer', null, 'Millions of years from now, after Socrates, Shakespeare and the bible are long forgotten, only two great works will remain: the sci-fi cinema epic Star Wars and Adult Swim''s stop-motion animated, cheap gag extravanganza Robot Chicken. And now, for the first time, they come together for the third time, in this all new special. That''s right, all your mot beloved Star Wars characters are going back through the comedy meat grinder.', 'Millions of years from now, after Socrates, Shakespeare and the bible are long forgotten, only two great works will remain: the sci-fi cinema epic Star Wars and Adult Swim''s stop-motion animated, cheap gag extravanganza Robot Chicken. And now, for the first time, they come together for the third time, in this all new special. That''s right, all your mot beloved Star Wars characters are going back through the comedy meat grinder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/htL6wH77hfO1N97n6MOwt9AD1oB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51888'),
  ('1078864534546777494', 'Robot Holocaust', 1986, 'Science Fiction', 'Tim Kincaid, Arthur D. Marks', 'Tim Kincaid', 'Norris Culf, Nadine Hartstein, J. Buzz Von Ornsteiner, Jennifer Delora, Andrew Howarth, Angelika Jager, Rick Gianasi, Michael Downend', null, 'Neo, a drifter from the atomic-blasted wastelands, arrives with his klutzy robot sidekick at a factory where slaves labor to fuel the sinister Dark One''s Power Station. There, he meets a comely woman who convinces him to help rescue her scientist father, who has invented a device that can break the Dark One''s control over the slaves. Gathering a motley crew of allies on the way, Neo and pals travel to the Power Station, where they confront the Dark One''s evil servants.', 'Neo, a drifter from the atomic-blasted wastelands, arrives with his klutzy robot sidekick at a factory where slaves labor to fuel the sinister Dark One''s Power Station. There, he meets a comely woman who convinces him to help rescue her scientist father, who has invented a device that can break the Dark One''s control over the slaves. Gathering a motley crew of allies on the way, Neo and pals travel to the Power Station, where they confront the Dark One''s evil servants.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9DiMdtWFAcykVd4c8WCpN8PcJdo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84760'),
  ('253349834811208981', 'Robot Jox', 1990, 'Science Fiction, Action', 'Stuart Gordon, Mac Ahlberg', 'Joe Haldeman', 'Gary Graham, Anne-Marie Johnson, Paul Koslo, Robert Sampson, Danny Kamekona, Hilary Mason, Michael Alldredge, Jeffrey Combs', 'PG', '50 years after a nuclear war, the two superpowers handle territorial disputes in a different way. Each fields a giant robot to fight one-on-one battles in official matches, each piloted by a man inside, known as robot jockeys or jox. The contest for possession of Alaska will be fought by two of the best. The conscientious Achilles fights for the Americans. Opposing him is a Russian, Alexander.', '50 years after a nuclear war, the two superpowers handle territorial disputes in a different way. Each fields a giant robot to fight one-on-one battles in official matches, each piloted by a man inside, known as robot jockeys or jox. The contest for possession of Alaska will be fought by two of the best. The conscientious Achilles fights for the Americans. Opposing him is a Russian, Alexander.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j8JgIZkmbpJ80HdR5mBT7fFpRSP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15618'),
  ('622633804280487423', 'Robot Monster', 1953, 'Science Fiction, Horror', 'Phil Tucker, Jack Greenhalgh, Robert E. Barnes', 'Wyott Ordung', 'George Nader, Claudia Barrett, Gregory Moffett, John Mylong, Selena Royle, Pamela Paulson, George Barrows, John Brown', null, 'Ro-Man, an alien robot who greatly resembles a gorilla in a diving helmet, is sent to earth to destroy all human life. Ro-Man falls in love with one of the last six remaining humans, and struggles to understand how his programming can instruct him to kill her while his heart demands that he can''t.', 'Ro-Man, an alien robot who greatly resembles a gorilla in a diving helmet, is sent to earth to destroy all human life. Ro-Man falls in love with one of the last six remaining humans, and struggles to understand how his programming can instruct him to kill her while his heart demands that he can''t.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5b4SKRHdSHCm2SZmrP26lnVC44x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43353'),
  ('200422175753428656', 'Robot Ninja', 1989, 'Science Fiction, Action, Horror', 'J.R. Bookwalter', 'J.R. Bookwalter', 'Michael Todd, Bogdan Pecic, Maria Markovic, Floyd Ewing Jr., Bill Morrison, James L. Edwards, Michael Kemper, Jon Killough', 'NR', 'A scientist helps a comic-book artist to become the superhero he has created in order to battle a vicious gang of rapists.', 'A scientist helps a comic-book artist to become the superhero he has created in order to battle a vicious gang of rapists.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jE42Gxi0U6g7ht6fSdlRAvycvVa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27649'),
  ('1078838766762026154', 'Robot on the Road', 2015, 'Science Fiction, Animation, Comedy', 'Hiroyuki Okiura, Takeshi Honda, Hiroyuki Okiura', 'Hiroyuki Okiura', 'Megumi Hayashibara, Koichi Yamadera', null, 'A perverted robot hitchhikes cross-country with an attractive woman in hopes of photographing her naked.', 'A perverted robot hitchhikes cross-country with an attractive woman in hopes of photographing her naked.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kRddjuaKatdVSjMalihgYHOdRhB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:375462'),
  ('688191623923026594', 'Robot Overlords', 2015, 'Science Fiction, Adventure, Action', 'Jon Wright, Fraser Taggart, John Marzano', 'Jon Wright, Mark Stay', 'Ben Kingsley, Gillian Anderson, Callan McAuliffe, Ella Hunt, Milo Parker, Geraldine James, Steven Mackintosh, Roy Hudd', 'PG-13', 'Earth has been conquered by robots from another galaxy and the human survivors must stay in their homes, or risk incineration.', 'Earth has been conquered by robots from another galaxy and the human survivors must stay in their homes, or risk incineration.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n9zyjUoTkcxWPC2osR2AdblPza1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:240483'),
  ('1076371466229494517', 'Robot Rabbit', 1953, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Friz Freleng', null, 'Mel Blanc, Arthur Q. Bryan', 'NR', 'Bugs Bunny faces off against Farmer Fudd''s robot.', 'Bugs Bunny faces off against Farmer Fudd''s robot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zrQLmdXRl5R7eoD79S7du3tsaf6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:204812'),
  ('928933373016075787', 'Robot Riot', 2020, 'Action, Science Fiction', 'Ryan Staples Scott', 'Aaron Mirtes, Ryan Staples Scott', 'Ryan Merriman, Jamie Costa, Cait Brasel, Sarah J. Bartholomew, Barrett Caroll Curtis, Jason Leyva, Brooks Ryan, Luke Wyckoff', null, 'Unconscious soldiers are dropped into a testing site only to discover their memories have been wiped and that once docile machines are the new intelligence.', 'Unconscious soldiers are dropped into a testing site only to discover their memories have been wiped and that once docile machines are the new intelligence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pXv4qbWyj6ycMaWkK2LzlizZQjf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:713825'),
  ('686908461222275682', 'Robot Stories', 2003, 'Drama, Science Fiction, Romance', 'Greg Pak', 'Greg Pak', 'Karen Tsen Lee, Glenn Kubota, Tamlyn Tomita, James Saito, Vin Knight, Gina Quintos, Wai Ching Ho, Cindy Cheung', null, 'Four stories including: "My Robot Baby," in which a couple must care for a robot baby before adopting a human child; "The Robot Fixer," in which a mother tries to connect with her dying son; "Machine Love," in which an office worker android learns that he, too, needs love; and "Clay," in which an old sculptor must choose between natural death and digital immortality.', 'Four stories including: "My Robot Baby," in which a couple must care for a robot baby before adopting a human child; "The Robot Fixer," in which a mother tries to connect with her dying son; "Machine Love," in which an office worker android learns that he, too, needs love; and "Clay," in which an old sculptor must choose between natural death and digital immortality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bXpVhiLaG8i1bIYaMEsC3pRJIkM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20032'),
  ('840261122444001935', 'Robot T-O', 2025, 'Comedy, Drama, Science Fiction', 'Tom Cucuel, Mathilde Ermeneux, Aurélien Marra', 'Giulio Callegari', 'Blanche Gardin, Angélique Flaugère, Laly Mercier, Xavier Lacaille, Georgia Scalliet, Édouard Sulpice, Gavril Dartevelle, Lucie Guien', null, 'In a near future, Max and her daughter are selling stolen robots on the black market. When Max loses custody of her daughter following their latest scheme, she must rely on the last robot she took, T-O, who is ready to do anything to help.', 'In a near future, Max and her daughter are selling stolen robots on the black market. When Max loses custody of her daughter following their latest scheme, she must rely on the last robot she took, T-O, who is ready to do anything to help.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eiu1bJEpBQeq5eyNHzuMhYWaLF2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1154725'),
  ('910044213198274682', 'Robot Wars', 1993, 'Action, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Albert Band, Aldo Antonelli, Adolfo Bartoli', 'Jackson Barr', 'Don Michael Paul, Barbara Crampton, James Staley, Lisa Rinna, Danny Kamekona, Yuji Okumoto, J. Downing, Peter Haskell', 'PG', 'In the year 2041, the rebel Centros are a plague to the survivors of the great toxic gas scare of 1993. A renegade Megarobot pilot and an archaeologist must team up (despite personal differences, a reluctant romance, and official pressure to cease and desist) to thwart the Centro''s attempts to resurrect a hidden Megarobot, with which they can challenge the prevailing order.', 'In the year 2041, the rebel Centros are a plague to the survivors of the great toxic gas scare of 1993. A renegade Megarobot pilot and an archaeologist must team up (despite personal differences, a reluctant romance, and official pressure to cease and desist) to thwart the Centro''s attempts to resurrect a hidden Megarobot, with which they can challenge the prevailing order.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wFMbece9Zl1hMgFegROfruDIfGD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40487'),
  ('791355243071909396', 'Robotech II: The Sentinels', 1988, 'Animation, Science Fiction', 'Carl Macek', 'Ardwight Chamberlain, Steve Kramer, Carl Macek', 'Tony Oliver, Melanie MacQueen, Rebecca Forstadt, Gregory Snegoff, Tom Wyner, Cam Clarke, Theodore Lehmann, Michael McConnohie', 'PG-13', 'Robotech II: The Sentinels was an attempt to continue the original 1985 Robotech television series. The project was cancelled in 1986. The aborted Sentinels series would have followed the ongoing adventures of Rick Hunter and Lisa Hayes and the rest of the Robotech Expeditionary Force (REF) during the events of The Robotech Masters and The New Generation series.', 'Robotech II: The Sentinels was an attempt to continue the original 1985 Robotech television series. The project was cancelled in 1986. The aborted Sentinels series would have followed the ongoing adventures of Rick Hunter and Lisa Hayes and the rest of the Robotech Expeditionary Force (REF) during the events of The Robotech Masters and The New Generation series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yed13FwpGTc8lg8R6ZM3vU8hKwt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23503'),
  ('944547133209059728', 'Robotech: The Movie', 1986, 'Animation, Action', 'Carl Macek, Noboru Ishiguro', 'Ardwight Chamberlain, Steve Kramer, Hiroyuki Hoshiyama', 'Kerrigan Mahan, Iona Morris, Diane Michelle, Edie Mirman, Michael McConnohie, Greg Finley, Tom Wyner, Wendee Lee', 'PG', 'In 1999 an alien spaceship crashed onto the earth. Hidden on board were the secrets of a unique science known as Robot technology. Databanks found in the ship were transferred to the Earth Robotech Computer Complex. In 2009, an alien search party arrived from hyper-space to reclaim their lost databank. The united Earth Government was forced into an Inter Galactic war. Earth forces were able to win the first battle... but at a great cost. The planet was virtually destroyed. New population centres grew out of the ashes... It is now 2027, a second armada sent by the aliens is nearing earth, they have come to recapture the secrets of their lost technology and then destroy the Earth.', 'In 1999 an alien spaceship crashed onto the earth. Hidden on board were the secrets of a unique science known as Robot technology. Databanks found in the ship were transferred to the Earth Robotech Computer Complex. In 2009, an alien search party arrived from hyper-space to reclaim their lost databank. The united Earth Government was forced into an Inter Galactic war. Earth forces were able to win the first battle... but at a great cost. The planet was virtually destroyed. New population centres grew out of the ashes... It is now 2027, a second armada sent by the aliens is nearing earth, they have come to recapture the secrets of their lost technology and then destroy the Earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vbkdLFe3kRmRp3VN8vHMWS70mEV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23504'),
  ('879678933392042907', 'Robotech: The Shadow Chronicles', 2006, 'Action, Adventure, Animation, Science Fiction', 'Tommy Yune', 'Ford Riley, Carl Macek, Frank Agrama', 'Richard Epcar, Eddie Frierson, Mark Hamill, Yuri Lowenthal, Alexandra Kenworthy, Tony Oliver, Kari Wahlgren, Arthur Santiago', 'PG', 'In the year 2044 AD, the human race has amped-up its space exploration and reached out to the stars through the miracle of ROBOTECHNOLOGY, but not without bringing intergalactic war upon the Earth itself. Heroes will die and allegiances will shift. But in the midst of combat, perhaps peace will spring up through the charred remains of battered history. One of the greatest science fiction sagas of all time continues...', 'In the year 2044 AD, the human race has amped-up its space exploration and reached out to the stars through the miracle of ROBOTECHNOLOGY, but not without bringing intergalactic war upon the Earth itself. Heroes will die and allegiances will shift. But in the midst of combat, perhaps peace will spring up through the charred remains of battered history. One of the greatest science fiction sagas of all time continues...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7jkmi0MqIP6XNRaFt0fHTV9VbiQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16364'),
  ('728206268432993118', 'Robotia, la película', 2024, 'Animation, Adventure', 'Diego Cagide, Diego Lucero, Jone Landaluze Iribarren', 'Mariano Alejandro Rojo, Beatriz Iso', 'Annabel Gallardo, Ariel Cister, Ana María Picchio, Valeria Stilman, Diego Recagno, Melina Macaggi, Andrés Ciavaglia, Lucía Baya Casal', null, 'In a world inhabited by androids, a girl dreams of playing soccer, despite her family''s prohibition. Her friends will come to her aid to help her fulfill her wish and show everyone what they are capable of, both on and off the field.', 'In a world inhabited by androids, a girl dreams of playing soccer, despite her family''s prohibition. Her friends will come to her aid to help her fulfill her wish and show everyone what they are capable of, both on and off the field.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uRH4QEaa38Pz7xOiBJDaWp50s8g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1229646'),
  ('861970473601834538', 'Robotix', 1990, 'Animation, Science Fiction, Action', null, null, 'Michael Bell, Arthur Burghardt, Corey Burton, Peter Cullen, Pat Fraley, Jason Maylor, Neil Ross, Susan Silo', 'G', 'As an Earthling crew of astronauts lose control, and crash land onto the warring planet of Skallor, housing alien races known as the "Protectons" and "Terracores." Huge war robots, the Robotix, are used to re-animate the souls of the deceased alien races. As several of the astronaut crew stray towards evil-doing, the good members use the help of the Robotix to help them get back to Earth.', 'As an Earthling crew of astronauts lose control, and crash land onto the warring planet of Skallor, housing alien races known as the "Protectons" and "Terracores." Huge war robots, the Robotix, are used to re-animate the souls of the deceased alien races. As several of the astronaut crew stray towards evil-doing, the good members use the help of the Robotix to help them get back to Earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6dpGgpKN38dALaVUM5X2nwaKbHS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40543'),
  ('1072668949310091764', 'Robotrix', 1991, 'Action, Comedy, Crime, Romance, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Jamie Luk Kim-Ming, Yeung Jim', 'Jamie Luk Kim-Ming', 'Amy Yip Chi-Mei, Chikako Aoyama, Hui Hiu-Daan, David Wu, Billy Chow Bei-Lei, Woo Fung, Stuart Yung Sai-Kit, Lam Chung', null, 'When evil inventor Ryuichi Yamamoto transfers his mind into that of a powerful cyborg, he becomes a murderer and rapist. But when one of his victims, Police officer Selina Lam becomes super robot Eve-R27, she teams up with android sidekick Ann and together they seek to bring the criminally insane scientist to justice.', 'When evil inventor Ryuichi Yamamoto transfers his mind into that of a powerful cyborg, he becomes a murderer and rapist. But when one of his victims, Police officer Selina Lam becomes super robot Eve-R27, she teams up with android sidekick Ann and together they seek to bring the criminally insane scientist to justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3ikwwNbk7GVorndt8lUyzaqIWpu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64348'),
  ('33989743259346145', 'Robotropolis', 2011, 'Adventure, Action, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Christopher Hatton, Byron Werner', 'Christopher Hatton', 'Zoe Naylor, Edward Foy, Graham Sibley, Tonya Cornelisse, Karina Summers, Peer Metze, Jourdan Lee, Daniel Jenkins', null, 'A group of reporters are covering the unveiling of a new facility that is completely maintained by robot prototypes. When one of the robots goes haywire, the reporters find themselves not just reporting on the malfunction, but fighting for their lives.', 'A group of reporters are covering the unveiling of a new facility that is completely maintained by robot prototypes. When one of the robots goes haywire, the reporters find themselves not just reporting on the malfunction, but fighting for their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pvOHSqQcWzcLuZY9D1sg62hR5G8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74779'),
  ('801908740980079619', 'Robots', 2005, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Science Fiction', 'Chris Wedge, Jamie Williams, Carlos Saldanha', 'Lowell Ganz, David Lindsay-Abaire, Babaloo Mandel', 'Ewan McGregor, Halle Berry, Greg Kinnear, Mel Brooks, Drew Carey, Amanda Bynes, Robin Williams, Jim Broadbent', 'PG', 'Rodney Copperbottom is a young robot inventor who dreams of making the world a better place, until the evil Ratchet takes over Bigweld Industries. Now, Rodney''s dreams – and those of his friends – are in danger of becoming obsolete.', 'Rodney Copperbottom is a young robot inventor who dreams of making the world a better place, until the evil Ratchet takes over Bigweld Industries. Now, Rodney''s dreams – and those of his friends – are in danger of becoming obsolete.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fnKCh67l2DDG9NxxIlk9IpsXQ99.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9928'),
  ('781474935315381621', 'Robots', 2023, 'Comedy, Science Fiction, Romance, Fantasy', 'Casper Christensen, Luke Geissbühler, Anthony Hines', 'Anthony Hines, Casper Christensen', 'Shailene Woodley, Jack Whitehall, Paul Rust, Nick Rutherford, Paul Jurewicz, David Grant Wright, Emanuela Postacchini, Chelsea Edmundson', 'R', 'A womanizer and a gold digger trick people into relationships with illegal robot doubles. When they unwittingly use this scam on each other, their robot doubles fall in love and elope, forcing the duo to team up to hunt them down before the authorities discover their secret.', 'A womanizer and a gold digger trick people into relationships with illegal robot doubles. When they unwittingly use this scam on each other, their robot doubles fall in love and elope, forcing the duo to team up to hunt them down before the authorities discover their secret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5BAqLXrPD4ra3zA07lVsozK6sEj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:723347'),
  ('876624017397405893', 'Robowar', 1988, 'Action, Science Fiction, War', 'Bruno Mattei, Richard Grassetti', 'Rossella Drudi, Claudio Fragasso', 'Reb Brown, Catherine Hickland, Massimo Vanni, Romano Puppo, Claudio Fragasso, Max Laurel, Jim Gaines, John P. Dulaney', null, 'A group of commandos heads into the jungles of Venezuela on a highly classified mission and encounters a robotic killing machine.', 'A group of commandos heads into the jungles of Venezuela on a highly classified mission and encounters a robotic killing machine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ps4uhlLu9arQeImGZoncftRVh1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105927'),
  ('758403114117388023', 'Robust', 2022, 'Drama', 'Simon Beaufils, Constance Meyer', 'Constance Meyer, Marcia Romano', 'Gérard Depardieu, Déborah Lukumuena, Lucas Mortier, Megan Northam, Florence Janas, Steve Tientcheu, Caroline Donnelly, Cédric Meusburger', null, 'When his right-hand man and only mate has to go away for a few weeks, Georges - an ageing film star - is given a substitute, Aïssa. The disillusioned actor and the young female security guard forge a special relationship.', 'When his right-hand man and only mate has to go away for a few weeks, Georges - an ageing film star - is given a substitute, Aïssa. The disillusioned actor and the young female security guard forge a special relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vjIRmCXBWRK2lozxDqzdIewlrVa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:785303'),
  ('406155670670231223', 'Rocca Changes the World', 2019, 'Family, Comedy', 'Katja Benrath, Torsten Breuer', 'Hilly Martinek', 'Luna Marie Maxeiner, Barbara Sukowa, Ivan Doan, Mina Tander, Fahri Yardım, Volker Bruch, Detlev Buck, Cordula Stratmann', null, '11-year-old Rocca, a clever, creative and brave girl who lives all by herself in defiance of her teachers and the authorities has to fight to keep her independence and prove to everyone that a child also has the power to change the world.', '11-year-old Rocca, a clever, creative and brave girl who lives all by herself in defiance of her teachers and the authorities has to fight to keep her independence and prove to everyone that a child also has the power to change the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AmCCtVXmUVgEa3TzrSnIIppS5LP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:577122'),
  ('490746153290750649', 'Rocco Chinnici: May Your Kiss Lie Lightly On My Head', 2018, 'TV Movie, Drama, History', 'Giuseppe Curti, Alessio Gelsini Torresi, Michele Soavi', null, 'Sergio Castellitto, Cristiana Dell''Anna, Manuela Ventura, Virginia La Tella, Luigi Imola, Bernardo Casertano, Paolo Giangrasso, Bruno Torrisi', null, 'An Italian magistrate leads a crusade against organized crime which ultimately costs him his life in this biopic told through his daughter''s eyes.', 'An Italian magistrate leads a crusade against organized crime which ultimately costs him his life in this biopic told through his daughter''s eyes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a4zsulGdUDjrQNlbJ8TtrJNt5Ix.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:502229'),
