  ('318119947247548891', 'Rock ''n'' Rodent', 1967, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Abe Levitow', null, null, null, 'Jerry heads out to his night job: drummer for an all-mouse rock band in the basement of a high-rise. They are loud enough to wake up Tom, despite his attempts to block the noise. Tom''s attempts keep running him afoul of a rather mean-tempered dog.', 'Jerry heads out to his night job: drummer for an all-mouse rock band in the basement of a high-rise. They are loud enough to wake up Tom, despite his attempts to block the noise. Tom''s attempts keep running him afoul of a rather mean-tempered dog.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1qglMwjum8QWUk4OK4xEuC5GS4W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:219576'),
  ('586206214294043259', 'Rock ''n'' Roll Frankenstein', 1999, 'Comedy, Horror, Music', 'Jay Hillman, Brian O''Hara', 'Brian O''Hara', 'Graig Guggenheim, Graig Guggenheim, Jayson Spence, Barry Feterman, Hiram Jacob Segarra, Andrew Hurley, Ted Travelstead, Mark Trares', null, 'The movie follows Bernie, a record producer who persuades his nephew Frankie to create a new rock star that will help Bernie overcome his work related ennui. Iggy, the burnt out roadie pillages the graves of various celebrities such as Buddy Holly, Jimi Hendrix, and Sid Vicious, using the head of Elvis Presley to top things off. All goes according to plan until a mishap leads Iggy to steal Liberace''s private parts instead of those of Jim Morrison. The monster is brought to life and is on the road to rock ''n'' roll success when the Liberace side of the monster begins to assert itself, with tragic results. The result: a monster (Guggenheim) with the sex drive of a macho rock star and the sexual orientation of Liberace.', 'The movie follows Bernie, a record producer who persuades his nephew Frankie to create a new rock star that will help Bernie overcome his work related ennui. Iggy, the burnt out roadie pillages the graves of various celebrities such as Buddy Holly, Jimi Hendrix, and Sid Vicious, using the head of Elvis Presley to top things off. All goes according to plan until a mishap leads Iggy to steal Liberace''s private parts instead of those of Jim Morrison. The monster is brought to life and is on the road to rock ''n'' roll success when the Liberace side of the monster begins to assert itself, with tragic results. The result: a monster (Guggenheim) with the sex drive of a macho rock star and the sexual orientation of Liberace.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4lHLDVQWzgVsfnhjCaWMdIMJi4Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3144'),
  ('373233846303146625', 'Rock ''n'' Roll High School', 1979, 'Comedy, Music', 'Dean Cundey, Allan Arkush, Mark Toepfer', 'Richard Whitley, Joseph McBride, Russ Dvonch', 'P. J. Soles, Vincent Van Patten, Clint Howard, Dey Young, Mary Woronov, Paul Bartel, Dick Miller, Don Steele', 'PG', 'A group of rock-music-loving students, with the help of the Ramones, take over their school to combat its newly installed oppressive administration.', 'A group of rock-music-loving students, with the help of the Ramones, take over their school to combat its newly installed oppressive administration.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kxoDBrtLqMsjMlfWb2caRRY92Xg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26326'),
  ('218192231002491566', 'Rock ''n'' Roll High School Forever', 1991, 'Comedy, Music', 'Deborah Brock, Worth Keeter, Molly M. Mayeux', 'Deborah Brock', 'Corey Feldman, Larry Linville, Mary Woronov, Evan Richards, Liane Curtis, Jason Lively, Brynn Horrocks, Michael Cerveris', 'PG-13', 'Those rambunctious kids are back in school and back in trouble in a smash sequel to the 1978 worldwide hit. Corey Feldman leads a rock and roll rally at Ronald Reagon High, but must triumph over the evil plans of the school''s fascist principal, Vadar, who wants to halt the school dance and run their school like a prison.', 'Those rambunctious kids are back in school and back in trouble in a smash sequel to the 1978 worldwide hit. Corey Feldman leads a rock and roll rally at Ronald Reagon High, but must triumph over the evil plans of the school''s fascist principal, Vadar, who wants to halt the school dance and run their school like a prison.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dLiBo5uyfIvP9fHHWfSgR6mKQPy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34742'),
  ('356598389786836734', 'Rock ''n'' Roll Nightmare', 1987, 'Horror, Music', 'John Fasano, Mark Mackay', 'Jon Mikl Thor', 'Jon Mikl Thor, Jillian Peri, Frank Dietz, Teresa Simpson, Adam Fried, Denise Dicandia, Jesse D''Angelo, Rusty Hamilton', null, 'At an old farmhouse, a family mysteriously dissapears at the hands of evil. Years later, hair metal band The Tritons comes to the farmhouse, whose barn now features a 24-track recording studio. Lead singer John Triton gets the band to perform their first night in the farmhouse after dinner, and weird little beasties suddenly appear, and strange things start to happen. Band members (and their tagalong girlfriends) begin to act strangely and vanish one by one. Soon, only John Triton remains, and he holds a secret. Finally, the evil shows itself and a battle between heaven and hell ensues....', 'At an old farmhouse, a family mysteriously dissapears at the hands of evil. Years later, hair metal band The Tritons comes to the farmhouse, whose barn now features a 24-track recording studio. Lead singer John Triton gets the band to perform their first night in the farmhouse after dinner, and weird little beasties suddenly appear, and strange things start to happen. Band members (and their tagalong girlfriends) begin to act strangely and vanish one by one. Soon, only John Triton remains, and he holds a secret. Finally, the evil shows itself and a battle between heaven and hell ensues....', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uR5B3T9lGW0ISM5xJ1esb5L9N7U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36762'),
  ('501143086355947877', 'Rock & Rule', 1983, 'Adventure, Animation, Fantasy', 'Clive A. Smith', 'Peter Sauder, John Halfpenny', 'Don Francks, Lou Reed, Susan Roman, Debbie Harry, Paul Le Mat, Robin Zander, Dan Hennessey, Chris Wiggins', 'PG', 'A malevolent rock star kidnaps a female singer to force her to participate in the summoning of a demon and her band must help her stop him.', 'A malevolent rock star kidnaps a female singer to force her to participate in the summoning of a demon and her band must help her stop him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rXXxITGJdiJEvk5c2Z1La1LNbpi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21356'),
  ('883913685865601277', 'Rock All Night', 1957, 'Crime, Music, Drama', 'Roger Corman, Floyd Crosby, Buck Ram', 'Charles B. Griffith', 'Dick Miller, Russell Johnson, Abby Dalton, Jeanne Cooper, Robin Morse, Mel Welles, Richard H. Cutting, Chris Alcaide', 'NR', 'Cloud Nine, the local teen hangout, has been taken over by a pair of escaped killers, who hold the local teens hostage. The bartender realizes it''s up to him to save the kids.', 'Cloud Nine, the local teen hangout, has been taken over by a pair of escaped killers, who hold the local teens hostage. The bartender realizes it''s up to him to save the kids.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4QKW2GKgGetQmA4Cye4WmUYZnR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85852'),
  ('835554538670479552', 'Rock Around the Clock', 1956, 'Drama, Music, Romance, Comedy', 'Fred F. Sears, Benjamin H. Kline, Gene Anderson Jr.', 'Robert E. Kent, James B. Gordon', 'Johnny Johnston, Alix Talton, Lisa Gaye, John Archer, Henry Slate, Earl Barton, Bill Haley, Alan Freed', null, 'A frustrated big-band promoter runs in to rock-and-rollers Bill Haley and the Comets at a small-town dance. He quickly becomes their manager and, with the help of Alan Freed, hopes to bring the new sound to the entire country. But will a conniving booking agent, with a personal ax to grind with the manager, conspire to keep the band from making the big time?', 'A frustrated big-band promoter runs in to rock-and-rollers Bill Haley and the Comets at a small-town dance. He quickly becomes their manager and, with the help of Alan Freed, hopes to bring the new sound to the entire country. But will a conniving booking agent, with a personal ax to grind with the manager, conspire to keep the band from making the big time?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9ARK9a3zovLoNsJIc3T1JCEo8AF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:93061'),
  ('1099466891657588728', 'Rock Crystal', 2004, 'Adventure, Drama', 'Joseph Vilsmaier, Joseph Vilsmaier', 'Klaus Richter', 'Dana Vávrová, Daniel Morgenroth, François Goeske, Josefina Vilsmaier, Max Tidof, Katja Riemann, Herbert Knaup, Paula Riemann', null, 'The towns of Gschaid and Millsdorf are in a constant state of feuding with each other. Nevertheless Gschaid''s Sebastian and Millsdorf''s Susanne are married. In her husband''s town Susanne has to put up with daily harassment by the locals, which also extends to her two children. Finally she moves back to her parents, alone. When the children, who long to find a magical crystal they believe has the power to reunite the family, get lost in a howling blizzard on the exposed mountain after bringing their mother her Christmas presents, both towns set up rescue missions.', 'The towns of Gschaid and Millsdorf are in a constant state of feuding with each other. Nevertheless Gschaid''s Sebastian and Millsdorf''s Susanne are married. In her husband''s town Susanne has to put up with daily harassment by the locals, which also extends to her two children. Finally she moves back to her parents, alone. When the children, who long to find a magical crystal they believe has the power to reunite the family, get lost in a howling blizzard on the exposed mountain after bringing their mother her Christmas presents, both towns set up rescue missions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8GFxp1rAoJRRN5OGeHRClWGVief.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12313'),
  ('276767228427958939', 'Rock Dog', 2016, 'Animation, Adventure, Comedy, Family, Music', 'Jen Rudin, Ash Brannon', 'Kurt Voelker, Ash Brannon', 'Luke Wilson, Eddie Izzard, J.K. Simmons, Lewis Black, Kenan Thompson, Mae Whitman, Jorge Garcia, Matt Dillon', 'PG', 'When a radio falls from the sky into the hands of a wide-eyed Tibetan Mastiff, he leaves home to fulfill his dream of becoming a musician, setting into motion a series of completely unexpected events.', 'When a radio falls from the sky into the hands of a wide-eyed Tibetan Mastiff, he leaves home to fulfill his dream of becoming a musician, setting into motion a series of completely unexpected events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7RXi2afiNJGU8EB79SD8HYoSz4O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:333667'),
  ('365783236375869833', 'Rock Dog 2: Rock Around the Park', 2021, 'Animation, Comedy, Music, Family', 'Mark Baldo', 'Alec Sokolow', 'Graham Hamilton, Ashleigh Ball, Andrew Francis, Kathleen Barr, Brian Drummond, Brian Dobson, Cathy Weseluck, Richard Newman', 'NR', 'When Bodi and his band ''True Blue'' leave Snow Mountain to tour with pop sensation Lil'' Foxy, they learn that fame comes at a price.', 'When Bodi and his band ''True Blue'' leave Snow Mountain to tour with pop sensation Lil'' Foxy, they learn that fame comes at a price.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kETYRGA15L0wkVPugSl8lKmSgFn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:812204'),
  ('866859021417779370', 'Rock Dog 3: Battle the Beat', 2023, 'Animation, Adventure, Comedy', 'Anthony Bell', 'Rob Muir', 'Graham Hamilton, Ashleigh Ball, Andrew Francis, Eddie Izzard, Diana Kaarina, Bethany Brown, Chiara Zanni, Brian Dobson', 'NR', 'After touring the world, Bodi takes some time off and returns to his village. When he learns that the girl group, K-9, doesn''t know who rock legend Angus Scattergood is, he is compelled to join the musical competition show, “Battle the Beat,” to inspire a new generation of rock stars. But after joining the show, Bodi quickly realizes he has bitten off more than he can chew when he becomes an overnight TV personality sensation.', 'After touring the world, Bodi takes some time off and returns to his village. When he learns that the girl group, K-9, doesn''t know who rock legend Angus Scattergood is, he is compelled to join the musical competition show, “Battle the Beat,” to inspire a new generation of rock stars. But after joining the show, Bodi quickly realizes he has bitten off more than he can chew when he becomes an overnight TV personality sensation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/39Hr1FKfqqvx0umS60PCCWtBOKd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1054972'),
  ('889758961434129404', 'Rock Estrela', 1986, 'Romance, Drama, Music', 'Lael Rodrigues, Nonato Estrela, Ana Maria Grova', 'Lael Rodrigues', 'Diogo Vilela, Malu Mader, Léo Jaime, Andréa Beltrão, Guilherme Karan, Vera Mossa, Tim Rescala, Jorge Lafond', null, 'Classical music student arrives from Buenos Aires to live with his rocker cousin in Rio De Janeiro. Between parties full of rock and roll, he has to decide between his childhood girlfriend, now a respectful businesswoman, and the volleyball player Vera.', 'Classical music student arrives from Buenos Aires to live with his rocker cousin in Rio De Janeiro. Between parties full of rock and roll, he has to decide between his childhood girlfriend, now a respectful businesswoman, and the volleyball player Vera.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xGWIc0okSyGBflvg71X66tbmgS5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:336784'),
  ('306678859944021313', 'Rock Haven', 2007, 'Drama, Romance', 'David Lewis, Bill Gollihur', 'David Lewis', 'Sean Hoagland, Owen Alabado, Laura Jane Coles, Katheryn Hecht, Erin Daly, Johnny Yono, David Lewis', 'NR', 'The coastal California community of Rock Haven is the perfect place for cute eighteen-year-old Brady and his loving mother to begin a fresh start. Their mission: to spread the word of the Lord. But while roaming the beach one day, Brady meets Clifford, a young man who is the complete opposite of him: outgoing and athletic as well as incredibly handsome. Their initial encounter stirs up feelings of homo desire that Brady has been suppressing. Once Clifford makes it clear that their attraction is mutual, Brady''s conflicting feelings of religious obligation and natural impulse go into overdrive, and the two young men must navigate their confusion, lust and beliefs in order to come to a mutual understanding.', 'The coastal California community of Rock Haven is the perfect place for cute eighteen-year-old Brady and his loving mother to begin a fresh start. Their mission: to spread the word of the Lord. But while roaming the beach one day, Brady meets Clifford, a young man who is the complete opposite of him: outgoing and athletic as well as incredibly handsome. Their initial encounter stirs up feelings of homo desire that Brady has been suppressing. Once Clifford makes it clear that their attraction is mutual, Brady''s conflicting feelings of religious obligation and natural impulse go into overdrive, and the two young men must navigate their confusion, lust and beliefs in order to come to a mutual understanding.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rq7OZ2qBrme0oweoO0RPTpJt9it.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27215'),
  ('249158649518469849', 'Rock Hudson''s Home Movies', 1992, 'Documentary', 'Mark Rappaport, Mark Daniels', 'Mark Rappaport', 'Eric Farr, Rock Hudson', null, 'In this revisionist documentary, actor Eric Farr re-creates the character of Rock Hudson in order to take a look back at his films. It compares the actor''s screen (and public) image with his real life and shows certain scenes, lines and situations in his films to insinuate that Hudson may have been gay.', 'In this revisionist documentary, actor Eric Farr re-creates the character of Rock Hudson in order to take a look back at his films. It compares the actor''s screen (and public) image with his real life and shows certain scenes, lines and situations in his films to insinuate that Hudson may have been gay.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4DTKyLmi4OLEfgUKzuvImof2fQR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:124101'),
  ('127674081697602796', 'Rock It!', 2010, 'Comedy, Family', 'Mike Marzuk', 'Peer Klehmet, Sebastian Wehlings', 'Emilia Schüle, Daniel Axt, Maria Ehrich, Vivien Wulf, Jan Wannemacher, Heio von Stetten, Markus Maria Profitlich, Max Herbrechter', null, 'When being sent to a boarding school for classical music, teenager Julia discovers rock music - and rock musicians. Torn between these two musical worlds, she has to find her own way.', 'When being sent to a boarding school for classical music, teenager Julia discovers rock music - and rock musicians. Torn between these two musical worlds, she has to find her own way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lA0DACjRQzDKl3GNCp623s0VEA5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52830'),
  ('68049560871088852', 'Rock Monster', 2008, 'Fantasy, Adventure, TV Movie', 'Declan O''Brien, Anton Bakarski, Todor Chapkanov', 'Declan O''Brien', 'Chad Michael Collins, Natalie Denise Sperl, Alicia Lagano, Jon Polito, David Figlioli, Michael Flemming, Daniel Hembling, Niki Iliev', 'PG', 'A college student, traveling with his friends to a remote eastern-European village, unwittingly releases the Rock Monster from it''s ancient slumber to wreak havoc on the surrounding countryside', 'A college student, traveling with his friends to a remote eastern-European village, unwittingly releases the Rock Monster from it''s ancient slumber to wreak havoc on the surrounding countryside', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cE8qLyCgqJJNJ77qfi90AAwEPrg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59229'),
  ('1134732498540623508', 'Rock My Heart', 2017, 'Adventure, Drama, Family', 'Sten Mende, Hanno Olderdissen', 'Hanno Olderdissen, Clemente Fernandez-Gil', 'Lena Klenke, Dieter Hallervorden, Emilio Sakraya, Michael Lott, Annette Frier, Milan Peschel, Vedat Erincin, Johann von Bülow', null, '17-year-old Jana has a congenital heart defect. To defy fate, Jana seeks every challenge, plunges into every wild and dangerous adventure. Her parents does not like that and are even more in constant fear of their daughter.', '17-year-old Jana has a congenital heart defect. To defy fate, Jana seeks every challenge, plunges into every wild and dangerous adventure. Her parents does not like that and are even more in constant fear of their daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mFl6xsdaDNzM4KxhJOIJkq9wXBp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:432870'),
  ('585946096539858401', 'Rock of Ages', 2012, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance, Music', 'Adam Shankman, Rebecca Baughman, Terrence B. Zinn', 'Allan Loeb, Chris D''Arienzo, Justin Theroux', 'Julianne Hough, Diego Boneta, Alec Baldwin, Tom Cruise, Russell Brand, Malin Åkerman, Paul Giamatti, Bryan Cranston', 'PG-13', 'A small town girl and a city boy meet on the Sunset Strip, while pursuing their Hollywood dreams.', 'A small town girl and a city boy meet on the Sunset Strip, while pursuing their Hollywood dreams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oVeE2QTUb14jPU2lYEGPE3s8T9j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80585'),
  ('426082485698418191', 'Rock On 2', 2016, 'Music, Drama', 'Shujaat Saudagar, Marc Koninckx, Ahaan Panday', 'Pubali Chaudhuri', 'Farhan Akhtar, Arjun Rampal, Purab Kohli, Shraddha Kapoor, Shashank Arora, Prachi Desai, Shahana Goswami, Kumud Mishra', null, 'The musical drama is a sequel to the 2008 blockbuster ''Rock On'' that tells the story of four friends and their passion for music. This time around, the film centers around the regional conflict prevailing in the North Eastern states of India.', 'The musical drama is a sequel to the 2008 blockbuster ''Rock On'' that tells the story of four friends and their passion for music. This time around, the film centers around the regional conflict prevailing in the North Eastern states of India.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bHXLurduTMZByPwSUss3LbSsgiU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:413588'),
  ('628949441974700090', 'Rock on Fire', 1994, 'Action, Thriller', 'Lung Sang, Philip Ma Kam-Cheung', 'Hung Hin-Pang', 'Mikie Ng, Fujimi Takajo, Thomas Cheung Kwok-Leung, Ken Lo Wai-Kwong, Stuart Yung Sai-Kit, Shing Fui-On, Billy Chow Bei-Lei, Mang Ding-Goh', null, 'Some dope cops trying to bust the "Big Boss", but faces stiff opposition in the form of his fiery minions.', 'Some dope cops trying to bust the "Big Boss", but faces stiff opposition in the form of his fiery minions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w9gM1S9Z9QXICkFA4ohZG0Ipj8y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:316441'),
  ('918406442009195695', 'Rock On!!', 2008, 'Drama', 'Abhishek Kapoor, Jason West', 'Pubali Chaudhuri', 'Farhan Akhtar, Arjun Rampal, Purab Kohli, Luke Kenny, Prachi Desai, Shahana Goswami, Koel Purie, Nicolette Bird', null, 'Aditya, Joe, Kedar and Rob form a rock band, but break up after they fail to make a success of it. They establish regular lives until they decide to reunite and take another shot at fulfilling their dreams.', 'Aditya, Joe, Kedar and Rob form a rock band, but break up after they fail to make a success of it. They establish regular lives until they decide to reunite and take another shot at fulfilling their dreams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cckTZXVpchMrljPouFf7u2wqUTX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19672'),
  ('499643027335716008', 'Rock Springs', 2026, 'Drama, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Vera Miao, Heyjin Jun, Guy Pooles, David Arnold, Hannah Christine Kess, Alex Byrne-Mintern, David Klohn', 'Vera Miao', 'Jimmy O. Yang, Aria Kim, Fiona Fu, Ricky He, Cardi Wong', null, 'After her father''s death, a grieving young girl moves to Rock Springs, Wyoming with her mother and grandmother, only to discover something monstrous hidden in the town’s history and the woods behind their new house.', 'After her father''s death, a grieving young girl moves to Rock Springs, Wyoming with her mother and grandmother, only to discover something monstrous hidden in the town’s history and the woods behind their new house.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FoXK8FGCQ84fzlkzMINdPl3W5LVE.jpg', 'plex:movie:rock-springs-2026'),
  ('274516193899453630', 'Rock Star', 2001, 'Music, Drama, Comedy', 'Stephen Herek, Ueli Steiger, David R. Ellis', 'John Stockwell', 'Mark Wahlberg, Jennifer Aniston, Dominic West, Jason Bonham, Jeff Pilson, Zakk Wylde, Timothy Spall, Blas Elias', 'R', 'A wannabe rock star who fronts a Pennsylvania-based tribute band is devastated when his bandmates kick him out of the group he founded. Things begin to look up for Izzy when he is asked to join Steel Dragon, the heavy metal rockers he had been imitating for so long. This film is loosely based on the true story of the band Judas Priest.', 'A wannabe rock star who fronts a Pennsylvania-based tribute band is devastated when his bandmates kick him out of the group he founded. Things begin to look up for Izzy when he is asked to join Steel Dragon, the heavy metal rockers he had been imitating for so long. This film is loosely based on the true story of the band Judas Priest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8pRMweo9WA1MvYOLsD2hWyFpZ1V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12508'),
  ('463808391471563459', 'Rock the Boat', 1944, 'Music, Animation', 'Norman McLaren', null, null, null, 'One of a series of French-Canadian folk songs, this film was illustrated by Norman McLaren for the Chants populaires series. White gouache drawings on black cards were photographed with overlapping ‘zooms’ to suggest the forward movement of a canoe along rivers and lakes. This film appears in Chants populaires no. 5 and in Chants populaires no. 6.', 'One of a series of French-Canadian folk songs, this film was illustrated by Norman McLaren for the Chants populaires series. White gouache drawings on black cards were photographed with overlapping ‘zooms’ to suggest the forward movement of a canoe along rivers and lakes. This film appears in Chants populaires no. 5 and in Chants populaires no. 6.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aB2qvWFNrJssRdtNa0nq4g03GQD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:145337'),
  ('159145381533605146', 'Rock the Casbah', 2013, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Laïla Marrakchi, Pierric Gantelmi d''Ille', 'Laïla Marrakchi', 'Morjana Alaoui, Nadine Labaki, Hiam Abbass, Lubna Azabal, Adel Bencherif, Omar Sharif, Fatima Herandi Raouya, Assia Bentria', null, 'The whole family is reunited when Sofia comes back for his father''s funeral. Quickly, inner problems are revealed.', 'The whole family is reunited when Sofia comes back for his father''s funeral. Quickly, inner problems are revealed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yeGlXJ67tOANGiTABwm1hYMrOd9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:214099'),
  ('765660593910688161', 'Rock the Kasbah', 2015, 'Comedy, Music, War', 'Barry Levinson, Sean Bobbitt', 'Mitch Glazer', 'Bill Murray, Zooey Deschanel, Bruce Willis, Kate Hudson, Taylor Kinney, Danny McBride, Scott Caan, Eugenia Kuzmina', 'R', 'A washed-up music producer finds one last shot at redemption with a golden-voiced young girl in Afghanistan. However, when jealousy gets the better of a disgruntled ex-boyfriend, he decides to oppose the young star with talent of his own.', 'A washed-up music producer finds one last shot at redemption with a golden-voiced young girl in Afghanistan. However, when jealousy gets the better of a disgruntled ex-boyfriend, he decides to oppose the young star with talent of his own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jGNOsJjpsJ4yWe3InuiXgYk8VuW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:253414'),
  ('150487651448352698', 'Rock-a-Bye Baby', 1958, 'Comedy', 'Frank Tashlin, Haskell B. Boggs, Charles C. Coleman', 'Frank Tashlin', 'Jerry Lewis, Marilyn Maxwell, Connie Stevens, Salvatore Baccaloni, Reginald Gardiner, Ida Moore, Gary Lewis, Isobel Elsom', 'NR', 'An average television repairman must care for the newborn triplets of his former hometown sweetheart—now a famous movie star—so her career will not suffer.', 'An average television repairman must care for the newborn triplets of his former hometown sweetheart—now a famous movie star—so her career will not suffer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/T1TsGHK6JIWvCZm8HL3TiYxSxw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42581'),
  ('393087146422861946', 'Rock-a-Bye Bear', 1952, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Tex Avery', null, 'Daws Butler, Bill Thompson', null, 'Spike gets a job running the house for a hibernating bear. Only problem is that same bear is VERY noise-sensitive, and Spike''s got a rival that wants his job.', 'Spike gets a job running the house for a hibernating bear. Only problem is that same bear is VERY noise-sensitive, and Spike''s got a rival that wants his job.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/atPGRSKMthAioTNsk7fpWxZKuNw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87192'),
  ('842920783218226131', 'Rock-A-Doodle', 1991, 'Comedy, Family, Animation, Fantasy, Music', 'Don Bluth, Robert Paynter, Gary Goldman', 'Don Bluth', 'Glen Campbell, Toby Scott Ganger, Christopher Plummer, Kathryn Holcomb, Stan Ivar, Ellen Greene, Phil Harris, Eddie Deezen', 'G', 'Chanticleer is a foolhardy farm rooster who believes his crows can actually make the sun come up and shine. When the sun rises one morning without Chanticleer''s crow, he leaves the farm in disgrace and runs off to become a rock ''n'' roll singer. But in his absence, a sinister, sunshine-hating owl prepares to take over.', 'Chanticleer is a foolhardy farm rooster who believes his crows can actually make the sun come up and shine. When the sun rises one morning without Chanticleer''s crow, he leaves the farm in disgrace and runs off to become a rock ''n'' roll singer. But in his absence, a sinister, sunshine-hating owl prepares to take over.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q5xSS8MNmrwR3em6VB6OC3992d6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20421'),
  ('738946397679732186', 'Rock, Paper and Scissors', 2019, 'Thriller', 'Martín Blousson, Macarena Garcia Lenzi, Nicolás Colledani', 'Macarena Garcia Lenzi, Martín Blousson, Julieta Garcia Lenzi', 'Pablo Sigal, Agustina Cervino, Valeria Giorcelli', null, 'Jesus and Maria José live together in the grand house that belonged to their recently deceased father. Their playful routine is disrupted when Magdalena, their half sister on their dad’s side, returns from Spain asking for her share of the inheritance. What are they going to do about this interloper into their dangerous folie à deux?', 'Jesus and Maria José live together in the grand house that belonged to their recently deceased father. Their playful routine is disrupted when Magdalena, their half sister on their dad’s side, returns from Spain asking for her share of the inheritance. What are they going to do about this interloper into their dangerous folie à deux?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1KmhgqvpjFVw1viUS86tp9f0ENc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:613081'),
  ('264591920885962221', 'Rock, Paper, Scissors', 2012, 'Drama, Action, Crime', 'Hernán Jabes, Daniel García', 'Hernán Jabes, Irina Dendiouk', 'Gloria Montoya, Leónidas Urbina, Scarlett Jaimes, Leandro Arvelo, Ernesto Campos, Alberto Alifa, Jesús Careca, Julio César Castro', null, 'The chance of an innocent child''s game will unveil a betrayal that will forever change the lives of two families when their paths cross, endangering what they love the most, in a city that does not give them a truce.', 'The chance of an innocent child''s game will unveil a betrayal that will forever change the lives of two families when their paths cross, endangering what they love the most, in a city that does not give them a truce.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y3il3vN7BYtiWby82Ct506NRQyH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:136752'),
  ('521532349963779260', 'Rock, Rock, Rock!', 1956, 'Comedy', 'Will Price', 'Milton Subotsky', 'Alan Freed, Fran Manfred, Tuesday Weld, Teddy Randazzo, Jacqueline Kerr, Ivy Schulman, Harvey Fuqua, Bobby Lester', 'NR', 'Teenage Dori can''t convince her father to buy her a gown so she decides to get the money together herself in time for the prom.', 'Teenage Dori can''t convince her father to buy her a gown so she decides to get the money together herself in time for the prom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gYTUVqqOA4HINuwKe46GEDMFnJh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23393'),
  ('811092143663098630', 'Rock''n Roll', 2017, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Guillaume Canet, Christophe Offenstein', 'Guillaume Canet, Rodolphe Lauga, Philippe Lefebvre', 'Guillaume Canet, Marion Cotillard, Gilles Lellouche, Philippe Lefebvre, Camille Rowe, Kev Adams, Ben Foster, Johnny Hallyday', null, 'Guillaume Canet is told by a young co-star that he''s no longer Rock''n'' Roll and can''t sell films anymore. He then tries to prove her wrong and gets help from his girlfriend, Marion Cotillard.', 'Guillaume Canet is told by a young co-star that he''s no longer Rock''n'' Roll and can''t sell films anymore. He then tries to prove her wrong and gets help from his girlfriend, Marion Cotillard.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tkzVWew2NgepjYDWu5WeVXLEeCj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:382589'),
  ('1075075973183930341', 'Rockabye', 1932, 'Drama', 'George Cukor, Charles Rosher', 'Jane Murfin, Kubec Glasmon', 'Constance Bennett, Joel McCrea, Paul Lukas, Jobyna Howland, Walter Pidgeon, Clara Blandick, Walter Catlett, Virginia Hammond', null, 'A Broadway actress with a problematic past falls hard for the author of her new play.', 'A Broadway actress with a problematic past falls hard for the author of her new play.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xxK08zZycbwheIaCWkKXn3UwfkC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109663'),
  ('74377487222134794', 'Rocker', 1972, 'Drama, Crime, TV Movie', 'Klaus Lemke, Bernd Fiedler, Anna Harnisch', 'Klaus Lemke', 'Hans-Jürgen Modschiedler, Gerd Kruskopf, Michael-Thomas Krannich, Paul Lys, Marianne Mim, Heidrun Rieckmann, Dennis O. Heinrich, Joe Ebel', null, 'In Hamburg, West Germany, a rocker biker gang helps a kid avenge his brother who was murdered by a two thugs.', 'In Hamburg, West Germany, a rocker biker gang helps a kid avenge his brother who was murdered by a two thugs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4SCeIGfSYRO7pR78MMG4gfCnk98.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36117'),
  ('1087641195516304026', 'Rockers', 1979, 'Comedy, Drama, Music', 'Ted Bafaloukos, Nigel Noble, Monty Diamond', 'Ted Bafaloukos', 'Leroy Wallace, Richard ''Dirty Harry'' Hall, Monica Craig, Marjorie Norman, Jacob Miller, Gregory Isaacs, Winston Rodney, Frank Dowding', null, 'Horsemouth, a drummer living in a ghetto of Kingston, plans to make money selling records. After his prized motorcycle is stolen, his plans fall through and he''s forced to adapt.', 'Horsemouth, a drummer living in a ghetto of Kingston, plans to make money selling records. After his prized motorcycle is stolen, his plans fall through and he''s forced to adapt.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oWPwk4CwVCw50DBEao8Dj0jIlIV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15717'),
  ('352546154020697797', 'Rockers', 2003, 'Drama, Action, Comedy, Music', 'Takanori Jinnai, Kôichi Nakayama', 'Takanori Jinnai', 'Shunsuke Nakamura, Takashi Tsukamoto, Ryuta Sato, Hiroshi Tamaki, Yumi Aso, Tetsuji Tamayama, Hakuryu, Hanawa', null, 'Guitarist Ko-chan is a mess of sexual repression after a childhood at the mercy of two elder sisters eager to use him as a guinea pig for their make-up skills. Bassist Gaku-chan keeps a bucket in the wings for whenever his nerves get the better of him, and drummer Momo-chan is doomed to forever carrying the botched childhood attempts at self-tattooing. It''s not until this foursome is forced to look for an additional guitar player after Jin''s dad burns his Stratocaster, that attitude and musical ability enter into the equation. Leather-clad, shade-wearing Tani (Tamaki), inseparable from his black Les Paul, is introduced as the king of R''n''R cool and Jinnai keeps him firmly seated on his throne throughout the film, retroactively proclaiming the guitarist, rather than himself, as the band''s true hero.', 'Guitarist Ko-chan is a mess of sexual repression after a childhood at the mercy of two elder sisters eager to use him as a guinea pig for their make-up skills. Bassist Gaku-chan keeps a bucket in the wings for whenever his nerves get the better of him, and drummer Momo-chan is doomed to forever carrying the botched childhood attempts at self-tattooing. It''s not until this foursome is forced to look for an additional guitar player after Jin''s dad burns his Stratocaster, that attitude and musical ability enter into the equation. Leather-clad, shade-wearing Tani (Tamaki), inseparable from his black Les Paul, is introduced as the king of R''n''R cool and Jinnai keeps him firmly seated on his throne throughout the film, retroactively proclaiming the guitarist, rather than himself, as the band''s true hero.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qM5pp5ul87a5Amv4g6lZTPHl6RF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39019'),
  ('911294802200270189', 'Rocket Attack U.S.A.', 1960, 'Thriller', 'Barry Mahon, Mike Tabb', null, 'Monica Davis, John McKay, Daniel Kern, Edward Czerniuk, Phillip St. George, Richard Downs, Herbert Flato, Ray Brewer', null, 'It''s the height of the Cold War between the United States and the Soviet Union with the Communists launching a spy satellite that has the Free World leaders in a panic. Fears about the nature of the satellite force the United States to send an agent undercover behind the Iron Curtain to discover what the Soviets have learned. What he finds is the Communists have used the information acquired from their spy satellite to help them perfect a new and even more deadly nuclear weapon.', 'It''s the height of the Cold War between the United States and the Soviet Union with the Communists launching a spy satellite that has the Free World leaders in a panic. Fears about the nature of the satellite force the United States to send an agent undercover behind the Iron Curtain to discover what the Soviets have learned. What he finds is the Communists have used the information acquired from their spy satellite to help them perfect a new and even more deadly nuclear weapon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uwiX7puxDD89fytQg4jZdpnlEoj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:113158'),
  ('384478075589855099', 'Rocket Gibraltar', 1988, 'Drama, Family', 'Daniel Petrie, Jost Vacano', 'Amos Poe', 'Burt Lancaster, Suzy Amis, Patricia Clarkson, Frances Conroy, Sinéad Cusack, John Glover, Bill Pullman, Kevin Spacey', null, 'A man''s family comes for his 77th birthday and while he loves all of his children and their children, he and his children don''t exactly connect. However, he connects with his grandchildren. And he tells them what he wants for his birthday and they do what they can to give it to him.', 'A man''s family comes for his 77th birthday and while he loves all of his children and their children, he and his children don''t exactly connect. However, he connects with his grandchildren. And he tells them what he wants for his birthday and they do what they can to give it to him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4yA9LoOXHl5gTxfizEpl4407phT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58434'),
  ('165417745272988853', 'Rocket Hunter', 2020, 'War, Action', 'Christopher Forbes', null, 'Sophie Adams, Jezibell Anat, Ronald Blanton, Wayne Blanton, Kayla Coppa, Ryan Cruce, Kelly Forbes, Charlie Gabel', 'PG-13', 'In one of the most dangerous missions of the war, an American B-17 pilot volunteers to fly a surrendered Messerschmitt 109 on a daring flight through the heart of Germany to try to prevent the people of London from being terrorized by the V-2 rockets. "Rocket Hunter" tells the story of an amazing pilot and his bombardier brother from the time they are teenagers dreaming of taking to the skies to the dark days of January 1945.', 'In one of the most dangerous missions of the war, an American B-17 pilot volunteers to fly a surrendered Messerschmitt 109 on a daring flight through the heart of Germany to try to prevent the people of London from being terrorized by the V-2 rockets. "Rocket Hunter" tells the story of an amazing pilot and his bombardier brother from the time they are teenagers dreaming of taking to the skies to the dark days of January 1945.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kdZ84L4m8XW7s1Zbt7t8kG77GvI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:666180'),
  ('1115849820475268657', 'Rocket Perelman', 2017, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Oliver Alaluukas, Valentin Selmke', 'Oliver Alaluukas, Johannes Rothe', 'Liv Lisa Fries, Tobias Lehmann, Gordon Kämmerer, Stefan Lampadius, Kai Michael Müller, Anne Haug, Africa Brau, Oliver Bröcker', null, 'In the artist colony Rocket Perelman ten people strive to live their version of freedom and independence - everybody for themselves and all together. But that''s hard work, since the joined theatre production puts the groups'' idealism to a hard test.', 'In the artist colony Rocket Perelman ten people strive to live their version of freedom and independence - everybody for themselves and all together. But that''s hard work, since the joined theatre production puts the groups'' idealism to a hard test.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AuKol1eeKgRrp4vTJRlbylizdpu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:486890'),
  ('192816165513708296', 'Rocket Science', 2007, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jeffrey Blitz, Jo Willems', 'Jeffrey Blitz', 'Nicholas D''Agosto, Margo Martindale, Reece Thompson, Anna Kendrick, Jonah Hill, Denis O''Hare, Vincent Piazza, Aaron Yoo', 'R', 'Hal is a 15-year-old high-school student with a minor yet socially alienating (and painful) disability: he stutters uncontrollably. Determined to work through the problem, Hal opts for an extreme route – he joins the school debating team, which sends him on a headfirst plunge into breakneck speech competitions and offers a much-needed boost toward correcting the problem.', 'Hal is a 15-year-old high-school student with a minor yet socially alienating (and painful) disability: he stutters uncontrollably. Determined to work through the problem, Hal opts for an extreme route – he joins the school debating team, which sends him on a headfirst plunge into breakneck speech competitions and offers a much-needed boost toward correcting the problem.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d5MfQznQKNtTsLFhw4wVXoqfk5y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13068'),
  ('1088616122550487593', 'Rocket Singh: Salesman of the Year', 2009, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Shimit Amin, Vikash Nowlakha', 'Jaideep Sahni', 'Ranbir Kapoor, Prem Chopra, Mukesh Bhatt, D. Santosh, Naveen Kaushik, Gauahar Khan, Manish Chaudhary, Shazahn Padamsee', null, 'Rocket Singh: Salesman of the Year is the sometimes thoughtless, sometimes thoughtful story of a fresh graduate trying to find a balance between the maddening demands of the ''professional'' way, and the way of his heart - and stumbling upon a crazy way which turned his world upside down, and his career right side up. Welcome to the world of sales boss!', 'Rocket Singh: Salesman of the Year is the sometimes thoughtless, sometimes thoughtful story of a fresh graduate trying to find a balance between the maddening demands of the ''professional'' way, and the way of his heart - and stumbling upon a crazy way which turned his world upside down, and his career right side up. Welcome to the world of sales boss!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Z8lLFzPOBfOO4w3CykRaCeh9h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26815'),
  ('773228327770031413', 'Rocket Squad', 1956, 'Animation, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Chuck Jones', null, 'Mel Blanc', null, 'In a futuristic city, Detectives Monday and Tuesday pursue a wanted criminal.', 'In a futuristic city, Detectives Monday and Tuesday pursue a wanted criminal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AunHVjYdxjiTLH05zP07fPnqx6Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100345'),
  ('102463038133133293', 'Rocket-bye Baby', 1956, 'Animation, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Chuck Jones', null, 'Daws Butler, June Foray', 'NR', 'A cosmic mix-up results in a Martian baby being delivered to Earth, while an Earth baby is sent to Mars. Joseph Wilbur and his wife try to raise the green-skinned, ingenious Martian tyke as if he were an Earthling. But the kid builds his own spaceship and flies away, and Wilbur must find him and bring him back, or he''ll never be able to make an exchange with the Martian parents for his own boy.', 'A cosmic mix-up results in a Martian baby being delivered to Earth, while an Earth baby is sent to Mars. Joseph Wilbur and his wife try to raise the green-skinned, ingenious Martian tyke as if he were an Earthling. But the kid builds his own spaceship and flies away, and Wilbur must find him and bring him back, or he''ll never be able to make an exchange with the Martian parents for his own boy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9KRkMK5zP3aJGEAPW23lNjFtMGa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:188805'),
  ('739346063063476019', 'Rocketman', 2019, 'Music, History, Drama', 'Jack Ravenscroft, Joe Barlow, Tim Blake', 'Lee Hall', 'Taron Egerton, Jamie Bell, Richard Madden, Bryce Dallas Howard, Gemma Jones, Steven Mackintosh, Tom Bennett, Matthew Illesley', 'R', 'The story of Elton John''s life, from his years as a prodigy at the Royal Academy of Music through his influential and enduring musical partnership with Bernie Taupin.', 'The story of Elton John''s life, from his years as a prodigy at the Royal Academy of Music through his influential and enduring musical partnership with Bernie Taupin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f4FF18ia7yTvHf2izNrHqBmgH8U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:504608'),
  ('511200305248880049', 'RocketMan', 1997, 'Comedy, Family, Science Fiction', 'Stuart Gillard, Steven Poster', 'Craig Mazin, Greg Erb', 'Harland Williams, Jessica Lundy, William Sadler, Jeffrey DeMunn, James Pickens Jr., Beau Bridges, Peter Onorati, Don Lake', 'PG', 'An accident-prone and obnoxious geek joins a NASA space mission to Mars. During the flight, he manages to put himself and the entire crew in jeopardy, but is in danger of emerging as a hero when his new colleagues need him to save them from the unforgiving surface of the red planet.', 'An accident-prone and obnoxious geek joins a NASA space mission to Mars. During the flight, he manages to put himself and the entire crew in jeopardy, but is in danger of emerging as a hero when his new colleagues need him to save them from the unforgiving surface of the red planet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6ejazTl7f8lWY3quZhenIOyOfED.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36797'),
  ('430553394310234126', 'Rocketry: The Nambi Effect', 2022, 'Drama, History', 'Aadore Mukherjee Mehra, R. Madhavan, Sirsha Ray', 'R. Madhavan', 'R. Madhavan, Simran, Misha Ghoshal, Jagan, Dinesh Prabhakar, Ron Donachie, Vincent Riotta, Phyllis Logan', null, 'The story of the great Indian rocket scientist, Shri Nambi Narayanan''s life, a true patriot, who was turned into a villain in the blink of an eye after being falsely accused of treason.', 'The story of the great Indian rocket scientist, Shri Nambi Narayanan''s life, a true patriot, who was turned into a villain in the blink of an eye after being falsely accused of treason.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o7A1agEoXvwyyOmIbHnUhfnC34j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:607145'),
  ('982229038845689777', 'Rocketship X-M', 1950, 'Science Fiction, Adventure', 'Kurt Neumann, Karl Struss, Frank Heath', 'Kurt Neumann', 'Lloyd Bridges, Osa Massen, John Emery, Noah Beery Jr., Hugh O''Brian, Morris Ankrum, Patrick Aherne, Sherry Moreland', 'NR', 'Astronauts blast off to explore the moon on Rocketship X-M or "Rocketship eXploration Moon". A spacecraft malfunction and some fuel miscalculations cause them to end up landing on Mars. On Mars, evidence of a once powerful civilization is found. The scientists determined that an atomic war destroyed most of the Martians. Those that survived reverted to a caveman like existence.', 'Astronauts blast off to explore the moon on Rocketship X-M or "Rocketship eXploration Moon". A spacecraft malfunction and some fuel miscalculations cause them to end up landing on Mars. On Mars, evidence of a once powerful civilization is found. The scientists determined that an atomic war destroyed most of the Martians. Those that survived reverted to a caveman like existence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kEODdwwJBEROPYpFUPWHSAm1ZTJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37744'),
  ('623737885978908920', 'Rockford', 1999, 'Drama, Comedy', 'C. Ramprasad, Nagesh Kukunoor', null, 'Rohan Dey, Nandita Das, Nagesh Kukunoor, Jayant Kripalani, Soumyarka Gupta, Ulrika Krishnamurti, Imran Mirza, Shilpa Pai', null, 'The movie chronicles the arrival of a (Hindu) student to a strict all-boys Christian boarding school in India and his assimilation into the school. The change is quite dramatic to the protagonist and there are a lot of events that could look extremely abusive to the viewer.', 'The movie chronicles the arrival of a (Hindu) student to a strict all-boys Christian boarding school in India and his assimilation into the school. The change is quite dramatic to the protagonist and there are a lot of events that could look extremely abusive to the viewer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g3arvaLw68T10lONJOcdtMBU06l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46422'),
  ('926077078557325236', 'Rockin'' Thru the Rockies', 1940, 'Comedy', 'Jules White', 'Clyde Bruckman', 'Curly Howard, Moe Howard, Larry Fine, Dorothy Comingore, Lorna Gray, Dorothy Appleby, Kathryn Sheldon, Dick Curtis', 'NR', 'The stooges are frontier guides leading a minstrel show west. When hostile Indians run the horses run off they are stranded. They must contend with a snow storm and a marauding bear as well the Indians. After almost killing each other ice fishing they solve their problems by rigging up a sail on the wagon and sailing west.', 'The stooges are frontier guides leading a minstrel show west. When hostile Indians run the horses run off they are stranded. They must contend with a snow storm and a marauding bear as well the Indians. After almost killing each other ice fishing they solve their problems by rigging up a sail on the wagon and sailing west.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ekklOeRC98Rwu8CbPhnRVTX8umW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115981'),
  ('477430077362634773', 'Rockin'' with Judy Jetson', 1988, 'Animation, Comedy, Adventure', 'Paul Sommer, Andrea Romano', 'Charles M. Howell IV, Kevin Hopps', 'George O''Hanlon, Penny Singleton, Janet Waldo, Daws Butler, Rob Paulsen, Mel Blanc, Michael Bell, P.L. Brown', 'G', 'There''s intergalactic trouble when the lyrics Judy Jetson wrote for teen heartthrob Sky Rocker are swapped with a secret message from a music-hating witch. Now it''s up to Judy, her family, and friends to save rock-and-roll.', 'There''s intergalactic trouble when the lyrics Judy Jetson wrote for teen heartthrob Sky Rocker are swapped with a secret message from a music-hating witch. Now it''s up to Judy, her family, and friends to save rock-and-roll.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tnyHPjXOEnWD6wMzNWRJrn0Mh2g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:249246'),
  ('446064141216514290', 'Rockman.EXE: The Program of Light and Darkness', 2005, 'Science Fiction, Animation, Action', 'Takao Kato, Mitsuru Ishihara, Shinichi Yamaoka', 'Kenichi Araki', 'Kumiko Higa, Akiko Kimura, Hiro Yuuki, Mitsuki Saiga, Keiko Nemoto, Akiko Nakagawa, Daisuke Kishio, Daisuke Sakaguchi', null, 'The Dematerialization Phenomenon, in which the real world becomes digital, has become a problem and must be resolved immediately. After hearing of this incident, Netto and Rockman left off after their father and Network Researcher, Yuuichirou. He also had found news of an invasion in the computer of the Trinity Brain trust company: ''The Earth itself will understand the way things stand in the cyber world''. In order to destroy the program causing the incident, Netto and Rockman have to go deep underground. But old enemies await them there, as well as new ones. As they fought each other, the vicious cyber-life, Nebula Grey, awakens. The Dematerialization Phenomenon will not be stopped unless Nebula Grey is defeated.', 'The Dematerialization Phenomenon, in which the real world becomes digital, has become a problem and must be resolved immediately. After hearing of this incident, Netto and Rockman left off after their father and Network Researcher, Yuuichirou. He also had found news of an invasion in the computer of the Trinity Brain trust company: ''The Earth itself will understand the way things stand in the cyber world''. In order to destroy the program causing the incident, Netto and Rockman have to go deep underground. But old enemies await them there, as well as new ones. As they fought each other, the vicious cyber-life, Nebula Grey, awakens. The Dematerialization Phenomenon will not be stopped unless Nebula Grey is defeated.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s4wfXt3jO5p0BsyyDx1MFJw1Z8S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87073'),
  ('957619088831537718', 'RocknRolla', 2008, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Guy Ritchie, David Higgs, Andy Nicholson', 'Guy Ritchie', 'Gerard Butler, Tom Wilkinson, Thandiwe Newton, Mark Strong, Idris Elba, Tom Hardy, Karel Roden, Toby Kebbell', 'R', 'When a Russian mobster sets up a real estate scam that generates millions of pounds, various members of London''s criminal underworld pursue their share of the fortune. Various shady characters, including Mr One-Two, Stella the accountant, and Johnny Quid, a druggie rock-star, try to claim their slice.', 'When a Russian mobster sets up a real estate scam that generates millions of pounds, various members of London''s criminal underworld pursue their share of the fortune. Various shady characters, including Mr One-Two, Stella the accountant, and Johnny Quid, a druggie rock-star, try to claim their slice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i7eyngqjdvKB7NvrWtCjjTNNq8N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13809'),
  ('1018321631901453876', 'Rocko''s Modern Life: Static Cling', 2019, 'Animation, Comedy, TV Movie, Family', 'Joe Murray, Cosmo Segurson', 'Dan Becker, Joe Murray, Cosmo Segurson', 'Carlos Alazraqui, Tom Kenny, Charlie Adler, Mr. Lawrence, Jill Talley, Linda Wallem, Steve Little, Joe Murray', null, 'After 20 years in space, Rocko returns to a technologically advanced O-Town and makes it his mission to get his favorite show back on the air.', 'After 20 years in space, Rocko returns to a technologically advanced O-Town and makes it his mission to get his favorite show back on the air.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nMoIFggYmEilUcS44XZuxYvHfG6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:439059'),
  ('424396162838831699', 'Rocks', 2003, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Chris Stenner, Arvid Uibel, Heidi Wittlinger', 'Chris Stenner, Arvid Uibel, Heidi Wittlinger', 'Michael Habeck, Rainer Basedow', null, 'The stone-people Hew and Kew have seen a lot in their everlasting lives on top of their mountain. Therefore they''re only mildly amazed by the ongoings in the valley below, they''ve got their own little problems to deal with - But all of a sudden, Mankind is discovering and inventing, instead of just woozeling, and this new behavior starts to threaten Hew''s and Kew''s stoic peacefulness...', 'The stone-people Hew and Kew have seen a lot in their everlasting lives on top of their mountain. Therefore they''re only mildly amazed by the ongoings in the valley below, they''ve got their own little problems to deal with - But all of a sudden, Mankind is discovering and inventing, instead of just woozeling, and this new behavior starts to threaten Hew''s and Kew''s stoic peacefulness...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uUhmizRpIvO8LU4lERH8IlYmboo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37060'),
  ('251321988186048966', 'Rocks', 2019, 'Drama', 'Malinda Kaur, Amber Tordoff-Gibson, James Cross', 'Theresa Ikoko, Claire Wilson', 'Bukky Bakray, Kosar Ali, D''Angelou Osei-Kissiedu, Shaneigha-Monik Greyson, Ruby Stokes, Tawheda Begum, Afi Okaidja, Anastasia Dymitrow', null, '15-year-old Rocks fears that she and her little brother Emmanuel will be taken into care and forced apart if anyone finds out that their mother has left them. Against all odds, and with the help of her loyal friends, she evades the authorities and navigates the most defining days of her young life.', '15-year-old Rocks fears that she and her little brother Emmanuel will be taken into care and forced apart if anyone finds out that their mother has left them. Against all odds, and with the help of her loyal friends, she evades the authorities and navigates the most defining days of her young life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8Mg4ew6drIax6ZmeY22dxM8ujBk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:575773'),
  ('398119806847677803', 'Rockstar', 2011, 'Drama, Music, Romance', 'Imtiaz Ali, Anil Mehta', null, 'Ranbir Kapoor, Nargis Fakhri, Shammi Kapoor, Aditi Rao Hydari, Kumud Mishra, Piyush Mishra, Moufid Aziz, Shernaz Patel', null, 'College student Janardhan is a simpleton who desperately seeks inspiration for the musician inside him. Although heartbreak helps him reach his goal, it also leads him to self-destruction.', 'College student Janardhan is a simpleton who desperately seeks inspiration for the musician inside him. Although heartbreak helps him reach his goal, it also leads him to self-destruction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/km0cGsCwx8K9wxEPntQfM341oOs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79464'),
  ('995069794775049179', 'Rockstar: DUKI from the End of the World', 2025, 'Documentary, Music', 'Alejandro Hartmann, Alejandra Martín', 'Tatiana Merenuk, Soledad Venier', 'Duki', 'R', 'Argentine trap star Duki gives an intimate look at his past and career, from early rap battles to his rise as a verified hitmaker in this documentary.', 'Argentine trap star Duki gives an intimate look at his past and career, from early rap battles to his rise as a verified hitmaker in this documentary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9CSTzX1pUrNLD7lsJ8h9hRFJtLQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1546933'),
  ('30984924271696803', 'Rocktober Blood', 1984, 'Horror, Music', 'Beverly Sebastian, Ferd Sebastian', 'Beverly Sebastian, Ferd Sebastian', 'Tray Loren, Donna Scoggins, Cana Cockrell, Renee Hubbard, Ben Sebastian, Nigel Benjamin, Tony Rista, David Mables', null, 'A crazed rock singer returns from the dead to murder members of his former band.', 'A crazed rock singer returns from the dead to murder members of his former band.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7K7FeOUThkz04m0hR4T19qzOKnP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84994'),
  ('685517100987275510', 'Rockula', 1990, 'Horror, Comedy, Music, Romance', 'Luca Bercovici, John Schwartzman', 'Jefery Levy, Luca Bercovici, Chris Ver Wiel', 'Dean Cameron, Toni Basil, Thomas Dolby, Tawny Fere, Susan Tyrrell, Bo Diddley, Tony Cox, Karen Berger', 'PG-13', 'Ralph is a sexually frustrated vampire who suffers from a peculiar curse. He''s condemned for eternity to watch his one true love, Mona, be murdered by a pirate wielding a ham bone. But now? Now it''s 1990, and Ralph is determined to break Mona''s cycle of reincarnation. His first order of business is winning her affections, which he does by starting Rockula: a rock band that''s sure to stake a claim on her heart.', 'Ralph is a sexually frustrated vampire who suffers from a peculiar curse. He''s condemned for eternity to watch his one true love, Mona, be murdered by a pirate wielding a ham bone. But now? Now it''s 1990, and Ralph is determined to break Mona''s cycle of reincarnation. His first order of business is winning her affections, which he does by starting Rockula: a rock band that''s sure to stake a claim on her heart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oDTW0B2nnfhQz8oCHbbP858eJtx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77824'),
  ('894600619023733250', 'Rocky', 1976, 'Drama', 'John G. Avildsen, James Crabe, Fred T. Gallo', 'Sylvester Stallone', 'Sylvester Stallone, Talia Shire, Burt Young, Carl Weathers, Burgess Meredith, Thayer David, Joe Spinell, Jimmy Gambina', 'PG', 'Rocky Balboa is a Philadelphia club fighter who seems to be going nowhere. But when a stroke of fate puts him in the ring with a world heavyweight champion, Rocky knows that it''s his one shot at the big time — a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity to go the distance and come out a winner!', 'Rocky Balboa is a Philadelphia club fighter who seems to be going nowhere. But when a stroke of fate puts him in the ring with a world heavyweight champion, Rocky knows that it''s his one shot at the big time — a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity to go the distance and come out a winner!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hEjK9A9BkNXejFW4tfacVAEHtkn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1366'),
  ('1142099042782636401', 'Rocky & Hudson: The Gay Cowboys', 1994, 'Animation, Comedy, Western', 'Otto Guerra', 'Adão Iturrusgarai', 'Marcos Ribeiro, Garcia Júnior, Mauro Ramos, Sheila Dorfman, Mário Jorge', null, 'The homosexual cowboy duo Rocky and Hudson become involved in two plots. In the first, they need to fight a dangerous scientist, and in the second, they go in search of the Sacred Totem.', 'The homosexual cowboy duo Rocky and Hudson become involved in two plots. In the first, they need to fight a dangerous scientist, and in the second, they go in search of the Sacred Totem.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hwQEq2Aaf8ACgyZvUSdR3CLQqf7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:251569'),
  ('1018682017375517314', 'Rocky Aur Rani Kii Prem Kahaani', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama, Family, Romance', 'Karan Johar, Manush Nandan, Varun Lalwani', 'Ishita Moitra, Sumit Roy, Shashank Khaitan', 'Alia Bhatt, Ranveer Singh, Jaya Bachchan, Shabana Azmi, Dharmendra, Aamir Bashir, Tota Roy Chowdhury, Churni Ganguly', null, 'Gym-freak brat Rocky falls in love with Rani, who comes from a well-educated Bengali family. Being from polar opposite worlds, the two decide to switch their families to adjust to each other''s cultures and backgrounds and to know if their marriage will survive. Rocky and Rani are trapped in a world where they are united by love but divided by families and the ultimate question is will they fit in?', 'Gym-freak brat Rocky falls in love with Rani, who comes from a well-educated Bengali family. Being from polar opposite worlds, the two decide to switch their families to adjust to each other''s cultures and backgrounds and to know if their marriage will survive. Rocky and Rani are trapped in a world where they are united by love but divided by families and the ultimate question is will they fit in?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vTQIqlxUkOuyf2UKhlM2OUaFGKz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:848116'),
  ('781956374947471875', 'Rocky Balboa', 2006, 'Drama', 'Clark Mathis, Sylvester Stallone, Rip Murray', 'Sylvester Stallone', 'Sylvester Stallone, Burt Young, Antonio Tarver, Geraldine Hughes, Milo Ventimiglia, Tony Burton, A.J. Benza, James Francis Kelly III', 'PG', 'When he loses a highly publicized virtual boxing match to ex-champ Rocky Balboa, reigning heavyweight titleholder Mason Dixon retaliates by challenging the Italian Stallion to a 10-round exhibition bout. To the surprise of his son and friends, Rocky agrees to come out of retirement and face an opponent who''s faster, stronger and thirty years his junior. Rocky takes on Dixon in what will become the greatest fight in boxing history!', 'When he loses a highly publicized virtual boxing match to ex-champ Rocky Balboa, reigning heavyweight titleholder Mason Dixon retaliates by challenging the Italian Stallion to a 10-round exhibition bout. To the surprise of his son and friends, Rocky agrees to come out of retirement and face an opponent who''s faster, stronger and thirty years his junior. Rocky takes on Dixon in what will become the greatest fight in boxing history!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/byBlJvZwCqgtIwrZNv0pyE974jC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1246'),
  ('568275259608152854', 'Rocky Handsome', 2016, 'Action, Thriller', 'Nishikant Kamat, Shanker Raman, Mukesh Chhabra', 'Lee Jeong-beom', 'John Abraham, Shruti Haasan, Nathalia Kaur, Diya Chalwad, Nishikant Kamat, Sharad Kelkar, Shivkumar Subramaniam, Suhasini Mulay', 'R', 'A vengeful man embarks on a murderous rampage after the kidnapping of a 7-year-old girl.', 'A vengeful man embarks on a murderous rampage after the kidnapping of a 7-year-old girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x6jfeYy7KTBk4eS0kMUHTd4sGtZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:376873'),
  ('653790375738330541', 'Rocky II', 1979, 'Drama', 'Sylvester Stallone, Bill Butler, Michael McLean', 'Sylvester Stallone', 'Sylvester Stallone, Talia Shire, Burt Young, Carl Weathers, Burgess Meredith, Tony Burton, Joe Spinell, Leonard Gaines', 'PG', 'After Rocky goes the distance with champ Apollo Creed, both try to put the fight behind them and move on. Rocky settles down with Adrian but can''t put his life together outside the ring, while Creed seeks a rematch to restore his reputation. Soon enough, the "Master of Disaster" and the "Italian Stallion" are set on a collision course for a climactic battle that is brutal and unforgettable.', 'After Rocky goes the distance with champ Apollo Creed, both try to put the fight behind them and move on. Rocky settles down with Adrian but can''t put his life together outside the ring, while Creed seeks a rematch to restore his reputation. Soon enough, the "Master of Disaster" and the "Italian Stallion" are set on a collision course for a climactic battle that is brutal and unforgettable.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nMaiiu0CzT77U4JZkUYV7KqdAjK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1367'),
  ('1118647881140552057', 'Rocky III', 1982, 'Drama, Action', 'Sylvester Stallone, Bill Butler, Clifford C. Coleman', 'Sylvester Stallone', 'Sylvester Stallone, Talia Shire, Burt Young, Carl Weathers, Mr. T, Burgess Meredith, Tony Burton, Hulk Hogan', 'PG', 'Following Rocky Balboa''s intense battle with his most powerful adversary yet – the ferocious Clubber Lang – Rocky joins forces with former rival Apollo Creed in an effort to get back his fighting spirit.', 'Following Rocky Balboa''s intense battle with his most powerful adversary yet – the ferocious Clubber Lang – Rocky joins forces with former rival Apollo Creed in an effort to get back his fighting spirit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lklrplDDuALhY3k8IDFdRqtpZPk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1371'),
  ('640189839850355004', 'Rocky IV', 1985, 'Drama', 'Sylvester Stallone, Bill Butler, William Ladd Skinner', 'Sylvester Stallone', 'Sylvester Stallone, Dolph Lundgren, Carl Weathers, Talia Shire, Burt Young, Brigitte Nielsen, Tony Burton, Michael Pataki', 'PG-13', 'Rocky Balboa holds the world heavyweight championship, but a new challenger has stepped forward: Drago, a six-foot-four, 261-pound fighter who has the backing of the Soviet Union. This time, Rocky''s training regimen takes him to Siberia, where he prepares for a globally televised match in the heart of Moscow. But nothing can truly prepare him for what he''s about to face – a fight to the finish, in which he must defend not only himself, but also the honor of his country!', 'Rocky Balboa holds the world heavyweight championship, but a new challenger has stepped forward: Drago, a six-foot-four, 261-pound fighter who has the backing of the Soviet Union. This time, Rocky''s training regimen takes him to Siberia, where he prepares for a globally televised match in the heart of Moscow. But nothing can truly prepare him for what he''s about to face – a fight to the finish, in which he must defend not only himself, but also the honor of his country!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2MHUit4H6OK5adcOjnCN6suCKOl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1374'),
  ('944227775629255840', 'Rocky Marciano', 1999, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Charles Winkler', 'Larry Golin, William Nack, Charles Winkler', 'Jon Favreau, Penelope Ann Miller, Judd Hirsch, Tony Lo Bianco, Duane Davis, Rino Romano, George C. Scott, Rhoda Gemignani', null, 'Step into the ring with one of America''s greatest legends...and stand a couple of rounds with greatness! "Pulling no punches" (LA Daily News), Jon Favreau (Swingers) and OscarÂ(r) winner* George C. Scott give TKO performances in this outstanding biography of the only undefeated world heavyweight champion in the history of boxing! In the small blue-collar town of Brockton, Massachusetts, young Rocky Marciano (Favreau) turns to the ring as his ticket out. Training twice as hard and twice as long as anyone else, he pounds his way to victory and his reputation quickly spreads as "the guy to beat." But behind the gloves Rocky is unhappy with his gift and he''s thinking of retiring. So, with the fate of his career hanging in the balance, he finds a way to unleash his thunder againthis time against his biggest hero: Joe Louis!', 'Step into the ring with one of America''s greatest legends...and stand a couple of rounds with greatness! "Pulling no punches" (LA Daily News), Jon Favreau (Swingers) and OscarÂ(r) winner* George C. Scott give TKO performances in this outstanding biography of the only undefeated world heavyweight champion in the history of boxing! In the small blue-collar town of Brockton, Massachusetts, young Rocky Marciano (Favreau) turns to the ring as his ticket out. Training twice as hard and twice as long as anyone else, he pounds his way to victory and his reputation quickly spreads as "the guy to beat." But behind the gloves Rocky is unhappy with his gift and he''s thinking of retiring. So, with the fate of his career hanging in the balance, he finds a way to unleash his thunder againthis time against his biggest hero: Joe Louis!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/etGbqFX6lNbthXtj85gXJuDQ9TA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41288'),
  ('765662393981586702', 'Rocky Mountain', 1950, 'Adventure, Western', 'Frank Mattison, Ted D. McCord, William Keighley', 'Winston Miller, Alan Le May', 'Errol Flynn, Patrice Wymore, Scott Forbes, Guinn ''Big Boy'' Williams, Dickie Jones, Howard Petrie, Slim Pickens, Chubby Johnson', 'NR', 'A Confederate troop, led by Captain Lafe Barstow, is prowling the far ranges of California and Nevada in a last desperate attempt to build up an army in the West for the faltering Confederacy. Because the patrol saves a stagecoach, with Johanna Carterr as one of the passengers, from an Indian attack, and is marooned on a rocky mountain, it fails in its mission but the honor of the Old South is upheld.', 'A Confederate troop, led by Captain Lafe Barstow, is prowling the far ranges of California and Nevada in a last desperate attempt to build up an army in the West for the faltering Confederacy. Because the patrol saves a stagecoach, with Johanna Carterr as one of the passengers, from an Indian attack, and is marooned on a rocky mountain, it fails in its mission but the honor of the Old South is upheld.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fxo5QdEFPr6feRs5Pt0EXH5m1qp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48897'),
  ('506353139283668703', 'Rocky Mountain Christmas', 2017, 'Drama, TV Movie, Romance', 'Tibor Takács, Adam Sliwinski', 'Gregg Rossen, Brian Sawyer, Elena Zaretsky', 'Lindy Booth, Kristoffer Polaha, Treat Williams, Chris McNally, Jason Schombing, Paige McCulloch, Marci T. House, Rhonda Dent', 'G', 'Sarah Davis heads to her uncle’s struggling ranch to escape New York and the spotlight from a recent breakup. Returning home for the first time since her aunt passed, complications arise when Graham, an entitled Hollywood star, arrives at the ranch to prepare for his next film. As Sarah and Graham start to bond, Sarah may get more for Christmas than she bargained for.', 'Sarah Davis heads to her uncle’s struggling ranch to escape New York and the spotlight from a recent breakup. Returning home for the first time since her aunt passed, complications arise when Graham, an entitled Hollywood star, arrives at the ranch to prepare for his next film. As Sarah and Graham start to bond, Sarah may get more for Christmas than she bargained for.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/314Nw750L4PoQj0ypMB1gKnA0e0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:491761'),
  ('343368291374522950', 'Rocky Mountain Holiday with John Denver and the Muppets', 1983, 'Comedy, Family, Music, TV Movie', 'George Riesenberger, Jim Henson', 'Joseph A. Bailey, Jon Stone', 'John Denver, Jim Henson, Frank Oz, Jerry Nelson, Richard Hunt, Dave Goelz, Steve Whitmire, Kathryn Mullen', 'NR', 'Rocky Mountain Holiday is a one-hour musical variety special featuring John Denver and the Muppets, which aired on ABC on May 12, 1983. In the special, John and the Muppets go on a summer camping trip to the Rocky Mountains.', 'Rocky Mountain Holiday is a one-hour musical variety special featuring John Denver and the Muppets, which aired on ABC on May 12, 1983. In the special, John and the Muppets go on a summer camping trip to the Rocky Mountains.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q6xdyPKI1KytagJ7USKmHstRxRV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78491'),
  ('929746223129133543', 'Rocky V', 1990, 'Drama', 'John G. Avildsen, Steven Poster, Clifford C. Coleman', 'Sylvester Stallone', 'Sylvester Stallone, Talia Shire, Burt Young, Richard Gant, Tommy Morrison, Sage Stallone, Burgess Meredith, Tony Burton', 'PG-13', 'A lifetime of taking shots has ended Rocky’s career, and a crooked accountant has left him broke. Inspired by the memory of his trainer, however, Rocky finds glory in training and takes on an up-and-coming boxer.', 'A lifetime of taking shots has ended Rocky’s career, and a crooked accountant has left him broke. Inspired by the memory of his trainer, however, Rocky finds glory in training and takes on an up-and-coming boxer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qCARerjCFZOEeLiVdomhwRYlDSn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1375'),
  ('578980029704804653', 'Rocky VI', 1986, 'Comedy, Music', 'Aki Kaurismäki, Timo Salminen', 'Mato Valtonen, Sakke Järvenpää, Aki Kaurismäki', 'Silu Seppälä, Sakari Kuosmanen, Heinäsirkka, Mato Valtonen, Juuso Hirvikangas, Matti Pellonpää, Jaakko Talaskivi, Sakke Järvenpää', null, 'Not to be confused with any of the sequels to Sylvester Stallone''s classic Oscar-winning Rocky, this short film from Finnish filmmaker Aki Kaurismäki is actually meant as a parody of the late Cold War-era Rocky IV, which saw Stallone''s character taking on a juiced-up Russian fighter played by Dolph Lundgren. In this 1986 send-up, Rock''y, played by Silu Seppala, goes head to head with Soviet Igor (Sakari Kuosmanen) and loses.', 'Not to be confused with any of the sequels to Sylvester Stallone''s classic Oscar-winning Rocky, this short film from Finnish filmmaker Aki Kaurismäki is actually meant as a parody of the late Cold War-era Rocky IV, which saw Stallone''s character taking on a juiced-up Russian fighter played by Dolph Lundgren. In this 1986 send-up, Rock''y, played by Silu Seppala, goes head to head with Soviet Igor (Sakari Kuosmanen) and loses.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yCeabh22fxbiKPhiyWLWYpoRaiA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60375'),
  ('1072963908902523361', 'Rod Steele 0014: You Only Live Until You Die', 1997, 'Action, Comedy', 'Rolfe Kanefsky, Nils Erickson', 'Rolfe Kanefsky', 'Robert Donavan, John Lazar, De''Ann Power, Gabriella Hall, Scott Coppola, Jacqueline Lovell, Mark Collver, Michelle Bauer', 'NR', 'Rod Steele (aka Agent 0014) is anything but the world''s greatest super spy, but when diabolical villainess Tangerina threatens the world again, he''s the world''s last and only hope.', 'Rod Steele (aka Agent 0014) is anything but the world''s greatest super spy, but when diabolical villainess Tangerina threatens the world again, he''s the world''s last and only hope.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vVxKzT8NWqr08Bv9ZbmSjWFFxd1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30733'),
  ('593692175778111551', 'Rodan', 1956, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Jun Fukuda, Ishirō Honda, Isamu Ashida', 'Takeshi Kimura, Takeo Murata', 'Kenji Sahara, Yumi Shirakawa, Akihiko Hirata, Minosuke Yamada, Yoshibumi Tajima, Akio Kobori, Mitsuo Tsuda, Ren Imaizumi', null, 'Mining engineer Shigeru investigates the disappearance and death of his fellow coworkers when prehistoric nymphs are discovered emerging from the mines. After an attack on the local village, Shigeru heads deeper into the mines only to make a more horrifying discovery in the form a prehistoric flying creature. Soon a second monster appears as the two converge in Fukuoka.', 'Mining engineer Shigeru investigates the disappearance and death of his fellow coworkers when prehistoric nymphs are discovered emerging from the mines. After an attack on the local village, Shigeru heads deeper into the mines only to make a more horrifying discovery in the form a prehistoric flying creature. Soon a second monster appears as the two converge in Fukuoka.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tcSSYYFsRrQCvy2HskkwpY29NnB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19742'),
  ('474083943910505305', 'Rodents', 1999, 'Action, Drama, Crime', 'Sebastián Cordero, Matthew Jensen, Viviana Cordero', 'Sebastián Cordero', 'Carlos Valencia, Marco Bustos, Alex Aspiazu, Cristina Dávila, Irina López, Fabricio Lalama, Simon Brauer, Antonio Negret', null, 'The world of Salvador, a young and naive petty thief is changed by the arrival of his cousin Angel, an ex-convict in search of easy money, and with a hideout. Salvador gets wrapped up in Angel''s twisted dealings in an attempt to escape from his suffocating family, dragging along his family and friends, in his criminal path. Where will this all lead?', 'The world of Salvador, a young and naive petty thief is changed by the arrival of his cousin Angel, an ex-convict in search of easy money, and with a hideout. Salvador gets wrapped up in Angel''s twisted dealings in an attempt to escape from his suffocating family, dragging along his family and friends, in his criminal path. Where will this all lead?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/327s87WVi7RFfecCDmim4W6kqnY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:265087'),
  ('354078761426526788', 'Rodeo', 2022, 'Drama, Crime', 'Raphaël Vandenbussche, Lola Quivoron', 'Antonia Buresi, Lola Quivoron', 'Julie Ledru, Antonia Buresi, Yanis Lafki, Louis Sotton, Junior Correia, Ahmed Hamdi, Mohamed Bettahar, Dave Nsaman Okebwan', 'NR', 'Hot-tempered and fiercely independent gearhead Julia meets a crew of dirt riders who fly along at full speed and perform stunts. She sets about infiltrating their male-dominated world, until an accident jeopardizes her ability to fit in.', 'Hot-tempered and fiercely independent gearhead Julia meets a crew of dirt riders who fly along at full speed and perform stunts. She sets about infiltrating their male-dominated world, until an accident jeopardizes her ability to fit in.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y5M3HqwF09cb2Sh5iE5V0LqRbmv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:936378'),
  ('732305573371852256', 'Rodeo and Juliet', 2015, 'Romance, Family, TV Movie', 'Keith Alan Morris, Thadd Turner', 'Stephen Beck, Harry Cason, Thadd Turner', 'Krista Allen, Tim Abell, Nadine Crocker, Zeb Halsell, Buck Taylor, Ariel Lucius, Chris Ranney, Lauren Alexandra', null, 'Juliet heads to her grandfather’s ranch with her mother for Christmas, where she meets a horse named Rodeo and young cowboy who change her life.', 'Juliet heads to her grandfather’s ranch with her mother for Christmas, where she meets a horse named Rodeo and young cowboy who change her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pMRKo6QmAggYcleh7abrk0jizKB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:365753'),
  ('1151891353555245615', 'Rodin', 2017, 'Drama, Romance', 'Jacques Doillon, Nicolas Guilleminot, Christophe Beaucarne', 'Jacques Doillon', 'Vincent Lindon, Izïa Higelin, Séverine Caneele, Magdalena Malina, Edward Akrout, Patricia Mazuy, Olivia Baes, Bernard Verley', null, 'Auguste Rodin (1840-1917), man of the people, autodidact and revolutionary sculptor - the most brilliant of his era. At 42, Rodin meets Camille Claudel, a young woman desperate to become his assistant. He quickly acknowledges her as his most able pupil, and treats her as an equal in matters of creation.', 'Auguste Rodin (1840-1917), man of the people, autodidact and revolutionary sculptor - the most brilliant of his era. At 42, Rodin meets Camille Claudel, a young woman desperate to become his assistant. He quickly acknowledges her as his most able pupil, and treats her as an equal in matters of creation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3bQGnpTM2uluIMC1wfZWW5ldunp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:445768'),
  ('915098447874549141', 'Rodrigo D. No Future', 1990, 'Crime, Drama, Music', 'Víctor Gaviria, Felipe Aljure', 'Víctor Gaviria, Juan Guillermo Arredondo, Ramón Correa', 'Ramiro Meneses, Carlos Mario Restrepo, Jackson Idrian Gallego, Vilma Díaz, Óscar Hernández, Irene de Galvis, Wilson Blandón, Leonardo Favio Sánchez', null, 'Rodrigo and his friends, restless teenagers from the marginalized neighborhoods on the hillsides of Medellín, spend their time causing trouble. But Rodrigo dreams of playing rock music and brings his friends together to form a punk band that becomes a lifeline amid a web of disorientation, violence, drugs, and fear.', 'Rodrigo and his friends, restless teenagers from the marginalized neighborhoods on the hillsides of Medellín, spend their time causing trouble. But Rodrigo dreams of playing rock music and brings his friends together to form a punk band that becomes a lifeline amid a web of disorientation, violence, drugs, and fear.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AqsLzU6AQUIHuDsQnqHT1qy0HVV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:177579'),
  ('451071696990070500', 'Rodrigue in Love', 2025, 'Comedy, Family', 'Johann Dionnet, Thomas Rames, Marine Barreau', 'François Magnin', 'Baptiste Lecaplain, Élisa Erka, Romain Francisco, Amaury de Crayencour, Ariane Mourier, Alison Wheeler, Lyes Salem, Rudy Milstein', null, 'A struggling actor, Stéphane arrives with his troupe at the Avignon Festival to perform a boulevard play. There, he meets Fanny, a renowned actress, and falls under her spell. Taking advantage of a misunderstanding to get closer to her, Stéphane sinks into a lie that he will have to keep going for the duration of the festival... but which will quickly overwhelm him!', 'A struggling actor, Stéphane arrives with his troupe at the Avignon Festival to perform a boulevard play. There, he meets Fanny, a renowned actress, and falls under her spell. Taking advantage of a misunderstanding to get closer to her, Stéphane sinks into a lie that he will have to keep going for the duration of the festival... but which will quickly overwhelm him!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oZAnL8j1RtFP2PsQKNgDC8g1XEe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1352310'),
  ('324516664339445279', 'Roe v. Wade', 2021, 'Drama, History', 'Alan McIntyre Smith, Nick Loeb, Cathy Allyn', 'Cathy Allyn, Nick Loeb', 'Jon Voight, Nick Loeb, Robert Davi, Stacey Dash, Jamie Kennedy, Joey Lawrence, Corbin Bernsen, Justine Wachsberger', 'PG-13', 'Drs. Bernard Nathanson and Mildred Jefferson square off in a national battle in this untold conspiracy that led to the most famous and controversial court case in history.', 'Drs. Bernard Nathanson and Mildred Jefferson square off in a national battle in this untold conspiracy that led to the most famous and controversial court case in history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ua3UIPn5IT07P73BaP1daVhIFDt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:565470'),
  ('880764853850945375', 'Roe vs. Wade', 1989, 'TV Movie, Drama', 'Gregory Hoblit, Newton Thomas Sigel', 'Alison Cross', 'Holly Hunter, Amy Madigan, Chris Mulkey, Terry O''Quinn, Stephen Tobolowsky, James Gammon, Dion Anderson, Kathy Bates', null, 'Holly Hunter plays a lonely, single, poorly educated Texan who finds herself pregnant with no means to support a child. To avoid giving up the child, she seeks an abortion. Denied an abortion in Texas the young woman hires a novice lawyer to plead her case in the US supreme court. Eventually the law is changed, but for the character it takes longer than nine months.', 'Holly Hunter plays a lonely, single, poorly educated Texan who finds herself pregnant with no means to support a child. To avoid giving up the child, she seeks an abortion. Denied an abortion in Texas the young woman hires a novice lawyer to plead her case in the US supreme court. Eventually the law is changed, but for the character it takes longer than nine months.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v7JM0saXGsfZtzIbtNHqgpoD54h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:263036'),
  ('205224778068785073', 'Rog', 2005, 'Drama, Thriller, Romance', 'Himanshu Brahmbhatt, Munish Makhija, Gaurav Khindaria', 'Niranjan Iyengar, Mahesh Bhatt, Subodh Chopra', 'Irrfan Khan, Ilene Hamann, Suhel Seth, Shyamoli Verma, Himanshu Malik, Manish Makhija, Denzil Smith', null, 'A troubled police officer falls in love with a dead woman whose murder he is investigating', 'A troubled police officer falls in love with a dead woman whose murder he is investigating', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3odZM1TuJH2n41fLLOykCFoSPgr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75467'),
  ('1082667138054649959', 'Roger & Me', 1989, 'Documentary, History, Comedy', 'Michael Moore, Kevin Rafferty', 'Michael Moore', 'Michael Moore, Rhonda Britton, Fred Ross, Roger B. Smith, Bob Eubanks, James Blanchard, Kaye Lani Rae Rafko Wilson, Pat Boone', 'R', 'A documentary about the closure of General Motors'' plant at Flint, Michigan, which resulted in the loss of 30,000 jobs. Details the attempts of filmmaker Michael Moore to get an interview with GM CEO Roger Smith.', 'A documentary about the closure of General Motors'' plant at Flint, Michigan, which resulted in the loss of 30,000 jobs. Details the attempts of filmmaker Michael Moore to get an interview with GM CEO Roger Smith.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ePVEnKOMtrIfHZ6wQBfWihTvwqD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1779'),
  ('75103987075355700', 'Roger Dodger', 2002, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Dylan Kidd, Joaquín Baca-Asay', 'Dylan Kidd', 'Campbell Scott, Jesse Eisenberg, Isabella Rossellini, Elizabeth Berkley, Jennifer Beals, Morena Baccarin, Mina Badie, Ato Essandoh', 'R', 'A smooth-talking ad executive attributes his remarkable success with women to his ability to manipulate their emotions from the moment he first meets them. When his teenage nephew drops in for a visit, he soon learns that his approach isn''t as foolproof as he thought when he attempts to teach the boy how to pick up women.', 'A smooth-talking ad executive attributes his remarkable success with women to his ability to manipulate their emotions from the moment he first meets them. When his teenage nephew drops in for a visit, he soon learns that his approach isn''t as foolproof as he thought when he attempts to teach the boy how to pick up women.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/koAdQdL3LUtho4nd1DWSubE7dU6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13441'),
  ('812265570747299910', 'Roger Waters: The Wall', 2014, 'Music, Documentary', 'Roger Waters, Sean Evans', 'Roger Waters', 'Roger Waters, Dave Kilminster, Graham Broad, Snowy White, Jon Carin', null, 'A concert film that the former Pink Floyd singer-songwriter made on various tour dates between 2010 and 2013, when he was playing his former group''s 1980 double-album in its entirety.', 'A concert film that the former Pink Floyd singer-songwriter made on various tour dates between 2010 and 2013, when he was playing his former group''s 1980 double-album in its entirety.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oFPVC3ival04a9Yijm716QXOsCA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:290382'),
  ('749603655677325718', 'Roger Waters: The Wall - Live in Berlin', 1990, 'Music', 'Ken O''Neill', 'Roger Waters', 'Roger Waters, Klaus Meine, Matthias Jabs, Rudolf Schenker, Francis Buchholz, Herman Rarebell, Ute Lemper, Cyndi Lauper', null, 'A global television broadcast of the event in which former Pink Floyd leader singer and composer Roger Waters led an all-star cast in a mammoth benefit performance of his acclaimed concept album, The Wall. Set in Berlin, Germany less than a year after the destruction of the hated Berlin Wall, Waters was accompanied by disparate talents such as Cyndi Lauper, James Galway, Joni Mitchell and Albert Finney in the classic dark musical tale of a rock star''s descent into madness and back.', 'A global television broadcast of the event in which former Pink Floyd leader singer and composer Roger Waters led an all-star cast in a mammoth benefit performance of his acclaimed concept album, The Wall. Set in Berlin, Germany less than a year after the destruction of the hated Berlin Wall, Waters was accompanied by disparate talents such as Cyndi Lauper, James Galway, Joni Mitchell and Albert Finney in the classic dark musical tale of a rock star''s descent into madness and back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/djjobmdz3bUUL641d1pLgBevK02.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47271'),
  ('985343447381237202', 'Roger Waters: Us + Them', 2019, 'Music, Documentary', 'Sean Evans, Roger Waters', null, 'Roger Waters, Jon Carin, Dave Kilminster, Bo Koster, Holly Laessig, Ian Ritchie, Gus Seyffert, Joey Waronker', null, 'Filmed in Amsterdam on the European leg of his 2017 – 2018 Us + Them tour which saw Waters perform to over two million people worldwide, the film features songs from his legendary Pink Floyd albums (The Dark Side of the Moon, The Wall, Animals, Wish You Were Here) and from his last album, Is This The Life We Really Want?', 'Filmed in Amsterdam on the European leg of his 2017 – 2018 Us + Them tour which saw Waters perform to over two million people worldwide, the film features songs from his legendary Pink Floyd albums (The Dark Side of the Moon, The Wall, Animals, Wish You Were Here) and from his last album, Is This The Life We Really Want?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h5iaU213fe4cV5hiw2FR6c8YCe1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:617924'),
  ('438412949701938053', 'Rogue', 2007, 'Action, Horror, Thriller', 'Greg McLean, Todd Embling, Marshall Crosby', 'Greg McLean', 'Radha Mitchell, Michael Vartan, Sam Worthington, Caroline Brazier, Stephen Curry, Celia Ireland, John Jarratt, Heather Mitchell', 'R', 'When a group of tourists stumble into the remote Australian river territory of an enormous crocodile, the deadly creature traps them on a tiny mud island with the tide quickly rising and darkness descending. As the hungry predator closes in, they must fight for survival against all odds.', 'When a group of tourists stumble into the remote Australian river territory of an enormous crocodile, the deadly creature traps them on a tiny mud island with the tide quickly rising and darkness descending. As the hungry predator closes in, they must fight for survival against all odds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/abFDVe71e7UE5MpAqjZvUYT2U7M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13022'),
  ('433343295237911176', 'Rogue', 2020, 'Action, Adventure', 'MJ Bassett, Brendan Barnes, Neely Eisenstein', 'Isabel Bassett, MJ Bassett', 'Megan Fox, Philip Winchester, Greg Kriek, Brandon Auret, Jessica Sutton, Kenneth Fok, Isabel Bassett, Adam Deacon', 'R', 'Battle-hardened O’Hara leads a lively mercenary team of soldiers on a daring mission: rescue hostages from their captors in remote Africa. But as the mission goes awry and the team is stranded, O’Hara’s squad must face a bloody, brutal encounter with a gang of rebels.', 'Battle-hardened O’Hara leads a lively mercenary team of soldiers on a daring mission: rescue hostages from their captors in remote Africa. But as the mission goes awry and the team is stranded, O’Hara’s squad must face a bloody, brutal encounter with a gang of rebels.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uOw5JD8IlD546feZ6oxbIjvN66P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:718444'),
  ('57731694561571737', 'Rogue Agent', 2022, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Declan Lawn, Adam Patterson, Larry Smith', 'Michael Bronner', 'Gemma Arterton, James Norton, Marisa Abela, Sarah Goldberg, Shazad Latif, Freya Mavor, Rob Malone, Julian Barratt', null, 'Conman Robert Freegard poses as an undercover MI5 agent and kidnaps countless victims amidst a high-stakes manhunt, until the woman who fell for him brings him to justice.', 'Conman Robert Freegard poses as an undercover MI5 agent and kidnaps countless victims amidst a high-stakes manhunt, until the woman who fell for him brings him to justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4tOaGR6mzUAEQzIgWCeVoneRIkp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:846956'),
  ('827857532413868240', 'Rogue City', 2020, 'Crime, Thriller, Action, Drama', 'Denis Rouden, Olivier Marchal, Franck Delpech', 'Olivier Marchal', 'Lannick Gautry, Stanislas Merhar, Kaaris, Jean Reno, David Belle, Gérard Lanvin, Moussa Maaskri, Catherine Marchal', 'PG-13', 'Caught in the crosshairs of police corruption and Marseille’s warring gangs, a loyal cop must protect his squad by taking matters into his own hands.', 'Caught in the crosshairs of police corruption and Marseille’s warring gangs, a loyal cop must protect his squad by taking matters into his own hands.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9HT9982bzgN5on1sLRmc1GMn6ZC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:671039'),
