  ('586664905825203668', 'Rogue Hostage', 2021, 'Action, Adventure, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Joe Narode, Jon Keeyes, Pasha Patriki', 'Mickey Solis', 'Tyrese Gibson, John Malkovich, Michael Jai White, Holly Taylor, Luna Lauren Vélez, Christopher Backus, John D. Hickman, Leslie Stratton', 'NR', 'A former Marine races against time to save a group of hostages -- including his young daughter and a congressman — when armed militants take over his stepfather''s store.', 'A former Marine races against time to save a group of hostages -- including his young daughter and a congressman — when armed militants take over his stepfather''s store.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zedUsN2fxRYhrp8k4uHVZuoEPaj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:825997'),
  ('784679677937223945', 'Rogue Male', 1976, 'Drama, War, TV Movie', 'Clive Donner, Brian Tufano', 'Frederic Raphael', 'Peter O''Toole, John Standing, Alastair Sim, Harold Pinter, Michael Byrne, Mark McManus, Ray Smith, Hugh Manning', 'NR', 'In 1939, Sir Robert Thorndyke takes aim at Adolf Hitler with a high powered rifle, but the shot misses its mark. Captured and tortured by the Gestapo and left for dead, Sir Robert makes his way back to England where he discovers the Gestapo has followed him. Knowing that his government would turn him over to German authorities, Sir Robert goes underground in his battle with his pursuers.', 'In 1939, Sir Robert Thorndyke takes aim at Adolf Hitler with a high powered rifle, but the shot misses its mark. Captured and tortured by the Gestapo and left for dead, Sir Robert makes his way back to England where he discovers the Gestapo has followed him. Knowing that his government would turn him over to German authorities, Sir Robert goes underground in his battle with his pursuers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2SizHGYx1fdiBh0D4MUBcE7JNhZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:141752'),
  ('437292560395177443', 'Rogue One: A Star Wars Story', 2016, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Sarah Mooney, Gareth Edwards, Greig Fraser', 'Chris Weitz, Tony Gilroy', 'Felicity Jones, Diego Luna, Alan Tudyk, Donnie Yen, Jiang Wen, Ben Mendelsohn, Guy Henry, Forest Whitaker', 'PG-13', 'A rogue band of resistance fighters unite for a mission to steal the Death Star plans and bring a new hope to the galaxy.', 'A rogue band of resistance fighters unite for a mission to steal the Death Star plans and bring a new hope to the galaxy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i0yw1mFbB7sNGHCs7EXZPzFkdA1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:330459'),
  ('486204876725748808', 'Rogue River', 2012, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Jourdan McClure, Brian Hamm', 'Ryan Finnerty, Kevin Haskin', 'Michelle Page, Art Alexakis, Chris Coy, Michael Cudlitz, Lucinda Jenney, Bill Moseley, Michael Rooker', 'R', 'When a young woman takes a trip down Rogue River, her car mysteriously disappears. Lost without transport or communication, she accepts the hospitality of a stranger who offers her shelter for the night at his cabin. With no other options available, she reluctantly accepts only to forever regret it. The ensuing hours yield nothing but torture, indescribable pain, and horrific agony. If you''ve seen Misery, you''ve seen nothing. This movie starts where horror films end and leaves viewers paralysed by fear and disgust.', 'When a young woman takes a trip down Rogue River, her car mysteriously disappears. Lost without transport or communication, she accepts the hospitality of a stranger who offers her shelter for the night at his cabin. With no other options available, she reluctantly accepts only to forever regret it. The ensuing hours yield nothing but torture, indescribable pain, and horrific agony. If you''ve seen Misery, you''ve seen nothing. This movie starts where horror films end and leaves viewers paralysed by fear and disgust.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qQ2dHxeS3PtBfwciQZXGxjlZoEK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79550'),
  ('86971749856139713', 'Rogue Trader', 1999, 'Drama, History, Thriller', 'James Dearden, Jean-François Robin', 'James Dearden', 'Ewan McGregor, Anna Friel, Nigel Lindsay, Tim McInnerny, Irene Ng, Lee Ross, Yves Beneyton, Simon Shepherd', null, 'Rogue Trader tells the true story of Nick Leeson, an employee of Barings Bank who--after a successful trading run--ends up accumulating $1.4 billion in losses hidden in account #88888.', 'Rogue Trader tells the true story of Nick Leeson, an employee of Barings Bank who--after a successful trading run--ends up accumulating $1.4 billion in losses hidden in account #88888.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t10DvWj5Yeog5jsJZuBoFDJJbhP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21039'),
  ('102690226248487501', 'Rogue Warfare', 2019, 'War, Action', 'Mike Gunther, Robert Dierx, John T. Connor', 'Mike Gunther', 'Stephen Lang, Will Yun Lee, Chris Mulkey, Rory Markham, Roman Mitichyan, Jermaine Love, Bertrand-Xavier Corbi, Katie Keene', 'R', 'A group of military elite from the U.S., Russia, UK, China and France join forces to fight an elite underground terrorist network.', 'A group of military elite from the U.S., Russia, UK, China and France join forces to fight an elite underground terrorist network.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/78hDh9EHDMbox4FlKlOrRfrmgpU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:627879'),
  ('1040938372990992413', 'Rogue Warfare: Death of a Nation', 2020, 'War, Action', 'Mike Gunther, John T. Connor, Pete Waterman', 'Michael Day', 'Will Yun Lee, Jermaine Love, Rory Markham, Stephen Lang, Bertrand-Xavier Corbi, Katie Keene, Fernando Chien, Chris Mulkey', 'R', 'After rescuing Daniel from the terrorist Black Mask Organization, the team uncovers plans for a deadly bomb set to detonate in 36 hours that threatens world order. With no time to recover, Daniel must throw his life back on the line as he and his elite team of soldiers race against time to find the bomb and defeat their enemy once and for all. Outnumbered and overmatched, each soldier must find their inner strength and skill to overcome insurmountable odds.', 'After rescuing Daniel from the terrorist Black Mask Organization, the team uncovers plans for a deadly bomb set to detonate in 36 hours that threatens world order. With no time to recover, Daniel must throw his life back on the line as he and his elite team of soldiers race against time to find the bomb and defeat their enemy once and for all. Outnumbered and overmatched, each soldier must find their inner strength and skill to overcome insurmountable odds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8GVpIEBqlRBvx28G0LfEX0U8D2k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:635780'),
  ('818989364596772420', 'Rogue Warfare: The Hunt', 2019, 'Action', 'John T. Connor, Steven Hacker, Mike Gunther', 'Andrew Emilio DeCesare', 'Will Yun Lee, Stephen Lang, Chris Mulkey, Fernando Chien, Essam Ferris, Bertrand-Xavier Corbi, Rory Markham, Gina DeCesare', null, 'The next installment of the Rogue Warfare Trilogy. Daniel has been captured and it is up to the TEAM to find him before it is to late.', 'The next installment of the Rogue Warfare Trilogy. Daniel has been captured and it is up to the TEAM to find him before it is to late.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kwpOjd5mZLDtgn3HO5JT9wDVAVI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:635776'),
  ('1151120925628845997', 'Rogues'' Tricks', 1907, 'Comedy, Action', 'Georges Méliès', null, null, null, 'Fun film from French master Georges Melies has a couple burglar''s breaking into a man''s home and having to hide when that man returns. Instead of a trick film or something that he''s known for, the director really changes gears here and instead delivers what''s basically an action movie.', 'Fun film from French master Georges Melies has a couple burglar''s breaking into a man''s home and having to hide when that man returns. Instead of a trick film or something that he''s known for, the director really changes gears here and instead delivers what''s basically an action movie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h1Iy8ebjkMd5cPxx1b5yXnZ5Srj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:196537'),
  ('255028345263078152', 'ROH Survival of the Fittest 2017 - Night 1', 2017, null, null, null, null, null, 'Survival of the Fittest (2017) was a three-night, three-city professional wrestling event produced by the American wrestling promotion Ring of Honor, the 12th Survival of the Fittest. It took place on November 17, 2017, at the Austin Highway Event Center in San Antonio, Texas,[1] November 18, 2017, at Gilley''s Dallas in Dallas, Texas[2] and November 19, 2017, at the Cox Convention Center in Oklahoma City, Oklahoma.[3]', 'Survival of the Fittest (2017) was a three-night, three-city professional wrestling event produced by the American wrestling promotion Ring of Honor, the 12th Survival of the Fittest. It took place on November 17, 2017, at the Austin Highway Event Center in San Antonio, Texas,[1] November 18, 2017, at Gilley''s Dallas in Dallas, Texas[2] and November 19, 2017, at the Cox Convention Center in Oklahoma City, Oklahoma.[3]', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dePDftIQiqaTmkXlmjoZQpl0NP2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1664741'),
  ('370773146135471726', 'Rohan at the Louvre', 2023, 'Mystery, Action, Adventure, Drama', 'Kazutaka Watanabe, 田中峰弥', 'Yasuko Kobayashi', 'Issey Takahashi, Marie Iitoyo, Fumino Kimura, Kento Nagao, Masanobu Ando, Minami, Ryo Ikeda, Kou Maehara', null, 'Rohan Kishibe is a mangaka who can read people like a book. At work on a new creation, Rohan recalls a tale of the blackest painting ever made. Called the most evil of paintings, it used a paint that should not exist. Driven by the events linked to it, Rohan and his editor, Izumi, go to the Louvre in France for answers.', 'Rohan Kishibe is a mangaka who can read people like a book. At work on a new creation, Rohan recalls a tale of the blackest painting ever made. Called the most evil of paintings, it used a paint that should not exist. Driven by the events linked to it, Rohan and his editor, Izumi, go to the Louvre in France for answers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bweM7e0WinLaytxwIlARBRaeY7L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1069813'),
  ('680490318449808160', 'Roja', 1992, 'Drama, Action, Romance', 'Mani Ratnam, Santosh Sivan', 'Sujatha Rangarajan', 'Arvind Swamy, Madhoo, Nassar, Janagaraj, Pankaj Kapur, Shiva Rindani, Vaishnavi, C. K. Saraswathi', null, 'Roja, a simple girl from a village in Tamil Nadu, makes desperate efforts to find her husband, Rishi, after he is kidnapped by militants during a secret undercover mission in Kashmir.', 'Roja, a simple girl from a village in Tamil Nadu, makes desperate efforts to find her husband, Rishi, after he is kidnapped by militants during a secret undercover mission in Kashmir.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1ZHr93dgcJ6jSAYpKISemBmYoIy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21463'),
  ('27735043878745499', 'Rojo', 2018, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Ana Inés Berard, Julia Bastanzo Paximada, Esteban Trivisonno', 'Benjamín Naishtat', 'Darío Grandinetti, Andrea Frigerio, Alfredo Castro, Diego Cremonesi, Laura Grandinetti, Claudio Martínez Bel, Susana Pampín, Rafael Federman', null, 'A small town in an Argentinian province, 1975. The life of Claudio, a successful lawyer, gets complicated when he has a stupid quarrel with a stranger in a crowded restaurant.', 'A small town in an Argentinian province, 1975. The life of Claudio, a successful lawyer, gets complicated when he has a stupid quarrel with a stranger in a crowded restaurant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yhTc71ysHxZoGqnqhc5R3Q4sFfg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:539685'),
  ('1007463425427264809', 'Rojo sangre', 2004, 'Horror', 'Christian Molina', 'Paul Naschy', 'Paul Naschy, Bibiana Fernández, Menh-Wai Trinh, Miguel del Arco, José Lifante, Alfonso Azpiri, Christian Molina, Rosa María Sardà', null, 'Veteran actor Pablo Thevenet has no luck: His daughter has been murdered, his wife has left him, he finds no job and his agent wants to leave him - current directors will never give him a role. He hates current talentless stars on TV talk shows. Suddenly, he finds some job - as a living sculpture in a whore house working for a Mr. Reficul and his transsexual assistant Dora Grizzel. Pablo becomes an artistic murderer, searching for those he thinks responsible of his current state. He also meets job partner Tic-Tac, an ex-prostitute who will sympathize with Pablo. Pablo also attracts the attention of unusual producer Ambrose Fuch, who wants him to act and direct movies. Everybody seems to have something to hide - including serial killer Pablo.', 'Veteran actor Pablo Thevenet has no luck: His daughter has been murdered, his wife has left him, he finds no job and his agent wants to leave him - current directors will never give him a role. He hates current talentless stars on TV talk shows. Suddenly, he finds some job - as a living sculpture in a whore house working for a Mr. Reficul and his transsexual assistant Dora Grizzel. Pablo becomes an artistic murderer, searching for those he thinks responsible of his current state. He also meets job partner Tic-Tac, an ex-prostitute who will sympathize with Pablo. Pablo also attracts the attention of unusual producer Ambrose Fuch, who wants him to act and direct movies. Everybody seems to have something to hide - including serial killer Pablo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aBfHf6ElYcD1HBUeXRh97DQ9qla.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27410'),
  ('904011222684491534', 'Roland''s Pass', 2000, 'Adventure, Comedy, Drama', 'Arnaud Larrieu, Jean-Marie Larrieu, Catherine Pujol', 'Jean-Marie Larrieu', 'Mathieu Amalric, Cécile Reigher, Julien Rivière, Anaïs Chunleau, Gilles Quessette, Jean-Marie Larrieu', null, 'Roland, a young father, decided to climb a famous mountain gap whose name he bears, in the company of his wife and two teenage children.', 'Roland, a young father, decided to climb a famous mountain gap whose name he bears, in the company of his wife and two teenage children.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6cl5sOofX8l4Kd65MrzYxiTcRQo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:134188'),
  ('461440934173134485', 'Role Models', 2008, 'Comedy', 'David Wain, Russ T. Alsobrook, Josh King', 'Ken Marino, Paul Rudd, Timothy Dowling', 'Seann William Scott, Paul Rudd, Christopher Mintz-Plasse, Bobb''e J. Thompson, Elizabeth Banks, Jane Lynch, Ken Jeong, Ken Marino', 'R', 'Two salesmen trash a company truck on an energy drink-fueled bender. Upon their arrest, the court gives them a choice: do hard time or spend 150 service hours with a mentorship program. After one day with the kids, however, jail doesn''t look half bad.', 'Two salesmen trash a company truck on an energy drink-fueled bender. Upon their arrest, the court gives them a choice: do hard time or spend 150 service hours with a mentorship program. After one day with the kids, however, jail doesn''t look half bad.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ki79dSjh6Rr51xrsz4dT04UGxSU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15373'),
