  ('792655570892606191', 'Roll Bounce', 2005, 'Comedy, Drama, Family', 'Malcolm D. Lee, J. Michael Muro', 'Norman Vance Jr.', 'Shad Moss, Brandon T. Jackson, Chi McBride, Marcus T. Paulk, Rick Gonzalez, Khleo Thomas, Busisiwe Irvin, Jurnee Smollett', 'PG-13', 'In the summer of 1978, a teenager and his group of friends face new challenges when their neighborhood roller-skating rink closes, forcing them to visit a different rink.', 'In the summer of 1978, a teenager and his group of friends face new challenges when their neighborhood roller-skating rink closes, forcing them to visit a different rink.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lStFr3EHTNbnyOdOk2QDCqYGnlR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14544'),
  ('316380098488513094', 'Roll Red Roll', 2019, 'Documentary', 'Matt Bockelman, Nancy Schwartzman', null, 'Mark Cole, Anthony Craig, Rachel Dissell, Alexandria Goddard, Marianne Hemmeter, Walter Madison, Trent Mays, Shawn McGhee', null, 'At a 2012 pre-season high-school football party in Steubenville, Ohio, a young woman was raped by members of the beloved high school football team. The aftermath exposed an entire culture of complicity—and Roll Red Roll maps out the roles that peer pressure, denial, sports machismo, and social media each played in the tragedy.', 'At a 2012 pre-season high-school football party in Steubenville, Ohio, a young woman was raped by members of the beloved high school football team. The aftermath exposed an entire culture of complicity—and Roll Red Roll maps out the roles that peer pressure, denial, sports machismo, and social media each played in the tragedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o5H3Z1DKNQv7uNXRQsBxxldwB2v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:509904'),
  ('1018631632372354651', 'Roller Blade', 1986, 'Action, Science Fiction', 'Donald G. Jackson, Donald G. Jackson', 'Donald G. Jackson, Randall Frakes', 'Suzanne Solari, Jeff Hutchinson, Shaun Michelle, Katina Garner, Sam Mann, Robby Taylor, Christopher Ray, Michelle Bauer', null, 'In a futuristic society, rebels fighting against a fascist state are aided by a group of roller-skating nuns called the Bod Sisters.', 'In a futuristic society, rebels fighting against a fascist state are aided by a group of roller-skating nuns called the Bod Sisters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vqz5NMcjVHdQaEFZGbW4vm8GAUe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28331'),
