  ('978863400150900903', 'Roly Poly', 1968, 'Comedy, Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Andrzej Wajda, Włodzimierz Kamiński, Andrzej Jerzy Piotrowski', 'Stanisław Lem', 'Bogumił Kobiela, Ryszard Filipski, Anna Prucnal, Jerzy Zelnik, Piotr Wysocki, Tadeusz Pluciński, Gerard Wilk, Wojciech Rajewski', null, 'Based on a screenplay by Stanislaw Lem. The main character, race car driver Ryszard Fox, is involved in many car accidents. After each car crash he gets a transplant for one or another internal organ. After a while there is a question: Who really is Ryszard Fox?', 'Based on a screenplay by Stanislaw Lem. The main character, race car driver Ryszard Fox, is involved in many car accidents. After each car crash he gets a transplant for one or another internal organ. After a while there is a question: Who really is Ryszard Fox?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n4oecK4rVnnXxCgfuqLMTcNLWDy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:189214'),
  ('1121697052482778732', 'Roma', 1972, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Giuseppe Rotunno, Federico Fellini, Paolo Pietrangeli', 'Federico Fellini, Bernardino Zapponi', 'Peter Gonzales Falcon, Fiona Florence, Pia De Doses, Marne Maitland, Renato Giovannoli, Elisa Mainardi, Norma Giacchero, Stefano Mayore', 'R', 'A virtually plotless, gaudy, impressionistic portrait of Rome through the eyes of one of its most famous citizens.', 'A virtually plotless, gaudy, impressionistic portrait of Rome through the eyes of one of its most famous citizens.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rqK75R3tTz2iWU0AQ6tLz3KMOU1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11035'),
  ('707411299570067536', 'Roma', 2004, 'Drama, History, Romance, Mystery', 'Adolfo Aristarain, José Luis Alcaine', 'Kathy Saavedra, Mario Camus', 'Juan Diego Botto, Susú Pecoraro, José Sacristán, Vando Villamil, Gustavo Garzón, Marcela Kloosterboer, Maxi Ghione, Marina Glezer', null, 'Joaquín Góñez, a novelist in his sixties recalls his emotions, his wild years in Buenos Aires, the memories of old friends, the meaning of loyalty and the intimate relationship with his mother, Roma.', 'Joaquín Góñez, a novelist in his sixties recalls his emotions, his wild years in Buenos Aires, the memories of old friends, the meaning of loyalty and the intimate relationship with his mother, Roma.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/umwZzQUp20FSyLQk2BfZQixqMr1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43432'),
