  ('432929389706864652', 'Roman Holiday', 1953, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'William Wyler, Henri Alekan, Herbert Coleman', 'Ian McLellan Hunter, John Dighton, Dalton Trumbo', 'Audrey Hepburn, Gregory Peck, Eddie Albert, Hartley Power, Harcourt Williams, Margaret Rawlings, Tullio Carminati, Paolo Carlini', 'G', 'Overwhelmed by her suffocating schedule, touring European princess Ann takes off for a night while in Rome. When a sedative she took from her doctor kicks in, however, she falls asleep on a park bench and is found by an American reporter, Joe Bradley, who takes her back to his apartment for safety. At work the next morning, Joe finds out Ann''s regal identity and bets his editor he can get exclusive interview with her, but romance soon gets in the way.', 'Overwhelmed by her suffocating schedule, touring European princess Ann takes off for a night while in Rome. When a sedative she took from her doctor kicks in, however, she falls asleep on a park bench and is found by an American reporter, Joe Bradley, who takes her back to his apartment for safety. At work the next morning, Joe finds out Ann''s regal identity and bets his editor he can get exclusive interview with her, but romance soon gets in the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8lI9dmz1RH20FAqltkGelY1v4BE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:804'),
  ('417605540299429145', 'Roman J. Israel, Esq.', 2017, 'Drama, Crime, Thriller', 'Dan Gilroy, Robert Elswit, Mike Smith', 'Dan Gilroy', 'Denzel Washington, Colin Farrell, Carmen Ejogo, Lynda Gravatt, Amanda Warren, Hugo Armstrong, Sam Gilroy, Tony Plana', 'PG-13', 'Hard-nosed liberal lawyer Roman J. Israel has been fighting the good fight forever while others take the credit. When his partner – the firm''s frontman – has a heart attack, Israel suddenly takes on that role. He soon discovers some unsettling truths about the firm – truths that conflict with his values of helping the poor and dispossessed – and finds himself in an existential crisis that leads to extreme actions.', 'Hard-nosed liberal lawyer Roman J. Israel has been fighting the good fight forever while others take the credit. When his partner – the firm''s frontman – has a heart attack, Israel suddenly takes on that role. He soon discovers some unsettling truths about the firm – truths that conflict with his values of helping the poor and dispossessed – and finds himself in an existential crisis that leads to extreme actions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/epTCHVcyLkT8Aqt08Ki3PWC2sUh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:413362'),
  ('79229530467028959', 'Roman Legion-Hare', 1955, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Friz Freleng, Milt Franklyn', null, 'Mel Blanc', null, 'The Coliseum, Rome, 54 A.D. Yosemite Sam, as Captain of the Guard, is ordered by Emperor Nero to find a victim to toss to the lions, or else he''ll be the victim. Shortly thereafter Sam encounters Bugs Bunny and decides he will make a good victim.', 'The Coliseum, Rome, 54 A.D. Yosemite Sam, as Captain of the Guard, is ordered by Emperor Nero to find a victim to toss to the lions, or else he''ll be the victim. Shortly thereafter Sam encounters Bugs Bunny and decides he will make a good victim.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u7QyFPEXDlHWC11Wn8o51QX7uU4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:235156'),
  ('1011222656514676374', 'Roman Polanski: Wanted and Desired', 2008, 'Documentary', 'Marina Zenovich', 'Joe Bini, P.G. Morgan, Marina Zenovich', 'Andrew Braunsberg, Richard Brenneman, Douglas Dalton, Marilyn Beck, Steve Barshop, Madeline Bessmer, Michael M. Crain, Samantha Geimer', null, 'Examines the public scandal and private tragedy which led to legendary director Roman Polanski''s sudden flight from the United States.', 'Examines the public scandal and private tragedy which led to legendary director Roman Polanski''s sudden flight from the United States.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1W8t1iBSTRFr5Q0G3iJhw5BaP3w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16800'),
  ('582528144648461652', 'Roman Scandals', 1933, 'Music, Comedy', 'Frank Tuttle, Gregg Toland, Ray June', null, 'Eddie Cantor, Ruth Etting, Gloria Stuart, Edward Arnold, David Manners, Verree Teasdale, Alan Mowbray, Jack Rutherford', 'NR', 'A kind-hearted young man is thrown out of his corrupt home town of West Rome, Oklahoma. He falls asleep and dreams that he is back in the days of olden Rome, where he gets mixed up with court intrigue and a murder plot against the Emperor.', 'A kind-hearted young man is thrown out of his corrupt home town of West Rome, Oklahoma. He falls asleep and dreams that he is back in the days of olden Rome, where he gets mixed up with court intrigue and a murder plot against the Emperor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3UvJ0QcKS5Eax32jCp7a9SJl6Ew.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43126'),
  ('685850491677370948', 'Roman Summer', 2000, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Matteo Garrone, Gian Enrico Bianchi, Gianni Di Gregorio', 'Matteo Garrone, Massimo Gaudioso, Attilio Caselli', 'Rossella Or, Monica Nappo, Salvatore Sansone, Victor Cavallo, Simone Carella, Rosellina Neri, Ester Astrologo, Paolo Sassanelli', null, 'Rome, Esquilino, summer. Rossella returns to Rome after years of absence and returns to her home, rented to her friend Salvatore, the set designer. The woman is gripped by an evident depression and wanders around the city that she does not recognize and that no longer recognizes her. People have changed and Rossella finds no one capable of answering the obsessive question that has plagued her for some time: "How can I disappear?"', 'Rome, Esquilino, summer. Rossella returns to Rome after years of absence and returns to her home, rented to her friend Salvatore, the set designer. The woman is gripped by an evident depression and wanders around the city that she does not recognize and that no longer recognizes her. People have changed and Rossella finds no one capable of answering the obsessive question that has plagued her for some time: "How can I disappear?"', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8h6h2VrpLEEC1XBxfiWtB3xUtee.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:255870'),
  ('713830759456136153', 'Roman Tales', 1955, 'Comedy', 'Gianni Franciolini, Paolo Heusch, Mario Montuori', 'Alberto Moravia', 'Antonio Cifariello, Franco Fabrizi, Giovanna Ralli, Maurizio Arena, Maria Pia Casilio, Eloisa Cianni, Giancarlo Costa, Margherita Autuori', null, 'Alvaro is been in jail and so he consider himself the most fit to lead his three friends Mario, Otello and Spartaco. The four young men decide to start a business. They need only a van to start a transport company. But they lack the money. How can they get it?', 'Alvaro is been in jail and so he consider himself the most fit to lead his three friends Mario, Otello and Spartaco. The four young men decide to start a business. They need only a van to start a transport company. But they lack the money. How can they get it?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9EjwUUL2N0Gi4V33BoZYAVH3jzo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:176294'),
  ('666717062944267157', 'Romance', 1930, 'Drama, Romance', 'Clarence Brown, Douglas Shearer, William H. Daniels', 'Bess Meredyth, Edwin Justus Mayer', 'Greta Garbo, Lewis Stone, Gavin Gordon, Elliott Nugent, Florence Lake, Clara Blandick, Henry Armetta, Mathilde Comont', null, 'A beautiful opera star kept by a rich older man falls in love with a young clergyman.', 'A beautiful opera star kept by a rich older man falls in love with a young clergyman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vZ2n5RngxRXgqJPZjmnM81tSMyK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77412'),
  ('1023321558684682408', 'Romance', 1999, 'Drama, Romance', 'Catherine Breillat, Michaël Weill, Fabrice Bigot', 'Catherine Breillat', 'Caroline Ducey, Sagamore Stévenin, François Berléand, Rocco Siffredi, Reza Habouhossein, Ashley Wanninger, Emma Colberti, Fabien de Jomaron', null, 'Frustrated by the lack of intimacy in her relationship, a young schoolteacher goes through a series of intimidating and often violent sexual partners.', 'Frustrated by the lack of intimacy in her relationship, a young schoolteacher goes through a series of intimidating and often violent sexual partners.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xR2b19JyLr8ssLzIvaXBOkGkghm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26338'),
  ('679357295050021964', 'Romance', 2008, 'Romance', 'Guel Arraes, Adriana Palheiros, Aline Guerra', 'Jorge Furtado, Guel Arraes', 'Wagner Moura, Letícia Sabatella, Andréa Beltrão, Marco Nanini, José Wilker, Vladimir Brichta, Edmilson Barros, Bruno Garcia', null, 'During a remake of the play Tristan and Isolde, actors Pedro and Ana fall in love. While the characters live an idealized love, the interpreters are living a true story, which they try to spice it up with the intensity of the fiction.', 'During a remake of the play Tristan and Isolde, actors Pedro and Ana fall in love. While the characters live an idealized love, the interpreters are living a true story, which they try to spice it up with the intensity of the fiction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q9aXqFqvoze1Nj8Hu7wjn0cTZfd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46651'),
  ('324804436417015149', 'Romance & Cigarettes', 2005, 'Comedy, Music, Romance', 'John Turturro, Tom Stern, Todd Pfeiffer', 'John Turturro', 'James Gandolfini, Susan Sarandon, Kate Winslet, Steve Buscemi, Bobby Cannavale, Mandy Moore, Mary-Louise Parker, Aida Turturro', 'R', 'Ironworker Nick lives with his wife, Kitty, and three daughters. When he meets a significantly younger woman, Tula, he starts an affair with her, much to the chagrin of his wife, and his life is thrown into upheaval. Kitty kicks Nick out of the house, and he is forced to make some difficult decisions.', 'Ironworker Nick lives with his wife, Kitty, and three daughters. When he meets a significantly younger woman, Tula, he starts an affair with her, much to the chagrin of his wife, and his life is thrown into upheaval. Kitty kicks Nick out of the house, and he is forced to make some difficult decisions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/phSntD46jD5IfYAa2lSoU6xJDJ6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13994'),
  ('642704295955791450', 'Romance at Hope Ranch', 2026, 'Romance, Drama, TV Movie, Comedy', 'Tailiah Breon', 'Juliana Wimbles', 'Gabriel Hogan, Stephanie Beran, Megan Sweeney, Dodie Montgomery, Alison Sweeney', 'TV-G', 'Hope Morgan sets out to begin a new chapter of her life-fulfilling her childhood dream of running a ranch in the picturesque town of Ruidoso, New Mexico and reviving the beloved Giddy Up Gala.', 'Hope Morgan sets out to begin a new chapter of her life-fulfilling her childhood dream of running a ranch in the picturesque town of Ruidoso, New Mexico and reviving the beloved Giddy Up Gala.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fmetadata-static.plex.tv%2F0%2Fgracenote%2F09aaeb5e611b3abdae2a402673778bee.jpg', 'plex:movie:romance-at-hope-ranch-2026'),
  ('486148020519518192', 'Romance Doll', 2020, 'Romance, Drama', 'Kohei Chida, Daika Matsukura, Ryo Otsuka', 'Yuki Tanada', 'Issey Takahashi, Yu Aoi, Kitaro, Pierre Taki, Eri Watanabe, Kenta Hamano, Toko Miura, Koji Ohkura', null, 'It was a pre-destined love and marriage for Sonoko and Tetsuo. They tied the knot and became husband and wife no questions asked. All is well then. Well, perhaps not. Each holds a secret that even the binds of matrimony cannot untie.', 'It was a pre-destined love and marriage for Sonoko and Tetsuo. They tied the knot and became husband and wife no questions asked. All is well then. Well, perhaps not. Each holds a secret that even the binds of matrimony cannot untie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/68tDy1xSJcT3kFpKimenuVVHqzJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:658006'),
  ('796619169952684918', 'Romance for Bugle', 1967, 'Drama, Romance', 'Otakar Vávra, Milan Jonáš, Jaroslava Čapková', 'Otakar Vávra, František Hrubín', 'Jaromír Hanzlík, Július Vašek, Zuzana Cigánová, Štefan Kvietik, Miriam Kantorková, Janusz Strachocki, Jaroslav Rozsíval, Jiří Štancl', null, 'A lyrical story about first love, death and disappointment, based on a poem of the same title.', 'A lyrical story about first love, death and disappointment, based on a poem of the same title.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rFkpAfeYcr1pQjNb4zkynDxkHcG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8705'),
  ('320773349280196814', 'Romance for Lovers', 1974, 'Romance, Drama, Music', 'Andrei Konchalovsky, Levan Paatashvili, Suren Mrktchyan', 'Evgeniy Grigorev', 'Yevgeni Kindinov, Yelena Koreneva, Innokentiy Smoktunovskiy, Irina Kupchenko, Elizaveta Solodova, Iya Savvina, Vladimir Konkin, Aleksandr Zbruev', null, 'Sergei and Tanya are in love with each other. Sergei is drafted into the marine corps and Tania waits for his return. Sergei''s division is abandoned in favor of helping local residents in distress. During the operation, his armored personnel gets carried into the sea. His relatives receive a notice of his death. Tanya''s loving childhood friend, a hockey player, helps her to cope with misfortune and she marries him. But it turned out that Sergei did not perish. He, together with a wounded friend he saved, are found on a deserted island after a long winter. Back home, Sergei learns that Tanya has married another. Unable to accept the loss of his beloved, Sergei dies; but this death is a symbolic and emotional one, not physical. Sergei continues to live a normal life without shock and strong distress, meets another girl, marries her, has a child. In the finale there is a spiritual rebirth of the hero.', 'Sergei and Tanya are in love with each other. Sergei is drafted into the marine corps and Tania waits for his return. Sergei''s division is abandoned in favor of helping local residents in distress. During the operation, his armored personnel gets carried into the sea. His relatives receive a notice of his death. Tanya''s loving childhood friend, a hockey player, helps her to cope with misfortune and she marries him. But it turned out that Sergei did not perish. He, together with a wounded friend he saved, are found on a deserted island after a long winter. Back home, Sergei learns that Tanya has married another. Unable to accept the loss of his beloved, Sergei dies; but this death is a symbolic and emotional one, not physical. Sergei continues to live a normal life without shock and strong distress, meets another girl, marries her, has a child. In the finale there is a spiritual rebirth of the hero.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pnrKmMH003F8mNi86zyh34h3ha8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:195823'),
  ('763865426328662998', 'Romance in a Minor Key', 1943, 'Drama, Romance', 'Helmut Käutner, Georg Bruckbauer', 'Willy Clever, Helmut Käutner', 'Marianne Hoppe, Paul Dahlke, Ferdinand Marian, Siegfried Breuer, Elisabeth Flickenschildt, Carl Günther, Eric Helgar, Karl Platen', null, 'A grieving husband tries to uncover the truth behind his wife''s suicide, leading him to discover a tragic tale of infidelity and redemption.', 'A grieving husband tries to uncover the truth behind his wife''s suicide, leading him to discover a tragic tale of infidelity and redemption.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6nMFUPHBZAwqxGhOK5Xg9rJzCn1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:148044'),
  ('425583513182970568', 'Romance in Manhattan', 1935, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'Stephen Roberts, Nicholas Musuraca, Alberto Colombo', 'Edward Kaufman, Jane Murfin', 'Francis Lederer, Ginger Rogers, Arthur Hohl, Jimmy Butler, J. Farrell MacDonald, Helen Ware, Eily Malyon, Lillian Harmer', null, 'Karel Novak is an incredibly naive Czech immigrant who is taken under the wing of streetwise New York chorus girl Sylvia. With the help of lovable cop-on-the-beat Murphy, Sylvia hides Karel from the immigration authorities and ultimately falls in love with him. In addition to Karel''s illegal-alien status, the plot is complicated by a crooked lawyer and a group of well-meaning welfare workers who endeavor to place Sylvia''s kid brother Frank in a foster home.', 'Karel Novak is an incredibly naive Czech immigrant who is taken under the wing of streetwise New York chorus girl Sylvia. With the help of lovable cop-on-the-beat Murphy, Sylvia hides Karel from the immigration authorities and ultimately falls in love with him. In addition to Karel''s illegal-alien status, the plot is complicated by a crooked lawyer and a group of well-meaning welfare workers who endeavor to place Sylvia''s kid brother Frank in a foster home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qHlA2SufMm39oQPlFgcZCiVIvZD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:196802'),
  ('297751811378387019', 'Romance in Style', 2022, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance', 'Ken Krawczyk, Michael Robison', null, 'Jaicy Elliot, Benjamin Hollingsworth, Connie Manfredi, Jorja Cadence, Daylin Willis, Laura Soltis, Paul Essiembre, Nadine Sanguyo', 'G', 'Ella''s unique designs inspire publishing mogul Derek to include plussized fashion in his magazine. It''s not long before Derek realizes that Ella''s influence reaches far beyond the catwalk.', 'Ella''s unique designs inspire publishing mogul Derek to include plussized fashion in his magazine. It''s not long before Derek realizes that Ella''s influence reaches far beyond the catwalk.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gYcVRws4Hu5B36ji7BheKDnSbfP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:994052'),
  ('95615570327386151', 'Romance in the Air', 2020, 'Romance, TV Movie', 'Brian Brough, John Lyde', 'Brittany Wiscombe', 'Cindy Busby, Torrance Coombs, Sashleigha Hightower, David Cleveland Brown, Tim Flynn, Al Lampkin, Lonzo Liggins, David McConnell', null, 'After learning her job is on the line, Eden returns to Lake Tahoe where she used to spend her summers growing up. There she’s reunited with her childhood friend Riley and finds that the draw of her past might direct her future to a happiness she’s been missing in her life.', 'After learning her job is on the line, Eden returns to Lake Tahoe where she used to spend her summers growing up. There she’s reunited with her childhood friend Riley and finds that the draw of her past might direct her future to a happiness she’s been missing in her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q4l6xkdIC8DUfRSyiuBXFchPp0d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:723266'),
  ('75336434323446705', 'Romance of a Fruit Peddler', 1922, 'Comedy', 'Shichuan Zhang', 'Zheng Zhengqiu', 'Zheng Zhegu, Zheng Zhengqiu, Yu Ying', null, 'Cheng the fruit seller is in love with the daughter of his neighbor the doctor, but the good doctor won''t let him marry her unless Chang finds him more patients...', 'Cheng the fruit seller is in love with the daughter of his neighbor the doctor, but the good doctor won''t let him marry her unless Chang finds him more patients...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9T2XfxlICLbtLMWSnZlLk256R64.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:175602'),
  ('1051654701759874461', 'Romance of Ida', 2022, 'Romance, TV Movie, History', 'Krisztina Goda, Andor Berényi, Gábor Gajdos', 'Réka Divinyi, Krisztina Goda', 'Júlia Mentes, Barnabás Rohonyi, Gábor Hevér, Márk Ember, Béla Mészáros, Angéla Stefanovics, Rozi Lovas, Éva Bata', null, 'Eighteen year old Ida returns home after being raised by nuns, but her father isn''t too pleased. Determined to see her married, he publishes an ad and offers suitors a generous dowry.', 'Eighteen year old Ida returns home after being raised by nuns, but her father isn''t too pleased. Determined to see her married, he publishes an ad and offers suitors a generous dowry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1p4CKLbLECn4WJlZbukFdMACN1y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1016661'),
  ('730750482460748094', 'Romance of Radium', 1937, 'History, Drama', 'Jacques Tourneur', 'N. Gayle Gitterman, Richard Goldstone', 'Pete Smith, Margaret Bert, André Cheron, James Conaty, Eddie Hart, Emmett Vogan', null, 'Romance of Radium is a 1937 American short film directed by Jacques Tourneur, and released by Metro-Goldwyn-Mayer. This short film tells the story of the discovery of radium and how it is used in medicine. In 1937, it was nominated for an Academy Award for Best Short Subject (One-Reel) at the 10th Academy Awards', 'Romance of Radium is a 1937 American short film directed by Jacques Tourneur, and released by Metro-Goldwyn-Mayer. This short film tells the story of the discovery of radium and how it is used in medicine. In 1937, it was nominated for an Academy Award for Best Short Subject (One-Reel) at the 10th Academy Awards', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/smOT3unqVgudlHuihFBGL6mgwm7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:170636'),
  ('928220324691694749', 'Romance of the West Chamber', 1997, 'History, Romance', 'Lam Yee Hung', null, 'Chisato Kawamura, Jimmy Wong Shu-Kei, Elvis Tsui Kam-Kong, Teresa Mak Ka-Kei, Karen Yeung Ga-Ling, Miu Kam-Fung, Boon Mei Sam', null, 'Cheung, a 23-year-old unmarried travelling scholar, stops by the monastery, where he sees a beautiful woman. Against the rules, Monk Faben allows Cheung to stay and woo the girl, Ann-Ann. She is shy, and also the Prime Minister''s daughter, so the wooing is arranged by Ann-Ann''s maid Hung.', 'Cheung, a 23-year-old unmarried travelling scholar, stops by the monastery, where he sees a beautiful woman. Against the rules, Monk Faben allows Cheung to stay and woo the girl, Ann-Ann. She is shy, and also the Prime Minister''s daughter, so the wooing is arranged by Ann-Ann''s maid Hung.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bup7TBYfLzFjH7r1cLX6iXQS7M0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:463461'),
  ('297155938232682834', 'Romance of Their Own', 2004, 'Action, Drama, Romance', 'Kim Tae-gyun, Kang Keon-hyang, Kim Jeong-gon', 'Kim Jeong-gon, Lee In-sung', 'Jo Han-sun, Gang Dong-won, Lee Chung-ah, Jung Da-hye, Lee Chun-hee, Lee Ji-hee, Song Chae-Min, Kwon Oh-Min', null, 'Han-kyung a rustic girl, comes to town to live with her mom. Attracted to her pure charm, the most popular guys Hae-won and Tae-sung come up to fight each other. But Tae- sung has a fatal secret not to love her. Their sad love triangle makes everyone cry.', 'Han-kyung a rustic girl, comes to town to live with her mom. Attracted to her pure charm, the most popular guys Hae-won and Tae-sung come up to fight each other. But Tae- sung has a fatal secret not to love her. Their sad love triangle makes everyone cry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jNoxMf8rAu4rau6fkUkL4nWB3i3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:131979'),
  ('573391359967231192', 'Romance on the High Seas', 1948, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Michael Curtiz, Elwood Bredell, Busby Berkeley', 'Julius J. Epstein, Philip G. Epstein', 'Jack Carson, Janis Paige, Don DeFore, Doris Day, Oscar Levant, S.Z. Sakall, Fortunio Bonanova, Eric Blore', 'NR', 'Georgia Garrett is sent by jealous wife Elvira Kent on an ocean cruise to masquerade as herself while she secretly stays home to catch her husband cheating. Meanwhile equally suspicious husband Michael Kent has sent a private eye on the same cruise to catch his wife cheating. Love and confusion ensues along with plenty of musical numbers.', 'Georgia Garrett is sent by jealous wife Elvira Kent on an ocean cruise to masquerade as herself while she secretly stays home to catch her husband cheating. Meanwhile equally suspicious husband Michael Kent has sent a private eye on the same cruise to catch his wife cheating. Love and confusion ensues along with plenty of musical numbers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/60YafJKLwCINwD7Q10yWXDpAGt3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43449'),
  ('943840295014955168', 'Romance on the Menu', 2020, 'Romance, TV Movie', 'Jason Hargreaves, Rosie Lourde', 'Alison Spuck McNeeley, Casie Tabanou', 'Cindy Busby, Tim Ross, Naomi Sequeira, Peter Bensley, Marita Wilcox, Barbara Bingham, Perry Mooney, Joey Vieira', 'G', 'New York restaurateur Caroline inherits a café in Lemon Myrtle Cove, Australia. While there, she starts falling for the place and its people, particularly Simon, the café’s charming local chef.', 'New York restaurateur Caroline inherits a café in Lemon Myrtle Cove, Australia. While there, she starts falling for the place and its people, particularly Simon, the café’s charming local chef.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dKV4BszFD8QioDJqgoH0CwpNjvN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:728204'),
  ('1141174047474129510', 'Romance on the Ranch', 2024, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'John Lyde, John Lyde', 'John Lyde', 'Suzanne Pereira, Chris Reid, Brando White, Takoda, Alireza Mirmontazeri, Jill Adler, Ischa Bee, Zoey Giovanna', null, 'When starting a new chapter in her life, Sara didn''t need any distractions. Selling her place, buying a camper, and heading West was what she felt she needed to find happiness again. When her truck breaks down in the mid-west, she is invited to park her camper on a family ranch while her truck is repaired. Here is where the distractions come in the form of two brothers, who are as different as night and day. Porter is young, strong, and eager to please.', 'When starting a new chapter in her life, Sara didn''t need any distractions. Selling her place, buying a camper, and heading West was what she felt she needed to find happiness again. When her truck breaks down in the mid-west, she is invited to park her camper on a family ranch while her truck is repaired. Here is where the distractions come in the form of two brothers, who are as different as night and day. Porter is young, strong, and eager to please.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tCuWdSSwth4m0RIdin9z4Nz8Il9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1266909'),
  ('789206785655554898', 'Romance with a Double Bass', 1974, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Robert Young, Clive Tickner', null, 'John Cleese, Connie Booth, Graham Crowden, Freddie Jones, Jonathan Lynn, Andrew Sachs, Desmond Jones, Dennis Ramsden', null, 'A bassist shows up early for the betrothal ball of a beautiful princess, and whiles away the time having a dip in the river. The princess is doing the same, unbeknownst to the bass player, but when someone steals their clothes, the bass player helps the princess to preserve her dignity by transporting her back to the castle in his bass case, and along the way they discover they have feelings for each other. Based on a short story by Anton Chekhov.', 'A bassist shows up early for the betrothal ball of a beautiful princess, and whiles away the time having a dip in the river. The princess is doing the same, unbeknownst to the bass player, but when someone steals their clothes, the bass player helps the princess to preserve her dignity by transporting her back to the castle in his bass case, and along the way they discover they have feelings for each other. Based on a short story by Anton Chekhov.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4ioV39KtYBy48u3TWhdYRvPI7iC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31637'),
  ('826111469903484708', 'Romance: Mother''s Friend', 2018, 'Romance', 'Yoo Hae-jong', null, 'Lee Eun-mi, Park Joo-bin, Yoo Seol-ah-I, Kim Hyo-sang, Lee Kang-woo, Yoo Sul-young', null, 'Jung-sik and Dae-soo are twenty-year-old students. They haven''t yet had their first time and all they talk about is sex. Since they are unable to seal the deal, they watch porn instead. One day, Min-jung, Jung-sik''s mother''s friend, moves in with them to stay until her divorce settles. She will make dreams come true.', 'Jung-sik and Dae-soo are twenty-year-old students. They haven''t yet had their first time and all they talk about is sex. Since they are unable to seal the deal, they watch porn instead. One day, Min-jung, Jung-sik''s mother''s friend, moves in with them to stay until her divorce settles. She will make dreams come true.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7FEi9nc1dpqNRULi03k5HdyTm7k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:701944'),
  ('329200030363063569', 'Romancham', 2023, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Jithu Madhavan, Sanu Thahir', 'Jithu Madhavan', 'Soubin Shahir, Sajin Gopu, Abin Bino, Afzal P H, Siju Sunny, Jagadeesh Kumar, Anantharaman Ajay, Arjun Ashokan', null, 'Set in 2007, at Bengaluru, A game of Ouija board goes hilariously wrong when seven bachelors unexpectedly invite a spirit and try to make the best out of the situation.', 'Set in 2007, at Bengaluru, A game of Ouija board goes hilariously wrong when seven bachelors unexpectedly invite a spirit and try to make the best out of the situation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9p8ux2AGYn3U2mEAbKmizAh6PL1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:976121'),
  ('751834827716100536', 'Romancing the Stone', 1984, 'Romance, Comedy, Action, Adventure', 'Robert Zemeckis, Dean Cundey, Terry Leonard', 'Diane Thomas', 'Michael Douglas, Kathleen Turner, Danny DeVito, Zack Norman, Alfonso Arau, Manuel Ojeda, Holland Taylor, Mary Ellen Trainor', 'PG', 'Though she can spin wild tales of passionate romance, novelist Joan Wilder has no life of her own. Then one day adventure comes her way in the form of a mysterious package. It turns out that the parcel is the ransom she''ll need to free her abducted sister, so Joan flies to South America to hand it over. But she gets on the wrong bus and winds up hopelessly stranded in the jungle.', 'Though she can spin wild tales of passionate romance, novelist Joan Wilder has no life of her own. Then one day adventure comes her way in the form of a mysterious package. It turns out that the parcel is the ransom she''ll need to free her abducted sister, so Joan flies to South America to hand it over. But she gets on the wrong bus and winds up hopelessly stranded in the jungle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qaCLbDs6Ace4I1lAbBNWPQAm75h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9326'),
  ('25231726885337633', 'Romanovin kivet', 1993, 'Action, Crime', 'Kari Sohlberg, Kalle Chydenius, Terhi Tammila', 'Kalle Chydenius, Santeri Kinnunen, Aleksi Mäkelä', 'Samuli Edelmann, Santeri Kinnunen, Stig Fransman, Kari-Pekka Toivonen, Katariina Kaitue, Kari Hietalahti, Minna Sanchez, Juha Veijonen', null, 'This action packed Finnish thriller tells the tale of two friends who get their revenge against the millionaire who double-crossed them. Patrick and Tony are hired by the wealthy gambler to steal the priceless Romanov stones, Russian jewels. They do it, but almost lose their lives when he double-crosses them. They turn around and get revenge, his money, his wife, and his daughter.', 'This action packed Finnish thriller tells the tale of two friends who get their revenge against the millionaire who double-crossed them. Patrick and Tony are hired by the wealthy gambler to steal the priceless Romanov stones, Russian jewels. They do it, but almost lose their lives when he double-crosses them. They turn around and get revenge, his money, his wife, and his daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4X36WQDqgH67xhYN57xyVYc2KAE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88126'),
  ('524637397923642944', 'Romantic', 2007, 'Drama, Romance', 'Sinan Çetin', 'Galip Tekin, Sinan Çetin, Gülin Tokat', 'Okan Bayülgen, Teoman, Yasemin Kozanoğlu, Nail Kirmizigül, Semih Sergen, Toprak Sergen, Esin Moralıoğlu, Nolan Hemmings', null, 'The friendship of Gokhan and Omer is challenged when Omer falls in love with beautiful Yasemin. Gokhan frames his best friend Omer for a murder, subsequently Omer must leave the country.', 'The friendship of Gokhan and Omer is challenged when Omer falls in love with beautiful Yasemin. Gokhan frames his best friend Omer for a murder, subsequently Omer must leave the country.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7iHFGiIL9VMJc0PErmCeUeDapbi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51431'),
  ('992467721453532058', 'Romantic Comedy', 1983, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Arthur Hiller, David M. Walsh', 'Bernard Slade', 'Dudley Moore, Mary Steenburgen, Frances Sternhagen, Janet Eilber, Robyn Douglass, Ron Leibman, Rozsika Halmos, Alexander Lockwood', 'PG', 'Jason is in need of a collaborator to give him inspiration. Phoebe is a small-town English teacher with an urge to write. On the day Jason is being married, Jason and Phoebe meet and form a partnership.', 'Jason is in need of a collaborator to give him inspiration. Phoebe is a small-town English teacher with an urge to write. On the day Jason is being married, Jason and Phoebe meet and form a partnership.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hzYgSiro6m9QJfcpJeQxv6hpOim.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77074'),
  ('194548894565922062', 'Romantic Debtors', 2010, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Kim Sung-han, Shin Geun-ho, Kim Yun-su', 'Shin Geun-ho, Choi Jin-won, Son Geun-joo', 'Im Chang-jung, Uhm Ji-won, Lee Jae-gu, Jo Deok-hyeon, Kim Jung-pal, Jeong Eun-u, Kim Sa-hui, Kang Jae-seop', null, 'A policeman in debt is constantly called by a woman working to collect his debt. When they meet by accident they attracted to each other, and does not realize they already have a hostile phone-relationship.', 'A policeman in debt is constantly called by a woman working to collect his debt. When they meet by accident they attracted to each other, and does not realize they already have a hostile phone-relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tnGvfGWBX6R5q3fFQIpRrtTgD4U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80610'),
  ('38452354664636965', 'Romantic Guide to Lost Places', 2020, 'Drama', 'Giorgia Farina, Timo Salminen, Gwyn Sannia', 'Heidrun Schleef, Giorgia Farina, Carlo Salsa', 'Clive Owen, Jasmine Trinca, Irène Jacob, Andrea Carpenzano, Teco Celio, Edoardo Gabbriellini, Roberto Zibetti, Romain Hartmann', null, 'Benno and Allegra: he''s over fifty, English, and drinks like a fish; she''s twenty years younger, a travel blogger with lots of imagination. They both live off their lies and have no intention of stopping now. Next-door neighbors who had never met until the day he wound up on the wrong landing, and nothing would ever be the same. Sheer chance leads this odd couple on a flight towards lost or forgotten places, where their mutual support makes for self-discovery.', 'Benno and Allegra: he''s over fifty, English, and drinks like a fish; she''s twenty years younger, a travel blogger with lots of imagination. They both live off their lies and have no intention of stopping now. Next-door neighbors who had never met until the day he wound up on the wrong landing, and nothing would ever be the same. Sheer chance leads this odd couple on a flight towards lost or forgotten places, where their mutual support makes for self-discovery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5LrVzFlH8SVaj9Kol3QZ9csHx10.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:727024'),
  ('405886609948094227', 'Romantiche', 2023, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Davide Leone, Pilar Fogliati, Filippo Orobello', 'Giovanni Veronesi, Pilar Fogliati, Giovanni Nasta', 'Pilar Fogliati, Barbora Bobuľová, Levante, Diane Fleri, Giovanni Toscano, Ibrahim Keshk, Vittorio Emanuele Propizio, Giovanni Anzaldo', null, 'A portrait of the flaws and peculiarities of four type of girls living in different districts of Rome.', 'A portrait of the flaws and peculiarities of four type of girls living in different districts of Rome.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4gr2GuuIYHbplKTX16HZph8Djoi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:889810'),
  ('196624315019848828', 'Romantics Anonymous', 2010, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Jean-Pierre Améris, Gérard Simon', 'Jean-Pierre Améris, Philippe Blasband', 'Benoît Poelvoorde, Isabelle Carré, Lorella Cravotta, Lise Lamétrie, Swann Arlaud, Pierre Niney, Stéphan Wojtowicz, Jacques Boudet', null, 'What happens when a man and a woman share a common passion? They fall in love. And this is what happens to Jean-René, the boss of a small chocolate factory, and Angélique, a gifted chocolate maker he has just hired. What occurs when a highly emotional man meets a highly emotional woman? They fall in love, and this is what occurs to Jean-René and Angélique who share the same handicap. But being pathologically timid does not make things easy for them. So whether they will manage to get together, join their solitudes and live happily ever after is a guessing matter.', 'What happens when a man and a woman share a common passion? They fall in love. And this is what happens to Jean-René, the boss of a small chocolate factory, and Angélique, a gifted chocolate maker he has just hired. What occurs when a highly emotional man meets a highly emotional woman? They fall in love, and this is what occurs to Jean-René and Angélique who share the same handicap. But being pathologically timid does not make things easy for them. So whether they will manage to get together, join their solitudes and live happily ever after is a guessing matter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hXL5TgqgFF8159dez0o8EK11ve3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51991'),
  ('396589314432512319', 'Romantique', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Nicolas Dessommes, Auriane Lacince, Thibault Segouin', 'Thibault Segouin', 'Golshifteh Farahani, Tchéky Karyo, Alex Lutz, Lucie Debay, Olivier Chantreau, Mira Rogliano, Mariama Gueye, Slimane Dazi', null, 'After disappearing overnight, a man reappears and discovers that he is the father of a little girl. This time he will do his best.', 'After disappearing overnight, a man reappears and discovers that he is the father of a little girl. This time he will do his best.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cLy5SLacate0GcTNnByEmlM5eG3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:892502'),
  ('316594039254329683', 'Romanzo Criminale', 2005, 'Crime, Drama', 'Michele Placido, Federico Giorgio Ridolfi, Luca Bigazzi', 'Michele Placido', 'Kim Rossi Stuart, Anna Mouglalis, Stefano Accorsi, Pierfrancesco Favino, Claudio Santamaria, Riccardo Scamarcio, Jasmine Trinca, Toni Bertorelli', null, 'After serving prison time for a juvenile offense, Freddo gathers his old buddies Libano and Dandi and embarks on a crime spree that makes the trio the most powerful gangsters in Rome. Libano loves their new status, and seeks to spread their influence throughout the underworld, while the other two pursue more fleshly desires. For decades, their gang perpetrates extravagant crimes, until paranoia threatens to split the friends apart.', 'After serving prison time for a juvenile offense, Freddo gathers his old buddies Libano and Dandi and embarks on a crime spree that makes the trio the most powerful gangsters in Rome. Libano loves their new status, and seeks to spread their influence throughout the underworld, while the other two pursue more fleshly desires. For decades, their gang perpetrates extravagant crimes, until paranoia threatens to split the friends apart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jd06ZOSBpjfKEthqli5O2urO0nm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14375'),
  ('1122545402251369921', 'Romasanta: The Werewolf Hunt', 2004, 'Action, Horror', 'Paco Plaza, Pep Armengol, Carol Dudley', 'Elena Serra, Alberto Marini', 'Julian Sands, Elsa Pataky, John Sharian, Gary Piquer, David Gant, Maru Valdivielso, Luna McGill, Carlos Reig-Plaza', null, 'A terror is stalking the land: people are disappearing daily, their bodies appearing covered in savage gashes coupled with precise surgical cuts. The legend of the ''Werewolf of Allariz'' spreads across the land like wildfire. When Barbara (Elsa Pataky) falls in love with travelling vendor Manuel Romasanta, she is at first besotted with him - but soon begins to be suspicious of him. What has happened to her sister, who - after being escorted by Romasanta to the city - seems to have disappeared forever.', 'A terror is stalking the land: people are disappearing daily, their bodies appearing covered in savage gashes coupled with precise surgical cuts. The legend of the ''Werewolf of Allariz'' spreads across the land like wildfire. When Barbara (Elsa Pataky) falls in love with travelling vendor Manuel Romasanta, she is at first besotted with him - but soon begins to be suspicious of him. What has happened to her sister, who - after being escorted by Romasanta to the city - seems to have disappeared forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yMVYoaAHA85fgH7CLKK7rimyPaX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12653'),
  ('184759875015499033', 'Rome 11:00', 1952, 'Drama', 'Basilio Franchina, Elio Petri, Giuseppe De Santis', 'Basilio Franchina, Rodolfo Sonego, Gianni Puccini', 'Carla Del Poggio, Lucia Bosè, Lea Padovani, Maria Grazia Francia, Eva Vanicek, Massimo Girotti, Raf Vallone, Elena Varzi', null, 'The story of 5 girls among 200 who answer a wanted ad for a modest secretarial position, which leads to overcrowding in the building and a tragic accident.', 'The story of 5 girls among 200 who answer a wanted ad for a modest secretarial position, which leads to overcrowding in the building and a tragic accident.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dI2UggXb3pzjjh9rXJ3lVhcey3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:158693'),
  ('287963551860990357', 'Rome Adventure', 1962, 'Drama, Romance', 'Russell Llewellyn, Ottavio Oppo, Delmer Daves', 'Delmer Daves', 'Troy Donahue, Angie Dickinson, Rossano Brazzi, Suzanne Pleshette, Constance Ford, Al Hirt, Hampton Fancher, Iphigenie Castiglioni', 'NR', 'Prudence resigns from her teaching position after being criticized for giving a student her copy of a romance novel. She sails for Italy, takes a job at a small bookstore in Rome, and meets Don, who has just broken up with his girlfriend. Prudence and Don tour Italy together, and romance naturally follows.', 'Prudence resigns from her teaching position after being criticized for giving a student her copy of a romance novel. She sails for Italy, takes a job at a small bookstore in Rome, and meets Don, who has just broken up with his girlfriend. Prudence and Don tour Italy together, and romance naturally follows.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7HUzY2mVusFWOmSm8ZKb93BHVtT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94915'),
  ('49581746912591601', 'Rome Express', 1932, 'Thriller', 'Walter Forde, Günther Krampf, Albert Jullion', 'Sidney Gilliat', 'Conrad Veidt, Esther Ralston, Hugh Williams, Donald Calthrop, Joan Barry, Harold Huth, Gordon Harker, Eliot Makeham', null, 'The theft of a famous painting leads to murder and many suspects on a plush train speeding from Paris to Rome.', 'The theft of a famous painting leads to murder and many suspects on a plush train speeding from Paris to Rome.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iDgs3yzntKN1ZMHVldXlpOpkZsj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:190405'),
  ('37226291264671276', 'Rome in Love', 2019, 'Romance, TV Movie', 'Teresa Razzauti, Horacio Marquínez, Sergio Ercolessi', 'Judd Parkin, Topher Payne', 'Italia Ricci, Peter Porte, Vincent Riotta, Ross McCall, Barbara Bouchet, Helen Pearson, Isabelle Connolly, Anna Manuelli', null, 'An unknown actress lands the role of a lifetime in Rome. Paired with an American journalist writing a profile, she will discover surprises about love and life in the eternal city.', 'An unknown actress lands the role of a lifetime in Rome. Paired with an American journalist writing a profile, she will discover surprises about love and life in the eternal city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1B49Sjm4EtibDyfIdMwU02LRHj8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:612298'),
  ('225556268938976265', 'Rome, Armed to the Teeth', 1976, 'Action, Crime', 'Umberto Lenzi, Goffredo Unger, Federico Zanni', 'Dardano Sacchetti', 'Maurizio Merli, Arthur Kennedy, Tomas Milian, Maria Rosaria Omaggio, Giampiero Albertini, Ivan Rassimov, Biagio Pelligra, Aldo Barberito', null, 'A tough, violent cop who doesn''t mind bending the law goes after a machine-gun-carrying, hunchbacked psychotic killer.', 'A tough, violent cop who doesn''t mind bending the law goes after a machine-gun-carrying, hunchbacked psychotic killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e3tyRaeZsX66e6LO5EanViBFJF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52808'),
  ('923945510317269244', 'Rome: Free City', 1946, 'Drama', 'Marcello Pagliero, Aldo Tonti, Luigi Filippo D''Amico', 'Suso Cecchi d''Amico, Luigi Filippo D''Amico, Marcello Marchesi', 'Valentina Cortese, Andrea Checchi, Nando Bruno, Marisa Merlini, Gar Moore, Vittorio De Sica, Manlio Busoni, Fedele Gentile', null, 'In a post-war Rome (1946) a cat burglar inadvertently saves the life of a would-be suicide man who returns from the war to find that he has been betrayed by his fiancée while fighting in the war. From that moment the thief takes the ex-soldier under his wing. They leave house together for a night full of misadventures. In a streets of Rome they meet the struggling typist who can’t pay her rent and opts to street life; a wandering amnesiac who lost his memory and keeps asking everyone “Do you recognize me?”. Thieves, gamblers, hookers, policemen, soldiers and endless chain of cigarette-smoking and alcohol/espresso-drinking.', 'In a post-war Rome (1946) a cat burglar inadvertently saves the life of a would-be suicide man who returns from the war to find that he has been betrayed by his fiancée while fighting in the war. From that moment the thief takes the ex-soldier under his wing. They leave house together for a night full of misadventures. In a streets of Rome they meet the struggling typist who can’t pay her rent and opts to street life; a wandering amnesiac who lost his memory and keeps asking everyone “Do you recognize me?”. Thieves, gamblers, hookers, policemen, soldiers and endless chain of cigarette-smoking and alcohol/espresso-drinking.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tp6144oFMx0mdc8QmPbgpW9RZ80.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:253133'),
  ('452758509568609902', 'Romeo & Juliet', 2013, 'Romance, Drama', 'Carlo Carlei, David Tattersall, Roy Bava', 'Julian Fellowes', 'Hailee Steinfeld, Douglas Booth, Tomas Arana, Christian Cooke, Damian Lewis, Natascha McElhone, Lesley Manville, Laura Morante', 'PG-13', 'In Verona, bad blood between the Montague and Capulet families leads to much bitterness. Despite the hostility, Romeo Montague manages an invitation to a masked ball at the estate of the Capulets and meets Juliet, their daughter. The two are instantly smitten but dismayed to learn that their families are enemies. Romeo and Juliet figure out a way to pursue their romance, but Romeo is banished for his part in the slaying of Juliet''s cousin, Tybalt.', 'In Verona, bad blood between the Montague and Capulet families leads to much bitterness. Despite the hostility, Romeo Montague manages an invitation to a masked ball at the estate of the Capulets and meets Juliet, their daughter. The two are instantly smitten but dismayed to learn that their families are enemies. Romeo and Juliet figure out a way to pursue their romance, but Romeo is banished for his part in the slaying of Juliet''s cousin, Tybalt.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9FZ3wTjY9rUvIoobJFv8ozoTwTT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91745'),
  ('247070590028216189', 'Romeo & Juliet: An East Side Story', 2026, 'Romance', null, 'Joel Paul Reisig, Phil Wurtzel', 'Mavin Tramble, Tyler Jalen Rich, Johnathan C. Williams, Crystal P., Deon Hunt', null, 'Inspired by Shakespeare''s classic tragedy, this modern retelling sets a tale of forbidden love and rivalry in present-day Detroit.', 'Inspired by Shakespeare''s classic tragedy, this modern retelling sets a tale of forbidden love and rivalry in present-day Detroit.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fm.media-amazon.com%2Fimages%2FM%2FMV5BNWQ0ZjZiZDQtNzJmNC00NTBmLTgxMjEtMzkzZGIwM2JiNTNhXkEyXkFqcGc%40._V1_.jpg', 'plex:movie:romeo-and-juliet-an-east-side-story-2026'),
  ('408469187998085959', 'Romeo + Juliet', 1996, 'Drama, Romance', 'Donald McAlpine, Baz Luhrmann, Everardo Gout', 'Craig Pearce, Baz Luhrmann', 'Leonardo DiCaprio, Claire Danes, Jesse Bradford, Vondie Curtis-Hall, Brian Dennehy, John Leguizamo, Miriam Margolyes, Harold Perrineau', 'PG-13', 'In this contemporary take on William Shakespeare''s classic tragedy, the Montagues and Capulets have moved their ongoing feud to the sweltering suburb of Verona Beach, where Romeo and Juliet fall in love and secretly wed. Though the film is visually modern, the bard''s dialogue remains.', 'In this contemporary take on William Shakespeare''s classic tragedy, the Montagues and Capulets have moved their ongoing feud to the sweltering suburb of Verona Beach, where Romeo and Juliet fall in love and secretly wed. Though the film is visually modern, the bard''s dialogue remains.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eLf4jclPijOqfEp6bDAmezRFxk5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:454'),
  ('981058594604446601', 'Romeo Akbar Walter', 2019, 'Action, Thriller', 'Robby Grewal, Purnendu Chandra Paanda, Tapan Tushar Basu', 'Robby Grewal', 'John Abraham, Mouni Roy, Jackie Shroff, Sikandar Kher, Suchitra Krishnamoorthi, Raghubir Yadav, Anil George, Rajesh Shringarpure', null, 'Prior to the India-Pakistan war of 1971, the RAW (Research and Analysis Wing) trains an Indian banker in espionage and martial arts, and sends him to Pakistan for an undercover operation where he finds himself sinking between emotions and violence.', 'Prior to the India-Pakistan war of 1971, the RAW (Research and Analysis Wing) trains an Indian banker in espionage and martial arts, and sends him to Pakistan for an undercover operation where he finds himself sinking between emotions and violence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bFMVatMQVqB3lZGXFpK38tPAetq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:585862'),
  ('539979239510317299', 'Romeo and Juliet', 1936, 'Drama, Romance', 'George Cukor, William H. Daniels, Douglas Shearer', null, 'Norma Shearer, Leslie Howard, John Barrymore, Edna May Oliver, Basil Rathbone, C. Aubrey Smith, Andy Devine, Conway Tearle', 'NR', 'Young love is poisoned by a generations long feud between two noble families.', 'Young love is poisoned by a generations long feud between two noble families.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tGK16kxbsSrNnuRyhw57Yl1H20w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43879'),
  ('435230175018829363', 'Romeo and Juliet', 1954, 'Drama, Romance', 'Renato Castellani, Robert Krasker', null, 'Laurence Harvey, Susan Shentall, Flora Robson, Norman Wooland, Mervyn Johns, John Gielgud, Bill Travers, Sebastian Cabot', 'NR', 'In Shakespeare''s classic play, the Montagues and Capulets, two families of Renaissance Italy, have hated each other for years, but the son of one family and the daughter of the other fall desperately in love and secretly marry.', 'In Shakespeare''s classic play, the Montagues and Capulets, two families of Renaissance Italy, have hated each other for years, but the son of one family and the daughter of the other fall desperately in love and secretly marry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8dazSg9J6CxC8mUMKs5AMj12eqF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92784'),
  ('229218008671841082', 'Romeo and Juliet', 1968, 'Drama, Romance', 'Franco Zeffirelli, Pasqualino De Santis, Isa Bartalini', 'Franco Brusati, Franco Zeffirelli, Masolino D''Amico', 'Leonard Whiting, Olivia Hussey, John McEnery, Michael York, Milo O''Shea, Pat Heywood, Robert Stephens, Bruce Robinson', 'PG', 'Romeo Montague and Juliet Capulet fall in love against the wishes of their feuding families. Driven by their passion, the young lovers defy their destiny and elope, only to suffer the ultimate tragedy.', 'Romeo Montague and Juliet Capulet fall in love against the wishes of their feuding families. Driven by their passion, the young lovers defy their destiny and elope, only to suffer the ultimate tragedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vaBQKLbSWkXGTOlsz9ARdJP4lvg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6003'),
  ('235703505436543634', 'Romeo and Juliet Get Married', 2005, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Bruno Barreto, Anne Pinheiro Guimarães, Gigi Soares', 'Marcos Caruso, Jandira Martini, Mário Prata', 'Luana Piovani, Marco Ricca, Luis Gustavo, Martha Mellinger, Berta Zemel, Leonardo Miggiorin, Mel Lisboa, Cybele Jácome', null, 'The tomboyish, outgoing Julieta is the daughter of a member of the Palmeiras soccer club board. She is constantly frustrated by what she sees as institutional bias against women in soccer. One day while watching her beloved Palmeiras, she is struck by a handsome man, Romeu, that she sees rooting for the Palmeiras'' chief rivals, the Corinthians. After meeting the same man again in the middle of eye exam, Julieta and Romeu quickly become a couple. However, in order to avoid incurring the wrath of her parents, Romeu is forced to pretend to be an adoring Palmeiras fan, an increasingly difficult task for the die-hard Corinthiano.', 'The tomboyish, outgoing Julieta is the daughter of a member of the Palmeiras soccer club board. She is constantly frustrated by what she sees as institutional bias against women in soccer. One day while watching her beloved Palmeiras, she is struck by a handsome man, Romeu, that she sees rooting for the Palmeiras'' chief rivals, the Corinthians. After meeting the same man again in the middle of eye exam, Julieta and Romeu quickly become a couple. However, in order to avoid incurring the wrath of her parents, Romeu is forced to pretend to be an adoring Palmeiras fan, an increasingly difficult task for the die-hard Corinthiano.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vVTKiWJSlbOHapbe8kUfaiGhCDT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49723'),
  ('266733663805813016', 'Romeo Is Bleeding', 1993, 'Crime, Drama, Romance', 'Peter Medak, Dariusz Wolski', 'Hilary Henkin', 'Gary Oldman, Lena Olin, Annabella Sciorra, Juliette Lewis, Roy Scheider, David Proval, Will Patton, Larry Joshua', 'R', 'A corrupt cop gets in over his head when he tries to assassinate a beautiful Russian hit-woman.', 'A corrupt cop gets in over his head when he tries to assassinate a beautiful Russian hit-woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ojXNRpHMXU99UFmF9MKKiJCymKr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2088'),
  ('845140415992503990', 'Romeo Is Juliet', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Giovanni Veronesi, Tani Canevari, Stefano Farina', 'Giovanni Veronesi, Pilar Fogliati, Nicola Baldoni', 'Sergio Castellitto, Pilar Fogliati, Margherita Buy, Geppi Cucciari, Maurizio Lombardi, Serena De Ferrari, Domenico Diele, Alessandro Haber', null, 'After her audition as Juliet fails to impress, a young actress determined to act in the latest production of Shakespeare''s play crossdresses and is unexpectedly chosen for the role of Romeo.', 'After her audition as Juliet fails to impress, a young actress determined to act in the latest production of Shakespeare''s play crossdresses and is unexpectedly chosen for the role of Romeo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gvGxnKFxPkJa0Y6reurTEhFiIby.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1168806'),
  ('430277710029435725', 'Romeo Must Die', 2000, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Andrzej Bartkowiak, Glen MacPherson, Conrad E. Palmisano', 'Eric Bernt, John Jarrell', 'Jet Li, Aaliyah, Isaiah Washington, Russell Wong, Delroy Lindo, D. B. Woodside, Henry O, Jon Kit Lee', 'R', 'Two warring gang families (one African-American, the other Chinese) maneuver for bragging rights to the Oakland, California, docks. Hang Sing and Trish O''Day uncover a trail of deceit that leaves most of the warring factions dead … or worse!', 'Two warring gang families (one African-American, the other Chinese) maneuver for bragging rights to the Oakland, California, docks. Hang Sing and Trish O''Day uncover a trail of deceit that leaves most of the warring factions dead … or worse!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zKrnaTWW63y4Q1XLrdZQyQmcRWd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2085'),
  ('836670295791625214', 'Romeo Santos: Utopia Live from MetLife Stadium', 2021, 'Music, Romance', 'Charles Todd, Devin Amar, Rick Siegel', null, 'Romeo Santos, Cardi B, Raulin Rodriguez, Joe Veras, El Chaval, Frank Reyes, Elvis Martinez, Kiko Rodriguez', null, 'In this Concert he focuses on the star and most important defender of bachata, the Dominican singer and songwriter Romeo Santos, and his concert on September 21, 2019 at MetLife Stadium in East Rutherford, New Jersey, which broke attendance record . Romeo took advantage of this event to bring together, for the first time live, all the legendary bachateros with whom he collaborated on his acclaimed album Utopia (2019), to the delight of the public who sang his favorite hits.', 'In this Concert he focuses on the star and most important defender of bachata, the Dominican singer and songwriter Romeo Santos, and his concert on September 21, 2019 at MetLife Stadium in East Rutherford, New Jersey, which broke attendance record . Romeo took advantage of this event to bring together, for the first time live, all the legendary bachateros with whom he collaborated on his acclaimed album Utopia (2019), to the delight of the public who sang his favorite hits.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sLkwsvEslKUqjWoftcakhBimZ2x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:857873'),
  ('260440548906473597', 'Romeo y Julieta', 1943, 'Comedy', 'Miguel M. Delgado, Jack Draper', 'Jaime Salvador', 'Cantinflas, María Elena Marqués, Ángel Garasa, Andrés Soler, Emma Roldán, José Baviera, Pedro Elviro, Conchita Gentil Arcos', null, 'Verona''s peace is disturbed by the rivalry between noble families: the Montesco and the Capuleto, irreconcilable enemies. The two families have continued fighting to make life unbearable in the Italian town. The Prince of Verona informs the chiefs that the two families respond with their lives if there are new struggles. At a ball in honor of Juliet, the daughter of Capuleto, incidentally meets Romeo, son of Montesco. Both fall in love immediately, not knowing that their love is impossible.', 'Verona''s peace is disturbed by the rivalry between noble families: the Montesco and the Capuleto, irreconcilable enemies. The two families have continued fighting to make life unbearable in the Italian town. The Prince of Verona informs the chiefs that the two families respond with their lives if there are new struggles. At a ball in honor of Juliet, the daughter of Capuleto, incidentally meets Romeo, son of Montesco. Both fall in love immediately, not knowing that their love is impossible.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rVBXvZDdCLR7qxrgPNBWcReOFap.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69057'),
  ('478679041417097086', 'Romeo, Juliet and Darkness', 1960, 'Drama, War', 'Jiří Weiss, Věra Ženíšková, Zdenek Sirový', 'Jan Otčenášek, Jiří Weiss', 'Ivan Mistrík, Dana Smutná, Jiřina Šejbalová, František Smolík, Blanka Bohdanová, Eva Mrázová, Karla Chadimová, Vladimír Ráž', null, 'Pavel, a young student living in Prague in 1942, hides a Jewish girl in his apartment building''s attic. Amidst the brutality of the occupying German army, love blossoms between the two. He is her only link to the outside world. Then the two are discovered by Pavel''s mother, who forces the residents of the apartment building to decide whether Hana can remain.', 'Pavel, a young student living in Prague in 1942, hides a Jewish girl in his apartment building''s attic. Amidst the brutality of the occupying German army, love blossoms between the two. He is her only link to the outside world. Then the two are discovered by Pavel''s mother, who forces the residents of the apartment building to decide whether Hana can remain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yB2lovsm5UJ8dCmTE6jd4aqy5qj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80084'),
  ('1028720630938976993', 'Romeos', 2011, 'Drama', 'Sabine Bernardi', 'Sabine Bernardi', 'Rick Okon, Max Befort, Liv Lisa Fries, Felix Brocke, Silke Geertz, Gilles Tschudi, Julia Schäfle, Daniel Rodic', null, 'Lukas, 20, is a prisoner in his own body. As a pre-op transgender person, he is constantly finding himself trapped in uncomfortable, compromising positions. His best friend, Ine introduces him to the gay scene in Cologne where he meets the confident and gorgeous, Fabio. The two develop a romantic relationship that tests the boundaries of love. ROMEOS forgoes stereotypes and conventions to offer an honest and humorous examination of the most basic of human conditions: friendship, sex, and love.', 'Lukas, 20, is a prisoner in his own body. As a pre-op transgender person, he is constantly finding himself trapped in uncomfortable, compromising positions. His best friend, Ine introduces him to the gay scene in Cologne where he meets the confident and gorgeous, Fabio. The two develop a romantic relationship that tests the boundaries of love. ROMEOS forgoes stereotypes and conventions to offer an honest and humorous examination of the most basic of human conditions: friendship, sex, and love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4ZT0P15q4pbVafS8aAeAnweu6uo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81704'),
  ('151229636122684149', 'Romería', 2025, 'Drama', 'Carla Simón, Hélène Louvart, Eva Valiño', 'Carla Simón', 'Llúcia Garcia, Mitch, Tristán Ulloa, Alberto Gracia, Miryam Gallego, Janet Novás, José Ángel Egido, Marina Troncoso', null, 'Marina, 18, orphaned at a young age, must travel to Spain’s Atlantic coast to obtain a signature for a scholarship application from the paternal grandparents she has never met. She navigates a sea of new aunts, uncles, and cousins, uncertain whether she will be embraced or met with resistance. Stirring long-buried emotions, reviving tenderness, and uncovering unspoken wounds tied to the past, Marina pieces together the fragmented and often contradictory memories of the parents she barely remembers.', 'Marina, 18, orphaned at a young age, must travel to Spain’s Atlantic coast to obtain a signature for a scholarship application from the paternal grandparents she has never met. She navigates a sea of new aunts, uncles, and cousins, uncertain whether she will be embraced or met with resistance. Stirring long-buried emotions, reviving tenderness, and uncovering unspoken wounds tied to the past, Marina pieces together the fragmented and often contradictory memories of the parents she barely remembers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/svscmm7MZml1JqBMl62REnbxhjP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1182861'),
  ('54839471354404559', 'Romero', 1989, 'Drama, History', 'Geoff Burton, John Duigan, Alfonso Cuarón', 'John Sacret Young', 'Raúl Juliá, Richard Jordan, Ana Alicia, Eddie Velez, Alejandro Bracho, Tony Plana, Harold Gould, Lucy Reina', 'PG-13', 'Romero is a compelling and deeply moving look at the life of Archbishop Oscar Romero of El Salvador, who made the ultimate sacrifice in a passionate stand against social injustice and oppression in his county. This film chronicles the transformation of Romero from an apolitical, complacent priest to a committed leader of the Salvadoran people.', 'Romero is a compelling and deeply moving look at the life of Archbishop Oscar Romero of El Salvador, who made the ultimate sacrifice in a passionate stand against social injustice and oppression in his county. This film chronicles the transformation of Romero from an apolitical, complacent priest to a committed leader of the Salvadoran people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rM4YcDw3U3w396RNslstu1OXRDz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32767'),
  ('1082664530753051179', 'ROMI', 2023, 'Horror, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Robert Cuffley', 'Susie Moloney', 'Alexa Barajas, Juan Riedinger, Pavel Kříž, Jocelyn Chugg, Jamie Shelnitz', null, 'Forced to hide out at a state of the art smart home, a young woman on the run is terrorized by ROMI, its sinister digital assistant.', 'Forced to hide out at a state of the art smart home, a young woman on the run is terrorized by ROMI, its sinister digital assistant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kgeCklZUXdImDcop8odTbCmvvjr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1139296'),
  ('703739556943837002', 'Romina', 2018, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Diego Cohen', 'Diego Cohen', 'Francisca Lozano, Roberto Beck, Walter Bercht, Victor Bonilla, Diego Cohen, Oliver Nava, Eduardo Negrete, Arantza Ruiz', null, 'A shocking assault inspires horrific violence when a group of teens encounters a girl from their school while camping in a remote spot.', 'A shocking assault inspires horrific violence when a group of teens encounters a girl from their school while camping in a remote spot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/klfBdSpbWnQLqVXXJD8Mczc3XfF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:535488'),
