  ('238784404533610926', 'Romper Stomper', 1992, 'Action, Drama, Thriller', 'Geoffrey Wright, Ron Hagen, Chris Odgers', 'Geoffrey Wright', 'Russell Crowe, Daniel Pollock, Jacqueline McKenzie, Alex Scott, Leigh Russell, Dan Wyllie, James McKenna, Eric Mueck', null, 'Nazi skinheads in Melbourne take out their anger on local Vietnamese, who are seen as threatening racial purity. Finally the Vietnamese have had enough and confront the skinheads in an all-out confrontation, sending the skinheads running. A woman who is prone to epileptic seizures joins the skins'' merry band, and helps them on their run from justice, but is her affliction also a sign of impurity?', 'Nazi skinheads in Melbourne take out their anger on local Vietnamese, who are seen as threatening racial purity. Finally the Vietnamese have had enough and confront the skinheads in an all-out confrontation, sending the skinheads running. A woman who is prone to epileptic seizures joins the skins'' merry band, and helps them on their run from justice, but is her affliction also a sign of impurity?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/urE3Jzl3zuz2XUmAq2rXubYn3SD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10412'),
  ('632576554813358039', 'Romuald & Juliette', 1989, 'Comedy', 'Coline Serreau, Jean-Noël Ferragut', 'Coline Serreau', 'Daniel Auteuil, Firmine Richard, Pierre Vernier, Maxime Leroux, Isabelle Carré, Gilles Privat, Catherine Salviat, Muriel Combeau', null, 'A company president gets framed with a food-poisoning scandal and the only person who can help him is the evening cleaning-woman, who always seems to be at the right place at the right time.', 'A company president gets framed with a food-poisoning scandal and the only person who can help him is the evening cleaning-woman, who always seems to be at the right place at the right time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AeipkfXO6tvdWQWYQm5mTic3uzv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11480'),
  ('239517200943765156', 'Romulus and Remus', 1961, 'Adventure', 'Sergio Corbucci, Guido Zurli, Franco Giraldi', 'Franco Rossetti, Ennio De Concini, Duccio Tessari', 'Steve Reeves, Gordon Scott, Virna Lisi, Franco Volpi, Massimo Girotti, Jacques Sernas, Laura Solari, Germano Longo', null, 'Twin brothers were raised by wolves, revolt against tyranny in pre-Roman Italy and then come to a parting of the ways as they lead their people toward the founding of a new city, the founders of Rome.', 'Twin brothers were raised by wolves, revolt against tyranny in pre-Roman Italy and then come to a parting of the ways as they lead their people toward the founding of a new city, the founders of Rome.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AaPz5Gg3MsxIU6KenTTJ5gq8n5y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:96786'),
  ('1045694223895307905', 'Romulus and the Sabines', 1961, 'Adventure', 'Richard Pottier, Bitto Albertini', 'Edoardo Anton', 'Roger Moore, Mylène Demongeot, Jean Marais, Rosanna Schiaffino, Scilla Gabel, Marino Masé, Giorgia Moll, Folco Lulli', null, 'The classic story from the early days of Rome where there are no women. Romulus, the founder of Rome, finds women to be wives from Sabina where there are a lot of women. The Sabine men, of course, attack Rome to get their wives and daughters back.', 'The classic story from the early days of Rome where there are no women. Romulus, the founder of Rome, finds women to be wives from Sabina where there are a lot of women. The Sabine men, of course, attack Rome to get their wives and daughters back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ro16UTHK8iL6ERRxUTKcytvXxFe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:138519'),
  ('779148436041546634', 'Romulus, My Father', 2007, 'Drama', 'Richard Roxburgh, Robert Connolly, Geoffrey Simpson', 'Nick Drake', 'Eric Bana, Franka Potente, Marton Csokas, Kodi Smit-McPhee, Russell Dykstra, Jacek Koman, Terry Norris, Alethea McGrath', null, 'The story of Romulus, his beautiful wife, Christina, and their struggle in the face of great adversity to bring up their son, Raimond. It is a story of impossible love that ultimately celebrates the unbreakable bond between father and son.', 'The story of Romulus, his beautiful wife, Christina, and their struggle in the face of great adversity to bring up their son, Raimond. It is a story of impossible love that ultimately celebrates the unbreakable bond between father and son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xvg88XAghIazPtrXYNkW3hCFWss.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14066'),
  ('1140329567466875951', 'Romy', 2009, 'Drama', 'Torsten C. Fischer', 'Benedikt Röskau', 'Jessica Schwarz, Thomas Kretschmann, Guillaume Delorme, Maresa Hörbiger, Heinz Hoenig, Alicia von Rittberg, Karlheinz Hackl, Erni Mangold', null, 'From her on-screen triumphs to her off-screen tribulations, this biopic focuses on the captivating life and career of actress Romy Schneider.', 'From her on-screen triumphs to her off-screen tribulations, this biopic focuses on the captivating life and career of actress Romy Schneider.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cFbfUaoKVykPEYr05hJU4wHZUo1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:113855'),
  ('58893052377927234', 'Romy and Michele''s High School Reunion', 1997, 'Comedy', 'Reynaldo Villalobos, David Mirkin, Martha Elcan', 'Robin Schiff', 'Mira Sorvino, Lisa Kudrow, Janeane Garofalo, Alan Cumming, Julia Campbell, Mia Cottet, Kristin Bauer, Elaine Hendrix', 'R', 'Two not-too-bright party girls reinvent themselves for their high school reunion. Armed with a borrowed Jaguar, new clothes and the story of their success as the inventors of Post-It notes, Romy and Michele descend on their alma mater, but their façade crumbles quickly.', 'Two not-too-bright party girls reinvent themselves for their high school reunion. Armed with a borrowed Jaguar, new clothes and the story of their success as the inventors of Post-It notes, Romy and Michele descend on their alma mater, but their façade crumbles quickly.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yLxgglhaP2QfWVZTdrv7mZgvuHL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9611'),
  ('843555804191289931', 'Ron Goossens, Low Budget Stuntman', 2017, 'Action, Comedy', 'Steffen Haars', 'Steffen Haars, Flip van der Kuil', 'Tim Haars, Bo Maerten, Michiel Romeyn, Henry van Loon, Steef Cuijpers, Nick Golterman, Roy Reymound, Waldemar Torenstra', null, 'Alcoholic and low budget stuntman Ron Goossens has to get The Netherlands'' most successful actrice between the sheets in order to save his own marriage. Will he succeed? A new outrageous comedy from the writers/directors of New Kids Turbo, New Kids Nitro and Bros Before Hos.', 'Alcoholic and low budget stuntman Ron Goossens has to get The Netherlands'' most successful actrice between the sheets in order to save his own marriage. Will he succeed? A new outrageous comedy from the writers/directors of New Kids Turbo, New Kids Nitro and Bros Before Hos.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/36DtuxvsOM7zv4qnkJkmSkXvoZY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:430945'),
  ('129731915993316057', 'Ronal the Barbarian', 2011, 'Animation, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Kresten Vestbjerg Andersen, Thorbjørn Christoffersen, Philip Einstein Lipski', 'Thorbjørn Christoffersen', 'Anders Juul, Hadi Ka-Koush, Lærke Winther, Brian Lykke, Lars Mikkelsen, Peter Aude, Lars Bom, Jens Jacob Tychsen', 'R', 'Ronal is a young barbarian with low self-esteem, the polar opposite of all the muscular barbarians in his village. He''s a real wuss. However, as fate would have it, responsibility for the tribe''s survival falls on Ronal''s scrawny shoulders, when the evil Lord Volcazar raids the village and abducts every living barbarian with the exception of Ronal, who is forced to go on a perilous quest to save his enslaved clan and thwart Volcazar’s plot to rule the world.', 'Ronal is a young barbarian with low self-esteem, the polar opposite of all the muscular barbarians in his village. He''s a real wuss. However, as fate would have it, responsibility for the tribe''s survival falls on Ronal''s scrawny shoulders, when the evil Lord Volcazar raids the village and abducts every living barbarian with the exception of Ronal, who is forced to go on a perilous quest to save his enslaved clan and thwart Volcazar’s plot to rule the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vT8m9Ji4mrUExpuIX0LGjMPHEHX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79433'),
  ('322017704046488459', 'Ronaldo', 2015, 'Documentary, History', 'Anthony Wonke', null, 'Cristiano Ronaldo, Lionel Messi, Dolores Aveiro, Hugo Aveiro, Georgie Bingham, Adrian Clarke, Rio Ferdinand, Jorge Mendes', 'PG-13', 'Filmed over 14 months with unprecedented access into the inner circle of the man and the sport, this is the first official and fully authorised film of one of the most celebrated figures in football. For the first time ever, the world gets vividly candid and un-paralleled, behind-closed-doors access to the footballer, father, family-man and friend in this moving & fascinating documentary. Through in-depth conversations, state of the art football footage and never before seen archival footage, the film gives an astonishing insight into the sporting and personal life of triple Ballon D''Or winner Cristiano Ronaldo at the peak of his career. From the makers of ‘Senna’ and ‘Amy’, Ronaldo takes audiences on an intimate and revealing journey of what it’s like to live as an iconic athlete in the eye of the storm.', 'Filmed over 14 months with unprecedented access into the inner circle of the man and the sport, this is the first official and fully authorised film of one of the most celebrated figures in football. For the first time ever, the world gets vividly candid and un-paralleled, behind-closed-doors access to the footballer, father, family-man and friend in this moving & fascinating documentary. Through in-depth conversations, state of the art football footage and never before seen archival footage, the film gives an astonishing insight into the sporting and personal life of triple Ballon D''Or winner Cristiano Ronaldo at the peak of his career. From the makers of ‘Senna’ and ‘Amy’, Ronaldo takes audiences on an intimate and revealing journey of what it’s like to live as an iconic athlete in the eye of the storm.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qdr6Jx39KErvSeQFVREjxeEK4lk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:361931'),
  ('270854131200857878', 'Ronde de nuit', 2020, 'Drama, TV Movie, Crime', 'Isabelle Czajka', null, 'Nacima Bekhtaoui, Samir Boitard, Olivia Côte, Pascal Rénéric, Clémentine Poidatz, Hedi Zada, Fejria Deliba, Marc Menahem', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pMmB3L1Fs6UkrBx0cbBw9hj3Ero.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:741135'),
  ('184019000626379995', 'Rondo', 1966, 'Drama', 'Zvonimir Berković', 'Zvonimir Berković', 'Stevo Žigon, Milena Dravić, Relja Bašić, Rudolf Kukić, Zvonimir Rogoz', null, 'Every Sunday, lonely bachelor and refined judge Mladen goes to play chess with his friend, sculptor Fedji. Slowly, he engages in a love affair with Neda, Fedia''s wife, and almost invisibly, a love triangle forms. Chess board is the central part of the film, as moves on the board reflect emotions of the characters.', 'Every Sunday, lonely bachelor and refined judge Mladen goes to play chess with his friend, sculptor Fedji. Slowly, he engages in a love affair with Neda, Fedia''s wife, and almost invisibly, a love triangle forms. Chess board is the central part of the film, as moves on the board reflect emotions of the characters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/amC8QIkBWjU3KtfbRyPrsuNuQiR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:266407'),
  ('946987855095743234', 'Ronia: The Robber''s Daughter', 1984, 'Adventure, Drama, Fantasy, Family', 'Tage Danielsson, Rune Ericson, Mischa Gavrjusjov', 'Astrid Lindgren', 'Hanna Zetterberg, Dan Håfström, Börje Ahlstedt, Lena Nyman, Per Oscarsson, Med Reventberg, Allan Edwall, Ulf Isenborg', null, 'Ronia lives happily in her father''s castle until she comes across a new playmate, Birk, in the nearby dark forest. The two explore the wilderness, braving dangerous Witchbirds and Rump-Gnomes. But when their families find out Birk and Ronia have been playing together, they forbid them to see each other again. Indeed, their fathers are competing robber chieftains and bitter enemies. Now the two spunky children must try to tear down the barriers that have kept their families apart for so long.', 'Ronia lives happily in her father''s castle until she comes across a new playmate, Birk, in the nearby dark forest. The two explore the wilderness, braving dangerous Witchbirds and Rump-Gnomes. But when their families find out Birk and Ronia have been playing together, they forbid them to see each other again. Indeed, their fathers are competing robber chieftains and bitter enemies. Now the two spunky children must try to tear down the barriers that have kept their families apart for so long.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gatMa1qfwpJqiawPjJxodUvdB0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:271'),
  ('437239195260912726', 'Ronin', 1998, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'John Frankenheimer, Robert Fraisse, Jean-Claude Bourdin', 'J. D. Zeik, David Mamet', 'Robert De Niro, Jean Reno, Natascha McElhone, Stellan Skarsgård, Skipp Sudduth, Jonathan Pryce, Sean Bean, Michael Lonsdale', 'R', 'A briefcase with undisclosed contents – sought by Irish terrorists and the Russian mob – makes its way into criminals'' hands. An Irish liaison assembles a squad of mercenaries, or ''ronin'', and gives them the thorny task of recovering the case.', 'A briefcase with undisclosed contents – sought by Irish terrorists and the Russian mob – makes its way into criminals'' hands. An Irish liaison assembles a squad of mercenaries, or ''ronin'', and gives them the thorny task of recovering the case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AirrhRJjHwytOV0pdLu7YZ4DEyr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8195'),
  ('1121301730616022053', 'Ronin-gai', 1990, 'History, Drama, Action', 'Kazuo Kuroki, Takaiwa Hitoshi, Masahiro Makino', 'Kazuo Kasahara', 'Yoshio Harada, Kanako Higuchi, Renji Ishibashi, Kaoru Sugita, Hideyo Amamoto, Moeko Ezawa, Hiroko Isayama, Michitarō Mizushima', null, 'Near the end of Japanese civil war, several disgraced ronin living in Edo''s red light district attempt to regain their honor by defending a brothel from a hostile militia bent on wiping out local prostitutes.', 'Near the end of Japanese civil war, several disgraced ronin living in Edo''s red light district attempt to regain their honor by defending a brothel from a hostile militia bent on wiping out local prostitutes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6zWalJBJJdCGHwHFIWMC0Y9vhYe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:151250'),
  ('868180149748807897', 'Ronnie Coleman: The King', 2018, 'Documentary', 'Kristin Mendez, Vlad Yudin', 'Vlad Yudin', 'Ronnie Coleman, Jay Cutler, Shawn Ray, Kai Greene, Victor Martinez, Dorian Yates, Rich Gaspari', null, 'Ronnie Coleman is known as "The King" and for good reason. He is the 8x Mr. Olympia champion in the world of bodybuilding - sharing the world record for most Olympia wins. Now retired, he has undergone over 6 surgeries leaving him unable to walk without crutches but his desire to train like a pro bodybuilder has not dissipated. Exploring the history of his career as a bodybuilding legend and following his journey to recovery; for the first time ever discover the true man behind The King.', 'Ronnie Coleman is known as "The King" and for good reason. He is the 8x Mr. Olympia champion in the world of bodybuilding - sharing the world record for most Olympia wins. Now retired, he has undergone over 6 surgeries leaving him unable to walk without crutches but his desire to train like a pro bodybuilder has not dissipated. Exploring the history of his career as a bodybuilding legend and following his journey to recovery; for the first time ever discover the true man behind The King.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hh8PTJdrYKX5wo50DOipH5yvxYR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:532944'),
  ('209719781834837294', 'Ronny Chieng: Asian Comedian Destroys America!', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Sebastian DiNatale', 'Ronny Chieng', 'Ronny Chieng', null, 'Ronny Chieng ("The Daily Show," "Crazy Rich Asians") takes center stage in this stand-up special and riffs on modern American life and more.', 'Ronny Chieng ("The Daily Show," "Crazy Rich Asians") takes center stage in this stand-up special and riffs on modern American life and more.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yZZdeUJ0JI89aZTbHb92bf1JGgK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:649802'),
  ('901696402056581046', 'Ronny Chieng: Love to Hate It', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Cameron Barnett, Cameron Barnett', 'Ronny Chieng', 'Ronny Chieng', 'R', 'Ronny Chieng unpacks fertility treatment fiascoes, the dark side of men''s self-help and scam-sensitive parents.', 'Ronny Chieng unpacks fertility treatment fiascoes, the dark side of men''s self-help and scam-sensitive parents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pGoB87zqMKedBsdaAHYzMq2cE7u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1391354'),
  ('215336152356321226', 'Ronny Chieng: Speakeasy', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Sebastian DiNatale, Cameron Barnett, Brian Flaherty', 'Ronny Chieng', 'Ronny Chieng', 'R', 'Ronny Chieng shares his rage at online critics, gratitude for nerds, bewilderment with irrational skeptics and unique cure for racism in this special.', 'Ronny Chieng shares his rage at online critics, gratitude for nerds, bewilderment with irrational skeptics and unique cure for racism in this special.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9JCHqAcLKpyneJOJwSApz59GeBY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:955384'),
  ('993072678231208050', 'Roofman', 2025, 'Crime, Comedy, Drama', 'Derek Cianfrance, Andrij Parekh, Mariela Comitini', 'Derek Cianfrance, Kirt Gunn', 'Channing Tatum, Kirsten Dunst, Ben Mendelsohn, LaKeith Stanfield, Juno Temple, Melonie Díaz, Uzo Aduba, Lily Collias', 'R', 'A former Army Ranger and struggling father turns to robbing McDonald’s restaurants by cutting holes in their roofs, earning him the nickname "Roofman." After escaping prison, he secretly lives inside a Toys “R” Us for six months, surviving undetected while planning his next move. But when he falls for a divorced mom drawn to his undeniable charm, his double life begins to unravel, setting off a compelling and suspenseful game of cat and mouse as his past closes in.', 'A former Army Ranger and struggling father turns to robbing McDonald’s restaurants by cutting holes in their roofs, earning him the nickname "Roofman." After escaping prison, he secretly lives inside a Toys “R” Us for six months, surviving undetected while planning his next move. But when he falls for a divorced mom drawn to his undeniable charm, his double life begins to unravel, setting off a compelling and suspenseful game of cat and mouse as his past closes in.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wXDFtcnYtevleGzCmAD2ReQnJ4l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1242419'),
  ('1048896281811953532', 'Rooftops', 1989, 'Action, Crime', 'Robert Wise, Theo van de Sande', 'Terence Brennan', 'Jason Gedrick, Troy Byer, Eddie Velez, Tisha Campbell, Alexis Cruz, Allen Payne, Steve Love, Rafael Báez', null, 'T, as most of his friends, lives in a self-constructed ''house'', built on top of an old building in the city. Their one passion is ''combat''. Combat is a dance/streetfight during which the contestants try to push each other out of the arena, while not allowed to actually touch each other. When drugdealers move into the neighbourhood and kill T''s best friend he embarks on a mission to eradicate the drug-presence in the neigbourhood. His friends are reluctant to help though, knowing what happened to T''s friend when he crossed them.', 'T, as most of his friends, lives in a self-constructed ''house'', built on top of an old building in the city. Their one passion is ''combat''. Combat is a dance/streetfight during which the contestants try to push each other out of the arena, while not allowed to actually touch each other. When drugdealers move into the neighbourhood and kill T''s best friend he embarks on a mission to eradicate the drug-presence in the neigbourhood. His friends are reluctant to help though, knowing what happened to T''s friend when he crossed them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3RQSFE7JQiIYr2fhjZMGT97FLFn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115386'),
  ('864588596341611445', 'Roohi', 2021, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Hardik Mehta, Amalendu Chaudhary', 'Mrighdeep Singh Lamba, Gautam Mehra', 'Rajkummar Rao, Varun Sharma, Janhvi Kapoor, Manav Vij, Sarita Joshi, Alexx O''Nell, Rajesh Jais, Anuraag Arora', null, 'In a fictional North Indian town, two boys Bhaura and Kattanni are stuck in a forest with Roohi. But there’s an insidious spirit following them with feet turned backwards.', 'In a fictional North Indian town, two boys Bhaura and Kattanni are stuck in a forest with Roohi. But there’s an insidious spirit following them with feet turned backwards.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/10kCy34fbgU9nI5ScfMcCGebNgo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:694103'),
  ('767723617375686909', 'Rookie of the Year', 1993, 'Family, Comedy', 'Daniel Stern, Jack N. Green', 'Sam Harper', 'Thomas Ian Nicholas, Gary Busey, Amy Morton, Patrick LaBrecque, Robert Hy Gorman, Bruce Altman, Dan Hedaya, Albert Hall', 'PG', '12-year-old Henry Rowengartner, whose late father was a minor league baseball player, grew up dreaming of playing baseball, despite his physical shortcomings. After Henry''s arm is broken while trying to catch a baseball at school, the tendon in that arm heals too tightly, allowing Henry to throw pitches that are as fast as 103 mph. Henry is spotted at nearby Wrigley Field by Larry "Fish" Fisher, the general manager of the struggling Chicago Cubs, after Henry throws an opponent''s home-run ball all the way from the outfield bleachers back to the catcher, and it seems that Henry may be the pitcher that team owner Bob Carson has been praying for.', '12-year-old Henry Rowengartner, whose late father was a minor league baseball player, grew up dreaming of playing baseball, despite his physical shortcomings. After Henry''s arm is broken while trying to catch a baseball at school, the tendon in that arm heals too tightly, allowing Henry to throw pitches that are as fast as 103 mph. Henry is spotted at nearby Wrigley Field by Larry "Fish" Fisher, the general manager of the struggling Chicago Cubs, after Henry throws an opponent''s home-run ball all the way from the outfield bleachers back to the catcher, and it seems that Henry may be the pitcher that team owner Bob Carson has been praying for.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9If8XnhBdEbQ2Q0ggAQC92CptjU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21845'),
  ('176312831939908190', 'Rookie Revue', 1941, 'War, Animation, Comedy', 'Friz Freleng', null, 'Mel Blanc, Robert C. Bruce, Jackson Wheeler', null, 'Random gags around military life, set on an army base. A bugler uses a jukebox to play reveille. In formation, one private has a great deal of trouble remembering what comes after "3"; after he gets it, he decides not to go for the $32 question. In the mess hall, the machine gunners machine gun their food while the bombers catch falling biscuits. The infantry marches for miles - past a "next time, take the train" billboard.', 'Random gags around military life, set on an army base. A bugler uses a jukebox to play reveille. In formation, one private has a great deal of trouble remembering what comes after "3"; after he gets it, he decides not to go for the $32 question. In the mess hall, the machine gunners machine gun their food while the bombers catch falling biscuits. The infantry marches for miles - past a "next time, take the train" billboard.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oZ6MaJekLAC6jVfa1pPA4dOHc2S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:236518'),
  ('1076307161430979679', 'Rookies', 2022, 'Documentary, Music, Action', 'Thierry Demaizière, Alban Teurlai, Alban Teurlai', 'Elsa Le Peutrec, Thierry Demaizière, Alban Teurlai', 'Charlotte Saudrais, Erwan Schamaneche, Michelle Kibebe, Nathanaël Marante, Ketsia Chayni Obame, Maxime Auber, Mélissa Joseph, Aniss Orblin', null, 'HipHop as a language and an outlet for young people: The film follows the youngest class members of a dance academy on their way to becoming professional dancers. Many of the students come from the socially deprived areas of Paris. Accompanied by a pulsating, dancing camera that pulls the audience right into the action, the film negotiates themes such as origins, pains, dreams and hopes.', 'HipHop as a language and an outlet for young people: The film follows the youngest class members of a dance academy on their way to becoming professional dancers. Many of the students come from the socially deprived areas of Paris. Accompanied by a pulsating, dancing camera that pulls the audience right into the action, the film negotiates themes such as origins, pains, dreams and hopes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/OKSprMJ5FbcU1OxNPecN45g1KY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:916403'),
  ('191845948941828935', 'Rookies Go to War', 1974, 'Comedy', 'Claude Zidi, Paul Bonis', 'Claude Zidi, Jean Bouchaud, Jean-Paul Farré', 'Gérard Rinaldi, Jean Sarrus, Gérard Filipelli, Jean-Guy Fechner, Jacques Seiler, Marisa Merlini, Heidy Bohlen, Paolo Stoppa', null, 'A Grand Slapstick comedy about four buddies serving in the army. Their long-suffering sergeant attempts to whip them into shape but the conflict spirals out of control.', 'A Grand Slapstick comedy about four buddies serving in the army. Their long-suffering sergeant attempts to whip them into shape but the conflict spirals out of control.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zEOiO2XGevANwDvfHMPNNRWXpM7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62662'),
  ('935000435772757584', 'Rookies Run Amok', 1971, 'Comedy', 'Claude Zidi', 'Claude Zidi, Michel Ardan', 'Gérard Rinaldi, Gérard Filipelli, Jean Sarrus, Jean-Guy Fechner, Luis Rego, Jacques Dufilho, Marion Game, Jacques Seiler', null, 'Les Bidasses en Folie, a french movie from 1971, is a very short, easy to watch, slapstick hippie comedy.', 'Les Bidasses en Folie, a french movie from 1971, is a very short, easy to watch, slapstick hippie comedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yyJASL56b18woHgL8ZNu8IjIj26.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72259'),
  ('655842228924534585', 'Rookies Run Amok 2', 1983, 'Comedy', 'Michel Vocoret, Alain Nauroy, Claude Bécognée', 'Michel Vocoret', 'Gérard Rinaldi, Jean Sarrus, Gérard Filipelli, Luis Rego, Paulette Dubost, Roger Carel, Franck-Olivier Bonnet, Corinne Corson', null, 'The sequel of a successful French comedy "Rookies Run Amok" (1971) again with "Les Charlots" group.', 'The sequel of a successful French comedy "Rookies Run Amok" (1971) again with "Les Charlots" group.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n4WQhAo0QOzERzhRGuh5JUeMAVw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72373'),
  ('784035440198812900', 'Room', 2015, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Reid A. Dunlop, Nathan Nugent, Lenny Abrahamson', 'Emma Donoghue', 'Brie Larson, Jacob Tremblay, Joan Allen, Sean Bridgers, Tom McCamus, William H. Macy, Cas Anvar, Amanda Brugel', 'R', 'Held captive for 7 years in an enclosed space, a woman and her young son finally gain their freedom, allowing the boy to experience the outside world for the first time.', 'Held captive for 7 years in an enclosed space, a woman and her young son finally gain their freedom, allowing the boy to experience the outside world for the first time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2hHDMeYyZjbGWn0BeNH1cTMxuM7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:264644'),
  ('256981792459687403', 'Room 13', 1964, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Harald Reinl, Ernst W. Kalinke', 'Will Tremper, Heinz Oskar Wuttig', 'Joachim Fuchsberger, Karin Dor, Richard Häussler, Walter Rilla, Siegfried Schürenberg, Eddi Arent, Hans Clarin, Kai Fischer', null, 'A serial-killer is murdering the ladies of a night club. Detective Gray is seeking for the killer but can only find a lot of gangsters. And the killer is about to act again...', 'A serial-killer is murdering the ladies of a night club. Detective Gray is seeking for the killer but can only find a lot of gangsters. And the killer is about to act again...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/esEmCHalNZxgF5E4TkrC2PPDTAr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70475'),
  ('1097195706493560442', 'Room 203', 2022, 'Horror', 'Christine W Chen, Ben Jagger', 'Ben Jagger, Nick Richey, John Poliquin', 'Francesca Xuereb, Viktoria Vinyarska, Scott Gremillion, Rick LaCour, Quinn Nehr, Sam A Coleman, Eric Wiegand, Timothy McKinney', 'NR', 'Two female roommates were tormented by the vengeful spirits dwelling in their gothic-style, rented apartment, which contains an ornate centerpiece.', 'Two female roommates were tormented by the vengeful spirits dwelling in their gothic-style, rented apartment, which contains an ornate centerpiece.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t4M0n5kfToiU9TIf22bccSbNugG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:885121'),
  ('1035168997112874190', 'Room 205', 2007, 'Horror', 'Martin Barnewitz, Mikael Valentin, Sune Lykke Albinus', 'Jannik Tai Mosholt', 'Neel Rønholt, Julie R. Ølgaard, Mira Wanting, Mikkel Arndt, Jon Lange, Rikke Lylloff, Steen Stig Lommer, Tania Maria Odgaard', null, 'Wanting to start a fresh, Katrine moves from the province into a dormitory in Copenhagen and enrolls at the University. But when she crosses conniving Sanne by getting together with Sanne''s ex, all hell breaks loose. Sanne and her friends frighten Katrine with an old myth surrounding the ghost of a former resident. Yet the myth very soon becomes reality.', 'Wanting to start a fresh, Katrine moves from the province into a dormitory in Copenhagen and enrolls at the University. But when she crosses conniving Sanne by getting together with Sanne''s ex, all hell breaks loose. Sanne and her friends frighten Katrine with an old myth surrounding the ghost of a former resident. Yet the myth very soon becomes reality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xchLlRZoSkbQcVpM7nByTLu6J7c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16008'),
  ('955529479674346656', 'Room 205 of Fear', 2011, 'Drama, Horror', 'Rainer Matsutani', 'Eckhard Vollmar', 'Jennifer Ulrich, André Hennicke, Tino Mewes, Marleen Lohse, Florian Jahr, Inez Bjørg David, Daniel Roesner, Julia Dietze', null, 'Katrine is excited to be moving into her own dorm room at university, leaving her over-protected father and the memory of her breakdown behind her. Enjoying her new found freedom things soon turn ugly though as she falls foul of the local ‘in’ crowd, who start to bully her. Katrine discovers that this group were responsible for the death of the previous occupant of the room, who is now out for revenge and becomes trapped in the middle of this nightmare. Inspired by (but in no way a copy of) Candyman and Ringu, Room 205 is an effective chiller that oozes tension as it builds to its shocking climax.', 'Katrine is excited to be moving into her own dorm room at university, leaving her over-protected father and the memory of her breakdown behind her. Enjoying her new found freedom things soon turn ugly though as she falls foul of the local ‘in’ crowd, who start to bully her. Katrine discovers that this group were responsible for the death of the previous occupant of the room, who is now out for revenge and becomes trapped in the middle of this nightmare. Inspired by (but in no way a copy of) Candyman and Ringu, Room 205 is an effective chiller that oozes tension as it builds to its shocking climax.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2ezqSry9kusoBy1VPxrqMzBzx6f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:142410'),
  ('1139289266813343154', 'Room 237', 2012, 'Documentary', 'Rodney Ascher', 'Rodney Ascher', 'Bill Blakemore, Geoffrey Cocks, Juli Kearns, John Fell Ryan, Jay Weidner', 'NR', 'A subjective documentary that explores various theories about hidden meanings in Stanley Kubrick''s classic film The Shining. Five very different points of view are illuminated through voice over, film clips, animation and dramatic reenactments.', 'A subjective documentary that explores various theories about hidden meanings in Stanley Kubrick''s classic film The Shining. Five very different points of view are illuminated through voice over, film clips, animation and dramatic reenactments.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wPXxJSz36VjAkxa4MZ0C28uOdwA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84330'),
  ('1147842014447209563', 'Room 6', 2006, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Raymond Stella, Michael Hurst', 'Michael Hurst', 'Christine Taylor, Shane Brolly, Chloë Grace Moretz, Jerry O''Connell, Jimmy Shubert, Lisa Ann Walter, Marshall Bell, Ellie Cornell', null, 'A schoolteacher with a phobia of hospitals finds herself searching for her boyfriend inside one while teaming up with a man suffering the same ordeal that she''s in.', 'A schoolteacher with a phobia of hospitals finds herself searching for her boyfriend inside one while teaming up with a man suffering the same ordeal that she''s in.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wkDi6nAQzSy5lex7kBaPPTlWx34.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10055'),
  ('38801194292923747', 'Room 666', 1982, 'Documentary', 'Wim Wenders, Agnès Godard', 'Wim Wenders', 'Jean-Luc Godard, Paul Morrissey, Mike de Leon, Monte Hellman, Romain Goupil, Susan Seidelman, Noël Simsolo, Rainer Werner Fassbinder', null, 'During the 1982 Cannes Film Festival, Wim Wenders asked a number of global film directors to, one at a time, go into a hotel room, turn on the camera, and answer a simple question: "What is the future of cinema?"', 'During the 1982 Cannes Film Festival, Wim Wenders asked a number of global film directors to, one at a time, go into a hotel room, turn on the camera, and answer a simple question: "What is the future of cinema?"', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aDXe4qmfNQ96X7k5olvEwsBHRqc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118257'),
  ('614250444889201590', 'Room 69', 2026, 'Thriller', 'Trudy Sargent', 'Dan Garcia, Deri Tyton', 'Shireen Heidari, Lyndsey E. Butler, Maurice Turner Jr.', null, 'When a wealthy divorcée reunites with her ex in Room 409, their secret tryst is interrupted by another woman, igniting a dangerous triangle of lust, deception, and revenge that could destroy them all.', 'When a wealthy divorcée reunites with her ex in Room 409, their secret tryst is interrupted by another woman, igniting a dangerous triangle of lust, deception, and revenge that could destroy them all.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2Fd87pTRvQ8BWz8RXzM8h1Ru6m59D.jpg', 'plex:movie:room-69-2026'),
  ('205803596603733100', 'Room 8', 2013, 'Drama, Fantasy, Science Fiction, Thriller, Horror', 'James W. Griffiths, G. Magni Ágústsson, Wiktor Mentlewicz', 'James W. Griffiths', 'Tom Cullen, Micheal Goudd, Yuri Klimov, Franc Zalewski', 'NR', 'Thrown to rot in a narrow and gloomy cell of a hideous Soviet prison, a weary new inmate struggles to come to terms with the new reality. Within the grey cage, an unwelcoming fellow convict cautions the newcomer not to touch the intriguingly mysterious red wooden box which rests on the lower bunk, moreover, not even think of opening it. Why is there so much secrecy about the contents of the box? Could there be hiding the means to his escape?', 'Thrown to rot in a narrow and gloomy cell of a hideous Soviet prison, a weary new inmate struggles to come to terms with the new reality. Within the grey cage, an unwelcoming fellow convict cautions the newcomer not to touch the intriguingly mysterious red wooden box which rests on the lower bunk, moreover, not even think of opening it. Why is there so much secrecy about the contents of the box? Could there be hiding the means to his escape?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qVJXdi5WtWDNGG1SAw9b9lPa032.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:191850'),
  ('550802890894729886', 'Room and Bird', 1951, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Friz Freleng', null, 'Mel Blanc, Bea Benaderet', 'NR', 'Tweety and Sylvester are Granny''s pets in the Spinsters Arms Hotel, where pets aren''t allowed.', 'Tweety and Sylvester are Granny''s pets in the Spinsters Arms Hotel, where pets aren''t allowed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/juLBKUdhi1l2yJIySferizFr1Ae.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119799'),
  ('139023093646095105', 'Room at the Top', 1958, 'Drama, Romance', 'Jack Clayton, Freddie Francis, Ronald Spencer', 'Mordecai Richler', 'Laurence Harvey, Simone Signoret, Heather Sears, Donald Wolfit, Donald Houston, Hermione Baddeley, Beatrice Varley, Allan Cuthbertson', 'NR', 'An ambitious young accountant schemes to wed a wealthy factory owner''s daughter, despite falling in love with a married older woman.', 'An ambitious young accountant schemes to wed a wealthy factory owner''s daughter, despite falling in love with a married older woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uuyruoqh7oBtjwN1mJyOF04CPjO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43103'),
  ('129650042704429170', 'Room for Murder', 2018, 'Thriller', 'Sidarth Kantamneni, Rob Schmidt', 'Jed Seidel', 'James Maslow, Lauren Swickard, Adam Huber, Jenna Kanell, Julia Denton, Jannette Sepwa, Lorraine Rodriguez-Reyes, Tanya Clarke', null, 'When Kristen decides to take a break from college and return home, she finds Jake, a handsome stranger, living in her old room. Her mother, Moira, explains that she invited Jake to live as a tenant to help with the house expenses. Soon, Kristen discovers not only are Jake and Moira sleeping together, but Jake has a secret, dangerous past.', 'When Kristen decides to take a break from college and return home, she finds Jake, a handsome stranger, living in her old room. Her mother, Moira, explains that she invited Jake to live as a tenant to help with the house expenses. Soon, Kristen discovers not only are Jake and Moira sleeping together, but Jake has a secret, dangerous past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/coFwTa57GMySgtdH0uuW0tGLFlY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:543016'),
  ('385314643352343314', 'Room for One More', 1952, 'Comedy, Family', 'Norman Taurog, Robert Burks', 'Jack Rose, Melville Shavelson', 'Cary Grant, Betsy Drake, Lurene Tuttle, Randy Stuart, John Ridgely, Irving Bacon, Mary Treen, Iris Mann', 'NR', 'Anne and "Poppy" Rose have three quirky kids. Anne has a generous heart and the belief in the innocence of children. To the unhappy surprise of her husband she takes in the orphan Jane, a problem child who already tried to kill herself once.', 'Anne and "Poppy" Rose have three quirky kids. Anne has a generous heart and the belief in the innocence of children. To the unhappy surprise of her husband she takes in the orphan Jane, a problem child who already tried to kill herself once.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2VJg810IoARDJDtZFGePRciXcsV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48627'),
  ('326288957618173621', 'Room for Rent', 2019, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Ben Braham Ziryab, Tommy Stovall', 'Stuart Flack', 'Lin Shaye, Oliver Rayon, Valeska Miller, Ryan Ochoa, Linda Cushma, Casey Nicholas Price, Tonya June Moore, Michael Harrelson', null, 'Lonely widow Joyce rents out a room in her house and becomes dangerously obsessed with one of her guests.', 'Lonely widow Joyce rents out a room in her house and becomes dangerously obsessed with one of her guests.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eEy7C8k1f4sMulW1Ca9s8EtFAhb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:600751'),
  ('1151892154589408888', 'Room in Rome', 2010, 'Drama, Romance', 'Julio Medem, Álex Catalán', 'Julio Medem', 'Elena Anaya, Natasha Yarovenko, Enrico Lo Verso, Najwa Nimri, Ander Malles, Laura Meizoso', null, 'A hotel room in the center of Rome serves as the setting for Alba and Natasha, two sexy and recently acquainted women, to have a physical adventure that touches their very souls.', 'A hotel room in the center of Rome serves as the setting for Alba and Natasha, two sexy and recently acquainted women, to have a physical adventure that touches their very souls.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w90ItYf9qagQKVEBr1uFxPomAtf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48650'),
  ('587256909536133470', 'Room No.7', 2017, 'Comedy, Thriller', 'Lee Yong-seung, Sung Seung-taek', 'Lee Yong-seung', 'Shin Ha-kyun, Doh Kyung-soo, Kim Dong-young, Kim Jong-soo, Kim Jong-goo, Park Soo-young, Jun Suk-ho, Hwang Jeong-min', null, 'In a DVD-themed sex hotel, a young employee has hidden drugs in room #7 for criminals in exchange for wiping off his debt. But then his boss hides a dead body in the same room and locks the door. And a dangerous battle of wits ensues between a man who must lock away the secret behind the door, and another, who must go inside.', 'In a DVD-themed sex hotel, a young employee has hidden drugs in room #7 for criminals in exchange for wiping off his debt. But then his boss hides a dead body in the same room and locks the door. And a dangerous battle of wits ensues between a man who must lock away the secret behind the door, and another, who must go inside.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nm1TVeSnup6kSNTFkhMIwI5Sz5B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:462385'),
  ('1039715595084358295', 'Room of Death', 2007, 'Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'Jérôme Alméras, Alfred Lot', 'Alfred Lot', 'Mélanie Laurent, Éric Caravaca, Gilles Lellouche, Jonathan Zaccaï, Céline Sallette, Laurence Côte, Jean-François Stévenin, Nathalie Richard', null, 'While on a joyride with the headlights turned off, two men hit and kill another man carrying a satchel full of money. The two men decide to take the money and throw the body into a pond and bury the money in a coal hill. The next morning the police discover the body of a kidnapped 12-year blind girl, Melody, in a warehouse near the site of the hit-and-run. They determine that the kidnapper saw the girl''s father bringing the ransom to him and also witnessed the hit-and-run and the men stealing the ransom.', 'While on a joyride with the headlights turned off, two men hit and kill another man carrying a satchel full of money. The two men decide to take the money and throw the body into a pond and bury the money in a coal hill. The next morning the police discover the body of a kidnapped 12-year blind girl, Melody, in a warehouse near the site of the hit-and-run. They determine that the kidnapper saw the girl''s father bringing the ransom to him and also witnessed the hit-and-run and the men stealing the ransom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1xXEUsUOOx4yV5ME5e1aFuCL1XQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12449'),
  ('586474367281982444', 'Room on the Broom', 2012, 'Family, Animation, TV Movie', 'Jan Lachauer, Max Lang', 'Julia Donaldson, Max Lang', 'Gillian Anderson, Timothy Spall, Sally Hawkins, Rob Brydon, Martin Clunes, Simon Pegg, David Walliams', 'NR', 'Animated film based on the wonderful children''s picture book written by Julia Donaldson and illustrated by Axel Scheffler. The story of a kind witch who invites a surprising collection of animals to join her on her broom, much to the frustration of her cat. The gang ultimately saves the witch from a fearsome dragon, and in gratitude she rewards them with a magnificent new broom which has room for everyone. A magical tale about friendship and family from Magic Light Pictures, the producers of the hugely successful The Gruffalo and The Gruffalo''s Child.', 'Animated film based on the wonderful children''s picture book written by Julia Donaldson and illustrated by Axel Scheffler. The story of a kind witch who invites a surprising collection of animals to join her on her broom, much to the frustration of her cat. The gang ultimately saves the witch from a fearsome dragon, and in gratitude she rewards them with a magnificent new broom which has room for everyone. A magical tale about friendship and family from Magic Light Pictures, the producers of the hugely successful The Gruffalo and The Gruffalo''s Child.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9qAL19JR0oJ7ZlVpUE1Os2P6XXp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:152581'),
  ('955026123874635958', 'Room Salon College Girls', 2018, 'Romance', 'Jo Tae-ho', null, 'Kim Hee-jeong, Yoon Da-hyeon, Choi Chul-min', null, 'Sexy female college students get part-time jobs at a room salon and provide very special services.', 'Sexy female college students get part-time jobs at a room salon and provide very special services.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xIGPD1QQzxIwRJc55ThQjZpD3tT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:528549'),
  ('1136238854627908124', 'Room Service', 1938, 'Comedy', 'William A. Seiter, J. Roy Hunt, James H. Anderson', 'Morrie Ryskind', 'Groucho Marx, Chico Marx, Harpo Marx, Lucille Ball, Ann Miller, Frank Albertson, Cliff Dunstan, Donald MacBride', 'NR', 'Broke Gordon Miller tries to land a backer for his new play while he has to deal with with the hotel manager trying to evict him and his cast.', 'Broke Gordon Miller tries to land a backer for his new play while he has to deal with with the hotel manager trying to evict him and his cast.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yQIpSvrEuZiDNtq2SABny5VCSIr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15938'),
  ('1029318355258761976', 'Room Service', 2024, 'Drama', 'Bobby Bonifacio', null, 'Shiena Yu, Angelo Ilagan, Rhealyn Ayson, Xera Bailey, Bo Ivann Lo, Anthony Dabao, Nathan Cajucom, Louie Kim Sedukis', null, 'A sex-crazed hotel room attendant who develops a sexual desire for a mysterious but magnetizing male guest who always brings along different women to his room.', 'A sex-crazed hotel room attendant who develops a sexual desire for a mysterious but magnetizing male guest who always brings along different women to his room.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w7lRAP3yqFmY0lYkFftEWR8jJQZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1218637'),
  ('788812460653480299', 'Room(h)ates', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Dominique Farrugia, Veronica Szawarska, Rémy Chevrin', 'Dominique Farrugia, Laurent Turner', 'Gilles Lellouche, Louise Bourgoin, Manu Payet, Marilou Berry, Julien Boisselier, Nicole Calfan, Kolia Abiteboul, Adèle Castillon', null, 'Delphine and Yvan divorce. While his financial situation does not allow him to find a home, Yvan remembers that he owns 20% of his ex-wife''s house. He then returned to live with Delphine, in his 20%. The two ex will discover the joys of forced housemates.', 'Delphine and Yvan divorce. While his financial situation does not allow him to find a home, Yvan remembers that he owns 20% of his ex-wife''s house. He then returned to live with Delphine, in his 20%. The two ex will discover the joys of forced housemates.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o8ZtzvBXiXJpAlHIPYmjzE3TKiO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:426962'),
  ('229679568403206801', 'RoomMate', 2013, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Takeshi Furusawa, Takeshi Hamada', 'Takeshi Furusawa', 'Kyoko Fukada, Keiko Kitagawa, Kengo Kora, Hiroyuki Onoue, Chihiro Ohtsuka, Mariko Tsutsui, Yukijiro Hotaru, Tomorowo Taguchi', null, 'Harumi Hagiwara lands in the hospital after being involved in an accident. She hits it off with her nurse, Reiko Nishimura, and the two decide to move in together after she''s discharged. However, Harumi begins to witness a series of mysterious events soon after noticing Reiko''s strange behavior. Additionally, she fears for her own safety when Reiko starts referring to herself as ''Mari'' as if she''s become an entirely different person. Before long, the situation develops into a case of murder.', 'Harumi Hagiwara lands in the hospital after being involved in an accident. She hits it off with her nurse, Reiko Nishimura, and the two decide to move in together after she''s discharged. However, Harumi begins to witness a series of mysterious events soon after noticing Reiko''s strange behavior. Additionally, she fears for her own safety when Reiko starts referring to herself as ''Mari'' as if she''s become an entirely different person. Before long, the situation develops into a case of murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mjYX6u5jQvBn1brH9zwXwZC0Yfd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:269136'),
  ('372636544930766885', 'Roommates', 1995, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Peter Yates, Mike Southon', 'Stephen Metcalfe, Max Apple', 'Peter Falk, D. B. Sweeney, Julianne Moore, Ellen Burstyn, Jan Rubeš, Joyce Reehling, Ernie Sabella, John Cunningham', 'PG', 'An elderly, yet young-at-heart man, moves in with his grandson, and both their lives turn upside-down.', 'An elderly, yet young-at-heart man, moves in with his grandson, and both their lives turn upside-down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ww737E66JgONeNCSZVuGRy7TvXI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:161495'),
  ('135618504809275312', 'Roommates Wanted', 2016, 'Comedy', 'François Desagnat, Vincent Gallot', 'Catherine Diament, Jérôme Corcos', 'André Dussollier, Bérengère Krief, Arnaud Ducret, Julia Piaton, Nicolas Marié, Panayotis Pascot, Audrey Looten, Mathieu Madénian', null, 'When recently widowed, it is difficult to get used to a new life ... This is the case for Hubert Jacquin, who spends most of his time in his huge apartment, depressed, in front of his TV. One day, after a misunderstanding, his life will change. Manuela, a young and bubbly adventurer in search of a dwelling calls his home! At first reluctant, Hubert will quickly get used to the presence of this energy storm, who even manages to convince him to allow two other people to stay. There are many surprises in store for Hubert ...', 'When recently widowed, it is difficult to get used to a new life ... This is the case for Hubert Jacquin, who spends most of his time in his huge apartment, depressed, in front of his TV. One day, after a misunderstanding, his life will change. Manuela, a young and bubbly adventurer in search of a dwelling calls his home! At first reluctant, Hubert will quickly get used to the presence of this energy storm, who even manages to convince him to allow two other people to stay. There are many surprises in store for Hubert ...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9FpgQeSFHn0wR0ybetcJ20nQyGb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:384371'),
  ('455720783069102010', 'Rooms for Tourists', 2004, 'Horror', 'Adrián García Bogliano, Verónica Padron, Darío Sebastián Bermeo', 'Ramiro García Bogliano, Adrián García Bogliano', 'Jimena Krouco, Elena Siritto, Lucrecia Federico, Oscar Ponce, Rolf García Puga, José Santiago, Trajano Leydet, Claudia González', null, 'Five city girls must spend the night in an isolated town within the province of Buenos Aires, where they will find out more than what the flesh and bone can stand: the most violent side of local hospitality.', 'Five city girls must spend the night in an isolated town within the province of Buenos Aires, where they will find out more than what the flesh and bone can stand: the most violent side of local hospitality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2kYg1VwoWDDUFHQjvJ1afSKJWW4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121022'),
  ('106678124283191832', 'Rooney', 2022, 'Documentary', 'Matt Smith', null, 'Wayne Rooney, Coleen Rooney, Gary Neville, Thierry Henry, David Beckham, Rio Ferdinand, Sven-Göran Eriksson, José Mourinho', null, 'A documentary covering the life and career of Manchester United and England legend Wayne Rooney.', 'A documentary covering the life and career of Manchester United and England legend Wayne Rooney.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ju9TN1o2dwvNTJfqIjT5Axx7fln.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:884361'),
  ('87765538415053688', 'Roop Ki Rani Choron Ka Raja', 1993, 'Action, Drama', 'Satish Kaushik, Vasant R. Patel', 'Javed Akhtar', 'Anil Kapoor, Sridevi, Anupam Kher, Paresh Rawal, Jackie Shroff, Bindu Desai, Dalip Tahil, Johny Lever', null, 'Jagmohan Jugral kills his twin brother, Manmohan, in order to escape from Customs Officer Verma. In the chase that follows, Jagmohan also kills Verma, and a doctor, Ashok Soni. With their deaths their children, Ramesh and Seema, are orphaned and end up at an orphanage. Both get separated when Seema is adopted by a respected couple. Ramesh runs away from the orphange and is adopted by Girdharilal, a career thief. Ramesh learns all the skills of thievery from Girdharilal. Ramesh is now grown up a better career thief than Gidharilal, and Seema too has grown up. Both are on the look-out for Jugral, who is now known as a very respectable citizen.', 'Jagmohan Jugral kills his twin brother, Manmohan, in order to escape from Customs Officer Verma. In the chase that follows, Jagmohan also kills Verma, and a doctor, Ashok Soni. With their deaths their children, Ramesh and Seema, are orphaned and end up at an orphanage. Both get separated when Seema is adopted by a respected couple. Ramesh runs away from the orphange and is adopted by Girdharilal, a career thief. Ramesh learns all the skills of thievery from Girdharilal. Ramesh is now grown up a better career thief than Gidharilal, and Seema too has grown up. Both are on the look-out for Jugral, who is now known as a very respectable citizen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kjfNMMO7eJjWe1J1PJ9c5dkznr2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:345980'),
  ('558846688989690508', 'Rooster Cogburn', 1975, 'Adventure, Drama, Western', 'Stuart Millar, Richard Hashimoto, Joseph Lenzi', 'Martha Hyer', 'John Wayne, Katharine Hepburn, Anthony Zerbe, Richard Jordan, John McIntire, Paul Koslo, Jack Colvin, Jon Lormer', 'PG', 'After a band of drunken thugs overruns a small Indian Nation town, killing Reverend Goodnight and raping the women folk, Eula Goodnight enlists the aid of US Marshal Cogburn to hunt them down and bring her father''s killers to justice.', 'After a band of drunken thugs overruns a small Indian Nation town, killing Reverend Goodnight and raping the women folk, Eula Goodnight enlists the aid of US Marshal Cogburn to hunt them down and bring her father''s killers to justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6R3X6KpHd70dI3LS22ZG5Rn422V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17538'),
  ('81563777968366387', 'Root of All Evil?', 2006, 'Documentary', 'Russell Barnes', 'Richard Dawkins', 'Richard Dawkins, Ted Haggard, Yousef al-Khattab, Richard Harries', null, 'In this two-part Channel 4 series, Professor Richard Dawkins challenges what he describes as ''a process of non-thinking called faith''. He describes his astonishment that, at the start of the 21st century, religious faith is gaining ground in the face of rational, scientific truth. Science, based on scepticism, investigation and evidence, must continuously test its own concepts and claims. Faith, by definition, defies evidence: it is untested and unshakeable, and is therefore in direct contradiction with science. In addition, though religions preach morality, peace and hope, in fact, says Dawkins, they bring intolerance, violence and destruction. The growth of extreme fundamentalism in so many religions across the world not only endangers humanity but, he argues, is in conflict with the trend over thousands of years of history for humanity to progress to become more enlightened and more tolerant.', 'In this two-part Channel 4 series, Professor Richard Dawkins challenges what he describes as ''a process of non-thinking called faith''. He describes his astonishment that, at the start of the 21st century, religious faith is gaining ground in the face of rational, scientific truth. Science, based on scepticism, investigation and evidence, must continuously test its own concepts and claims. Faith, by definition, defies evidence: it is untested and unshakeable, and is therefore in direct contradiction with science. In addition, though religions preach morality, peace and hope, in fact, says Dawkins, they bring intolerance, violence and destruction. The growth of extreme fundamentalism in so many religions across the world not only endangers humanity but, he argues, is in conflict with the trend over thousands of years of history for humanity to progress to become more enlightened and more tolerant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/teVVE5yZQGcq81xpwIfdHjEWSKS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14297'),
  ('659492006580913783', 'Rooting for Roona', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Akshay Shankar, Pavitra Chalam, Ananya Roy', null, null, 'NR', 'In rural India, a child with hydrocephalus gets a chance at life-changing surgery after her photos go viral. This documentary charts her journey.', 'In rural India, a child with hydrocephalus gets a chance at life-changing surgery after her photos go viral. This documentary charts her journey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gx6DUx7EugLPM3NuY8PSJMuHR7J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:753272'),
  ('351938153767442324', 'Roots', 1954, 'Drama', 'Benito Alazraki', 'Carlos Velo, Manuel Barbachano Ponce, Fernando Espejo', 'Beatriz Flores, Juan de la Cruz, Juan Cano, Rafael Ramírez, Conchita Montes, Eduardo Urruchua, Olimpia Alazraki, Doctor González', null, 'Four independent stories based on writer Francisco Rojas Gonzáles''s work, depicting the reality of Mexican indian people: Las Vacas (The Cow), Nuestra Señora (Our Lady), El Tuerto (One-Eyed) and La Potranca (The Filly). In El Tuerto, a one eyed boy is relentlessly bullied by his mates. His religious mother asks God to make the boy''s eyes equal. The outcome is tragic.', 'Four independent stories based on writer Francisco Rojas Gonzáles''s work, depicting the reality of Mexican indian people: Las Vacas (The Cow), Nuestra Señora (Our Lady), El Tuerto (One-Eyed) and La Potranca (The Filly). In El Tuerto, a one eyed boy is relentlessly bullied by his mates. His religious mother asks God to make the boy''s eyes equal. The outcome is tragic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e9TPig33RGa9WoTDiD4dbDB6Mp4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:122769'),
  ('835327294787753176', 'Roots', 1987, 'Drama', 'Guguli Mgeladze', 'Suliko Zhgenti', 'David Abashidze, Joseph (Soso) Jachvliani, Ya Parulava, Aleksandr Medzmariashvili, Laurence Ragon, Nugzar Kurashvili, Gogi Gegechkori, Merab Ninidze', null, 'In the hot summer of 1917, the nineteen-year-old peasant Georgy Zakareishvili left his village in search of work and, settling on a French ship, soon found himself in Paris, where he married a Frenchwoman. Modest wealth, beloved wife, sons and a faithful friend helped him to endure separation from his homeland. When the opportunity came to his homeland, George was already old and could not postpone the upcoming meeting with his native Georgia. He tried to convey his love to his grandson George: he sang folk songs, taught Georgian, talked about the people of his village. And now, in fulfillment of his grandfather’s orders, George the Younger took his ashes to his homeland...', 'In the hot summer of 1917, the nineteen-year-old peasant Georgy Zakareishvili left his village in search of work and, settling on a French ship, soon found himself in Paris, where he married a Frenchwoman. Modest wealth, beloved wife, sons and a faithful friend helped him to endure separation from his homeland. When the opportunity came to his homeland, George was already old and could not postpone the upcoming meeting with his native Georgia. He tried to convey his love to his grandson George: he sang folk songs, taught Georgian, talked about the people of his village. And now, in fulfillment of his grandfather’s orders, George the Younger took his ashes to his homeland...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eDDCEan0ZOqyUZbwXlh9d5Gp8k9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:614832'),
  ('248035057444519043', 'Roots of Evil', 1979, 'Action, Crime', 'Christian Anders, Antonio Tarruella', 'Christian Anders', 'Christian Anders, Maribel Martín, Dunja Rajter, Deep Roy, Fernando Bilbao, Ria Kemp, Wolfgang Schütte, José María Guía', null, 'A young karate master tries to defend his karate school and take revenge on those responsible for his master''s death.', 'A young karate master tries to defend his karate school and take revenge on those responsible for his master''s death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wLTsI5HUm5QB4ILmdBOR4UHeJQ6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:201478'),
  ('822610733421716757', 'Roots Search', 1986, 'Animation, Science Fiction, Horror', 'Hisashi Sugai, Hiroshi Negishi, Hiroshi Negishi', 'Michiru Shimada', 'Kenyu Horiuchi, Keiko Han, Yusaku Yara, Osamu Kobayashi, Banjo Ginga, Takao Horiuchi, Hideyuki Tanaka, Kaneto Shiozawa', null, 'When a research crew in deep space discovers the desolate ship "Green Planet" that warps into their area, they encounter Buzz, the commander and sole surivor of the ship. Being too incapacitated to make them aware of the situation of his ship, the research team will soon discover that they have found something far, far worse...', 'When a research crew in deep space discovers the desolate ship "Green Planet" that warps into their area, they encounter Buzz, the commander and sole surivor of the ship. Being too incapacitated to make them aware of the situation of his ship, the research team will soon discover that they have found something far, far worse...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mGzlfddZQg1U12YasLWiJ4uqt8l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:166706'),
  ('539554546789094256', 'Roots: The Gift', 1988, 'Drama, History, TV Movie', 'Kevin Hooks, John A. Alonzo', 'David Eyre', 'LeVar Burton, Louis Gossett Jr., Avery Brooks, Kate Mulgrew, Shaun Cassidy, John McMartin, Jerry Hardin, Annabella Price', 'PG', 'On Christmas Eve 1770, a young African warrior, who three years prior had been captured and sold into slavery in America, leads a desperate group of runaway slaves as they attempt to reach freedom in the North.', 'On Christmas Eve 1770, a young African warrior, who three years prior had been captured and sold into slavery in America, leads a desperate group of runaway slaves as they attempt to reach freedom in the North.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tEYHKIBMBpUzl33MBNkrrMOezor.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88655'),
  ('861841550353873662', 'Rooty Toot Toot', 1951, 'Animation, Music, Crime, Comedy', 'John Hubley', 'John Hubley', 'Thurl Ravenscroft, Annette Warren', null, 'Frankie walks into a bar, where she catches her boyfriend Johnny with the sensuous Nellie Bly and kills him in a fit of jealousy.', 'Frankie walks into a bar, where she catches her boyfriend Johnny with the sensuous Nellie Bly and kills him in a fit of jealousy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1LXJD042SEw18ZoGzEDMOF9nGuM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:103956'),
