  ('214233399176023250', 'Rope Hell', 1978, 'Crime, Drama', 'Kōyū Ohara, Hidenobu Nimura, Takashi Kanno', 'Kyōhei Konno, Kōyū Ohara', 'Naomi Tani, Nami Aoki, Hirokazu Inoue, Hitoshi Takagi, Kenji Fuji, Yoshie Kitsuda, Michio Hino, Shûji Kagawa', null, 'Akiko is the heir to a yakuza clan. Hitoshi, who has been kicked out of the rival Hono Clan after attempting to seduce Akiko, kidnaps her at the behest of Hanamura. Hanamura has formed a new gang and intends to use Akiko as a hostage to take over her clan''s territory. During the torture and abuse sessions which follow, Akiko comes to enjoy the treatment and forsakes her gangland empire.', 'Akiko is the heir to a yakuza clan. Hitoshi, who has been kicked out of the rival Hono Clan after attempting to seduce Akiko, kidnaps her at the behest of Hanamura. Hanamura has formed a new gang and intends to use Akiko as a hostage to take over her clan''s territory. During the torture and abuse sessions which follow, Akiko comes to enjoy the treatment and forsakes her gangland empire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jKDc4Wp11sdSoFUWpwDOINDZ8r5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:143667'),
