  ('457660875333200179', 'Roped', 2020, 'Drama, Romance', 'Reuben Steinberg, Shaun Paul Piccinino', 'John Ducey', 'Josh Swickard, Casper Van Dien, Lauren Swickard, Christina Moore, John Schneider, Michael Roark, Shane Graham, Cooper Lundeen', 'PG', 'A star cowboy in a traveling rodeo gets thrown off course when he falls in love with the daughter of a tough-minded town councilman.', 'A star cowboy in a traveling rodeo gets thrown off course when he falls in love with the daughter of a tough-minded town councilman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sRpDm8j5EbYjSCLKPVKvVqumbyt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:699519'),
  ('254591367344559756', 'Rorschach', 2022, 'Thriller, Action', 'Nissam Basheer, Nimish Ravi', 'Sameer Abdul', 'Mammootty, Grace Antony, Sharafudheen, Asif Ali, Jagadish, Bindu Panicker, Kottayam Nazeer, Sanju Sivaram', null, 'Luke Anthony comes to a village in search of his wife Sophia, who got lost in a nearby forest while traveling through the countryside. But, as the search operation progresses, doubts crop up on whether the woman has actually gone missing or even whether she is a figment of his imagination.', 'Luke Anthony comes to a village in search of his wife Sophia, who got lost in a nearby forest while traveling through the countryside. But, as the search operation progresses, doubts crop up on whether the woman has actually gone missing or even whether she is a figment of his imagination.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cBShNRU8l6fMBPkjG5KBrGqXnwe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:950284'),
  ('722447893149201605', 'Rory McIlroy: The Masters Wait', 2026, 'Documentary, Biography, Sport', 'Drea Cooper', null, 'Rory McIlroy', null, 'Rory McIlroy''s 14-year pursuit of a Masters victory at Augusta National-the sole major missing from his career Grand Slam. A hole-by-hole chronicle of the 2025 final round, from his 2011 meltdown through years of disappointment.', 'Rory McIlroy''s 14-year pursuit of a Masters victory at Augusta National-the sole major missing from his career Grand Slam. A hole-by-hole chronicle of the 2025 final round, from his 2011 meltdown through years of disappointment.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2Fe0a1f18TuiioWTiloYSmei1VHGQ.jpg', 'plex:movie:rory-mcilroy-the-masters-wait'),
  ('449684190524786679', 'Rosa', 1986, 'Action, Comedy', 'Joe Cheung Tung-Cho, Tai Kwan-Tak, Benz Kong To-Hoi', 'Wong Kar-Wai, Barry Wong Ping-Yiu', 'Yuen Biao, Lowell Lo Koon-Ting, Lu Hsiao-Fen, Kara Hui Ying-Hung, Paul Chun Pui, James Tien Chun, Charlie Cho Cha-Lee, Dick Wei', null, 'Hsia and Lei Kung are two bumbling cops assigned to protect the gorgeous Rosa, girlfriend to a missing informer named Lee. But Rosa''s wanted by more than just the law - the bad guys want her for leverage, and Lei Kung just wants her to be his girlfriend! Meanwhile, Hsia attempts to romance Lei Kung''s sister, and the bad guys prepare for a final blow-out fight sequence!', 'Hsia and Lei Kung are two bumbling cops assigned to protect the gorgeous Rosa, girlfriend to a missing informer named Lee. But Rosa''s wanted by more than just the law - the bad guys want her for leverage, and Lei Kung just wants her to be his girlfriend! Meanwhile, Hsia attempts to romance Lei Kung''s sister, and the bad guys prepare for a final blow-out fight sequence!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zZ2TnZX0r6fZykmi9NpygecYupm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64302'),
  ('35504985065933385', 'Rosa Chumbe', 2015, 'Drama', 'Jonatan Relayze, Paúl Córdova', 'Christopher Vasquez, Jonatan Relayze', 'Liliana Trujillo, Cindy Díaz, Franco Diaz, Alejandro Romero Caceres, Jorge Ramirez, Daysi Ontaneda, Andrea Fernandez, Jorgedian Dihigo', null, 'Rosa is a mature police officer with both a gambling and a drinking problem. She lives with her daughter Sheila, who has a little baby. One day, after a big fight between them, Sheila steals her mother''s savings and storms out of the house leaving her baby behind. Rosa is forced to spend some time with her grandson. Something changes inside her heart of stone. However, everything takes a wrong turn one night. Only a miracle can save her.', 'Rosa is a mature police officer with both a gambling and a drinking problem. She lives with her daughter Sheila, who has a little baby. One day, after a big fight between them, Sheila steals her mother''s savings and storms out of the house leaving her baby behind. Rosa is forced to spend some time with her grandson. Something changes inside her heart of stone. However, everything takes a wrong turn one night. Only a miracle can save her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5BrtsEIz09MFnodUZUu0KzSYhSA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:407575'),
  ('688660102568033670', 'Rosa la rose, fille publique', 1986, 'Drama', 'Paul Vecchiali, Georges Strouvé, Renato Berta', 'Paul Vecchiali', 'Marianne Basler, Jean Sorel, Pierre Cosso, Laurent Lévy, Catherine Lachens, Evelyne Buyle, Pierre Oudrey, Heinz Schwarzinger', null, 'A radiant young sex worker thrives amidst the clients of Paris’s Les Halles under the protectiveness of her pimp. Her carefully balanced existence unravels when she meets a working‑class man and falls in love, forcing her to confront the emotional and social consequences of pursuing a different path.', 'A radiant young sex worker thrives amidst the clients of Paris’s Les Halles under the protectiveness of her pimp. Her carefully balanced existence unravels when she meets a working‑class man and falls in love, forcing her to confront the emotional and social consequences of pursuing a different path.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cnqWSLBAqWQTZGBTSm0nPeWXDQE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63153'),
  ('960922091525623713', 'Rosa Luxemburg', 1986, 'Drama, History', 'Margarethe von Trotta, Franz Rath, Margit Czenki', 'Margarethe von Trotta', 'Barbara Sukowa, Daniel Olbrychski, Otto Sander, Hannes Jaenicke, Karin Baal, Winfried Glatzeder, Charles Regnier, Hans-Michael Rehberg', null, 'Polish socialist and Marxist Rosa Luxemburg works tirelessly in the service of revolution in early 20th century Poland and Germany. While Luxemburg campaigns for her beliefs, she is repeatedly imprisoned as she forms the Spartacist League offering a new vision for Germany.', 'Polish socialist and Marxist Rosa Luxemburg works tirelessly in the service of revolution in early 20th century Poland and Germany. While Luxemburg campaigns for her beliefs, she is repeatedly imprisoned as she forms the Spartacist League offering a new vision for Germany.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xsbuAzu2ZsZsV0hROoiarPTOsPv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55562'),
  ('538723737997163036', 'Rosa Peral''s Tapes', 2023, 'Documentary', 'Carles Vidal Novellas, Manuel Perez', null, 'Rosa Peral, Mayka Navarro, Olga Arderiu, Toni Muñoz', 'R', 'This true-crime documentary film features Rosa Peral''s first interview from prison since she was convicted of murdering her partner aided by an ex-lover.', 'This true-crime documentary film features Rosa Peral''s first interview from prison since she was convicted of murdering her partner aided by an ex-lover.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nQG3HhzRnr26e0O0yuTeXqnVGbn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1167520'),
