  ('264763685209838289', 'Rosa Rosae. A Spanish Civil War Elegy', 2021, 'Documentary, Animation', 'Carlos Saura, Fiorela Gianuzzi', 'Carlos Saura', 'Eulalia Ramón', null, 'Saura creates and recovers more than thirty images, drawings and photographs that he prints, manipulates, plays with and subsequently films, to produce a story which, while recreating the Spanish Civil War, could also reflect the horrors of universal conflict, seen through the eyes of a child and his surroundings.', 'Saura creates and recovers more than thirty images, drawings and photographs that he prints, manipulates, plays with and subsequently films, to produce a story which, while recreating the Spanish Civil War, could also reflect the horrors of universal conflict, seen through the eyes of a child and his surroundings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rsuCyNGGQQUVDi6m9cSlr67W5Nq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:865388'),
  ('74767857154147450', 'Rosa''s Wedding', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Guillermo Escribano, Icíar Bollaín, Sergi Gallardo', 'Icíar Bollaín, Alicia Luna', 'Candela Peña, Sergi López, Nathalie Poza, Ramón Barea, Paula Usero, Xavo Giménez, Paloma Vidal, Lucía Poveda', null, 'Rosa is about to turn 45 and realises that she''s always lived her life to serve everyone else. So she decides to leave it all behind, take charge of her life and fulfil her dream of starting her own business.', 'Rosa is about to turn 45 and realises that she''s always lived her life to serve everyone else. So she decides to leave it all behind, take charge of her life and fulfil her dream of starting her own business.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bdy9e0cdq83szB07rHbiG4kokEg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:679888'),
  ('335959024664034830', 'Rosalie', 1966, 'Crime, Drama', 'Walerian Borowczyk, Yann Le Masson', 'Walerian Borowczyk', 'Ligia Branice', null, 'Based on a short story by Guy de Maupassant, Borowczyk relates the plight of a servant girl who killed and buried her child in the garden.', 'Based on a short story by Guy de Maupassant, Borowczyk relates the plight of a servant girl who killed and buried her child in the garden.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7fh7JcUqKl0o6iJMXtTaPPeWBXg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:145914'),
  ('543968793945346682', 'Rosalie', 2024, 'Drama, Romance', 'Stéphanie Di Giusto, Pascale Béraud, Christos Voudouris', 'Stéphanie Di Giusto, Sandrine Le Coustumer, Alexandra Echkenazi', 'Nadia Tereszkiewicz, Benoît Magimel, Benjamin Biolay, Guillaume Gouix, Gustave Kervern, Anna Biolay, Eugène Marcuse, Juliette Armanet', null, 'France, 1870s. Rosalie is a young woman unlike any other. She hides a secret: she was born with a face and body covered in hair. She’s concealed her peculiarity all her life to stay safe, shaving to fit in. Until Abel, an indebted bar owner unaware of her secret, marries Rosalie for her dowry. Will Abel be able to love Rosalie and see her as the woman she is, once he finds out the truth?', 'France, 1870s. Rosalie is a young woman unlike any other. She hides a secret: she was born with a face and body covered in hair. She’s concealed her peculiarity all her life to stay safe, shaving to fit in. Until Abel, an indebted bar owner unaware of her secret, marries Rosalie for her dowry. Will Abel be able to love Rosalie and see her as the woman she is, once he finds out the truth?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Ah8Fdk0K8yQzcYPe3uKulih8wFd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:995746'),
  ('386150865717726708', 'Rosalie Blum', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Julien Rappeneau, Pierre Cottereau', 'Julien Rappeneau', 'Noémie Lvovsky, Kyan Khojandi, Alice Isaaz, Anémone, Philippe Rebbot, Sara Giraudeau, Camille Rutherford, Nicolas Bridet', null, 'Vincent Machot knows his life by heart. He shares it between his hair dressing salon, his cousin, his cat, and his too-invasive mother. But life sometimes holds surprises, even for the most prudent of people... He crosses paths with Rosalie Blum by accident. She is a mysterious and solitary woman whom he is sure he has already met. But where? Intrigued, he decides to follow her everywhere, in the hope of knowing more about her.', 'Vincent Machot knows his life by heart. He shares it between his hair dressing salon, his cousin, his cat, and his too-invasive mother. But life sometimes holds surprises, even for the most prudent of people... He crosses paths with Rosalie Blum by accident. She is a mysterious and solitary woman whom he is sure he has already met. But where? Intrigued, he decides to follow her everywhere, in the hope of knowing more about her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pqOu8C8puyyrpUSv943Rxk3Htx1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:381353'),
  ('254009866842905239', 'Rosalie Goes Shopping', 1989, 'Comedy', 'Percy Adlon, Bernd Heinl', 'Percy Adlon, Eleonore Adlon', 'Marianne Sägebrecht, Brad Davis, Judge Reinhold, Erika Blumberger, Willy Harlander, John Hawkes, Patricia Zehentmayr, Courtney Kraus', null, 'Rosalie loves to shop too much to let a little thing like no money stop her. When the local shopkeepers no longer take her bad checks or bad credit cards, she''s finds herself out of ways to please her consumerist tendencies… until she discovers The Internet! Master shopper becomes master hacker, and Rosalie is back on top.', 'Rosalie loves to shop too much to let a little thing like no money stop her. When the local shopkeepers no longer take her bad checks or bad credit cards, she''s finds herself out of ways to please her consumerist tendencies… until she discovers The Internet! Master shopper becomes master hacker, and Rosalie is back on top.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5d51JLVrRI1AswvIpQXnMScYRRb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56162'),
  ('635456905112359846', 'Rosaline', 2022, 'Romance, Drama, Comedy', 'Karen Maine, Laurie Rose, Frederic Evard', 'Scott Neustadter, Michael H. Weber', 'Kaitlyn Dever, Isabela Merced, Kyle Allen, Sean Teale, Christopher McDonald, Minnie Driver, Bradley Whitford, Spencer Rayshon Stevenson', 'PG-13', 'Left heartbroken after Romeo begins to pursue her cousin Juliet, Rosaline schemes to foil the famous romance and win back her guy in this comedic twist of Shakespeare''s Romeo and Juliet.', 'Left heartbroken after Romeo begins to pursue her cousin Juliet, Rosaline schemes to foil the famous romance and win back her guy in this comedic twist of Shakespeare''s Romeo and Juliet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jQHrbzVy6ptopxqUohV6PcmmVcY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:826769'),
