  ('897603798563632429', 'Rosanero', 2022, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Andrea Porporati, Cristina Corna, Marcello Montarsi', 'Andrea Porporati', 'Salvatore Esposito, Fabiana Martucci, Antonio Milo, Ciro Esposito, Salvatore Striano, Aniello Arena, Sebastiano Somma, Giovanni Napolitano', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eL3kWwwM6RoDwrGdnbidhP0EgxW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:990438'),
  ('796181335146250867', 'Rosario', 2025, 'Horror', 'Felipe Vargas, Carmen Cabana', 'Alan Trezza', 'Emeraude Toubia, José Zúñiga, David Dastmalchian, Paul Ben-Victor, Diana Lein, Emilia Faucher, Constanza Guitérrez, Nick Ballard', 'R', 'Wall Street stockbroker Rosario Fuentes returns to her grandmother''s apartment after her sudden death. While sorting through her belongings, Rosario discovers a hidden chamber that''s filled with occult artifacts tied to dark generational rituals. As supernatural occurrences begin to plague her, she must confront her family''s buried secrets and face the truth about the sacrifices and choices they made.', 'Wall Street stockbroker Rosario Fuentes returns to her grandmother''s apartment after her sudden death. While sorting through her belongings, Rosario discovers a hidden chamber that''s filled with occult artifacts tied to dark generational rituals. As supernatural occurrences begin to plague her, she must confront her family''s buried secrets and face the truth about the sacrifices and choices they made.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/beLZhuHT97849WkWgty2X1hkWUa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1297028'),
  ('476684585934599056', 'Rosario Tijeras', 2005, 'Crime, Romance, Drama', 'Emilio Maillé, Pascal Marti', 'Marcelo Figueras', 'Flora Martínez, Alejandra Borrero, Kristina Lilley, Unax Ugalde, Manolo Cardona, Rodrigo Oviedo, Alonso Arias, Alex Cox', null, 'Rosario Tijeras has been abused by men all her life, initially by her stepfather. Years later, she works as a paid assassin, seducing men and killing them when they least expect it. She meets Emilio, a wealthy womanizer, and his best friend, Antonio, at a nightclub, and starts an affair with Emilio despite Antonio''s growing feelings for her. But circumstances bring her closer to Antonio, until her past catches up with her in a devastating way.', 'Rosario Tijeras has been abused by men all her life, initially by her stepfather. Years later, she works as a paid assassin, seducing men and killing them when they least expect it. She meets Emilio, a wealthy womanizer, and his best friend, Antonio, at a nightclub, and starts an affair with Emilio despite Antonio''s growing feelings for her. But circumstances bring her closer to Antonio, until her past catches up with her in a devastating way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d8CnXqN257vDOwZyIaA0IM6DcoU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10810'),
  ('432212628469483628', 'Rosas blancas para mi hermana negra', 1970, 'Drama', 'Abel Salazar', 'Gregorio Walerstein, Alfredo Malerba', 'Libertad Lamarque, Robertha, Eusebia Cosme, Irma Lozano, Roberto Cañedo, Steve Flanagan, Laila Novak', null, 'The story revolves around Laura, a white singer, and Angustias, her longtime black friend, with both mothers dedicated to the education of their daughters: Alicia and Roberta. Trouble ensues when Laura’s daughter, Alicia, falls in love with Ricardo, a young black medical student.', 'The story revolves around Laura, a white singer, and Angustias, her longtime black friend, with both mothers dedicated to the education of their daughters: Alicia and Roberta. Trouble ensues when Laura’s daughter, Alicia, falls in love with Ricardo, a young black medical student.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8a1PKzoRwgnMySYx9LYLKlM7Y4b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:410156'),
  ('1142526801285723401', 'Rosaura at 10 O''Clock', 1958, 'Thriller, Drama, Mystery', 'Aníbal González Paz, Mario Soffici, Orlando Zumpano', 'Mario Soffici, Marco Denevi', 'Juan Verdaguer, Susana Campos, María Luisa Robledo, Alberto Dalbés, María Concepción César, Héctor Calcaño, Amalia Bernabé, Miguel Ligero', null, 'Out of the blue, a meek, old painter begins receiving love letters from Rosaura. This intrigues his fellow boarding house tenants, so they involve themselves into his relationship until one day the mysterious Rosaura appears.', 'Out of the blue, a meek, old painter begins receiving love letters from Rosaura. This intrigues his fellow boarding house tenants, so they involve themselves into his relationship until one day the mysterious Rosaura appears.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3lIPt9LW9gTcSiHQtukc71vl8Jg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128489'),
  ('68701135896855367', 'Rosauro Castro', 1950, 'Drama, Crime', 'Roberto Gavaldón, Raúl Martínez Solares', 'Robert Quigley', 'Pedro Armendáriz, Carlos López Moctezuma, María Douglas, Carlos Navarro, Arturo Martínez, Mimí Derba, Enriqueta Reza, Rogelio Fernández', null, 'Cardoza''s death, a candidate for mayor of a village chief enemy and Rosauro Castro, leads to Mr. Garcia Mata to undertake an investigation. Upon arriving realizes that even the whole town, including the mayor, lives in fear by the chief and only achieved revenge end the injustices committed by Rosauro Castro.', 'Cardoza''s death, a candidate for mayor of a village chief enemy and Rosauro Castro, leads to Mr. Garcia Mata to undertake an investigation. Upon arriving realizes that even the whole town, including the mayor, lives in fear by the chief and only achieved revenge end the injustices committed by Rosauro Castro.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ayk7EzEnCCyB7kmK4mM1yrqGUVC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:240339'),
  ('335040812092404943', 'Rose', 2012, 'Drama, History, War', 'Wojtek Smarzowski, Piotr Sobociński Jr.', 'Michał Szczerbic', 'Marcin Dorociński, Agata Kulesza, Malwina Buss, Jacek Braciak, Kinga Preis, Edward Linde-Lubaszenko, Marian Dziędziel, Eryk Lubos', null, 'This harrowing tale of survival centers on Rose, a Masurian woman, whose German soldier husband was killed in the war, leaving her alone on their farm. A single woman had no defense against Russian soldiers who raped as a form of revenge, nor against plundering Poles who found themselves in desperate straits. Help arrives for Rose in the form of Tadeusz, a former officer in the Polish Home Army who deserted after he saw his wife raped and murdered by Russian troops and is attempting to hide his identity.', 'This harrowing tale of survival centers on Rose, a Masurian woman, whose German soldier husband was killed in the war, leaving her alone on their farm. A single woman had no defense against Russian soldiers who raped as a form of revenge, nor against plundering Poles who found themselves in desperate straits. Help arrives for Rose in the form of Tadeusz, a former officer in the Polish Home Army who deserted after he saw his wife raped and murdered by Russian troops and is attempting to hide his identity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/keQEIvYOpjlTdz593vLvJjkbnYy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89156'),
  ('430078547011682734', 'Rose', 2021, 'Drama', 'Aurélie Saada, Martin De Chabaneix', 'Aurélie Saada, Yaël Langmann', 'Françoise Fabian, Aure Atika, Grégory Montel, Damien Chapelle, Mehdi Nebbou, Pascal Elbé, Anne Suarez, Bernard Murat', null, 'Rose, 78-year-old, has just lost her beloved husband. When her grief gives way to a powerful impulse to live her life, making her realize that she can still redefine herself as a woman, the whole balance of the family is upset.', 'Rose, 78-year-old, has just lost her beloved husband. When her grief gives way to a powerful impulse to live her life, making her realize that she can still redefine herself as a woman, the whole balance of the family is upset.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9994ieDF2Lp7znBQvesFiBKyTua.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:846864'),
  ('562968455972380262', 'Rose', 2022, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Tanja Grunwald, Rasmus Videbæk, Niels Arden Oplev', 'Niels Arden Oplev', 'Sofie Gråbøl, Lene Maria Christensen, Anders W. Berthelsen, Søren Malling, Luca Reichardt Ben Coker, Peter Gantzler, Christiane Gjellerup Koch, Karen-Lise Mynster', null, 'Over the course of a week, sisters Inger and Ellen find their relationship challenged on a highly anticipated coach trip to Paris. Inger reveals her struggles with schizophrenia to the group, receiving both pity and discrimination. On arrival, it soon becomes clear that Inger has a hidden agenda concerning a figure from her past, ultimately involving the entire group in her hunt for answers.', 'Over the course of a week, sisters Inger and Ellen find their relationship challenged on a highly anticipated coach trip to Paris. Inger reveals her struggles with schizophrenia to the group, receiving both pity and discrimination. On arrival, it soon becomes clear that Inger has a hidden agenda concerning a figure from her past, ultimately involving the entire group in her hunt for answers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ewzE98Ajsk92rZQIxAOUHFLIJku.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:901251'),
  ('621116784077780374', 'Rose Hill', 1997, 'TV Movie, Western, Drama', 'Christopher Cain, Willy Kurant', null, 'Jennifer Garner, Jeffrey D. Sams, Zak Orth, Justin Chambers, Tristan Tait, David Newsom, Casey Siemaszko, Stuart Wilson', null, 'Four orphan boys running from the law in New York stumble upon a baby in a carriage. They decide to head west and take the baby which they name Mary Rose with them. Eventually they set up a ranch which they name Rose Hill. Mary Rose grows up to be a beautiful woman and gets involved with a man who kills one of her brothers. Her brothers then explain to her that they found her in New York and she returns to find her real family. During this time Rose Hill is falling apart since her oldest brother has fallen ill and her other two brothers have gone their separate ways.', 'Four orphan boys running from the law in New York stumble upon a baby in a carriage. They decide to head west and take the baby which they name Mary Rose with them. Eventually they set up a ranch which they name Rose Hill. Mary Rose grows up to be a beautiful woman and gets involved with a man who kills one of her brothers. Her brothers then explain to her that they found her in New York and she returns to find her real family. During this time Rose Hill is falling apart since her oldest brother has fallen ill and her other two brothers have gone their separate ways.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zM8RFyE8WUXlL9lA875OnfkAaX2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86543'),
  ('806397629723188386', 'Rose Hobart', 1936, 'Mystery', 'Joseph Cornell', null, 'Rose Hobart, Charles Bickford, Noble Johnson, Georges Renavent, Lupita Tovar', null, 'Cornell employs clips from 1931''s jungle melodrama East of Borneo – more specifically, clips of its lead actress, Rose Hobart – to disquieting effect. Through Cornell''s collage editing, Hobart becomes a singular object of desire and dread, trapped in an exotic paradise.', 'Cornell employs clips from 1931''s jungle melodrama East of Borneo – more specifically, clips of its lead actress, Rose Hobart – to disquieting effect. Through Cornell''s collage editing, Hobart becomes a singular object of desire and dread, trapped in an exotic paradise.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3PykCY8op3AYwTvzw3Zx9Utq6OU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105552'),
  ('1055590912007546042', 'Rose Island', 2020, 'Comedy, Adventure', 'Giulio Cupperi, Jacopo Giovannini, Sydney Sibilia', 'Sydney Sibilia, Francesca Manieri', 'Elio Germano, Matilda De Angelis, Fabrizio Bentivoglio, François Cluzet, Tom Wlaschiha, Luca Zingaretti, Leonardo Lidi, Fabrizio Rongione', null, 'In 1968, engineer Giorgio Rosa established the independent state called "The Isle of Roses" off the coast of Rimini, built on a platform outside the territorial waters, with Esperanto as the official language. The Italian authorities did not take it well because the micronation was seen as an expedient to not pay taxes on the revenues obtained thanks to the arrival of numerous tourists and curious people.', 'In 1968, engineer Giorgio Rosa established the independent state called "The Isle of Roses" off the coast of Rimini, built on a platform outside the territorial waters, with Esperanto as the official language. The Italian authorities did not take it well because the micronation was seen as an expedient to not pay taxes on the revenues obtained thanks to the arrival of numerous tourists and curious people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fbmYUDOo6tNq3A1VWhhxE6pjNEB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:636565'),
  ('1104728125682010006', 'Rose Marie', 1936, 'Romance, Adventure, Music', 'W.S. Van Dyke, William H. Daniels, Joseph M. Newman', 'Frances Goodrich, Albert Hackett, Alice D.G. Miller', 'Jeanette MacDonald, Nelson Eddy, Reginald Owen, Allan Jones, James Stewart, Alan Mowbray, Gilda Gray, George Regas', 'NR', 'An incognito opera singer falls for a policeman who has been assigned to track down her fugitive brother.', 'An incognito opera singer falls for a policeman who has been assigned to track down her fugitive brother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/54J30pAeefdKGIrImWPSiiUU3Su.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43880'),
  ('830069278260743331', 'Rose Plays Julie', 2021, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Tom Comerford, Joe Lawlor, Christine Molloy', 'Christine Molloy, Joe Lawlor', 'Ann Skelly, Orla Brady, Aidan Gillen, Annabell Rickerby, Catherine Walker, Joanne Crawford, Alan Howley, Sadie Soverall', null, 'A story of a young woman searching for her biological mother. Set against a backdrop of misogyny, revenge, and longing, Rose undertakes a journey that leads her to revelations that are both devastating and dangerous.', 'A story of a young woman searching for her biological mother. Set against a backdrop of misogyny, revenge, and longing, Rose undertakes a journey that leads her to revelations that are both devastating and dangerous.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sUCZFHWi4l8weOLUKt2yHnylhAM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:589820'),
  ('169163695211195282', 'Rose, c''est Paris', 2010, 'Drama', 'Serge Bramly', 'Serge Bramly', 'Sabine Bail, Monica Bellucci, Sigrid Bouaziz, Louise Bourgoin, Virgile Bramly, Naomi Campbell, Eva Vik, Inge van Bruystegem', null, 'Bettina Rheims and Serge Bramly''s Rose, c''est Paris is both a photographic monograph and a feature-length film. This extraordinary work of art, in two different but interlocking and complementary formats, defies easy categorization. For in this multi-layered opus of poetic symbolism, photographer Bettina Rheims and writer Serge Bramly evoke the City of Light in a completely novel way: this is a Paris of surrealist visions, confused identities, artistic phantoms, unseen manipulation, obsession, fetish, and seething desire.', 'Bettina Rheims and Serge Bramly''s Rose, c''est Paris is both a photographic monograph and a feature-length film. This extraordinary work of art, in two different but interlocking and complementary formats, defies easy categorization. For in this multi-layered opus of poetic symbolism, photographer Bettina Rheims and writer Serge Bramly evoke the City of Light in a completely novel way: this is a Paris of surrealist visions, confused identities, artistic phantoms, unseen manipulation, obsession, fetish, and seething desire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1xYeJ3gSHvRok61nzqaJzDi3FmS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:208467'),
  ('572011845342975658', 'Rose: A Love Story', 2020, 'Horror', 'Graham Drover, Jonny Magowan, Lauren Taverner', 'Matt Stokoe', 'Sophie Rundle, Matt Stokoe, Olive Gray, Nathan McMullen, Boadicea Ricketts', null, 'The story of a young couple living alone in the woods, who must contend with a life-altering illness that manifests itself in a violent and terrifying way. Rose’s disease is a vampiric, parasitic thirst for blood. As her hunger grows, all humanity seems to give way to a feral violence that harms both her and those around her. Their loving relationship strains under the burden of Rose’s illness, and it is only a matter of time until the secluded life that they have built is upended entirely.', 'The story of a young couple living alone in the woods, who must contend with a life-altering illness that manifests itself in a violent and terrifying way. Rose’s disease is a vampiric, parasitic thirst for blood. As her hunger grows, all humanity seems to give way to a feral violence that harms both her and those around her. Their loving relationship strains under the burden of Rose’s illness, and it is only a matter of time until the secluded life that they have built is upended entirely.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3OoqaAsZjC8FkyrQd8IQC51qTHR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:731587'),
  ('1089778067859000194', 'Roseanna', 1993, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Daniel Alfredson, Dan Myhrman, Jimmy Karlsson', 'Jonas Cornell', 'Gösta Ekman, Kjell Bergqvist, Rolf Lassgård, Niklas Hjulström, Lena Nilsson, Ingvar Andersson, Bernt Ström, Torgny Anderberg', null, 'A young American girl is found dead in Gota Kanal, Swedens largest channel. Since there are hardly any clues or evidence at all it seems as if the murder cant be solved. Martin Beck and his men are assigned to the case. Soon they find a likely suspect and together with a police woman they begin a cat and mouse game to catch him. Plot by Mattias Pettersson.', 'A young American girl is found dead in Gota Kanal, Swedens largest channel. Since there are hardly any clues or evidence at all it seems as if the murder cant be solved. Martin Beck and his men are assigned to the case. Soon they find a likely suspect and together with a police woman they begin a cat and mouse game to catch him. Plot by Mattias Pettersson.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/90rjPeTt6rGCr08lM93GPDfdLHD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34645'),
  ('976438045289016072', 'Roseanna''s Grave', 1997, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Paul Weiland, Henry Braham', 'Saul Turteltaub', 'Jean Reno, Mercedes Ruehl, Polly Walker, Mark Frankel, Trevor Peacock, Fay Ripley, Giuseppe Cederna, Roberto Della Casa', null, 'Roseanna is dying of a heart condition, and all she wants is to be buried next to her daughter, in a cemetery that is getting full fast. The cemetery can''t expand because Capestro, the man who owns the land next to the cemetery, won''t sell. While Marcello is doing good deeds to make sure no one dies, Roseanna thinks of Marcello''s future.', 'Roseanna is dying of a heart condition, and all she wants is to be buried next to her daughter, in a cemetery that is getting full fast. The cemetery can''t expand because Capestro, the man who owns the land next to the cemetery, won''t sell. While Marcello is doing good deeds to make sure no one dies, Roseanna thinks of Marcello''s future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qaimjcQYua8UjnEJAx6UPjRRc3a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65889'),
  ('1092992908047900194', 'Rosebud', 1975, 'Action, Thriller', 'Otto Preminger, Denys N. Coop', 'Erik Lee Preminger', 'Peter O''Toole, Richard Attenborough, Cliff Gorman, Claude Dauphin, John V. Lindsay, Peter Lawford, Raf Vallone, Adrienne Corri', null, 'In a bold coup a Palestinian terrorist group captures the yacht Rosebud and kidnaps the millionaires five daughters on it. At first they demand film clips to be shown on major European TV stations. Undercover agent Martin is hired to hunt the terrorists down.', 'In a bold coup a Palestinian terrorist group captures the yacht Rosebud and kidnaps the millionaires five daughters on it. At first they demand film clips to be shown on major European TV stations. Undercover agent Martin is hired to hunt the terrorists down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5NoT4BpyOIE5I1FRcIwjS6bHsvd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1943'),
  ('295604764318067093', 'Rosebush Pruning', 2026, 'Drama, Thriller, Comedy', 'Karim Aïnouz, Hélène Louvart, Marta Almarcha, Sara Brasal, Gloria Picó', 'Efthimis Filippou, Marco Bellocchio', 'Callum Turner, Riley Keough, Jamie Bell, Lukas Gage, Elena Anaya', null, 'In a Spanish villa, American siblings Jack, Ed, Anna and Robert wallow in isolation and their inherited fortune. When Jack wants to move in with his girlfriend and Ed uncovers the truth about their mother’s death, the fabric of the family begins to unravel.', 'In a Spanish villa, American siblings Jack, Ed, Anna and Robert wallow in isolation and their inherited fortune. When Jack wants to move in with his girlfriend and Ed uncovers the truth about their mother’s death, the fabric of the family begins to unravel.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FrEn0kHtZAjb44R2Jv0FUBLdFPsY.jpg', 'plex:movie:rosebush-pruning'),
  ('927442329244642740', 'Roselyne and the Lions', 1988, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama, Fantasy, Adventure, Action', 'Jean-Jacques Beineix, Jean-François Robin', 'Jacques Forgeas, Jean-Jacques Beineix', 'Isabelle Pasco, Gérard Sandoz, Gabriel Monnet, Philippe Clévenot, Günter Meisner, Wolf Harnisch, Jacques Le Carpentier, Carlos Pavlidis', null, 'Thierry drops out of school to apprentice as a lion tamer at the zoo where he meets Roselyne, who shares his passion. They fall in love and when he loses his job, the young lovers journey across France finding odd jobs at several circuses. In Germany, they fall under the tutelage of ageing big cat trainer, Klint, and while they are closer to realising their dreams, they find that their success drivers them part.', 'Thierry drops out of school to apprentice as a lion tamer at the zoo where he meets Roselyne, who shares his passion. They fall in love and when he loses his job, the young lovers journey across France finding odd jobs at several circuses. In Germany, they fall under the tutelage of ageing big cat trainer, Klint, and while they are closer to realising their dreams, they find that their success drivers them part.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8QSPynZVLAnBzmh1NKI6e6QskNj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:131128'),
  ('758354149662103593', 'Rosemary', 1958, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Rolf von Rautenfeld, Rolf Thiele', 'Rolf Thiele, Rolf Ulrich, Jo Herbst', 'Nadja Tiller, Peter van Eyck, Carl Raddatz, Gert Fröbe, Hanne Wieder, Mario Adorf, Jo Herbst, Werner Peters', 'NR', 'West Germany in ''50s is becoming an economic superpower. In such climate, Rosemarie is just one of many enterpreneurs who wants her piece of new fortune. She uses her charms to bring members of West German industrial elite to her bed. There she finds business secrets and later sells them to French competition. However, when scandal errupts, Rosemarie would find that she can''t beat the system.', 'West Germany in ''50s is becoming an economic superpower. In such climate, Rosemarie is just one of many enterpreneurs who wants her piece of new fortune. She uses her charms to bring members of West German industrial elite to her bed. There she finds business secrets and later sells them to French competition. However, when scandal errupts, Rosemarie would find that she can''t beat the system.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kVuJUvG5WWp2pa402ht65KnY8zf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4382'),
  ('662396689259745182', 'Rosemary''s Baby', 1968, 'Drama, Horror, Thriller', 'Roman Polanski, William A. Fraker, Daniel McCauley', 'Roman Polanski', 'Mia Farrow, John Cassavetes, Ruth Gordon, Sidney Blackmer, Maurice Evans, Ralph Bellamy, Victoria Vetri, Patsy Kelly', 'R', 'A young couple, Rosemary and Guy, moves into an infamous New York apartment building, known by frightening legends and mysterious events, with the purpose of starting a family.', 'A young couple, Rosemary and Guy, moves into an infamous New York apartment building, known by frightening legends and mysterious events, with the purpose of starting a family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uYgvlHceRFjAFbsNeMInYcLZLUb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:805'),
  ('431346182254069252', 'Rosencrantz & Guildenstern Are Dead', 1991, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Tom Stoppard, Peter Biziou, Peter Cotton', 'Tom Stoppard', 'Gary Oldman, Tim Roth, Richard Dreyfuss, Iain Glen, Ian Richardson, Donald Sumpter, Joanna Miles, Joanna Roth', 'PG', 'Rosencrantz and Guildensterm, minor characters from the play ''Hamlet'', find themselves on the road to Elsinore Castle at the behest of the King of Denmark. The duo encounter a band of players before arriving to find that they are needed to try to discern what troubles the prince Hamlet. Meanwhile, they ponder the meaning of their existence.', 'Rosencrantz and Guildensterm, minor characters from the play ''Hamlet'', find themselves on the road to Elsinore Castle at the behest of the King of Denmark. The duo encounter a band of players before arriving to find that they are needed to try to discern what troubles the prince Hamlet. Meanwhile, they ponder the meaning of their existence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6RI9sYpRxIdqlmsF6kBOiF7Bxug.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18971'),
  ('1063177928660490918', 'Rosenstrasse', 2003, 'Drama, War', 'Franz Rath, Margarethe von Trotta', 'Margarethe von Trotta, Pamela Katz', 'Katja Riemann, Maria Schrader, Doris Schade, Jutta Lampe, Svea Lohde, Jürgen Vogel, Martin Feifel, Fedja van Huêt', null, 'When Ruth''s husband dies in New York, in 2000, she imposes strict Jewish mourning, which puzzles her children. A stranger comes to the house - Ruth''s cousin - with a picture of Ruth, age 8, in Berlin, with a woman the cousin says helped Ruth escape. Hannah, Ruth''s daughter engaged to a gentile, goes to Berlin to find the woman, Lena Fisher, now 90. Posing as a journalist investigating intermarriage, Hannah interviews Lena who tells the story of a week in 1943 when the Jewish husbands of Aryan women were detained in a building on Rosenstrasse. The women gather daily for word of their husbands. The film goes back and forth to tell Ruth and Lena''s story. How will it affect Hannah?', 'When Ruth''s husband dies in New York, in 2000, she imposes strict Jewish mourning, which puzzles her children. A stranger comes to the house - Ruth''s cousin - with a picture of Ruth, age 8, in Berlin, with a woman the cousin says helped Ruth escape. Hannah, Ruth''s daughter engaged to a gentile, goes to Berlin to find the woman, Lena Fisher, now 90. Posing as a journalist investigating intermarriage, Hannah interviews Lena who tells the story of a week in 1943 when the Jewish husbands of Aryan women were detained in a building on Rosenstrasse. The women gather daily for word of their husbands. The film goes back and forth to tell Ruth and Lena''s story. How will it affect Hannah?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/whHyCV08F1C2r7uzTeyHsJ4nIWg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6317'),
  ('1132674289350799588', 'Roses for the Prosecutor', 1959, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Wolfgang Staudte, Erich Claunigk, Jerzy Macc', 'George Hurdalek', 'Martin Held, Walter Giller, Ingrid van Bergen, Camilla Spira, Werner Peters, Ralf Wolter, Wolfgang Preiss, Paul Hartmann', null, 'April 1945. Because he stole two bars of chocolate, the soldier Rudi is sentenced to death by the court-martial judge Dr. Schramm. Rudi manages to escape from the firing squad at the last minute, and since the end of the war has been making a meager living as a street peddler. Years later, Dr. Schramm is now a respected public prosecutor. By chance, he runs into Rudi one day on the street. Afraid that Rudi will blow the whistle on him, Dr. Schramm wants to scare him out of town. He has Rudi arrested and bullied by the police.', 'April 1945. Because he stole two bars of chocolate, the soldier Rudi is sentenced to death by the court-martial judge Dr. Schramm. Rudi manages to escape from the firing squad at the last minute, and since the end of the war has been making a meager living as a street peddler. Years later, Dr. Schramm is now a respected public prosecutor. By chance, he runs into Rudi one day on the street. Afraid that Rudi will blow the whistle on him, Dr. Schramm wants to scare him out of town. He has Rudi arrested and bullied by the police.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pF9v0UhVF6LxfkLLnSAdLdqKg62.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:131216'),
  ('103089480407033903', 'Roses on Credit', 2010, 'Romance, Drama, War, TV Movie', 'Amos Gitai, Éric Gautier', null, 'Léa Seydoux, Grégoire Leprince-Ringuet, Catherine Jacob, Pierre Arditi, Maud Wyler, Valeria Bruni Tedeschi, Elsa Zylberstein, Ariane Ascaride', null, 'A young couple marry in France in the 1940s and the film follows the arc of their marriage over the next decade. As France recovers from the trauma of the war, the wife finds herself increasingly caught up in acquiring material possessions while the husband prefers a more traditional lifestyle.', 'A young couple marry in France in the 1940s and the film follows the arc of their marriage over the next decade. As France recovers from the trauma of the war, the wife finds herself increasingly caught up in acquiring material possessions while the husband prefers a more traditional lifestyle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fLtprxQx1zTcfjNB59dsPDFXESk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:292019'),
  ('1065070548513865506', 'Rosetta', 1999, 'Drama', 'Jean-Pierre Dardenne, Luc Dardenne, Alain Marcoen', 'Jean-Pierre Dardenne, Luc Dardenne', 'Émilie Dequenne, Olivier Gourmet, Fabrizio Rongione, Anne Yernaux, Bernard Marbaix, Frédéric Bodson, Florian Delain, Christiane Dorval', 'R', 'Young, impulsive Rosetta lives a hard and stressful life as she struggles to support herself and her alcoholic mother. Refusing all charity, she is desperate to maintain a dignified job.', 'Young, impulsive Rosetta lives a hard and stressful life as she struggles to support herself and her alcoholic mother. Refusing all charity, she is desperate to maintain a dignified job.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/buwLjQPPA9FaATvKzeAppLXiGMB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11489'),
  ('855279741509371276', 'Rosewater', 2014, 'Drama', 'Jon Stewart, Bobby Bukowski', 'Jon Stewart', 'Gael García Bernal, Shohreh Aghdashloo, Kim Bodnia, Claire Foy, Haluk Bilginer, Golshifteh Farahani, Nasser Faris, Dimitri Leonidas', 'R', 'In 2009, Iranian Canadian journalist Maziar Bahari was covering Iran''s volatile elections for Newsweek. One of the few reporters living in the country with access to US media, he made an appearance on The Daily Show with Jon Stewart, in a taped interview with comedian Jason Jones. The interview was intended as satire, but if the Tehran authorities got the joke they didn''t like it - and it would quickly came back to haunt Bahari when he was rousted from his family home and thrown into prison.', 'In 2009, Iranian Canadian journalist Maziar Bahari was covering Iran''s volatile elections for Newsweek. One of the few reporters living in the country with access to US media, he made an appearance on The Daily Show with Jon Stewart, in a taped interview with comedian Jason Jones. The interview was intended as satire, but if the Tehran authorities got the joke they didn''t like it - and it would quickly came back to haunt Bahari when he was rousted from his family home and thrown into prison.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iTzGgTjaB16vVDfBOp6jBvVbwzr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:222649'),
  ('56595782164631983', 'Rosewood', 1997, 'Drama, History, Action, Thriller', 'John Singleton, Johnny E. Jensen, Jerry Ballew', 'Gregory Poirier', 'Ving Rhames, Jon Voight, Don Cheadle, Bruce McGill, Loren Dean, Elise Neal, Michael Rooker, Robert Patrick', 'R', 'Spurred by a white woman''s lie, vigilantes destroy a black Florida town and slay inhabitants in 1923.', 'Spurred by a white woman''s lie, vigilantes destroy a black Florida town and slay inhabitants in 1923.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5EeTYDXdrpD9mZSSwsrFbqgok9U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25624'),
  ('279759792731902989', 'Rosewood Lane', 2011, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Victor Salva, Don E. FauntLeRoy', 'Victor Salva', 'Rose McGowan, Luna Lauren Vélez, Ray Wise, Lin Shaye, Bill Fagerbakke, Lesley-Anne Down, Rance Howard, Ashton Moio', 'R', 'Radio talk show therapist Sonny Blake moves back to her childhood home on seemingly idyllic Rosewood Lane after her alcoholic father dies. But upon arrival in the old neighborhood, Sonny discovers her neighbors are terrified of the local paperboy. She thinks this is ridiculous, until she encounters the boy himself. It turns out that he is a cunning and dangerous sociopath, one who may have gruesomely killed her father - and others.', 'Radio talk show therapist Sonny Blake moves back to her childhood home on seemingly idyllic Rosewood Lane after her alcoholic father dies. But upon arrival in the old neighborhood, Sonny discovers her neighbors are terrified of the local paperboy. She thinks this is ridiculous, until she encounters the boy himself. It turns out that he is a cunning and dangerous sociopath, one who may have gruesomely killed her father - and others.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7iv2Akvi4kO0taSUL0ujewgLJ0l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86759'),
  ('1091321639224745116', 'Rosie', 2013, 'Drama', 'Sophie Maintigneux, Marcel Gisler', 'Marcel Gisler, Rudolf Nadler', 'Fabian Krüger, Sibylle Brunner, Sebastian Ledesma, Judith Hofmann, Eric Hättenschwiler, Alexis Haupt, Anna-Katharina Müller, Margot Gödrös', null, 'Lorenz Meran, a successful gay author suffering acute writers'' block, has to leave Berlin and return to eastern Switzerland to provide care for his aged mother, Rosie. But it is not only his mother''s battle against being dictated to and losing her dignity that he is struggling with. It''s also his own midlife crisis.', 'Lorenz Meran, a successful gay author suffering acute writers'' block, has to leave Berlin and return to eastern Switzerland to provide care for his aged mother, Rosie. But it is not only his mother''s battle against being dictated to and losing her dignity that he is struggling with. It''s also his own midlife crisis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zEkleEM9RWwksujurgNpNUJVlRh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:188231'),
  ('79348887268452037', 'Rosita', 1923, 'Romance, Comedy, History', 'Ernst Lubitsch, Charles Rosher, Raoul Walsh', 'Hanns Kräly', 'Mary Pickford, Holbrook Blinn, Irene Rich, George Walsh, Charles Belcher, Charles Belcher, Mathilde Comont, George Periolat', 'NR', 'The King tosses Rosita in jail and when Don Diego, who Rosita loves, tries to defend her, he too is thrown in jail. While Don Diego is sentenced to be executed, the King lusts after Rosita and decides to put her up in a luxurious villa. To give her a title, he marries her to a masked nobleman, who turns out to be Don Diego.', 'The King tosses Rosita in jail and when Don Diego, who Rosita loves, tries to defend her, he too is thrown in jail. While Don Diego is sentenced to be executed, the King lusts after Rosita and decides to put her up in a luxurious villa. To give her a title, he marries her to a masked nobleman, who turns out to be Don Diego.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iRfihiRxa84mtfK6yKlabi9dvJU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:175689'),
  ('1059394947077715412', 'Rossini', 1997, 'Comedy', 'Gernot Roll, Helmut Dietl, Marc Rothemund', 'Patrick Süskind, Helmut Dietl', 'Götz George, Mario Adorf, Heiner Lauterbach, Veronica Ferres, Joachim Król, Armin Rohde, Meret Becker, Gudrun Landgrebe', null, 'Zigeuner is on the hunt for the woman of his dreams, a woman who should also play the main role in the film. Meanwhile, ruthless producer Oskar Reiter wants to buy the film rights at all costs - and he is struggling for the love of the beautiful Valerie.', 'Zigeuner is on the hunt for the woman of his dreams, a woman who should also play the main role in the film. Meanwhile, ruthless producer Oskar Reiter wants to buy the film rights at all costs - and he is struggling for the love of the beautiful Valerie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xTWkqGS5i9bPTwHCgHsNiiurn25.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9643'),
  ('275127507979887792', 'Roswell', 1994, 'Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Jeremy Kagan, Steven Poster', 'Arthur Kopit', 'Kyle MacLachlan, Martin Sheen, Dwight Yoakam, Xander Berkeley, Bob Gunton, Kim Greist, Peter MacNicol, John M. Jackson', 'PG-13', 'Based on the book "UFO Crash at Roswell" by Kevin Randle and Donald Schmitt, Roswell follows the attempts of Major Jesse Marcel to discover the truth about strange debris found on a local rancher''s field in July of 1947. Told by his superiors that what he has found is nothing more than a downed weather balloon, Marcel maintains his military duty until the weight of the truth, however out of this world it may be, forces him to piece together what really occurred.', 'Based on the book "UFO Crash at Roswell" by Kevin Randle and Donald Schmitt, Roswell follows the attempts of Major Jesse Marcel to discover the truth about strange debris found on a local rancher''s field in July of 1947. Told by his superiors that what he has found is nothing more than a downed weather balloon, Marcel maintains his military duty until the weight of the truth, however out of this world it may be, forces him to piece together what really occurred.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kU1WrVsRYG8d6qyMhEsRk5dvT5z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43275'),
  ('372466332789906606', 'Rota Comando', 2009, 'Action, History, Documentary', 'Elias Junior', null, 'Elias Junior', null, 'A história é baseada em fatos reais e inspirada no livro “Matar ou Morrer“, do ex-oficial Conte Lopes. Apesar de ser uma produção independente o filme pretende criar polêmica e já é sucesso nos camelôs como o primo rico “Tropa de Elite”.', 'A história é baseada em fatos reais e inspirada no livro “Matar ou Morrer“, do ex-oficial Conte Lopes. Apesar de ser uma produção independente o filme pretende criar polêmica e já é sucesso nos camelôs como o primo rico “Tropa de Elite”.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ujh6cy093HsPiKMiKrKtR7I1q0a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50335'),
  ('912623988918434392', 'Rotten to the Core', 1965, 'Crime, Comedy', 'John Boulting, Freddie Young', 'Jeffrey Dell', 'Charlotte Rampling, Anton Rodgers, Eric Sykes, Ian Bannen, Thorley Walters, Peter Vaughan, Dudley Sutton, Kenneth Griffith', null, 'Rogues Jelly Knight, Scapa Flood, and Lennie the Dip leave prison expecting boss The Duke to have their stash ready to share out. Instead, Duke''s girl Sara gives them the news Duke is dead and the money gone on nursing care. They soon discover that Duke is actually running Hope Springs Nature Clinic with the help of most of the local villains. Very strange - and the nearby army camp and Sara''s encouragement of Lieutenant Vine would seem to be no coincidence either. Written by Jeremy Perkins', 'Rogues Jelly Knight, Scapa Flood, and Lennie the Dip leave prison expecting boss The Duke to have their stash ready to share out. Instead, Duke''s girl Sara gives them the news Duke is dead and the money gone on nursing care. They soon discover that Duke is actually running Hope Springs Nature Clinic with the help of most of the local villains. Very strange - and the nearby army camp and Sara''s encouragement of Lieutenant Vine would seem to be no coincidence either. Written by Jeremy Perkins', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dchuHeOqLZdz2RpsACtrvGEo3Qr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:139118'),
  ('269652410450234974', 'Rotting in the Sun', 2023, 'Comedy, Mystery, Thriller', 'Osvaldo Montaño, Alfredo Sánchez López, Sebastián Silva', 'Sebastián Silva, Pedro Peirano', 'Sebastián Silva, Jordan Firstman, Catalina Saavedra, Mateo Riestra, Martine Gutierrez, Alberto Rafael Cortés, Anajo Aldrete, Gustavo Melgarejo', 'NR', 'A filmmaker facing an existential crisis goes on a vacation to a Mexican gay nudist beach, where he meets a social media celebrity who convinces him to collaborate with him on his new TV show. But one disappears and another embarks on a wild journey through Mexico City to find him.', 'A filmmaker facing an existential crisis goes on a vacation to a Mexican gay nudist beach, where he meets a social media celebrity who convinces him to collaborate with him on his new TV show. But one disappears and another embarks on a wild journey through Mexico City to find him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n2UhXsV5W2IlVdCRSxtK7hNa83s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1058696'),
  ('888581980518180362', 'Rottweiler', 2004, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Action', 'Brian Yuzna, Javier Salmones, Ignacio Gutiérrez-Solana', 'Miguel Tejada-Flores', 'William Miller, Irene Montalà, Ivana Baquero, Paulina Gálvez, Cornell John, Lluís Homar, Paul Naschy, Lolo Herrero', 'R', 'Dante travels across a desolate, futuristic Spain in search of his girlfriend, Ula. He is pursued by a bloodthirsty, cybernetic Rottweiler.', 'Dante travels across a desolate, futuristic Spain in search of his girlfriend, Ula. He is pursued by a bloodthirsty, cybernetic Rottweiler.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uONkXsdAU11mTC8Z6SeJQyuLptC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12532'),
  ('716406417610795315', 'Rouge', 1987, 'Drama, Fantasy, Romance, Mystery', 'Stanley Kwan Kam-Pang, Cub Chin Kong-Hon, Bill Wong Chung-Piu', 'Chiu Kang-Chien', 'Anita Mui Yim-Fong, Leslie Cheung, Alex Man Chi-Leung, Emily Chu Bo-Yee, Irene Wan, Tam Sin-Hung, Chu Shui-Tong, Wong Yu', null, 'Amid the opulent teahouses of 1930s Hong Kong, a humble courtesan and the wayward scion of a wealthy family fall in love and embrace death by suicide pact. Fifty years later, her ghost returns to find him, drawing a young contemporary couple into her quest to rekindle a passion that may be as illusory as time itself.', 'Amid the opulent teahouses of 1930s Hong Kong, a humble courtesan and the wayward scion of a wealthy family fall in love and embrace death by suicide pact. Fifty years later, her ghost returns to find him, drawing a young contemporary couple into her quest to rekindle a passion that may be as illusory as time itself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q2wAAeGagOmqmqEkEgveLJYBj89.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68883'),
  ('99842159866123215', 'Rouge', 2026, 'Documentary', 'Hamoody Jaafar', 'Hamoody Jaafar', 'Brent Darby Jr., Legend Geeter, Ahmoni Weston, LaMonta Stone', null, 'The River Rouge Panthers of Michigan, a legendary high school basketball team, seen through perspectives of coaches, recruiters, and players past and present.', 'The River Rouge Panthers of Michigan, a legendary high school basketball team, seen through perspectives of coaches, recruiters, and players past and present.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fm.media-amazon.com%2Fimages%2FM%2FMV5BOGVmMjIyMmQtZTM0OC00YjMxLWJmYzUtOTFlYTkyNWUxNjM2XkEyXkFqcGc%40._V1_.jpg', 'plex:movie:rouge-2026-1'),
  ('890208145593031606', 'Rough Cut', 1980, 'Adventure, Comedy, Crime, Mystery, Romance', 'Don Siegel, Freddie Young, Peter R. Hunt', 'Larry Gelbart', 'Burt Reynolds, Lesley-Anne Down, David Niven, Timothy West, Patrick Magee, Al Matthews, Susan Littler, Joss Ackland', 'PG', 'Two sophisticated jewel thieves join forces to steal $30 million in uncut jewels.', 'Two sophisticated jewel thieves join forces to steal $30 million in uncut jewels.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/omQO3KUJH0g6BntveHhjpiqekNv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49375'),
  ('733057467759951003', 'Rough Cut', 2008, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Jang Hoon, Kim Gi-tae', 'Kim Ki-duk, Ok Jin gon', 'So Ji-sub, Kang Ji-hwan, Hong Soo-hyun, Ko Chang-seok, Kong Jeong-hwan, Jang Hee-jin, Han Gi-joong, Jeong Man-sik', null, 'Gang-pae is #2 gangster in his organization who longs to become an actor. Su-ta is a superstar actor who takes on the role of a gangster in an action movie called Rough Cut. When another actor leaves the set due to Su-tas violent ways, the production is on the verge of shutting down. Su-ta asks Gang-pae, whom he met by chance, to play alongside him in the movie in order to save the production.', 'Gang-pae is #2 gangster in his organization who longs to become an actor. Su-ta is a superstar actor who takes on the role of a gangster in an action movie called Rough Cut. When another actor leaves the set due to Su-tas violent ways, the production is on the verge of shutting down. Su-ta asks Gang-pae, whom he met by chance, to play alongside him in the movie in order to save the production.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iv1hGQjD390UeH2unAoR6wAchBF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17593'),
  ('512963438223972296', 'Rough Draft', 1998, 'Thriller, Drama, Horror', 'Joshua Wallace, Keith L. Smith, Nicole Burke', 'Jennifer Badham', 'Gary Busey, Arnold Vosloo, Michael Madsen, Brien Blakely, Julia Campbell, Reno Wilson, Marcy Kaplan, Patricia Skeriotis', null, 'A struggling freelance writer, while investigating the transvestite night life, stumbles across a serial killer in action. The two then strike up a bizarre partnership to document the killer''s motives and handiwork as a possessed detective struggling with his own personal demons tries to solve the crimes.', 'A struggling freelance writer, while investigating the transvestite night life, stumbles across a serial killer in action. The two then strike up a bizarre partnership to document the killer''s motives and handiwork as a possessed detective struggling with his own personal demons tries to solve the crimes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eYgvetyNQK3paZqZ1UvPjbvRuHy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125294'),
  ('78397291759702625', 'Rough Gang', 1933, 'Drama', 'Humberto Mauro, A.P. Castro', 'Humberto Mauro, Octávio Gabus Mendes', 'Durval Bellini, Déa Selva, Lu Marival, Décio Murilo, Andrea Duarte, Alfredo Nunes, Ivan Villar, Carlos Eugênio', null, 'A man kills his wife on their wedding night, after discovering she had been unfaithful. After being acquitted, he moves to the country, where he becomes part of a love triangle.', 'A man kills his wife on their wedding night, after discovering she had been unfaithful. After being acquitted, he moves to the country, where he becomes part of a love triangle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xCMztPgcuHLWqe1mdZk2gxcQBrO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:188346'),
  ('622222410269294795', 'Rough Magic', 1995, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance, Fantasy', 'Clare Peploe, John J. Campbell, Peggy Hughes', 'Robert Mundi, William Brookfield, Clare Peploe', 'Bridget Fonda, Russell Crowe, Jim Broadbent, D.W. Moffett, Kenneth Mars, Paul Rodríguez, Michael Ensign, Thomas Rosales Jr.', 'PG-13', 'In the 1950s, a pretty magician''s apprentice travels to Mexico to escape her boyfriend, a wealthy politician, and to find a Mayan shaman who will teach her the ancient principles of magic.', 'In the 1950s, a pretty magician''s apprentice travels to Mexico to escape her boyfriend, a wealthy politician, and to find a Mayan shaman who will teach her the ancient principles of magic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1ihrS8fbHnIvkcruSWBJSGiayh7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45671'),
  ('680731087757862721', 'Rough Night', 2017, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Julie A. Bloom, Vincent Giarratano, Jeannette Kim', 'Lucia Aniello, Paul W. Downs', 'Scarlett Johansson, Jillian Bell, Zoë Kravitz, Ilana Glazer, Kate McKinnon, Paul W. Downs, Ryan Cooper, Ty Burrell', 'R', 'Five best friends from college reunite 10 years later for a wild bachelorette weekend in Miami. Their hard partying takes a hilariously dark turn when they accidentally kill a male stripper. Amidst the craziness of trying to cover it up, they''re ultimately brought closer together when it matters most.', 'Five best friends from college reunite 10 years later for a wild bachelorette weekend in Miami. Their hard partying takes a hilariously dark turn when they accidentally kill a male stripper. Amidst the craziness of trying to cover it up, they''re ultimately brought closer together when it matters most.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ttC00xcQ5UIO04kU8y0h5OAIYYJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:397422'),
  ('374771902220357375', 'Rough Night in Jericho', 1967, 'Romance, Western', 'Arnold Laven, Russell Metty, James Curtis Havens', 'Sydney Boehm, Marvin H. Albert', 'Dean Martin, George Peppard, Jean Simmons, John McIntire, Slim Pickens, Don Galloway, Brad Weston, Richard O''Brien', 'NR', 'The only business in the Wild West town of Jericho that corrupt sheriff Alex Flood doesn''t control behind the scenes is the stagecoach owned by tough-willed widow Molly Lang and her right-hand man, Hickman. Former marshal Dolan, recently hired by Lang and Hickman as a driver, wants to stay out of the mess, but when he sees Flood''s henchman Yarbrough assault Lang, he steps up to fight the corruption.', 'The only business in the Wild West town of Jericho that corrupt sheriff Alex Flood doesn''t control behind the scenes is the stagecoach owned by tough-willed widow Molly Lang and her right-hand man, Hickman. Former marshal Dolan, recently hired by Lang and Hickman as a driver, wants to stay out of the mess, but when he sees Flood''s henchman Yarbrough assault Lang, he steps up to fight the corruption.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2gmK6yhpwiestvvblxufMXqDsMa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64963'),
  ('165001044101070826', 'Rough Play', 2013, 'Drama', 'Shin Yeon-shick, Choi Yong-jin, Lee Si-hyun', 'Kim Ki-duk', 'Lee Joon, Seo Young-hee, Don Lee, Yang Dong-geun, Kim Soy, Kim Hyung-jun, Kang Shin-hyo, Seo Bum-suk', null, 'Young is a nameless actor who dreams of becoming a big movie star. Then one day, he makes his breakthrough with a film and becomes a star overnight.', 'Young is a nameless actor who dreams of becoming a big movie star. Then one day, he makes his breakthrough with a film and becomes a star overnight.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nAUORfqeiBVWsLUXJ0dj9LPUmag.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:227793'),
  ('21050655605476615', 'Rough Winds', 2006, 'Drama', 'Gerardo Herrero, Alfredo Mayo, Ana María Alonso', 'Ángeles González-Sinde, Alberto Macías, Almudena Grandes', 'José Luis García Pérez, Cuca Escribano, Carme Elias, Pilar Castro, Roberto Enríquez, Andrés Gertrúdix, Elena Villaronga, Alberto Jiménez', null, 'Two strangers flee from their past and settle in an urbanization on the Cádiz coast. There, hundreds of kilometers from Madrid, they try to rebuild their lives, even though the memories are still very strong.', 'Two strangers flee from their past and settle in an urbanization on the Cádiz coast. There, hundreds of kilometers from Madrid, they try to rebuild their lives, even though the memories are still very strong.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zZZfuy9evZx3ROtiErnKVNYTuHk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:189461'),
  ('496114387393440795', 'Roughest Africa', 1923, 'Comedy', 'Ralph Ceder', null, 'Stan Laurel, James Finlayson, Katherine Grant, George Rowe, John Brown', null, 'Two bungling adventures go on a big game hunt in Africa.', 'Two bungling adventures go on a big game hunt in Africa.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A740LySwItXqfk1kdJLjFdhIQmR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:168194'),
  ('615530110826212060', 'Roughshod', 1949, 'Western', 'Mark Robson, Joseph F. Biroc, Nate Levinson', 'Daniel Mainwaring, Hugo Butler', 'Robert Sterling, Gloria Grahame, Claude Jarman Jr., John Ireland, Jeff Donnell, Myrna Dell, Martha Hyer, George Cooper', 'NR', 'Rancher Clay and his brother, Steve, head out across the Sonora mountain pass, followed by Lednov, an ex-con seeking revenge on Clay for putting him behind bars. Clay and Steve unexpectedly cross paths with a group of dance hall girls -- including Mary, Marcia and Helen -- whose stagecoach has broken down, and help them get to the nearest ranch, where Lednov unfortunately catches up to Clay.', 'Rancher Clay and his brother, Steve, head out across the Sonora mountain pass, followed by Lednov, an ex-con seeking revenge on Clay for putting him behind bars. Clay and Steve unexpectedly cross paths with a group of dance hall girls -- including Mary, Marcia and Helen -- whose stagecoach has broken down, and help them get to the nearest ranch, where Lednov unfortunately catches up to Clay.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Obymlbem4l9Ch9Uh0H1CRvYkih.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126374'),
  ('443772563512260189', 'Roujin Z', 1991, 'Animation, Drama, Science Fiction', 'Hiroyuki Kitakubo, Hideo Okazaki, Yasunori Honda', 'Katsuhiro Otomo', 'Chisa Yokoyama, Hikojiro Matsumura, Chie Sato, Hikojiro Matsumura, Koji Tsujitani, Sho Saito, Rica Matsumoto, Ryuji Saikachi', null, 'Mr. Takazawa, an elderly invalid who is cared for at his home by Haruko, a young nursing student, is chosen by the Japanese Ministry of Public Welfare to test the Z-001, a computerized hospital bed with robotic features that allegedly displays more efficiency and skills than any human nurse, but Haruko mistrusts a machine unable to consider human feelings.', 'Mr. Takazawa, an elderly invalid who is cared for at his home by Haruko, a young nursing student, is chosen by the Japanese Ministry of Public Welfare to test the Z-001, a computerized hospital bed with robotic features that allegedly displays more efficiency and skills than any human nurse, but Haruko mistrusts a machine unable to consider human feelings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kpJBEfjC9l7BFhmmGPmkNB8gl6h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35648'),
  ('872293677529477886', 'Round Da Way', 2009, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Emmanuel Klotz, Albert Pereira-Lazaro', 'Alexis Dolivet, Emmanuel Klotz', 'Vincent Cassel, Diane Kruger, Omar Sy, Fred Testot, Gilles Lellouche, Frédérique Bel, Hafid F. Benamar, Franck Sinius', null, 'It’s summer in the hood. As every year, there are those who stay, those who leave, and... those who should have left. Some, like Joe Hustleton, work «under the table» in the rich neighborhoods and fall head over heels for a pretty girl. Some, like Tony Pepperoni, play businessman and spend the summer fleeing a local gang leader and a psychopathic girlfriend. Some, like Sammy and Harvey, pretend to have left. Tropics are far for the homies... and summer promises to be very hot!', 'It’s summer in the hood. As every year, there are those who stay, those who leave, and... those who should have left. Some, like Joe Hustleton, work «under the table» in the rich neighborhoods and fall head over heels for a pretty girl. Some, like Tony Pepperoni, play businessman and spend the summer fleeing a local gang leader and a psychopathic girlfriend. Some, like Sammy and Harvey, pretend to have left. Tropics are far for the homies... and summer promises to be very hot!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/myw0jbvci1Z84dMKMtQkCLBaY5u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19106'),
  ('587310757947239505', 'Round Trip', 2009, 'Drama', 'Gerardo Tort', 'Beatriz Novaro, Marina Stavenhagen', 'Teresa Ruiz, Cassandra Ciangherotti, Mary Paz Mata, Felipe de Lara, Gina Morett, Fabiana Perzabal, Catalina López, Octavio Castro', null, 'Lucia is a Mexican girl from a poor town who sets her mind to cross the border to The United States to find her son''s father who she hasn''t heard from in years. On the road she meets Fernanda, a high middle class girl that has unresolved issues with her ex-boyfriend and is willing to travel hundreds of miles to resolve them once and for all. Lucia and Fernanda are two girls from two very different social backgrounds, yet they travel the same road hoping to reconnect with the men they love. But it seems destiny has brought them together in their individual quests to share a path, to know each other and to know themselves a little better and discover if happiness is at their destinations.', 'Lucia is a Mexican girl from a poor town who sets her mind to cross the border to The United States to find her son''s father who she hasn''t heard from in years. On the road she meets Fernanda, a high middle class girl that has unresolved issues with her ex-boyfriend and is willing to travel hundreds of miles to resolve them once and for all. Lucia and Fernanda are two girls from two very different social backgrounds, yet they travel the same road hoping to reconnect with the men they love. But it seems destiny has brought them together in their individual quests to share a path, to know each other and to know themselves a little better and discover if happiness is at their destinations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qzwH1aZjao1RiZesLIRh9EqZyOT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:253361'),
  ('324674740384041062', 'Round Trip to Ismailia', 1997, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance, Family, Music', 'Kariem Diaa Aldeen', null, 'Mohamed Fouad, Hanan Turk, Khaled El Nabawy, Mohamed Henedi, Karima Mokhtar, Ezzat Abu Ouf, Hamdy Ghaith, Ghareib Mahmoud', null, 'The story of Egyptian displaced family from Ismailia after the 1967 war. Hema (Mohamed Fouad) dreams of becoming famous singer and continues the journey of success with the help of his friend (Mohamed Henedi) and his brother(Khaled Nabawy), but his brother is jealous of him and trying to drive a wedge between him and his lover (Hanan Turk). Hema is back to sing in Ismailia after the return of her natural life after the 1973.', 'The story of Egyptian displaced family from Ismailia after the 1967 war. Hema (Mohamed Fouad) dreams of becoming famous singer and continues the journey of success with the help of his friend (Mohamed Henedi) and his brother(Khaled Nabawy), but his brother is jealous of him and trying to drive a wedge between him and his lover (Hanan Turk). Hema is back to sing in Ismailia after the return of her natural life after the 1973.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AwqazIYfx9I6SQZc6RkUTPtXLmI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:331618'),
  ('1070755160782058956', 'Round-Trip', 2003, 'Family', 'Ella Lemhagen, Hanna Nilsson, Anders Bohman', 'Ella Lemhagen', 'Amanda Davin, Jørgen Langhelle, Bjørn Floberg, Helena af Sandeberg, Torkel Petersson, Julia Ragnarsson, Sara Lindh, Leonard Goldberg', null, '11-year old Julia and Martin are tired of having to flip back and forth between their divorced parents and when they realize how much they look like, they decide to swap places. After meeting at an airport, the each embark on a journey that will change their lives forever.', '11-year old Julia and Martin are tired of having to flip back and forth between their divorced parents and when they realize how much they look like, they decide to swap places. After meeting at an airport, the each embark on a journey that will change their lives forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Sp44Vz922kTM4pJmmxTduwgXTX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74431'),
  ('972925122736425360', 'Rounders', 1998, 'Drama, Crime', 'Jean-Yves Escoffier, John Dahl, Harry Darrow', 'David Levien, Brian Koppelman', 'Matt Damon, Edward Norton, John Turturro, Gretchen Mol, John Malkovich, Famke Janssen, Martin Landau, Michael Rispoli', 'R', 'Poker addict Mike McDermott knows the game inside out, but loses his money one night in a game to Russian-American gangster Teddy KGB. Promising his partner Jo he''ll give up, he meets up with best friend Lester ''Worm'' Murphy, just out of prison and owing lots of money to the wrong kind of people. McDermott becomes his co-guarantor and now there''s only one way to raise the money, the pair have to get back into the game.', 'Poker addict Mike McDermott knows the game inside out, but loses his money one night in a game to Russian-American gangster Teddy KGB. Promising his partner Jo he''ll give up, he meets up with best friend Lester ''Worm'' Murphy, just out of prison and owing lots of money to the wrong kind of people. McDermott becomes his co-guarantor and now there''s only one way to raise the money, the pair have to get back into the game.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mqbMwYGwIChnaCO55h7v8DG8Wwy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10220'),
  ('758771279332335969', 'Roundhay Garden Scene', 1888, 'Documentary', 'Louis Aimé Augustin Le Prince', null, 'Adolphe Le Prince, Joseph Whitley, Sarah Whitley, Annie Hartley', null, 'The earliest surviving motion-picture film, and believed to be one of the very first moving images ever created, was shot by Louis Aimé Augustin Le Prince using the LPCCP Type-1 MkII single-lens camera. It was taken on paper-based photographic film in the garden of Oakwood Grange, the Whitley family house in Roundhay, Leeds, West Riding of Yorkshire (UK), on 14 October 1888. The film shows Adolphe Le Prince (Le Prince’s son), Mrs. Sarah Whitley (Le Prince’s mother-in-law), Joseph Whitley, and Miss Harriet Hartley walking around in circles, laughing to themselves, and staying within the area framed by the camera. Roundhay Garden Scene is often associated with a recording speed of around 12 frames per second and runs for about 2 to 3 seconds.', 'The earliest surviving motion-picture film, and believed to be one of the very first moving images ever created, was shot by Louis Aimé Augustin Le Prince using the LPCCP Type-1 MkII single-lens camera. It was taken on paper-based photographic film in the garden of Oakwood Grange, the Whitley family house in Roundhay, Leeds, West Riding of Yorkshire (UK), on 14 October 1888. The film shows Adolphe Le Prince (Le Prince’s son), Mrs. Sarah Whitley (Le Prince’s mother-in-law), Joseph Whitley, and Miss Harriet Hartley walking around in circles, laughing to themselves, and staying within the area framed by the camera. Roundhay Garden Scene is often associated with a recording speed of around 12 frames per second and runs for about 2 to 3 seconds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qI9eTP3NpJlxTk3oMBvfz8Awwkw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16463'),
  ('725378992241468330', 'Roustabout', 1964, 'Music, Romance', 'John Rich, Lucien Ballard, Michael D. Moore', 'Anthony Lawrence, Allan Weiss', 'Elvis Presley, Barbara Stanwyck, Joan Freeman, Leif Erickson, Sue Ane Langdon, Pat Buttram, Joan Staley, Dabbs Greer', 'PG', 'After a singer loses his job at a coffee shop, he finds employment at a struggling carnival, but his attempted romance with a teenager leads to friction with her father.', 'After a singer loses his job at a coffee shop, he finds employment at a struggling carnival, but his attempted romance with a teenager leads to friction with her father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nzB1aQauY8GTu1SCQV3EcGOqjXF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2094'),
  ('1133490516962212288', 'Route 132', 2010, 'Drama', 'Louis Bélanger, Pierre Mignot, Marc Larose', 'Louis Bélanger, Alexis Martin', 'François Papineau, Alexis Martin, Sophie Bourgeois, Andrée Lachapelle, Gilles Renaud, Janine Sutto, Gary Boudreault, Clémence DesRochers', null, 'Two old friends and small-time crooks embark on a crime spree, but take an unexpected detour that could lead them down the road to redemption.', 'Two old friends and small-time crooks embark on a crime spree, but take an unexpected detour that could lead them down the road to redemption.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7gZYZZdNudSujWYiwjZ9teHXlXa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62117'),
  ('275814181076522204', 'Route 666', 2001, 'Horror, Action, Thriller', 'William Wesley, Richard Jones, Philip Lee', 'William Wesley, Scott Fivelson, Thomas Weber', 'Lou Diamond Phillips, Lori Petty, Steven Williams, L.Q. Jones, Dale Midkiff, Mercedes Colon, Rob Roy Fitzgerald, Adam Vernier', 'R', 'Smith, a mob informer hiding out with the Witness Protection Program, decides to make a break for it and hide out in the Arizona desert. The Feds catch up with him and rescue him just before a group of hitmen can manage to silence him for good. In the course of getting Smith away from the mafia thugs, the pair of agents assigned to protect him turn onto an abandoned stretch of highway nicknamed ''Route 666'' after the mysterious death of a prison chain gang. As the three continue on their way, they soon discover just what happened to the chain gang, and how the highway earned its name.', 'Smith, a mob informer hiding out with the Witness Protection Program, decides to make a break for it and hide out in the Arizona desert. The Feds catch up with him and rescue him just before a group of hitmen can manage to silence him for good. In the course of getting Smith away from the mafia thugs, the pair of agents assigned to protect him turn onto an abandoned stretch of highway nicknamed ''Route 666'' after the mysterious death of a prison chain gang. As the three continue on their way, they soon discover just what happened to the chain gang, and how the highway earned its name.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mrTWXADgmrvPmXsC7PX7V7yAIEh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55547'),
  ('441164048999423850', 'Route 9', 1998, 'Crime', 'David Mackay', 'Brendan Broderick, Rob Kerchner', 'Kyle MacLachlan, Peter Coyote, Amy Locane, Wade Williams, Miguel Sandoval, Roma Maffia', null, 'During a routine surveilance on desolate Route 9, two small town deputies come across over one million dollars in cash, a van full of drugs, several dead bodies and not a witness in sight.', 'During a routine surveilance on desolate Route 9, two small town deputies come across over one million dollars in cash, a van full of drugs, several dead bodies and not a witness in sight.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x4COKYODbCCaLMwCrRLn357Tj1j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:199074'),
  ('453244724374009876', 'Route Irish', 2011, 'Drama', 'Ken Loach, Chris Menges', 'Paul Laverty', 'Mark Womack, John Bishop, Andrea Lowe, Geoff Bell, Jack Fortune, Talib Hamafraj, Jamie Michie, Najwa Nimri', null, 'A private security contractor in Iraq rejects the official explanation of his friend''s death and decides to investigate.', 'A private security contractor in Iraq rejects the official explanation of his friend''s death and decides to investigate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u82X81dSc7d0hcDf34RBv568eFm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59065'),
  ('170780672467157816', 'Route One/USA', 1989, 'Documentary', 'Robert Kramer', 'Robert Kramer', 'Jesse Jackson, Paul McIsaac, Pat Robertson', null, 'Route One is the first major U.S. highway. 5000 km along the Atlantic coast, from the Canadian border to the tip of Florida. Doc, a physician who spent many years in Africa, returns to the U.S. and decides to reconnect with his home country by walking the legendary Route One.', 'Route One is the first major U.S. highway. 5000 km along the Atlantic coast, from the Canadian border to the tip of Florida. Doc, a physician who spent many years in Africa, returns to the U.S. and decides to reconnect with his home country by walking the legendary Route One.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lsJRIU0OzbjXRm61X17wdg4FPuw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110751'),
  ('12408098310584776', 'Rover Dangerfield', 1991, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'James L. George, Bob Seeley', 'Rodney Dangerfield', 'Rodney Dangerfield, Susan Boyd, Ronnie Schell, Ned Luke, Shawn Southwick, Dana Hill, Sal Landi, Tom Williams', 'G', 'Rover, a street-smart dog owned by a Las Vegas showgirl is dumped off Hoover Dam by the showgirl''s boyfriend. Rather than drowning, Rover winds up in your basic idyllic farm in a classic city-boy-in-country shtick.', 'Rover, a street-smart dog owned by a Las Vegas showgirl is dumped off Hoover Dam by the showgirl''s boyfriend. Rather than drowning, Rover winds up in your basic idyllic farm in a classic city-boy-in-country shtick.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dM73WqNaIPDj7lwRBOT2ioMFAsq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22466'),
  ('936983061529003897', 'Roving Mars', 2006, 'Documentary', 'George Butler, T.C. Christensen', 'George Butler, Robert Andrus', 'Paul Newman, Steve Squyres, Rob Manning, Charles Elachi, Wayne Lee, George Butler', 'PG', 'Join the Mars rovers Spirit and Opportunity for an awe-inspiring journey to the surface of the mysterious red planet.', 'Join the Mars rovers Spirit and Opportunity for an awe-inspiring journey to the surface of the mysterious red planet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l2SX7melm80fHU0KNYRSwW5KmPg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18085'),
  ('463684060954185270', 'Row 19', 2021, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Nikolay Smirnov, Alexander Babaev', 'James Heth, Austin Sepulveda, Dmitry Lemeshev', 'Svetlana Ivanova, Wolfgang Cerny, Marta Timofeeva, Ekaterina Vilkova, Anatoly Kot, Vitaliya Kornienko, Denis Yasik, Anna Glaube', null, 'A young female doctor and her 6-year-old daughter are on an overnight flight in a violent storm. When passengers on the half-empty plane inexplicably begin to die, the woman’s grip on reality weakens and she is forced to relive her worst childhood nightmare.', 'A young female doctor and her 6-year-old daughter are on an overnight flight in a violent storm. When passengers on the half-empty plane inexplicably begin to die, the woman’s grip on reality weakens and she is forced to relive her worst childhood nightmare.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aqn3bSUJRFJkW5eIj8vg9TFTzfe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:659384'),
  ('1017638436351654823', 'Rowan Atkinson Live', 1992, 'Comedy', 'Thomas Schlamme', 'Rowan Atkinson, Richard Curtis, Ben Elton', 'Rowan Atkinson, Angus Deayton', null, 'Rowan Atkinson and Angus Deayton in Boston doing a live performance of the same styles of humor we''ve seen in Mr. Bean and Blackadder. Included are lessons on Shakespearean acting, a school headmaster meeting with the father of a boy he''s beaten to death, and tips for having a successful date.', 'Rowan Atkinson and Angus Deayton in Boston doing a live performance of the same styles of humor we''ve seen in Mr. Bean and Blackadder. Included are lessons on Shakespearean acting, a school headmaster meeting with the father of a boy he''s beaten to death, and tips for having a successful date.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5bpz7tAxLISIMbOPB8kBj2fb7Lz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18458'),
  ('606749897908423039', 'Rowdy Rathore', 2012, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Prabhu Deva, Santosh Thundiyil', 'A. C. Mugil', 'Akshay Kumar, Sonakshi Sinha, Nassar, Yashpal Sharma, Mushtaq Khan, Gurdeep Kohli, Paresh Ganatra, Amit Kumar Tiwari', 'PG-13', 'A small-time thug comes across a young girl who claims him to be her father, following which he realizes he has a lookalike who''s being hunted by goons.', 'A small-time thug comes across a young girl who claims him to be her father, following which he realizes he has a lookalike who''s being hunted by goons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ytdp64MDSpONpm932nQcMTD95IF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:102632'),
  ('775342676177116550', 'Rowing Across the Atlantic', 1978, 'Animation', 'Jean-François Laguionie, Jean-François Laguionie', 'Jean-Paul Gaspari, Jean-François Laguionie', 'Charlotte Maury-Sentier, Jean-Pierre Sentier', null, 'Newlyweds, Adelaide and Jonathan leave New York in 1907 in a boat and row, ignorant of world events, to Europe. The years pass and many things are changing them, love is gradually degrading to hatred, then indifference. Old age is almost here, and with it, in a last swim, a last embrace, husband and wife end up “alone at last.” The boat adrift, will be discovered on the shores of Europe in the year 1957', 'Newlyweds, Adelaide and Jonathan leave New York in 1907 in a boat and row, ignorant of world events, to Europe. The years pass and many things are changing them, love is gradually degrading to hatred, then indifference. Old age is almost here, and with it, in a last swim, a last embrace, husband and wife end up “alone at last.” The boat adrift, will be discovered on the shores of Europe in the year 1957', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e667bHwMIDpcPrZviCJurK6FoQX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128440'),
  ('749513964519991947', 'Rowing with the Wind', 1988, 'Horror, Drama, Romance, Thriller', 'Gonzalo Suárez, Carlos Suárez', 'Gonzalo Suárez', 'Hugh Grant, Lizzy McInnerny, Valentine Pelka, Elizabeth Hurley, José Luis Gómez, Aitana Sánchez-Gijón, Bibiana Fernández, Virginia Mataix', null, 'In the summer of 1816, Percy Shelley, his mistress Mary, and her stepsister Claire visit Lord Byron at Lake Geneva. Byron challenges each to write a horror story, and Mary begins her novel, Frankenstein. She imagines the monster becoming real, and for the next six years, as tragedy befalls those around her, she believes the personification of her imagination is the cause. Against this backdrop, Claire has Byron''s baby then is estranged from him and barred from her daughter. Byron and Percy continue their friendship, the one self-centered and decadent, the other wildly idealistic. The Shelleys take up residence near Pisa.', 'In the summer of 1816, Percy Shelley, his mistress Mary, and her stepsister Claire visit Lord Byron at Lake Geneva. Byron challenges each to write a horror story, and Mary begins her novel, Frankenstein. She imagines the monster becoming real, and for the next six years, as tragedy befalls those around her, she believes the personification of her imagination is the cause. Against this backdrop, Claire has Byron''s baby then is estranged from him and barred from her daughter. Byron and Percy continue their friendship, the one self-centered and decadent, the other wildly idealistic. The Shelleys take up residence near Pisa.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t1FqqT8fP1LTGBUNd95Y2nmESQl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80047'),
  ('1091163878051546278', 'Roxane', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Mélanie Auffret, Nicolas Massart, Dylan Talleux', 'Mélanie Auffret, Michaël Souhaité', 'Guillaume de Tonquédec, Léa Drucker, Lionel Abelanski, Kate Duchêne, Liliane Rovère, Michel Jonasz, Jean-Yves Lafesse, Baptiste Perais', null, 'What does Cyrano de Bergerac do at a chicken farmer? This is the problem of Raymond, who has always kept his passion for the theater hidden. But when he is threatened with bankruptcy, he decides to try everything for the whole.', 'What does Cyrano de Bergerac do at a chicken farmer? This is the problem of Raymond, who has always kept his passion for the theater hidden. But when he is threatened with bankruptcy, he decides to try everything for the whole.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vfuNuwOh4hbJjpZqgOt4zGZ1ylX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:602283'),
  ('468762767966637684', 'Roxanne', 1987, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Ian Baker, Fred Schepisi, Wendy Chesal', 'Steve Martin', 'Steve Martin, Daryl Hannah, Rick Rossovich, Shelley Duvall, John Kapelos, Fred Willard, Max Alexander, Michael J. Pollard', 'PG', 'In this modern take on Edmond Rostand''s classic play "Cyrano de Bergerac," C. D. Bales is the witty, intelligent, and brave fire chief of a small Pacific Northwest town who, due to the size of his enormous nose, declines to pursue the girl of his dreams, lovely Roxanne Kowalski. Instead, when his shy underling Chris McConnell becomes smitten with Roxanne, C.D. feeds the handsome young man the words of love to win her heart.', 'In this modern take on Edmond Rostand''s classic play "Cyrano de Bergerac," C. D. Bales is the witty, intelligent, and brave fire chief of a small Pacific Northwest town who, due to the size of his enormous nose, declines to pursue the girl of his dreams, lovely Roxanne Kowalski. Instead, when his shy underling Chris McConnell becomes smitten with Roxanne, C.D. feeds the handsome young man the words of love to win her heart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c2XSGkpAIIof6Oi8Sr6wBvwt1Lk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11584'),
  ('255615272478871376', 'Roxanne Roxanne', 2017, 'Drama', 'Michael Larnell, Federico Cesca', 'Michael Larnell', 'Chanté Adams, Mahershala Ali, Nia Long, Elvis Nolasco, Shenell Edmonds, Adam Horovitz, Germar Terrell Gardner, Terrence Shingler', null, 'The most feared battle emcee in the early 1980s in Queens, New York, was a fierce teenager from the Queensbridge projects. At the age of 14, Roxanne Shanté was well on her way to becoming a hip-hop legend, as she hustled to provide for her family while defending herself from the dangers of the street.', 'The most feared battle emcee in the early 1980s in Queens, New York, was a fierce teenager from the Queensbridge projects. At the age of 14, Roxanne Shanté was well on her way to becoming a hip-hop legend, as she hustled to provide for her family while defending herself from the dangers of the street.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4WHkXS4828gKrhZg4Tje5gj5QVs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:426257'),
  ('1084777849859328785', 'Roxette: All Videos Ever Made & More!', 2001, 'Music', null, null, 'Per Gessle, Marie Fredriksson', null, 'All Videos Ever Made &amp; More - The Complete Collection 1987-2001 is a DVD by the Swedish pop duo Roxette, released on November 19, 2001. It features all the music videos the duo recorded from 1987 to 2001.', 'All Videos Ever Made &amp; More - The Complete Collection 1987-2001 is a DVD by the Swedish pop duo Roxette, released on November 19, 2001. It features all the music videos the duo recorded from 1987 to 2001.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5iInegJ0q3fiJUwzcmmbBybYBwa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90218'),
  ('418761685075704875', 'Roxie Hart', 1942, 'Comedy, Romance', 'William A. Wellman, Leon Shamroy', 'Nunnally Johnson', 'Ginger Rogers, Adolphe Menjou, George Montgomery, Lynne Overman, Nigel Bruce, Phil Silvers, Sara Allgood, William Frawley', 'NR', 'A café in Chicago, 1942. On a rainy night, veteran reporter Homer Howard tells an increasing audience the story of Roxie Hart and the crime she was judged for in 1927.', 'A café in Chicago, 1942. On a rainy night, veteran reporter Homer Howard tells an increasing audience the story of Roxie Hart and the crime she was judged for in 1927.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hBCSkYj3xMsWcbEzG2kD3dhF3sM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57684'),
  ('437012776270576947', 'Roy', 2015, 'Romance, Action, Drama', 'Vikramjit Singh, Shahid Hasan', 'Vikramjit Singh', 'Arjun Rampal, Jacqueline Fernandez, Ranbir Kapoor, Abhijeet Singh, Shernaz Patel, Rajit Kapoor, Mandana Karimi, Asif Basra', null, 'A love triangle revolving around the lives of a filmmaker, a thief and their mutual love interest.', 'A love triangle revolving around the lives of a filmmaker, a thief and their mutual love interest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kiQVm9AUAHhFhl4vPZAZJQMyRh2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:316900'),
  ('611635269523120038', 'Roy Colt and Winchester Jack', 1970, 'Western, Comedy', 'Mario Bava, Lamberto Bava, Antonio Rinaldi', 'Mario Di Nardo', 'Brett Halsey, Charles Southwood, Marilù Tolo, Teodoro Corrà, Guido Lollobrigida, Bruno Corazzari, Mauro Bosco, Federico Boido', null, 'Two outlaws compete with each other over a treasure map that will lead them to buried gold while one of them is in league with a sadistic priest-turned-crime lord, while a young Native American girl helps both outlaws and plays both sides against each other.', 'Two outlaws compete with each other over a treasure map that will lead them to buried gold while one of them is in league with a sadistic priest-turned-crime lord, while a young Native American girl helps both outlaws and plays both sides against each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aAIsRLMAmNm7yCj3xqjHjSCPRK6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92788'),
  ('275717062529229689', 'Roy Orbison and Friends: A Black and White Night', 1988, 'Music, Documentary', 'Tony Mitchell, Tony Mitchell', null, 'Roy Orbison, Jackson Browne, T Bone Burnett, Elvis Costello, J. Steven Soles, Bonnie Raitt, Bruce Springsteen, Tom Waits', null, 'Recorded live at the Coconut Grove in Los Angeles, Roy is joined by an eclectic ensemble of rock and roll superstars including Jackson Browne, Elvis Costello, T-Bone Burnett, J.D. Souther, Jennifer Warnes, k.d. lang, Bonnie Raitt, Bruce Springsteen and Tom Waits.', 'Recorded live at the Coconut Grove in Los Angeles, Roy is joined by an eclectic ensemble of rock and roll superstars including Jackson Browne, Elvis Costello, T-Bone Burnett, J.D. Souther, Jennifer Warnes, k.d. lang, Bonnie Raitt, Bruce Springsteen and Tom Waits.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8ARclqBB6rGXokpkKGjJURXiX6f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17674'),
  ('1097729700830395075', 'Royal Affairs in Versailles', 1953, 'Drama, History, Comedy', 'Sacha Guitry, Marc Lanjean, Gérard Renateau', 'Sacha Guitry', 'Sacha Guitry, Bourvil, Lana Marconi, Gaby Morlay, Gérard Philipe, Jean Marais, Jean Desailly, Jean-Louis Barrault', null, 'Witty narration follows the history of Versailles Palace; founded by Louis XIII, enlarged by autocratic Louis XIV, whose personal affairs and amours, and those of his two successors, are followed in more detail to the start of the Revolution, after which the story is brought rapidly up to date. A huge cast plays mainly historical persons who appear briefly.', 'Witty narration follows the history of Versailles Palace; founded by Louis XIII, enlarged by autocratic Louis XIV, whose personal affairs and amours, and those of his two successors, are followed in more detail to the start of the Revolution, after which the story is brought rapidly up to date. A huge cast plays mainly historical persons who appear briefly.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nqNv5BGV62736n3kVS0DUljQNAh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67540'),
  ('9901912786534612', 'Royal Cat Nap', 1958, 'Comedy, Animation', 'William Hanna, Joseph Barbera', null, 'Francoise Brun-Cottan', 'NR', 'Jerry and his little French mouse friend are raiding while the king sleeps. They awaken him and he calls for Tom to give him an ultimatum: One more sound from the mice and it''s off with Tom''s head. The mice hear this and team up to torment Tom.', 'Jerry and his little French mouse friend are raiding while the king sleeps. They awaken him and he calls for Tom to give him an ultimatum: One more sound from the mice and it''s off with Tom''s head. The mice hear this and team up to torment Tom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qkTGoiI4KEHzd4FXuQJfous67if.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77554'),
  ('102886188938471863', 'Royal Flash', 1975, 'Adventure, Comedy, Romance', 'Richard Lester, Geoffrey Unsworth', 'George MacDonald Fraser', 'Malcolm McDowell, Alan Bates, Florinda Bolkan, Oliver Reed, Tom Bell, Joss Ackland, Christopher Cazenove, Henry Cooper', 'PG', 'Cowardly rogue Harry Flashman''s (Malcolm McDowell) schemes to gain entry to the royal circles of 19th-century Europe go nowhere until he meets a pair of devious nobles with their own agenda. At their urging, Flashman agrees to re-create himself as a bogus Prussian nobleman to woo a beautiful duchess. But the half-baked plan quickly comes unraveled, and he''s soon on the run from several new enemies who are all calling for the rapscallion''s head.', 'Cowardly rogue Harry Flashman''s (Malcolm McDowell) schemes to gain entry to the royal circles of 19th-century Europe go nowhere until he meets a pair of devious nobles with their own agenda. At their urging, Flashman agrees to re-create himself as a bogus Prussian nobleman to woo a beautiful duchess. But the half-baked plan quickly comes unraveled, and he''s soon on the run from several new enemies who are all calling for the rapscallion''s head.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rx5DYndn3ua5Pe3yz492kqERH19.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54302'),
  ('491783392223504339', 'Royal Hearts', 2018, 'TV Movie, Romance', 'James Brolin, Phil Parmet', null, 'James Brolin, Cindy Busby, Andrew Cooper, Lachlan Nieboer, Martin Wimbush, Howard Crossley, Jeremy Colton, Glynis Barber', 'G', 'Kelly, a hopeless romantic in Montana eager to finish her dissertation, and her father, Hank, a rancher, receive news that he has inherited an estate from a faraway land. When they travel there, they discover that Hank has not only inherited the estate, but the title that goes along with it – KING!', 'Kelly, a hopeless romantic in Montana eager to finish her dissertation, and her father, Hank, a rancher, receive news that he has inherited an estate from a faraway land. When they travel there, they discover that Hank has not only inherited the estate, but the title that goes along with it – KING!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t6DdClPubkyVSeFMDk8aFGCrG1h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:505723'),
  ('49642917671543347', 'Royal Matchmaker', 2018, 'Romance, TV Movie', 'Mike Rohl, Viorel Sergovici', 'Mark Amato', 'Bethany Joy Lenz, Will Kemp, Brittany Bristow, Elva Trill, Simon Dutton, Poppy Roe, Janis Ahern, Boiangiu Alma', null, 'A struggling NYC matchmaker is hired by a king to find his son a suitable wife in time for a national celebration. As the clock ticks towards her deadline, the matchmaker finds him the perfect wife -- only to realize that she’s fallen in love with him!', 'A struggling NYC matchmaker is hired by a king to find his son a suitable wife in time for a national celebration. As the clock ticks towards her deadline, the matchmaker finds him the perfect wife -- only to realize that she’s fallen in love with him!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j8i0iUMww0QmPSjiPG4yEf21CVY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:501689'),
  ('192602977691692245', 'Royal New Year''s Eve', 2017, 'Romance, TV Movie, Comedy, Drama', 'Eddy Hardy, Natalie Fiteni, Richard Worden', 'Rick Garman', 'Jessy Schram, Sam Page, Crystal Balint, Hayley Sales, Cheryl Ladd, Andrew Kavadas, Nicole LaPlaca, Gerard Plunkett', null, 'An aspiring fashion designer falls in love with her socialite client''s prospective fiance, Prince Jeffrey.', 'An aspiring fashion designer falls in love with her socialite client''s prospective fiance, Prince Jeffrey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rNzJ3GZqT1L3uszZMjqsmzuD3L6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:474979'),
  ('478494902856156379', 'Royal Palace', 2005, 'Comedy', 'Valérie Lemercier, James Welland', 'Brigitte Buc', 'Valérie Lemercier, Lambert Wilson, Catherine Deneuve, Denis Podalydès, Mathilde Seigner, Michel Aumont, Gisèle Casadesus, Maurane', null, 'Eugenia is the queen of an imaginary European country. When her husband dies, quite unexpectedly, the country is left without a king. According to the law, the new king needs to be married so that leaves out the eldest son. Her youngest son, Prince Arnaud is married to the lovely Armelle and they have two young children. They become the future rulers of the kingdom.', 'Eugenia is the queen of an imaginary European country. When her husband dies, quite unexpectedly, the country is left without a king. According to the law, the new king needs to be married so that leaves out the eldest son. Her youngest son, Prince Arnaud is married to the lovely Armelle and they have two young children. They become the future rulers of the kingdom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2qMAOpqTH1RE6Jfp24tHPNuxDb6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32390'),
  ('509144262252999513', 'Royal Rendezvous', 2023, 'Romance, TV Movie', 'Christine Luby, Ciaran Kavanagh', 'Scott Damian, Sara Endsley, Heather R. Provost', 'Isabella Gómez, Ruairí O''Connor, Ronan Raftery, Dearbhla Molloy, Marcus Lamb, Juliette Crosbie, Leonard Buckley, Peter Rothwell', 'PG', 'A Chef from East L.A. received an invitation to a manor in Ireland to cook for a royal banquet that was planned by a Lord to convince his grandmother to sell their home.', 'A Chef from East L.A. received an invitation to a manor in Ireland to cook for a royal banquet that was planned by a Lord to convince his grandmother to sell their home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/93f71drYfVjZvqP0EsGVMRvF5Ab.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1081920'),
  ('691489099744636132', 'Royal Space Force - The Wings of Honneamise', 1987, 'Animation, Science Fiction', 'Yoshiyuki Sadamoto, Hiroyuki Yamaga, Takami Akai', 'Hiroyuki Yamaga', 'Leo Morimoto, Mitsuki Yayoi, Aya Murata, Kazuyuki Sogabe, Masato Hirano, Masahiro Anzai, Bin Shimada, Hirotaka Suzuoki', 'PG-13', 'On a future Earth, war between the Kingdom of Honneamise and its rival, The Republic, is inevitable. As evolving technology creates new ways to wage war, a small group seeks to propel mankind into space in their world’s first spaceflight program. For astronaut candidate Shirotsugh Lhadatt, it’s a personal odyssey as he grows from an aimless young man into a leader willing to put everything on the line in order to move the human race forward and away from the brink of Armageddon.', 'On a future Earth, war between the Kingdom of Honneamise and its rival, The Republic, is inevitable. As evolving technology creates new ways to wage war, a small group seeks to propel mankind into space in their world’s first spaceflight program. For astronaut candidate Shirotsugh Lhadatt, it’s a personal odyssey as he grows from an aimless young man into a leader willing to put everything on the line in order to move the human race forward and away from the brink of Armageddon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h5naABij9ghj6CLcpBYBkxMGYGX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20043'),
  ('1118974731451573168', 'Royal Tramp', 1992, 'Action, Comedy', 'Wong Jing, Aman Chang Man', 'Wong Jing', 'Stephen Chow, Richard Ng Man-Tat, Sharla Cheung, Chingmy Yau Suk-Ching, Elvis Tsui Kam-Kong, Natalis Chan Pak-Cheung, Deric Wan, Fennie Yuen Kit-Ying', null, 'The story of Wai Siu Bo, a pimp who after saving Chan Kan Nam, the leader of the Heaven and Earth society, a revolutionary group, is made a member. After a botched first assignment for the group, he is made a servant to the Prince, the very person the Heaven and Earth society want to overthrow. What follows is plenty of mayhem and laughter.', 'The story of Wai Siu Bo, a pimp who after saving Chan Kan Nam, the leader of the Heaven and Earth society, a revolutionary group, is made a member. After a botched first assignment for the group, he is made a servant to the Prince, the very person the Heaven and Earth society want to overthrow. What follows is plenty of mayhem and laughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tJeafyenaenHTiMVKRPBAISQ3qH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51730'),
  ('777837645050592463', 'Royal Tramp 2', 1992, 'Action, Comedy', 'Wong Jing, David Chung', 'Wong Jing', 'Stephen Chow, Brigitte Lin, Chingmy Yau Suk-Ching, Natalis Chan Pak-Cheung, Michele Reis, Fennie Yuen Kit-Ying, Vivian Chen, Deric Wan', null, 'After discovering that the Empress is actually Lung Erh, a member of the St Dragon Sect, and that she imprisoned the real empress. Lung Erh, is bent on eliminating the person who disclosed her true identity, Wai Siu Bo. But more complications ensues when Lung Erh is assigned to protect the Prince, whose servant is none other than Wai Siu Bo.', 'After discovering that the Empress is actually Lung Erh, a member of the St Dragon Sect, and that she imprisoned the real empress. Lung Erh, is bent on eliminating the person who disclosed her true identity, Wai Siu Bo. But more complications ensues when Lung Erh is assigned to protect the Prince, whose servant is none other than Wai Siu Bo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nc3I27aQucb5IGn8VXWKN5gygqc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51731'),
  ('529843853142904593', 'Royal Treasure', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Yan Min', null, 'Huang Bo, Sun Honglei, Huang Lei, Show Lo, Wang Xun, Zhang Yixing, Zhao Liying, Yu Hewei', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/upIgx6YxNjvMAbFkB7g8bVrB9bL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:387949'),
  ('904493718572319736', 'Royal Warriors', 1986, 'Action, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'David Chung, Derek Wan Man-Kit, Ma Chun-Wah', 'Tsang Kan-Cheong', 'Michelle Yeoh, Hiroyuki Sanada, Michael Wong, Pai Ying, David Lam Wai, Michael Chan Wai-Man, Kam Hing-Yin, Kenneth Tsang', 'R', 'When a tough policewoman learns about a group of violent terrorists, she, along with her partner and a Japanese detective, does everything it takes to take them down.', 'When a tough policewoman learns about a group of violent terrorists, she, along with her partner and a Japanese detective, does everything it takes to take them down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/79QtxrBbDG2FbvgJSxWQpYCKJbM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45450'),
  ('289544058314134672', 'Royal Wedding', 1951, 'Music, Comedy, Romance', 'Stanley Donen, Robert H. Planck, Arvid Griffen', 'Alan Jay Lerner', 'Fred Astaire, Jane Powell, Peter Lawford, Sarah Churchill, Keenan Wynn, Albert Sharpe, Henri Letondal, Viola Roache', 'NR', 'A brother and sister dance act encounter challenges and romance when booked in London during the Royal Wedding.', 'A brother and sister dance act encounter challenges and romance when booked in London during the Royal Wedding.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5hOyBgsmSApFl10ZfaYxUTQu5Ze.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18646'),
  ('882723232947941279', 'Royally Ever After', 2018, 'Drama, TV Movie, Comedy, Romance', 'Seamus Deasy, Tony Aherne, David Kennedy', null, 'Fiona Gubelmann, Torrance Coombs, Carmen du Sautoy, Barry McGovern, Fiona Bell, Rebekah Wainwright, John Guerrasio, Aideen Wylde', null, 'Sara''s dream of finding the perfect mate is realized when boyfriend Daniel proposes marriage, but there is one tiny hitch. It turns out he is the real-life prince of a small European monarchy, and his marriage requires the approval of his royal parents. Commoner Sara will have to do more than simply impress the in-laws-to-be. If she wants to become Daniel’s wife, she’ll have to prove she’s got all the makings of an honest-to-goodness princess.', 'Sara''s dream of finding the perfect mate is realized when boyfriend Daniel proposes marriage, but there is one tiny hitch. It turns out he is the real-life prince of a small European monarchy, and his marriage requires the approval of his royal parents. Commoner Sara will have to do more than simply impress the in-laws-to-be. If she wants to become Daniel’s wife, she’ll have to prove she’s got all the makings of an honest-to-goodness princess.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1k5HpDPTWGIh24cvW5wQmV7YOuP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:520409'),
  ('551496190395796502', 'Royally Wrapped For Christmas', 2021, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance', 'T.W. Peacocke, Paul Mitchnick', 'W. Stewart', 'Jen Lilley, Brendan Fehr, Michael Hanrahan, Fiona Reid, Meher Pavri, Jeremy Walmsley', 'G', 'Lindsay Palmer, the NY director of an international charity organization, is called to the Kingdom of Veronia by the royal family who runs the foundation to interview for the job of overseeing the whole operation. As Lindsay is put through the interview process, she ends up finding true love with the prince.', 'Lindsay Palmer, the NY director of an international charity organization, is called to the Kingdom of Veronia by the royal family who runs the foundation to interview for the job of overseeing the whole operation. As Lindsay is put through the interview process, she ends up finding true love with the prince.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1X0C6fBt1tWR9lpwdrwjVqhWpOV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:878419'),
  ('36402676560828884', 'Royalteen', 2022, 'Romance, Drama', 'Emilie K. Beck, Per-Olav Sørensen, Håvard Andrè Byrkjeland', 'Ester Schartum-Hansen, Per-Olav Sørensen', 'Ines Høysæter Asserson, Veslemøy Mørkrid, Elli Rhiannon Müller Osborne, Mathias Storhøi, Sunniva Lind Høverstad, Amalie Sporsheim, Filip Bargee Ramberg, Niels Halstensen Skåber', 'R', 'A teenager struggles to keep her scandal-ridden past and a big secret from getting out when she strikes up an unlikely romance with the crown prince.', 'A teenager struggles to keep her scandal-ridden past and a big secret from getting out when she strikes up an unlikely romance with the crown prince.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oK6I9Wa5RIqxpNbJ4NWemsotcYJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:996518'),
  ('146370087055379224', 'Royalteen: Princess Margrethe', 2023, 'Drama, Romance', 'Ingvild Søderlind, Jakob Ingason', 'Ester Schartum-Hansen, Marta Huglen Revheim, Per-Olav Sørensen', 'Elli Rhiannon Müller Osborne, Ines Høysæter Asserson, Mathias Storhøi, Amalie Sporsheim, Sammy Germain Wadi, Filip Bargee Ramberg, Frode Winther, Kirsti Stubø', 'R', 'In the wake of her prom scandal, Princess Margrethe longs for normalcy as she struggles to maintain her perfect facade while dealing with family drama.', 'In the wake of her prom scandal, Princess Margrethe longs for normalcy as she struggles to maintain her perfect facade while dealing with family drama.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yZ6rd29u0Z4ICp4QVSXm1uQ7gjy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1079078'),
  ('1115777016241021400', 'Royce', 1994, 'Comedy, Action, TV Movie', 'Rod Holcomb, Thomas Del Ruth, Babu Subramaniam', 'Paul Bernbaum', 'Jim Belushi, Miguel Ferrer, Peter Boyle, Chelsea Field, Anthony Stewart Head, Marie-Françoise Theodore, Daniel Kash, Paris Jefferson', null, 'Royce is a member of the ultra-secret service "Black Hole", working for the US Government on top-secret missions. When the senator responsible for forming Black Hole disbands the organization, Royce''s fellow Black Hole members plot revenge on the man responsible for them losing their jobs. Royce decides not to join them, instead deciding to thwart their attempts to exact revenge on the senator.', 'Royce is a member of the ultra-secret service "Black Hole", working for the US Government on top-secret missions. When the senator responsible for forming Black Hole disbands the organization, Royce''s fellow Black Hole members plot revenge on the man responsible for them losing their jobs. Royce decides not to join them, instead deciding to thwart their attempts to exact revenge on the senator.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2XJ63t3iDCmG16XS3rBT9AUBarx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:116215'),
  ('1013030835577206249', 'RR', 1981, null, 'Stan Brakhage', null, null, null, 'This film is a mix of landscape images seen from train windows and the patterned shapes and shifting tones of moving-visual-thought thus prompted; it was inspired by Robert Breer''s FUJI.', 'This film is a mix of landscape images seen from train windows and the patterned shapes and shifting tones of moving-visual-thought thus prompted; it was inspired by Robert Breer''s FUJI.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xQUz1w5eQJCezbmJbGW2f3n9PP4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:547804'),
  ('1058849441726477473', 'RR', 2007, 'Documentary', 'James Benning', null, null, null, 'Looping, chugging and barreling by, the trains in Benning''s latest monumental film map a stunning topography and a history of American development. RR comes three decades after Benning and Bette Gordon made The United States of America (1975), a cinematic journey along the country’s interstates that is keenly aware “of superhighways and railroad tracks as American public symbols.” A political essay responding to the economic histories of trains as instruments in a culture of hyper-consumption, RR articulates its concern most explicitly when Eisenhower''s military-industrial complex speech is heard as a mile long coal train passes through eastern Wyoming. Benning spent two and a half years collecting two hundred and sixteen shots of trains, forty-three of which appear in RR. The locomotives'' varying colors, speeds, vectors, and reverberations are charged with visual thrills, romance and a nostalgia heightened by Benning''s declaration that this will be his last work in 16mm film.', 'Looping, chugging and barreling by, the trains in Benning''s latest monumental film map a stunning topography and a history of American development. RR comes three decades after Benning and Bette Gordon made The United States of America (1975), a cinematic journey along the country’s interstates that is keenly aware “of superhighways and railroad tracks as American public symbols.” A political essay responding to the economic histories of trains as instruments in a culture of hyper-consumption, RR articulates its concern most explicitly when Eisenhower''s military-industrial complex speech is heard as a mile long coal train passes through eastern Wyoming. Benning spent two and a half years collecting two hundred and sixteen shots of trains, forty-three of which appear in RR. The locomotives'' varying colors, speeds, vectors, and reverberations are charged with visual thrills, romance and a nostalgia heightened by Benning''s declaration that this will be his last work in 16mm film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4hxV9O86MOBA8JgBWVnmuri3WtZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126610'),
  ('1086403467032002298', 'RRR', 2022, 'Action, Adventure, Drama', 'Ravi Ahuja, Priyanka Shivhare, S. S. Rajamouli', 'S. S. Rajamouli', 'N.T. Rama Rao Jr., Ram Charan, Olivia Morris, Ray Stevenson, Alison Doody, Ajay Devgn, Alia Bhatt, Samuthirakani', 'NR', 'A fictional history of two legendary revolutionaries'' journey away from home before they began fighting for their country in the 1920s.', 'A fictional history of two legendary revolutionaries'' journey away from home before they began fighting for their country in the 1920s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nEufeZlyAOLqO2brrs0yeF1lgXO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:579974'),
  ('532686719846360010', 'RRRrrrr!!!', 2004, 'Comedy', 'Alain Chabat, Fabien Vergez, Laurent Dailland', 'Maurice Barthélemy, Alain Chabat, Marina Foïs', 'Maurice Barthélemy, Marina Foïs, Elise Larnicol, Pierre-François Martin-Laval, Jean-Paul Rouve, Pascal Vincent, Alain Chabat, Jean Rochefort', null, 'In 35,000 BC, the tribe of the Dirty Hairs is at war against the tribe of the Clean Hairs for eight hundred years, trying to get their shampoo. The chief of the Dirty Hairs sends his daughter Guy disguised to the enemy tribe to get some shampoo for his tribe. When the healer of the Clean Hairs tribe surprisingly kills two cavemen of his tribe, their imbecile chief assigns Pierre with curled hair and Pierre blonde to investigate the murder and find the criminal.', 'In 35,000 BC, the tribe of the Dirty Hairs is at war against the tribe of the Clean Hairs for eight hundred years, trying to get their shampoo. The chief of the Dirty Hairs sends his daughter Guy disguised to the enemy tribe to get some shampoo for his tribe. When the healer of the Clean Hairs tribe surprisingly kills two cavemen of his tribe, their imbecile chief assigns Pierre with curled hair and Pierre blonde to investigate the murder and find the criminal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qsGU6myn85MfqpNAxzJtxJ3VgrM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21778'),
  ('233302576905684725', 'RTT', 2009, 'Comedy', 'Frédéric Berthe, Giovanni Fiore Coltellacci', 'Alexandre de La Patellière, Franck Magnier, Julien Rappeneau', 'Kad Merad, Mélanie Doutey, Manu Payet, Francis Renaud, Pierre Laplace, Daniel Duval, Nathalie Levy-Lang, Arthur Dupont', null, 'When Florence, his companion of five years, shocks him with the news that she''s leaving him, moving to Miami and marrying another man, Arthur loses it. He follows Florence to all the way to Florida with plans to stop the wedding, which is set to take place in just a few days. Along the way, he crosses paths with Emilie, who is also heading to Miami, but unlike Arthur, is wanted by the police. As a result, Arthur gets stuck on an adventure he definitely never expected.', 'When Florence, his companion of five years, shocks him with the news that she''s leaving him, moving to Miami and marrying another man, Arthur loses it. He follows Florence to all the way to Florida with plans to stop the wedding, which is set to take place in just a few days. Along the way, he crosses paths with Emilie, who is also heading to Miami, but unlike Arthur, is wanted by the police. As a result, Arthur gets stuck on an adventure he definitely never expected.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qB5yqRLiLvcspXVZ88l7QYpJeOZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26629'),
  ('771590369197329307', 'Ru', 2023, 'Drama', 'Charles-Olivier Michaud, Frédérique Descarries-Fontan, Delphine Le Courtois', 'Jacques Davidts', 'Chloé Djandji, Chantal Thuy, Jean Bui, Olivier Dinh, Xavier Nguyen, Patrice Robitaille, Karine Vanasse, Mali Corbeil-Gauvreau', null, 'After a dangerous sea crossing and a stay in a camp in Malaysia, the young Vietnamese Tinh and her family are accepted as refugees in Canada and arrive in Montreal where they begin their new life. But for Tinh, adapting has its share of difficulties.', 'After a dangerous sea crossing and a stay in a camp in Malaysia, the young Vietnamese Tinh and her family are accepted as refugees in Canada and arrive in Montreal where they begin their new life. But for Tinh, adapting has its share of difficulties.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/48m1dBNxnBRHS1Fm30eTWgvVOrv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:942243'),
  ('717487118747290282', 'Rubber', 2010, 'Comedy, Drama, Fantasy, Horror, Mystery', 'Quentin Dupieux, Quentin Dupieux, Ian J. Putnam', 'Quentin Dupieux', 'Thomas F. Duffy, David Bowe, Stephen Spinella, Roxane Mesquida, Jack Plotnick, Wings Hauser, Ethan Cohn, Charley Koontz', 'R', 'In the California desert, the adventures of a telepathic killer-tire, mysteriously attracted by a very pretty girl, as witnessed by incredulous onlookers.', 'In the California desert, the adventures of a telepathic killer-tire, mysteriously attracted by a very pretty girl, as witnessed by incredulous onlookers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mWgCORI5IC5vOvB2cDVQe0YNtXZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45649'),
  ('433997270657552818', 'Rubber Tarzan', 1981, 'Comedy, Family', 'Søren Kragh-Jacobsen, Dan Laustsen', 'Hans Hansen, Søren Kragh-Jacobsen', 'Alex Svanbjerg, Otto Brandenburg, Peter Schrøder, Susanne Heinrich, Jens Okking, Kjeld Løfting, Terese Damsholt, Kirsten Rolffes', null, 'Ivan is a very lonely 8 year boy who is bullied almost every day in school. Even his father taunts him because Ivan litteraly is a weakling (That should explain the title Rubber Tarzan). As a result of this Ivan spends a lot of his time on daydreaming until he meets a kind of kindred spirit - the friendly and lonely crane driver Ole.', 'Ivan is a very lonely 8 year boy who is bullied almost every day in school. Even his father taunts him because Ivan litteraly is a weakling (That should explain the title Rubber Tarzan). As a result of this Ivan spends a lot of his time on daydreaming until he meets a kind of kindred spirit - the friendly and lonely crane driver Ole.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gzaUxIpMWUGepZjSumZ3QHylnD7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21279'),
  ('822889664911528410', 'Rubber''s Lover', 1996, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Shozin Fukui, Yousaku Kawamura, Tatsuya Kondo', 'Shozin Fukui', 'Norimizu Ameya, Yohta Kawase, Mika Kunihiro, Zeeko Uchiyama, Sosuke Saito, Shizuka Matsui, Kawamura Hiroshi, Tatsuya Kondo', null, 'After the explosive demise of their last subject, scientists must look for a replacement on whom to continue their bizarre experiments with brain-altering drugs.', 'After the explosive demise of their last subject, scientists must look for a replacement on whom to continue their bizarre experiments with brain-altering drugs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e3gnezLmqQUfAsNIJZcPRmbPTlE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48191'),
  ('1039550030271070771', 'Rubberface', 1981, 'Drama, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Glen Salzman, Rene Ohashi, Rebecca Yates', 'Michael Glassbourg, Nada Harcourt', 'Jim Carrey, Adah Glassbourg, Lynne Deragon, Ann-Marie MacDonald, Helene Udy, Gabe Cohen, Marla Lukofsky, Michael Glassbourg', null, 'A teen-age girl conceals her insecurity behind a barrage of jokes — until she meets an aspiring comedian who asks for her help with his new act. Janet is an over-weight girl who has a knack for making the other children in school laugh... by making fun of her own weight. In seeing the other kids'' reactions, she feels that she might have what it takes to be a comedian. She visits the local comedy club where she finds Tony Moroni who is a struggling comedian whose jokes are less than funny. Together Tony helps Janet find self-esteem and Janet helps Tony with his material.', 'A teen-age girl conceals her insecurity behind a barrage of jokes — until she meets an aspiring comedian who asks for her help with his new act. Janet is an over-weight girl who has a knack for making the other children in school laugh... by making fun of her own weight. In seeing the other kids'' reactions, she feels that she might have what it takes to be a comedian. She visits the local comedy club where she finds Tony Moroni who is a struggling comedian whose jokes are less than funny. Together Tony helps Janet find self-esteem and Janet helps Tony with his material.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sj5sqGKfySuDNehhOcWt2K94Tcj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79678'),
  ('475406480428405337', 'Ruben Brandt, Collector', 2018, 'Animation, Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Milorad Krstić', 'Milorad Krstić', 'Iván Kamarás, Csaba Márton, Gabriella Hámori, Matt Devere, Henry Grant, Christian Nielson Buckholdt, Katalin Dombi, Paul Bellantoni', null, 'Psychotherapist Ruben Brandt becomes the most wanted criminal in the world when he and four of his patients steal paintings from the world''s most renowned museums and art collections.', 'Psychotherapist Ruben Brandt becomes the most wanted criminal in the world when he and four of his patients steal paintings from the world''s most renowned museums and art collections.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wE88Mwcs90Cr3sGxEzLSgnTS7uE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:543033'),
  ('1091602189134112336', 'Rübezahls Schatz', 2017, 'TV Movie, Family, Fantasy', 'Stefan Bühling, The Chau Ngo', 'Angelika Schwarzhuber, Bettina Janis', 'Sabin Tambrea, Henriette Confurius, Catherine Flemming, Amelie Plaas-Link, Joachim Foerster, Thorsten Merten, David Schütter, Rüdiger Klink', null, 'The mountain spirit Rübezahl falls in love with the young maid Rosa. Blind with love, he does not notice that the Baroness of Harrant wants to plunder his gold treasures in order to build a sawmill in the Giant Mountains.', 'The mountain spirit Rübezahl falls in love with the young maid Rosa. Blind with love, he does not notice that the Baroness of Harrant wants to plunder his gold treasures in order to build a sawmill in the Giant Mountains.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tQsnGYwdVSSwrySIw6jnjnIR7Vq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:484737'),
  ('674257351585044925', 'Rubí', 1970, 'Drama, Romance', 'Carlos Enrique Taboada, Javier Durán', 'Carlos Enrique Taboada, Francisco Guerrero', 'Irán Eory, Aldo Monti, Carlos Bracho, Alicia Bonet, Miguel Ángel Álvarez, Rosa Maria Gallardo, Adriana Roel, Alfonso Mejía', null, 'This is the story of Rubí, a young, selfish and hypocritical woman who, through ambition and deception, ruins the lives of those around her and her own.', 'This is the story of Rubí, a young, selfish and hypocritical woman who, through ambition and deception, ruins the lives of those around her and her own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sTOHCcLQdxDsJ9jlUSiBJPr98Xn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:259665'),
  ('601120193490143275', 'Rubikon', 2022, 'Science Fiction, Thriller, Drama', 'Nadja Berke, Magdalena Lauritsch, Xiaosu Han', 'Magdalena Lauritsch, Jessica Lind', 'Julia Franz Richter, Mark Ivanir, George Blagden, Nicholas Monu, Daniela Kong, Konstantin Frolov, Hannah Rang, Lupo Grujcic', 'NR', 'The company soldier Hannah and the scientists Gavin and Dimitri are researching an algae project on board the Rubikon space station, which is supposed to permanently supply humanity with oxygen and food. But suddenly the earth disappears below them in a brown, toxic fog and all contact is broken off - are they the last survivors of humanity? Should they initiate the safe station, dare the return flight and thereby risk their lives?', 'The company soldier Hannah and the scientists Gavin and Dimitri are researching an algae project on board the Rubikon space station, which is supposed to permanently supply humanity with oxygen and food. But suddenly the earth disappears below them in a brown, toxic fog and all contact is broken off - are they the last survivors of humanity? Should they initiate the safe station, dare the return flight and thereby risk their lives?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n5Ynx568yHn1hKG2ND7ctoL9jEl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:793961'),
  ('968125634741350617', 'Rubin & Ed', 1992, 'Adventure, Drama, Comedy', 'Trent Harris, Bryan Duggan, John Cameron', 'Trent Harris', 'Crispin Glover, Howard Hesseman, Karen Black, Michael Greene, Anna Louise Daniels, Brittney Lewis, Frank Magner, Dorene Nielsen', null, 'Reclusive Rubin Farr teams up with vocal but unsuccessful multi-level salesman Ed Tuttle on a quest to bury Rubin''s dead cat in the "perfect spot." Their trip takes them across Utah''s desert where they have run-ins with Ed''s ex-wife Rula and an elusive Andy Warhol critic.', 'Reclusive Rubin Farr teams up with vocal but unsuccessful multi-level salesman Ed Tuttle on a quest to bury Rubin''s dead cat in the "perfect spot." Their trip takes them across Utah''s desert where they have run-ins with Ed''s ex-wife Rula and an elusive Andy Warhol critic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tky5hpVgeOuA9cel0sDSZkFdqYP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41792'),
  ('212657527062606890', 'Rubius X', 2022, 'Documentary', 'Pedro Ample', null, 'Rubén Doblas Gundersen, Miguel Ángel Rogel, Alejandro Bravo Yañez, Abraham Bandera, Irina Isasia, Bente Gundersen, Irene Cívico', null, 'On the 10th anniversary of the publication of his first video on the Internet, "Rubius X" is a documentary that deals with the origin, motivation and secrets behind Rubius, one of the most followed Spanish content creators in the world. A review of the history of a pioneer, the icon of a whole generation, who represents like few others the revolution of the new digital media.', 'On the 10th anniversary of the publication of his first video on the Internet, "Rubius X" is a documentary that deals with the origin, motivation and secrets behind Rubius, one of the most followed Spanish content creators in the world. A review of the history of a pioneer, the icon of a whole generation, who represents like few others the revolution of the new digital media.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k6KAAVebtdVb0FRU2PWqYLnhgRA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:912826'),
  ('17230503705221333', 'Ruby', 1977, 'Horror', 'Curtis Harrington, William Mendenhall', 'Barry Schneider, George Edwards', 'Piper Laurie, Stuart Whitman, Janit Baldwin, Roger Davis, Crystin Sinclaire, Paul Kent, Len Lesser, Jack Perkins', 'R', 'Strange killings occur at Ruby''s drive-in theatre, sixteen years after the murder of her gangster boyfriend.', 'Strange killings occur at Ruby''s drive-in theatre, sixteen years after the murder of her gangster boyfriend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hAKlXyTc0LqvG2J7TbrvBfBZRHz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85695'),
  ('759560657596677575', 'Ruby', 1992, 'Drama, Action, Thriller, Crime', 'John Mackenzie, Matthew Carlisle, Richard Oswald', 'Stephen Davis', 'Danny Aiello, Sherilyn Fenn, Tobin Bell, Joe Cortese, David Duchovny, Richard C. Sarafian, Leonard Termo, Arliss Howard', 'R', 'Fact and fiction are combined in this story about Jack Ruby and a stripper, Candy Cane, and how they become involved in a conspiracy to kill J.F.K.', 'Fact and fiction are combined in this story about Jack Ruby and a stripper, Candy Cane, and how they become involved in a conspiracy to kill J.F.K.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wEPTCmzKLnP9GArjWvYfI6TJTv6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70709'),
  ('522169087874503358', 'Ruby', 2021, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'David Bercovici-Artieda, Gail Harvey', 'Gregory Small, Richard Blaney', 'Raechelle Banno, Naomi Judd, Sam Duke, Gil Bellows, Ty Wood, Karina Banno, Lauralee Bell, Veena Sood', 'PG-13', 'Ruby Landry is filled with hope as love blooms with her high school sweetheart Paul Tate. But lingering thoughts of her mysterious father and her mother''s death often creep into Ruby''s mind.', 'Ruby Landry is filled with hope as love blooms with her high school sweetheart Paul Tate. But lingering thoughts of her mysterious father and her mother''s death often creep into Ruby''s mind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gGSJZ1JQ3fJw8jfBWVGmW4ljqrY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:786699'),
  ('533456998463897424', 'Ruby & Quentin', 2003, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Francis Veber, Luciano Tovoli, Christopher Gachet', 'Francis Veber', 'Gérard Depardieu, Jean Reno, Richard Berry, André Dussollier, Jean-Pierre Malo, Leonor Varela, Jean-Michel Noirey, Laurent Gamelon', null, 'After hiding his loot and getting thrown in jail, brooding outlaw Ruby befriends Quentin, a dim-witted and garrulous giant. After Quentin botches a solo escape attempt, they make a break together. Unable to shake the clumsy Quentin, Ruby is forced to take him along as he pursues his former partners in crime to avenge the death of the woman he loved and get to the money.', 'After hiding his loot and getting thrown in jail, brooding outlaw Ruby befriends Quentin, a dim-witted and garrulous giant. After Quentin botches a solo escape attempt, they make a break together. Unable to shake the clumsy Quentin, Ruby is forced to take him along as he pursues his former partners in crime to avenge the death of the woman he loved and get to the money.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cVmCfQJ1U744FsWWJmeK5bujy2d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:7229'),
  ('286975156248251167', 'Ruby Bridges', 1998, 'Drama, Family, History, TV Movie', 'John Simmons, Euzhan Palcy, Rick Clark', 'Toni Ann Johnson', 'Chaz Monet, Michael Beach, Penelope Ann Miller, Lela Rochon, Kevin Pollak, Jean Louisa Kelly, Peter Francis James, Diana Scarwid', 'PG', 'When six-year-old Ruby Bridges is chosen to be the first African-American to integrate her local elementary school, she is subjected to the true ugliness of racism for the first time.', 'When six-year-old Ruby Bridges is chosen to be the first African-American to integrate her local elementary school, she is subjected to the true ugliness of racism for the first time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kMZzzR05SvMLLxzYN0kzKNUW30h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:96715'),
  ('281450477432853150', 'Ruby Cairo', 1992, 'Mystery, Thriller', 'Graeme Clifford, Aristidis Nikoloudis, László Kovács', 'Robert Dillon, Michael Thomas', 'Andie MacDowell, Liam Neeson, Viggo Mortensen, Jack Thompson, Paul Spencer, Chad Power, Monica Mikala, Kaelynn Craddick', 'PG-13', 'Baseball cards and a food-aid worker help a woman follow her shady husband''s money trail around the world.', 'Baseball cards and a food-aid worker help a woman follow her shady husband''s money trail around the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4K5XRQrCfALbGoLBsJb7hUwDZGV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69035'),
  ('524825112096277358', 'Ruby Gentry', 1952, 'Drama, Romance', 'King Vidor, Russell Harlan', 'Silvia Richards', 'Jennifer Jones, Charlton Heston, Karl Malden, Tom Tully, James Anderson, Josephine Hutchinson, Phyllis Avery, Herbert Heyes', 'NR', 'A sexy but poor young girl marries a rich man she doesn''t love, but carries a torch for another man.', 'A sexy but poor young girl marries a rich man she doesn''t love, but carries a torch for another man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bFFDqnL6mK2epcaFb1BNInKpq8N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50085'),
  ('99748636845602356', 'Ruby Gillman, Teenage Kraken', 2023, 'Animation, Family, Fantasy, Comedy', 'Faryn Pearl, Kirk DeMicco, Michael Kevin Murphy', 'Pam Brady, Brian C. Brown, Elliott DiGuiseppi', 'Lana Condor, Toni Collette, Annie Murphy, Sam Richardson, Liza Koshy, Will Forte, Colman Domingo, Jaboukie Young-White', 'PG', 'Ruby Gillman, a sweet and awkward high school student, discovers she''s a direct descendant of the warrior kraken queens. The kraken are sworn to protect the oceans of the world against the vain, power-hungry mermaids. Destined to inherit the throne from her commanding grandmother, Ruby must use her newfound powers to protect those she loves most.', 'Ruby Gillman, a sweet and awkward high school student, discovers she''s a direct descendant of the warrior kraken queens. The kraken are sworn to protect the oceans of the world against the vain, power-hungry mermaids. Destined to inherit the throne from her commanding grandmother, Ruby must use her newfound powers to protect those she loves most.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8ChIb3WzYAcza1vrXR56v510MWk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1040148'),
  ('1075449482143899231', 'Ruby Herring Mysteries: Prediction Murder', 2020, 'Mystery, TV Movie', 'Shawn Seifert, David Heimbecker, Bill Mizel', 'Andrea Canning', 'Taylor Cole, Stephen Huszar, Jason Cermak, Courtney Richter, Jerry Trimble, Teagan Vincze, James Kot, Chelsey Reist', null, 'When crime reporter Ruby Herring receives clues to a murder that happened five years earlier involving a local psychic, she joins forces with Detective Jake Killian to help crack the case.', 'When crime reporter Ruby Herring receives clues to a murder that happened five years earlier involving a local psychic, she joins forces with Detective Jake Killian to help crack the case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/41FDwR0pnYZSmf5SBLkh3MBg2IV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:681632'),
  ('639548655459190927', 'Ruby in Paradise', 1993, 'Drama, Romance', 'Victor Nuñez, Alex Vlacos, Jennifer Fong', 'Victor Nuñez', 'Ashley Judd, Todd Field, Bentley Mitchum, Dorothy Lyman, Allison Dean, Betsy Douds, Felicia Hernández, Divya Satia', 'R', 'Reeling from her mother''s recent death, Ruby Lee Gissing relocates to Florida to start anew. After finding a job at a souvenir store, Ruby becomes friends with the shop''s owner, Mildred Chambers, and slowly acclimates to her new surroundings. Before long, she''s juggling the affections of Mildred''s Lothario son, Ricky, and the good-natured Mike. As she wavers between Ricky and Mike, Ruby also tries to come to terms with her past.', 'Reeling from her mother''s recent death, Ruby Lee Gissing relocates to Florida to start anew. After finding a job at a souvenir store, Ruby becomes friends with the shop''s owner, Mildred Chambers, and slowly acclimates to her new surroundings. Before long, she''s juggling the affections of Mildred''s Lothario son, Ricky, and the good-natured Mike. As she wavers between Ricky and Mike, Ruby also tries to come to terms with her past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gk0vbIVYwpXxSf1wQbS2r9IsBoV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47889'),
  ('133423988089264445', 'Ruby Is Dead', 2017, 'Crime, Drama, TV Movie', 'Laurent Tuel', 'Sébastien Mounier', 'Mélanie Doutey, Karole Rocher, Olivier Loustau, Lubna Azabal, Grégory Gadebois, Michel Vuillermoz, Aurélien Recoing, Michaël Abiteboul', null, 'The body of a teenager is found in a river.', 'The body of a teenager is found in a river.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jCOmVx1qZK6DIXBcay9vR7zeYVI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:461189'),
  ('1148754808218815191', 'Ruby Red', 2013, 'Fantasy, Drama, Romance', 'Felix Fuchssteiner, Sonja Rom', 'Katharina Schöde', 'Maria Ehrich, Jannis Niewöhner, Laura Berlin, Uwe Kockisch, Josefine Preuß, Florian Bartholomäi, Katharina Thalbach, Veronica Ferres', null, 'On her 16th birthday, Gwendolyn Shepherd finds out that instead of her cousin, she has inherited a rare gene that allows her to travel through time.', 'On her 16th birthday, Gwendolyn Shepherd finds out that instead of her cousin, she has inherited a rare gene that allows her to travel through time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lCfUO2be7jlskyTXRnf1bQtdIes.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:175774'),
  ('540280657153429476', 'Ruby Sparks', 2012, 'Comedy, Romance, Fantasy, Drama', 'Jonathan Dayton, Valerie Faris, Matthew Libatique', 'Zoe Kazan', 'Paul Dano, Zoe Kazan, Chris Messina, Annette Bening, Antonio Banderas, Alia Shawkat, Deborah Ann Woll, Steve Coogan', 'R', 'Calvin is a young novelist who achieved phenomenal success early in his career but is now struggling with his writing – as well as his romantic life. Finally, he makes a breakthrough and creates a character named Ruby who inspires him. When Calvin finds Ruby, in the flesh, sitting on his couch about a week later, he is completely flabbergasted that his words have turned into a living, breathing person.', 'Calvin is a young novelist who achieved phenomenal success early in his career but is now struggling with his writing – as well as his romantic life. Finally, he makes a breakthrough and creates a character named Ruby who inspires him. When Calvin finds Ruby, in the flesh, sitting on his couch about a week later, he is completely flabbergasted that his words have turned into a living, breathing person.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zELurt0GVRkR5X5ymuk7KXUxhC8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:103332'),
  ('652779114491498854', 'Ruckus', 1981, 'Thriller, Drama, Action, Comedy', 'Max Kleven, Walter Scott, Don Burgess', 'Max Kleven', 'Dirk Benedict, Linda Blair, Richard Farnsworth, Matt Clark, Jon Van Ness, Taylor Lacher, Ben Johnson, Clifford A. Pellow', 'PG', 'Madoc County is a quiet and peaceful place until vagrant Kyle Hanson arrives. The people of Madoc County are repelled by his appearance and want to chase him out of the city. Unfortunately for them, Kyle Hanson is a former Vietnam elite soldier and he uses his skills to fight back.', 'Madoc County is a quiet and peaceful place until vagrant Kyle Hanson arrives. The people of Madoc County are repelled by his appearance and want to chase him out of the city. Unfortunately for them, Kyle Hanson is a former Vietnam elite soldier and he uses his skills to fight back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wqR8v4EKUhz6Zvcl4YZe4QOmc2T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47550'),
  ('761506437223106151', 'Rudderless', 2014, 'Music, Drama, Comedy', 'William H. Macy, Eric Lin, Rachel Jensen', 'William H. Macy, Jeff Robison, Casey Twenter', 'Billy Crudup, Anton Yelchin, Felicity Huffman, Selena Gomez, Miles Heizer, Alexandra Lovelace, Laurence Fishburne, William H. Macy', 'R', 'A grieving father in a downward spiral stumbles across a box of his recently deceased son''s demo tapes and lyrics. Shocked by the discovery of this unknown talent, he forms a band in the hope of finding some catharsis.', 'A grieving father in a downward spiral stumbles across a box of his recently deceased son''s demo tapes and lyrics. Shocked by the discovery of this unknown talent, he forms a band in the hope of finding some catharsis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ka3gEmHph5FTJouSdOOK02Ck6bx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:244403'),
  ('1120754518076243309', 'Rude Awakening', 1989, 'Comedy', 'David Greenwalt, Aaron Russo, Newton Thomas Sigel', 'Neil Levy, Richard LaGravenese', 'Cheech Marin, Eric Roberts, Julie Hagerty, Robert Carradine, Louise Lasser, Buck Henry, Andrea Martin, Cindy Williams', 'R', 'In the later 1960s, two hippies are forced to leave their friends as they are wanted by the FBI, who sees them as criminals. They hide in the jungle for 20 years, secluded from the outside world. In the later 1980s, the find out that a secret war is about to start in the US, and decide to return to New York to tell someone about it.', 'In the later 1960s, two hippies are forced to leave their friends as they are wanted by the FBI, who sees them as criminals. They hide in the jungle for 20 years, secluded from the outside world. In the later 1980s, the find out that a secret war is about to start in the US, and decide to return to New York to tell someone about it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3i6wviquq8F8hTVAGdMOXBwmtGX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24254'),
  ('286893095654798526', 'Rude Boy', 1980, 'Drama, Music, Documentary', 'Jack Hazan, David Mingay, Jack Hazan', 'Ray Gange, David Mingay', 'Ray Gange, Joe Strummer, Topper Headon, Paul Simonon, Mick Jones, Jimmy Pursey, Caroline Coon, Johnny Green', 'R', 'Rude Boy is a semi-documentary, part character study, part ''rockumentary'', featuring a British punk band, The Clash. The script includes the story of a fictional fan juxtposed with actual public events of the day, including political demonstrations and Clash concerts.', 'Rude Boy is a semi-documentary, part character study, part ''rockumentary'', featuring a British punk band, The Clash. The script includes the story of a fictional fan juxtposed with actual public events of the day, including political demonstrations and Clash concerts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/46tzKLP9Huzjf1L09qEEdvNAdx0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27930'),
  ('610726030600007462', 'Rudo & Cursi', 2008, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Carlos Cuarón, Adam Kimmel', 'Carlos Cuarón', 'Gael García Bernal, Diego Luna, Guillermo Francella, Dolores Heredia, Adriana Paz, Jessica Mas, Salvador Zerboni, Tania Esmeralda Aguilar', 'R', 'Tato and Beto are poor stepbrothers living on a banana plantation in Mexico. Both are talented soccer players, but their dreams lay elsewhere: tone-deaf Tato wants to be a singer, while Beto is content to remain on the plantation. One day, a sports agent sees the two young men playing soccer and offers to take one of them to Mexico City for a chance at sports stardom.', 'Tato and Beto are poor stepbrothers living on a banana plantation in Mexico. Both are talented soccer players, but their dreams lay elsewhere: tone-deaf Tato wants to be a singer, while Beto is content to remain on the plantation. One day, a sports agent sees the two young men playing soccer and offers to take one of them to Mexico City for a chance at sports stardom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2J3puhJdawCVeVKLDXTpgY4TAl3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4786'),
  ('633161365528091694', 'Rudolf the Black Cat', 2016, 'Comedy, Animation, Adventure, Family', 'Kunihiko Yuyama, Motonori Sakakibara', 'Yoichi Kato', 'Ryohei Suzuki, Mao Inoue, Norito Yashima, Nana Mizuki, Rio Sasaki, Arata Furuta, Sandayuu Dokumamushi', 'G', 'Rudolf, a black stray cat, is suddenly separated from his beloved master. He unexpectedly wakes up in a long-distance truck that takes him to metropolis Tokyo. There, he meets Ippai-attena, a big boss cat feared by everyone in town. Unable to return home, Rudolf starts a life as a stray with Ippai-attena, but Ippai-attena isn''t all that he seems to be.', 'Rudolf, a black stray cat, is suddenly separated from his beloved master. He unexpectedly wakes up in a long-distance truck that takes him to metropolis Tokyo. There, he meets Ippai-attena, a big boss cat feared by everyone in town. Unable to return home, Rudolf starts a life as a stray with Ippai-attena, but Ippai-attena isn''t all that he seems to be.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/54qg3GgKYUM8vdFSUbkdrNo7czt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:429005'),
  ('1108142580025108154', 'Rudolph and Frosty''s Christmas in July', 1979, 'Animation, Fantasy, Family, TV Movie', 'Jules Bass, Arthur Rankin, Jr.', 'Romeo Muller', 'Red Buttons, Ethel Merman, Mickey Rooney, Alan Sues, Jackie Vernon, Shelley Winters, Paul Frees, Billie Mae Richards', 'G', 'Winterbolt is trying to make the North Pole his evil wonderland, and it is up to Frosty the Snowman, Rudolph the Red-Nosed Reindeer and others to stop him.', 'Winterbolt is trying to make the North Pole his evil wonderland, and it is up to Frosty the Snowman, Rudolph the Red-Nosed Reindeer and others to stop him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v24SYZqlfvzvjyQpt6MtQLQNJ0u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40246'),
  ('328793098138426119', 'Rudolph the Red-Nosed Reindeer', 1948, 'Animation, Family, Fantasy', 'Max Fleischer, Charles Schettler, Samuel Benavie', null, 'Paul Wing', null, 'Classic holiday tale about a flying reindeer who helps Santa Claus. An interpretation of Robert L. May''s 1939 Christmas poem, this animated short was created to run in theaters to advertise Montgomery Ward department stores, publisher of the original story.', 'Classic holiday tale about a flying reindeer who helps Santa Claus. An interpretation of Robert L. May''s 1939 Christmas poem, this animated short was created to run in theaters to advertise Montgomery Ward department stores, publisher of the original story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sDxEaJoFRHcI7kdDE5c8WSMofPi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81294'),
  ('574118488347925812', 'Rudolph the Red-Nosed Reindeer', 1964, 'Animation, Family, TV Movie, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Larry Roemer, Maury Laws', 'Romeo Muller', 'Burl Ives, Billie Mae Richards, Larry D. Mann, Stan Francis, Paul Kligman, Janis Orenstein, Alfie Scopp, Carl Banas', 'G', 'Sam the snowman tells us the story of a young red-nosed reindeer who, after being ousted from the reindeer games because of his glowing nose, teams up with Hermey, an elf who wants to be a dentist, and Yukon Cornelius, the prospector. They run into the Abominable Snowman and find a whole island of misfit toys. Rudolph vows to see if he can get Santa to help the toys, and he goes back to the North Pole on Christmas Eve. But Santa''s sleigh is fogged in. But when Santa looks over Rudolph, he gets a very bright idea...', 'Sam the snowman tells us the story of a young red-nosed reindeer who, after being ousted from the reindeer games because of his glowing nose, teams up with Hermey, an elf who wants to be a dentist, and Yukon Cornelius, the prospector. They run into the Abominable Snowman and find a whole island of misfit toys. Rudolph vows to see if he can get Santa to help the toys, and he goes back to the North Pole on Christmas Eve. But Santa''s sleigh is fogged in. But when Santa looks over Rudolph, he gets a very bright idea...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xjAElUhXuc7zFJPj3qUHjcySNsE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13382'),
  ('878764931559099011', 'Rudolph the Red-Nosed Reindeer & the Island of Misfit Toys', 2001, 'Animation, Family', 'William R. Kowalchuk Jr.', 'Lee Tockar', 'Rick Moranis, Kathleen Barr, Jamie Lee Curtis, Richard Dreyfuss, Scott McNeil, Garry Chalk, Elizabeth Carol Savenkoff, Colin Murdock', 'NR', 'When the mysterious Toy Taker grabs all of Santa''s toys, it looks like the children will miss out on Christmas. But everyone''s favorite reindeer, Rudolph, comes to the rescue with his lovable friends: Hermey the elf, Yukon Cornelius the grizzly prospector, the abominable snow monster Bumbles and Rudolph''s very special friend Clarice. Together, they promise Santa they''ll track down Toy Taker and rescue Santa''s toy. Their incredible quest takes them on a wild adventure with Rudolph''s red nose leading the way!', 'When the mysterious Toy Taker grabs all of Santa''s toys, it looks like the children will miss out on Christmas. But everyone''s favorite reindeer, Rudolph, comes to the rescue with his lovable friends: Hermey the elf, Yukon Cornelius the grizzly prospector, the abominable snow monster Bumbles and Rudolph''s very special friend Clarice. Together, they promise Santa they''ll track down Toy Taker and rescue Santa''s toy. Their incredible quest takes them on a wild adventure with Rudolph''s red nose leading the way!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sZEfq7g2LUNxI0axgWm0cwQ41gl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43575'),
  ('202605848647172312', 'Rudolph the Red-Nosed Reindeer: The Movie', 1998, 'Animation, Family, Music', 'William R. Kowalchuk Jr.', 'Robert L. May, Michael Aschner', 'Eric Pospisil, Kathleen Barr, John Goodman, Whoopi Goldberg, Debbie Reynolds, Bob Newhart, Eric Idle, Richard Simmons', 'G', 'Young Rudolph suffers a childhood accident that sees his nose turn from the publicly accepted norm of black to a glowing red colour. His parents worry about him getting teased, and indeed he does in the end. When he is beaten in the reindeer games by his rival for a doe he fancies, Rudolph runs away and moves into a cave with Slyly the Fox. However can he overcome his fear and reach his true potential?', 'Young Rudolph suffers a childhood accident that sees his nose turn from the publicly accepted norm of black to a glowing red colour. His parents worry about him getting teased, and indeed he does in the end. When he is beaten in the reindeer games by his rival for a doe he fancies, Rudolph runs away and moves into a cave with Slyly the Fox. However can he overcome his fear and reach his true potential?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pNwHtfMVcqmWat1MfMJ9XSVBBXR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33719'),
  ('792886788535823207', 'Rudolph''s Shiny New Year', 1977, 'Animation, Fantasy, Family, TV Movie, Comedy', 'Jules Bass, Arthur Rankin, Jr.', 'Romeo Muller', 'Red Skelton, Frank Gorshin, Morey Amsterdam, Harold Peary, Paul Frees, Billie Mae Richards, Don Messick, June Foray', 'G', 'Rudolph must find Happy, the baby new year, before the midnight of New Year''s Eve.', 'Rudolph must find Happy, the baby new year, before the midnight of New Year''s Eve.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v4T0lazUxH5yBjzG5jL90RjXJGB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30059'),
  ('113608447527268925', 'Rudraksh', 2004, 'Action, Fantasy', 'Mani Shankar', null, 'Sanjay Dutt, Suniel Shetty, Bipasha Basu, Isha Koppikar, Kabir Bedi, Raj Zutshi, Veerendra Saxena, Nigaar Khan', null, 'Good and sinful are two sides of a same coin. If good grows in strength so does evil. Finally there comes a point when one must overcome the other. Dr. Gayatri (Bipasha Basu) is an Indian American paranormal researcher at University of California, researching esoteric practices like voodoo, spirit possession, magic and healing powers. She seeks the hidden knowledge that goes into such practices, the knowledge that cannot be explained by science or logic. Her search for answers brings her and her team of scientists to India. In India she comes across an uncommon man named Varun (Sanjay Dutt) who is gifted with special intuitive and healing powers which he claims to have developed through meditation. He can affect people''s minds through his mental powers. He is a blend of Indian philosophy and modern culture, a master at martial arts and a devotee of Lord Hanuman. He heals people by absorbing their pain. He worships and trains by day, while working as a bouncer at a club by night.', 'Good and sinful are two sides of a same coin. If good grows in strength so does evil. Finally there comes a point when one must overcome the other. Dr. Gayatri (Bipasha Basu) is an Indian American paranormal researcher at University of California, researching esoteric practices like voodoo, spirit possession, magic and healing powers. She seeks the hidden knowledge that goes into such practices, the knowledge that cannot be explained by science or logic. Her search for answers brings her and her team of scientists to India. In India she comes across an uncommon man named Varun (Sanjay Dutt) who is gifted with special intuitive and healing powers which he claims to have developed through meditation. He can affect people''s minds through his mental powers. He is a blend of Indian philosophy and modern culture, a master at martial arts and a devotee of Lord Hanuman. He heals people by absorbing their pain. He worships and trains by day, while working as a bouncer at a club by night.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3sE0OIkg0qUIpUcrJAVWXTdQP3Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:361866'),
  ('343595932510820740', 'Rudy', 1993, 'Drama, History', 'David Anspaugh, Oliver Wood, Sam Hoffman', 'Angelo Pizzo', 'Sean Astin, Jon Favreau, Ned Beatty, Lili Taylor, Charles S. Dutton, Vince Vaughn, Greta Lind, Christopher Reed', 'PG', 'Rudy grew up in a steel mill town where most people ended up working, but wanted to play football at Notre Dame instead. There were only a couple of problems. His grades were a little low, his athletic skills were poor, and he was only half the size of the other players. But he had the drive and the spirit of 5 people and has set his sights upon joining the team.', 'Rudy grew up in a steel mill town where most people ended up working, but wanted to play football at Notre Dame instead. There were only a couple of problems. His grades were a little low, his athletic skills were poor, and he was only half the size of the other players. But he had the drive and the spirit of 5 people and has set his sights upon joining the team.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fAbfTCRpjHe2rprXBly55KL1dL9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14534'),
  ('845298518569936233', 'Rudy, the Racing Pig', 1995, 'Comedy, Family', 'Peter Timm, Fritz Seemann', 'Ulrich Limmer, Uwe Timm', 'Ulrich Mühe, Iris Berben, Cora Sabrina Grimm, Kristina Pauls, Constantin von Jascheroff, Edgar Selge, Karl Lieffen, Angelika Milster', null, 'Flat-dwelling urban family win a pig in a raffle, and decide to keep it. They lose their flat (no pets allowed) but eventually Rudi the pig makes good.', 'Flat-dwelling urban family win a pig in a raffle, and decide to keep it. They lose their flat (no pets allowed) but eventually Rudi the pig makes good.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cTC8wSdwIsDjypjYDEIvKZlKA7b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9284'),
  ('687257603419903708', 'Rudy: The Return of the Racing Pig', 2007, 'Action, Comedy, Family', 'Peter Timm, Achim Poulheim', 'Peter Timm, Karsten Willutzki', 'Sebastian Koch, Maurice Teichert, Sophie von Kessel, Sina Richardt, Dominique Horwitz, Ludger Burmann, Maria Ehrich, Tom Hinterthan', null, 'Up to now, Nickel (9) and his single dad Thomas have been managing very well together. Then Nickel goes on a school excursion and brings the little piglet Rudy back with him in his rucksack. Once he´s home, he makes a terrifying discovery: dad has a girlfriend! Worse yet, she´s moved in with him and brought her daughter Felicitas (12) along! Nickel makes a deal with Thomas: if those two stay, then so can Rudy. When life becomes unbearable for Nickel, he flees with Rudy to ‘Porkland’, followed by Feli and pursued by two dumb crooks. It’s the beginning of an adventure that ends in the swamps of the Oder Valley, where Rudi saves the lives of the two children and finds a new home.', 'Up to now, Nickel (9) and his single dad Thomas have been managing very well together. Then Nickel goes on a school excursion and brings the little piglet Rudy back with him in his rucksack. Once he´s home, he makes a terrifying discovery: dad has a girlfriend! Worse yet, she´s moved in with him and brought her daughter Felicitas (12) along! Nickel makes a deal with Thomas: if those two stay, then so can Rudy. When life becomes unbearable for Nickel, he flees with Rudy to ‘Porkland’, followed by Feli and pursued by two dumb crooks. It’s the beginning of an adventure that ends in the swamps of the Oder Valley, where Rudi saves the lives of the two children and finds a new home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Bf7NtgbRchl25rEEG11OXFvOc7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43730'),
  ('626289011325732599', 'Rue de Paris', 1959, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Denys de La Patellière, Louis Page', 'Denys de La Patellière, Michel Audiard', 'Jean Gabin, Marie-José Nat, Claude Brasseur, Renée Faure, Roger Dumas, Paul Frankeur, Roger Tréville, Dominique Page', null, 'While Henri was a POW during the war, his wife passed away, and he returned to face the challenges of bringing up three children alone. Henri may get drunk and angry at times, but he also has a better side that will not stay buried.', 'While Henri was a POW during the war, his wife passed away, and he returned to face the challenges of bringing up three children alone. Henri may get drunk and angry at times, but he also has a better side that will not stay buried.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2xk76wLixK5PQqRTW5kr6NnEape.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74708'),
  ('985640026081153423', 'Rue Mandar', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Idit Cebula', null, 'Sandrine Kiberlain, Richard Berry, Emmanuelle Devos, Lionel Abelanski, Micheline Presle, Jackie Berroyer', null, 'When their beloved Polish immigrant mother passes away, the sisters Emma (Kiberlain) and Rosemonde (Devos), and their brother, Charles (Berry), are obliged to deal with the personal and physical aftereffects, which include the cozy, old fashioned flat where she lived on the movie’s titular street (located in the heart of Paris’ chic 2nd arrondissement).', 'When their beloved Polish immigrant mother passes away, the sisters Emma (Kiberlain) and Rosemonde (Devos), and their brother, Charles (Berry), are obliged to deal with the personal and physical aftereffects, which include the cozy, old fashioned flat where she lived on the movie’s titular street (located in the heart of Paris’ chic 2nd arrondissement).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pHEjrOw2F11bjON4dUXy8DpN78w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:161074'),
  ('1084652973288347904', 'Ruffiano and Sweeteeth', 1997, 'Family, Fantasy', 'Karel Smyczek, Jan Malíř, Milena Kropáčková', 'Karel Smyczek', 'Jiří Strach, Barbora Seidlová, Pavel Zedníček, Arnošt Goldflam, Marián Labuda, Jiří Pecha, Jiří Lábus, Miroslav Táborský', null, 'Famed outlaw Lotrando sends his son to a strict Catholic boarding school to learn manners, but the boy becomes too polite to lead the band. When they inadvertently arrive in a sultanate where the princess Zubeida lies gravely ill and are mistaken for physicians, father and son must overcome their inexperience and imposture to heal her and save the realm.', 'Famed outlaw Lotrando sends his son to a strict Catholic boarding school to learn manners, but the boy becomes too polite to lead the band. When they inadvertently arrive in a sultanate where the princess Zubeida lies gravely ill and are mistaken for physicians, father and son must overcome their inexperience and imposture to heal her and save the realm.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5ul56wOE6rX86HoMtfYQEKvgK3K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77595'),
  ('1118789798559472704', 'Rufmord', 2018, 'Drama, Crime, TV Movie', 'Martin Langer, Viviane Andereggen', 'Britta Stöckle, Claudia Kaufmann', 'Rosalie Thomass, Ulrike C. Tscharre, Johanna Gastdorf, Johann von Bülow, Lilly Forgách, Katja Lechthaler, Shenja Lacher, Verena Altenberger', null, 'Luisa loves her teaching profession and is popular with her students because of her fresh teaching methods. But shortly after she refused to give a student a high school recommendation, a nude photo of her appears on her school''s website. Her life becomes a gauntlet. Nowhere is she safe from sexual reprisals, her elementary school leaves her on leave and the police investigation leads nowhere. Then the young woman disappears. Traces in her house indicate a violent crime. Was Luisa the murder victim after the infamous slander?', 'Luisa loves her teaching profession and is popular with her students because of her fresh teaching methods. But shortly after she refused to give a student a high school recommendation, a nude photo of her appears on her school''s website. Her life becomes a gauntlet. Nowhere is she safe from sexual reprisals, her elementary school leaves her on leave and the police investigation leads nowhere. Then the young woman disappears. Traces in her house indicate a violent crime. Was Luisa the murder victim after the infamous slander?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q5KReSaSeypPbOydNtixO3SW9Cv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:516910'),
  ('223363024961761956', 'Rufus', 2016, 'TV Movie, Family, Comedy', 'Savage Steve Holland, Thomas M. Harting', 'Bill Motz, Bob Roth', 'Davis Cleveland, Jace Norman, Lisa Durupt, Noel Johansen, Haley Tju, Chad Riley, Yvonne Chapman, Paul Belsito', 'G', 'Manny has moved to a new school, and it''s not easy to fit in. After wishing he had more friends, Manny finds a mysterious collar and puts it on Rufus, the family dog. Suddenly, Rufus turns into a boy! Manny''s not sure what to do, so he enrolls Rufus in school. When the other students notice Rufus''s silly dog antics -- chasing squirrels, eating without utensils, asking for belly rubs, and catching a soccer ball with his mouth -- he immediately becomes the most popular kid around. Manny is jealous of his new best friend but eventually learns that a dog''s loyalty to his owner always comes first.', 'Manny has moved to a new school, and it''s not easy to fit in. After wishing he had more friends, Manny finds a mysterious collar and puts it on Rufus, the family dog. Suddenly, Rufus turns into a boy! Manny''s not sure what to do, so he enrolls Rufus in school. When the other students notice Rufus''s silly dog antics -- chasing squirrels, eating without utensils, asking for belly rubs, and catching a soccer ball with his mouth -- he immediately becomes the most popular kid around. Manny is jealous of his new best friend but eventually learns that a dog''s loyalty to his owner always comes first.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hrkulam0zPHsvt6oC6worZP1SdI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:378221'),
  ('905739237534689927', 'Rufus 2', 2017, 'TV Movie, Family, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Thomas M. Harting, Savage Steve Holland', 'Bill Motz, Bob Roth', 'Jace Norman, Davis Cleveland, Jade Pettyjohn, Kalvin Olafson, Lisa Durupt, Amitai Marmorstein, Wesley Salter, Haley Tju', 'G', 'Rufus is a dog but turns into a human with a pendant. He meets a girl named Kat who asks him to go out. Kat is a cat who can also turn into a human as well.', 'Rufus is a dog but turns into a human with a pendant. He meets a girl named Kat who asks him to go out. Kat is a cat who can also turn into a human as well.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bcAWtUu09ylQDhDKrKkAW9S7lA4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:435737'),
  ('605325988311637514', 'Rugantino', 1973, 'Comedy', 'Pasquale Festa Campanile, Gastone Di Giovanni, Monica Venturini', 'Pasquale Festa Campanile, Massimo Franciosa', 'Adriano Celentano, Claudia Mori, Toni Ucci, Maria Grazia Spina, Riccardo Garrone, Renzo Palmer, Sergio Tofano, Guglielmo Spoletini', null, 'A beautiful girl Rosina lives In Rome. Her husband is strong as a bull and jealous as Shakespeare''s Othello. Once the husband of Rosina kills a wealthy aristocrat, who sang the serenade to his wife, and now he is hiding from justice.', 'A beautiful girl Rosina lives In Rome. Her husband is strong as a bull and jealous as Shakespeare''s Othello. Once the husband of Rosina kills a wealthy aristocrat, who sang the serenade to his wife, and now he is hiding from justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cPvAJNIqmlCGnzdHfeYIcEPuWPG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50196'),
  ('412695298992616770', 'Rugged Bear', 1953, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Jack Hannah', null, 'Clarence Nash, James MacDonald', 'NR', 'It''s a peaceful day in a national forest...until hunting season begins at which point all the bears hide out in a cave but one bear, Humphrey, doesn''t make it. He hides out in a cabin and, seeing hunter Donald Duck approaching, hides the bearskin rug in a trunk and takes its place. Masquerading as the rug tends to be an unpleasant experience for Humphrey as Donald opens nuts and bottles in his mouth and washes him in the washer/dryer among other things. Finally, when hunting season ends and Donald leaves, Humphrey is relieved but makes a startling discovery.', 'It''s a peaceful day in a national forest...until hunting season begins at which point all the bears hide out in a cave but one bear, Humphrey, doesn''t make it. He hides out in a cabin and, seeing hunter Donald Duck approaching, hides the bearskin rug in a trunk and takes its place. Masquerading as the rug tends to be an unpleasant experience for Humphrey as Donald opens nuts and bottles in his mouth and washes him in the washer/dryer among other things. Finally, when hunting season ends and Donald leaves, Humphrey is relieved but makes a startling discovery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vyJWO5vxfcnOwacdiy2sR3c4N2T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67165'),
  ('521627790041453911', 'Ruggles of Red Gap', 1935, 'Comedy', 'Leo McCarey, Alfred Gilks', 'Harlan Thompson, Walter DeLeon', 'Charles Laughton, Mary Boland, Charles Ruggles, Zasu Pitts, Roland Young, Leila Hyams, Maude Eburne, Lucien Littlefield', 'NR', 'In this comedy of an Englishman stranded in a sea of barbaric Americans, Marmaduke Ruggles - a gentleman''s gentleman and butler to an Earl - is lost in a poker game to an uncouth American cattle baron. Ruggles'' life is turned upside down as he''s taken to the USA, is gradually assimilated into American life, accidentally becomes a local celebrity, and falls in love along the way.', 'In this comedy of an Englishman stranded in a sea of barbaric Americans, Marmaduke Ruggles - a gentleman''s gentleman and butler to an Earl - is lost in a poker game to an uncouth American cattle baron. Ruggles'' life is turned upside down as he''s taken to the USA, is gradually assimilated into American life, accidentally becomes a local celebrity, and falls in love along the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/57KChzqCoDDsNGqJzsv10NzOwod.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36006'),
  ('510039816712692428', 'Rugrats Go Wild', 2003, 'Family, Comedy, Adventure, Animation, Fantasy', 'John Eng, Norton Virgien, Priit Pärn', 'Kate Boutilier', 'E. G. Daily, Nancy Cartwright, Kath Soucie, Dionne Quan, Tim Curry, Joe Alaskey, Tress MacNeille, Michael Bell', 'PG', 'When the Rugrats find themselves stranded on a deserted island, they meet the Thornberrys, a family who agrees to help them escape.', 'When the Rugrats find themselves stranded on a deserted island, they meet the Thornberrys, a family who agrees to help them escape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hpVpXRNY2IsU0xvfXtYOxu0QDwc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20694'),
  ('239832193204741961', 'Rugrats in Paris: The Movie', 2000, 'Family, Comedy, Adventure, Animation, Romance', 'Stig Bergqvist, Paul Demeyer', 'J. David Stem, David N. Weiss, Jill Gorey', 'E. G. Daily, Christine Cavanaugh, Cheryl Chase, Susan Sarandon, John Lithgow, Tara Strong, Kath Soucie, Michael Bell', 'G', 'A group of rambunctious toddlers travel a trip to Paris. As they journey from the Eiffel Tower to Notre Dame, they learn new lessons about trust, loyalty and love.', 'A group of rambunctious toddlers travel a trip to Paris. As they journey from the Eiffel Tower to Notre Dame, they learn new lessons about trust, loyalty and love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/grIL8mvfLznaWsv7EEEPhCpkH81.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16340'),
  ('1149495875061687589', 'Rugrats: All Growed Up', 2001, 'Family, TV Movie, Comedy, Animation', 'Anthony Bell', 'Gábor Csupó, Paul Germain, Eryk Casemiro', 'Christine Cavanaugh, Cheryl Chase, Kath Soucie, Tara Strong, Cree Summer, Tress MacNeille, Melanie Chartoff, Jack Riley', null, 'Will Tommy still be the gang''s fearless leader? Will Chuckie survive his first "crush"? Will Angelica still be underhanded? The answers are here as the entire Rugrats gang embarks on one of their most fantastic adventures yet.', 'Will Tommy still be the gang''s fearless leader? Will Chuckie survive his first "crush"? Will Angelica still be underhanded? The answers are here as the entire Rugrats gang embarks on one of their most fantastic adventures yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rTDny0lgKKUTqgmfGXmnmV8K8uv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55289'),
  ('1014159773935273642', 'Ruin Me', 2017, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Preston DeFrancis, Jesse Eisenhardt', 'Preston DeFrancis, Trysta A. Bissett', 'Marcienne Dwyer, Matt Dellapina, Chris Hill, Eva Hamilton, John Odom, Samuel Ashdown, Cameron Gordon, Rocky Rector', null, 'Six strangers sign up for a slasher movie re-enactment, in which they are dropped into the woods and pursued by knife wielding assassins. But when the body count becomes real, Alexandra must unravel the mystery of who is responsible if she wants to survive the ordeal.', 'Six strangers sign up for a slasher movie re-enactment, in which they are dropped into the woods and pursued by knife wielding assassins. But when the body count becomes real, Alexandra must unravel the mystery of who is responsible if she wants to survive the ordeal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lhP3sm0RaDCPYBbXaFDkq8hvHpm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:401272'),
  ('5354106208648589', 'Rule 34', 2023, 'Drama', 'Julia Murat, Léo Bittencourt, Gabriel Bortolini', 'Rafael Lessa, Gabriel Bortolini, Julia Murat', 'Sol Miranda, Lucas Andrade, Lorena Comparato, Isabela Mariotto, Georgette Fadel, Márcio Vito, Raquel Karro, Rodrigo Bolzan', null, 'Simone is a young law student who studies criminal law and advocates for women''s rights. On her free time, she''s a cam girl that makes live sexual performances on the Internet. One night, she watches a video that awakens her interest in BDSM-related activities, leading her into a series of conflicts dominated by violence and eroticism.', 'Simone is a young law student who studies criminal law and advocates for women''s rights. On her free time, she''s a cam girl that makes live sexual performances on the Internet. One night, she watches a video that awakens her interest in BDSM-related activities, leading her into a series of conflicts dominated by violence and eroticism.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bhfHqvpIzxQoXhmpUhn03g8EzFS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:997265'),
  ('324835582124018555', 'Rule Breakers', 2025, 'Drama', 'Bill Guttentag, John Pardue', 'Bill Guttentag, Jason Brown, Elaha Mahboob', 'Nikohl Boosheri, Noorin Gulamgaus, Amber Afzali, Nina Hosseinzadeh, Sara Malal Rowe, Mariam Saraj, Nasser Memarzia, Ali Fazal', 'PG', 'In a nation where educating girls is seen as rebellion, a visionary woman dares to teach young minds to dream. When their innovation draws global attention, their success sparks hope—and opposition. As threats loom and sacrifices are made, their courage and unity ignite a movement that could forever transform the world.', 'In a nation where educating girls is seen as rebellion, a visionary woman dares to teach young minds to dream. When their innovation draws global attention, their success sparks hope—and opposition. As threats loom and sacrifices are made, their courage and unity ignite a movement that could forever transform the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zJ6yH7e7XFsVTbF1gZnERCVeQJn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1379520'),
  ('249618842702776623', 'Rule Number One', 2008, 'Action, Horror', 'Kelvin Tong, Venus Keung', 'Kelvin Tong', 'Shawn Yue Man-Lok, Ekin Cheng Yee-Kin, Stephanie Che Yuen-Yuen, Fiona Xie, Renee Lee Wan, Bill Liu, Gloria Wong Yung, Tsui Hing-Wah', null, 'Rookie Sergeant Lee is injured in a shoot-out and is assigned to the dubious-sounding Miscellaneous Affairs Department (MAD). There, he is paired up with Inspector Wong, a jaded and alcoholic veteran who explains that MAD’s role is to answer supernatural calls. Wong explains MAD’s rule number one - there are no ghosts. For every seemingly inexplicable phenomenon, there is a corresponding scientific and rational explanation.', 'Rookie Sergeant Lee is injured in a shoot-out and is assigned to the dubious-sounding Miscellaneous Affairs Department (MAD). There, he is paired up with Inspector Wong, a jaded and alcoholic veteran who explains that MAD’s role is to answer supernatural calls. Wong explains MAD’s rule number one - there are no ghosts. For every seemingly inexplicable phenomenon, there is a corresponding scientific and rational explanation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7NZcCHuCDzgsSZ13tR2gxjurCEh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52389'),
  ('1140136745571778051', 'Rulers of the City', 1976, 'Crime, Action', 'Fernando Di Leo, Erico Menczer', 'Peter Berling, Fernando Di Leo', 'Jack Palance, Al Cliver, Harry Baer, Gisela Hahn, Enzo Pulcrano, Carmelo Reale, Edmund Purdom, Vittorio Caprioli', null, 'Tony, a mob loan collector, is dissatisfied with his station in life. Though he dreams of one day being rich, he is stuck with the dead-end job of beating up borrowers who fall behind in their payments. After meeting up with Napoli, another mob enforcer who''s just been fired from his job, the two hatch a plan. Together, they will con mob boss Manzari out of a fortune, after which they can retire and live in luxury. Manzari, however, is not about to let them go so easily.', 'Tony, a mob loan collector, is dissatisfied with his station in life. Though he dreams of one day being rich, he is stuck with the dead-end job of beating up borrowers who fall behind in their payments. After meeting up with Napoli, another mob enforcer who''s just been fired from his job, the two hatch a plan. Together, they will con mob boss Manzari out of a fortune, after which they can retire and live in luxury. Manzari, however, is not about to let them go so easily.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/emX3puWQnOtcJXVMI2Bltywfh6G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65320'),
  ('709011603586409430', 'Rules Don''t Apply', 2016, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Eric Richard Lasko, Donald Murphy, Mollie Stallman', 'Warren Beatty', 'Warren Beatty, Lily Collins, Alden Ehrenreich, Matthew Broderick, Annette Bening, Alec Baldwin, Haley Bennett, Candice Bergen', 'PG-13', 'The unconventional love story of an aspiring actress, her ambitious driver, and their eccentric boss, the legendary billionaire Howard Hughes.', 'The unconventional love story of an aspiring actress, her ambitious driver, and their eccentric boss, the legendary billionaire Howard Hughes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y7MlOsOYMFcaG8a29ELRN0jw18T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:291328'),
  ('703053971230256760', 'Rules of Dating', 2005, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Han Jae-rim', 'Go Yun-hui, Han Jae-rim', 'Park Hae-il, Kang Hye-jung, Park Gri-na, Kim Se-dong, Park Jin-woo, Woo Ki-hong, Jung Young-ki, Kim Shin-rock', null, 'Choi arrives at a new high school to work as a student-teacher. During her first day at work, the teacher that she is assigned to work with, Lim, hits on her in a very brash way.', 'Choi arrives at a new high school to work as a student-teacher. During her first day at work, the teacher that she is assigned to work with, Lim, hits on her in a very brash way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6lnUwHq9T2YODXm3owsPf3TYWen.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114661'),
  ('264898564102892753', 'Rules of Engagement', 2000, 'War, Drama', 'William Friedkin, Nicola Pecorini, William A. Fraker', 'Stephen Gaghan', 'Tommy Lee Jones, Samuel L. Jackson, Guy Pearce, Ben Kingsley, Bruce Greenwood, Anne Archer, Blair Underwood, Philip Baker Hall', 'R', 'A Marine Colonel is brought to court-martial after ordering his men to fire on demonstrators surrounding the American embassy in Yemen.', 'A Marine Colonel is brought to court-martial after ordering his men to fire on demonstrators surrounding the American embassy in Yemen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/38iMM0sHOqNz315ApF9bEjT4rFA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10479'),
  ('39099188957753212', 'Rum Runners', 1971, 'Adventure, Comedy', 'Robert Enrico, Jean Boffety', 'Pierre Pelegri', 'Lino Ventura, Brigitte Bardot, Bill Travers, Clive Revill, La Polaca, Jess Hahn, Antonio Casas, Andréas Voutsinas', 'NR', 'During the prohibition era, Cornelius, a bootlegger, is on the run from the American coastguards. He comes across a silent film actress, Linda, on the set of a movie and falls in love with her.', 'During the prohibition era, Cornelius, a bootlegger, is on the run from the American coastguards. He comes across a silent film actress, Linda, on the set of a movie and falls in love with her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iU27k69tPFB39wZ9hivKcuhXBJV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74811'),
  ('799919543665073073', 'Rumba', 2008, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Bruno Romy, Fiona Gordon, Dominique Abel', null, 'Dominique Abel, Fiona Gordon, Bruno Romy, Philippe Martz, Yohan Faure, Claire Dubien, Thérèse Fisher', null, 'Teachers in a rural school, happy couple Fiona and Dom have a common passion: Latin Dancing. One night, after a glorious dance competition, they have a car accident and see their lives turn upside down.', 'Teachers in a rural school, happy couple Fiona and Dom have a common passion: Latin Dancing. One night, after a glorious dance competition, they have a car accident and see their lives turn upside down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iJLXLPUAfifEMXx1FTtZBzAYnYI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51871'),
  ('1097798194704977309', 'Rumba Therapy', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Ludovic Colbeau-Justin, Martin Pavlacky, Louise Fontaine', 'Franck Dubosc', 'Franck Dubosc, Louna Espinosa, Jean-Pierre Darroussin, Marie-Philomène Nga, Catherine Jacob, Marie Vincent, Karina Marimon, Michel Houellebecq', null, 'Tony is a macho middle-aged school bus driver in the provinces with no friends or relations. A sudden heart attack throws him into a tailspin. Tony''s convinced he''s going to die. When his cardiologist warns him : We all need others. Alone, we''re nothing. Tony decides to reconnect with the daughter he abandoned twenty years earlier, when she was just a baby. Still a coward, he''s unable to screw up the courage to actually confront her directly. So he decides to sign up for a dance class she''s teaching in Paris. Incognito, of course. To get to know her gradually… in a desperate attempt to give some meaning to his empty life. In the process, he has more than a few dance steps to learn!', 'Tony is a macho middle-aged school bus driver in the provinces with no friends or relations. A sudden heart attack throws him into a tailspin. Tony''s convinced he''s going to die. When his cardiologist warns him : We all need others. Alone, we''re nothing. Tony decides to reconnect with the daughter he abandoned twenty years earlier, when she was just a baby. Still a coward, he''s unable to screw up the courage to actually confront her directly. So he decides to sign up for a dance class she''s teaching in Paris. Incognito, of course. To get to know her gradually… in a desperate attempt to give some meaning to his empty life. In the process, he has more than a few dance steps to learn!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tPHXxQJaiEHdwEUSidoBrvZ4r3e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:665388'),
  ('151824062203209199', 'Rumble', 2021, 'Animation, Family', 'Michael Jefferies, Hamish Grieve', 'Hamish Grieve, Matt Lieberman', 'Will Arnett, Geraldine Viswanathan, Stephen A. Smith, Terry Crews, Jimmy Tatro, Joe Anoa''i, Rebecca Quin, Tony Danza', 'PG', 'In a world where monster wrestling is a global sport and monsters are superstar athletes, teenage Winnie seeks to follow in her father’s footsteps by coaching a loveable underdog monster into a champion.', 'In a world where monster wrestling is a global sport and monsters are superstar athletes, teenage Winnie seeks to follow in her father’s footsteps by coaching a loveable underdog monster into a champion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3eZRgjfFWTpejRvRKyKe1EKgt9s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:598331'),
  ('395923759941186226', 'Rumble Fish', 1983, 'Crime, Drama, Romance', 'Francis Ford Coppola, Stephen H. Burum, David Valdes', 'S.E. Hinton, Francis Ford Coppola', 'Matt Dillon, Mickey Rourke, Diane Lane, Dennis Hopper, Diana Scarwid, Vincent Spano, Nicolas Cage, Chris Penn', 'R', 'Absent-minded street thug Rusty James struggles to live up to his legendary older brother''s reputation, and longs for the days of gang warfare.', 'Absent-minded street thug Rusty James struggles to live up to his legendary older brother''s reputation, and longs for the days of gang warfare.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nwIUWs7cexC8Wk9c6ey8nFltAZd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:232'),
  ('25901269538157748', 'Rumble in the Bronx', 1995, 'Crime, Action, Comedy, Thriller', 'Stanley Tong Gwai-Lai, William Cheng Wai-Ming, Sharon Lam Suk-Ching', 'Edward Tang, Fibe Ma Mei-Ping', 'Jackie Chan, Anita Mui Yim-Fong, Françoise Yip, Bill Tung Biu, Marc Akerstream, Garvin Cross, Morgan Lam, Ailen Sit Chun-Wai', 'R', 'Keong comes from Hong Kong to visit New York for his uncle''s wedding. His uncle runs a market in the Bronx and Keong offers to help out while Uncle is on his honeymoon. During his stay in the Bronx, Keong befriends a neighbor kid and beats up some neighborhood thugs who cause problems at the market. One of those petty thugs in the local gang stumbles into a criminal situation way over his head.', 'Keong comes from Hong Kong to visit New York for his uncle''s wedding. His uncle runs a market in the Bronx and Keong offers to help out while Uncle is on his honeymoon. During his stay in the Bronx, Keong befriends a neighbor kid and beats up some neighborhood thugs who cause problems at the market. One of those petty thugs in the local gang stumbles into a criminal situation way over his head.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1nAfchiXHQB3iyhK8fCJJEnNs5A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33542'),
  ('754287823566454728', 'Rumble Through the Dark', 2023, 'Thriller, Action', 'Parker Phillips, Graham Phillips', 'Michael Farris Smith', 'Aaron Eckhart, Bella Thorne, Marianne Jean-Baptiste, Ritchie Coster, Virginia Newcomb, Derek Russo, Mike McColl, Liz Fenning', 'R', 'In the dark landscape of the Mississippi Delta, a former bare-knuckle fighter must win one last fight to pay off his debts to the local mob boss and save his childhood home—the stakes nothing less than life or death.', 'In the dark landscape of the Mississippi Delta, a former bare-knuckle fighter must win one last fight to pay off his debts to the local mob boss and save his childhood home—the stakes nothing less than life or death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oz0ELid5Vg9VJxgFfwA93STzj40.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:844416'),
  ('435454970125370007', 'Rumbos', 2016, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Manuela Burló Moreno, Unax Mendia', 'Manuela Burló Moreno', 'Carmen Machi, Ernesto Alterio, Pilar López de Ayala, Miki Esparbé, Nora Navas, Emilio Palacios, Karra Elejalde, Pepa Aniorte', null, 'During a long night of August, some people have different experiences that leave a deep impression in them. Linked by a radio night show, all them cross the city of Barcelona, not knowing that their fates will collide with each other in unexpected ways.', 'During a long night of August, some people have different experiences that leave a deep impression in them. Linked by a radio night show, all them cross the city of Barcelona, not knowing that their fates will collide with each other in unexpected ways.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1rQ83hCGrwq2tpCjKKjeRlei9xN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:391618'),
  ('550336112535776603', 'Rumor Has It...', 2005, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Rob Reiner, Peter Deming, Gregory Kent Simmons', 'Ted Griffin', 'Jennifer Aniston, Kevin Costner, Shirley MacLaine, Mark Ruffalo, Richard Jenkins, Christopher McDonald, Steve Sandvoss, Mena Suvari', 'PG-13', 'Sarah Huttinger learns that her family was the inspiration for the book and film "The Graduate" -- and that she just might be the offspring of the well-documented event.', 'Sarah Huttinger learns that her family was the inspiration for the book and film "The Graduate" -- and that she just might be the offspring of the well-documented event.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ypirKAqugrpevnEqMJxkBoIlgco.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2800'),
