  ('1151995245625874323', 'Rumours', 2024, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Guy Maddin, Galen Johnson, Evan Johnson', 'Evan Johnson', 'Cate Blanchett, Roy Dupuis, Nikki Amuka-Bird, Charles Dance, Takehiro Hira, Denis Ménochet, Rolando Ravello, Zlatko Burić', 'R', 'En route to the annual G7 summit, the seven leaders of the world’s wealthiest liberal democracies get lost in the woods and face increasing peril while attempting to draft a provisional statement regarding a global crisis.', 'En route to the annual G7 summit, the seven leaders of the world’s wealthiest liberal democracies get lost in the woods and face increasing peril while attempting to draft a provisional statement regarding a global crisis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lAjLzQDyUXxCH4tOBxkRYDbBpY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1187417'),
  ('565492256626445106', 'Rumpelstiltskin', 1995, 'Horror', 'Mark Jones, Paul N. Martin, Michelle LeDoux', 'Mark Jones, Joe Ruby', 'Kim Johnston Ulrich, Tommy Blaze, Allyce Beasley, Max Grodénchik, Vera Lockwood, Sherman Augustus, Jay Pickett, Valerie Wildman', 'R', 'In the 1400s, Rumpelstiltskin is imprisoned inside a small jade figurine. In modern-day Los Angeles, the recently widowed wife of a police officer, with baby in tow, finds her way into a witch''s shop and purchases a certain figurine, resulting in the cackling beast being freed and demanding possession of the baby.', 'In the 1400s, Rumpelstiltskin is imprisoned inside a small jade figurine. In modern-day Los Angeles, the recently widowed wife of a police officer, with baby in tow, finds her way into a witch''s shop and purchases a certain figurine, resulting in the cackling beast being freed and demanding possession of the baby.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4BMmj4WHCzUJFxmyr4GNw3aTG6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28229'),
  ('667432873354898279', 'Rumpelstiltskin', 2025, 'Horror, Fantasy', 'Andy Edwards, Sam P. Green, Evyn George', 'Andy Edwards', 'Hannah Baxter-Eve, Joss Carter, Adrian Bouchet, Colin Malone, Evyn George, Ayvianna Snow, Jennifer Lim, Annabella Rich', null, 'Once upon a time, a miller attempted to marry his daughter off to the King by promising she could spin straw into gold. With the help of a demonic imp, she completes the task, but the King becomes greedy and wants more. So, she promises the imp her firstborn in return for yet more favours. But when it comes time to honour her bargain, dark forces merge when the Imp makes a deal with the devil.', 'Once upon a time, a miller attempted to marry his daughter off to the King by promising she could spin straw into gold. With the help of a demonic imp, she completes the task, but the King becomes greedy and wants more. So, she promises the imp her firstborn in return for yet more favours. But when it comes time to honour her bargain, dark forces merge when the Imp makes a deal with the devil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2irI6Bx5dU754W52rReruUj3RI2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1385169'),
  ('743400082741641403', 'Rumpelstiltskin and the Golden Secret', 1960, 'Fantasy, Family', 'Erwin Anders, Christoph Engel', 'Gudrun Deubener, Margot Beichler, Christoph Engel', 'Siegfried Seibt, Karin Lesch, Karl-Heinz Rothin, Reinhard Michalke, Nikolaus Paryla, Peter Dommisch, Bodo Mette, Hans-Hartmut Krüger', null, 'East German adaptation of Grimm‘s fairy tale "Rumpelstiltskin". A boastful miller pretends that his daughter Marie can spin straw into gold, and so she is locked into a room full of straw and ordered to spin it into gold by the next morning. A little man appears and offers his help in exchange for Marie''s necklace. The greedy treasurer makes Marie spin twice more until the only thing she has left to give the little man is the promise of her first-born child…', 'East German adaptation of Grimm‘s fairy tale "Rumpelstiltskin". A boastful miller pretends that his daughter Marie can spin straw into gold, and so she is locked into a room full of straw and ordered to spin it into gold by the next morning. A little man appears and offers his help in exchange for Marie''s necklace. The greedy treasurer makes Marie spin twice more until the only thing she has left to give the little man is the promise of her first-born child…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6gzp8KoKWvxdSZzwTuRPUxrKn1C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13304'),
  ('115414675222028145', 'Rumpole''s Return', 1980, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery, Comedy', 'John Glenister', 'John Mortimer', 'Leo McKern, Albert Welling, Peter Bowles, Patricia Hodge, James Smith, Ian Gelder, Deborah Fallender, Moray Watson', null, 'A bored Rumpole, living in Florida retirement, uses an inquiry from Phyllida as a pretext to re-establish himself back in chambers.', 'A bored Rumpole, living in Florida retirement, uses an inquiry from Phyllida as a pretext to re-establish himself back in chambers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/huuu1WmnVZIUrTRWpznOBkFyUeI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:316875'),
  ('912711205458005689', 'Rumspringa', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Birgit Dierken, Tomas Erhart, Mira Thiel', 'Nika Heinrich, Oskar Minkler, Mira Thiel', 'Timur Bartels, Jonas Holdenrieder, Tijan Marei, Gizem Emre, Nicole Johannhanwahr, Enno Kalisch, Rauand Taleb, Leon Ullrich', null, 'During a trip to Berlin, a young Amish in the middle of a rite of passage reconnects with his roots, explores other ways of life, falls in love — and faces a big decision.', 'During a trip to Berlin, a young Amish in the middle of a rite of passage reconnects with his roots, explores other ways of life, falls in love — and faces a big decision.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tPmr7R2Zq66SXhFcXZiFSJ0Afx8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:956862'),
