  ('79817577594016064', 'Run', 2004, null, 'Jeeva, Jeeva', 'N. Linguswamy', 'Abhishek Bachchan, Bhumika Chawla, Mahesh Manjrekar, Vijay Raaz, Mukesh Rishi, Pankaj Tripathi, Goga Kapoor, Ayesha Jhulka', null, 'This action movie is filled with romance and adventure. As Abhisek fights for his life against the forces of crime and injustice, he meets Bhoomika, who captures his heart.', 'This action movie is filled with romance and adventure. As Abhisek fights for his life against the forces of crime and injustice, he meets Bhoomika, who captures his heart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qCE7mktMbGb6o6y5QJPg6bDMcpR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:158780'),
  ('227674559521398846', 'Run', 2013, 'Action, Drama', 'Simone Bartesaghi', 'Simone Bartesaghi', 'Eric Roberts, William Moseley, Adrian Pasdar, Kelsey Asbille, Craig Henningsen, Edoardo Ballerini, Jeremy Gallant, Kris Eivers', null, 'A street smart, 17-year-old named Daniel practices Parkour and is both hero and thief.', 'A street smart, 17-year-old named Daniel practices Parkour and is both hero and thief.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lcEOVoHUyfcMCjciOWikPLWPK0Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:224087'),
  ('1149465392180782853', 'Run', 2014, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Philippe Lacôte', 'Philippe Lacôte', 'Isaach de Bankolé, Abdoul Karim Konaté, Reine Sali Coulibaly, Abdoul Bah, Alexandre Desane, Adelaïde Ouattara, Clément Drabo, Djinda Kane', null, 'Run escapes... He just killed the Prime Minister of his country. In order to do so, he had to act as if he was a crazy man, wandering through the city. His life comes back by flashes; his childhood with Tourou when his dream was to become a rain miracle-worker, his adventures with Gladys the eater, and his past as a young member of militia, in the heart of the politic and military conflict in Ivory Coast. All those lives, Run didn''t choose them. Every time, he felt in by running from another life. That''s the reason why his name''s Run.', 'Run escapes... He just killed the Prime Minister of his country. In order to do so, he had to act as if he was a crazy man, wandering through the city. His life comes back by flashes; his childhood with Tourou when his dream was to become a rain miracle-worker, his adventures with Gladys the eater, and his past as a young member of militia, in the heart of the politic and military conflict in Ivory Coast. All those lives, Run didn''t choose them. Every time, he felt in by running from another life. That''s the reason why his name''s Run.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yTfYnBiZcyG8I5aJvyMwvOPbMKq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:266062'),
  ('661293193711125325', 'Run', 2020, 'Drama', 'Scott Graham, Simon Tindall', 'Scott Graham', 'Mark Stanley, Amy Manson, Marli Siu, Anders Hayward, Scott Murray, Caleb Imray, Lisa Livingstone, Stuart Murison', null, 'A former boyracer, who married his first love and took a job in one of the fish factories, now has a 17 year-old-son of his own following in his footsteps and can no longer ignore the fact he’s going nowhere. Unable to be physically or emotionally present with his family, he takes his son’s car out for one final joy ride and risks losing the love that surrounds him', 'A former boyracer, who married his first love and took a job in one of the fish factories, now has a 17 year-old-son of his own following in his footsteps and can no longer ignore the fact he’s going nowhere. Unable to be physically or emotionally present with his family, he takes his son’s car out for one final joy ride and risks losing the love that surrounds him', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rrdgxsYRKWPPvHK5JiQjN0dQWf3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:528215'),
  ('357686013602821794', 'Run', 2023, 'Drama', 'Cameron Pike, Oliver Williams, Charlie Hutson', 'Oliver Williams', 'Joshua Meischke, Charlie Hutson, Oliver Williams, Ewan Rollings', null, 'When Ethan becomes overwhelmed by his future prospects, he tries escape from the impending stress of adult life.', 'When Ethan becomes overwhelmed by his future prospects, he tries escape from the impending stress of adult life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zAghlI5x1RLfaYyGHMFQ9aDCLzd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1161699'),
  ('689111867288591113', 'Run & Gun', 2022, 'Action, Thriller', 'Christopher Borrelli', 'Christopher Borrelli', 'Ben Milliken, Brad William Henke, Janel Parrish, Mark Dacascos, Celestino Cornielle, Angela Sarafyan, Alison Thornton, Hudson Yang', 'R', 'After leaving a life of crime and violence, Ray is a reformed good guy, enjoying a quiet family life in the ‘burbs. But when his past is discovered, Ray is blackmailed into one last job to collect a mysterious package. After a deadly double-cross, he finds himself wounded and on the run from ruthless assassins who will stop at nothing to get what he has. Now, with the lives of his loved ones hanging in the balance and danger at every turn, Ray’s only hope is to draw upon his violent past to survive.', 'After leaving a life of crime and violence, Ray is a reformed good guy, enjoying a quiet family life in the ‘burbs. But when his past is discovered, Ray is blackmailed into one last job to collect a mysterious package. After a deadly double-cross, he finds himself wounded and on the run from ruthless assassins who will stop at nothing to get what he has. Now, with the lives of his loved ones hanging in the balance and danger at every turn, Ray’s only hope is to draw upon his violent past to survive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h0AKLEk4XCajdav1hSHIR71cU66.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:910596'),
  ('136184407959061788', 'Run After Me Until I Catch You', 1976, 'Comedy', 'Robert Pouret', 'Robert Pouret, Nicole de Buron', 'Annie Girardot, Jean-Pierre Marielle, Marilù Tolo, Geneviève Fontanel, Daniel Prévost', null, 'A love story between the pets hairdresser and accountant - both with significant life history.', 'A love story between the pets hairdresser and accountant - both with significant life history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4P1rUOCy0gjUapkW59fAXuRpgwL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84403'),
  ('921784564036214921', 'Run All Night', 2015, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Jaume Collet-Serra, Martin Ruhe, Doug Coleman', 'Brad Ingelsby', 'Liam Neeson, Joel Kinnaman, Ed Harris, Vincent D''Onofrio, Bruce McGill, Genesis Rodriguez, Boyd Holbrook, Holt McCallany', 'R', 'Brooklyn mobster and prolific hit man Jimmy Conlon has seen better days. Longtime best friend of a mob boss, Jimmy is haunted by the sins of his past—as well as a dogged police detective who’s been one step behind Jimmy for 30 years. But when Jimmy’s estranged son becomes a target, Jimmy must make a choice between the crime family he chose and the real family he abandoned long ago. Now, with nowhere safe to turn, Jimmy has just one night to figure out exactly where his loyalties lie and to see if he can finally make things right.', 'Brooklyn mobster and prolific hit man Jimmy Conlon has seen better days. Longtime best friend of a mob boss, Jimmy is haunted by the sins of his past—as well as a dogged police detective who’s been one step behind Jimmy for 30 years. But when Jimmy’s estranged son becomes a target, Jimmy must make a choice between the crime family he chose and the real family he abandoned long ago. Now, with nowhere safe to turn, Jimmy has just one night to figure out exactly where his loyalties lie and to see if he can finally make things right.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iGvSMoPbWZWDnIhh54yiq3sW7wH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:241554'),
