  ('212924294447163846', 'Run for the Sun', 1956, 'Adventure, Thriller', 'Roy Boulting, Joseph LaShelle, Rolando Aguilar', 'Roy Boulting, Dudley Nichols', 'Richard Widmark, Trevor Howard, Jane Greer, Peter van Eyck, Juan García, José Antonio Carbajal, José Chávez, Guillermo Calles', null, 'Mike, a Hemingway-esque adventure novelist, is spending his days in a self-imposed exile somewhere in Central America. A reporter for Sight Magazine, Katie, has tracked him down in the hope of getting the biggest scoop of her career. Mike falls for Katie. On a flight to Mexico City, their plane crashes near a remote hideaway of Nazi war criminals in hiding. The Nazis want to stay hidden and plan to dispose of their new guests', 'Mike, a Hemingway-esque adventure novelist, is spending his days in a self-imposed exile somewhere in Central America. A reporter for Sight Magazine, Katie, has tracked him down in the hope of getting the biggest scoop of her career. Mike falls for Katie. On a flight to Mexico City, their plane crashes near a remote hideaway of Nazi war criminals in hiding. The Nazis want to stay hidden and plan to dispose of their new guests', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4QcUVK1mPGPzKYiykMP9rfldQCY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65402'),
  ('1107287797852140131', 'Run for Your Life!', 2008, 'Drama, Documentary', 'Adnan Köse, James Jacobs', null, 'Max Riemelt, Jasmin Schwiers, Uwe Ochsenknecht, Axel Stein, Robert Gwisdek, Ismail Deniz, Udo Schenk, Leslie Malton', null, 'He lived the junkie''s life as a heroin addict. Triathlon transformed him. Biopic of the record breaking Ironman Andreas Niedrig.', 'He lived the junkie''s life as a heroin addict. Triathlon transformed him. Biopic of the record breaking Ironman Andreas Niedrig.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/M7nCUXO0ktZSggHcB1blaiuezc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10505'),
  ('404483491441671012', 'Run Hide Fight', 2021, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Kyle Rankin, Darin Moran', 'Kyle Rankin', 'Isabel May, Thomas Jane, Radha Mitchell, Eli Brown, Olly Sholotan, Treat Williams, Barbara Crampton, Cyrus Arnold', 'R', 'A 17-year-old girl uses her wits, survival skills, and compassion to fight for her life, and those of her fellow classmates, against a group of live-streaming school shooters.', 'A 17-year-old girl uses her wits, survival skills, and compassion to fight for her life, and those of her fellow classmates, against a group of live-streaming school shooters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wlP25H14OvKoFORIwuKomZzioA5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:629017'),
  ('662234401995264022', 'Run If You Can', 2010, 'Drama', 'Dietrich Brüggemann, Alexander Sass', 'Anna Brüggemann, Dietrich Brüggemann', 'Robert Gwisdek, Jacob Matschenz, Anna Brüggemann, Daniel Drewes, Amelie Kiefer, Franziska Weisz, Michael Sens, Leslie Malton', null, 'An independent tragicomedy, Run If You Can is the debut feature for director Brüggemann who, along with his sister, also wrote the compelling screenplay. Forced to spend the rest of his life in a wheelchair, Ben is deeply desperate, despite his humor and vivaciousness. When he meets Christian, his new assistant, Ben treats him like every other helper he’s had. Things suddenly change when Christian meets Annika, “the cello player” whom Ben has been observing from his window for years. The three become close friends, putting Annika in the middle of an emotional, and somehow dangerous, ménage à trois. While conquering Annika is nothing very serious for career-focused Christian, Ben’s love for Annika reminds him of his past and forces him to face his most remote fears. A character-driven story, Run If You Can owes much of its power to the actors’ performances, especially Robert Gwisdek’s outstanding interpretation of Ben.', 'An independent tragicomedy, Run If You Can is the debut feature for director Brüggemann who, along with his sister, also wrote the compelling screenplay. Forced to spend the rest of his life in a wheelchair, Ben is deeply desperate, despite his humor and vivaciousness. When he meets Christian, his new assistant, Ben treats him like every other helper he’s had. Things suddenly change when Christian meets Annika, “the cello player” whom Ben has been observing from his window for years. The three become close friends, putting Annika in the middle of an emotional, and somehow dangerous, ménage à trois. While conquering Annika is nothing very serious for career-focused Christian, Ben’s love for Annika reminds him of his past and forces him to face his most remote fears. A character-driven story, Run If You Can owes much of its power to the actors’ performances, especially Robert Gwisdek’s outstanding interpretation of Ben.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lRS7CRenHeX1hhyU7WIQSmnghSj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56624'),
  ('908274596953111761', 'Run Lola Run', 1998, 'Action, Drama, Thriller', 'Tom Tykwer, Frank Griebe, Marc Kubik', 'Tom Tykwer', 'Franka Potente, Moritz Bleibtreu, Herbert Knaup, Nina Petri, Armin Rohde, Joachim Król, Ludger Pistor, Suzanne von Borsody', 'R', 'Lola receives a phone call from her boyfriend Manni. He lost 100,000 DM in a subway train that belongs to a very bad guy. She has 20 minutes to raise this amount and meet Manni. Otherwise, he will rob a store to get the money. Three different alternatives may happen depending on some minor event along Lola''s run.', 'Lola receives a phone call from her boyfriend Manni. He lost 100,000 DM in a subway train that belongs to a very bad guy. She has 20 minutes to raise this amount and meet Manni. Otherwise, he will rob a store to get the money. Three different alternatives may happen depending on some minor event along Lola''s run.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v0giIi4bTILVhNhJajet3WWY3FA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104'),
  ('1079812584017864546', 'Run of the Arrow', 1957, 'Western', 'Samuel Fuller, Joseph F. Biroc, Gene Bryant', 'Samuel Fuller', 'Rod Steiger, Sara Montiel, Brian Keith, Ralph Meeker, Jay C. Flippen, Charles Bronson, Olive Carey, H.M. Wynant', null, 'When the South loses the war, Confederate veteran O''Meara goes West, joins the Sioux, takes a wife and refuses to be an American but he must choose a side when the Sioux go to war against the U.S. Army.', 'When the South loses the war, Confederate veteran O''Meara goes West, joins the Sioux, takes a wife and refuses to be an American but he must choose a side when the Sioux go to war against the U.S. Army.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r1nonOkyMMmmtVGvk5JSuY3KpPH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35001'),
  ('1063304946731587607', 'Run Rabbit Run', 2024, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Bonnie Elliott, Nathan Croft, Dean Fay', 'Hannah Kent', 'Sarah Snook, Lily LaTorre, Damon Herriman, Greta Scacchi, Sunny Whelan, Naomi Rukavina, Shabana Azeez, Trevor Jamieson', 'R', 'Sarah is a fertility doctor with a firm understanding of the cycle of life. When she is forced to make sense of the increasingly strange behavior of her young daughter Mia, she must challenge her own beliefs and confront a ghost from her past.', 'Sarah is a fertility doctor with a firm understanding of the cycle of life. When she is forced to make sense of the increasingly strange behavior of her young daughter Mia, she must challenge her own beliefs and confront a ghost from her past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cgetiYyTqJ4CMmPmvDw30nnYj1f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:714669'),
