  ('321350983921861770', 'Run Silent, Run Deep', 1958, 'Drama, War', 'Robert Wise, Russell Harlan, Emmett Emerson', 'John Gay', 'Clark Gable, Burt Lancaster, Jack Warden, Brad Dexter, Don Rickles, Nick Cravat, Joe Maross, Mary LaRoche', 'NR', 'The captain of a submarine sunk by the Japanese during WWII is finally given a chance to skipper another sub after a year of working a desk job. His singleminded determination for revenge against the destroyer that sunk his previous vessel puts his new crew in unneccessary danger.', 'The captain of a submarine sunk by the Japanese during WWII is finally given a chance to skipper another sub after a year of working a desk job. His singleminded determination for revenge against the destroyer that sunk his previous vessel puts his new crew in unneccessary danger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xdRkSTYa1ayIIuYezazDwH0Axcf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18784'),
