  ('187941853425158810', 'Run the Race', 2019, 'Drama', 'Chris Dowling, Kristopher S. Kimlin', 'Jake McEntire', 'Tanner Stine, Evan Hofer, Kristoffer Polaha, Frances Fisher, Mykelti Williamson, Kelsey Reinhardt, Mario Van Peebles, Caleb Castille', 'PG', 'Reeling from his mother’s death and his father’s abandonment, Zach, an All-State athlete, finds glory on the football field, working to earn a college scholarship and the brothers’ ticket out of town. When a devastating injury puts Zach—and his dreams—on the sidelines, David laces up his track cleats to salvage their future and point Zach toward hope.', 'Reeling from his mother’s death and his father’s abandonment, Zach, an All-State athlete, finds glory on the football field, working to earn a college scholarship and the brothers’ ticket out of town. When a devastating injury puts Zach—and his dreams—on the sidelines, David laces up his track cleats to salvage their future and point Zach toward hope.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1myP5YdjENipbKZYbONxZwPN8KK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:507990'),
  ('530547240552180393', 'Run the Tide', 2016, 'Drama', 'Morgan Poferl, Michael Toji, Brendan Lee', 'Rajiv Shah', 'Taylor Lautner, Nico Christou, Kenny Johnson, Constance Zimmer, Johanna Braddy, Rajiv Shah, Nichelle Hines, David Barrera', null, 'When their drug abusing mother is released from prison determined to rebuild their family, Rey kidnaps his younger brother Oliver and escapes their desert home for the California coast.', 'When their drug abusing mother is released from prison determined to rebuild their family, Rey kidnaps his younger brother Oliver and escapes their desert home for the California coast.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6QwGnsw1Dk1aU8jtnfg5j13RK31.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:353074'),
  ('348121401117867052', 'Run to You', 2022, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Saverio Guarna, Riccardo Milani', 'Furio Andreotti, Giulia Calenda, Riccardo Milani', 'Pierfrancesco Favino, Miriam Leone, Vanessa Scalera, Michele Placido, Pietro Sermonti, Pilar Fogliati, Andrea Pennacchi, Giulio Base', null, 'Gianni is a serial seducer but his life is destined to change when he meets Chiara, a beautiful woman who has had an accident and is paraplegic.', 'Gianni is a serial seducer but his life is destined to change when he meets Chiara, a beautiful woman who has had an accident and is paraplegic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vWgcIHKARoGFtbEPP9Ut7y2fmoP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:654895'),
  ('643267880795970361', 'Run-Off', 2016, 'Drama', 'Hwang Jae-jin, Kim Jong-hyun, Hong Kyung-pyo', 'Kim Jong-hyun, Jeong Cheol, Lee Hee Chan', 'Soo Ae, Oh Dal-su, Oh Yeon-seo, Ha Jae-sook, Kim Seul-gi, Kim Ye-won, Jin Ji-hee, Park So-dam', null, 'In 2003 the year of Aomori Asian Games, Dae-woong, a former ice hockey player receives an offer to be a director of Korean national ice hockey team. Before he enjoys the moment, realizes it is a woman national team with bunch of losers; a figure skating player who wants to get married by becoming a national team, a former field hockey player, now a fat housewife, and an expelled short track skater. As an ace player, Ji-won, a former national team player of North Korea, joins the team. But they still have hope as only 5 teams participating this year. With the great victory of first match, they feel the medal is closer, yet Ji-won meets her sister left in North Korea alone as a next opponent...', 'In 2003 the year of Aomori Asian Games, Dae-woong, a former ice hockey player receives an offer to be a director of Korean national ice hockey team. Before he enjoys the moment, realizes it is a woman national team with bunch of losers; a figure skating player who wants to get married by becoming a national team, a former field hockey player, now a fat housewife, and an expelled short track skater. As an ace player, Ji-won, a former national team player of North Korea, joins the team. But they still have hope as only 5 teams participating this year. With the great victory of first match, they feel the medal is closer, yet Ji-won meets her sister left in North Korea alone as a next opponent...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/135m1ssNL3thonQ1PygUg559nJR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:408362'),
  ('68031921756194651', 'Run, Man, Run', 1968, 'Western, Comedy, Adventure', 'Guglielmo Mancori, Sergio Sollima, Mauro Sacripanti', 'Pompeo De Angelis, Sergio Sollima', 'Tomas Milian, Donald O''Brien, Linda Veras, Marco Guglielmi, John Ireland, Chelo Alonso, Dante Maggio, Gianni Rizzo', null, 'The legendary Tomas Milian stars as Cuchillo, a knife-throwing thief on the run from murderous bandits, sadistic American agents, his hot-blooded fiancée and a sheriff turned bounty hunter, all of whom are gunning for a hidden fortune in gold that could finance the Mexican Revolution.', 'The legendary Tomas Milian stars as Cuchillo, a knife-throwing thief on the run from murderous bandits, sadistic American agents, his hot-blooded fiancée and a sheriff turned bounty hunter, all of whom are gunning for a hidden fortune in gold that could finance the Mexican Revolution.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5j8FLFM3n6SVSQvqPoEmZcyk2l2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18928'),
  ('342187325649973794', 'Run, Melos!', 1992, 'Animation, History, Drama', 'Masaaki Osumi, Hiroyuki Okiura, Seiichi Morishita', 'Masaaki Osumi', 'Koichi Yamadera, Shinji Ogawa, Akiji Kobayashi, Megumi Hayashibara, Takuma Gono', null, 'The movie tells the story of Melos, a Greek country man that gets arrested and accused of conspiracy against the king. He gets three days to travel to his sister''s wedding while Selinentius (Selinae), a genius sculptor that Melos just met stays as a hostage.', 'The movie tells the story of Melos, a Greek country man that gets arrested and accused of conspiracy against the king. He gets three days to travel to his sister''s wedding while Selinentius (Selinae), a genius sculptor that Melos just met stays as a hostage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j4VqzApv6jBDDQwX3bbEs04n25f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:123950'),
  ('575566084911498692', 'Run, Run, Sweet Road Runner', 1965, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Rudy Larriva', null, null, null, 'Wile E. Coyote unsuccessfully tries to catch the Road Runner in a bird seed trap with overhead spikes.', 'Wile E. Coyote unsuccessfully tries to catch the Road Runner in a bird seed trap with overhead spikes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qH2qsPJ40S1wWkNBnuPeES5Skix.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:234379'),
  ('824181126196393645', 'Run, Tiger Run!', 2022, 'Animation, Adventure, Comedy, Action, Family', 'Stanley Tsang, Joey Zou, Dawei He', 'Er He, Kun Huang, Di Lan', 'Nianci Shen, Liang Dawei, Liang Zou, Jianru Zhang, Lu Qi, Qimin Cao, Shi Chen, Sheng Dian', 'NR', 'The film follows a young boy who sets out on a mission to try and track down his long lost parents.', 'The film follows a young boy who sets out on a mission to try and track down his long lost parents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/73PZdKGTj2PkIeBfRhTG5KJBY5X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:931405'),
  ('706594892362195589', 'Run, Virgin, Run', 1970, 'Comedy', 'Dieter Wedekind, Hans Billian, Horst Schäfer', 'Hans Billian', 'Joav Jasinski, Maria Brockerhoff, Helga Tölle, Michaela Martin, Regina Walther, Ingrid Simon, Christine Kuon, Karin Glier', null, 'Legend has it that a brisk wind called the "Faun" delivers vigor to the men of Falklenhousen - accounting for the town''s satisfied wives and high birth rate. Truth is, when the men are away, their voluptuous wives play!', 'Legend has it that a brisk wind called the "Faun" delivers vigor to the men of Falklenhousen - accounting for the town''s satisfied wives and high birth rate. Truth is, when the men are away, their voluptuous wives play!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2QDRm1pKQnOG7kNbRlwkTKQZX7b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:264947'),
  ('408111537120399128', 'Run, Waiter, Run!', 1981, 'Comedy', 'Ladislav Smoljak, Ivan Šlapeta, Drahomíra Králová', 'Zdeněk Svěrák', 'Josef Abrhám, Libuše Šafránková, Zdeněk Svěrák, Daniela Bakerová, Eliška Balzerová, Jiří Kodet, Dagmar Patrasová, Karel Augusta', null, 'A comedy concerning a down on his luck bookshop owner with a penchant for women who decides to make some money by pretending to be a waiter and collecting cash from unsuspecting diners.', 'A comedy concerning a down on his luck bookshop owner with a penchant for women who decides to make some money by pretending to be a waiter and collecting cash from unsuspecting diners.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lSdJABAGORox5aHGYB36E4AiRcw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36919'),
  ('1074708157552973835', 'Run! Bitch Run!', 2009, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Joseph Guzman', 'Joseph Guzman, Robert James Hayes II', 'Cheryl Lyone, Ivet Corvea, Christina DeRosa, Daeg Faerch, Peter Tahoe, Patricia Grant, Mike Tursi, Chenoa Mason', null, 'Things go horribly wrong when Catherine and Rebecca, two Catholic School girls, knock on the wrong door while selling Religious paraphernalia.', 'Things go horribly wrong when Catherine and Rebecca, two Catholic School girls, knock on the wrong door while selling Religious paraphernalia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m0vcux2QJ2K9MGBqi6O9TLrSwgU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26334'),
  ('57731479676932316', 'Runaway', 1984, 'Science Fiction, Crime, Thriller, Drama', 'John A. Alonzo, Michael Crichton', 'Michael Crichton', 'Tom Selleck, Cynthia Rhodes, Gene Simmons, Kirstie Alley, Stan Shaw, G.W. Bailey, Joey Cramer, Chris Mulkey', 'PG-13', 'In the near future, a police officer specializes in malfunctioning robots. When a robot turns out to have been programmed to kill, he begins to uncover a homicidal plot to create killer robots... and his son becomes a target.', 'In the near future, a police officer specializes in malfunctioning robots. When a robot turns out to have been programmed to kill, he begins to uncover a homicidal plot to create killer robots... and his son becomes a target.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8xMeKeXGHY2KbiMjSpEGqlIjAEp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9507'),
  ('563090501246756575', 'Runaway', 2005, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Tim McCann, Frank Barrera', 'Bill True', 'Aaron Stanford, Robin Tunney, Peter Gerety, Melissa Leo, Terry Kinney, Michael Gaston', null, 'Michael Adler has run away from his suburban home with his little brother Dylan. Hiding out in a quiet, rural town, Michael''s convinced he can make a better life for both of them. While Dylan stays holed up in a cheap motel all day, Michael works at a convenience store where everything starts to come together for him. But as Michael falls in love with his beautiful co-worker, Carly, his past begin', 'Michael Adler has run away from his suburban home with his little brother Dylan. Hiding out in a quiet, rural town, Michael''s convinced he can make a better life for both of them. While Dylan stays holed up in a cheap motel all day, Michael works at a convenience store where everything starts to come together for him. But as Michael falls in love with his beautiful co-worker, Carly, his past begin', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t5cqHBDQGgTEoMiMTbniY3VZRLu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35851'),
  ('800266409957813594', 'Runaway', 2010, 'Music, Fantasy, Romance', 'Ye, Kyle Kibbe, Mark Taylor', 'Hype Williams', 'Ye, Selita Ebanks, Radka Pavlovčinová, Pavlína Červíčková, Jade Clayton, Romana Novotná, Lucia Šenková, Hana Riegerová', 'NR', 'A man falls in love with a half-woman/half-phoenix who fell to Earth from the sky.', 'A man falls in love with a half-woman/half-phoenix who fell to Earth from the sky.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kdAkNtloSB3yJmTpVOiclt2ztf5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48018'),
  ('250137798363524895', 'Runaway Brain', 1995, 'Animation, Comedy, Science Fiction, Horror', 'Chris Bailey', 'Tim Hauser', 'Wayne Allwine, Russi Taylor, Kelsey Grammer, Jim Cummings, Bill Farmer', 'G', 'In an attempt to convince Minnie that he hasn''t forgotten to buy her an anniversary present, Mickey Mouse ends up promising to take her to Hawaii. Funds being short, he applies for a job as lab assistant to the sinister Dr. Frankenollie, who happens to be searching for a donor to provide his monstrous creation with a brain.', 'In an attempt to convince Minnie that he hasn''t forgotten to buy her an anniversary present, Mickey Mouse ends up promising to take her to Hawaii. Funds being short, he applies for a job as lab assistant to the sinister Dr. Frankenollie, who happens to be searching for a donor to provide his monstrous creation with a brain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cEB4K6YavRvrfiAp83cJCgg91Df.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67166'),
  ('1078971325085661805', 'Runaway Bride', 1999, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Garry Marshall, Stuart Dryburgh, Ian Fox', 'Josann McGibbon, Sara Parriott', 'Julia Roberts, Richard Gere, Joan Cusack, Héctor Elizondo, Rita Wilson, Paul Dooley, Christopher Meloni, Donal Logue', 'PG', 'Having already left three grooms at the altar, Maggie Carpenter is branded "the runaway bride" by jaded New York journalist Ike Graham. But, after his facts are called into question, Ike races to Maggie''s hometown to save his reputation and report on her upcoming fourth trip down the aisle – during which he''s convinced she''ll run again. Though he''s there on a muckraking mission, Ike can''t help but fall for this breathtaking heartbreaker.', 'Having already left three grooms at the altar, Maggie Carpenter is branded "the runaway bride" by jaded New York journalist Ike Graham. But, after his facts are called into question, Ike races to Maggie''s hometown to save his reputation and report on her upcoming fourth trip down the aisle – during which he''s convinced she''ll run again. Though he''s there on a muckraking mission, Ike can''t help but fall for this breathtaking heartbreaker.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wzivR0yWJStVdhcl0A5rQvVdTQ7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4806'),
  ('5872662507380943', 'Runaway Car', 1997, 'Comedy, TV Movie, Action, Adventure', 'Jack Sholder, Anghel Decca', 'Paul F. Edwards', 'Judge Reinhold, Nina Siemaszko, Brian Hooks, Paul Eiding, Glenn Morshower, Brian Reddy, Elizabeth Dennehy, Rick Hurst', null, 'A nurse apprentice, who had a bad day at work, meets a computer programmer at a car garage. The man is urged to go somewhere, but his car is not ready yet, so the nurse offers him a ride. Before leaving the man, they pick up the nurse''s baby nephew. Once on the street, they almost run over a young man. Not knowing if he is hurt, they pick up the man too. But the worst luck begins when the car brakes break down', 'A nurse apprentice, who had a bad day at work, meets a computer programmer at a car garage. The man is urged to go somewhere, but his car is not ready yet, so the nurse offers him a ride. Before leaving the man, they pick up the nurse''s baby nephew. Once on the street, they almost run over a young man. Not knowing if he is hurt, they pick up the man too. But the worst luck begins when the car brakes break down', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vqpYFnuwYII3G2Garqy0hAd6ofc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:99036'),
  ('561346703306203316', 'Runaway Horse', 2007, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Rainer Kaufmann', 'Ralf Hertwig, Kathrin Richter', 'Katja Riemann, Ulrich Tukur, Ulrich Noethen, Petra Schmidt-Schaller, Jan Messutat', null, 'Helmut and Sabine Halm have always managed vacations of lazy privacy at their favorite retreat on Germany′s Lake Constance. So when the energetic, handsome Klaus Buch turns up with his beautiful girlfriend Helene, Helmut is quite ready to dismiss this dimly familiar acquaintance. But Klaus is overjoyed to recognize his old schoolmate Helmut, eager to recall every incident of their shared time, and to display every detail of this successful lifestyle as a fit sportsman and author. The precious days of privacy give way to an unwanted and awkward intimacy, as the Buchs and the Halms hike, dine and sail together. Their joint activities aggravate myriad psychological tensions among the four characters, which are all the more intensely ironic for their peaceful veneer and which must eventually erupt.', 'Helmut and Sabine Halm have always managed vacations of lazy privacy at their favorite retreat on Germany′s Lake Constance. So when the energetic, handsome Klaus Buch turns up with his beautiful girlfriend Helene, Helmut is quite ready to dismiss this dimly familiar acquaintance. But Klaus is overjoyed to recognize his old schoolmate Helmut, eager to recall every incident of their shared time, and to display every detail of this successful lifestyle as a fit sportsman and author. The precious days of privacy give way to an unwanted and awkward intimacy, as the Buchs and the Halms hike, dine and sail together. Their joint activities aggravate myriad psychological tensions among the four characters, which are all the more intensely ironic for their peaceful veneer and which must eventually erupt.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xN6uLEfBpq4PB9rfvfFct0wKknk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6416'),
  ('990032504973304660', 'Runaway Jury', 2003, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Gary Fleder, Robert Elswit, Michael Zimbrich', 'David Levien, Brian Koppelman, Matthew Chapman', 'John Cusack, Gene Hackman, Dustin Hoffman, Rachel Weisz, Bruce Davison, Bruce McGill, Jeremy Piven, Leland Orser', 'PG-13', 'After a workplace shooting in New Orleans, a trial against the gun manufacturer pits lawyer Wendell Rohr against shady jury consultant Rankin Fitch, who uses illegal means to stack the jury with people sympathetic to the defense. But when juror Nicholas Easter and his girlfriend Marlee reveal their ability to sway the jury into delivering any verdict they want, a high-stakes cat-and-mouse game begins.', 'After a workplace shooting in New Orleans, a trial against the gun manufacturer pits lawyer Wendell Rohr against shady jury consultant Rankin Fitch, who uses illegal means to stack the jury with people sympathetic to the defense. But when juror Nicholas Easter and his girlfriend Marlee reveal their ability to sway the jury into delivering any verdict they want, a high-stakes cat-and-mouse game begins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zwCdI1voOVpJyTNN3Rwe3PVPakX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11329'),
  ('862939229941248237', 'Runaway Nightmare', 1982, 'Thriller, Horror, Comedy', 'Mike Cartel', 'Mike Cartel', 'Mike Cartel, Al Valletta, Seeska Vandenberg, Cindy Donlan, Jody Lee Olhava, Cheryl Gamson, Georgia Durante, Karen Stride', null, 'Two dorky Nevada worm wranglers are kidnapped by a gang of beautiful women as part of a plot to steal platinum from the Mafia.', 'Two dorky Nevada worm wranglers are kidnapped by a gang of beautiful women as part of a plot to steal platinum from the Mafia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zy340ncJWTbQzEUhE8qR8eR9kWt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89381'),
  ('1129919342350603014', 'Runaway Romance', 2018, 'Romance, TV Movie', 'Brian Herzlinger', 'Emily Golden, Miralee Ferrell, John-Eliot Jordan', 'Trevor Donovan, Danielle Chuchran, Tatum O''Neal, Beau Davidson, Galadriel Stineman, Drew Cash, Ken Strunk, Kellen Boyle', 'G', 'When she’s written out of her show, her relationship and her seemingly perfect life, reality TV star Ann Stanway leaves Hollywood and finds herself marooned in Amish country. But when Ann is taken in by the owner of a nearby Inn, and meets a handsome young architect, she discovers that the reality she left isn’t nearly as perfect as the one she’s found.', 'When she’s written out of her show, her relationship and her seemingly perfect life, reality TV star Ann Stanway leaves Hollywood and finds herself marooned in Amish country. But when Ann is taken in by the owner of a nearby Inn, and meets a handsome young architect, she discovers that the reality she left isn’t nearly as perfect as the one she’s found.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tEhxcrIJpfG4DmZGY8kGsR7uPir.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:495386'),
  ('1074767519025982534', 'Runaway Train', 1985, 'Action, Thriller, Drama, Adventure', 'Andrei Konchalovsky, Alan Hume, Jack Cummins', 'Akira Kurosawa, Hideo Oguni', 'Jon Voight, Eric Roberts, Rebecca De Mornay, Kyle T. Heffner, John P. Ryan, T.K. Carter, Kenneth McMillan, Stacey Pickren', 'R', 'A hardened convict and a younger prisoner escape from a brutal prison in the middle of winter only to find themselves on an out-of-control train with a female railway worker while being pursued by the vengeful head of security.', 'A hardened convict and a younger prisoner escape from a brutal prison in the middle of winter only to find themselves on an out-of-control train with a female railway worker while being pursued by the vengeful head of security.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yEvMuhIdwPhhEtikAihxUTM1u75.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11893'),
  ('616260008343408676', 'Runaway!', 1973, 'Thriller, TV Movie', 'David Lowell Rich, Bud Thackery, Alan Crosland, Jr.', 'Gerald Di Pego', 'Ben Johnson, Ben Murphy, Ed Nelson, Darleen Carr, Martin Milner, Lee Montgomery, Vera Miles, Ray Danton', null, 'A group of skiers are trapped inside a runaway train hurtling down a mountainside.', 'A group of skiers are trapped inside a runaway train hurtling down a mountainside.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2bgtuRc21GUCh4rrkFr5FmrYF5H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:252910'),
  ('956429621595582200', 'Runner', 2024, 'Thriller', 'Andrea Arnone, Nicola Barnaba', 'Nicola Barnaba, Marco Guerrini', 'Matilde Gioli, Francesco Montanari, Flora Contrafatto, Antonio di Turi, Vincenzo Scuruchi, Saverio Malara, Ilenia Calabrese, Federico Tocci', null, 'Lisa is a young 25 year old who has dreamed of cinema since she was a child. For her, the role of the runner is an important milestone: it is her arrival in the world of cinema, but also the starting point for a brilliant career. She is finally on a set, starting a relationship with Sonja, protagonist and film star. What more could you want from life? What could go wrong? But the actress has a dark past that comes back to look for her at the most unexpected moment. Accused of Sonja''s murder, the girl is forced to flee. Lisa runs, runs to save her life and to find the evidence that will exonerate her and allow the real murderer to be convicted.', 'Lisa is a young 25 year old who has dreamed of cinema since she was a child. For her, the role of the runner is an important milestone: it is her arrival in the world of cinema, but also the starting point for a brilliant career. She is finally on a set, starting a relationship with Sonja, protagonist and film star. What more could you want from life? What could go wrong? But the actress has a dark past that comes back to look for her at the most unexpected moment. Accused of Sonja''s murder, the girl is forced to flee. Lisa runs, runs to save her life and to find the evidence that will exonerate her and allow the real murderer to be convicted.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xNaHENguLcVDNYVyWaxVji6uzol.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1096826'),
  ('815631679078723941', 'Runner Runner', 2013, 'Crime, Thriller, Drama', 'Brad Furman, Joe Camp III, David M. Bernstein', 'Brian Koppelman, David Levien', 'Justin Timberlake, Ben Affleck, Gemma Arterton, Anthony Mackie, Michael Esper, Oliver Cooper, Christian George, Yul Vazquez', 'R', 'When a poor college student who cracks an online poker game goes bust, he arranges a face-to-face with the man he thinks cheated him, a sly offshore entrepreneur.', 'When a poor college student who cracks an online poker game goes bust, he arranges a face-to-face with the man he thinks cheated him, a sly offshore entrepreneur.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ck5jZjv7WVoCBBgTH1gJlhyCLPy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:146238'),
  ('66396786540782544', 'Running', 1979, 'Drama', 'Laszlo George, Steven Hilliard Stern, David Bailey', 'Steven Hilliard Stern', 'Michael Douglas, Susan Anspach, Lawrence Dane, Eugene Levy, Chuck Shamata, Philip Akin, Trudy Young, Murray Westgate', 'PG', 'An Olympic hopeful marathon runner hopes his success will be the answer to his marriage woes and other personal problems.', 'An Olympic hopeful marathon runner hopes his success will be the answer to his marriage woes and other personal problems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fId0oNkAjVKueIzrAog8TSIVk6U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:146322'),
  ('751216383501752533', 'Running Against Time', 1991, 'Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Bruce Seth Green, Glen Sanford', 'Robert Glass, Stanley Shapiro', 'Robert Hays, Catherine Hicks, Sam Wanamaker, Wayne Tippit, James DiStefano, Paul Scherrer', null, 'Hoping to prevent his brother''s Vietnam death and to prevent the JFK assassination, a time-traveling college professor goes back to the ''60s but can''t find his way out. Trapped in a time warp, he can''t effect a change because he can''t return to his present time', 'Hoping to prevent his brother''s Vietnam death and to prevent the JFK assassination, a time-traveling college professor goes back to the ''60s but can''t find his way out. Trapped in a time warp, he can''t effect a change because he can''t return to his present time', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9bDQshhIZlBD2HTCUNWFTwJBiW0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:227064'),
