  ('1004942457325196071', 'Running Out of Time', 1994, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Imanol Uribe, Javier Aguirresarobe, Raúl de la Morena', 'Imanol Uribe', 'Carmelo Gómez, Ruth Gabriel, Javier Bardem, Karra Elejalde, Candela Peña, Elvira Mínguez, Pepón Nieto, Joseba Apaolaza', null, 'Days before committing an attack, Antonio, a gunman of the terrorist gang ETA who has dedicated his life to a cause he no longer believes in, meets Charo, a young drug addict who, despite the sordid environment in which she lives, still retains her innocence.', 'Days before committing an attack, Antonio, a gunman of the terrorist gang ETA who has dedicated his life to a cause he no longer believes in, meets Charo, a young drug addict who, despite the sordid environment in which she lives, still retains her innocence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3QFSC7bTMaYuYgKZ2j10QL6Ykso.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114218'),
