  ('652989104948925155', 'Runway 34', 2022, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Ajay Devgn, Aseem Bajaj', 'Aamil Keyan Khan, Sandeep Kewlani', 'Ajay Devgn, Amitabh Bachchan, Rakul Preet Singh, Boman Irani, Angira Dhar, Aakanksha Singh, Nirupama Verma, Avantika Akerkar', null, 'A flying prodigy, Captain Vikrant Khanna''s flight takes a stirring and mysterious trajectory after take-off from an international destination. Concurrently, it follows the tenacious Narayan Vedant in his pursuit to uncover the truth.', 'A flying prodigy, Captain Vikrant Khanna''s flight takes a stirring and mysterious trajectory after take-off from an international destination. Concurrently, it follows the tenacious Narayan Vedant in his pursuit to uncover the truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8RlQEuxeRqHh7sWTRswdUC9kP3H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:766116'),
  ('1063192163482810761', 'Runway Cop', 2012, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Shin Terra, Choi Joo-young, Song Hyun-suk', 'Ko Young-jae', 'Kang Ji-hwan, Sung Yu-ri, Lee Soo-hyuk, Kim Young-kwang, Shin Min-chul, Shin Jung-keun, Lee Hee-jun, Kim Ji-young', null, 'All he has is smell and a D-line body but is devoted in catching the bad guys. Detective Cha (Kang Ji-hwan) takes the cover of a model on a runway to solve a case.', 'All he has is smell and a D-line body but is devoted in catching the bad guys. Detective Cha (Kang Ji-hwan) takes the cover of a model on a runway to solve a case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9UJwldECxRo60pzG4Ir91yYDK6J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:124874'),
  ('1000265392334772034', 'Rupture', 1961, 'Comedy', 'Pierre Levent, Pierre Étaix, Jean-Claude Carrière', 'Jean-Claude Carrière, Pierre Étaix', 'Pierre Étaix, Anne-Marie Royer, Anny Nelsen', null, 'A man receives a breakup letter from his sweetheart, who sends him back his photo, in pieces. The pained lover decides to reply. Fountain pen, penholder, desk, stamps, paper and inkwell all contrive diabolically to thwart him.', 'A man receives a breakup letter from his sweetheart, who sends him back his photo, in pieces. The pained lover decides to reply. Fountain pen, penholder, desk, stamps, paper and inkwell all contrive diabolically to thwart him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ic7i4HJwPy6NJ0Ed0CEFxc7jttf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:188191'),
  ('989717864283588533', 'Rupture', 2016, 'Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Steven Shainberg, Karim Hussain, Beau Ferris', 'Brian Nelson', 'Noomi Rapace, Peter Stormare, Kerry Bishé, Lesley Manville, Michael Chiklis, Ari Millen, Joel Labelle, Sergio Di Zio', null, 'A single mom tries to break free from a mysterious organization that has abducted her.', 'A single mom tries to break free from a mysterious organization that has abducted her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/41MCf9bzSpqhr7EAu95su0XdjVQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:345925'),
  ('668443162766094902', 'Rurouni Kenshin Part I: Origins', 2012, 'Adventure, Action, Fantasy, War, History', 'Keishi Otomo, Takuro Ishizaka, Kenji Tanigaki', 'Kiyomi Fujii, Keishi Otomo', 'Takeru Satoh, Emi Takei, Koji Kikkawa, Yu Aoi, Munetaka Aoki, Go Ayano, Genki Sudo, Taketo Tanaka', 'PG-13', 'In 1868, after the Bakumatsu war ends, the ex-assassin Kenshin Himura traverses Japan with an inverted sword, to defend the needy without killing.', 'In 1868, after the Bakumatsu war ends, the ex-assassin Kenshin Himura traverses Japan with an inverted sword, to defend the needy without killing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vo3Zs07PZfKNsTrU0pcPZONJcN5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:127533'),
  ('574053637064308141', 'Rurouni Kenshin Part II: Kyoto Inferno', 2014, 'Action, Adventure, Drama, Fantasy', 'Keishi Otomo, Takuro Ishizaka, Kenji Tanigaki', 'Kiyomi Fujii, Keishi Otomo', 'Takeru Satoh, Emi Takei, Munetaka Aoki, Kaito Oyagi, Yu Aoi, Yosuke Eguchi, Yūsuke Iseya, Min Tanaka', 'PG-13', 'Kenshin has settled into his new life with Kaoru and his other friends when he is approached with a request from the Meiji government. Makoto Shishio, a former assassin like Kenshin, was betrayed, set on fire and left for dead. He survived, and is now in Kyoto, plotting with his gathered warriors to overthrow the new government. Against Kaoru''s wishes, Kenshin reluctantly agrees to go to Kyoto and help keep his country from falling back into civil war.', 'Kenshin has settled into his new life with Kaoru and his other friends when he is approached with a request from the Meiji government. Makoto Shishio, a former assassin like Kenshin, was betrayed, set on fire and left for dead. He survived, and is now in Kyoto, plotting with his gathered warriors to overthrow the new government. Against Kaoru''s wishes, Kenshin reluctantly agrees to go to Kyoto and help keep his country from falling back into civil war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gI2xYpJPQOsmFblvowkW2IgEHkC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:221731'),
  ('553312291113779864', 'Rurouni Kenshin: New Kyoto Arc: Cage of Flames', 2011, 'Drama, Animation, Action', 'Kazuhiro Furuhashi, Shinichi Igarashi, Hiro Kaburagi', 'Mari Okada', 'Mayo Suzukaze, Miki Fujitani, Mina Tominaga, Yuji Ueda, Shuichi Ikeda, Ken Narita, Tomo Sakurai, Masanori Ikeda', null, 'Although she''s only sixteen and looks even younger, Misao Makimachi is already a skilled and competent member of the Oniwabanshu ninja clan. That''s fortunate for Misao, because her onimitsu talents may be all that keeps her alive when a journey in search of the leader of the clan, Aoshi Shinomori, leads her instead into a face-to-face encounter with an even more dangerous man and a plot to overthrow the Meiji government! Quickly enmeshed in the affairs of the legendary assassin Hitokiri Battosai, now known as Kenshin Himura, wielder of the reverse-blade sword, Misao finds herself pulled into the middle of a deadly intrigue against Makoto Shishio, who is orchestrating the conquest of all Japan - beginning with Kyoto!', 'Although she''s only sixteen and looks even younger, Misao Makimachi is already a skilled and competent member of the Oniwabanshu ninja clan. That''s fortunate for Misao, because her onimitsu talents may be all that keeps her alive when a journey in search of the leader of the clan, Aoshi Shinomori, leads her instead into a face-to-face encounter with an even more dangerous man and a plot to overthrow the Meiji government! Quickly enmeshed in the affairs of the legendary assassin Hitokiri Battosai, now known as Kenshin Himura, wielder of the reverse-blade sword, Misao finds herself pulled into the middle of a deadly intrigue against Makoto Shishio, who is orchestrating the conquest of all Japan - beginning with Kyoto!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wJhEK3ajbqtL6mz3KC5fOCyAN1d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:145675'),
  ('426740793276125788', 'Rurouni Kenshin: New Kyoto Arc: The Chirps of Light', 2012, 'Animation, Action, Drama', 'Kazuhiro Furuhashi, Hiromitsu Hagiwara, Shinichi Igarashi', 'Mari Okada', 'Mayo Suzukaze, Miki Fujitani, Mina Tominaga, Yuji Ueda, Tomo Sakurai, Ken Narita, Shuichi Ikeda, Masanori Ikeda', null, 'Shishio''s plan is enacted while Kenshin and Misao help defend the city.', 'Shishio''s plan is enacted while Kenshin and Misao help defend the city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qbMFrq2mt7qCdVI6AxbjiqlHywA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:210227'),
  ('487603091283499143', 'Rurouni Kenshin: The Beginning', 2021, 'Action, Adventure, Drama, Romance', 'Takuro Ishizaka, Keishi Otomo', 'Keishi Otomo', 'Takeru Satoh, Kasumi Arimura, Issey Takahashi, Nijiro Murakami, Masanobu Ando, Kazuki Kitamura, Yosuke Eguchi, Towa Araki', 'R', 'Before he was a protector, Kenshin was a fearsome assassin known as Battosai. But when he meets gentle Tomoe Yukishiro, a beautiful young woman who carries a huge burden in her heart, his life will change forever.', 'Before he was a protector, Kenshin was a fearsome assassin known as Battosai. But when he meets gentle Tomoe Yukishiro, a beautiful young woman who carries a huge burden in her heart, his life will change forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rODS466qSdrwMlGdbUwPENhDN2c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:672322'),
  ('450657749909608330', 'Rurouni Kenshin: The Final', 2021, 'Action, Adventure, History, Drama', 'Takuro Ishizaka, Keishi Otomo', 'Keishi Otomo', 'Takeru Satoh, Emi Takei, Mackenyu, Munetaka Aoki, Yu Aoi, Yūsuke Iseya, Tao Tsuchiya, Ryosuke Miura', 'PG-13', 'In 1879, Kenshin and his allies face their strongest enemy yet: his former brother-in-law Enishi Yukishiro and his minions, who''ve vowed their revenge.', 'In 1879, Kenshin and his allies face their strongest enemy yet: his former brother-in-law Enishi Yukishiro and his minions, who''ve vowed their revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7bbEASVf9XWtfxWiuWUMY3uyhTb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:602063'),
  ('1022461619242618889', 'Rus Gelin', 2003, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Zeki Alasya', 'Umur Bugay', 'Metin Akpınar, Zeki Alasya, Şafak Sezer, Tatsyana Tsvikeviç, Murat Akkoyunlu, Sibel Taşçıoğlu, Bilge Şen, Nezih Tuncay', null, 'The world champion archer, who comes from Moldova, one of the poorest countries in the Eastern Bloc, wants to compete on behalf of Turkey. To do so, she must be married to a Turkish man. The federation president intervenes and decides to arrange a formal marriage. For this purpose, a former wrestler is persuaded to be the groom. After the comical marriage, events will take a rather amusing turn. Zeki Alasya, who directed the film, once again appears on screen with Metin Akpınar, effectively responding to speculation that they are estranged.', 'The world champion archer, who comes from Moldova, one of the poorest countries in the Eastern Bloc, wants to compete on behalf of Turkey. To do so, she must be married to a Turkish man. The federation president intervenes and decides to arrange a formal marriage. For this purpose, a former wrestler is persuaded to be the groom. After the comical marriage, events will take a rather amusing turn. Zeki Alasya, who directed the film, once again appears on screen with Metin Akpınar, effectively responding to speculation that they are estranged.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ahpmaEsMt9uu9xzBjTAbZrIS4hU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:380387'),
  ('415861879521345915', 'Rush', 1991, 'Crime, Drama', 'Lili Fini Zanuck, Katterli Frauenfelder, Martha Elcan', 'Peter Dexter', 'Jason Patric, Jennifer Jason Leigh, Sam Elliott, Max Perlich, Gregg Allman, William Sadler, Tony Frank, Special K. McCray', 'R', 'Undercover cop Jim Raynor is a seasoned veteran. His partner, Kristen Cates, is lacking in experience, but he thinks she''s tough enough to work his next case with him: a deep cover assignment to bring down the notoriously hard-to-capture drug lord Gaines. While their relationship turns romantic during the assignment, they also turn into junkies, and will have to battle their own addictions if they want to bring down Gaines once and for all.', 'Undercover cop Jim Raynor is a seasoned veteran. His partner, Kristen Cates, is lacking in experience, but he thinks she''s tough enough to work his next case with him: a deep cover assignment to bring down the notoriously hard-to-capture drug lord Gaines. While their relationship turns romantic during the assignment, they also turn into junkies, and will have to battle their own addictions if they want to bring down Gaines once and for all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mYRGsAFhvPmH8umMhsO8EJmhLQX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20289'),
  ('173407308268879142', 'Rush', 2013, 'Drama, Action', 'Ron Howard, Anthony Dod Mantle, Michael Wood', 'Peter Morgan', 'Chris Hemsworth, Daniel Brühl, Olivia Wilde, Alexandra Maria Lara, Pierfrancesco Favino, David Calder, Natalie Dormer, Stephen Mangan', 'R', 'In the 1970s, a rivalry propels race car drivers Niki Lauda and James Hunt to fame and glory — until a horrible accident threatens to end it all.', 'In the 1970s, a rivalry propels race car drivers Niki Lauda and James Hunt to fame and glory — until a horrible accident threatens to end it all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/95BDrWmcfJDEa2WCfjmLgi67jhi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:96721'),
  ('944927572065944708', 'Rush Hour', 1998, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Adam Greenberg, Brett Ratner, Kenneth Siao Wai-Keung', 'Ross LaManna, Jim Kouf', 'Jackie Chan, Chris Tucker, Tom Wilkinson, Philip Baker Hall, Elizabeth Peña, Chris Penn, Mark Rolston, Tzi Ma', 'PG-13', 'When Hong Kong Inspector Lee is summoned to Los Angeles to investigate a kidnapping, the FBI doesn''t want any outside help and assigns cocky LAPD Detective James Carter to distract Lee from the case. Not content to watch the action from the sidelines, Lee and Carter form an unlikely partnership and investigate the case themselves.', 'When Hong Kong Inspector Lee is summoned to Los Angeles to investigate a kidnapping, the FBI doesn''t want any outside help and assigns cocky LAPD Detective James Carter to distract Lee from the case. Not content to watch the action from the sidelines, Lee and Carter form an unlikely partnership and investigate the case themselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3WsLE6FtxEPRa6U9sbY1ckrn39s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2109'),
  ('405610374083521632', 'Rush Hour 2', 2001, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Matthew F. Leonetti, Brett Ratner, Conrad E. Palmisano', 'Jeff Nathanson', 'Jackie Chan, Chris Tucker, John Lone, Roselyn Sánchez, Zhang Ziyi, Alan King, Harris Yulin, Kenneth Tsang', 'PG-13', 'It''s vacation time for Carter as he finds himself alongside Lee in Hong Kong wishing for more excitement. While Carter wants to party and meet the ladies, Lee is out to track down a Triad gang lord who may be responsible for killing two men at the American Embassy. Things get complicated as the pair stumble onto a counterfeiting plot. The boys are soon up to their necks in fist fights and life-threatening situations. A trip back to the U.S. may provide the answers about the bombing, the counterfeiting, and the true allegiance of sexy customs agent Isabella.', 'It''s vacation time for Carter as he finds himself alongside Lee in Hong Kong wishing for more excitement. While Carter wants to party and meet the ladies, Lee is out to track down a Triad gang lord who may be responsible for killing two men at the American Embassy. Things get complicated as the pair stumble onto a counterfeiting plot. The boys are soon up to their necks in fist fights and life-threatening situations. A trip back to the U.S. may provide the answers about the bombing, the counterfeiting, and the true allegiance of sexy customs agent Isabella.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aBQf2vMiCINeVC9v6BGVYKXurTh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5175'),
  ('378017439245052198', 'Rush Hour 3', 2007, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Brett Ratner, J. Michael Muro, Conrad E. Palmisano', 'Jeff Nathanson', 'Jackie Chan, Chris Tucker, Hiroyuki Sanada, Max von Sydow, Yvan Attal, Roman Polanski, Zhang Jingchu, Philip Baker Hall', 'PG-13', 'After a botched assassination attempt, the mismatched duo finds themselves in Paris, struggling to retrieve a precious list of names, as the murderous crime syndicate''s henchmen try their best to stop them. Once more, Lee and Carter must fight their way through dangerous gangsters; however, this time, the past has come back to haunt Lee. Will the boys get the job done once and for all?', 'After a botched assassination attempt, the mismatched duo finds themselves in Paris, struggling to retrieve a precious list of names, as the murderous crime syndicate''s henchmen try their best to stop them. Once more, Lee and Carter must fight their way through dangerous gangsters; however, this time, the past has come back to haunt Lee. Will the boys get the job done once and for all?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mp9CzKxLa2i7yblMXUrzVfGqsCo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5174'),
  ('945138683628943852', 'Rush Week', 1989, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Bob Bralver, Rick Tunell, Jeff Mart', 'Russell V. Manzatt, Michael W. Leighton', 'Pamela Ludwig, Dean Hamilton, Roy Thinnes, Donald Grant, Courtney Gebhart, John Donovan, David Denney, Todd Eric Andrews', null, 'An ambitious young journalist working for her college newspaper becomes intrigued by the recent string of disappearances of several female students, which she believes to be connected to an on-campus murder that happened the previous year during the college''s raucous Rush Week.', 'An ambitious young journalist working for her college newspaper becomes intrigued by the recent string of disappearances of several female students, which she believes to be connected to an on-campus murder that happened the previous year during the college''s raucous Rush Week.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3V3monBerblT60LLdnebAdrUfVN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68884'),
  ('485695204074263230', 'Rush: Beyond the Lighted Stage', 2010, 'Documentary, Music', 'Scot McFadyen, Sam Dunn, Martin Hawkes', 'Mike Munn, Sam Dunn, Scot McFadyen', 'Geddy Lee, Neil Peart, Alex Lifeson, Sebastian Bach, Jack Black, Jimmy Chamberlin, Taylor Hawkins, Terry Brown', null, 'An in-depth look at the Canadian rock band Rush, chronicling the band''s musical evolution from their progressive rock sound of the ''70s to their current heavy rock style.', 'An in-depth look at the Canadian rock band Rush, chronicling the band''s musical evolution from their progressive rock sound of the ''70s to their current heavy rock style.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5su3xR3k0doJmUYIVk8O5QnXnxn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41120'),
  ('1052170014300935866', 'Rushed', 2021, 'Mystery, Thriller, Horror, Drama, Crime', 'Vibeke Muasya, Andreas O''Donohue Villaggio, Matthias Schubert', 'Siobhan Fallon Hogan', 'Siobhan Fallon Hogan, Robert Patrick, Jake Weary, Jay Jay Warren, Danny Mastrogiorgio, Sean Cullen, Peri Gilpin, Andrea Suarez Paz', null, 'Barbara O’Brien, an Irish Catholic mother, has her life turned upside-down when her son, a freshman in college, is involved in a tragic hazing incident. Taking justice into her own hands, she travels across the country recording mothers who have lost sons to hazing in an effort to prove the university’s liability. When she is confronted by corruption and cover ups, she seeks revenge on the one person she finds truly responsible, proving that hell hath no fury like a mother scorned.', 'Barbara O’Brien, an Irish Catholic mother, has her life turned upside-down when her son, a freshman in college, is involved in a tragic hazing incident. Taking justice into her own hands, she travels across the country recording mothers who have lost sons to hazing in an effort to prove the university’s liability. When she is confronted by corruption and cover ups, she seeks revenge on the one person she finds truly responsible, proving that hell hath no fury like a mother scorned.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/prPR4srMj4KJDRc9uqKbdIz36Bx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:828305'),
  ('962410869790096972', 'Rushmore', 1998, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Wes Anderson, Robert D. Yeoman, Michael Cedar', 'Wes Anderson, Owen Wilson', 'Jason Schwartzman, Bill Murray, Olivia Williams, Seymour Cassel, Brian Cox, Mason Gamble, Sara Tanaka, Stephen McCole', 'R', 'When a beautiful first-grade teacher arrives at a prep school, she soon attracts the attention of an ambitious teenager named Max, who quickly falls in love with her. Max turns to the father of two of his schoolmates for advice on how to woo the teacher. However, the situation soon gets complicated when Max''s new friend becomes involved with her, setting the two pals against one another in a war for her attention.', 'When a beautiful first-grade teacher arrives at a prep school, she soon attracts the attention of an ambitious teenager named Max, who quickly falls in love with her. Max turns to the father of two of his schoolmates for advice on how to woo the teacher. However, the situation soon gets complicated when Max''s new friend becomes involved with her, setting the two pals against one another in a war for her attention.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hSJ6swahAuZ8wM96lHDTwQPXUvZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11545'),
  ('539296646240624436', 'Ruslan and Ludmila', 1972, 'Adventure, Family, Fantasy', 'Aleksandr Ptushko, Igor Gelein, Valentin Zakharov', 'Samuil Bolotin, Aleksandr Ptushko', 'Valeri Kozinets, Natalya Petrova, Vladimir Fyodorov, Mariya Kapnist, Igor Yasulovich, Andrei Abrikosov, Oleg Mokshantsev, Ruslan Akhmetov', null, 'In the midst of the wedding party of Prince Ruslan and Ludmila, daughter of Prince Vladimir, the girl is kidnapped by the evil sorcerer Chernomor and the witch Naina. Three of her past suitors set out, as does Ruslan, to rescue Ludmila.', 'In the midst of the wedding party of Prince Ruslan and Ludmila, daughter of Prince Vladimir, the girl is kidnapped by the evil sorcerer Chernomor and the witch Naina. Three of her past suitors set out, as does Ruslan, to rescue Ludmila.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/azrstL2rObiXaqCCgWUpUR3eKBL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:149837'),
  ('791210192253948646', 'Russell Peters: Deported', 2020, 'Comedy', 'David Higby', 'Russell Peters', 'Russell Peters, Jason Collings', null, 'Comedian Russell Peters explores life as a middle-aged man dealing with health issues, relationships and fatherhood in this hilarious one-hour special.', 'Comedian Russell Peters explores life as a middle-aged man dealing with health issues, relationships and fatherhood in this hilarious one-hour special.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jk9sStD5fRWZk9qK1PjAON1QXoE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:664473'),
  ('610219257856507133', 'Russell Peters: Notorious', 2013, 'Comedy', 'David Higby', 'Russell Peters', 'Russell Peters', null, 'Now watch comedy rockstar, Russell Peters up-close and personal with his new act and his trademark lightening fast improv with all new material as part of his Notorious World Tour 2013.', 'Now watch comedy rockstar, Russell Peters up-close and personal with his new act and his trademark lightening fast improv with all new material as part of his Notorious World Tour 2013.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v0M9EFaA1UXrVBgnCVKY15gdZ9V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:228009'),
  ('1083132332650484161', 'Russell Peters: Outsourced', 2006, 'Comedy', 'Alan C. Blomquist', 'Russell Peters', 'Russell Peters, Angelo Tsarouchas', 'R', 'Russell’s last DVD and CD, Outsourced, was taped before a sold out audience at the Warfield Theatre in San Francisco, and gives viewers and listeners an excellent overview of Russell’s comedic genius.', 'Russell’s last DVD and CD, Outsourced, was taped before a sold out audience at the Warfield Theatre in San Francisco, and gives viewers and listeners an excellent overview of Russell’s comedic genius.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2uIS6bXgFlzUUdCsDX7jMVw3zBK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23077'),
  ('803314195548172290', 'Russell Peters: Red, White and Brown', 2008, 'Comedy', 'Jigar Talati', null, 'Russell Peters, Melle Mel', null, 'In this sold-out performance, Canadian comic Russell Peters skewers racial stereotypes as he offers his audacious take on multiculturalism--including his Indian heritage and culture clashes around the world. Recorded live at Madison Square Garden''s WAMU theater and broadcast on Showtime, this stand-up concert is not to be missed. Red, White and Brown is the second stand-up comedy album by Canadian comedian Russell Peters, recorded at the WAMU Theatre in Madison Square Garden on February 2, 2008.[3] The CD/DVD was released in Canada on September 30, 2008, and in the U.S. on January 27, 2009, debuting at #3 on the Canadian Albums Chart.[4] The hip hop theme music was produced by Marco Polo, and legendary MC Melle Mel introduced Peters to the stage.', 'In this sold-out performance, Canadian comic Russell Peters skewers racial stereotypes as he offers his audacious take on multiculturalism--including his Indian heritage and culture clashes around the world. Recorded live at Madison Square Garden''s WAMU theater and broadcast on Showtime, this stand-up concert is not to be missed. Red, White and Brown is the second stand-up comedy album by Canadian comedian Russell Peters, recorded at the WAMU Theatre in Madison Square Garden on February 2, 2008.[3] The CD/DVD was released in Canada on September 30, 2008, and in the U.S. on January 27, 2009, debuting at #3 on the Canadian Albums Chart.[4] The hip hop theme music was produced by Marco Polo, and legendary MC Melle Mel introduced Peters to the stage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/845vKEUjyXZdYO6JhCBiWwZ6D83.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20332'),
  ('919868723373316243', 'Russendisko', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Oliver Ziegenbalg', 'Oliver Ziegenbalg, Wladimir Kaminer', 'Matthias Schweighöfer, Friedrich Mücke, Christian Friedel, Peri Baumeister, Susanne Bormann, Pheline Roggan, Imogen Kogge, Rainer Bock', null, 'Three young Russian friends, who move from Moscow to Berlin in a lucky wave of emigration right after the fall of the Berlin wall. They take their chance looking for a better life and find themselves involved in the tales of everyday lunacy on the streets of Berlin and its spirit of the early nineties.', 'Three young Russian friends, who move from Moscow to Berlin in a lucky wave of emigration right after the fall of the Berlin wall. They take their chance looking for a better life and find themselves involved in the tales of everyday lunacy on the streets of Berlin and its spirit of the early nineties.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/34vwgjaGT0ILmKQaWo31PumjoLY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114438'),
  ('805675826191934083', 'Russia 88', 2009, 'Drama', 'Pavel Bardin, Sergey Danduryan', 'Pyotr Fyodorov', 'Pyotr Fyodorov, Andrey Merzlikin, Anton Kuznetsov, Roman Sinitsyn, Aleksandr Sokolovjvskiy, Marina Oryol, Nikolay Machulsky, Mikhail Pavlik', null, 'A gang of skinheads ''Russia 88'' are filming propaganda videos in order to place it on the internet. At the same time the camera records the life of the gang, they become accustomed to this and stop paying attention to it. The leader of the gang ''Blade'' discovers that his sister is dating a guy from the Caucasus. This family drama develops into a tragedy.', 'A gang of skinheads ''Russia 88'' are filming propaganda videos in order to place it on the internet. At the same time the camera records the life of the gang, they become accustomed to this and stop paying attention to it. The leader of the gang ''Blade'' discovers that his sister is dating a guy from the Caucasus. This family drama develops into a tragedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3fK5Tx7OgwKBLZeWZ2uwOZMizBj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49585'),
  ('912055867921973400', 'Russian Ark', 2002, 'Drama, Fantasy, History', 'Aleksandr Sokurov, Tilman Büttner, Marina Koreneva', 'Anatoly Nikiforov, Aleksandr Sokurov', 'Sergey Dreyden, Mariya Kuznetsova, Leonid Mozgovoy, Mikhail Piotrovsky, Edisher (Davit) Giorgobiani, Aleksandr Chaban, Lev Eliseev, Oleg Khmelnitsky', 'NR', 'A ghost and a French marquis wander through the Winter Palace in St Petersburg, encountering scenes from many different periods of its history.', 'A ghost and a French marquis wander through the Winter Palace in St Petersburg, encountering scenes from many different periods of its history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dkFM8Q7J0wNpEnbtD1AcWumkShj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16646'),
  ('479509936840695130', 'Russian Dolls', 2005, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Cédric Klapisch, Alice Cordie, Samantha Mialet', 'Cédric Klapisch', 'Romain Duris, Kelly Reilly, Audrey Tautou, Cécile de France, Kevin Bishop, Olivier Saladin, Zinedine Soualem, Evguenya Obraztsova', null, 'Five years after their summer together in Barcelona, Xavier, William, Wendy, Martine and Isabelle reunite.', 'Five years after their summer together in Barcelona, Xavier, William, Wendy, Martine and Isabelle reunite.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3jB22Ii6FuE6YEMn1BHzsXaFUPm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1826'),
  ('948409967310637970', 'Russian Mom', 2016, 'Drama, Romance', 'Choi Won-joon-I', null, 'Irina Griga, Kang Ye-na, Kim Do-hee, Yoon Se-hyeong, Jeon Ji-hak', null, 'Jang-ho who dreams of becoming a chef is pretty close to his dad Yeong-soo; enough to talk about his girlfriend and they live alone. One day, Yeong-soo tells Jang-ho that he''s getting remarried to a Russian woman. Jang-ho accepts this and meets Olga. He is surprised to see a young and beautiful woman standing before him. A few days later, Yeong-soo goes to Russia on a business trip and Jang-ho and Olga get to know each other.', 'Jang-ho who dreams of becoming a chef is pretty close to his dad Yeong-soo; enough to talk about his girlfriend and they live alone. One day, Yeong-soo tells Jang-ho that he''s getting remarried to a Russian woman. Jang-ho accepts this and meets Olga. He is surprised to see a young and beautiful woman standing before him. A few days later, Yeong-soo goes to Russia on a business trip and Jang-ho and Olga get to know each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hktmN8qVDyzp3I9f7veWfF6l45c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:419116'),
  ('835613833670508081', 'Russian Nymphet: Temptation', 2004, 'Drama, Romance', 'Armen Oganezov', 'Armen Oganezov', 'Oleg Bilitsky, Valeria Nemchenko', null, 'A Russian teen turns the tables on her fashion photographer. Suddenly he doesn''t like being the one on camera!', 'A Russian teen turns the tables on her fashion photographer. Suddenly he doesn''t like being the one on camera!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dYrocmJO2bCFI5aYkuaYogkrgmu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:570595'),
  ('691039104978552426', 'Russian Raid', 2020, 'Action', 'Igor Gotsmanov, Aleksandra Shelukhina, Nina Sidorenko', 'Robert Orr', 'Ivan Kotik, Aleksandr Krasovskiy, Ilya Antonenko, Vladimir Mineev, Nikita Kologrivyy, Sofya Ozerova, Kirill Sarychev, Dmitry Krivochurov', null, 'Nikita, a former Russian Spetsnaz operative, is hired to neutralize the large private security force at a local factory so that his shady employer can extort the business from the factory owner. But Nikita and his group of highly trained fighters get more than they bargained for when it turns out the factory is actually owned by a dangerous warlord connected to the Russian military. By the time the ''hostile takeover'' is complete, Nikita reveals that he has orchestrated his own secret mission to take personal revenge on the most dangerous man in Russia.', 'Nikita, a former Russian Spetsnaz operative, is hired to neutralize the large private security force at a local factory so that his shady employer can extort the business from the factory owner. But Nikita and his group of highly trained fighters get more than they bargained for when it turns out the factory is actually owned by a dangerous warlord connected to the Russian military. By the time the ''hostile takeover'' is complete, Nikita reveals that he has orchestrated his own secret mission to take personal revenge on the most dangerous man in Russia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/58j2eRQ1W9NnKuETQBXg22O0jIL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:651793'),
  ('58893846868452427', 'Russian Red', 2016, 'Drama', 'Charly Braun, Alexandre Samori', 'Martha Nowill, Charly Braun', 'Martha Nowill, Maria Manoella, Soraia Chaves, Esteban Fuene de Colombi, Michel Melamed, Fernando Alves Pinto, Mihail Trojnik, Svetlana Murashova', null, 'Marta and Manu are two Brazilian actresses that decide to move to Moscow to study the Stanislavski method. There, wrapped around a complex love triangle, they must overcome their differences to survive in a different country.', 'Marta and Manu are two Brazilian actresses that decide to move to Moscow to study the Stanislavski method. There, wrapped around a complex love triangle, they must overcome their differences to survive in a different country.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3avPcHFEbSLY0LVhwcmNyx9GmPn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:417595'),
  ('450589342247535095', 'Russian Rhapsody', 1944, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Robert Clampett', null, 'Mel Blanc, Robert C. Bruce', 'NR', 'As Adolf Hitler personally flies a bomber on a mission to the Soviet Union, the gremlins from the Kremlin set about to stop him.', 'As Adolf Hitler personally flies a bomber on a mission to the Soviet Union, the gremlins from the Kremlin set about to stop him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3z857WqrX1qtigEKqzaKgDnQ6zu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:180082'),
  ('542041304061177288', 'Russian Symphony', 1994, 'Drama, Science Fiction', 'Konstantin Lopushansky, Nikolai Pokoptsev, Aleksandr Karelin', 'Konstantin Lopushansky', 'Viktor Mikhaylov, Anatoly Khropov, Anna Aleksakhina, Andrey Krasko, Valentina Kovel, Valeriy Garkalin, Aleksandr Ilin, Valentin Golubenko', null, 'The protagonist finds out that some children were left behind in a sinking school, and is slowly driven mad as he tries to save them. A parable on the theme of the Last Judgment, numerous catastrophic events reveal a certain ambiguity in their origins, accompanied by the terrible suspicion that the things going on are some kind of a performance or theatrical production.', 'The protagonist finds out that some children were left behind in a sinking school, and is slowly driven mad as he tries to save them. A parable on the theme of the Last Judgment, numerous catastrophic events reveal a certain ambiguity in their origins, accompanied by the terrible suspicion that the things going on are some kind of a performance or theatrical production.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mW7IWSc2Y4UUH8fLIAgpap91Mhz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106671'),
  ('415047338475225637', 'Russkies', 1987, 'Drama, Family', 'Rick Rosenthal, Reed Smoot, Louis Race', 'Alan Jay Glueckman, Sheldon Lettich, Michael Nankin', 'Joaquin Phoenix, Peter Billingsley, Whip Hubley, Stefan DeSalle, Summer Phoenix, Susan Walters, Patrick Kilpatrick, Vic Polizos', null, 'A group of American boys discovers a Russian sailor washed up on the coast of Florida and decide to befriend him, assuming that he is friendly and will bring them no danger and thus go against the ideas of their parents, as well as the government.', 'A group of American boys discovers a Russian sailor washed up on the coast of Florida and decide to befriend him, assuming that he is friendly and will bring them no danger and thus go against the ideas of their parents, as well as the government.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A7utYbyrvaKKIbGTH3tsPeSZA20.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27738'),
  ('1092211651551270018', 'Rust', 2011, 'Drama', 'Daniele Gaglianone, Gherardo Gossi, Marita D''Elia', 'Daniele Gaglianone, Alessandro Scippa, Giaime Alonge', 'Filippo Timi, Stefano Accorsi, Valerio Mastandrea, Valeria Solarino, Giampaolo Stella, Giuseppe Furlò, Giulia Coccellato, Giacomo Del Fiacco', null, 'In a hot summer, the lives of the children are about to be changed forever when two girls are found raped and murdered. The children know who the suspect is but knowing that the adults will never believe them, they decide to keep quiet. When one of their friends sister disappear, they know they have to take the matter into their own hands.', 'In a hot summer, the lives of the children are about to be changed forever when two girls are found raped and murdered. The children know who the suspect is but knowing that the adults will never believe them, they decide to keep quiet. When one of their friends sister disappear, they know they have to take the matter into their own hands.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/txWopsaV30LarwgSLJB608zU2De.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73867'),
