  ('57225746801707107', 'Rythmetic', 1956, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Norman McLaren, Evelyn Lambart', null, null, null, 'On a blue background, a series of numbers (1 to 5) begin to appear, forming simple arithmetic equations that create a pattern. Numbers and symbols move as the pattern grows, to a soundtrack of simple beats.', 'On a blue background, a series of numbers (1 to 5) begin to appear, forming simple arithmetic equations that create a pattern. Numbers and symbols move as the pattern grows, to a soundtrack of simple beats.', null, 'tmdb:movie:251122'),
  ('267264582147295164', 'Ryuichi Hirokawa: Human Battlefield', 2015, 'Documentary', 'Saburo Hasegawa, Yutaka Yamazaki', null, 'Ryuichi Hirokawa', null, 'Documentary on photojournalist Ryuichi Hirokawa', 'Documentary on photojournalist Ryuichi Hirokawa', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/U3t9nvNvtrDWKIKiTh0ncRoBVE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1068769'),
  ('244765742825214285', 'Ryuichi Sakamoto: Coda', 2017, 'Documentary, Music', 'Stephen Nomura Schible, Neo Sora, Tom Richmond', 'Stephen Nomura Schible', 'Ryuichi Sakamoto, Leonardo DiCaprio, David Bowie, John Malkovich, Debra Winger, Donatas Banionis, Natalya Bondarchuk, Haruomi Hosono', null, 'Oscar-winning composer Ryuichi Sakamoto weaves man-made and natural sounds together in his works. His anti-nuclear activism grew after the 2011 Fukushima disaster, and his career only paused after a 2014 cancer diagnosis.', 'Oscar-winning composer Ryuichi Sakamoto weaves man-made and natural sounds together in his works. His anti-nuclear activism grew after the 2011 Fukushima disaster, and his career only paused after a 2014 cancer diagnosis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iwd9X3YDEvLy7M8aZsgdpfOKows.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:473888'),
  ('822397397906114210', 'Ryuzo and the Seven Henchmen', 2015, 'Comedy, Action', 'Takeshi Kitano, Katsumi Yanagijima', 'Takeshi Kitano', 'Tatsuya Fuji, Masaomi Kondo, Akira Nakao, Tōru Shinagawa, Ben Hiura, Ryota Nakanishi, Yoshizumi Ito, Ken Yoshizawa', null, 'Ryuzo and his 7 former henchmen are all retired yakuza, but they now live as regular old men. One day, Ryuzo becomes the victim of a phishing fraud. He calls his 7 men together to reform their society.', 'Ryuzo and his 7 former henchmen are all retired yakuza, but they now live as regular old men. One day, Ryuzo becomes the victim of a phishing fraud. He calls his 7 men together to reform their society.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kMPpxlQhsqzImbhctl3lDrOHoQZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:315841'),
  ('1023296233631772563', 'Rzeczpospolita babska', 1969, 'Comedy, War', 'Tadeusz Wieżan, Halina Lachowicz, Helena Bialecka', 'Stanisława Drzewiecka, Hieronim Przybył', 'Aleksandra Zawieruszanka, Zofia Merle, Jan Machulski, Krystyna Chimanienko, Irena Karel, Wiesława Kwaśniewska, Teresa Lipowska, Krystyna Sienkiewicz', null, 'After the end of World War 2 a division of female soldiers settles down at Recovered Territories and make an oath to never enter into relationships with men, which may prove difficult, because male soldiers have also made their home nearby.', 'After the end of World War 2 a division of female soldiers settles down at Recovered Territories and make an oath to never enter into relationships with men, which may prove difficult, because male soldiers have also made their home nearby.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hXrBxnFrX4rh0sbUGmi9AwPRmHt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:302209'),
  ('1117012792762115879', 'S Diary', 2004, 'Comedy', 'Kwon Jong-kwan', 'Kwon Jong-kwan, Choi Jin-young, Joon-Seok Sol', 'Kim Seon-a, Kim Soo-ro, Gong Yoo, Na Moon-hee, Kim Mi-kyeong, Lee Hyeon-woo, Kim Seon-hwa, Shin Dong-hwan', null, 'A cute Korean story about a girl Jini and her memories of first loves. Her mom gave her a diary at coming of age and in the movie she goes through her past boyfriends and reflects on how they''ve given her memories.', 'A cute Korean story about a girl Jini and her memories of first loves. Her mom gave her a diary at coming of age and in the movie she goes through her past boyfriends and reflects on how they''ve given her memories.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jjw3TkkwSVJvDsDAjyIFHtz9Wab.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71248'),
  ('297287734839771056', 'S He', 2018, 'Animation, Fantasy', 'Shengwei Zhou', 'Shengwei Zhou', 'Fuyang Lyu, Shengwei Zhou', null, 'In a dystopian world, male shoes dominate and the females—high-heels with spindly vines—are kept strictly for breeding purposes. Under disguise, a female breaks loose and attempts to move beyond her confines. Her attempt alters not only her fate but the very fabric of society.', 'In a dystopian world, male shoes dominate and the females—high-heels with spindly vines—are kept strictly for breeding purposes. Under disguise, a female breaks loose and attempts to move beyond her confines. Her attempt alters not only her fate but the very fabric of society.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u28c0DHW291SMxaJRFpxS6yjLBx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:532032'),
  ('364357584704268914', 'S Is for Stanley', 2016, 'Documentary', 'Luigi Martinucci, Alex Infascelli, Edoardo Carlo Bolli', 'Alex Infascelli, Vincenzo Scuccimarra, Filippo Ulivieri', 'Emilio D''Alessandro, Janette Woolmore, Alex Infascelli', null, 'The incredible story of the Italian Emilio D''Alessandro, personal driver of the great director Stanley Kubrick (1928-1999), who met Emilio by chance in London in 1971 and hired him, thus establishing a deep friendship that lasted thirty years and helped create four masterpieces of cinema. A moving tale about two seemingly opposing people who found their ideal travel companion far away from home…', 'The incredible story of the Italian Emilio D''Alessandro, personal driver of the great director Stanley Kubrick (1928-1999), who met Emilio by chance in London in 1971 and hired him, thus establishing a deep friendship that lasted thirty years and helped create four masterpieces of cinema. A moving tale about two seemingly opposing people who found their ideal travel companion far away from home…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7TxRQ9JYCmyqDiRPzUtkm2U4Ry8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:399504'),
  ('323095022638774397', 'S: The Last Policeman: Recovery of Our Future', 2015, 'Drama, Crime, Action, Thriller', 'Shunichi Hirano, Koji Kawamoto, Hideo Yamamoto', 'Kazunao Furuya', 'Osamu Mukai, Go Ayano, Yui Aragaki, Nao Omori, Kazue Fukiishi, Munetaka Aoki, Joe Odagiri, Hiroyuki Ikeuchi', null, 'The NPS (National Police Safety Rescue), whose purpose is to catch extreme criminals alive, becomes the center of attention. A sit-in demonstration takes place. Members of the NPS, including Ichigo Kamikura (Osamu Mukai) go to the protest site. Meanwhile, a transport ship is hijacked in the Pacific Ocean.', 'The NPS (National Police Safety Rescue), whose purpose is to catch extreme criminals alive, becomes the center of attention. A sit-in demonstration takes place. Members of the NPS, including Ichigo Kamikura (Osamu Mukai) go to the protest site. Meanwhile, a transport ship is hijacked in the Pacific Ocean.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lxi5gWziqCsHTDXOYxgOHJhHCct.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:372821'),
  ('753497087015180035', 'S. Darko', 2009, 'Thriller, Crime, Science Fiction, Mystery', 'Chris Fisher, Marvin V. Rush, Donald Hauer', 'Nate Atkins', 'Daveigh Chase, Elizabeth Berkley, Briana Evigan, James Lafferty, Ed Westwick, Bret Roberts, Jackson Rathbone, Barbara Tarbuck', 'R', 'Seven years after the events of the first film, Samantha Darko finds herself stranded in a small desert town after her car breaks down where she is plagued by bizarre visions telling of the universe''s end. As a result, she must face her own demons, and in doing so, save the world and herself.', 'Seven years after the events of the first film, Samantha Darko finds herself stranded in a small desert town after her car breaks down where she is plagued by bizarre visions telling of the universe''s end. As a result, she must face her own demons, and in doing so, save the world and herself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/djuhoG2GizTa9SLi2LBuCPAt6N7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17532'),
  ('498357789381781809', 'S.A.S. San Salvador', 1983, 'Action', 'Raoul Coutard, Georges Liron, Sabine Eckhard', 'Gérard de Villiers', 'Raimund Harmstorf, Miles O''Keeffe, Dagmar Lassander, Anton Diffring, Alexander Kerst, Sybil Danning, Monika Kaelin, Catherine Jarret', null, 'Enrique Chacon kills Oscar Romero, a Catholic archbishop in San Salvador. The CIA calls a special agent, Malko Linge, a ruined prince who lives with an expensive woman - Countess Alexandra - to get rid of this nuisance of a man. He does, with many encounters with sweet girls, and macho villains.', 'Enrique Chacon kills Oscar Romero, a Catholic archbishop in San Salvador. The CIA calls a special agent, Malko Linge, a ruined prince who lives with an expensive woman - Countess Alexandra - to get rid of this nuisance of a man. He does, with many encounters with sweet girls, and macho villains.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yOLwjPfmF8PRKuNsiycgBvuc3oM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:167642'),
  ('163543201135031274', 'S.D.U. - Mission in Mission', 1994, 'Action', 'King Lee King-Chu', 'Dick Cho', 'Power Chan Kwok-Pong, Peter Kam-Cheong Yung, Vincent Wan Yeung-Ming, Michael Tao Tai-Yu, Jay Lau Kam-Ling, Kent Cheng Jak-Si, Kent Got Ying-Kin, Bobby Yip Kin-Sang', null, 'The story follows Hunter and Yat, two new hot shot recruits, who under the watchful eye of their commanding officer, Yuk Pai, rise quickly through the ranks, enduring much mental and physical hardship along the way. Their new found skills are put to the test when renegade SDU member returns from seclusion in Thailand to wreak havoc on Hong Kong and the SDU''s most secret missions.', 'The story follows Hunter and Yat, two new hot shot recruits, who under the watchful eye of their commanding officer, Yuk Pai, rise quickly through the ranks, enduring much mental and physical hardship along the way. Their new found skills are put to the test when renegade SDU member returns from seclusion in Thailand to wreak havoc on Hong Kong and the SDU''s most secret missions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fm8EkOzCLONrNT6ys2kV142J0mf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:261287'),
  ('883574961270194632', 'S.F.W.', 1995, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jefery Levy, Peter Deming', 'Danny Rubin, Jefery Levy', 'Stephen Dorff, Reese Witherspoon, Jake Busey, Joey Lauren Adams, Pamela Gidley, David Barry Gray, Jack Noseworthy, Richard Portnow', 'R', 'An alienated and misanthropic teenager gains sudden and unwanted celebrity status after he''s taken hostage by terrorists where his indifference to their threats to kill him makes news headlines.', 'An alienated and misanthropic teenager gains sudden and unwanted celebrity status after he''s taken hostage by terrorists where his indifference to their threats to kill him makes news headlines.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3bq91jWCReRrqlPn81alSoxeXoP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29444'),
  ('58824717928004374', 'S.I.U.', 2011, 'Crime, Action, Adventure', 'Hwang Byeong-gug, Jang Jae-hyun, Kang Seung-gi', 'Hwang Sung-goo, Kim Yu-jin', 'Uhm Tae-woong, Joo Won, Jung Jin-young, Sung Dong-il, Lee Tae-im, Kim Jung-tae, Jo Jae-yun, Jeong Man-sik', null, 'Sung-Bum is a hot-tempered detective who relies on his intuition to crack cases. He rarely comes across a case that he cannot solve. The body of a police officer is then discovered in a burned out car near an abandoned building. Drugs are also found near the dead officer. To catch the killer the police department sets up a special investigation unit for the case. Sung-Bum takes part in the investigation. Ho-Ryong is a young, confident man who works as a criminal profiler. He trained with the F.B.I. in the United States. Ho-Ryong is also assigned to the special investigation unit. Ho-Ryong relies on evidence rather than instinct. Detective Sung-Bum takes an immediate dislike for Ho-Ryong.', 'Sung-Bum is a hot-tempered detective who relies on his intuition to crack cases. He rarely comes across a case that he cannot solve. The body of a police officer is then discovered in a burned out car near an abandoned building. Drugs are also found near the dead officer. To catch the killer the police department sets up a special investigation unit for the case. Sung-Bum takes part in the investigation. Ho-Ryong is a young, confident man who works as a criminal profiler. He trained with the F.B.I. in the United States. Ho-Ryong is also assigned to the special investigation unit. Ho-Ryong relies on evidence rather than instinct. Detective Sung-Bum takes an immediate dislike for Ho-Ryong.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rQf35Q4UJthX6wDnHKJwQJ2YcyD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82994'),
  ('311364807188748951', 'S.M.A.R.T. Chase', 2017, 'Action, Comedy, Adventure, Crime, Thriller', 'Charles Martin, Philipp Blaubach', 'Kevin Bernhardt', 'Orlando Bloom, Leo Wu, Simon Yam, Hannah Quinlivan, Lynn Hung Doi-Lam, Liang Jing, Xing Yu, Thomas Price', 'NR', 'A washed-up private security agent has to escort a valuable Chinese antique out of Shanghai but is ambushed en route.', 'A washed-up private security agent has to escort a valuable Chinese antique out of Shanghai but is ambushed en route.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rw5qHjaMTwER15MfwUG13WXQ0Cy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:473920'),
  ('334224979987272876', 'S.O.B.', 1981, 'Comedy', 'Blake Edwards, Harry Stradling Jr., L. Andrew Stone', 'Blake Edwards', 'Julie Andrews, William Holden, Marisa Berenson, Larry Hagman, Robert Loggia, Stuart Margolin, Richard Mulligan, Robert Preston', 'R', 'A movie producer who made a huge flop tries to salvage his career by revamping his film as an erotic production, where its family-friendly star takes her top off.', 'A movie producer who made a huge flop tries to salvage his career by revamping his film as an erotic production, where its family-friendly star takes her top off.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6irq1xZdQ8rC4AuxPDlA9NkPyYs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27225'),
  ('454311403183274930', 'S.O.S MAMIS 2: New Mom On The Block', 2023, 'Comedy, Family', 'Eduardo Pacheco, Camila Collao, Teo Asensio Bascuñan', 'Aníbal Herrera, Mirella Granucci', 'Paz Bascuñan, María Elena Swett, Tamara Acosta, Loreto Aravena, Jenny Cavallo, Karla Melo, Leonor Asensio Bascuñan, Ricardo Fernández', null, 'Daniela is the new mother at Saint Michael School. Trini feels that there is something wrong with Daniela, she will discover her big secret, showing the true nature of Daniela.', 'Daniela is the new mother at Saint Michael School. Trini feels that there is something wrong with Daniela, she will discover her big secret, showing the true nature of Daniela.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s2mKUNizHPYjjXkt9rv6ZWmpKmI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1159259'),
  ('725843561409082145', 'S.O.S. Mamis: The Movie', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Gabriela Sobarzo, Camila Collao, Antonio Quercia', 'Mirella Granucci, Aníbal Herrera', 'Paz Bascuñan, Loreto Aravena, María Elena Swett, Tamara Acosta, Jenny Cavallo, Ignacia Allamand, Ricardo Fernández, Marcial Tagle', null, 'Trini''s daughter is sad that her best friend is leaving Saint Michael School since her mother can''t keep paying for it. Trini promises her daughter that this won''t happen and decides to put together a plan with the other "mamis" of the group to solve the problem. But this mission will be much more difficult than they thought and they will have to stick together as a group.', 'Trini''s daughter is sad that her best friend is leaving Saint Michael School since her mother can''t keep paying for it. Trini promises her daughter that this won''t happen and decides to put together a plan with the other "mamis" of the group to solve the problem. But this mission will be much more difficult than they thought and they will have to stick together as a group.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dubFxWUiXW4QzOygVsChYYIuzfx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:949218'),
  ('410226950765271718', 'S.O.S. Survive or Sacrifice', 2020, 'Adventure, Thriller', 'Roman Doronin, Kirill Speranskiy', 'Roman Doronin', 'Jeannine Kaspar, Marianna Rosset, Ksenia Pinch, Zach Rose, Crystal Webb, Diljohn Singh, William Baldwin', null, 'Two sisters living separate lives on different continents are reunited on a Mediterranean Island. The two barely have time to bond and revive family ties as Kate, the elder, meets a group of locals and agrees to an exciting ride on a hot air balloon. But disaster strikes and as the result of a freak accident, the balloon is carried far out to sea. Their cell phones out of range, and the balloon running out of gas, Kate and her friends are battling for their lives. While, back on land, the younger sister, Liz, has become an unwanted "material witness" to a crime. Matters then take a dramatic twist, one that will mark their lives forever.', 'Two sisters living separate lives on different continents are reunited on a Mediterranean Island. The two barely have time to bond and revive family ties as Kate, the elder, meets a group of locals and agrees to an exciting ride on a hot air balloon. But disaster strikes and as the result of a freak accident, the balloon is carried far out to sea. Their cell phones out of range, and the balloon running out of gas, Kate and her friends are battling for their lives. While, back on land, the younger sister, Liz, has become an unwanted "material witness" to a crime. Matters then take a dramatic twist, one that will mark their lives forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cqLekREuHyuX5Xe3wvRnERS8Hia.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:758545'),
  ('771536478656292290', 'S.O.S. Titanic', 1980, 'History, Drama, Thriller, TV Movie', 'William Hale, Christopher Challis', 'James Costigan', 'David Janssen, Cloris Leachman, Susan Saint James, David Warner, Ian Holm, Helen Mirren, Harry Andrews, David Battley', null, 'The Titanic disaster as seen through the eyes of one couple in each of the three classes on board.', 'The Titanic disaster as seen through the eyes of one couple in each of the three classes on board.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wy5ut2GVpPaNxxXFRdkIywjRpeO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86938'),
  ('764175000107416353', 'S.O.S.: Women to the Sea', 2014, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Cris D''amato, Bruno Garotti, Felipe Reinheimer', 'Marcelo Saback, Sylvio Gonçalves, Rodrigo Nogueira', 'Giovanna Antonelli, Fabiula Nascimento, Thalita Carauta, Reynaldo Gianecchini, Emanuelle Araújo, Marcello Airoldi, Rodrigo Ferrarini, Karina Marthin', null, 'Recently divorced Adriana tries to get revenge on the woman who took her husband away from her by going on a European cruze along with them.', 'Recently divorced Adriana tries to get revenge on the woman who took her husband away from her by going on a European cruze along with them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3cB6m75oYbbuRI9K1Tgi2DBKhw9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:227961'),
  ('739101226602899419', 'S.O.S.: Women to the Sea 2', 2015, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Cris D''amato, Chris Spaight Babcock, Anita Barbosa', 'Bruno Garotti, Sylvio Gonçalves', 'Giovanna Antonelli, Thalita Carauta, Fabiula Nascimento, Reynaldo Gianecchini, Gil Coelho, Felipe Roque, Felipe Montanari, Rhaissa Batista', null, 'Afraid her husband will fall back with his ex girlfriend after they''re assigned to work together, Adriana and her sister set sail to the U.S. to go after him to stop this from happening.', 'Afraid her husband will fall back with his ex girlfriend after they''re assigned to work together, Adriana and her sister set sail to the U.S. to go after him to stop this from happening.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aQKthnMTPMTOJmHepgWMOQhE7qX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:337706'),
  ('667021582924756246', 'S.P.Q.R.: 2,000 and a Half Years Ago', 1994, 'Comedy', 'Carlo Vanzina, Gianlorenzo Battaglia', 'Enrico Vanzina, Carlo Vanzina', 'Christian De Sica, Massimo Boldi, Leslie Nielsen, Gabriella Labate, Nadia Rinaldi, Marco Vivio, Cash Casia, Yoon C. Joyce', null, 'In 71 BC in Rome, utter disorder reigns in the form of political corruption and bribery involving the senator Cynic (Leslie Nielsen). The situation is claimed to be similar to the “Tangentopoli” situation in Italy in the 1990s: one of the politicians involved was Bettino Craxi.', 'In 71 BC in Rome, utter disorder reigns in the form of political corruption and bribery involving the senator Cynic (Leslie Nielsen). The situation is claimed to be similar to the “Tangentopoli” situation in Italy in the 1990s: one of the politicians involved was Bettino Craxi.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tzRo3DbGDtCMEmi5ZOzlCSZThoL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11334'),
