  ('824669876550935255', 'S.S.D.', 2008, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Vadim Shmelyov, Oleg Kirichenko, Gennady Meder', 'Vadim Shmelyov, Denis Karyshev', 'Dmitriy Kubasov, Evgenia Brik, Artyom Mazunov, Ivan Nikolaev, Stanislav Erdley, Karina Myndrovskaya, Yekaterina Kopanova, Veronika Ivashchenko', null, 'On TV a new reality show, "Pionerlager", has started. Following the results of a casting, five young men and five girls, led by young TV presenter Alice Ten, go to the thrown pioneer camp. The rules state that every week someone would be eliminated from the show. The last one remaining will win the main prize: one million roubles. But suddenly game rules change: the invisible observer declares that it is life, not money, that will be the award for the winner. The maniac hiding behind the mask of a horse, begins a hunt for the participants. Children''s horror stories which he once listened to in pioneer camp, revive and become a plot of its own murders.', 'On TV a new reality show, "Pionerlager", has started. Following the results of a casting, five young men and five girls, led by young TV presenter Alice Ten, go to the thrown pioneer camp. The rules state that every week someone would be eliminated from the show. The last one remaining will win the main prize: one million roubles. But suddenly game rules change: the invisible observer declares that it is life, not money, that will be the award for the winner. The maniac hiding behind the mask of a horse, begins a hunt for the participants. Children''s horror stories which he once listened to in pioneer camp, revive and become a plot of its own murders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7EqQUQPSoFnv9qD6oEOPjjzxhAf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60068'),
  ('25454597497390925', 'S.W.A.T.', 2003, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Clark Johnson, Gabriel Beristain, Lars P. Winther', 'David Ayer, David McKenna', 'Samuel L. Jackson, Colin Farrell, Michelle Rodriguez, LL Cool J, Josh Charles, Jeremy Renner, Brian Van Holt, Olivier Martinez', 'PG-13', 'Hondo Harrelson recruits Jim Street to join an elite unit of the Los Angeles Police Department. Together they seek out more members, including tough Deke Kay and single mom Chris Sanchez. The team''s first big assignment is to escort crime boss Alex Montel to prison. It seems routine, but when Montel offers a huge reward to anyone who can break him free, criminals of various stripes step up for the prize.', 'Hondo Harrelson recruits Jim Street to join an elite unit of the Los Angeles Police Department. Together they seek out more members, including tough Deke Kay and single mom Chris Sanchez. The team''s first big assignment is to escort crime boss Alex Montel to prison. It seems routine, but when Montel offers a huge reward to anyone who can break him free, criminals of various stripes step up for the prize.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bon63yPVIgUFLP2653Dg9GCOJLJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9257'),
  ('734761718674705551', 'S.W.A.T.', 2019, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Ding Sheng', 'Ding Sheng', 'Ling Xiaosu, Jia Nailiang, Jin Chen, Leon Zhang, Robert Knepper, Kevin Lee, Liu Wenbo, Liu Junxiao', null, 'The story centers on the Chinese Special Police Unit, from their hard training to their first mission.', 'The story centers on the Chinese Special Police Unit, from their hard training to their first mission.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wFklu01YHWhp2MxljR8e3XyvpPp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:559937'),
  ('633543302439764678', 'S.W.A.T.: Firefight', 2011, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Benny Boom, Don Davis, Mike Ellis', 'Reed Steiner', 'Gabriel Macht, Robert Patrick, Carly Pope, Giancarlo Esposito, Kristanna Loken, Matt Bushell, Nicholas Gonzalez, Shannon Kane', 'R', 'Los Angeles S.W.A.T. officer, Lt. Paul Cutler, is sent to train the Detroit S.W.A.T. team on new anti-terrorism and homeland security techniques. Cutler has a hard time settling into his assignment as he locks horns with his new captain and encounters resistance from the team he must lead. Cutler begins to adjust to his new assignment, starting a budding romance with police psychologist Kim Byers along the way. Unexpectedly, a routine hostage call turns deadly, and a relentless ex-government agent named Walter Hatch vows revenge on Cutler and the entire S.W.A.T. team for killing the woman he loves. Cutler must use his considerable S.W.A.T. training and knowledge to save his teammates and defeat a trained killer.', 'Los Angeles S.W.A.T. officer, Lt. Paul Cutler, is sent to train the Detroit S.W.A.T. team on new anti-terrorism and homeland security techniques. Cutler has a hard time settling into his assignment as he locks horns with his new captain and encounters resistance from the team he must lead. Cutler begins to adjust to his new assignment, starting a budding romance with police psychologist Kim Byers along the way. Unexpectedly, a routine hostage call turns deadly, and a relentless ex-government agent named Walter Hatch vows revenge on Cutler and the entire S.W.A.T. team for killing the woman he loves. Cutler must use his considerable S.W.A.T. training and knowledge to save his teammates and defeat a trained killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aUr0RzL0jDxdlpJsOiBy4mkLC0i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54445'),
  ('1125310336280142393', 'S.W.A.T.: Under Siege', 2017, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Tony Giglio, Michael Balfry', 'Jonas Barnes, Keith Domingue', 'Adrianne Palicki, Michael Jai White, Ty Olsson, Pascale Hutton, Sam Jaeger, Monique Ganderton, Kyra Zagorsky, Olivia Cheng', 'R', 'When a D.E.A. and S.W.A.T. cartel takedown ends in a shootout, S.W.A.T. Agent Travis Hall seizes a mysterious prisoner taking him into custody. Before long, the S.W.A.T. compound is under siege by wave-after-wave of assault teams attempting to recover the prisoner known as “The Scorpion” for the tattoo blazed across his back. When Travis discovers that his prisoner is a Secret Ops double agent planted within the cartel, it’s up to him and his expert S.W.A.T. team to keep “The Scorpion” and his billion dollar secrets safe.', 'When a D.E.A. and S.W.A.T. cartel takedown ends in a shootout, S.W.A.T. Agent Travis Hall seizes a mysterious prisoner taking him into custody. Before long, the S.W.A.T. compound is under siege by wave-after-wave of assault teams attempting to recover the prisoner known as “The Scorpion” for the tattoo blazed across his back. When Travis discovers that his prisoner is a Secret Ops double agent planted within the cartel, it’s up to him and his expert S.W.A.T. team to keep “The Scorpion” and his billion dollar secrets safe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sGcDltZ2aUgLV7oFxGlpO1oGmc0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:461053'),
  ('154699626977692646', 'S*P*Y*S', 1974, 'Action, Comedy', 'Irvin Kershner, Gerry Fisher, Mishka Cheyko', 'Lawrence J. Cohen, Fred Freeman, Malcolm Marmorstein', 'Elliott Gould, Donald Sutherland, Zouzou, Joss Ackland, Xavier Gélin, Vladek Sheybal, Michael Petrovitch, Shane Rimmer', 'PG', 'Two CIA bunglers botch a Soviet defection, then both sides mark them for termination.', 'Two CIA bunglers botch a Soviet defection, then both sides mark them for termination.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9QFu1cBye3h9WKlbPojd7nAbPV4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35405'),
  ('824431901380156034', 'S&M Hunter', 1986, 'Comedy', 'Shūji Kataoka, Toshio Shimura, Takaaki Hashiguchi', 'Shūji Kataoka', 'Shirō Shimomoto, Hiromi Saotome, Yutaka Ikejima, Ayu Kiyokawa, Bunmei Tobayama, Naomi Sugishita, Mie Mogami, Utako Sarashina', 'NR', 'When the all-girl gang, The Bombers, kidnap a man to use as their personal sex slave, S&M Hunter accepts the mission to infiltrate The Bombers'' hideout and show them the ropes.', 'When the all-girl gang, The Bombers, kidnap a man to use as their personal sex slave, S&M Hunter accepts the mission to infiltrate The Bombers'' hideout and show them the ropes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5lv32sQLdD9nrxGtLUthnYcRBcG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39873'),
  ('651618187266384926', 'S&M Judge', 2009, 'Drama', 'Erik Lamens, Stijn Van der Veken', 'Erik Lamens', 'Gene Bervoets, Veerle Dobbelaere, Dirk van Dijck, Koen van Impe, Marie Vinck, Axel Daeseleire, Tom Waes, Bruno Vanden Broecke', null, 'In 1997, the Belgian public was in shock when judge Koen A. was convicted for the S&amp;M relationship with his wife. Although their life was destroyed by the verdict, Koen and his wife Magda remain together today. The film is a story about dark sexuality and true love, told from the lover''s unique point of view', 'In 1997, the Belgian public was in shock when judge Koen A. was convicted for the S&amp;M relationship with his wife. Although their life was destroyed by the verdict, Koen and his wife Magda remain together today. The film is a story about dark sexuality and true love, told from the lover''s unique point of view', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dSfZAvoofKj8lwXdnAgFBsBjwlU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21167'),
  ('427488672298527416', 'S&Man', 2006, 'Horror', 'J.T. Petty, Patrick McGraw', 'J.T. Petty', 'Elizabeth Cartier, Carol J. Clover, Debbie D, Michelle Glick, Bill Zebub, Jerami Cruise, Freddy Dingo, Meg Kaplan', 'R', 'S&Man (also known as Sandman) is a 2006 pseudo-documentary film that examines the underground subculture of horror films. It combines real interviews with indie horror film makers and a scripted plot that does not immediately come into focus until the second half of the film.', 'S&Man (also known as Sandman) is a 2006 pseudo-documentary film that examines the underground subculture of horror films. It combines real interviews with indie horror film makers and a scripted plot that does not immediately come into focus until the second half of the film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xdRU8P5HgG0ajQ5vfD631HxYOiH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67742'),
  ('1107418868819793472', 'S1m0ne', 2002, 'Science Fiction, Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Andrew Niccol, Edward Lachman, Rosemary C. Cremona', 'Andrew Niccol', 'Al Pacino, Rachel Roberts, Catherine Keener, Evan Rachel Wood, Jay Mohr, Winona Ryder, Jason Schwartzman, Elias Koteas', 'PG-13', 'The career of a disillusioned producer, who is desperate for a hit, is endangered when his star walks off the film set. Forced to think fast, the producer decides to digitally create an actress "Simone" to sub for the star — the first totally believable synthetic actress.', 'The career of a disillusioned producer, who is desperate for a hit, is endangered when his star walks off the film set. Forced to think fast, the producer decides to digitally create an actress "Simone" to sub for the star — the first totally believable synthetic actress.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mdHEOCSGPvwa9pYiV1ZDZ1ihj42.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9296'),
  ('703801144715608006', 'S21: The Khmer Rouge Killing Machine', 2003, 'Documentary, History, War', 'Rithy Panh, Prum Mésar, Rithy Panh', 'Rithy Panh', 'Chum Mey, Khieu ''Poev'' Ches, Yeay Cheu, Nhiem Ein, Houy Him, Ta Him, Nhieb Ho, Prakk Kahn', null, 'Documentary of the S-21 genocide prison in Phnom Penh with interviews of prisoners and guards. On the search for reasons why this could have happened.', 'Documentary of the S-21 genocide prison in Phnom Penh with interviews of prisoners and guards. On the search for reasons why this could have happened.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7lkXz41WJjIvoHCnsLtXMqvCeiW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43936'),
  ('184695721110204537', 'S4: The Bob Lazar Story', 2026, 'Documentary', 'Luigi Vendittelli', null, 'Bob Lazar, George Knapp, Gene Huff', null, 'Over 35 years after Bob Lazar''s revelations, this documentary exposes secrets of a facility the government still denies. Featuring Lazar''s testimony, recreations, and new evidence, it reopens a case that continues to spark global curiosity', 'Over 35 years after Bob Lazar''s revelations, this documentary exposes secrets of a facility the government still denies. Featuring Lazar''s testimony, recreations, and new evidence, it reopens a case that continues to spark global curiosity', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9ipDFr3eSAIqTLDYdKwuFAsOxc9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1462146'),
  ('864012239708732557', 'Sa Bang-ji', 1988, 'Drama, Romance, History', 'Joo Hong-shik, Song Gyeong-sik', 'An Tae-kun, Chi Sang-hak', 'Lee Hye-young, Bang Hee, Kwak Jeong-Hee, Park Am, Lee Kyeong-hui', null, 'Sa Bangji was an intersex person who according to historical records lived during Korea’s Joseon Dynasty. Taken in by a kindly benefactor, Sa Bangji lives in a monastery that is one day visited by a young widow, Lee So-sa, who is in mourning following the death of her husband. The pair’s meeting seems predestined, with the erotic attraction between Sa Bangji and Lee So-sa soon evolving into something far more transcendent – and dangerous. While aspects of the film – its stylised depiction of female actors and sex – identify it as a product of its time, Sa Bangji is undeniably a milestone in screen representations of intersex people, a film that refuses to shy away from the horrendous stigmatization faced by its titular character.', 'Sa Bangji was an intersex person who according to historical records lived during Korea’s Joseon Dynasty. Taken in by a kindly benefactor, Sa Bangji lives in a monastery that is one day visited by a young widow, Lee So-sa, who is in mourning following the death of her husband. The pair’s meeting seems predestined, with the erotic attraction between Sa Bangji and Lee So-sa soon evolving into something far more transcendent – and dangerous. While aspects of the film – its stylised depiction of female actors and sex – identify it as a product of its time, Sa Bangji is undeniably a milestone in screen representations of intersex people, a film that refuses to shy away from the horrendous stigmatization faced by its titular character.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uFsTrW5qzU2l3YE0ataLoUgfsjJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:585032'),
  ('744723113617140601', 'Saagar', 1985, 'Romance, Drama', 'Ramesh Sippy, S M Anwar', 'Javed Akhtar', 'Rishi Kapoor, Kamal Haasan, Dimple Kapadia, Nadira, Saeed Jaffrey, Madhur Jaffrey, A.K. Hangal, Shafi Inamdar', null, 'Raja, a fisherman is secretly in love with Mona. When wealthy Ravi comes to live with his grandmother, Kamladevi, he sees Mona and falls in love with her. Mona also reciprocates his love. Raja is devastated by this turn of events. But when Kamladevi gets to know that Ravi is seeing Mona, she puts pressure on Mona to give up Ravi and marry someone else.', 'Raja, a fisherman is secretly in love with Mona. When wealthy Ravi comes to live with his grandmother, Kamladevi, he sees Mona and falls in love with her. Mona also reciprocates his love. Raja is devastated by this turn of events. But when Kamladevi gets to know that Ravi is seeing Mona, she puts pressure on Mona to give up Ravi and marry someone else.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e3B199JqDmGvuY6DtBe9ZTANZ1G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:144672'),
  ('284360995951910462', 'Saaho', 2019, 'Action, Adventure, Thriller', 'Sujeeth, Prashanth Reddy, Aarun Kumar Thevar', 'Sujeeth', 'Prabhas, Shraddha Kapoor, Neil Nitin Mukesh, Chunky Panday, Mandira Bedi, Arun Vijay, Murali Sharma, Jackie Shroff', 'NR', 'A battle for power ensues as warring gangters thrive to gain possession of a "black box" that can make them richer than they already are, and an undercover cop intervenes with the help of his sharp intellect and an instinct to kill.', 'A battle for power ensues as warring gangters thrive to gain possession of a "black box" that can make them richer than they already are, and an undercover cop intervenes with the help of his sharp intellect and an instinct to kill.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/abjWQwUakmBUecf73jiZDx5iex0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:454292'),
  ('652624143708384279', 'Saajan', 1991, 'Drama, Romance', 'Lawrence D''Souza, Arshad Parvez, Lawrence D''Souza', 'Reema Rakesh Nath', 'Sanjay Dutt, Salman Khan, Madhuri Dixit, Laxmikant Berde, Kader Khan, Reema Lagoo, Pankaj Udhas, Ekta Sohini', null, 'Breaking conventional barriers, a poor, disabled orphan befriends the son of a wealthy businessman. However, their friendship is put to the test after both friends fall in love with the same woman.', 'Breaking conventional barriers, a poor, disabled orphan befriends the son of a wealthy businessman. However, their friendship is put to the test after both friends fall in love with the same woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wg4WBjFhYZeLaaQhE3NeFyfTn2Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107745'),
  ('55524871660207830', 'Saajan Chale Sasural', 1996, 'Comedy, Romance', 'David Dhawan', null, 'Govinda, Karisma Kapoor, Tabu, Kader Khan, Shakti Kapoor, Satish Kaushik, Satish Shah, Arjun', null, 'Naive villager Shyamsunder, who sings, comes to Bombay to try his luck with Bollywood and wealth. He ends up on the streets, playing for small alms. He meets with another musician, Muthu Swami, and both attempt to meet the owner of Tips Cassettes, Mr. Khurana, for an audition, in vain though. Then one day, Shyamsunder meets beautiful Divya, the only daughter of Mr. Khurana, and both fall in love with each other. Divya would like to marry Shyamsunder, and also further his career. What she does not know is that Shyamsunder loves another woman from his village by the name of Pooja, who he has promised to marry. Pooja arrives in the city, and with Divya already present there, Shyamsunder and Muthu Swami invent a look-alike of Shyamsunder, with hilarious results.', 'Naive villager Shyamsunder, who sings, comes to Bombay to try his luck with Bollywood and wealth. He ends up on the streets, playing for small alms. He meets with another musician, Muthu Swami, and both attempt to meet the owner of Tips Cassettes, Mr. Khurana, for an audition, in vain though. Then one day, Shyamsunder meets beautiful Divya, the only daughter of Mr. Khurana, and both fall in love with each other. Divya would like to marry Shyamsunder, and also further his career. What she does not know is that Shyamsunder loves another woman from his village by the name of Pooja, who he has promised to marry. Pooja arrives in the city, and with Divya already present there, Shyamsunder and Muthu Swami invent a look-alike of Shyamsunder, with hilarious results.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hv9ro0IWbhqyTkSLxGU4aaQBamK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:166871'),
  ('895784705271715321', 'Saamy', 2003, 'Action, Drama', 'Hari, Priyan', 'Hari', 'Vikram, Trisha Krishnan, Vijayakumar, Delhi Ganesh, Kota Srinivasa Rao, Manorama, Vivek, Ramesh Khanna', null, 'A policeman accepts bribes from corrupt politicians and local thugs to help them in their illegal work. However, he decides to correct his mistakes after he falls in love with a woman.', 'A policeman accepts bribes from corrupt politicians and local thugs to help them in their illegal work. However, he decides to correct his mistakes after he falls in love with a woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p7LQw6a2DCEqlyR48phqxZg1l0z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49029'),
  ('588332593250833801', 'Saand Ki Aankh', 2019, 'Drama', 'Sudhakar Reddy Yakkanti, Tushar Hiranandani', 'Balwinder Singh Janjua', 'Taapsee Pannu, Bhumi Pednekar, Prakash Jha, Pawan Chopra, Kuldeep Sareen, Shaad Randhawa, Vineet Kumar Singh, Sara Arjun', null, 'Following the exciting story of the world''s oldest sharpshooters Chandro and Prakashi Tomar, the drama marks the directorial debut of acclaimed scriptwriter Tushar Hiranandani. The film stars Bhumi Pednekar and Taapsee Pannu.', 'Following the exciting story of the world''s oldest sharpshooters Chandro and Prakashi Tomar, the drama marks the directorial debut of acclaimed scriptwriter Tushar Hiranandani. The film stars Bhumi Pednekar and Taapsee Pannu.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y2W3FuqjIQO83ZQxcW8pM6HP7D7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:523278'),
  ('499869231767519570', 'Saani Kaayidham', 2022, 'Crime, Action, Drama, Romance', 'Arun Matheswaran, Yamini Yagnamurthy', 'Arun Matheswaran', 'Keerthy Suresh, Selvaraghavan, Kanna Ravi, Lizzie Antony, Vinodh Munna, Aadukalam Murugadoss, R. K. Vijaimurugan', null, 'A police constable from an oppressed caste and her half-brother go after the dominant caste men who raped her and burned her husband and kid alive.', 'A police constable from an oppressed caste and her half-brother go after the dominant caste men who raped her and burned her husband and kid alive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rm1f70UT6SMYcM31hrM5Dl2tpWy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:755393'),
  ('736730602736082893', 'Saaransh', 1984, 'Drama', 'Adeep Tandon, Mahesh Bhatt', 'Mahesh Bhatt, Sujit Sen', 'Anupam Kher, Rohini Hattangadi, Soni Razdan, Madan Jain, Suhas Bhalekar, Vijay Kashyap, Suresh Chatwal, Salim Ghouse', null, 'A retired school teacher and his wife come to terms with life after the death of their only son in a mugging incident on the streets of New York.', 'A retired school teacher and his wife come to terms with life after the death of their only son in a mugging incident on the streets of New York.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pSGvEfaQvKGyH1N8dQBt3F2lJKK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:132338'),
  ('833430168266503319', 'Saathiya', 2002, 'Romance, Drama', 'Shaad Ali, Siddhartha Luther, Hassan Kutty', 'Mani Ratnam', 'Vivek Oberoi, Rani Mukerji, Tanuja Samarth, Sharat Saxena, Satish Shah, Swaroop Sampat, Shah Rukh Khan, Tabu', null, 'A couple elopes to get married and set up home hoping that just love will do the trick - but that''s just the beginning of their story.', 'A couple elopes to get married and set up home hoping that just love will do the trick - but that''s just the beginning of their story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/905TrVqL3R6PmaT2difJaB6I0OM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20656'),
  ('226997209809386069', 'Saawariya', 2007, 'Drama, Music, Romance, Family', 'Sanjay Leela Bhansali, Shailey Sharma, Vibhu Puri', 'Vibhu Puri', 'Ranbir Kapoor, Sonam Kapoor Ahuja, Rani Mukerji, Salman Khan, Zohra Sehgal, Begum Para, Kenny Desai, Vibha Chibber', 'PG', 'Two souls arrive in a small town, one on vacation, the other to meet a lover. They spend the most magical dream-like days of their lives in that town... with each other.', 'Two souls arrive in a small town, one on vacation, the other to meet a lover. They spend the most magical dream-like days of their lives in that town... with each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k5JRtA6Np3n0nTr11QK6Pt9gm4r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16283'),
  ('244742172404845670', 'Saaya', 2003, 'Mystery, Horror', 'Anurag Basu', 'Amol Shetge', 'John Abraham, Tara Sharma, Mahima Chaudhry, Zohra Sehgal, Raj Zutshi, Shreya Ghoshal, Akshita Mutreja, Sadiya Siddiqui', null, 'Tanya is a rich woman who is married to another rich man named Vinod. But their lives change by Vinod''s death. Tanya than starts falling in love with a doctor named Akash. But Akash is in love with a woman named Maya and after some time gets married to her. But their marriage does not last long. Because, first Maya leaves him to travel to another part of India to help people who are sick; and then Akash receives news that she is dead. Tanya comes up to console Akash and hopes that he will now love, accept and marry her. But Akash does not do so, as he is still immersed in Maya''s memories, and believes that Maya is still alive and calling out to him. Is Akash going out of his mind?', 'Tanya is a rich woman who is married to another rich man named Vinod. But their lives change by Vinod''s death. Tanya than starts falling in love with a doctor named Akash. But Akash is in love with a woman named Maya and after some time gets married to her. But their marriage does not last long. Because, first Maya leaves him to travel to another part of India to help people who are sick; and then Akash receives news that she is dead. Tanya comes up to console Akash and hopes that he will now love, accept and marry her. But Akash does not do so, as he is still immersed in Maya''s memories, and believes that Maya is still alive and calling out to him. Is Akash going out of his mind?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gsbI2smESxO0JExRbawfZSYJwSa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:205211'),
  ('198090857918539350', 'Saayavanam', 2025, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Anil Kumar, L. Ramachandran', 'Viju Ramachandran', 'Santhosh Damodharan, Soundara Raja, Devananda Shajilal, Appukutty, Janaki Jayaraman, Vetrivel Raja, Mathew Mampra', null, 'Sita tries to live an honest and truthful life following all religious and social norms of her upbringing while unraveling the true agenda of men around her. In this process, she emerges victorious as a strong and brave woman.', 'Sita tries to live an honest and truthful life following all religious and social norms of her upbringing while unraveling the true agenda of men around her. In this process, she emerges victorious as a strong and brave woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/FfkveUaCib1ukPkBMeU2IFQcqw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1310458'),
  ('577310646299373992', 'Sabadazo', 1988, null, 'Arturo Martínez', null, 'Julio Alemán, Roberto ''El Flaco'' Guzmán, Sergio Goyri, Dacia González, Arturo Martínez, Bruno Rey, Humberto Elizondo, Antonio Raxel', null, 'Realizing that he''s out of touch with "the common people," a Mexico City politician spends a weekend slumming among the plebes he''s supposed to represent.', 'Realizing that he''s out of touch with "the common people," a Mexico City politician spends a weekend slumming among the plebes he''s supposed to represent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nzVSIC0r0VVCBHp3WAHI2BUHprV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:625418'),
