  ('622231535577466063', 'Sabah', 2005, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Ruba Nadda, Luc Montpellier', 'Ruba Nadda', 'Arsinée Khanjian, Jeff Seymour, Kathryn Winslow, Shawn Doyle, Setta Keshishian, Roula Said, Fadia Nadda, Aaron Abrams', null, 'One day, when Sabah least expects it, she falls in love with the wrong man. She''s Muslim, he''s not. Unbeknownst to her family, she goes on a whirlwind affair before both culture and love collide.', 'One day, when Sabah least expects it, she falls in love with the wrong man. She''s Muslim, he''s not. Unbeknownst to her family, she goes on a whirlwind affair before both culture and love collide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mo2cYWxTMipPtVZcEix5XiSb7Gf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61559'),
