  ('1036129574686573067', 'Sack Race', 1896, 'Documentary', 'Louis Lumière', null, null, null, 'Shot in 1896, this playful actuality captures workers from the Lumière factory in Lyon competing in a sack race. The scene shows the participants’ comic struggles and falls, with onlookers enjoying the lighthearted contest. Beyond its humor, the film offers a glimpse of everyday leisure and camaraderie among the Lumière workforce during cinema’s earliest years.', 'Shot in 1896, this playful actuality captures workers from the Lumière factory in Lyon competing in a sack race. The scene shows the participants’ comic struggles and falls, with onlookers enjoying the lighthearted contest. Beyond its humor, the film offers a glimpse of everyday leisure and camaraderie among the Lumière workforce during cinema’s earliest years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/23g6cmwpbBur0kv7tlE1k6CWld9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:190572'),
  ('1026332923217638162', 'Sacramento', 2025, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Michael Angarano, Ben Mullen, René Peraza', 'Christopher Nicholas Smith, Michael Angarano', 'Michael Cera, Michael Angarano, Maya Erskine, Kristen Stewart, Rosalind Chao, Bunny Levine, Amber Riat, Iman Karram', 'R', 'When free-spirited Rickey suddenly reappears in father-to-be Glenn’s life, the two former best friends embark on a spontaneous road trip from LA to Sacramento.', 'When free-spirited Rickey suddenly reappears in father-to-be Glenn’s life, the two former best friends embark on a spontaneous road trip from LA to Sacramento.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9tAHcIb9hys2rO6eDcKatjVOLR8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:842931'),
  ('865368626152920905', 'Sacred Heart', 2005, 'Drama', 'Ferzan Özpetek, Gian Filippo Corticelli', 'Ferzan Özpetek, Gianni Romoli', 'Barbora Bobuľová, Andrea Di Stefano, Lisa Gastoni, Massimo Poggio, Camille Dugay Comencini, Gigi Angelillo, Erika Blanc, Caterina Vertova', null, 'Irene, a workaholic, is forced to re-evaluate her priorities after the suicide of her two best friends.', 'Irene, a workaholic, is forced to re-evaluate her priorities after the suicide of her two best friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ruf42yD7jOSqMMPbjcr2ZbRg19A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43584'),
  ('1012638382831690086', 'Sacred Planet', 2004, 'Documentary', 'Jon Long', 'Karen Fernandez Long, Jon Long', 'Robert Redford, Arapata McKay, Tsaan Ciqae, Mae Tui, Cy Peck Jr., Mutang Urud', 'G', 'SACRED PLANET is a journey away from the hectic "world" we live in. Through stunning cinematography, it transports you to some of the most fascinating, exotic, and remote sites on Earth, giving you new insights into her diverse landscapes, peoples, and animals. You''ll be mesmerized by the beauty of these all-but-forgotten faraway places, the majesty of the creatures who live there, and the wisdom of the elders who hold the knowledge of the past. This magical around-the-world odyssey is an awe-inspiring wonder the entire family will enjoy.', 'SACRED PLANET is a journey away from the hectic "world" we live in. Through stunning cinematography, it transports you to some of the most fascinating, exotic, and remote sites on Earth, giving you new insights into her diverse landscapes, peoples, and animals. You''ll be mesmerized by the beauty of these all-but-forgotten faraway places, the majesty of the creatures who live there, and the wisdom of the elders who hold the knowledge of the past. This magical around-the-world odyssey is an awe-inspiring wonder the entire family will enjoy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cGkSfWjhq59mgx5zQFs0EgjSgJa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66860'),
  ('802999215245959803', 'Sacred Silence', 1996, 'Drama, Crime, Romance', 'Antonio Capuano, Antonio Baldoni, Claudio Grimaldi', 'Antonio Capuano', 'Fabrizio Bentivoglio, Emanuele Gargiulo, Tonino Taiuti, Rosaria De Cicco, Oscar Di Maio, Antonella Stefanucci, Livia Imparato, Teresa Saponangelo', null, 'A young priest crusades against organized crime in his Naples neighbourhood but falls in love with a 13-year-old boy. It''s the chance the gangsters were waiting for to get rid of the thorn in their side. Will they be able to force the boy to accuse the priest of sexual harassment and have his reputation destroyed?', 'A young priest crusades against organized crime in his Naples neighbourhood but falls in love with a 13-year-old boy. It''s the chance the gangsters were waiting for to get rid of the thorn in their side. Will they be able to force the boy to accuse the priest of sexual harassment and have his reputation destroyed?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f6PG7AwtlnIgjyDZWdbgM45x6dU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12814'),
  ('950006447683702185', 'Sacrifice', 2010, 'History, Drama, Action, Thriller', 'Chen Kaige, Yang Shu', 'Ningyu Zhao', 'Ge You, Wang Xueqi, Huang Xiaoming, Fan Bingbing, Vincent Zhao Wenzhuo, Hai Qing, Zhang Fengyi, Arthur Chen', null, 'For generations the Zhao family has wielded power, until their mortal enemy TU’AN GU slaughters the entire clan, determined to wipe out their influence forever. But one Zhao baby survives hidden by CHENG YING the doctor who delivered him. When Tu’an Gu learns of the baby’s escape he seizes every infant in the city, vowing to kill them all unless the Zhao baby is surrendered. As the tyrant’s soldiers arrive at Cheng Ying’s home the frantic doctor hides his wife with their own baby whilst surrendering the Zhao child as his own. But his family is discovered; his baby is presumed to be the Zhao heir and murdered along with his wife for harboring the infant. Now set on revenge Cheng Ying enrolls the Zhao orphan into the service of the Tu’an Gu household, plotting to use him as an instrument of vengeance when he comes of age.', 'For generations the Zhao family has wielded power, until their mortal enemy TU’AN GU slaughters the entire clan, determined to wipe out their influence forever. But one Zhao baby survives hidden by CHENG YING the doctor who delivered him. When Tu’an Gu learns of the baby’s escape he seizes every infant in the city, vowing to kill them all unless the Zhao baby is surrendered. As the tyrant’s soldiers arrive at Cheng Ying’s home the frantic doctor hides his wife with their own baby whilst surrendering the Zhao child as his own. But his family is discovered; his baby is presumed to be the Zhao heir and murdered along with his wife for harboring the infant. Now set on revenge Cheng Ying enrolls the Zhao orphan into the service of the Tu’an Gu household, plotting to use him as an instrument of vengeance when he comes of age.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/36HScOStUVBOydrQwofZwrG3CUE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55741'),
  ('846354486775357166', 'Sacrifice', 2011, 'Action', 'Damian Lee, David Pelletier', 'Damian Lee', 'Cuba Gooding Jr., Christian Slater, Devon Bostick, Kim Coates, Lara Daans, Arcadia Kendal, Zion Forrest Lee, Jake Simons', 'R', 'A tough undercover cop inadvertently gets involved in a dangerous heroin ring when a young defector of the drug trade leaves his five year-old sister in his care.', 'A tough undercover cop inadvertently gets involved in a dangerous heroin ring when a young defector of the drug trade leaves his five year-old sister in his care.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fMXYwKqR82b9qDiCq8A6fVgekhw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56913'),
  ('64535320142043047', 'Sacrifice', 2016, 'Thriller, Crime, Mystery', 'Peter A. Dowling', 'Peter A. Dowling, S.J. Bolton', 'Radha Mitchell, Rupert Graves, Ian McElhinney, David Robb, Joanne Crawford, Liam Carney, Declan Conlon, Peter Vollebregt', null, 'Sacrifice is the story of consultant surgeon, Tora Hamilton, who moves with her husband, Duncan, to the remote Shetland Islands, 100 miles off the north-east coast of Scotland. Deep in the peat soil around her new home, Tora discovers the body of a young woman with rune marks carved into her skin and a gaping hole where her heart once beat. Ignoring warnings to leave well alone, Tora uncovers terrifying links to a legend that might never have been confined to the pages of the story-books.', 'Sacrifice is the story of consultant surgeon, Tora Hamilton, who moves with her husband, Duncan, to the remote Shetland Islands, 100 miles off the north-east coast of Scotland. Deep in the peat soil around her new home, Tora discovers the body of a young woman with rune marks carved into her skin and a gaping hole where her heart once beat. Ignoring warnings to leave well alone, Tora uncovers terrifying links to a legend that might never have been confined to the pages of the story-books.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eVrlNY7SbWmTslaRlJvo3sMsZm4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:394661'),
  ('603889130607100545', 'Sacrifice', 2021, 'Horror', 'Phil Romanos, Andy Collier, Tor Mian', 'Tor Mian, Andy Collier', 'Barbara Crampton, Sophie Stevens, Ludovic Hughes, Lukas Loughran, Johanna Adde Dahl, Jack Kristiansen, Anders Lundin, Dag Soerlie', 'R', 'Isaac and his pregnant wife visit a remote Norwegian village to claim an unexpected inheritance. The couple finds themselves caught in a nightmare when they encounter a sinister cult that worships a sea-dwelling deity.', 'Isaac and his pregnant wife visit a remote Norwegian village to claim an unexpected inheritance. The couple finds themselves caught in a nightmare when they encounter a sinister cult that worships a sea-dwelling deity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xXI5Lg6mJLEesTggRJBrq50vrqU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:631583'),
  ('488939363630703623', 'Sacrilege', 2020, 'Horror', 'David Creed', 'David Creed', 'Tamaryn Payne, Emily Wyatt, Sian Abrahams, Naomi Willow, Ian Champion, Rory Wilton, Emma Spurgin Hussey, Conner Mckenzy', null, 'Four lifelong friends head to a remote lodge for a weekend of fun. What begins as an idyllic retreat quickly descends into a fight for their lives when a local Pagan cult offer them up to their Goddess as a sacrifice for the Solstice.', 'Four lifelong friends head to a remote lodge for a weekend of fun. What begins as an idyllic retreat quickly descends into a fight for their lives when a local Pagan cult offer them up to their Goddess as a sacrifice for the Solstice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eskH1oSrcKauYQKmU55h3dPFSO5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:674528'),
  ('901910033306420456', 'Sacro GRA', 2013, 'Documentary', 'Gianfranco Rosi, Roberto Rinalduzzi, Gianfranco Rosi', 'Gianfranco Rosi', 'Roberto Giuliani, Franceso De Santis, Paolo Regis, Amelia Regis, Principe Filippo Pellegrini, Cesare Bergamini, Gaetano Finocchi, Patrizia Torselli', null, 'After the India of Varanasi’s boatmen, the American desert of the dropouts, and the Mexico of the killers of drugtrade, Gianfranco Rosi has decided to tell the tale of a part of his own country, roaming and filming for over two years in a minivan on Rome’s giant ring road—the Grande Raccordo Anulare, or GRA—to discover the invisible worlds and possible futures harbored in this area of constant turmoil. Elusive characters and fleeting apparitions emerge from the background of the winding zone: a nobleman from the Piemonte region and his college student daughter sharing a one-room efficiency in a modern apartment building along the GRA.', 'After the India of Varanasi’s boatmen, the American desert of the dropouts, and the Mexico of the killers of drugtrade, Gianfranco Rosi has decided to tell the tale of a part of his own country, roaming and filming for over two years in a minivan on Rome’s giant ring road—the Grande Raccordo Anulare, or GRA—to discover the invisible worlds and possible futures harbored in this area of constant turmoil. Elusive characters and fleeting apparitions emerge from the background of the winding zone: a nobleman from the Piemonte region and his college student daughter sharing a one-room efficiency in a modern apartment building along the GRA.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7vsmiudJxiYYQWlnv6OmMT3tH9E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:216790'),
  ('756793715275013106', 'Sad Hill Unearthed', 2018, 'Documentary, History', 'Guillermo de Oliveira, Guillermo de Oliveira', 'Guillermo de Oliveira', 'David Alba, Sergio García, Diego Montero, Joseba del Valle, Christopher Frayling, Peter J. Hanley, Eugenio Alabiso, Sergio Salvati', null, 'Province of Burgos, northern Spain, October 2015. A group of fans undertake the titanic task of restoring the location of the last scene of The Good, the Bad and the Ugly, the mythical spaghetti western directed by Italian filmmaker Sergio Leone in 1966.', 'Province of Burgos, northern Spain, October 2015. A group of fans undertake the titanic task of restoring the location of the last scene of The Good, the Bad and the Ugly, the mythical spaghetti western directed by Italian filmmaker Sergio Leone in 1966.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1DgoWzjWlLzN4GuLgrIe2iScTPt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:508466'),
  ('165991950793980566', 'Sad Movie', 2005, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Won Jin, Shin Sang-yeul, Kwon Jong-kwan', 'Kwon Jong-kwan, Hwang Sung-goo', 'Jung Woo-sung, Lim Soo-jung, Cha Tae-hyun, Son Tae-young, Yum Jung-ah, Yeo Jin-goo, Shin Min-a, Lee Ki-woo', null, 'These intertwining stories about romance and separation follow a firefighter who can''t find the right time to propose, a shy theme park worker who falls for an artist, an estranged mother and son, and a man seeking to regain his lost love.', 'These intertwining stories about romance and separation follow a firefighter who can''t find the right time to propose, a shy theme park worker who falls for an artist, an estranged mother and son, and a man seeking to regain his lost love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Ur9d6aHguQ752alSktjdCDLSbk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18422'),
  ('858023549654549181', 'Sad?', 1996, 'Documentary', 'Mark Nunneley', null, 'Dorian Crook, Sean Connery, Patrick McGoohan, Grace Kelly, Ray Milland, William Holden, George Peppard', null, 'Set in the mid sixties and shot with more black than white, ‘SAD?’ is a dark ten minute film that explores the time that we spend alone watching television, and the good and sad effects it can have on you. The film has a timeless, forgotten feel about it, a study of a world and time detached from the norm, a life filled with both laughter and loneliness, escapism and escapees...', 'Set in the mid sixties and shot with more black than white, ‘SAD?’ is a dark ten minute film that explores the time that we spend alone watching television, and the good and sad effects it can have on you. The film has a timeless, forgotten feel about it, a study of a world and time detached from the norm, a life filled with both laughter and loneliness, escapism and escapees...', null, 'tmdb:movie:367085'),
  ('938271048911018496', 'Sada', 1998, 'Drama', 'Nobuhiko Obayashi, Noritaka Sakamoto', 'Hiroko Nishizawa, Nobuhiko Obayashi', 'Hitomi Kuroki, Tsurutaro Kataoka, Norihei Miki, Kippei Shiina, Toshie Negishi, Renji Ishibashi, Bengal, Kyūsaku Shimada', null, 'The film follows the life of Sada Abe, who became a celebrity in 1936 after strangling her lover and slicing off his penis.', 'The film follows the life of Sada Abe, who became a celebrity in 1936 after strangling her lover and slicing off his penis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ubkLILF2FYkm6UUK95AtX1Jng4S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:122188'),
  ('940757747726985989', 'Sadak', 1991, 'Romance, Thriller, Action', 'Mahesh Bhatt', 'Robin Bhatt', 'Sanjay Dutt, Pooja Bhatt, Deepak Tijori, Neelima Azim, Soni Razdan, Avtar Gill, Mushtaq Khan, Javed Khan', null, 'A taxi driver with a tragic past sees an opportunity for redemption when he encounters a woman sold into prostitution. Wanting to help her escape, he has to deal with the wrath of the brothel madam.', 'A taxi driver with a tragic past sees an opportunity for redemption when he encounters a woman sold into prostitution. Wanting to help her escape, he has to deal with the wrath of the brothel madam.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fFESWq8YQHRrwSJ9K8ThAxlDCx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:230435'),
  ('1040847063643977414', 'Sadako', 2019, 'Horror', 'Takahiro Imai, Hideo Nakata', 'Noriaki Sugihara', 'Elaiza Ikeda, Takashi Tsukamoto, Hiroya Shimizu, Himeka Himejima, Renn Kiriyama, Rie Tomosaka, Hitomi Sato, Jitsuko Yoshimura', null, 'A psychologist connects her missing brother to the strange case of a mysterious little girl believed to be Sadako reincarnated.', 'A psychologist connects her missing brother to the strange case of a mysterious little girl believed to be Sadako reincarnated.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wCanUYBbUxADpfqpoe3tmQ3KVL6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:583132'),
  ('1085001585760975221', 'Sadako 3D', 2012, 'Horror', 'Tsutomu Hanabusa, Yamamoto Hideyuki', 'Kōji Suzuki', 'Satomi Ishihara, Koji Seto, Yusuke Yamamoto, Ryosei Tayama, Ai Hashimoto, Tsutomu Takahashi, Shota Sometani, Hikari Takara', 'NR', 'Akane is a high school teacher who hears a rumor from her students that there is actual footage on the Internet of someone''s suicide. The footage is said to drive anyone who sees it to also commit suicide. Akane does not believe the rumor at first, but when one of her female students dies after viewing the footage, she and her boyfriend Takanori are fatefully drawn into the horror that has been created by the man who appears in the suicide footage, Kashiwada. Kashiwada''s intention is to create chaos in the world by bringing back Sadako and the power of her curse. Now Akane has to fight against Sadako and Kashiwada to save the lives of herself and Takanori.', 'Akane is a high school teacher who hears a rumor from her students that there is actual footage on the Internet of someone''s suicide. The footage is said to drive anyone who sees it to also commit suicide. Akane does not believe the rumor at first, but when one of her female students dies after viewing the footage, she and her boyfriend Takanori are fatefully drawn into the horror that has been created by the man who appears in the suicide footage, Kashiwada. Kashiwada''s intention is to create chaos in the world by bringing back Sadako and the power of her curse. Now Akane has to fight against Sadako and Kashiwada to save the lives of herself and Takanori.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7sqOEjP3hwk1yDPuqowei1xasRo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:140441'),
  ('307063908645171013', 'Sadako 3D 2', 2013, 'Horror', 'Tsutomu Hanabusa, Nobushige Fujimoto, Yamamoto Hideyuki', 'Tsutomu Hanabusa', 'Miori Takimoto, Koji Seto, Kokoro Hirasawa, Itsumi Ohsawa, Takeshi Ōnishi, Yusuke Yamamoto, Ryosei Tayama, Satomi Ishihara', null, 'Five years have passed since the events of Sadako 3D. Akane is pregnant with a child with her boyfriend Takenori. However, Akane dies after giving birth to her daughter. When Takenori''s sister Fuko takes up the task of caring for Akane''s daughter, the infamous cursed video resurfaces. During her investigation, Fuko learns about the legend of Sadako''s daughter...', 'Five years have passed since the events of Sadako 3D. Akane is pregnant with a child with her boyfriend Takenori. However, Akane dies after giving birth to her daughter. When Takenori''s sister Fuko takes up the task of caring for Akane''s daughter, the infamous cursed video resurfaces. During her investigation, Fuko learns about the legend of Sadako''s daughter...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/falY0cXNGbGXPvrg8YDhnFhVWu2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:257527'),
  ('874042350945580198', 'Sadako DX', 2022, 'Horror, Mystery, Comedy', 'Hisashi Kimura, Takahito Kasai', 'Yuya Takahashi', 'Fuka Koshiba, Kazuma Kawamura, Naomi Nishida, Yuki Yagi, Hiroyuki Ikeuchi, Hiroyuki Watanabe, Mario Kuroba, Wan Marui', null, 'Ayaka Ichijo is a graduate student with an IQ of 200 who tries to investigate the strange deaths happening nationwide after people supposedly watched a cursed video and her younger sister also did the same out of curiosity.', 'Ayaka Ichijo is a graduate student with an IQ of 200 who tries to investigate the strange deaths happening nationwide after people supposedly watched a cursed video and her younger sister also did the same out of curiosity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a0WfIX5OMr6mi6QusBOfMnQkiGh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:940417'),
  ('794868486728974838', 'Sadako vs. Kayako', 2016, 'Horror', 'Koji Shiraishi, Hidetoshi Shinomiya, Yasuhiro Omine', 'Koji Shiraishi', 'Mizuki Yamamoto, Aimi Satsukawa, Tina Tamashiro, Elly Nanami, Runa Endo, Rintaro Shibamoto, Masanobu Ando, Mai Kikuchi', 'NR', 'A girl, Yūri Kurahashi, after watching a cursed videotape together with her friend in a haunted house, becomes trapped in a conflict between the two murderous ghosts: Sadako Yamamura and Kayako Saeki.', 'A girl, Yūri Kurahashi, after watching a cursed videotape together with her friend in a haunted house, becomes trapped in a conflict between the two murderous ghosts: Sadako Yamamura and Kayako Saeki.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bRNL8q6utwEc2Vog5GwTFgm5NEQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:382602'),
  ('349334168579722473', 'Saddle the Wind', 1958, 'Western', 'Robert Parrish, Mickey McCardle, Robert Saunders', 'Rod Serling', 'Robert Taylor, Julie London, John Cassavetes, Donald Crisp, Charles McGraw, Royal Dano, Richard Erdman, Douglas Spencer', 'NR', 'Steve Sinclair is a world-weary former gunslinger, now living as a peaceful farmer. Things go wrong when his wild younger brother Tony arrives on the scene with his new bride Joan Blake.', 'Steve Sinclair is a world-weary former gunslinger, now living as a peaceful farmer. Things go wrong when his wild younger brother Tony arrives on the scene with his new bride Joan Blake.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bn4b43hKF5z5jVSidGEma1yaWD5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77814'),
  ('875434276306055530', 'Saddle Tramp', 1950, 'Western', 'Hugo Fregonese, Joseph Gershenson, Charles P. Boyle', 'Harold Shumate', 'Joel McCrea, Wanda Hendrix, John Russell, John McIntire, Jeanette Nolan, Russell Simpson, Ed Begley, Jimmy Hunt', 'NR', 'Carefree Chuck Connor is on his way west and stops off to see an old friend and his four lads. When his host is killed in a riding accident Chuck realises he must take care of the family. They hit the road and he takes a job on a ranch, but he has to keep the children hidden as his boss hates kids. There''s also tension with the neighbouring ranch, and when a girl on the run from her nasty uncle joins the family unannounced Chuck wonders what he has done to deserve all this.', 'Carefree Chuck Connor is on his way west and stops off to see an old friend and his four lads. When his host is killed in a riding accident Chuck realises he must take care of the family. They hit the road and he takes a job on a ranch, but he has to keep the children hidden as his boss hates kids. There''s also tension with the neighbouring ranch, and when a girl on the run from her nasty uncle joins the family unannounced Chuck wonders what he has done to deserve all this.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eQVbkLOaNCmPptiOIbQY6BPK11r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:132335'),
  ('470741474556468271', 'Saddle Up For Revenge', 2021, 'Comedy, TV Movie', 'Alex Lutz, Michel Vannier, Arthur Sanigou', 'Alex Lutz, Lison Daniel, Thomas Poitevin', 'Audrey Lamy, Alex Lutz, Guillaume Gallienne, Leïla Bekhti, Gaspard Ulliel, Izïa Higelin, Marion Cotillard, Karin Viard', null, 'Parody of the acclaimed Australian series of the 80s, Return to Eden. Wealthy heiress Stephanie Harper marries athlete Craig Danners, without suspecting that he only wants her money and is having an affair with her best friend, Crystal. Craig and Crystal have a plan to get rid of Stephanie and steal her fortune by making her suffer a terrible accident, which leaves her face disfigured. She is saved by the handsome Doctor Danley, who performed a plastic surgery on Stephanie that turned her into a completely different and beautiful woman. Stephanie starts plotting her revenge against Craig and Crystal, who believe that she died in the accident.', 'Parody of the acclaimed Australian series of the 80s, Return to Eden. Wealthy heiress Stephanie Harper marries athlete Craig Danners, without suspecting that he only wants her money and is having an affair with her best friend, Crystal. Craig and Crystal have a plan to get rid of Stephanie and steal her fortune by making her suffer a terrible accident, which leaves her face disfigured. She is saved by the handsome Doctor Danley, who performed a plastic surgery on Stephanie that turned her into a completely different and beautiful woman. Stephanie starts plotting her revenge against Craig and Crystal, who believe that she died in the accident.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vhJfuT6k8Q2S1mcw31rYuyfcsuH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:875853'),
  ('1083279515132690635', 'Sade', 2000, 'History, Drama, Crime', 'Benoît Jacquot, Benoît Delhomme, Antoine Santana', 'Jacques Fieschi, Bernard Minoret', 'Daniel Auteuil, Marianne Denicourt, Jeanne Balibar, Isild Le Besco, Jean-Pierre Cassel, Grégoire Colin', null, 'A man prepares himself to be transferred to a detention center and rest home where he will relive one more time the highlights of his youth.', 'A man prepares himself to be transferred to a detention center and rest home where he will relive one more time the highlights of his youth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mcr6I5KtSUrR1peEZ2EFotW6Hhx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72356'),
  ('1043012393123822442', 'Sadhu Miranda', 2008, 'Crime, Drama', 'Siddique', 'Siddique', 'Prasanna, Abbas, Kavya Madhavan, Karunas, Kota Srinivasa Rao, Manoj K Jayan, Manivannan, Mithra Kurian', null, 'The movie starts of with a robbery of 20 crores in Pondicherry DID Bank where a college girl is killed by one of the thieves. The same night as the robbery, the manager of the bank (Manivannan) commits suicide.After this the story opens up in Chennai where Shiva Sundaram (Prasanna) a visible foolish person comes in search of David Raj (Manoj K. Jayan) where he saves a girl from being raped by one of David Raj''s men.', 'The movie starts of with a robbery of 20 crores in Pondicherry DID Bank where a college girl is killed by one of the thieves. The same night as the robbery, the manager of the bank (Manivannan) commits suicide.After this the story opens up in Chennai where Shiva Sundaram (Prasanna) a visible foolish person comes in search of David Raj (Manoj K. Jayan) where he saves a girl from being raped by one of David Raj''s men.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4RYhPAuA46VWjKebWWbDqFx2FdE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:245572'),
  ('464704222657037866', 'Sadie McKee', 1934, 'Drama, Romance', 'Clarence Brown, Douglas Shearer, Oliver T. Marsh', 'Carey Wilson', 'Joan Crawford, Gene Raymond, Franchot Tone, Edward Arnold, Esther Ralston, Earl Oxford, Jean Dixon, Leo G. Carroll', 'NR', 'A maid has romances with a two-timer, a boozing millionaire and the master of the house.', 'A maid has romances with a two-timer, a boozing millionaire and the master of the house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sHuWPirdEdaEbIQ7zgFYI64oUbp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43696'),
  ('582357283454376097', 'Sadie Thompson', 1928, 'Drama, Romance', 'Raoul Walsh, George Barnes, Robert Kurrle', null, 'Gloria Swanson, Lionel Barrymore, Blanche Friderici, Charles Lane, Florence Midgley, James A. Marcus, Sophia Artega, Will Stanton', 'NR', 'A young, beautiful prostitute named Sadie Thompson arrives on the South Pacific island of Pago Pago looking for honest work and falls for Timothy O''Hara, an American sailor who is unfazed by her unsavory past. However, Mr. Davidson, a missionary who arrived on the island at the same time, aims to "save" Sadie from her sinful life and petitions to have her separated from her beau and deported back to San Francisco.', 'A young, beautiful prostitute named Sadie Thompson arrives on the South Pacific island of Pago Pago looking for honest work and falls for Timothy O''Hara, an American sailor who is unfazed by her unsavory past. However, Mr. Davidson, a missionary who arrived on the island at the same time, aims to "save" Sadie from her sinful life and petitions to have her separated from her beau and deported back to San Francisco.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7IHxSWO4paEcPiuh515L4fzJDZx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42538'),
  ('807648531241641860', 'Sadio Mané - Made in Senegal', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Mehdi Benhadj-Djilali, Jermain Raffington, Peta Jenkin', null, 'Sadio Mané, Jürgen Klopp, Mohamed Salah, Georginio Wijnaldum, Virgil van Dijk, Naby Keïta, Kalidou Koulibaly, Cheikhou Kouyaté', null, 'Sadio''s story is the classical heroes journey and and archetype for African football players. Blessed with exceptional talent, he sets out from his village to find his destiny in the world - defying his family, social structures, doubters and injuries - to come back triumphant and able to help those around him.', 'Sadio''s story is the classical heroes journey and and archetype for African football players. Blessed with exceptional talent, he sets out from his village to find his destiny in the world - defying his family, social structures, doubters and injuries - to come back triumphant and able to help those around him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qcYsEWh5CkB9gCDxwzi8MLD4PfV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:683712'),
  ('170094261646716064', 'Sadma', 1983, 'Drama, Romance', 'Balu Mahendra, Balu Mahendra', 'Balu Mahendra', 'Kamal Haasan, Sridevi, Silk Smitha, Gulshan Grover, Kanwarjeet Paintal, Arvind Deshpande, Viju Khote, Birbal', null, 'A head injury causes a woman to regress to childhood. Lost and confused, she is eventually befriended by a school teacher. A Hindi remake of the 1982 film "Moondram Pirai" by the same team.', 'A head injury causes a woman to regress to childhood. Lost and confused, she is eventually befriended by a school teacher. A Hindi remake of the 1982 film "Moondram Pirai" by the same team.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5XJpcUUM3uN2QyGJowL1awY4mTX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54357'),
