  ('503733344966012613', 'Sadsacks In the Boarding School', 1978, 'Comedy', 'Michel Vocoret, Roger Fellous', 'Michel Vocoret', 'Jean-Marc Thibault, Jacques Jouanneau, Michel Modo, Charles Gérard, Christiane Muller, Sylvain Green, Maurice Illouz, Katia Tchenko', null, '1978, France. Young recruits are secretly digging an underground tunnel to get to the boarding school for girls, located in front of their barracks. Sexual girls are digging a tunnel towards...', '1978, France. Young recruits are secretly digging an underground tunnel to get to the boarding school for girls, located in front of their barracks. Sexual girls are digging a tunnel towards...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/of0mEEbEFWblIsXnvZwg2AHL1OL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84516'),
  ('685151625584837915', 'Saejima Nao: Akume kinenbi', 1988, 'Drama', 'Hiroyuki Okizawa, Masaharu Ito, Masahito Segawa', 'Chiho Katsura, Yuyo Wakatsuki', 'Nao Saejima, Miki Nakahara, Ryota Sakanishi, Masanori Ôba, Kazunori Nobuzane, Takashi Sawa, Hiroshi Tamura', null, 'A beautiful aspiring photographer visits Okinawa with her boyfriend for a passionate weekend getaway. Things get a little dangerous when she gets caught snooping around a large house by another couple...', 'A beautiful aspiring photographer visits Okinawa with her boyfriend for a passionate weekend getaway. Things get a little dangerous when she gets caught snooping around a large house by another couple...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2mHf7CSbCJuovSd3gGBF6qWnQug.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:746938'),
  ('209808789194281863', 'Saekano the Movie: Finale', 2019, 'Animation, Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Yuichiro Mizutani, Michio Hasegawa, Yu Kurihara', 'Fumiaki Maruto', 'Yoshitsugu Matsuoka, Kiyono Yasuno, Saori Onishi, Ai Kayano, Sayuri Yahagi, Chinatsu Akasaki, Tetsuya Kakihara, Hitomi Nabatame', null, 'After blessing software announced their first work, Eriri and Utaha leave the group to join popular creator Akane Kosaka in developing a major game called Fields Chronicle. Meanwhile, Tomoya and Megumi join hands with their new members and various other parties to produce their new game. What will become of Eriri and Utaha’s major work? Will the relationship between Tomoya and Megumi change? And what will be the ultimate fate of blessing software’s new game?', 'After blessing software announced their first work, Eriri and Utaha leave the group to join popular creator Akane Kosaka in developing a major game called Fields Chronicle. Meanwhile, Tomoya and Megumi join hands with their new members and various other parties to produce their new game. What will become of Eriri and Utaha’s major work? Will the relationship between Tomoya and Megumi change? And what will be the ultimate fate of blessing software’s new game?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jJKmT4ltysVdapJaNTexpcby96n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:608826'),
  ('245982104459876806', 'Safari', 1956, 'Adventure', 'Terence Young, John Wilcox, Ted Moore', 'Anthony Veiller', 'Victor Mature, Janet Leigh, John Justin, Roland Culver, Liam Redmond, Earl Cameron, Orlando Martins, Juma', 'NR', 'Wealthy eccentric Sir Vincent Brampton and his fiancée Linda Latham hire Ken Duffield to lead them on a jungle hunt. Duffield is looking for the murderer of his son; he gets the killer and Linda.', 'Wealthy eccentric Sir Vincent Brampton and his fiancée Linda Latham hire Ken Duffield to lead them on a jungle hunt. Duffield is looking for the murderer of his son; he gets the killer and Linda.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7FdM5YlubXCptvXnzw3LLEhVwfq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49372'),
  ('1077336729611751644', 'Safari', 2009, 'Adventure, Comedy', 'Olivier Baroux, Arnaud Stefani', 'Richard Grandpierre, Jean-Paul Bathany, Olivier Baroux', 'Kad Merad, Lionel Abelanski, Frédérique Bel, Guy Lecluyse, David Saracino, Nicolas Marié, Yannick Noah, Omar Sy', null, 'Richard Dacier owns a tour agency specialized on organizing safaris for European tourists eager to confront the African wild life. Actually, he took the job after his father and never went into the savanna by himself. As he owes big money to some mobster, he is compelled to convey a fake tourist, with a suspicious suitcase, toward Mozambic. To avoid suspicion from the authorities, he is supposed to tour a group of tourists as usual. The only problem - he is completely unexperienced as a guide!', 'Richard Dacier owns a tour agency specialized on organizing safaris for European tourists eager to confront the African wild life. Actually, he took the job after his father and never went into the savanna by himself. As he owes big money to some mobster, he is compelled to convey a fake tourist, with a suspicious suitcase, toward Mozambic. To avoid suspicion from the authorities, he is supposed to tour a group of tourists as usual. The only problem - he is completely unexperienced as a guide!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k3YyJ8SCHjYiVtL8dXn0sQzcEzU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15587'),
  ('1001049267998466600', 'Safari', 2016, 'Documentary', 'Ulrich Seidl, Wolfgang Thaler', 'Ulrich Seidl, Veronika Franz', 'Inge Ellinger, Manfred Ellinger, Eva Hofmann, Tina Hofmann, Gerald Eichinger, Manuel Eichinger, Volker Neemann, Marita Neemann', null, 'Africa. In the wild expanses, where bush-bucks, impalas, zebras, gnus and other creatures graze by the thousands, they are on holiday. German and Austrian hunting tourists drive through the bush, lie in wait, stalk their prey. They shoot, sob with excitement and pose before the animals they have bagged. A vacation movie about killing, a movie about human nature.', 'Africa. In the wild expanses, where bush-bucks, impalas, zebras, gnus and other creatures graze by the thousands, they are on holiday. German and Austrian hunting tourists drive through the bush, lie in wait, stalk their prey. They shoot, sob with excitement and pose before the animals they have bagged. A vacation movie about killing, a movie about human nature.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tK7DoH4plUvVkToGZZDFMbLfmFy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:413043'),
  ('222082924246623692', 'Safari: Match Me If You Can', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Yoliswa Gärtig, Rudi Gaul', 'Rudi Gaul, Friederike Klingholz', 'Max Mauff, Juliane Köhler, Justus von Dohnányi, Sebastian Bezzel, Mina Tander, Friederike Kempter, Janina Fautz, Sunnyi Melles', null, 'Munich, the city of singles and unfulfilled desire. Whoever feels like having a one-night stand can just use Safari, a new dating app. But is it also possible to find love via the app? Harry at least meets Lara through Safari, even though he’s married to Aurelie.', 'Munich, the city of singles and unfulfilled desire. Whoever feels like having a one-night stand can just use Safari, a new dating app. But is it also possible to find love via the app? Harry at least meets Lara through Safari, even though he’s married to Aurelie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ijA8Pemp9NMFpIFyaRPa0m4J3bu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:485880'),
  ('1108232232344798137', 'Safe', 1995, 'Drama', 'Todd Haynes, Alex Nepomniaschy, Elizabeth Gill', 'Todd Haynes', 'Julianne Moore, Xander Berkeley, Peter Friedman, James Le Gros, Dean Norris, Julie Burgess, Ronnie Farer, Jodie Markell', 'R', 'Carol White, a Los Angeles housewife in the late 1980s, comes down with a debilitating illness with no clear diagnosis.', 'Carol White, a Los Angeles housewife in the late 1980s, comes down with a debilitating illness with no clear diagnosis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2O71QsBkbqdLqQdx2yuNpJ4pFPq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32646'),
  ('897036800934597331', 'Safe', 2012, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Boaz Yakin, Stefan Czapsky, Chad Stahelski', 'Boaz Yakin', 'Jason Statham, Chris Sarandon, James Hong, Catherine Chan, Robert John Burke, Anson Mount, Reggie Lee, Joseph Sikora', 'R', 'After a former elite agent rescues a 12-year-old Chinese girl who''s been abducted, they find themselves in the middle of a standoff between Triads, the Russian Mafia and high-level corrupt New York City politicians and police.', 'After a former elite agent rescues a 12-year-old Chinese girl who''s been abducted, they find themselves in the middle of a standoff between Triads, the Russian Mafia and high-level corrupt New York City politicians and police.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kOCpkoMUVae9UIf85gO71SyjLbW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72387'),
  ('962388653282143327', 'Safe Conduct', 2002, 'War, Drama, History', 'Bertrand Tavernier, Alain Choquart, Martin Bourboulon', 'Bertrand Tavernier, Jean Cosmos', 'Jacques Gamblin, Denis Podalydès, Charlotte Kady, Marie Desgranges, Ged Marlon, Philippe Morier-Genoud, Laurent Schilling, Maria Pitarresi', null, 'During the Nazi occupation of France as two filmmakers attempt to navigate their careers without compromising their ideals. Facing pressure from the Vichy government, assistant director Jean Devaivre uses his position at the German-controlled studio Continental Films as a cover for his resistance activities, while screenwriter Jean Aurenche uses his wits to keep from being involved in the creation of any collaborationist propaganda.', 'During the Nazi occupation of France as two filmmakers attempt to navigate their careers without compromising their ideals. Facing pressure from the Vichy government, assistant director Jean Devaivre uses his position at the German-controlled studio Continental Films as a cover for his resistance activities, while screenwriter Jean Aurenche uses his wits to keep from being involved in the creation of any collaborationist propaganda.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1ikMr33fwo1a8piJFei160ebYdS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70443'),
  ('705673902519246217', 'Safe Haven', 2013, 'Romance, Thriller', 'Lasse Hallström, Terry Stacey, Stephen P. Dunn', 'Dana Stevens, Gage Lansky', 'Julianne Hough, Josh Duhamel, Cobie Smulders, David Lyons, Mimi Kirkland, Noah Lomax, Irene Ziegler, Robin Mullins', 'PG-13', 'A young woman with a mysterious past lands in Southport, North Carolina where her bond with a widower forces her to confront the dark secret that haunts her.', 'A young woman with a mysterious past lands in Southport, North Carolina where her bond with a widower forces her to confront the dark secret that haunts her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2CbJ3HTb6SFbMeguYH52UQSHOwY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:112949'),
  ('69423397390553298', 'Safe House', 1998, 'Thriller', 'Eric Steven Stahl, Vincent Donohue, Joel Jeffrey Nishimine', 'Eric Steven Stahl, John Schalter, Sean McLain', 'Patrick Stewart, Kimberly Williams-Paisley, Héctor Elizondo, Joy Kilpatrick, Craig Shoemaker, James Harlow, Richard Livingston, Julia Vera', null, 'A psychological thriller; Mace Sowell, an ex-intelligence operative and whose past government activities catches up with him, faces his own mortality, in the shape of the onset of Alzheimer''s disease. Holding the electronic key to secret information which implicates a Presidential front-runner, Mace struggles for his life while battling the debilitating effects of the disease.', 'A psychological thriller; Mace Sowell, an ex-intelligence operative and whose past government activities catches up with him, faces his own mortality, in the shape of the onset of Alzheimer''s disease. Holding the electronic key to secret information which implicates a Presidential front-runner, Mace struggles for his life while battling the debilitating effects of the disease.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8xkkY7FkpjPEB2gQ3MAlmVdq3h4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28123'),
  ('402447225898038312', 'Safe House', 2012, 'Action, Thriller', 'Daniel Espinosa, Oliver Wood, Trey Batchelor', 'David Guggenheim', 'Denzel Washington, Ryan Reynolds, Vera Farmiga, Brendan Gleeson, Sam Shepard, Rubén Blades, Nora Arnezeder, Robert Patrick', 'R', 'A dangerous CIA renegade resurfaces after a decade on the run. When the safe house he''s remanded to is attacked by mercenaries, a rookie operative escapes with him. Now, the unlikely allies must stay alive long enough to uncover who wants them dead.', 'A dangerous CIA renegade resurfaces after a decade on the run. When the safe house he''s remanded to is attacked by mercenaries, a rookie operative escapes with him. Now, the unlikely allies must stay alive long enough to uncover who wants them dead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7CBhSjQa07LYt0RGejYjWugGmdV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59961'),
  ('308958672351029138', 'Safe House', 2025, 'Action, Thriller', 'Jamie Marshall, Knoko Chapple, Austin Davoren', 'Leon Langford', 'Lucien Laviscount, Hannah John-Kamen, Lewis Tan, Holt McCallany, Ethan Embry, Michael Bradway, Brian Van Holt, Adam Levy', null, 'Trapped in a high-security safe house after a terrorist attack in downtown Los Angeles, six government agents realize they must survive not just the enemy outside, but the potential traitor among them.', 'Trapped in a high-security safe house after a terrorist attack in downtown Los Angeles, six government agents realize they must survive not just the enemy outside, but the potential traitor among them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jlQW7qPp9j6yGqiIEcB3uNYbjys.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1522923'),
