  ('1011353843180618539', 'Safe Sex', 1999, 'Comedy', 'Michalis Reppas, Thanasis Papathanasiou, Roula Nicolaou', 'Michalis Reppas, Thanasis Papathanasiou', 'Mina Adamaki, Alexandros Antonopoulos, Eleni Kastani, Maria Kavoyianni, Anna Panagiotopoulou, Kostas Koklas, Renia Louizidou, Kostas Grekas', null, 'A satire of life in modern Greece, presented through a series of different stories about sex. There are several couples and their relation with sex in parallel stories that come together in a hilarious way.', 'A satire of life in modern Greece, presented through a series of different stories about sex. There are several couples and their relation with sex in parallel stories that come together in a hilarious way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iTxgwrDFT0vPae5TlNiYMd9oWZu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17914'),
