  ('1090818071878360738', 'Safer at Home', 2021, 'Thriller, Horror, Crime, Drama', 'Will Wernick, Jason Goodell', 'Will Wernick, Lia Bozonelis', 'Jocelyn Hudon, Emma Lahana, Alisa Allapach, Adwin Brown, Dan J. Johnson, Brandon Morales, Daniel Robaire, Michael Kupisk', null, 'Two years into the pandemic, a group of friends throw an online party with a night of games, drinking and drugs. After taking an ecstasy pill, things go terribly wrong and the safety of their home becomes more terrifying than the raging chaos outside.', 'Two years into the pandemic, a group of friends throw an online party with a night of games, drinking and drugs. After taking an ecstasy pill, things go terribly wrong and the safety of their home becomes more terrifying than the raging chaos outside.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2mfnSVdDartB6TJ3k7Qyn0zMzKu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:792657'),
