  ('175809848793530131', 'Şalvar Davası', 1983, 'Comedy', 'Kartal Tibet, Çetin Tunca', 'Başar Sabuncu', 'Müjde Ar, Şener Şen, Halil Ergün, Pembe Mutlu, İhsan Yüce, Sırrı Elitaş, Gökhan Mete, Sevinç Pekin', null, 'A group of women in a small village get organized against the macho men of the town.', 'A group of women in a small village get organized against the macho men of the town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y6oU0mjePJ4azOX65YTOzmQkq2z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:331126'),
  ('858407629639080888', 'Salvation', 2025, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Hana Kitasei, Mackenzie Munro', 'Alex Runnels', 'Skeet Ulrich, Ashley Moore, Theo Rossi, Claire Forlani, Thomas Jane, Devon Bostick, Jeffrey Alan Solomon, Rebecca Gibel', null, 'A foster child bonds with a snake-handling Pentecostal community but uncovers sinister truths. She must choose between reporting pastor''s crimes or preserving her newfound support system, risking personal safety for a sense of belonging.', 'A foster child bonds with a snake-handling Pentecostal community but uncovers sinister truths. She must choose between reporting pastor''s crimes or preserving her newfound support system, risking personal safety for a sense of belonging.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k0ux5SqOmCR7b4MUHJL5vY2jNjf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1563506'),
  ('211098516571553737', 'Salvation Army', 2013, 'Drama', 'Abdellah Taïa, Agnès Godard', 'Abdellah Taïa', 'Said Mrini, Karim Ait M''Hand, Amine Ennaji, Frédéric Landenberg, Guillaume Bonnier, Sandra Korol, Felipe Castro', null, 'Abdellah is a young gay man navigating the sexual, racial and political climate of Morocco. Growing up in a large family in a working-class neighborhood, Abdellah is caught between a distant father, an authoritarian mother, an older brother whom he adores and a handful of predatory older men, in a society that denies his homosexuality.', 'Abdellah is a young gay man navigating the sexual, racial and political climate of Morocco. Growing up in a large family in a working-class neighborhood, Abdellah is caught between a distant father, an authoritarian mother, an older brother whom he adores and a handful of predatory older men, in a society that denies his homosexuality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/XpDqsRY25dzWKudn9JYrBK5P7t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:215960'),
  ('223848397472442524', 'Salvation Boulevard', 2011, 'Comedy, Thriller, Action, Drama', 'George Ratliff, Tim Orr', 'Douglas Stone, George Ratliff', 'Jennifer Connelly, Marisa Tomei, Pierce Brosnan, Ed Harris, Greg Kinnear, Isabelle Fuhrman, Howard Hesseman, Jim Gaffigan', 'R', 'Set in the world of mega-churches in which a former Deadhead-turned-born-again-Christian finds himself on the run from fundamentalist members of his mega-church who will do anything to protect their larger-than-life pastor.', 'Set in the world of mega-churches in which a former Deadhead-turned-born-again-Christian finds himself on the run from fundamentalist members of his mega-church who will do anything to protect their larger-than-life pastor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q8kPPcpPUGhdAOP5LYHDMKZBXYP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51995'),
  ('1063992137031148599', 'Salvatore Giuliano', 1962, 'Crime, Drama, History', 'Francesco Rosi, Franco Indovina, Nando Cicero', 'Francesco Rosi, Suso Cecchi d''Amico, Enzo Provenzale', 'Salvo Randone, Frank Wolff, Pippo Agusta, Sennuccio Benelli, Giuseppe Calandra, Pietro Cammarata, Max Cartier, Nando Cicero', null, 'Sicilian bandit Salvatore Giuliano''s bullet-riddled corpse is found facedown in a courtyard in Castelvetrano, a handgun and rifle by his side. Local and international press descend upon the scene, hoping to crack open the true story behind the death of this young man, who, at the age of twenty-seven, had already become Italy’s most wanted criminal and celebrated hero.', 'Sicilian bandit Salvatore Giuliano''s bullet-riddled corpse is found facedown in a courtyard in Castelvetrano, a handgun and rifle by his side. Local and international press descend upon the scene, hoping to crack open the true story behind the death of this young man, who, at the age of twenty-seven, had already become Italy’s most wanted criminal and celebrated hero.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uaFTCD0y2MEccTFyHOHj6IrwyZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27523'),
  ('643586728925740801', 'Salvatore. Questa è la vita', 2006, null, 'Gian Paolo Cugno, Gino Sgreva', 'Gian Paolo Cugno, Paolo Di Reda', 'Enrico Lo Verso, Galatea Ranzi, Lucia Sardo, Maurizio Nicolosi, Giancarlo Giannini, Gabriele Lavia, Ernesto Mahieux, Alessandro Mallia', null, 'Salvatore is a young orphan, living in Sicily with his little sister and his grandmother; after loosing his father in a tragic way he quits school and starts working as a fisherman and a farmer in order to support his little family. The Social Services soon discover the situation and resolve to put Salvatore in an orphanage, parting him from his family. Only a young, idealistic teacher (Enrico Lo Verso) tries to help him, going everyday after school to his house, to teach him the lessons he misses in the morning and to work with him in his greenhouse or on his fishing boat.', 'Salvatore is a young orphan, living in Sicily with his little sister and his grandmother; after loosing his father in a tragic way he quits school and starts working as a fisherman and a farmer in order to support his little family. The Social Services soon discover the situation and resolve to put Salvatore in an orphanage, parting him from his family. Only a young, idealistic teacher (Enrico Lo Verso) tries to help him, going everyday after school to his house, to teach him the lessons he misses in the morning and to work with him in his greenhouse or on his fishing boat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iXn6BWkVpy5SwuNp6u4JhNvZG7V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80258'),
  ('1112986825360853314', 'Salve Maria', 2024, 'Drama', 'Mar Coll, Nilo Mur, Javi de la Llave', 'Valentina Viso, Mar Coll', 'Laura Weissmahr, Oriol Pla, Giannina Fruttero, Clara Garcés, Magali Heu, Belén Cruz, Oscar Walls, Sam Avtaev', null, 'Maria, a new mother and writer, is transfixed by the disturbing case of a woman who drowned her infant twins, prompting her own journey through the complexities of motherhood.', 'Maria, a new mother and writer, is transfixed by the disturbing case of a woman who drowned her infant twins, prompting her own journey through the complexities of motherhood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c1vxdtbIyKE31mX9znwIsrHJ30S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1247597'),
  ('148418061017378610', 'Sálvese quien pueda', 1984, 'Comedy', 'Enrique Carreras, Antonio Merayo, Ricardo Cuevas', 'Enrique Carreras, Salvador Valverde Calvo, Juan Carlos Mesa', 'Alberto Olmedo, Jorge Porcel, Beatriz Bonnet, Mario Sapag, Mónica Gonzaga, Carlos Garaycochea, Marita Ballesteros, Nancy Herrera', null, 'The story of a bandoneon-loving musician who works as a detective in a hotel and the story of a chemist in love with a widowed woman.', 'The story of a bandoneon-loving musician who works as a detective in a hotel and the story of a chemist in love with a widowed woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aMHRhxNkmbXhhWUrzYvvBDrphhR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:548242'),
  ('326286201123288270', 'Salvo', 2013, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Fabio Grassadonia, Antonio Piazza, Daniele Ciprì', 'Fabio Grassadonia, Antonio Piazza', 'Saleh Bakri, Sara Serraiocco, Mario Pupella, Giuditta Perriera, Luigi Lo Cascio, Redouane Behache, Filippo Luna, Jake J. Meniani', null, 'Salvo, a ruthless Sicilian Mafia hit man, changes his priorities after being involved in a bloody ambush.', 'Salvo, a ruthless Sicilian Mafia hit man, changes his priorities after being involved in a bloody ambush.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pAd8TgB4KgiOuIf7PBY7dMFEF9j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:190901'),
  ('471439149460320424', 'Salyut-7', 2017, 'Action, Drama, Adventure', 'Kirill Bobrov, Sergey Astakhov, Ivan Burlakov', 'Bakur Bakuradze, Alexey Chupov, Natalya Merkulova', 'Vladimir Vdovichenkov, Pavel Derevyanko, Aleksandr Samoylenko, Vitaliy Khaev, Oksana Fandera, Lyubov Aksyonova, Roman Perelygin, Mariya Mironova', 'PG-13', 'USSR, June 1985. After contact with the Salyut 7 space station is lost, cosmonauts Vladimir Dzhanibekov and Viktor Savinykh dock with the empty, frozen craft, and bring her back to life. Based on actual events.', 'USSR, June 1985. After contact with the Salyut 7 space station is lost, cosmonauts Vladimir Dzhanibekov and Viktor Savinykh dock with the empty, frozen craft, and bring her back to life. Based on actual events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s2ktgF2ze4aVt9bXBUvxFJllqyd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:438740'),
  ('136727313618431380', 'Sam', 2015, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Romance', 'Sibyl Santiago, Liza Binkley, Isobel Griffiths', 'John A. Gallagher, Nicholas Brooks', 'Natalie Knepp, Brock Harris, Sean Kleier, Morgan Fairchild, Stacy Keach, James McCaffrey, Bryan Batt, Sarah Scott', 'NR', 'The journey of young, handsome New York City playboy Sam Wellman - man’s man and professional woman hater – and his relationship with Doc, his best (and only!) friend. One strange, drunken night Sam stumbles into an Old Curiosity Shop, where the elderly proprietor offers him tea along with sage advice on treasuring “the female of the species”. Sam awakens the next morning to find himself transformed into a woman.', 'The journey of young, handsome New York City playboy Sam Wellman - man’s man and professional woman hater – and his relationship with Doc, his best (and only!) friend. One strange, drunken night Sam stumbles into an Old Curiosity Shop, where the elderly proprietor offers him tea along with sage advice on treasuring “the female of the species”. Sam awakens the next morning to find himself transformed into a woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yhi43UFo5DjksahZ8N5TUYDavPj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:414977'),
  ('743713350839402215', 'Sam & Kate', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Darren Le Gallo, Frankie DeMarco', 'Darren Le Gallo', 'Jake Hoffman, Schuyler Fisk, Sissy Spacek, Dustin Hoffman, Henry Thomas, Elizabeth Faith Ludlow, Dylan McNamara, Elizabeth Becka', 'R', 'Bill is an ailing larger-than-life father being taken care of by his son Sam, who has returned home to care for him. While home, Sam falls for a local woman, Kate. At the same time, Bill starts to fall for her mom, Tina.', 'Bill is an ailing larger-than-life father being taken care of by his son Sam, who has returned home to care for him. While home, Sam falls for a local woman, Kate. At the same time, Bill starts to fall for her mom, Tina.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fzQN7YcIgboMavMMwrOTaqz8agm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:844404'),
  ('823696582364316503', 'Sam Bahadur', 2023, 'Drama, History, War', 'Meghna Gulzar, Nandini Shrikent, Karan Mally', 'Bhavani Iyer, Shantanu Srivastava, Meghna Gulzar', 'Vicky Kaushal, Sanya Malhotra, Fatima Sana Shaikh, Mohammed Zeeshan Ayyub, Edward Sonnenblick, Neeraj Kabi, Govind Namdeo, Paul O''Neill', null, 'Based on the life of Sam Manekshaw, who was the Chief of the Army Staff of the Indian Army during the Indo-Pakistani War of 1971, and the first Indian Army officer to be promoted to the rank of Field Marshal.', 'Based on the life of Sam Manekshaw, who was the Chief of the Army Staff of the Indian Army during the Indo-Pakistani War of 1971, and the first Indian Army officer to be promoted to the rank of Field Marshal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nFYf3g3CObjx9ri3PMWkK1lWFhr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:814215'),
  ('330780256683745902', 'Sam Kinison: Breaking the Rules', 1987, 'Comedy', 'Walter C. Miller', 'Sam Kinison', 'Sam Kinison, Denise Gallup, Dian Gallup, Hugh Hefner', 'R', 'This is a great performance. Through yelling and energetic story-telling, he talks about marriage, drugs, being arrested (thanks to his ex-wife), pleasing women, religion, and much, much more.', 'This is a great performance. Through yelling and energetic story-telling, he talks about marriage, drugs, being arrested (thanks to his ex-wife), pleasing women, religion, and much, much more.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l4pligKABQknfKMTdpAxz3PjTJW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44123'),
  ('895394071138456120', 'Sam Kinison: Family Entertainment Hour', 1991, 'Comedy', 'Walter C. Miller', 'Sam Kinison', 'Sam Kinison, Arthur Eckdahl, Randy Hansen, Paul Henderson, Ice-T, Bill Kinison, Malika Kinison, Sally Marr', null, 'Get ready to scream with laughter! Sam Kinison''s primal scream will echo down through the comedy hall of fame summing up so much of modernity''s horror and stupidity. This concert was taped at the Wiltern Theatre where Sam was joined with the Randy Hansen Band and a salacious slew of sinuous sirens, including his wife Malika. Join Sam Kinison and guests for a concert guaranteed to make you laugh ''til you cry for more - there''s something for every member of the family - Sam Kinison style!', 'Get ready to scream with laughter! Sam Kinison''s primal scream will echo down through the comedy hall of fame summing up so much of modernity''s horror and stupidity. This concert was taped at the Wiltern Theatre where Sam was joined with the Randy Hansen Band and a salacious slew of sinuous sirens, including his wife Malika. Join Sam Kinison and guests for a concert guaranteed to make you laugh ''til you cry for more - there''s something for every member of the family - Sam Kinison style!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hKAhogDrSQDz9ZM3alNYrNH649r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69072'),
  ('1143455882494429639', 'Sam Smith: Love Goes – Live at Abbey Road Studios', 2021, 'Music', 'Paul Dugdale', 'Sam Smith', 'Sam Smith, Labrinth', null, 'Grammy-winning artist Sam Smith gives an intimate, soulful and chilling performance at the iconic Abbey Road Studios. This experience features songs from their third album and more.', 'Grammy-winning artist Sam Smith gives an intimate, soulful and chilling performance at the iconic Abbey Road Studios. This experience features songs from their third album and more.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2MdUahtFN5461usx0EcGHrDJLx4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:829125'),
  ('303468608293049371', 'Sam Was Here', 2016, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Christophe Deroo', 'Christophe Deroo, Clement Tuffreau', 'Rusty Joiner, Sigrid La Chapelle, Rhoda Pell, Hassan Galedary, Clément Lepoutre, Kate Moran', null, 'California, Mojave Desert, 1998. A strange glow appears in the sky. Sam, a forty-something door-to-door salesman, travels through the few inhabited zones of the Californian desert in search of clients.', 'California, Mojave Desert, 1998. A strange glow appears in the sky. Sam, a forty-something door-to-door salesman, travels through the few inhabited zones of the Californian desert in search of clients.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3M1Mt7dXaiRSOygR9C66DA3sbtt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:412766'),
  ('394963253427766514', 'Sam Whiskey', 1969, 'Comedy, Western', 'Arnold Laven, Robert C. Moreno, Burt Astor', 'William W. Norton', 'Burt Reynolds, Angie Dickinson, Clint Walker, Ossie Davis, William Schallert, Woodrow Parfrey, Rick Davis, Anthony James', 'PG-13', 'A widow hires an ex-gambler to retrieve gold bars from a sunken river boat in Colorado and discreetly return them to the Federal Mint, from where they had been stolen by her dead husband.', 'A widow hires an ex-gambler to retrieve gold bars from a sunken river boat in Colorado and discreetly return them to the Federal Mint, from where they had been stolen by her dead husband.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ho9de3wKBBHUo5iCRlY8NJ8PrEy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8693'),
  ('334255595478695916', 'Sam''s Song', 1969, 'Drama', 'Jordan Leondopoulos', 'Jordan Leondopoulos', 'Robert De Niro, Jarred Mickey, Jennifer Warren, Terrayne Crawford, Martin J. Kelley, Phyllis Black, Vic Ramos, Margit Echols', null, 'A political filmmaker finds himself in Long Island for a weekend where he finds himself entangled with a high-living, jet set crowd. At first it is exciting, but soon he finds himself disillusioned by their shallowness.', 'A political filmmaker finds himself in Long Island for a weekend where he finds himself entangled with a high-living, jet set crowd. At first it is exciting, but soon he finds himself disillusioned by their shallowness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hP99mnZzQ0ySALTJYwmzq8bkIFR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73612'),
  ('332565673152551530', 'Samadhi', 1967, 'Animation', 'Jordan Belson', null, null, null, 'Samadhi is both mystical and mysterious, an incredible fusion of movement, sound and colour. Belson notes the influence of his study and practice of Yoga and Tibetan Buddhism on the creation of Samadhi. The film is inspired by the principles of yogic meditation: the movement of consciousness towards samadhi (union of subject and object), the fusion of atma (breath and mind), a state which reveals the divine force of kundalini, a bright white light we discover at the end of Samadhi. The Tibetan Book of The Dead is the inspiration behind Belson’s use of colour in Samadhi, corresponding to descriptions of the elements of Earth, Fire, Air and Water in the book. —Sophie Pinchetti, The Third Eye', 'Samadhi is both mystical and mysterious, an incredible fusion of movement, sound and colour. Belson notes the influence of his study and practice of Yoga and Tibetan Buddhism on the creation of Samadhi. The film is inspired by the principles of yogic meditation: the movement of consciousness towards samadhi (union of subject and object), the fusion of atma (breath and mind), a state which reveals the divine force of kundalini, a bright white light we discover at the end of Samadhi. The Tibetan Book of The Dead is the inspiration behind Belson’s use of colour in Samadhi, corresponding to descriptions of the elements of Earth, Fire, Air and Water in the book. —Sophie Pinchetti, The Third Eye', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ateWEVdDUUsgJiZJUkGc6zyQPEG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:142192'),
  ('830478747743875846', 'Samakdo', 2026, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Chae Ki-jun', null, 'Jo Yoon-seo, Kwak Si-yang, Yang Joo-ho, Im So Young, Jang Eui-soo, Lee Pu-reum', null, 'The producer of the accusation program begins to track the cult ''Samsundo'' and the historical facts behind it. The more they try to find out about ''Samsundo'', the more they become engulfed in a bizarre phenomenon. Will they be able to safely arrive at ''Thousand Years'' Shrine, the only shrine in Korea, and let the whole story known to the world?', 'The producer of the accusation program begins to track the cult ''Samsundo'' and the historical facts behind it. The more they try to find out about ''Samsundo'', the more they become engulfed in a bizarre phenomenon. Will they be able to safely arrive at ''Thousand Years'' Shrine, the only shrine in Korea, and let the whole story known to the world?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7YLhUBObx7gT3bXAGYbxdr4cm8g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1096963'),
  ('1062761832109620372', 'Samaná Sunrise', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Rafa Cortés, Pau Esteve Birba', 'Rafa Cortés', 'María Luisa Mayol, Luis Tosar, Bárbara Santa-Cruz, Luis Zahera, Charles Dance, Alfredo Castro, Andresito Germosen De La Cruz, Laura Diaz', null, 'Two couples and friends, Ale and Santi and Natalia and Mario, are celebrating their twenty years together by holidaying in the Caribbean. They catch up with each other''s news, drink, reconnect... Ale, tipsy on the rum, decides to admit that the night the four met one another, she had played her hand to end up with Santi, who had initially fancied Natalia. The news doesn''t get the expected response. The following morning, Ale gets up with a horrible hangover and absolutely no idea of the extent to which she will have to face the consequences of her action.', 'Two couples and friends, Ale and Santi and Natalia and Mario, are celebrating their twenty years together by holidaying in the Caribbean. They catch up with each other''s news, drink, reconnect... Ale, tipsy on the rum, decides to admit that the night the four met one another, she had played her hand to end up with Santi, who had initially fancied Natalia. The news doesn''t get the expected response. The following morning, Ale gets up with a horrible hangover and absolutely no idea of the extent to which she will have to face the consequences of her action.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jLJlN27YGDKZNpR0RRxlgLIfoLP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1341012'),
  ('149870467000908489', 'Samantha Hudson: A Story About Faith, Sex and Electro-Queer', 2018, 'Documentary', 'Joan Porcel', 'Álvaro Augusto, Joan Porcel', 'Samantha Hudson', null, 'He was a high school icon and now he''s an Instagram icon. Many people admire him, others hate him, but he doesn''t leave anyone indifferent. Neither will do this astonishing documentary film where there is a lot of sex, faith and all the queer electronic music in the world.', 'He was a high school icon and now he''s an Instagram icon. Many people admire him, others hate him, but he doesn''t leave anyone indifferent. Neither will do this astonishing documentary film where there is a lot of sex, faith and all the queer electronic music in the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5bOQ7JaVTi5ZJVA5qXwfsoSzhFe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:532448'),
  ('555755060378049831', 'Samantha: An American Girl Holiday', 2004, 'Drama, Family, TV Movie', 'Nadia Tass, David Parker', null, 'AnnaSophia Robb, Mia Farrow, Olivia Ballantyne, Kelsey Lewis, Jordan Bridges, Rebecca Mader, Keir Gilchrist, Bruce Gooch', null, 'Kindhearted Samantha Parkington''s world starts to change the day Nellie O''Malley walks into her life. Nellie, her father, and her two little sisters have moved in next door to be servants for the Ryland family. Though they come from completely different backgrounds, Samantha and Nellie become fast friends. The girls turn to each other in happiness and sorrow, adventure and danger.', 'Kindhearted Samantha Parkington''s world starts to change the day Nellie O''Malley walks into her life. Nellie, her father, and her two little sisters have moved in next door to be servants for the Ryland family. Though they come from completely different backgrounds, Samantha and Nellie become fast friends. The girls turn to each other in happiness and sorrow, adventure and danger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hJwb18mOK68CJfREiNaBD0Xfrpn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25786'),
  ('567778381742547122', 'Samaritan', 2022, 'Science Fiction, Crime, Action', 'Christina Fong, David Ungaro, James McGrady', 'Bragi F. Schut', 'Javon Walton, Sylvester Stallone, Dascha Polanco, Moisés Arias, Pilou Asbæk, Sophia Tatum, Martin Starr, Henry G. Sanders', 'PG-13', 'Thirteen year old Sam Cleary suspects that his mysteriously reclusive neighbor Mr. Smith is actually the legendary vigilante Samaritan, who was reported dead 25 years ago. With crime on the rise and the city on the brink of chaos, Sam makes it his mission to coax his neighbor out of hiding to save the city from ruin.', 'Thirteen year old Sam Cleary suspects that his mysteriously reclusive neighbor Mr. Smith is actually the legendary vigilante Samaritan, who was reported dead 25 years ago. With crime on the rise and the city on the brink of chaos, Sam makes it his mission to coax his neighbor out of hiding to save the city from ruin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zgH8Ej50n2cvJCMJrxd4twEwSqz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:629176'),
  ('279117193134504047', 'Samaritan Girl', 2004, 'Drama', 'Sun Sang-jae, Kim Ki-duk, Jang Cheol-soo', 'Kim Ki-duk', 'Han Yeo-reum, Kwak Ji-min, Lee Eol, Jeong In-gi, Kwon Hyun-min, Oh Young, Im Gyun-Ho, Lee Jong-Gil', null, 'Jae-Young is an amateur prostitute who sleeps with men while her best friend Yeo-Jin "manages" her, fixing dates, taking care of the money, and making sure the coast is clear. When Jae-Young falls in love with one of those men, she suppresses her feelings towards him in respect of her friend who''s jealous.', 'Jae-Young is an amateur prostitute who sleeps with men while her best friend Yeo-Jin "manages" her, fixing dates, taking care of the money, and making sure the coast is clear. When Jae-Young falls in love with one of those men, she suppresses her feelings towards him in respect of her friend who''s jealous.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w0cn9vwzkheuCT2a2MStdnadOyh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1279'),
  ('393462188414103726', 'Samaritan Zatoichi', 1968, 'Adventure, Action, Drama', 'Kenji Misumi, Fujio Morita, Mitsuaki Tsuji', 'Kiyokata Saruwaka, Hisashi Sugiura, Tetsurō Yoshida', 'Shintarō Katsu, Yoshiko Mita, Makoto Satō, Kō Nishimura, Takuya Fujioka, Chōchō Miyako, Akira Shimizu, Ryoichi Tamagawa', null, 'Zatoichi is forced to kill a young man who owes a debt to a yakuza boss. Moments later, his sister Osode arrives with the money she earned (prostituting herself) to pay his debts. The bosses true motives are revealed and he attempts to steal Osode even though the debt is paid. Zatoichi realizes his grievous error and protects the girl from the gang. Osode and Zatoichi are caught in a dilemma as she must rely on her brother''s killer for protection and Zatoichi wrestles with the injustice he has caused.', 'Zatoichi is forced to kill a young man who owes a debt to a yakuza boss. Moments later, his sister Osode arrives with the money she earned (prostituting herself) to pay his debts. The bosses true motives are revealed and he attempts to steal Osode even though the debt is paid. Zatoichi realizes his grievous error and protects the girl from the gang. Osode and Zatoichi are caught in a dilemma as she must rely on her brother''s killer for protection and Zatoichi wrestles with the injustice he has caused.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sNYpnU1uuNfOew0mN0y2xx4rgAZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54281'),
  ('716842947373886897', 'Samay: When Time Strikes', 2003, 'Crime, Thriller, Mystery', 'Robby Grewal', 'Robby Grewal, Sameer Kohli', 'Sushmita Sen, Jackie Shroff, Sushant Singh, Deepak Dobriyal', null, 'Assistant Commissioner of Police (ACP) Malvika Chauhan battles time to obtain & solve the clues to solve the various murders occurring in the city.', 'Assistant Commissioner of Police (ACP) Malvika Chauhan battles time to obtain & solve the clues to solve the various murders occurring in the city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vlxRMeakczNOsovgluMk6T65rcw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:150922'),
  ('382335907587625412', 'Samba', 1965, 'Comedy', 'Rafael Gil, Christian Matras, Gábor Pogány', 'Jesús María de Arozamena, José López Rubio, Rafael Gil', 'Sara Montiel, Marc Michel, Fosco Giachetti, Carlos Alberto, José Prada, Zeni Pereira, Eliezer Gomes, Antônio Pitanga', null, 'Singer Laura Monteiro (Montiel) is murdered by her old protector João Fernandes de Oliveira (Giachetti), who has found out her love affair with Assis (Carlos Alberto). Favela-girl Belén (also Montiel) is the look-alike who takes her place, unaware she is being used by a gang that smuggles precious stones sewn in Carnival costumes. Written by fabreu', 'Singer Laura Monteiro (Montiel) is murdered by her old protector João Fernandes de Oliveira (Giachetti), who has found out her love affair with Assis (Carlos Alberto). Favela-girl Belén (also Montiel) is the look-alike who takes her place, unaware she is being used by a gang that smuggles precious stones sewn in Carnival costumes. Written by fabreu', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/osrXorjwS3wVQUB9WaIiUYEV4R4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:103890'),
  ('542554060815666841', 'Samba', 2014, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Stéphane Fontaine, Hervé Ruet, Olivier Nakache', 'Éric Toledano, Olivier Nakache', 'Omar Sy, Charlotte Gainsbourg, Tahar Rahim, Izïa Higelin, Issaka Sawadogo, Hélène Vincent, Youngar Fall, Christiane Millet', null, 'Samba migrated to France 10 years ago from Senegal, and has since been plugging away at various lowly jobs. Alice is a senior executive who has recently undergone a burnout. Both struggle to get out of their dead-end lives. Samba''s willing to do whatever it takes to get working papers, while Alice tries to get her life back on track until fate draws them together.', 'Samba migrated to France 10 years ago from Senegal, and has since been plugging away at various lowly jobs. Alice is a senior executive who has recently undergone a burnout. Both struggle to get out of their dead-end lives. Samba''s willing to do whatever it takes to get working papers, while Alice tries to get her life back on track until fate draws them together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4U0OwAZCxaFWzteynhbtBwRxEBM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:269148'),
  ('1128609038043963048', 'Samba in Mettmann', 2004, 'Comedy', 'Andreas Höfer, Angelo Colagrossi', 'Hape Kerkeling, Angelo Colagrossi', 'Hape Kerkeling, Doris Kunstmann, Alexandra Neldel, Barbara Magdalena Ahren, Janette Rauch, Pamela Knight, Rolf Nagel, Sky du Mont', null, 'Olaf is to take care of the family''s cleaner''s store, while his dad is away on a fair. In the evening he runs into three Brazilian ladies thrown out of a limousine not knowing where to go. Olaf invites them to stay with him and his deaf pot-smoking grandfather, which at first just causes some confusion as he soon is to marry his girlfriend Vera. The next day it''s topsy-turvy all over.', 'Olaf is to take care of the family''s cleaner''s store, while his dad is away on a fair. In the evening he runs into three Brazilian ladies thrown out of a limousine not knowing where to go. Olaf invites them to stay with him and his deaf pot-smoking grandfather, which at first just causes some confusion as he soon is to marry his girlfriend Vera. The next day it''s topsy-turvy all over.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1ESaTMrVejyVU0D8KQ8f40gZbjN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10926'),
  ('223994824878172357', 'Sambhavam Adhyayam Onnu', 2026, 'Fantasy, Thriller, Drama', 'Jithu Satheesan Mangalathu, Najose, Anoop Mohan S, Melbin Mathew', 'Jithu Satheesan Mangalathu', 'Vineeth Kumar, Assim Jamal, Shinoy P Das, Vijayan Unni, Askar Ali', null, 'Three Kerala Police officers venture into a mysterious forest on the Kerala-Tamil Nadu border to find a missing officer. They encounter strange time-related phenomena, uncovering the hidden secrets of Velloorkkatt forest.', 'Three Kerala Police officers venture into a mysterious forest on the Kerala-Tamil Nadu border to find a missing officer. They encounter strange time-related phenomena, uncovering the hidden secrets of Velloorkkatt forest.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FtBNSo4T0R8UztkkpjYkzXI4bFAT.jpg', 'plex:movie:sambhavam-adhyayam-onnu-2026'),
  ('623921046979674955', 'Sambizanga', 1973, 'Drama', 'Sarah Maldoror, Claude Agostini', 'Mário Pinto de Andrade', 'Elisa Andrade, Domingos de Oliveira, Jean M''Vondo, Dino Abelino, Benoît Moutsila, Talagongo, Lopes Rodrigues, Henriette Meya', 'NR', 'Domingos is a member of an African liberation movement, arrested by the Portuguese secret police, after bloody events in Angola. His wife goes from a prison station to another, trying in vain to find out where he is.', 'Domingos is a member of an African liberation movement, arrested by the Portuguese secret police, after bloody events in Angola. His wife goes from a prison station to another, trying in vain to find out where he is.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/isnDnTWjOE9EJqsKXvCwZQrIkeE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87392'),
  ('717975234300389281', 'Same Kind of Different as Me', 2017, 'Drama', 'Michael Carney, Don Burgess, Michael Burgess', 'Ron Hall, Alexander Foard, Michael Carney', 'Greg Kinnear, Djimon Hounsou, Renée Zellweger, Jon Voight, Olivia Holt, Peyton Wich, Lara Grice, Ty Parker', 'PG-13', 'International art dealer Ron Hall must befriend a dangerous homeless man in order to save his struggling marriage to his wife, a woman whose dreams will lead all three of them on the journey of their lives.', 'International art dealer Ron Hall must befriend a dangerous homeless man in order to save his struggling marriage to his wife, a woman whose dreams will lead all three of them on the journey of their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bHh5W7YuMorc4orn8DQ6c8YEnBm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:300687'),
  ('946270530140014879', 'Same Love, Same Rain', 1999, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Juan José Campanella, Daniel Shulman', 'Juan José Campanella', 'Ricardo Darín, Soledad Villamil, Eduardo Blanco, Ulises Dumont, Alfonso De Grazia, Alicia Zanca, Graciela Tenenbaum, Mariana Richaudeau', null, 'Jorge is a writer for a left-leaning Buenos Aires magazine that''s at odds with the country''s military dictatorship. He meets lovely and intelligent actress Laura and begins an on-and-off romance that will continue for the next two decades. Fearful of commitment, Jorge initially moves on from her and his fortunes suffer, but the situation changes when he and Laura renew their acquaintance. Meanwhile, the country undergoes a political transformation.', 'Jorge is a writer for a left-leaning Buenos Aires magazine that''s at odds with the country''s military dictatorship. He meets lovely and intelligent actress Laura and begins an on-and-off romance that will continue for the next two decades. Fearful of commitment, Jorge initially moves on from her and his fortunes suffer, but the situation changes when he and Laura renew their acquaintance. Meanwhile, the country undergoes a political transformation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qSeUv634CRFlHsmdXcUCQkcxqAt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44516'),
  ('261492454406764274', 'Same Old Song', 1997, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Alain Resnais, Renato Berta', 'Agnès Jaoui, Jean-Pierre Bacri', 'Pierre Arditi, Sabine Azéma, Jean-Pierre Bacri, André Dussollier, Agnès Jaoui, Lambert Wilson, Jane Birkin, Jean-Paul Roussillon', null, 'Odile is a business executive looking for a new, bigger apartment. Her younger sister Camille has just completed her doctoral thesis in history and is a Paris tour guide. Simon is a regular on Camille''s tours because he''s attracted to her. Camille has fallen for Marc, and they begin an affair. Nicolas is also looking for an apartment, since he hopes to eventually have his family join him in Paris.', 'Odile is a business executive looking for a new, bigger apartment. Her younger sister Camille has just completed her doctoral thesis in history and is a Paris tour guide. Simon is a regular on Camille''s tours because he''s attracted to her. Camille has fallen for Marc, and they begin an affair. Nicolas is also looking for an apartment, since he hopes to eventually have his family join him in Paris.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rhBcUjyHVssuCke2eZsypcUIMt2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2817'),
  ('379733379990319067', 'Same Old West', 2025, 'Drama, Western', 'Erico Rassi, André Carvalheira, Helena Ungaretti', 'Erico Rassi', 'Ângelo Antônio, Babu Santana, Tuanny Araujo, Rodger Rogério, Antônio Fábio, Daniel Porpino, Adanilo, Reisson Vinicius', null, 'In the backlands of Goiás, Brazil, brutish men who cannot deal with their weaknesses are constantly abandoned by the women they love. Sad and bitter, these men turn violently against each other.', 'In the backlands of Goiás, Brazil, brutish men who cannot deal with their weaknesses are constantly abandoned by the women they love. Sad and bitter, these men turn violently against each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oIFBDkkX3CJiasgmANr2H4P2dsm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1314750'),
  ('817000545342023347', 'Same Same But Different', 2009, 'Drama, Romance', 'Detlev Buck', 'Detlev Buck, Ruth Toma, Michael Ostrowski', 'David Kross, Apinya Sakuljaroensuk, Stefan Konarske, Jens Harzer, Anne Müller, Michael Ostrowski, Marie Jung, Lucile Charlemagne', null, 'Based on the true story of Benjamin Prufer and Sreykeo Solvan. The unexpected and uncertain love story of Sreykeo, a 21 year old bar girl in Phnom Penh and Ben, a young German student traveling to Cambodia on a post graduation summer trip. When Ben returns home to Germany he discovers that Sreyko is sick and he takes on the responsibility to save her. On the way he discovers a world where not everyone is dealt the same cards and where motivations are not always pure.', 'Based on the true story of Benjamin Prufer and Sreykeo Solvan. The unexpected and uncertain love story of Sreykeo, a 21 year old bar girl in Phnom Penh and Ben, a young German student traveling to Cambodia on a post graduation summer trip. When Ben returns home to Germany he discovers that Sreyko is sick and he takes on the responsibility to save her. On the way he discovers a world where not everyone is dealt the same cards and where motivations are not always pure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eSq61iJTzmWavEHhJuCp7sVpc5i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49853'),
  ('1021758716484272653', 'Same Sex Parents', 2001, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Laurence Katrian', 'Sandra Joxe', 'Louise Monot, Élisabeth Bourgine, Samuel Labarthe, Lucas Bonnifait, Fanny Florido, Donatienne Dupont, Julie Fournier', null, 'A jealous classmate exposes the fact that Olympe has 2 gay parents. Feeling ostracized and humiliated, Olympe lashes out at her closeted mother. Life unravels so that the truth can set them free.', 'A jealous classmate exposes the fact that Olympe has 2 gay parents. Feeling ostracized and humiliated, Olympe lashes out at her closeted mother. Life unravels so that the truth can set them free.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Vndw5uqeiJW62mIC28V9V0Qjx6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:393129'),
  ('628037444610465288', 'Same Time Next Week', 2017, 'Romance, TV Movie, Comedy', 'Toby Gorman, Monika Mitchell, Jody Ryan', 'Rick Garman, Sean King', 'Jewel Staite, Stephanie Bennett, James Kirk, Janet Glassford, Travis Milne, Jim Calarco, Chris McNally, Marci T. House', 'G', 'Sara deals with her grief by trying to complete her late husband’s bucket list. Injuring herself on one of the tasks leads her to meet Dr. Ryan. A widower himself, Ryan begins to help Sara complete the bucket list. The two get close and Sara doesn’t want to betray her husband’s memory, so she stops seeing Ryan. However, Ryan doesn’t give up and helps Sara realize that everyone deserves a second chance at love', 'Sara deals with her grief by trying to complete her late husband’s bucket list. Injuring herself on one of the tasks leads her to meet Dr. Ryan. A widower himself, Ryan begins to help Sara complete the bucket list. The two get close and Sara doesn’t want to betray her husband’s memory, so she stops seeing Ryan. However, Ryan doesn’t give up and helps Sara realize that everyone deserves a second chance at love', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/71TVleoftnJgtMti1vYyUVpYxrs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:469736'),
  ('298958500215608981', 'Same Time, Next Christmas', 2019, 'Romance, TV Movie', 'Stephen Herek, Christopher Baffa', 'Karen Bloch Morse', 'Lea Michele, Bryan Greenberg, Charles Michael Davis, Candace Smith, George Newbern, Nia Vardalos, Phil Morris', 'PG', 'Olivia Anderson is a successful young woman who met her childhood sweetheart during her family’s annual Christmas visit to Hawaii. After being separated by distance and years, the two reunite at the same Hawaiian resort years later, and the old chemistry between them flares up anew—but circumstances conspire to keep them apart.', 'Olivia Anderson is a successful young woman who met her childhood sweetheart during her family’s annual Christmas visit to Hawaii. After being separated by distance and years, the two reunite at the same Hawaiian resort years later, and the old chemistry between them flares up anew—but circumstances conspire to keep them apart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rxnyJpZpL6nAQKhs13hX0MvztmO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:639422'),
  ('617281785827496169', 'Same Time, Next Year', 1978, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Robert Mulligan, Robert Surtees', 'Bernard Slade', 'Alan Alda, Ellen Burstyn, Ivan Bonar, Bernie Kuby, Cosmo Sardo, David Northcutt, William Cantrell', 'PG', 'A man and woman meet by chance at a romantic inn over dinner and, although both are married to others, they find themselves in the same bed the next morning questioning how this could have happened. They agree to meet on the same weekend each year—in the same hotel room—and the years pass each has some personal crisis that the other helps them through, often without both of them understanding what is going on.', 'A man and woman meet by chance at a romantic inn over dinner and, although both are married to others, they find themselves in the same bed the next morning questioning how this could have happened. They agree to meet on the same weekend each year—in the same hotel room—and the years pass each has some personal crisis that the other helps them through, often without both of them understanding what is going on.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/58un6toArCEcOfctQ5a2fuQrm4o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37672'),
  ('113137287660337307', 'Sami Blood', 2017, 'Drama', 'Amanda Kernell, Sophia Olsson, Petrus Sjövik', 'Amanda Kernell', 'Lene Cecilia Sparrok, Mia Sparrok, Maj-Doris Rimpi, Julius Fleischanderl, Olle Sarri, Hanna Alström, Malin Crépin, Andreas Kundler', null, 'Elle Marja, 14, is a reindeer-breeding Sami girl. Exposed to the racism of the 1930s and phrenological examinations at her boarding school, she starts dreaming of another life. To achieve this other life she has to become someone else and break all ties with her family and culture.', 'Elle Marja, 14, is a reindeer-breeding Sami girl. Exposed to the racism of the 1930s and phrenological examinations at her boarding school, she starts dreaming of another life. To achieve this other life she has to become someone else and break all ties with her family and culture.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vSQWzjzmZONLGDPnzWa1e7xRfr8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:408435'),
  ('882062456469380440', 'Samia', 2024, 'Drama, Family', 'Yasemin Samdereli, Florian Berutti', 'Yasemin Samdereli, Nesrin Samdereli', 'Ilham Mohamed Osman, Elmi Rashid Elmi, Fatah Ghedi, Fathia Mohamed Absie, Riyan Roble, Zakaria Mohammed, Kaltuma Mohamed Abdi, Waris Dirie', null, 'Samia Yusuf Omar is just 9 years old when she discovers her special talent: she is faster than all the other boys and girls. With her friend Ali, who is the same age, she has the goal to earn real money with running and become famous. The children make a pact: Ali becomes Samia''s coach. With his help, Samia is to become a real champion. But the ongoing civil war makes life in Mogadishu increasingly difficult...', 'Samia Yusuf Omar is just 9 years old when she discovers her special talent: she is faster than all the other boys and girls. With her friend Ali, who is the same age, she has the goal to earn real money with running and become famous. The children make a pact: Ali becomes Samia''s coach. With his help, Samia is to become a real champion. But the ongoing civil war makes life in Mogadishu increasingly difficult...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fj9E0LxWLw2kvzdeR4kPjxeRcWz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1178684'),
  ('1064893753129323354', 'Samjin Company English Class', 2020, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Lee Jong-pil, Shin Seung-hoon, Park Se-seung', 'Son Mi, Hong Soo-young', 'Ko A-sung, Esom, Park Hye-su, Cho Hyun-chul, Kim Jong-soo, Kim Won-hae, Bae Hae-seon, David Lee McInnis', null, 'In mid ''90s, 3 female high school-grad office workers take up English classes together to get promotions and they team up to uncover corruption within their company.', 'In mid ''90s, 3 female high school-grad office workers take up English classes together to get promotions and they team up to uncover corruption within their company.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mruYaS9DXIhWfybp3WcpelW2lcJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:630211'),
  ('1087777734671730757', 'Sammy and Me', 2002, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Eduardo Milewicz, Marcelo Camorino, Daniel Gimelberg', 'Carmen Lopez-Areal, Eduardo Milewicz', 'Ricardo Darín, Angie Cepeda, Cristina Banegas, Alejandra Flechner, Pochi Ducasse, Henny Trayles, Sara Facio', null, 'Things begin to fall apart for Samy (Ricardo Darín), a longtime television writer on the brink of turning 40, when his midlife crisis starts interfering with his career. Suddenly, his scripts just aren''t that funny, and he''s considering leaving showbiz altogether. Can a pretty new actress (Angie Cepeda) help him turn his life around? Eduardo Milewicz directs this Spanish-language romantic comedy.', 'Things begin to fall apart for Samy (Ricardo Darín), a longtime television writer on the brink of turning 40, when his midlife crisis starts interfering with his career. Suddenly, his scripts just aren''t that funny, and he''s considering leaving showbiz altogether. Can a pretty new actress (Angie Cepeda) help him turn his life around? Eduardo Milewicz directs this Spanish-language romantic comedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pDmPOuIH74LNxiVYZLhMjgas9eY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64462'),
  ('668856719719890347', 'Sammy and Rosie Get Laid', 1987, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Stephen Frears, Oliver Stapleton', 'Hanif Kureishi', 'Shashi Kapoor, Ayub Khan-Din, Frances Barber, Claire Bloom, Lesley Manville, Suzette Llewellyn, Roland Gift, Emer Gillespie', null, 'Sammy and Rosie are an unconventional middle-class London married couple. They live in the midst of inner-city chaos, surround themselves with intellectual street people, and sleep with everybody - except each other! Things become interesting when Sammy''s father, Rafi, who is a former Indian government minister, comes to London for a visit. Sammy, Rosie, and Rafi try to find meaning through their lives and loves.', 'Sammy and Rosie are an unconventional middle-class London married couple. They live in the midst of inner-city chaos, surround themselves with intellectual street people, and sleep with everybody - except each other! Things become interesting when Sammy''s father, Rafi, who is a former Indian government minister, comes to London for a visit. Sammy, Rosie, and Rafi try to find meaning through their lives and loves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1qqhHVnrIyQAIpJn9H4yqtAoTw1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42013'),
  ('1077959431211715853', 'Sammy Going South', 1963, 'Adventure', 'Alexander Mackendrick, Erwin Hillier, Peter Price', 'Denis Cannan', 'Edward G. Robinson, Fergus McClelland, Constance Cummings, Paul Stassino, Harry H. Corbett, Zia Mohyeddin, Orlando Martins, John Turner', 'NR', 'After he is orphaned by an air raid on Port Said during the Suez Crisis, a young boy attempts to go by himself from the Suez Canal to Durban in South Africa where his nearest relative, Aunt Jane, lives. On the way he meets a variety of different people who help or hinder his journey - including an ageing diamond smuggler.', 'After he is orphaned by an air raid on Port Said during the Suez Crisis, a young boy attempts to go by himself from the Suez Canal to Durban in South Africa where his nearest relative, Aunt Jane, lives. On the way he meets a variety of different people who help or hinder his journey - including an ageing diamond smuggler.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tEstwSao0sPm7NPIwrsoHlOQgMt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41250'),
  ('334100713362053176', 'Samoa, Queen of the Jungle', 1968, 'Adventure, Action', 'Guido Malatesta, Augusto Tiezzi', 'Gianfranco Clerici', 'Roger Browne, Edwige Fenech, Ivy Holzer, Ivano Staccioli, Femi Benussi, Andrea Aureli, Umberto Ceriani, Tullio Altamura', null, 'Adventurer Clint travels across Borneo with a bunch of rogues and geologists on the search for a diamond mine. In the middle of the jungle, they meet a beautiful woman called Samoa. Hardly a surprise that Clint falls in love with Samoa, but trouble with the natives begins when the diamonds are found because diamonds are holy stones to them.', 'Adventurer Clint travels across Borneo with a bunch of rogues and geologists on the search for a diamond mine. In the middle of the jungle, they meet a beautiful woman called Samoa. Hardly a surprise that Clint falls in love with Samoa, but trouble with the natives begins when the diamonds are found because diamonds are holy stones to them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Ad7ZxZFpwtuBc3KeXRszewxfjHT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:271197'),
  ('1107907353397460255', 'Samouraïs', 2002, 'Action, Science Fiction', 'Giordano Gederlini, Emma Skowronek, Pierre Aïm', 'Matthieu Le Naour, Alexandre Coquelle, Giordano Gederlini', 'Cyril Mourali, Maï Anh Le, Yasuaki Kurata, Saïd Serrari, Santi Sudaros, Dara-Indo Oum, Kevin Peracini, Hidetoshi Nakahashi', null, 'An ageless Demon Warrior is magically impregnated into the womb of a Parisian Kung-Fu Master''s girlfriend. But what is the Demon''s relationship with a new-release blockbuster fighting game?', 'An ageless Demon Warrior is magically impregnated into the womb of a Parisian Kung-Fu Master''s girlfriend. But what is the Demon''s relationship with a new-release blockbuster fighting game?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rfg7K8NYj3lfMf2Jhw1GnO1bHOt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35110'),
  ('392293010307463280', 'Samowolka', 1993, 'Drama', 'Krzysztof Tusiewicz, Feliks Falk', 'Piotr Kokociński', 'Robert Gonera, Aleksander Gawek, Mariusz Jakus, Krzysztof Zaleski, Paweł Iwanicki, Marcin Jędrzejewski, Robert Latusek, Michał Żebrowski', null, 'New recruits go to the army and experience nothing but humiliation, cruelty and pure sadism from older soldiers.', 'New recruits go to the army and experience nothing but humiliation, cruelty and pure sadism from older soldiers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8jiePvRi3iuFEaYPimOqZKJtauL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107189'),
  ('1133480893292593209', 'Sampradayaini Suppini Suddapusaani', 2026, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'Sudheer Sreeram, Rithvik Reddy, Gudivaka Shiva Kumar', 'Sudheer Sreeram', 'Laya, Master Rohan Roy, Sivaji Sontineni', null, 'A village Sarpanch lands in trouble, dragging his wife and son into danger. They embark on a road journey to escape major risks in this crime comedy.', 'A village Sarpanch lands in trouble, dragging his wife and son into danger. They embark on a road journey to escape major risks in this crime comedy.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F5NaXPthSsxJHo5Br0IIiLYz0z3w.jpg', 'plex:movie:sampradayaini-suppini-suddapusaani'),
  ('733510837692322427', 'Samrat Prithviraj', 2022, 'Action, Drama, History', 'Manush Nandan, Shanoo Sharma, Dr. Chandraprakash Dwivedi', 'Dr. Chandraprakash Dwivedi', 'Akshay Kumar, Manushi Chhillar, Sanjay Dutt, Sonu Sood, Manav Vij, Ashutosh Rana, Sakshi Tanwar, Aishwarya Raj Bhakuni', null, 'The true story of legendary Hindu warrior king "Prithviraj Chauhan" including his early military successes, love story with Sanyogita & clashes with Muhammad of Ghor, a ruler of the Ghurid dynasty who led the foundation of Muslim rule in the Indian subcontinent.', 'The true story of legendary Hindu warrior king "Prithviraj Chauhan" including his early military successes, love story with Sanyogita & clashes with Muhammad of Ghor, a ruler of the Ghurid dynasty who led the foundation of Muslim rule in the Indian subcontinent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/itjop20yizH1cwB44tIo5JivPSq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:611598'),
  ('624895173679851234', 'Sams im Glück', 2012, 'Family', 'Peter Gersina', 'Paul Maar, Ulrich Limmer', 'Christine Urspruch, Ulrich Noethen, Aglaia Szyszkowitz, Armin Rohde, Eva Mattes, August Zirner, Anna Thalbach, Heio von Stetten', null, 'The Taschenbiers could actually lead quite a contented life - if it weren''t for the strange fact that if you have a Sams in your home for 10 years, you slowly but steadily become a Sams yourself. And this is exactly what happens to Mr. Taschenbier. You can''t see his recurring transformations from the outside. But his behavior changes all the more: he''s just as greedy, chirpy and cheeky as our Sams. But when he changes back again, he can''t remember anything. And what only we know: If Sams stays with the Taschenbiers, then this transformation will continue until Mr. Taschenbier himself has completely turned into a Sams!', 'The Taschenbiers could actually lead quite a contented life - if it weren''t for the strange fact that if you have a Sams in your home for 10 years, you slowly but steadily become a Sams yourself. And this is exactly what happens to Mr. Taschenbier. You can''t see his recurring transformations from the outside. But his behavior changes all the more: he''s just as greedy, chirpy and cheeky as our Sams. But when he changes back again, he can''t remember anything. And what only we know: If Sams stays with the Taschenbiers, then this transformation will continue until Mr. Taschenbier himself has completely turned into a Sams!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hYvjfFueJJ8HVoC3PYhOnQpBVGS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:136387'),
  ('905351138568669152', 'SamSam', 2020, 'Animation, Family, Science Fiction, Adventure, Comedy', 'Tanguy de Kermel', 'Valérie Magis, Jean Regnaud', 'Isaac Lobé-Lebel, Lior Chabbat, Jérémy Prévost, Sébastien Desjours, Léopold Vom Dorp, Victoire Pauwels, Léovanie Raud, Laurent Maurel', null, 'SamSam, the smallest of the great heroes, has still not discovered his first superpower, while at home and at school, everyone has one! Faced with the worry of his parents and the mockery of his comrades, he goes in search of this hidden power. With the help of Mega, the new mysterious student of his school, Samsam embarks on this adventure full of cosmic monsters ...', 'SamSam, the smallest of the great heroes, has still not discovered his first superpower, while at home and at school, everyone has one! Faced with the worry of his parents and the mockery of his comrades, he goes in search of this hidden power. With the help of Mega, the new mysterious student of his school, Samsam embarks on this adventure full of cosmic monsters ...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nNMAglUfOuDuyAKYSmXzFkBeNha.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:589973'),
  ('768846458932601639', 'Samsara', 2002, 'Adventure, Drama, Romance', 'Pan Nalin, Rali Ralchev, Jampa Kalsang Tamang', 'Pan Nalin', 'Shawn Ku, Christy Chung Lai-Tai, Neelesha Barthel, Lhakpa Tsering, Tenzin Tashi, Jamayang Jinpa, Jampa Kalsang Tamang', null, 'A love story situated in the Himalayas. A Buddhist monk can''t choose between life and the way of the Buddha.', 'A love story situated in the Himalayas. A Buddhist monk can''t choose between life and the way of the Buddha.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j97jPOtKRpPjNSoaupokZHWGQaj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8341'),
  ('735706719187204702', 'Samsara', 2011, 'Documentary', 'Ron Fricke, Ron Fricke', 'Mark Magidson, Ron Fricke', 'Ni Made Megahadi Pratiwi, Puti Sri Candra Dewi, Putu Dinda Pratika, Marcos Luna, Hiroshi Ishiguro, Olivier De Sagazan, Ladyboys of Cascade Bar, Kikumaru', 'PG-13', 'Filmed over nearly five years in twenty-five countries on five continents, and shot on seventy-millimetre film, Samsara transports us to the varied worlds of sacred grounds, disaster zones, industrial complexes, and natural wonders.', 'Filmed over nearly five years in twenty-five countries on five continents, and shot on seventy-millimetre film, Samsara transports us to the varied worlds of sacred grounds, disaster zones, industrial complexes, and natural wonders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qodkea4k0pNUmNTl5TJO2PdTqgW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89708'),
  ('119142376556450462', 'Samsara', 2023, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Lois Patiño, Mauro Herce, Jessica Sarah Rinland', 'Lois Patiño, Garbiñe Ortega', 'Amid Keomany, Toumor Xiong, Simone Milavanh, Mariam Vuaa Mtego, Juwairiya Idrisa Uwesu', null, 'Samsara is the Buddhist cycle of death and reincarnation. From the temples of Laos, we will accompany a soul in its transit from one body to another through the bardo.', 'Samsara is the Buddhist cycle of death and reincarnation. From the temples of Laos, we will accompany a soul in its transit from one body to another through the bardo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xfuZAK2K7OJe3iBk58u40iohrNy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1077684'),
  ('287648609817561057', 'Samson', 1961, 'Adventure', 'Zygmunt Hübner, Andrzej Żuławski, Barbara Sass', 'Kazimierz Brandys, Andrzej Wajda', 'Serge Merlin, Alina Janowska, Elżbieta Kępińska, Jan Ciecierski, Tadeusz Bartosik, Władysław Kowalski, Irena Netto, Beata Tyszkiewicz', null, 'The hero is a Jewish youth. He, like his family, has always been silent and undemonstrative in the face of prejudice. Now he stands up for his right to survive, and in so doing represents the fighting spirit that culminated in the Warsaw Uprising.', 'The hero is a Jewish youth. He, like his family, has always been silent and undemonstrative in the face of prejudice. Now he stands up for his right to survive, and in so doing represents the fighting spirit that culminated in the Warsaw Uprising.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xF4QU8J4UNFrUyeRi19t9KbkCVX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:204196'),
  ('303262509871883690', 'Samson', 2018, 'Action, Drama, Adventure', 'Bruce Macdonald, Trevor Michael Brown, Brian Shanley', 'Jason Baumgardner, Zach Smith, Galen Gilbert', 'Taylor James, Jackson Rathbone, Billy Zane, Caitlin Leahy, Frances Sholto-Douglas, Rutger Hauer, Lindsay Wagner, Greg Kriek', 'PG-13', 'After losing the love of his life to a cruel Philistine prince, a young Hebrew with Supernatural strength defends his people, sacrificing everything to avenge his love, his people, and his God.', 'After losing the love of his life to a cruel Philistine prince, a young Hebrew with Supernatural strength defends his people, sacrificing everything to avenge his love, his people, and his God.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v7Zaj1IEzMMB7KzfglpxdXWB66u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:474392'),
  ('14537580951923960', 'Samson & Sally', 1984, 'Animation', 'Jannik Hastrup', 'Li Vilstrup, Jannik Hastrup', 'Jesper Klein, Helle Hertz, Per Pallesen, Bodil Udsen, Poul Thomsen, Kirsten Peüliche, Berthe Qvistgaard, Claus Ryskjær', null, 'Samson is a young whale that doesn''t have friends. He spends his time listening to his mother''s stories about the legendary whale Moby Dick. Samson becomes fascinated about it and decides to go on a journey to find Moby Dick.', 'Samson is a young whale that doesn''t have friends. He spends his time listening to his mother''s stories about the legendary whale Moby Dick. Samson becomes fascinated about it and decides to go on a journey to find Moby Dick.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mCBPbCbRA1tRT9MNZ5oeLjOcP55.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36132'),
  ('95311065037038267', 'Samson and Delilah', 1949, 'Romance, Drama, History', 'Cecil B. DeMille, George Barnes, Edward Salven', 'Jesse Lasky Jr.', 'Hedy Lamarr, Victor Mature, George Sanders, Angela Lansbury, Henry Wilcoxon, Olive Deering, Fay Holden, Julia Faye', 'NR', 'When strongman Samson rejects the love of the beautiful Philistine woman Delilah, she seeks vengeance that brings horrible consequences they both regret.', 'When strongman Samson rejects the love of the beautiful Philistine woman Delilah, she seeks vengeance that brings horrible consequences they both regret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d2AHCe6WzvshD7ucKuUWgugExjc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29993'),
  ('938121670409949033', 'Samson and Delilah', 2009, 'Drama, Romance', 'Warwick Thornton, Lauren Edwards, Richard McGrath', 'Warwick Thornton, Beck Cole', 'Rowan McNamara, Marissa Gibson, Mitjili Napanangka Gibson, Scott Thornton, Matthew Gibson, Peter Bartlett, Noreen Robertson Nampijinpa, Kenrick Martin', null, 'Samson, a cheeky 15-year-old boy, and Delilah, live in an isolated Aboriginal community in the Central Australian desert. The two teenagers soon discover that life outside the community can be cruel. Lost, unwanted and alone they discover that life isn’t always fair, but love never judges.', 'Samson, a cheeky 15-year-old boy, and Delilah, live in an isolated Aboriginal community in the Central Australian desert. The two teenagers soon discover that life outside the community can be cruel. Lost, unwanted and alone they discover that life isn’t always fair, but love never judges.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w5BD4rNvGthCZSoJzJsIO8bQJhA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47075'),
  ('52919979541588086', 'Samui Song', 2018, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'Chankit Chamnivikaipong, Pen-Ek Ratanaruang, Chedpong Laoyant', 'Pen-Ek Ratanaruang', 'Chermarn Boonyasak, David Asavanond, Vithaya Pansringarm, Stéphane Sednaoui, Palika Suwanlak, Srisuphalak Vejvirun, Saruta Achinopunyawat, Puthabutr Kongka', null, 'A soap opera actress finds herself increasingly pressured by her husband, a rich foreigner entirely devoted to a charismatic cult leader.', 'A soap opera actress finds herself increasingly pressured by her husband, a rich foreigner entirely devoted to a charismatic cult leader.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8i8lT9xj7PzBEyVdK0OIVtlM6Tb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:472644'),
  ('865180162388289667', 'Samurai Assassin', 1965, 'Drama, Action, History', 'Kihachi Okamoto, Hiroshi Murai, Michio Yamamoto', 'Shinobu Hashimoto', 'Toshirō Mifune, Keiju Kobayashi, Yūnosuke Itō, Michiyo Aratama, Eijirō Tōno, Tatsuyoshi Ehara, Tadao Nakamaru, Kaoru Yachigusa', null, 'Japan, 1860. The men of the Mito clan, victims of the Ansei purge, anxiously prowl around the Sakurada Gate of Edo Castle with the intention of assassinating Naosuke Ii of Hikone, tairō of the Tokugawa shogunate and responsible for their misfortune.', 'Japan, 1860. The men of the Mito clan, victims of the Ansei purge, anxiously prowl around the Sakurada Gate of Edo Castle with the intention of assassinating Naosuke Ii of Hikone, tairō of the Tokugawa shogunate and responsible for their misfortune.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p4Z3hIghFiJZdr9fIVMzRn8Rxgu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79406'),
  ('876513530431449877', 'Samurai Avenger: The Blind Wolf', 2009, 'Thriller, Action', 'Kurando Mitsutake, Mark Migdal', 'John Migdal, Kurando Mitsutake', 'Domiziano Arcangeli, Kurando Mitsutake, Jeffrey James Lippold, Megan Hallin, Kyle Ingleman, Lorne Leutcher, Mariko Denda, Aki Hiro', null, 'A blind man seeks revenge against the psychopath who took away his sight and slaughtered his wife and daughter. Eight years after the massacre, the man has returned to the desert town, now a highly trained samurai swordsman ready to seek justice. But he doesn''t know there awaits seven assassins hired by his sworn enemy who want the bounty on his head. Set in nowhere, no time, this bloody modern day fable is a new age hybrid action film with a classic samurai essence and a spaghetti western spirit. This is, "Sushi Western!"', 'A blind man seeks revenge against the psychopath who took away his sight and slaughtered his wife and daughter. Eight years after the massacre, the man has returned to the desert town, now a highly trained samurai swordsman ready to seek justice. But he doesn''t know there awaits seven assassins hired by his sworn enemy who want the bounty on his head. Set in nowhere, no time, this bloody modern day fable is a new age hybrid action film with a classic samurai essence and a spaghetti western spirit. This is, "Sushi Western!"', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bH4OSMnUrc2E5mwY7MzbauriFsj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35627'),
  ('49451064818475937', 'Samurai Banners', 1969, 'Action, War, History', 'Hiroshi Inagaki, Kazuo Yamada', 'Shinobu Hashimoto, Takeo Kunihiro', 'Toshirō Mifune, Yoshiko Sakuma, Kinnosuke Nakamura, Yūjirō Ishihara, Katsuo Nakamura, Umenosuke Nakamura, Masakazu Tamura, Nakamura Kanzaburo', null, 'Kansuke Yamamoto is a samurai who dreams of a country united, peaceful from sea to sea. He enters the service of Takeda, the lord of Kai domain. He convinces Takeda to kill the lord of neighboring Suwa and take his wife as a concubine. He then convinces the widow, Princess Yu, to accept this arrangement and to bear Takeda a son. He pledges them his life. He then spends years using treachery, poetic sensibility, military and political strategy to expand Takeda''s realm, advance the claim of Yu''s son as the heir, and prepare for an ultimate battle with the forces of Echigo. Has Kansuke overreached? Are his dreams, blinded by love, too big?', 'Kansuke Yamamoto is a samurai who dreams of a country united, peaceful from sea to sea. He enters the service of Takeda, the lord of Kai domain. He convinces Takeda to kill the lord of neighboring Suwa and take his wife as a concubine. He then convinces the widow, Princess Yu, to accept this arrangement and to bear Takeda a son. He pledges them his life. He then spends years using treachery, poetic sensibility, military and political strategy to expand Takeda''s realm, advance the claim of Yu''s son as the heir, and prepare for an ultimate battle with the forces of Echigo. Has Kansuke overreached? Are his dreams, blinded by love, too big?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nfaNnLRRsGSpEp05sisHrcS2CrV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49363'),
  ('192992294216197245', 'Samurai Cat 2: A Tropical Adventure', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Takeshi Watanabe, Masaaki Yoshimura, Koji Endo', 'Kazuki Kitamura', 'Kazuki Kitamura, Hana Kino, Kaori Takahashi, Megumi Yokoyama, Kanna Mori, Fuyuki Moto, Yasukaze Motomiya, Takashi Nishina', null, 'The Edo period. Once a famous swordsman, Kyutaro Madarame, aka “Madara the Devil,” is now a masterless samurai. When a white cat called Tamanojo appears before Kyutaro, the encounter changes him forever. Starring Kazuki Kitamura. This offbeat tale of samurai spirit and adorable animal antics returns to the screen on a breathtaking scale!', 'The Edo period. Once a famous swordsman, Kyutaro Madarame, aka “Madara the Devil,” is now a masterless samurai. When a white cat called Tamanojo appears before Kyutaro, the encounter changes him forever. Starring Kazuki Kitamura. This offbeat tale of samurai spirit and adorable animal antics returns to the screen on a breathtaking scale!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vWcGt6S2tC5XOeV7a3QNsega3zp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:342185'),
  ('409301117671480252', 'Samurai Cat: The Movie', 2014, 'Action, Comedy, History', 'Yoshitaka Yamaguchi, Takeshi Watanabe, Masatoshi Tôjô', 'Yuji Nagamori, Yoshitaka Yamaguchi, Hideo Jojo', 'Kazuki Kitamura, Misako Renbutsu, Yasufumi Terawaki, Yōsuke Asari, Shigeyuki Totsugi, Yoriko Doguchi, Yoichi Nukumizu, Kanji Tsuda', null, 'The ever versatile Kazuki Kitamura stars as masterless samurai Kyutaro Madarame, a feared swordsman who has fallen on hard times in old Edo. Caught between two warring gangs in an epic battle of cat lovers and dog lovers, he begrudgingly accepts the canine faction''s offer to assassinate the opposite leader''s beloved pet: an adorable white cat. Yet upon raising his lethal sword, he cannot bring himself to go through with the act, and the cat melts his ronin heart. But before finding peace as a newly minted cat person, the still fearsome Madarame will have to take on both gangs in a classic samurai street brawl.', 'The ever versatile Kazuki Kitamura stars as masterless samurai Kyutaro Madarame, a feared swordsman who has fallen on hard times in old Edo. Caught between two warring gangs in an epic battle of cat lovers and dog lovers, he begrudgingly accepts the canine faction''s offer to assassinate the opposite leader''s beloved pet: an adorable white cat. Yet upon raising his lethal sword, he cannot bring himself to go through with the act, and the cat melts his ronin heart. But before finding peace as a newly minted cat person, the still fearsome Madarame will have to take on both gangs in a classic samurai street brawl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qgmEYMZY1mM6RTcyt70E5ivwSNM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:279178'),
  ('694093031153729146', 'Samurai Commando Mission 1549', 2005, 'Action, Science Fiction', 'Masaaki Tezuka, Atsushi Kaneshige, Osamu Fujiishi', 'Kiyoto Takeuchi, Yasushi Matsuura', 'Yosuke Eguchi, Kyoka Suzuki, Katsuhisa Namase, Daisuke Shima, Tetsuya Igawa, Kazuki Tsujimoto, Hiroki Touchi, Shintaro Wada', null, 'An accident during tests of an anti-plasma artificial magnetic shield at Japan''s Ground Self Defense Force East Fuji practice range sends the 3rd Special Experimental Company, under Colonel Matoba on a time-slip 460 years into the past, into ''the Age of civil War''. At the same time an imaginary-number anomaly thought to be caused by interference from the past begins eroding the present.', 'An accident during tests of an anti-plasma artificial magnetic shield at Japan''s Ground Self Defense Force East Fuji practice range sends the 3rd Special Experimental Company, under Colonel Matoba on a time-slip 460 years into the past, into ''the Age of civil War''. At the same time an imaginary-number anomaly thought to be caused by interference from the past begins eroding the present.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aRegAvUhium2g7FPAiuuZX5rnZt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33029'),
  ('706129900273198709', 'Samurai Cop', 1991, 'Action, Crime, Comedy, Thriller', 'Amir Shervan, Peter Palian', 'Amir Shervan', 'Mathew Karedas, Mark Frazer, Cranston Komuro, Robert Z''Dar, Gerald Okamura, Melissa Moore, Joselito Rescober, Cameron Oppenheimer', 'R', 'When Japanese organized crime imbeds itself within LA, the police turn to one man to take down the deadly Yakuza — Joe Marshall, aka "The Samurai." With his fearless swagger and rock hard jaw, The Samurai tears a two-fisted hole through the mob and doesn''t stop until the job is done.', 'When Japanese organized crime imbeds itself within LA, the police turn to one man to take down the deadly Yakuza — Joe Marshall, aka "The Samurai." With his fearless swagger and rock hard jaw, The Samurai tears a two-fisted hole through the mob and doesn''t stop until the job is done.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jOlz0kpxlLY5xixyDYpcYUi2SJy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65374'),
  ('7686927774953399', 'Samurai Cop 2: Deadly Vengeance', 2015, 'Action, Comedy, Crime, Thriller', 'Gregory Hatanaka, Spike Hasegawa', 'Tony T.L. Young, Rich Mallery, Gregory Hatanaka', 'Mathew Karedas, Mark Frazer, Kayden Kross, Laurene Landon, Tommy Wiseau, Cranston Komuro, Melissa Moore, Lexi Belle', 'R', '25 years later after the events of Samurai Cop (1991), Detective Frank Washington is forced to team up with his long estranged partner Joe Marshall to solve a series of assassinations being committed by a secret group of female vigilante killers.', '25 years later after the events of Samurai Cop (1991), Detective Frank Washington is forced to team up with his long estranged partner Joe Marshall to solve a series of assassinations being committed by a secret group of female vigilante killers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yYoWUAzGe5PH8E3lltUiM1LzTD0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:284460'),
  ('556242943937868512', 'Samurai Fiction', 1998, 'Action, Comedy', 'Hiroyuki Nakano, Yujiro Yajima', 'Hiroyuki Nakano, Hiroshi Saito', 'Morio Kazama, Tomoyasu Hotei, Tamaki Ogawa, Mitsuru Fukikoshi, Mari Natsuki, Taketoshi Naitō, Kei Tani, Fumiya Fujii', null, 'A warrior-in-training and his bumbling friends go in pursuit of a stolen sword.', 'A warrior-in-training and his bumbling friends go in pursuit of a stolen sword.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yWKRqv2fEZ10nM7245CjZm4ttEO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10686'),
  ('104570219516199417', 'Samurai from Nowhere', 1964, 'Action, Adventure', 'Seiichiro Uchikawa, Yoshiharu Ota, Akira Inomata', 'Hideo Oguni', 'Isamu Nagato, Shima Iwashita, Tetsuro Tamba, Chieko Baisho, Seiji Miyaguchi, Kichijirō Ueda, Nakajirō Tomita, Jun Hamamura', null, 'Misawa Ihei (Nagato) is traveling with his wife Tae (Iwashita Shima) who abhors the practice of sword fighting for prize money. Tae is the daughter of the clan''s chief counselor who married the low-ranking Ihei to avoid becoming the clan lord''s mistress. Into the mix comes Oba Gunjuro (Tetsurō Tamba), a mysterious ronin who will do anything for money. This leads to a fitting climax as the forces of hate and love converge while the couple attempt to break through the border!', 'Misawa Ihei (Nagato) is traveling with his wife Tae (Iwashita Shima) who abhors the practice of sword fighting for prize money. Tae is the daughter of the clan''s chief counselor who married the low-ranking Ihei to avoid becoming the clan lord''s mistress. Into the mix comes Oba Gunjuro (Tetsurō Tamba), a mysterious ronin who will do anything for money. This leads to a fitting climax as the forces of hate and love converge while the couple attempt to break through the border!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zHwzihHYZC1XU8Bc1iiPn1Li0Bq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:102280'),
  ('372205760638150174', 'Samurai Fury', 2025, 'Action, Drama', 'Yū Irie, Tomoaki Kawasumi, Ryo Otsuka', 'Yū Irie', 'Yo Oizumi, Kento Nagao, Wakana Matsumoto, Yuya Endo, Tomoya Maeno, Ami201, Hannya, Rina Takeda', 'NR', 'Set in war-torn 15th century Kyoto, on the eve of the Onin War, the movie centers on a band of outlaws led by Hyoe, a scoundrel whose lethal sword skills place him at the tip of the spear in a deadly uprising against the corrupt Shogunate and its army, led by former friend-turned-archrival Doken.', 'Set in war-torn 15th century Kyoto, on the eve of the Onin War, the movie centers on a band of outlaws led by Hyoe, a scoundrel whose lethal sword skills place him at the tip of the spear in a deadly uprising against the corrupt Shogunate and its army, led by former friend-turned-archrival Doken.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/apthwI5WmRT3cpiMg9sppEJ0PsN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1246369'),
  ('308629746518404875', 'Samurai Hustle', 2014, 'History, Comedy', 'Katsuhide Motoki, Shôji Ehara, Kazuhiko Ishida', 'Akihiro Dobashi', 'Kuranosuke Sasaki, Kyoko Fukada, Tsuyoshi Ihara, Masahiko Nishimura, Takanori Jinnai, Yasufumi Terawaki, Yusuke Kamiji, Tokio Emoto', null, 'During the reign of the eighth shogun of the Tokugawa shogunate, the Yunagaya Domain in the Tohoku region is a small han. But at the han, there is a gold mine. Suddenly, Masaatsu Naito of Yunagaya Domain receives an order to perform Sankin-kotai within 5 days. Sankin-kotai is a custom that requires the daimyo to visit the shogun in Edo. Unfortunately, the time needed to visit the shogun in Edo for Masaatsu Naito is 8 days. Masaatsu Naito also learns he received the order because a high ranking government official wants the gold mine. Also, the expense for Sankin-kotai is high and the Yunagaya Domain is such a small han that it seems impossible to complete. Nevertheless, Masaatsu Naito begins an unexpected operation to complete Sankin-kotai in 5 days.', 'During the reign of the eighth shogun of the Tokugawa shogunate, the Yunagaya Domain in the Tohoku region is a small han. But at the han, there is a gold mine. Suddenly, Masaatsu Naito of Yunagaya Domain receives an order to perform Sankin-kotai within 5 days. Sankin-kotai is a custom that requires the daimyo to visit the shogun in Edo. Unfortunately, the time needed to visit the shogun in Edo for Masaatsu Naito is 8 days. Masaatsu Naito also learns he received the order because a high ranking government official wants the gold mine. Also, the expense for Sankin-kotai is high and the Yunagaya Domain is such a small han that it seems impossible to complete. Nevertheless, Masaatsu Naito begins an unexpected operation to complete Sankin-kotai in 5 days.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tow08OsC8jSzzc3HPNVRufNC1LC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:279049'),
  ('836117753709364649', 'Samurai Hustle Returns', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Shôji Ehara, Katsuhide Motoki, Kazuhiko Ishida', 'Akihiro Dobashi', 'Kuranosuke Sasaki, Kyoko Fukada, Tsuyoshi Ihara, Yasufumi Terawaki, Ennosuke Ichikawa, Yusuke Kamiji, Yuri Chinen, Tokio Emoto', null, 'Masaatsu Naito successfully completes Sankin-kotai (required ritual to visit the shogun). On his way home, he hears that an insurrection by peasants has taken place in his hometown of Yunagaya. Masaatsu Naito knows that it is a counterattack by Matsudaira. He returns to Yunagaya, but finds that his castle is gone.', 'Masaatsu Naito successfully completes Sankin-kotai (required ritual to visit the shogun). On his way home, he hears that an insurrection by peasants has taken place in his hometown of Yunagaya. Masaatsu Naito knows that it is a counterattack by Matsudaira. He returns to Yunagaya, but finds that his castle is gone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Adcv0EjdRq4LjiiYBLXPcQ3qprh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:442321'),
  ('712863118596179655', 'Samurai I: Musashi Miyamoto', 1954, 'Drama, Action, Adventure', 'Hiroshi Inagaki, Jun Fukuda, Jun Yasumoto', 'Tokuhei Wakao, Hiroshi Inagaki', 'Toshirō Mifune, Rentaro Mikuni, Mariko Okada, Kurôemon Onoe, Kaoru Yachigusa, Mitsuko Mito, Eiko Miyoshi, Akihiko Hirata', null, 'Struggling to elevate himself from his low caste in 17th century Japan, Miyamoto trains to become a mighty samurai warrior.', 'Struggling to elevate himself from his low caste in 17th century Japan, Miyamoto trains to become a mighty samurai warrior.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2nCSzKqOslKrsvUHb2T1jsuh2eQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31372'),
  ('600355921355610945', 'Samurai II: Duel at Ichijoji Temple', 1955, 'Drama, Action, Adventure', 'Hiroshi Inagaki, Jun Fukuda, Jun Yasumoto', 'Hiroshi Inagaki, Tokuhei Wakao', 'Toshirō Mifune, Koji Tsuruta, Kaoru Yachigusa, Mariko Okada, Michiyo Kogure, Akihiko Hirata, Mitsuko Mito, Kurôemon Onoe', null, 'After years on the road establishing his reputation as Japan''s greatest fencer, Takezo returns to Kyoto. Otsu waits for him, yet he has come not for her but to challenge the leader of the region''s finest school of fencing. To prove his valor and skill, he walks deliberately into ambushes set up by the school''s followers.', 'After years on the road establishing his reputation as Japan''s greatest fencer, Takezo returns to Kyoto. Otsu waits for him, yet he has come not for her but to challenge the leader of the region''s finest school of fencing. To prove his valor and skill, he walks deliberately into ambushes set up by the school''s followers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nybLbDfegJOUMzsdrWWvLTD4kY0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31374'),
  ('705695202200864542', 'Samurai III: Duel at Ganryu Island', 1956, 'Action, Adventure, Drama, Romance, History', 'Hiroshi Inagaki, Jun Fukuda, Hiroshi Ueda', 'Tokuhei Wakao, Hiroshi Inagaki', 'Toshirō Mifune, Koji Tsuruta, Kaoru Yachigusa, Mariko Okada, Kurôemon Onoe, Michiko Saga, Takashi Shimura, Minoru Chiaki', null, 'A humble and simple Takezo abandons his life as a knight errant. He''s sought as a teacher and vassal by Shogun, Japan''s most powerful clan leader. He''s also challenged to fight by the supremely confident and skillful Sasaki Kojiro. Takezo agrees to fight Kojiro in a year''s time but rejects Shogun''s patronage, choosing instead to live on the edge of a village, raising vegetables. He''s followed there by Otsu and later by Akemi, both in love with him. The year ends as Takezo assists the villagers against a band of brigands. He seeks Otsu''s forgiveness and accepts her love, then sets off across the water to Ganryu Island for his final contest.', 'A humble and simple Takezo abandons his life as a knight errant. He''s sought as a teacher and vassal by Shogun, Japan''s most powerful clan leader. He''s also challenged to fight by the supremely confident and skillful Sasaki Kojiro. Takezo agrees to fight Kojiro in a year''s time but rejects Shogun''s patronage, choosing instead to live on the edge of a village, raising vegetables. He''s followed there by Otsu and later by Akemi, both in love with him. The year ends as Takezo assists the villagers against a band of brigands. He seeks Otsu''s forgiveness and accepts her love, then sets off across the water to Ganryu Island for his final contest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oVGMAef2EGjeXc4rJTTqTJq1ib4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31378'),
  ('928110984812114512', 'Samurai Marathon', 2019, 'Action, Drama', 'Bernard Rose, Yôhei Matsushita, Takuro Ishizaka', 'Bernard Rose, Kikumi Yamagishi, Hiroshi Saito', 'Takeru Satoh, Nana Komatsu, Mirai Moriyama, Shota Sometani, Munetaka Aoki, Naoto Takenaka, Etsushi Toyokawa, Hiroki Hasegawa', null, 'When feudal lord Itakura Katsuakira decides to prepare his samurai troops for the onslaught of modernization by having them compete in a marathon, his independent-minded daughter Yuki secretly joins the race.', 'When feudal lord Itakura Katsuakira decides to prepare his samurai troops for the onslaught of modernization by having them compete in a marathon, his independent-minded daughter Yuki secretly joins the race.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yusSNvTIKItyVgAZFUmSqAd5o1k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:578514'),
  ('578782031749084290', 'Samurai Pirate', 1963, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Senkichi Taniguchi, Takao Saitō', 'Takeshi Kimura, Shinichi Sekizawa', 'Toshirō Mifune, Mie Hama, Tadao Nakamaru, Kumi Mizuno, Ichirō Arishima, Hideyo Amamoto, Mitsuko Kusabue, Jun Tazaki', null, 'An adventurous and daring sailor sets sail to the castle of an ailing king to stop an evil premier, hungry for power and wealth, from succeeding the throne and marrying the king''s beautiful daughter. Along the way, with the help of some courageous rebels and a lustful wizard, he must overcome the powers of a bewitching witch, a band of ruthless pirates, and the castle''s Imperial guards. He must also free those kidnapped into slavery and restore the king''s reputation.', 'An adventurous and daring sailor sets sail to the castle of an ailing king to stop an evil premier, hungry for power and wealth, from succeeding the throne and marrying the king''s beautiful daughter. Along the way, with the help of some courageous rebels and a lustful wizard, he must overcome the powers of a bewitching witch, a band of ruthless pirates, and the castle''s Imperial guards. He must also free those kidnapped into slavery and restore the king''s reputation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mKNjK092wzyaRyQj24DsxO9eaNE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48383'),
  ('788455623227118815', 'Samurai Princess', 2009, 'Action, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Kengo Kaji', 'Sotaro Hayashi', 'Aino Kishi, Dai Mizuno, Asuka Kataoka, Miki Hirase, Kentarō Shimazu, Sarasa Tani, Mihiro, Mitsuru Karahashi', 'NR', 'When 11 of her friends are raped and murdered, leaving the Samurai Princess (Aino Kishi) the only survivor, she becomes infused with her comrades'' souls. Transformed into an android, she sets out to avenge their deaths. Dai Mizuno co-stars as the princess''s human partner in this Kengo Kaji-directed gore fest that features breast grenades, detachable chainsaw limbs, deadly guitar riffs and more.', 'When 11 of her friends are raped and murdered, leaving the Samurai Princess (Aino Kishi) the only survivor, she becomes infused with her comrades'' souls. Transformed into an android, she sets out to avenge their deaths. Dai Mizuno co-stars as the princess''s human partner in this Kengo Kaji-directed gore fest that features breast grenades, detachable chainsaw limbs, deadly guitar riffs and more.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2SnfWeWweozPtJCIqMMSm6UgEvA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26144'),
  ('199723599171169599', 'Samurai Rebellion', 1967, 'Drama, History, Action', 'Masaki Kobayashi, Kazuo Yamada', 'Shinobu Hashimoto', 'Toshirō Mifune, Yōko Tsukasa, Gō Katō, Tatsuyoshi Ehara, Etsuko Ichihara, Isao Yamagata, Tatsuya Nakadai, Shigeru Kōyama', 'NR', 'The mother of a feudal lord''s only heir is kidnapped by the lord. Her husband and his samurai father must decide whether to accept the unjust decision, or risk death to rescue her.', 'The mother of a feudal lord''s only heir is kidnapped by the lord. Her husband and his samurai father must decide whether to accept the unjust decision, or risk death to rescue her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bKySGFUTgsZyn5i7s5htMVy4Xd2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27031'),
  ('793657560683998759', 'Samurai Reincarnation', 1981, 'Action, Fantasy, Horror', 'Kiyoshi Hasegawa, Kinji Fukasaku', 'Kinji Fukasaku, Tatsuo Nogami', 'Sonny Chiba, Kenji Sawada, Akiko Kana, Hiroyuki Sanada, Ai Kanzaki, Hideo Murota, Noboru Matsuhashi, Naoko Kubo', null, 'After surviving the slaughter of many Christians 350 years ago, a samurai denounces God for ignoring the pleas of believers. He sells his soul to Satan and receives the power to resurrect the dead to join him in a murderous rampage.', 'After surviving the slaughter of many Christians 350 years ago, a samurai denounces God for ignoring the pleas of believers. He sells his soul to Satan and receives the power to resurrect the dead to join him in a murderous rampage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1RREOQRTYdjkzNxMv37winNPXFt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74289'),
  ('259325913558126921', 'Samurai Resurrection', 2003, 'Fantasy, Action, History, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Katsumi Yanagijima, Hideyuki Hirayama', 'Satoko Okudera', 'Kumiko Aso, Yosuke Kubozuka, Tetta Sugimoto, Koichi Sato, Kyōzō Nagatsuka, Tomoka Kurotani, Kazue Fukiishi, Kazuya Takahashi', null, 'Shiro Amasuka, dead leader of the Shimbara Revolt is resurrected from hell with the desire of overthrowing the shogunate for killing his companions. To do this , he resurrects an army of living dead swordsmen. Between him and his goal, only Yagyu Jubei stands...', 'Shiro Amasuka, dead leader of the Shimbara Revolt is resurrected from hell with the desire of overthrowing the shogunate for killing his companions. To do this , he resurrects an army of living dead swordsmen. Between him and his goal, only Yagyu Jubei stands...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nExaA9VAR3Tji6rbtqBGerrG8EN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36182'),
  ('680541392116888206', 'Samurai Saga', 1959, 'Action, Drama', 'Hiroshi Inagaki, Kazuo Yamada, Teruo Maru', 'Hiroshi Inagaki', 'Toshirō Mifune, Yōko Tsukasa, Akira Takarada, Keiko Awaji, Seizaburō Kawazu, Kamatari Fujiwara, Akihiko Hirata, Eiko Miyoshi', null, 'Edmund Rostand''s play Cyrano de Bergerac, transplanted to Japan. A poet-warrior with an oversized nose (matched only by his great heart) loves a lady. But she sees him only as a friend, so he helps another man to woo her by giving him the poetry of his own heart.', 'Edmund Rostand''s play Cyrano de Bergerac, transplanted to Japan. A poet-warrior with an oversized nose (matched only by his great heart) loves a lady. But she sees him only as a friend, so he helps another man to woo her by giving him the poetry of his own heart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1NbRZbD7wW4fQuOqvuV42OZpVmh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:186624'),
  ('681605886950657158', 'Samurai Shodown: The Motion Picture', 1994, 'Action, Animation', 'Hiroshi Ishiodori, Kazunori Iwakura, Seiichi Morishita', 'Nobuaki Kishima', 'Shingo Katori, Reiko Chiba, Yuu Daiki, Wataru Takagi, Sakiko Tamagawa, Takehito Koyasu, Takeshi Aono, Koichi Kitamura', 'PG-13', 'One hundred years after their deaths, six legendary holy warriors are reborn to seek justice against the former comrade who betrayed them into the hands of an evil god! The six warriors search the feudal province of Edo questing for the last Saint Soldier, Haohmaru, and their sworn nemesis Shirou Amakusa. Will the followers of the divine light triumph over the forces of darkness, or is history destined to repeat itself? Before their hundred-year journey has ended, six samurai will prove that the only thing stronger than their holy blades is the steel of their wills!', 'One hundred years after their deaths, six legendary holy warriors are reborn to seek justice against the former comrade who betrayed them into the hands of an evil god! The six warriors search the feudal province of Edo questing for the last Saint Soldier, Haohmaru, and their sworn nemesis Shirou Amakusa. Will the followers of the divine light triumph over the forces of darkness, or is history destined to repeat itself? Before their hundred-year journey has ended, six samurai will prove that the only thing stronger than their holy blades is the steel of their wills!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3WpzXMuGjvQDmVoE5uCtufvbxJh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71251'),
  ('169056817944227262', 'Samurai Spy', 1965, 'Action, Drama', 'Masahiro Shinoda, Masao Kosugi', 'Yoshiyuki Fukuda', 'Kōji Takahashi, Shintarō Ishihara, Eitarō Ozawa, Kei Satō, Rokkō Toura, Tetsuro Tamba, Eiji Okada, Seiji Miyaguchi', null, 'Years of warfare end in a Japan unified under the Tokugawa shogunate, and samurai spy Sasuke Sarutobi, tired of conflict, longs for peace. When a high-ranking spy named Tatewaki Koriyama defects from the shogun to a rival clan, however, the world of swordsmen is thrown into turmoil. After Sasuke is unwittingly drawn into the conflict, he tracks Tatewaki, while a mysterious, white-hooded figure seems to hunt them both. By tale’s end, no one is who they seemed to be, and the truth is far more personal than anyone suspected. Director Masahiro Shinoda’s Samurai Spy, filled with clan intrigue, ninja spies, and multiple double crosses, marks a bold stylistic departure from swordplay film convention.', 'Years of warfare end in a Japan unified under the Tokugawa shogunate, and samurai spy Sasuke Sarutobi, tired of conflict, longs for peace. When a high-ranking spy named Tatewaki Koriyama defects from the shogun to a rival clan, however, the world of swordsmen is thrown into turmoil. After Sasuke is unwittingly drawn into the conflict, he tracks Tatewaki, while a mysterious, white-hooded figure seems to hunt them both. By tale’s end, no one is who they seemed to be, and the truth is far more personal than anyone suspected. Director Masahiro Shinoda’s Samurai Spy, filled with clan intrigue, ninja spies, and multiple double crosses, marks a bold stylistic departure from swordplay film convention.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uLD26c8LgyKYJVcHPNtuE0ekOln.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46916'),
  ('446405545641873545', 'Samurai Vendetta', 1959, 'Drama, Action', 'Kazuo Mori, Akira Inoue, Shozo Honda', 'Daisuke Itō', 'Raizō Ichikawa, Shintarō Katsu, Chitose Maki, Ryōsuke Kagawa, Saburo Date, Reiko Fujiwara, Tokiko Mita, Fujio Suga', null, 'Two amiable samurai wind up on opposite sides of the vendetta between Lord Asano''s retainers and the family of Lord Kira that led to the famous revenge of the 47 Ronin.', 'Two amiable samurai wind up on opposite sides of the vendetta between Lord Asano''s retainers and the family of Lord Kira that led to the famous revenge of the 47 Ronin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bW7s5nU9H6JG9YHE835vJOxjlDv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125229'),
  ('903312231915576711', 'Samurai Wolf', 1966, 'Action, Adventure, Drama', 'Hideo Gosha, Sadaji Yoshida, Takashi Harada', 'Kei Tasaka', 'Isao Natsuyagi, Ryōhei Uchida, Toyoko Takechi, Junko Miyazono, Tatsuo Endō, Yoshirō Aoki, Junkichi Orimoto, Misako Tominaga', null, 'This is the story of a vagrant samurai – the solitary, savage and scrupulous Kiba – who arrives at a village to defend a beautiful, blind woman against a sinister plot. Her assailants then send against him another samurai, named Sana, who is without scruples. The fight between them will become personal, for the honor and love of the blind woman.', 'This is the story of a vagrant samurai – the solitary, savage and scrupulous Kiba – who arrives at a village to defend a beautiful, blind woman against a sinister plot. Her assailants then send against him another samurai, named Sana, who is without scruples. The fight between them will become personal, for the honor and love of the blind woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m3HxlJLKNR1RUtTdWjoDXp2sRUu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57706'),
  ('516560858549636370', 'Samurai Wolf II', 1967, 'Action, Adventure, Drama', 'Hideo Gosha, Sadaji Yoshida', 'Kei Tasaka, Norifumi Suzuki', 'Isao Natsuyagi, Kō Nishimura, Ichirō Nakatani, Yūko Kusunoki, Rumiko Fuji, Chiyo Aoi, Satoshi Amazu, Yoshirō Aoki', null, 'Kiba Okaminosuke finds himself entangled with a group of prisoners being transported to their executions, one of whom oddly looks exactly like his dead father. There are crooked gold miners, a beautiful girl who is unfortunately a complete lunatic and a dojo master who is obsessed with killing Kiba just to prove that his school''s sword style is the best.', 'Kiba Okaminosuke finds himself entangled with a group of prisoners being transported to their executions, one of whom oddly looks exactly like his dead father. There are crooked gold miners, a beautiful girl who is unfortunately a complete lunatic and a dojo master who is obsessed with killing Kiba just to prove that his school''s sword style is the best.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c95UkoftMiBWsPukR7Jr2lDOOyw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57707'),
  ('407961475645109013', 'Samurai X: The Motion Picture', 1997, 'Animation, Action, Fantasy', 'Hatsuki Tsuji, Hatsuki Tsuji, Hiroaki Edamitsu', 'Yukiyoshi Ôhashi', 'Mayo Suzukaze, Miki Fujitani, Yuji Ueda, Mina Tominaga, Hirotaka Suzuoki, Hiroshi Yanaka, Holly Kaneko, Katsuya Shiga', null, 'The war against the Tokugawa Shogunate ended years ago. But there are some who are not happy with the outcome. Shigure Takimi watched his friends and family get slashed down in the name of freedom and prosperity. Now he and a band of desparate rebels have sworn to settle one final score. Only one man stands in their way: Rurouni Kenshin. Will the former assassin take up his sword to fight again? When Shigure discovers Kenshin''s true identity and his fight becomes a personal vendetta, the young hero will have no choice.', 'The war against the Tokugawa Shogunate ended years ago. But there are some who are not happy with the outcome. Shigure Takimi watched his friends and family get slashed down in the name of freedom and prosperity. Now he and a band of desparate rebels have sworn to settle one final score. Only one man stands in their way: Rurouni Kenshin. Will the former assassin take up his sword to fight again? When Shigure discovers Kenshin''s true identity and his fight becomes a personal vendetta, the young hero will have no choice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/14iwocaqk0oL4Ec63OpSZuKBASy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39977'),
  ('595125955364353492', 'Samurai Zombie', 2008, 'Horror, Action', 'Koji Kanaya, Tak Sakaguchi', 'Ryuhei Kitamura', 'Mitsuru Fukikoshi, Shintaro Matsubara, Airi Nakajima, Nana Natsume, Tak Sakaguchi', null, 'A family travelling in a minivan are taken hostage by two fugitives. When the minivan gets a flat tire, they stumble upon a village infested by zombies in samurai armor.', 'A family travelling in a minivan are taken hostage by two fugitives. When the minivan gets a flat tire, they stumble upon a village infested by zombies in samurai armor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/byoZ0nNCPQi7e4uzNrZP7NYwNX6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52400'),
  ('236913647040455159', 'San Andreas', 2015, 'Action, Drama, Thriller', 'Brad Peyton, Tony Williams, Jodie Whetter', 'Carlton Cuse', 'Dwayne Johnson, Alexandra Daddario, Carla Gugino, Ioan Gruffudd, Archie Panjabi, Paul Giamatti, Hugo Johnstone-Burt, Art Parkinson', 'PG-13', 'In the aftermath of a massive earthquake in California, a rescue-chopper pilot makes a dangerous journey across the state in order to rescue his estranged daughter.', 'In the aftermath of a massive earthquake in California, a rescue-chopper pilot makes a dangerous journey across the state in order to rescue his estranged daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Gfjn962aaFSD6eST6QU3oLDZTo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:254128'),
  ('304416535383581156', 'San Andreas Quake', 2015, 'Action, Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'John Baumgartner, Ben Demaree', 'John Baumgartner', 'Jhey Castles, Jason Woods, Grace Van Dien, Elaine Partnow, Lane Townsend, Tessa Mossey, Alet Taylor, Sandra J. Payne', 'PG-13', 'When a discredited L.A. Seismologist warns of an impending 12.7 earthquake, no one takes her seriously. Now on her own, she races desperately to get her family to safety before the earthquake breaks Los Angeles apart from the mainland.', 'When a discredited L.A. Seismologist warns of an impending 12.7 earthquake, no one takes her seriously. Now on her own, she races desperately to get her family to safety before the earthquake breaks Los Angeles apart from the mainland.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4dx0K5ZbdhQDfcyBqqHJFH1OW71.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:339533'),
  ('833314919437655153', 'San Antonio', 1945, 'Western', 'David Butler, Bert Glennon', 'W.R. Burnett, Alan Le May', 'Errol Flynn, Alexis Smith, S.Z. Sakall, Victor Francen, Florence Bates, John Litel, Paul Kelly, Robert Shayne', 'NR', 'Rancher Clay Hardin arrives in San Antonio to search for and capture Roy Stuart, notorious leader of a gang of cattle rustlers. The vicious outlaw is indeed in the Texan town, intent on winning the affections of a beautiful chanteuse named Jeanne Starr. When the lovely lady meets and falls in love with the charismatic Hardin, the stakes for both men become higher.', 'Rancher Clay Hardin arrives in San Antonio to search for and capture Roy Stuart, notorious leader of a gang of cattle rustlers. The vicious outlaw is indeed in the Texan town, intent on winning the affections of a beautiful chanteuse named Jeanne Starr. When the lovely lady meets and falls in love with the charismatic Hardin, the stakes for both men become higher.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vwLq4HsUrjnfaQq1cwYzUCKnZ60.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17818'),
  ('61662070793844850', 'San Antonio', 2004, 'Action, Comedy', 'Frédéric Auburtin, Willy Stassen', 'Laurent Touil-Tartour', 'Gérard Lanvin, Gérard Depardieu, Barbara Schulz, Luis Rego, Michel Galabru, Ériq Ebouaney, Robert Hossein, Jérémie Renier', null, 'While a terrorist epidemy strikes the world leaders, the commissaire San-Antonio and his partner, the lieutenant Bérurier, have to escort the French ambassador in a British hotel. But after a negligence of Bérurier (one more little sex affair...), San-Antonio witnessed, helpless, to the ambassador''s abduction, organized by a gorgeous Italian girl. Back to Paris, San-Antonio is dismissed by the police chief, Achille Hachille. A real godsend for Bérurier, who get promoted... But soon, the situation degenerates, when the president of the Republic mysteriously disappears. Immediate reaction from Police Minister : San-Antonio is the only one who can save the day. He has 48 hours and a secret squad to find the president. At the Elysée, San-Antonio finds Bérurier, the official investigator. But now, it''s every man for himself : who will be the first to find the President ?', 'While a terrorist epidemy strikes the world leaders, the commissaire San-Antonio and his partner, the lieutenant Bérurier, have to escort the French ambassador in a British hotel. But after a negligence of Bérurier (one more little sex affair...), San-Antonio witnessed, helpless, to the ambassador''s abduction, organized by a gorgeous Italian girl. Back to Paris, San-Antonio is dismissed by the police chief, Achille Hachille. A real godsend for Bérurier, who get promoted... But soon, the situation degenerates, when the president of the Republic mysteriously disappears. Immediate reaction from Police Minister : San-Antonio is the only one who can save the day. He has 48 hours and a secret squad to find the president. At the Elysée, San-Antonio finds Bérurier, the official investigator. But now, it''s every man for himself : who will be the first to find the President ?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z8Z2sICArSBGJKkok3RKUOjoOro.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54552'),
  ('5736427964336730', 'San Babila-8 P.M.', 1976, 'Crime, Drama', 'Carlo Lizzani, Renzo Maietto, Piergiorgio Pozzi', 'Ugo Pirro, Mino Giarda, Carlo Lizzani', 'Daniele Asti, Giuliano Cesareo, Pietro Brambilla, Pietro Giannuso, Brigitte Skay, Grazia Baccari, Gilberto Squizzato, Paola Faloja', null, 'A quartet of young neo-Fascists terrorise the Milanise locals while the Police mostly look the other way.', 'A quartet of young neo-Fascists terrorise the Milanise locals while the Police mostly look the other way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9TqdM9WdQbnptSaW15Ytiu3qdDf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107034'),
  ('126404230512180448', 'San Demetrio London', 1943, 'Action, Drama, War', 'Charles Frend', 'Charles Frend, F. Tennyson Jesse, Robert Hamer', 'Walter Fitzgerald, Ralph Michael, Neville Mapp, Barry Letts, Frederick Piper, Gordon Jackson, Robert Beatty, Mervyn Johns', null, 'Based on the true story of the 1940 rescue of the tanker MV San Demetrio by parts of her own crew after she had been set afire in the middle of the Atlantic by the German heavy cruiser Admiral Scheer and then had been abandoned. When one of the lifeboats drifted back to the burning tanker the day after, and found that she still hadn''t exploded, they decided to board her and put out the fires. Eventually, they managed to start the engine again and decided to try to reach Britain against all odds.', 'Based on the true story of the 1940 rescue of the tanker MV San Demetrio by parts of her own crew after she had been set afire in the middle of the Atlantic by the German heavy cruiser Admiral Scheer and then had been abandoned. When one of the lifeboats drifted back to the burning tanker the day after, and found that she still hadn''t exploded, they decided to board her and put out the fires. Eventually, they managed to start the engine again and decided to try to reach Britain against all odds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2WZMGUtpSEkozlZ1lnaJDDiFQ8k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70426'),
  ('75828092262526751', 'San Ferry Ann', 1965, 'Comedy', 'Jeremy Summers, Ron Jackson, Billy Williams', 'Bob Kellett', 'David Lodge, Joan Sims, Wilfrid Brambell, Lynne Carol, Barbara Windsor, Ronnie Stevens, Ron Moody, Graham Stark', null, 'A motley crew of British characters ride The San Ferry Ann to the shores of France where they embark on a weekend of calamity. The campervan family led by Dad and Mum (David Lodge and Joan Sims) create chaos from the moment they set their tires on the shore resulting in frequent run-ins with the Gendarme, while Lewd Grandad (Wilfred Brambell) finds his own misadventures with a newly acquainted friend, a mad German ex-soldier (Ron Moody). Also aboard for the ride is a saucy hitchhiker (Barbara Windsor) who causes a few heads to turn including that of a fellow traveller (Ronnie Stevens) who pursues her affection with comic results. By the end of this weekend the French may well be wishing to say ''au revoir'' to these trouble-making tourists. San Ferry Ann is a humorous take on the tradition of the British get-away. A classic sound effect comedy that sits with the likes of similarly praised titles such as ''The Plank'', ''Futtock''s End'' and ''Rhubarb Rhubarb''.', 'A motley crew of British characters ride The San Ferry Ann to the shores of France where they embark on a weekend of calamity. The campervan family led by Dad and Mum (David Lodge and Joan Sims) create chaos from the moment they set their tires on the shore resulting in frequent run-ins with the Gendarme, while Lewd Grandad (Wilfred Brambell) finds his own misadventures with a newly acquainted friend, a mad German ex-soldier (Ron Moody). Also aboard for the ride is a saucy hitchhiker (Barbara Windsor) who causes a few heads to turn including that of a fellow traveller (Ronnie Stevens) who pursues her affection with comic results. By the end of this weekend the French may well be wishing to say ''au revoir'' to these trouble-making tourists. San Ferry Ann is a humorous take on the tradition of the British get-away. A classic sound effect comedy that sits with the likes of similarly praised titles such as ''The Plank'', ''Futtock''s End'' and ''Rhubarb Rhubarb''.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wGwUJXe6gUSL2zKXYTTJXW7e2rD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:173076'),
  ('636869451300645769', 'San Francisco', 1936, 'Drama, Romance, Music', 'W.S. Van Dyke, Edwin B. Willis, Harry McAfee', 'Herman J. Mankiewicz', 'Clark Gable, Jeanette MacDonald, Spencer Tracy, Jack Holt, Jessie Ralph, Ted Healy, Shirley Ross, Margaret Irving', 'NR', 'A beautiful singer and a battling priest try to reform a Barbary Coast saloon owner in the days before the great earthquake and subsequent fires in 1906.', 'A beautiful singer and a battling priest try to reform a Barbary Coast saloon owner in the days before the great earthquake and subsequent fires in 1906.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zQF1UDB0ck4dRfKAn4XixGrCkjx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43881'),
  ('781564482347901615', 'San Francisco', 1968, null, 'Anthony Stern', null, null, null, 'One of the earliest music videos, the film shows various pictures of San Francisco in the psychedelic era, with rapid cuts and freeze-frames, and Pink Floyd''s music.', 'One of the earliest music videos, the film shows various pictures of San Francisco in the psychedelic era, with rapid cuts and freeze-frames, and Pink Floyd''s music.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oXDT3pm00XA6dn7jhAhe3AUVMGY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:148827'),
  ('944900248912673858', 'San Giovanni decollato', 1940, 'Comedy', 'Amleto Palermi, Fernando Risi, Fede Arnaud', 'Amleto Palermi, Aldo Vergano, Cesare Zavattini', 'Totò, Titina De Filippo, Bella Starace Sainati, Silvana Jachino, Franco Coop, Osvaldo Genazzani, Augusto Di Giovanni, Mario Siletti', null, 'Mastr''Antonio Miciaccio caretaker and shoemaker is devoted to Saint John Beheaded and is trying to find out who has been stealing the oil that keeps the candle to the saint burning. He also does not approve of his daughter''s boy friend and he does not want him to marry her.', 'Mastr''Antonio Miciaccio caretaker and shoemaker is devoted to Saint John Beheaded and is trying to find out who has been stealing the oil that keeps the candle to the saint burning. He also does not approve of his daughter''s boy friend and he does not want him to marry her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7mVKodi2a0AlaxFIXACfe9jgHEc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74384'),
  ('71430447774186717', 'San Quentin', 1937, 'Action, Drama', 'Lloyd Bacon, Sidney Hickox', 'Humphrey Cobb, Peter Milne', 'Pat O''Brien, Humphrey Bogart, Ann Sheridan, Barton MacLane, Joe Sawyer, Veda Ann Borg, Archie Robbins, Joe King', null, 'Ex-Army officer Jameson takes a job a prison guard at San Quentin. Joe, the brother of his new girlfriend May, is sentenced to the prison for robbery. When Jameson tries to separate lawbreakers from hardened criminals, badguy Hansen tries to stir up trouble by telling Joe about Jameson''s interest in his sister.', 'Ex-Army officer Jameson takes a job a prison guard at San Quentin. Joe, the brother of his new girlfriend May, is sentenced to the prison for robbery. When Jameson tries to separate lawbreakers from hardened criminals, badguy Hansen tries to stir up trouble by telling Joe about Jameson''s interest in his sister.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vXVOti9ouBpscfSvFEl0cFsXqEy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51601'),
