  ('1141067931269397089', 'Sana: Let Me Hear', 2024, 'Horror', 'Takashi Shimizu, Tai Ouchi, Yasutaka Mori', 'Takashi Shimizu, Rumi Kakuta', 'Nagisa Shibuya, Hayase Ikoi, Soma Santoki, Towa Araki, Shota Sometani, Satoru Matsuo, Makita Sports, Tomoko Hoshi', null, 'During the summer vacation period, temporary teacher Honoka Kimijima is in charge of a supplementary class. One day, a female student suddenly jumps off from the school rooftop and dies in front of Honoka Kimijima. Then she notices a mystery student who is not supposed to be there.', 'During the summer vacation period, temporary teacher Honoka Kimijima is in charge of a supplementary class. One day, a female student suddenly jumps off from the school rooftop and dies in front of Honoka Kimijima. Then she notices a mystery student who is not supposed to be there.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e6niTHYeia696k2wBXYJIH70WJS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1281998'),
