  ('1100533848520153668', 'Sanam Bewafa', 1991, 'Drama, Family', 'Saawan Kumar Tak, Ali Shah, Manmohan Singh', 'Bharat Bhalla', 'Salman Khan, Chandni, Danny Denzongpa, Kanchan, Puneet Issar, Pankaj Dheer, Jagdeep, Dina Pathak', null, 'Salman falls in love with Ruksar but their fathers, despite being neighbours, are sworn enemies. The couple end up marrying but they are shocked when they finally discover the reason why their fathers allow the marriage to take place.', 'Salman falls in love with Ruksar but their fathers, despite being neighbours, are sworn enemies. The couple end up marrying but they are shocked when they finally discover the reason why their fathers allow the marriage to take place.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mnou9y9BgH7JVmsozvuqGxVPULc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:161396'),
