  ('811316633096899693', 'Sanders of the River', 1935, 'Adventure, Drama', 'Stanley Irving, Zoltan Korda, Osmond Borradaile', 'Jeffrey Dell, Lajos Biró', 'Paul Robeson, Leslie Banks, Nina Mae McKinney, Robert Cochran, Martin Walker, Tony Wane, Marqués De Portago, Eric Maturin', null, 'A British District Officer in Nigeria in the 1930s rules his area strictly but justly. He struggles with gun-runners and slavers with the aid of a loyal native chief.', 'A British District Officer in Nigeria in the 1930s rules his area strictly but justly. He struggles with gun-runners and slavers with the aid of a loyal native chief.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vlxgBfYguWO3Ttk6ap2Op2ycv29.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86956'),
  ('575522336179498836', 'Sandhesam', 1991, 'Comedy, Drama, Family', 'Sathyan Anthikad, Vipin Mohan', 'Sreenivasan', 'Thilakan, Sreenivasan, Jayaram, Oduvil Unnikrishnan, Kaviyoor Ponnamma, Maathu, Siddique, Mala Aravindan', null, 'After his retirement, Raghavan Nair (Thilakan) is back at his home. His long cherished dream to spend his retired life along with his family is thwarted after seeing his two sons brawling each other over their political differences.', 'After his retirement, Raghavan Nair (Thilakan) is back at his home. His long cherished dream to spend his retired life along with his family is thwarted after seeing his two sons brawling each other over their political differences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tF1Y52WGqX7t3Lj35oQC6IL3ENB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:134477'),
  ('1134890819664805539', 'Sandokan the Great', 1963, 'Adventure', 'Umberto Lenzi, Aurelio G. Larraya, Angelo Lotti', 'Víctor Andrés Catena, Fulvio Gicca Palli, Umberto Lenzi', 'Steve Reeves, Geneviève Grad, Andrea Bosic, Rik Battaglia, Mario Valdemarin, Leo Anchóriz, Antonio Molino Rojo, Enzo Fiermonte', 'NR', 'After the capture of the Sultan of Muluder, Sandokan, the sultan''s son, leads a guerilla army through treacherous jungles to free his father and defeat Queen Victoria''s army of invaders.', 'After the capture of the Sultan of Muluder, Sandokan, the sultan''s son, leads a guerilla army through treacherous jungles to free his father and defeat Queen Victoria''s army of invaders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nqRNCFBXKJueiPhWOVnEIQ6skVF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4731'),
