  ('1122624738741458772', 'Sanjay''s Super Team', 2015, 'Animation, Family, Fantasy, Action', 'Sanjay Patel', 'Sanjay Patel', 'Arun Rao, Brenton Schraff, Sunny Singh Attar, Jaquelynn Herrera', 'G', 'SANJAY''S SUPER TEAM follows the daydream of a young Indian boy, bored with his father''s religious meditation, who imagines "a kind of ancient, Hindu version of The Avengers," with the gods appearing like superheros.', 'SANJAY''S SUPER TEAM follows the daydream of a young Indian boy, bored with his father''s religious meditation, who imagines "a kind of ancient, Hindu version of The Avengers," with the gods appearing like superheros.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mShcGzOctlq6zs33UdrCdAwZMGq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:345637'),
  ('954477691074878885', 'Sanju', 2018, 'Drama', 'Rajkumar Hirani, Mukesh Chhabra, Ravi Varman', 'Rajkumar Hirani, Abhijat Joshi', 'Ranbir Kapoor, Paresh Rawal, Vicky Kaushal, Anushka Sharma, Dia Mirza, Manisha Koirala, Sonam Kapoor Ahuja, Boman Irani', null, 'Sanju explores some of the most crucial chapters from movie star Sanjay Dutt’s dramatic and controversial real life. It gives a lowdown on his tryst with drugs and his trials and tribulations in the Arms Acts case and the 1993 Mumbai blasts.', 'Sanju explores some of the most crucial chapters from movie star Sanjay Dutt’s dramatic and controversial real life. It gives a lowdown on his tryst with drugs and his trials and tribulations in the Arms Acts case and the 1993 Mumbai blasts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q1wkN4VQuBTj1AeyTLLz2w6awMA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:496328'),
  ('243537515314719656', 'Sankarabharanam', 1980, 'Romance, Drama, Music', 'Vamsy, K. Viswanath, Balu Mahendra', 'K. Viswanath', 'Somayajulu J V, Manju Bhargavi, Chandramohan, Rajyalakshmi, Tulasi, Allu Ramalingaiah, Nirmalamma, Saakshi Ranga Rao', null, 'Sankara Shastri is a devout and famous classical singer who finds a fan in Tulasi, a prostitute''s daughter. She wants to devote herself to his service, but her mother has other plans for her.', 'Sankara Shastri is a devout and famous classical singer who finds a fan in Tulasi, a prostitute''s daughter. She wants to devote herself to his service, but her mother has other plans for her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9LDbi3KsrpBQL48uXIPWTYsdjyF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30088'),
  ('1011937510163022966', 'Sankofa', 1993, 'Drama, Fantasy, History, Science Fiction', 'Haile Gerima, Babeto Matthews, Agustín Cubano', 'Haile Gerima', 'Kofi Ghanaba, Oyafunmike Ogunlano, Alexandra Duah, Nick Medley, Mutabaruka, Afemo Omilami, Reginald Carter, Mzuri', null, 'On a photo shoot in Ghana, an American model slips back in time, becomes enslaved on a plantation and bears witness to the agony of her ancestral past.', 'On a photo shoot in Ghana, an American model slips back in time, becomes enslaved on a plantation and bears witness to the agony of her ancestral past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t5PTcnhZgHzL7HUZKQP95UQDD5o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68351'),
  ('930224333401893067', 'Sanky Panky 3', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Eduardo Ortiz, Carlos Zayas', 'Miguel Morales', 'Fausto Mata, Tony Pascual, Aquiles Correa, Jazmin Caratini, Rafael Sánchez Navarro, Omar Cruz Soto, Rafa Sánchez', null, 'Genaro, Chelo and Carlitos finally reach their goal of leaving the Dominican Republic in search of a visa, but in Puerto Rico they still can''t stop getting in trouble.', 'Genaro, Chelo and Carlitos finally reach their goal of leaving the Dominican Republic in search of a visa, but in Puerto Rico they still can''t stop getting in trouble.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cKs1JbX7Ujuf2jV5dSV0d5y4Qpa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:407651'),
  ('248493989526120934', 'Sanmanassullavarkku Samadhanam', 1986, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Sathyan Anthikad', 'Sreenivasan', 'Mohanlal, Karthika, Sreenivasan, KPAC Lalitha, Thilakan, M G Soman, Yadu Krishnan, Sukumari', null, 'The only way Gopalakrishnan can escape from certain bankruptcy is to sell the property he owns in the city and use the proceeds to settle his debts. To do that, he has to evict his tenants from there first. Unfortunate for him, his tenant is the feisty Meera and her family, who absolutely refuses to vacate the house. Gopalakrishnan uses an obscure clause in the contract to take up residence at the house, and tries his best to smoke his tenants out.', 'The only way Gopalakrishnan can escape from certain bankruptcy is to sell the property he owns in the city and use the proceeds to settle his debts. To do that, he has to evict his tenants from there first. Unfortunate for him, his tenant is the feisty Meera and her family, who absolutely refuses to vacate the house. Gopalakrishnan uses an obscure clause in the contract to take up residence at the house, and tries his best to smoke his tenants out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tOWsaCUfiHRK0c4t0vAOwkkiXIp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:280321'),
  ('758670667460230098', 'Sanmao Joins the Army', 1992, 'Drama, Comedy, War', 'Zhang Jianya', 'Leping Zhang, Zhang Jianya', 'Lin Jia, Wei Zongwan, Sun Feihu, Ying Li, Lin Dong, Xu Caigen', null, 'In 1937, after the Marco Polo Bridge Incident, the Second Sino-Japanese War breaks out. San Mao, a wandering orphan, joins the army to participate in the Battle of Shanghai.', 'In 1937, after the Marco Polo Bridge Incident, the Second Sino-Japanese War breaks out. San Mao, a wandering orphan, joins the army to participate in the Battle of Shanghai.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ipDclhPbLChkePvuqaJoqTWlATa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:265671'),
  ('1091003391378002460', 'Sans peur et sans reproche', 1988, 'Comedy', 'Gérard Jugnot, Gérard de Battista', 'Christian Biegalski, Jean-Bernard Pouy, Gérard Jugnot', 'Gérard Jugnot, Patrick Timsit, Anémone, Gérard Darmon, Victoria Abril, Roland Giraud, Josiane Balasko, Michel Blanc', null, 'Without fear and beyond reproach: the life of the brave knight de Bayard reviewed and corrected with humorous sauce.', 'Without fear and beyond reproach: the life of the brave knight de Bayard reviewed and corrected with humorous sauce.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rcLG3jDid6si0OiDrzABe4WuwCy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50226'),
  ('859539952373299645', 'Sans pitié', 2026, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Julien Hosmalin, Florian Solin', 'Julien Hosmalin, Kamel Guemra, Olivier Torres, Myriam Dupuis, Henri Loevenbruck', 'Adam Bessa, Tewfik Jallab, Jonathan Turnbull, Laura Sépul, Bérangère McNeese', null, 'Maria raises her two sons, Ryan and Dario, on her own. The three of them run the shooting stand at a small traveling fair. After a motorcycle ride with his older brother, Dario disappears and remains missing. It’s only the next day that he reappears—injured and completely silent... Twenty years later, after their mother’s death, the two brothers reunite. Dario has rebuilt his life in Canada, while Ryan stayed behind in Ferris Wheel, surviving off the stand and small-time hustles. Dario rediscovers this forgotten world of the fairground and the family it harbors. But one night, among Ryan’s circle, he unexpectedly comes face to face with one of his former captors. From that moment on, the two brothers must grapple—with vengeance on one side, and forgiveness on the other...', 'Maria raises her two sons, Ryan and Dario, on her own. The three of them run the shooting stand at a small traveling fair. After a motorcycle ride with his older brother, Dario disappears and remains missing. It’s only the next day that he reappears—injured and completely silent... Twenty years later, after their mother’s death, the two brothers reunite. Dario has rebuilt his life in Canada, while Ryan stayed behind in Ferris Wheel, surviving off the stand and small-time hustles. Dario rediscovers this forgotten world of the fairground and the family it harbors. But one night, among Ryan’s circle, he unexpectedly comes face to face with one of his former captors. From that moment on, the two brothers must grapple—with vengeance on one side, and forgiveness on the other...', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FzngPhsBOrE6gEDWmBvutzYsKZ1E.jpg', 'plex:movie:sans-pitie-2026'),
  ('194835468981104898', 'Sans Soleil', 1983, 'Documentary', 'Chris Marker, Chris Marker, Pierre Camus', 'Chris Marker', 'Florence Delay, Amílcar Cabral, Arielle Dombasle, Bin Akao, David Coverdale, Chris Marker, Alexandra Stewart', 'NR', 'A woman narrates the thoughts of a world traveler, meditations on time and memory expressed in words and images from places as far-flung as Japan, Guinea-Bissau, Iceland, and San Francisco.', 'A woman narrates the thoughts of a world traveler, meditations on time and memory expressed in words and images from places as far-flung as Japan, Guinea-Bissau, Iceland, and San Francisco.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sspJu9K03FZQP8A1cheurkiePD0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1563'),
  ('299057535358120312', 'Sans Titre', 1997, null, 'Leos Carax, Éric Gautier', 'Leos Carax', 'Yekaterina Golubeva, Guillaume Depardieu, Catherine Deneuve', null, 'In 1997, for it''s fiftieth anniversary, the Cannes Film Festival asked Leos Carax for a short film, a kind of postcard addressed to the festival, in which the director would give news of himself and of his film project "Pola X."', 'In 1997, for it''s fiftieth anniversary, the Cannes Film Festival asked Leos Carax for a short film, a kind of postcard addressed to the festival, in which the director would give news of himself and of his film project "Pola X."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wGRhq0eHzt8kaRkGkfEbUrJ4ixQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:139057'),
  ('62981689220702506', 'Sanshiro Sugata', 1943, 'Drama', 'Akira Kurosawa, Akira Mimura, Seki Nakamura', 'Akira Kurosawa', 'Denjirō Ōkōchi, Susumu Fujita, Yukiko Todoroki, Ryūnosuke Tsukigata, Takashi Shimura, Ranko Hanai, Sugisaku Aoyama, Ichirō Sugai', null, 'A hotheaded youth in 1880s Meiji Japan apprentices to judo master Shōgorō Yano, trading brute jujutsu bravado for discipline and humility. As Sanshirō matures, he proves judo’s spirit against old-guard challengers—including a deadly duel—while falling for his vanquished opponent’s daughter. Based on the novel by Tsuneo Tomita, son of Tomita Tsunejirō, the earliest disciple of judo.', 'A hotheaded youth in 1880s Meiji Japan apprentices to judo master Shōgorō Yano, trading brute jujutsu bravado for discipline and humility. As Sanshirō matures, he proves judo’s spirit against old-guard challengers—including a deadly duel—while falling for his vanquished opponent’s daughter. Based on the novel by Tsuneo Tomita, son of Tomita Tsunejirō, the earliest disciple of judo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vmQV7lDO8hCaU6tuKhF3b9gFs4f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35022'),
  ('44859794625575912', 'Sanshiro Sugata, Part Two', 1945, 'Action, Drama, Adventure', 'Akira Kurosawa, Takeo Itō', 'Akira Kurosawa', 'Denjirō Ōkōchi, Susumu Fujita, Ryūnosuke Tsukigata, Akitake Kōno, Yukiko Todoroki, Sōji Kiyokawa, Masayuki Mori, Seiji Miyaguchi', null, 'A few years after his breakthrough, Sanshiro resumes his path to judo mastery—testing his discipline against an American prizefighter and later facing vengeful karate brothers. As rival schools and public spectacle push him toward violence, he must reconcile strength with restraint and the true spirit of his art.', 'A few years after his breakthrough, Sanshiro resumes his path to judo mastery—testing his discipline against an American prizefighter and later facing vengeful karate brothers. As rival schools and public spectacle push him toward violence, he must reconcile strength with restraint and the true spirit of his art.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9rOoa0NfglJ8nkesLonyeXkQZkO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45965'),
  ('983461787329015528', 'Sant Tukaram', 1936, 'Drama', 'Vishnupant Govind Damle, Sheikh Fattelal', null, 'Vishnupant Pagnis, Gauri, B. Nandrekar, Shankar Kulkarni, Kusum Bhagwat, Shanta Majumdar, Master Chhotu, Pandit Damle', null, 'This classic film chronicles the life of Tukaram (17th C.), one of Maharashtra’s most popular saint poets, activating the 20th century resonances of his turning away from courtly Sanskrit towards vernacular rhythms of religious poetry.', 'This classic film chronicles the life of Tukaram (17th C.), one of Maharashtra’s most popular saint poets, activating the 20th century resonances of his turning away from courtly Sanskrit towards vernacular rhythms of religious poetry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8KpgTQ3y8dT8jDqNru5clqrybUj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:154636'),
  ('364057815166148810', 'Santa', 1932, 'Drama', 'Antonio Moreno, Alex Phillips', 'Carlos Noriega Hope', 'Lupita Tovar, Carlos Orellana, Juan José Martínez Casado, Donald Reed, Antonio R. Frausto, Mimí Derba, Rosita Arriaga, Joaquín Busquets', null, 'Santa is a beautiful and very humble young girl living in Chimalistac, a small and quiet spot south of the 1930''s Mexico City. After Santa is cheated by arrogant soldier Marcelino, she''s rejected by her family and friends and expelled of Chimalistac. Santa finds shelter in a whorehouse and becomes a cinic and bitter woman, mistreated by bullfighter "Jarameno" and silently loved by blind pianist Hipólito.', 'Santa is a beautiful and very humble young girl living in Chimalistac, a small and quiet spot south of the 1930''s Mexico City. After Santa is cheated by arrogant soldier Marcelino, she''s rejected by her family and friends and expelled of Chimalistac. Santa finds shelter in a whorehouse and becomes a cinic and bitter woman, mistreated by bullfighter "Jarameno" and silently loved by blind pianist Hipólito.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cpe61FW8Btt2jb04IOXpsi3biKB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:181745'),
  ('432190162956905922', 'Santa', 2021, 'Drama', 'Victor Postiglione, Pablo Desanzo, Gonzalo Inovich', 'Victor Postiglione', 'Manuel Vainstein, Jonathan Da Rosa, Daiana Hernández, Cristian Salguero, Germán de Silva, Mariana Anghileri, Roly Serrano', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/igauBEqPo2BQ4LQY9GabTrE1WKl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:799572'),
  ('36777407896521831', 'Santa & Andres', 2016, 'Drama', 'Carlos Lechuga, Javier Labrador Deulofeu', 'Carlos Lechuga', 'Lola Amores, Eduardo Martinez, Luna Tinoco, George Abreu, César Domínguez, Ederlys Rodríguez, Maikel Alexi Sánchez', null, 'Santa, a peasant woman loyal to the Revolution, is sent to guard Andrés, a gay writer who is under house arrest, considered “ untrustworthy” for his ideas and sexuality by the Cuban authorities. Set in a small village in eastern Cuba during the early 1980s, this poignant political drama depicts an encounter between two deeply thoughtful souls on opposite sides of a profound cultural divide. Both have experienced deep loss, and both know the damaging effects of isolation and oppression. Even so, the cavernous ideological divide separating them — the same one that has separated Cuban friends and kin for over 50 years — has until now seemed insurmountable.', 'Santa, a peasant woman loyal to the Revolution, is sent to guard Andrés, a gay writer who is under house arrest, considered “ untrustworthy” for his ideas and sexuality by the Cuban authorities. Set in a small village in eastern Cuba during the early 1980s, this poignant political drama depicts an encounter between two deeply thoughtful souls on opposite sides of a profound cultural divide. Both have experienced deep loss, and both know the damaging effects of isolation and oppression. Even so, the cavernous ideological divide separating them — the same one that has separated Cuban friends and kin for over 50 years — has until now seemed insurmountable.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5YlbEsMIKnJC53d9C7owd88hZ4n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:412207'),
  ('32054377126763960', 'Santa and the Ice Cream Bunny', 1972, 'Fantasy, Family', 'R. Winer', null, 'Jay Ripley, Shay Garner, Pat Morrell, Ruth McMahon, Heather Hughes', 'G', 'Santa Claus finds his sleigh stuck in the sand on a Florida beach only days before Christmas Eve.', 'Santa Claus finds his sleigh stuck in the sand on a Florida beach only days before Christmas Eve.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nyxCEzLSnMfA3zgaeCZPbf10Wmh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79720'),
  ('690621946070315644', 'Santa and the Three Bears', 1970, 'Animation, Family, Fantasy', 'Barry Mahon, Tony Benedict', null, 'Hal Smith, Jean Vander Pyl, Christina Ferra-Gilmore, Bobby Riha', 'G', 'Two bear cubs want to meet Santa despite their mother telling them that Santa does not exist. With the help of the park ranger, their wish might come true!', 'Two bear cubs want to meet Santa despite their mother telling them that Santa does not exist. With the help of the park ranger, their wish might come true!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v9wosDbf4FAppKE54X21K2yzreD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48576'),
  ('1008195138843664176', 'Santa Baby', 2006, 'Comedy, TV Movie, Fantasy', 'Ron Underwood, Derick V. Underschultz', 'Garrett Frawley', 'Jenny McCarthy, Ivan Sergei, George Wendt, Kandyse McClure, Michael Moriarty, Tobias Mehler, Lynne Griffin, Lyle W. Edge', 'PG', 'Mary Class is a highly successful business executive - who just happens to be the daughter of Santa Claus. But when her father falls ill, Mary returns to the North Pole and the life she left behind to take over for her dad and implement her innovative ideas for running Christmas.', 'Mary Class is a highly successful business executive - who just happens to be the daughter of Santa Claus. But when her father falls ill, Mary returns to the North Pole and the life she left behind to take over for her dad and implement her innovative ideas for running Christmas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/42zv9dVVbTZ7tNwEG0cAk28FUSX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26847'),
  ('672039668526463264', 'Santa Baby 2', 2009, 'Comedy, TV Movie, Fantasy', 'Ron Underwood, Attila Szalay', 'Brian Turner, Garrett Frawley', 'Jenny McCarthy, Dean McDermott, Jessica Parker Kennedy, Gabe Khouth, Paul Sorvino, Kelly Stables, Rohan Campbell', 'PG', 'Santa''s in the midst of a late-life crisis -- he''s tired of the responsibilities of the job and is ready to pass on the reins to Mary, who feels torn between the family business and running her own high stakes firm in New York City, along with balancing a relationship with the love of her life, Luke (Dean McDermott). The situation gets increasingly dire when Teri, an ambitious new arrival to the North Pole, sows dissension at the workshop in an effort to take over Christmas.', 'Santa''s in the midst of a late-life crisis -- he''s tired of the responsibilities of the job and is ready to pass on the reins to Mary, who feels torn between the family business and running her own high stakes firm in New York City, along with balancing a relationship with the love of her life, Luke (Dean McDermott). The situation gets increasingly dire when Teri, an ambitious new arrival to the North Pole, sows dissension at the workshop in an effort to take over Christmas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aXASsMZ96szEoK593ZNcYqHAd65.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42673'),
  ('467527434196236257', 'Santa Buddies', 2009, 'Family, Adventure', 'Robert Vince, Kamal Derkaoui, Tim Chappell', 'Robert Vince, Anna McRoberts, Kevin DiCicco', 'Zachary Gordon, Josh Flitter, Skyler Gisondo, Field Cate, Liliana Mumy, Ty Panitz, Danny Woodburn, Richard Kind', 'G', 'When Puppy Paws, the fun-loving son of Santa Paws, gets bored, he finds Budderball on Santa''s naughty list and figures he''s just the dog to show him how to be an ordinary pup. When the magical Christmas Icicle starts to melt however, and the world begins to forget the true meaning of the season, it''s up to Puppy Paws and his newfound Buddies to journey back to the North Pole and save Christmas.', 'When Puppy Paws, the fun-loving son of Santa Paws, gets bored, he finds Budderball on Santa''s naughty list and figures he''s just the dog to show him how to be an ordinary pup. When the magical Christmas Icicle starts to melt however, and the world begins to forget the true meaning of the season, it''s up to Puppy Paws and his newfound Buddies to journey back to the North Pole and save Christmas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8HDtN8Kjb8KzoVMgBjACzCz5Pyr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24833'),
  ('588223804610661973', 'Santa Chikita', 1953, 'Comedy', 'Victor Antoun, Alekos Sakellarios, Errikos Iatrou', 'Christos Giannakopoulos, Alekos Sakellarios', 'Vasilis Logothetidis, Ilia Livykou, Stephanos Stratigos, Dina Stathatou, Vagelis Protopapas, Thanasis Tzeneralis, Nikos Kazis, Smaro Stefanidou', null, 'A poor man accepts the money someone offers him to marry a foreign woman so that she can stay in Greece.', 'A poor man accepts the money someone offers him to marry a foreign woman so that she can stay in Greece.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wHzCQfKrsG70BSOnwPsq5g8wPDy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:566166'),
