  ('548097775725839498', 'Santa Claus', 1959, 'Family, Fantasy, Comedy', 'René Cardona', 'Adolfo Torres Portillo, René Cardona', 'José Elías Moreno, Cesáreo Quezadas ''Pulgarcito'', José Luis Aguirre, Armando Arriola, Lupita Quezadas, Antonio Díaz Conde hijo, Nora Veryán, Ángel Di Stefani', 'NR', 'Pitch, the mean-spirited devil, is trying to ruin Christmas. Santa Claus teams up with Merlin the Magician and the children of the world in order to save the day!', 'Pitch, the mean-spirited devil, is trying to ruin Christmas. Santa Claus teams up with Merlin the Magician and the children of the world in order to save the day!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4wI91ojyHnUaNJzYlaFRuhqkRCh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13383'),
  ('1117110861363559714', 'Santa Claus', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Alexandre Coffre, Valérie Espagne, Daniel Dittmann', 'Fabrice Carazo, Laurent Zeitoun, Yoann Gromb', 'Tahar Rahim, Victor Cabal, Amélie Glenn, Michaël Abiteboul, Philippe Rebbot, Annelise Hesme, Jean-François Cayrey, Djibril Gueye', null, 'One night, a burglar in a Santa Claus costume is surprised by Victor, a young boy who believes he is the real Santa Claus. Victor then follows him, and they embark on an unexpected adventure that will change their lives.', 'One night, a burglar in a Santa Claus costume is surprised by Victor, a young boy who believes he is the real Santa Claus. Victor then follows him, and they embark on an unexpected adventure that will change their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mEVDs1OWSMEDtQuWFpVV5X1FBEd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:305455'),
  ('846314699073499546', 'Santa Claus and the Magic Drum', 1996, 'Animation, Family', 'Mauri Kunnas, Pekka Lehtosaari, Imre Ádám', 'Mauri Kunnas', 'Esa Saario, Ulla Tapaninen, Henna Haverinen, Olli Parviainen, Aarre Karén, Veikko Honkanen, Vesa Vierikko, Eija Ahvo', null, 'A few days before Christmas Eve the last sack of letters arrives to Santa. At the bottom is a letter that is a bit older than the others, it''s a drawing. While the curious Santa tries to figure out what the drawing looks like, strange things begin to happen.', 'A few days before Christmas Eve the last sack of letters arrives to Santa. At the bottom is a letter that is a bit older than the others, it''s a drawing. While the curious Santa tries to figure out what the drawing looks like, strange things begin to happen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oE4NFNWSI3KDmWKGw0pAnXYXe3i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61495'),
  ('409666232789900888', 'Santa Claus Conquers the Martians', 1964, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'David L. Quaid, Nicholas Webster, Gerry Rich', 'Glenville Mareth', 'John Call, Leonard Hicks, Vincent Beck, Bill McCutcheon, Victor Stiles, Donna Conforti, Chris Month, Pia Zadora', 'NR', 'Martians fear their children have become lazy and joyless due to their newfound obsession with Earth TV shows. After ancient Martian leader Chochem suggests that the children of Mars need more fun—including their own Santa Claus—supreme leader Lord Kimar assembles an expedition to Earth. Once there, they kidnap two children who lead them to the North Pole, then capture the real Santa Claus, taking all three back to Mars in an attempt to bring the Martian children happiness.', 'Martians fear their children have become lazy and joyless due to their newfound obsession with Earth TV shows. After ancient Martian leader Chochem suggests that the children of Mars need more fun—including their own Santa Claus—supreme leader Lord Kimar assembles an expedition to Earth. Once there, they kidnap two children who lead them to the North Pole, then capture the real Santa Claus, taking all three back to Mars in an attempt to bring the Martian children happiness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f8lxrcMx98AuvlLSb2hPkz0CuH0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32307'),
  ('535517059375890794', 'Santa Claus Has Blue Eyes', 1966, 'Drama', 'Jean Eustache, Daniel Lacambre, Philippe Théaudière', 'Jean Eustache', 'Jean-Pierre Léaud, Gérard Zimmermann, Henri Martinez, René Gilson, Michèle Maynard, Carmen Ripoll, Maurice Domingo, Jeanne Delos', null, 'Daniel needs some money to buy a duffle coat that is in fashion, so he agrees to work for a photographer by dressing up as Santa Claus. He discovers that it is much easier to meet girls when he is in his costume.', 'Daniel needs some money to buy a duffle coat that is in fashion, so he agrees to work for a photographer by dressing up as Santa Claus. He discovers that it is much easier to meet girls when he is in his costume.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/OMF1gE9NISOiO3k43AX0bdvpVu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84823'),
  ('532556622879534961', 'Santa Claus Is a Stinker', 1982, 'Comedy', 'Jean-Marie Poiré, Jean Pieuchot, Robin Katz', 'Marie-Anne Chazel, Christian Clavier, Josiane Balasko', 'Gérard Jugnot, Thierry Lhermitte, Anémone, Christian Clavier, Marie-Anne Chazel, Josiane Balasko, Bruno Moynot, Martin Lamotte', null, 'Two neurotics, working for a suicide hotline on the night of Christmas Eve, get caught up in a catastrophe when a pregnant woman, her abusive boyfriend, and a transvestite visit their office.', 'Two neurotics, working for a suicide hotline on the night of Christmas Eve, get caught up in a catastrophe when a pregnant woman, her abusive boyfriend, and a transvestite visit their office.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z86yqhtqmNxQN214OK4PUDbpBOq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14645'),
