  ('44956647403373935', 'Santa Maradona', 2001, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Marco Ponti, Marcello Montarsi, Mirta Guarnaschelli', 'Marco Ponti', 'Stefano Accorsi, Anita Caprioli, Libero De Rienzo, Mandala Tayde, Domenico D''Alessandro, Fabio Troiano, Aleksandar Cvjetković, Andrea Camuffo', null, 'An aimless college graduate jumping from one job interview to another — killing time in between with his wisecracking and deadbeat room-mate — falls in love with an actress.', 'An aimless college graduate jumping from one job interview to another — killing time in between with his wisecracking and deadbeat room-mate — falls in love with an actress.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fYuwnWK4TN1EVB8RiGbNps5cyBr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56899'),
  ('1075398922682496610', 'Santa Paws 2: The Santa Pups', 2012, 'Family, Fantasy, Adventure', 'Robert Vince, Mark Irwin', 'Robert Vince, Philip Fracassi, Anna McRoberts', 'Genevieve Hannelius, Tatiana Gudegast, Marlowe Peyton, Aidan Gemme, Cheryl Ladd, Danny Woodburn, Richard Kind, Josh Feldman', 'G', 'When Mrs. Claus travels to Pineville, the merriest place on the planet, a quartet of magical puppies stow away on her sled, granting joyful wishes to the town''s boys and girls. However, something goes terribly wrong - the Christmas spirit begins to disappear. Now, the Santa Pups and Mrs. Claus must race to save Christmas magic from running out for all.', 'When Mrs. Claus travels to Pineville, the merriest place on the planet, a quartet of magical puppies stow away on her sled, granting joyful wishes to the town''s boys and girls. However, something goes terribly wrong - the Christmas spirit begins to disappear. Now, the Santa Pups and Mrs. Claus must race to save Christmas magic from running out for all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sqbtTl02wRkmLu7dVpI90T039wW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:142308'),
  ('681342466022476475', 'Santa Tell Me', 2024, 'TV Movie, Romance, Comedy', 'Ryan Landels, Tyler Walzak, Kit Marlatt', 'Ryan Landels', 'Erin Krakow, Daniel Lissing, Benjamin Ayres, Christopher Russell, Kurtis Szarka, Sharon Crandall, Russell Roberts, Mashal Nazari', null, 'When Olivia, a successful interior designer, finds an old letter from Santa promising she’ll meet the love of her life by Christmas Eve — and that his name will be Nick — she’s stunned to meet not one, but three guys named Nick.” In addition to navigating three holiday romances, she finds herself drawn to a co-worker.', 'When Olivia, a successful interior designer, finds an old letter from Santa promising she’ll meet the love of her life by Christmas Eve — and that his name will be Nick — she’s stunned to meet not one, but three guys named Nick.” In addition to navigating three holiday romances, she finds herself drawn to a co-worker.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zKvCa16DTB1gJJ9hdCpSHyWu9Ue.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1325888'),
  ('76067709454919341', 'Santa Who?', 2000, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'William Dear, Derick V. Underschultz', null, 'Leslie Nielsen, Steven Eckholdt, Robyn Lively, Max Morrow, Tommy Davidson, Darren Frost, Karen LeBlanc, R.D. Reid', 'NR', 'Santa Claus develops amnesia after accidentally falling out of his sleigh and only the innocence of a small child can save him. Meanwhile, Santa has to battle the disbelief of a newsman.', 'Santa Claus develops amnesia after accidentally falling out of his sleigh and only the innocence of a small child can save him. Meanwhile, Santa has to battle the disbelief of a newsman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5qOwQ76sVubcbvS0CcD4gp1rJzI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42332'),
  ('355641113025759241', 'Santa with Muscles', 1996, 'Action, Family, Comedy', 'Michael Gfelner, John Murlowski, David Rimer', 'Jonathan Bond, Fred Mata, Dorrie Krum Raymond', 'Hulk Hogan, Ed Begley Jr., Don Stark, Robin Curtis, Clint Howard, Mila Kunis, Adam Wylie, Aria Noelle Curzon', 'PG', 'A heartless millionaire believes he is Santa Claus after an accident renders him amnesiac.', 'A heartless millionaire believes he is Santa Claus after an accident renders him amnesiac.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ldxrT4FkyJWENpqy0ZucCu1HgAj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31388'),
  ('1080509248918082693', 'Santa''s Apprentice', 2010, 'Family, Animation', 'Luc Vinciguerra', 'Alexandre Reverend', 'Nathan Simony, Benoît Allemane, Julie Gayet, Lorànt Deutsch, Pierre-François Martin-Laval, Line Renaud, Isabelle Mergault, Bruno Salomone', 'G', 'Santa doesn''t want to retire, but rules are rules and he must train someone to replace him. The lucky winner, to be chosen from among millions of children, must be named Nicholas, be an orphan and have a pure heart. On the other side of the planet, there is a little boy who is a perfect match, but his lack of self-confidence and fear of heights make him a poor contestant. Will Santa agree to step down, and help his apprentice take his place?', 'Santa doesn''t want to retire, but rules are rules and he must train someone to replace him. The lucky winner, to be chosen from among millions of children, must be named Nicholas, be an orphan and have a pure heart. On the other side of the planet, there is a little boy who is a perfect match, but his lack of self-confidence and fear of heights make him a poor contestant. Will Santa agree to step down, and help his apprentice take his place?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ot2u06E1TjVCXkcoAEPSE1hHuTi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51450'),
  ('661292996802619187', 'Santa''s Little Helper', 2015, 'Comedy, Family', 'Gil Junger', 'Bennett Yellin, James Robert Johnston', 'Mike Mizanin, Saraya Bevis, AnnaLynne McCord, Eric Keenleyside, Kathryn Kirkpatrick, Geoff Gustafson, Karen Holness, Dylan Schmid', 'PG', 'After getting fired from his job, a slick, fast-talking businessman is thrown into an elf competition to become Santa¹s next second-in-command. Put through a series of rigorous training exercises to prepare for the contest, The Miz and another aspiring elf go head-to-head in the hopes of becoming Santa¹s Little Helper.', 'After getting fired from his job, a slick, fast-talking businessman is thrown into an elf competition to become Santa¹s next second-in-command. Put through a series of rigorous training exercises to prepare for the contest, The Miz and another aspiring elf go head-to-head in the hopes of becoming Santa¹s Little Helper.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dtycBCVRO4elSb0umqJm8PTXIla.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:353609'),
  ('1126712587836403994', 'Santa''s Little Helpers', 2019, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Adventure', 'Simorre Kevin, Derek Drymon, Bruno Chauffard', 'David Feiss', 'Pierre Coffin, Carlos Alazraqui, Brian T. Delaney, Raymond S. Persi, Tara Strong', null, 'After being accidentally stranded at the North Pole, the Minions decide to embrace their new surroundings by taking on the role of Santa''s helpers. Chaos and hilarity ensue as they attempt to prove their worth as elves, bringing their signature mischief to the workshop in this festive, lighthearted holiday adventure.', 'After being accidentally stranded at the North Pole, the Minions decide to embrace their new surroundings by taking on the role of Santa''s helpers. Chaos and hilarity ensue as they attempt to prove their worth as elves, bringing their signature mischief to the workshop in this festive, lighthearted holiday adventure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7lPl9jxnLyqSgxxvDUDCj601ex8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:579524'),
  ('502364130057060636', 'Santa''s Slay', 2005, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Horror', 'David Steiman, Matthew F. Leonetti', 'David Steiman', 'Bill Goldberg, Douglas Smith, Emilie de Ravin, Robert Culp, Dave Thomas, Saul Rubinek, Rebecca Gayheart, Chris Kattan', 'R', 'Santa Claus is actually a demon who lost a bet with an angel, so he became the giver of toys and happiness. But this year the bet is off, and Santa is about to return to his evil ways.', 'Santa Claus is actually a demon who lost a bet with an angel, so he became the giver of toys and happiness. But this year the bet is off, and Santa is about to return to his evil ways.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sdd0TRVpMjAViiBPq0oufYOHg0m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12591'),
  ('976604257727993149', 'Santa''s Workshop', 1932, 'Animation, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Wilfred Jackson', null, 'Pinto Colvig, Allan Watson, Delos Jewkes, Walt Disney, Harriette Haddon', 'G', 'Santa''s little helpers must hurry to finish the toys before Christmas Day.', 'Santa''s little helpers must hurry to finish the toys before Christmas Day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/21eoNIxYWj63hHWoXkzreQCWOnx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67167'),
  ('838757658453637550', 'Santana', 2020, 'Action', 'Trevor Michael Brown, Jean Bellingan, Tony McLeod', 'Chris Roland, Maradona Dias Dos Santos', 'Paulo Americano, Raúl Rosário, David O''Hara, Rapulana Seiphemo, Hakeem Kae-Kazim, Tamer Burjaq, Nompilo Gwala, Neide Vieira', null, 'Two brothers — one a narcotics agent and the other a general — finally discover the identity of the drug lord who murdered their parents decades ago. They may kill each other before capturing the bad guys.', 'Two brothers — one a narcotics agent and the other a general — finally discover the identity of the drug lord who murdered their parents decades ago. They may kill each other before capturing the bad guys.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Rj8l6gElLpRL7Kj17iZhrT5Zuw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:734309'),
  ('576286956071498462', 'Santee', 1973, 'Drama, Action, Western', 'Gary Nelson, Donald M. Morgan', 'Brand Bell, Thomas W. Blackburn', 'Glenn Ford, Michael Burns, Dana Wynter, Jay Silverheels, Harry Townes, John Larch, Robert J. Wilke, Robert Donner', 'PG', 'Jody Deakes joins up with his father after many years, just to discover that his dad is part of an outlaw gang on the run from a relentless bounty hunter named Santee. Jody is orphaned soon after Santee catches up to the gang, and follows Santee in hopes of taking vengeance for his father''s death. Instead, however, Jody discovers that Santee is a good and loving man, tormented by the death of his young son at the hands of another outlaw gang. Santee and his wife take Jody in and a father and son relationship begins to grow. Then the gang that shot Santee''s son shows up. The film was produced by Edward Platt of Get Smart fame. It was one of the first motion pictures to be shot electronically on videotape and then transferred to film.', 'Jody Deakes joins up with his father after many years, just to discover that his dad is part of an outlaw gang on the run from a relentless bounty hunter named Santee. Jody is orphaned soon after Santee catches up to the gang, and follows Santee in hopes of taking vengeance for his father''s death. Instead, however, Jody discovers that Santee is a good and loving man, tormented by the death of his young son at the hands of another outlaw gang. Santee and his wife take Jody in and a father and son relationship begins to grow. Then the gang that shot Santee''s son shows up. The film was produced by Edward Platt of Get Smart fame. It was one of the first motion pictures to be shot electronically on videotape and then transferred to film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fX8x0AU5CzpLuPWkwhN6LC2v0lz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94561'),
  ('442949990318997734', 'Santiago', 2007, 'Documentary', 'João Moreira Salles, Walter Carvalho', 'João Moreira Salles', 'Santiago Badariotti Merlo', null, 'Documentary about Santiago, a peculiar man who used to work for the director and his parents as a butler. The material was filmed in 1992 but, for some strange reason, the director felt he couldn''t edit it and put it aside. In 2005 he remembers the unfinished film and starts its edition.', 'Documentary about Santiago, a peculiar man who used to work for the director and his parents as a butler. The material was filmed in 1992 but, for some strange reason, the director felt he couldn''t edit it and put it aside. In 2005 he remembers the unfinished film and starts its edition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rV8XDFk3sJ59l341YOV44Iw3KdM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86324'),
  ('353467791096182035', 'Santiago, Italia', 2018, 'Documentary', 'Maura Morales Bergmann, Nanni Moretti', 'Nanni Moretti', 'Nanni Moretti, Patricio Guzmán, Carmen Castillo, Miguel Littín, Alejandra Matus, Salvador Allende, Carmen Hertz, Augusto Pinochet', null, 'After the coup d''État of the Democratic government of Allende, the embassy of Italy in Santiago played a major role in helping the opposers of the regime, and extradited many of them to Italy.', 'After the coup d''État of the Democratic government of Allende, the embassy of Italy in Santiago played a major role in helping the opposers of the regime, and extradited many of them to Italy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kjSnXFg4FxMrLFq4lY5smvUjgFb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:561318'),
  ('321439552042569699', 'Santo and Blue Demon Against the Monsters', 1970, 'Action, Science Fiction, Horror', 'Gilberto Martínez Solares, Raúl Martínez Solares', 'Rafael García Travesí, Jesús Sotomayor Martínez', 'El Santo, Blue Demon, Jorge Rado, Carlos Ancira, Hedi Blue, Carlos Suárez, Adalberto Martínez, Santanón', null, 'Bruno Halder a sinister scientist seeking revenge against his brother and niece is resurrected by Waldo his faithful sidekick. Besides his minions of zombies Halder enlists the help of Wolfman, Franquestain, a Vampire, a Mummy and a Cyclops. Once again the survival of mankind is put in the hands of Santo', 'Bruno Halder a sinister scientist seeking revenge against his brother and niece is resurrected by Waldo his faithful sidekick. Besides his minions of zombies Halder enlists the help of Wolfman, Franquestain, a Vampire, a Mummy and a Cyclops. Once again the survival of mankind is put in the hands of Santo', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jyi1RVKJ7iAlbVHnzaBfspxWv6P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62925'),
  ('692082520999570118', 'Santo and Blue Demon vs. Dr. Frankenstein', 1974, 'Horror, Action', 'Rosalío Solano, Miguel M. Delgado', 'Francisco Cavazos', 'El Santo, Blue Demon, Sasha Montenegro, Jorge Russek, Ivonne Govea, Rubén Aguirre, Jorge Casanova, Carlos Suárez', null, 'Innocent women are being kidnapped and used as guinea pigs for a brain transplant experiment. The diabolical Dr. Frankenstein continues his quest to perfect his brain transplant operation to bring back his deceased wife at any cost - even if it means playing with the lives of others. El Santo and Blue Demon are called in to help when their friend Alicia becomes Dr. Frankenstein''s next target. It''ll take both heroes to go up against the dastardly doctor and go mano a mano with his super strong zombie Golem.', 'Innocent women are being kidnapped and used as guinea pigs for a brain transplant experiment. The diabolical Dr. Frankenstein continues his quest to perfect his brain transplant operation to bring back his deceased wife at any cost - even if it means playing with the lives of others. El Santo and Blue Demon are called in to help when their friend Alicia becomes Dr. Frankenstein''s next target. It''ll take both heroes to go up against the dastardly doctor and go mano a mano with his super strong zombie Golem.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v7GlN5Zt8JUlq0RekDzkcKbiHNk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3214'),
  ('886110195767840223', 'Santo and Blue Demon vs. Dracula and the Wolf Man', 1973, 'Action, Adventure, Horror', 'Miguel M. Delgado, Rosalío Solano', 'Alfredo Salazar', 'El Santo, Blue Demon, Aldo Monti, Agustín Martínez Solares, Nubia Martí, María Eugenia San Martín, Alfredo Wally Barrón, Jorge Mondragón', null, 'After facing defeat at the hands of Cristaldi the magician, Dracula is back to seek revenge and rule the world. With the help of Wolfman and his legion of followers, victory seems eminent. Professor Cristaldi, a descendant of the magician, is warned about Dracula''s plans and calls upon El Santo and Blue Demon in the hopes that they can put the infamous Count and the werewolf down for good.', 'After facing defeat at the hands of Cristaldi the magician, Dracula is back to seek revenge and rule the world. With the help of Wolfman and his legion of followers, victory seems eminent. Professor Cristaldi, a descendant of the magician, is warned about Dracula''s plans and calls upon El Santo and Blue Demon in the hopes that they can put the infamous Count and the werewolf down for good.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7MLtLEF5Mei2ybyTVeJD5iIHvZD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55729'),
  ('503237796853988574', 'Santo and the Golden Eagle', 1973, 'Drama, Action, Mystery', 'Alfredo B. Crevenna', 'Luis Quintanilla Rico, Raúl Portillo', 'El Santo, Irma Serrano, Dacia González, Jorge Lavat, Juan Gallardo, Soledad Acosta, Carlos Suárez, Fernando Osés', null, 'The rich landowner La Tigresa suffers several attacks and seeks help from Santo. The attacks continue but Santo protects and she falls for him.', 'The rich landowner La Tigresa suffers several attacks and seeks help from Santo. The attacks continue but Santo protects and she falls for him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Opd5cqvd3Mg5EEfNZZffUqOhPh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:165436'),
  ('156027729102127838', 'Santo in the Hotel of Death', 1963, 'Action, Horror, Thriller', 'Federico Curiel', 'Antonio Orellana, Federico Curiel, Fernando Osés', 'El Santo, Fernando Casanova, Ana Bertha Lepe, Roberto Ramírez Garza, Alfredo Wally Barrón, Luis Aragón, Alejandro Parodi, Augusto Benedico', null, 'Tourists visiting the pyramids in Mexico experience a string of deaths and disappearances while staying at a nearby hotel. Police investigators Fernando and Cornado are assigned to the case and attempt to solve the mystery with the help of reporter (and girlfriend of Fernando) Veronica and the wrestler Santo.', 'Tourists visiting the pyramids in Mexico experience a string of deaths and disappearances while staying at a nearby hotel. Police investigators Fernando and Cornado are assigned to the case and attempt to solve the mystery with the help of reporter (and girlfriend of Fernando) Veronica and the wrestler Santo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f1wS2d687oX7ngfy70RqAsypqxh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62914'),
  ('884050355976362713', 'Santo in the Treasure of Dracula', 1969, 'Action, Horror, Science Fiction', 'René Cardona, Raúl Martínez Solares', null, 'El Santo, Aldo Monti, Noelia Noel, Roberto G. Rivera, Carlos Agostí, Alberto Rojas, Pili González, Jorge Mondragón', null, 'A woman travels to her past life with the help of Santo''s past life regression machine', 'A woman travels to her past life with the help of Santo''s past life regression machine', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5oZ8UY4o182FJIh21QRdaIFQMVk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92729'),
  ('488084954646921732', 'Santo in the Vengeance of the Mummy', 1971, 'Action, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Raúl Martínez Solares, René Cardona', 'Alfredo Salazar', 'El Santo, Eric del Castillo, Mary Montiel, César del Campo, Carlos Ancira, Carlos Suárez, Alejandro Reyna, Alma Rojo', null, 'When Santo accompanies a troupe of archaeologists in the search for Aztec artifacts, they find the Mummy of an Aztec who leaves a warning to those who tamper with his resting place. The adventurers ignore the warning, and before long, the Mummy starts bumping them off one-by-one with his bow & arrow.', 'When Santo accompanies a troupe of archaeologists in the search for Aztec artifacts, they find the Mummy of an Aztec who leaves a warning to those who tamper with his resting place. The adventurers ignore the warning, and before long, the Mummy starts bumping them off one-by-one with his bow & arrow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4I4HhlQovOrX5EEDBP1b2aN71L4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55732'),
  ('246485595547312317', 'Santo in the Wax Museum', 1963, 'Science Fiction, Action, Horror', 'Alfonso Corona Blake, Manuel San Fernando', 'Alfonso Corona Blake', 'El Santo, Norma Mora, Rubén Rojo, Roxana Bellini, Claudio Brook, José Luis Jiménez, Víctor Velázquez, Jorge Mondragón', null, 'El Santo, the masked Mexican wrestler, investigates a series of kidnappings. He discovers that the mysterious Doctor Caroll is using the victims as part of his experiments to develop an army of monsters. Naturally, El Santo is able to overcome them all - with wrestling!', 'El Santo, the masked Mexican wrestler, investigates a series of kidnappings. He discovers that the mysterious Doctor Caroll is using the victims as part of his experiments to develop an army of monsters. Naturally, El Santo is able to overcome them all - with wrestling!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hnkfclZpys1B3IHr9taiNkS7eNz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62915'),
  ('441128691444842508', 'Santo vs. Capulina', 1969, 'Comedy, Action', 'René Cardona', 'Alfredo Zacarías', 'El Santo, Gaspar Henaine, Liza Castro, Crox Alvarado, Carlos Agostí, Miguel Gómez Checa, Nathanael León, Mario García ''Harapos''', null, 'Calpuina is a night-watchman in a wharehouse, a perfect job for him. When some thieves break in and steal some crates, El Santo is after them because they are using the wharehouse for diamond smuggling. Capulina hinders their capture. Then he decides that he will put on a wrestler''s mask and help El Santo to caputre the crooks.', 'Calpuina is a night-watchman in a wharehouse, a perfect job for him. When some thieves break in and steal some crates, El Santo is after them because they are using the wharehouse for diamond smuggling. Capulina hinders their capture. Then he decides that he will put on a wrestler''s mask and help El Santo to caputre the crooks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mc2sOEYI9OMl3MkepwwRssjHp6j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:276174'),
  ('582126941247546439', 'Santo vs. Doctor Death', 1973, 'Science Fiction, Action, Adventure, Horror', 'Rafael Romero Marchent, Godofredo Pacheco, Mariano Canales', 'José Luis Navarro, Rafael Romero Marchent', 'El Santo, Carlos Romero Marchent, Helga Liné, George Rigaud, Antonio Pica, Mirta Miller, Maribel Hidalgo, Frank Braña', null, 'Masked Mexican wrestler and superhero Santo plays private investigator, called in by government officials to investigate the mysterious vandalism of a high profile painting. With the help of his two counterparts, he uncovers the truth behind an art collector/chemist who may be murdering female models.', 'Masked Mexican wrestler and superhero Santo plays private investigator, called in by government officials to investigate the mysterious vandalism of a high profile painting. With the help of his two counterparts, he uncovers the truth behind an art collector/chemist who may be murdering female models.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eieRG983KAtQRRPMtqExUeqidTz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:213041'),
  ('925693977864020412', 'Santo vs. Evil Brain', 1961, 'Action, Crime, Adventure', 'Joselito Rodríguez', 'Fernando Osés, Enrique Zambrano', 'Joaquín Cordero, Norma Suárez, El Santo, Fernando Osés, Alberto S. Insúa, Enrique Zambrano, Juanito Tremble, Enrique Almirante', null, 'In his first film El Santo was still referred to as ‘El Enmascarado’. Rendered compliant by a scientist and his gangsters via a serum and mysterious rays, he is forced for the opening act to be a henchman for the evil forces who want to take over the world. The film has great historic value, due also to its impressive exterior shots of pre-revolutionary Cuba 1959.', 'In his first film El Santo was still referred to as ‘El Enmascarado’. Rendered compliant by a scientist and his gangsters via a serum and mysterious rays, he is forced for the opening act to be a henchman for the evil forces who want to take over the world. The film has great historic value, due also to its impressive exterior shots of pre-revolutionary Cuba 1959.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1TIJ8Zqv1F5MVMYE7wTd64CCLyx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:240186'),
  ('95061689517905991', 'Santo vs. Frankenstein''s Daughter', 1972, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Raúl Martínez Solares, Miguel M. Delgado, Gustavo César Carrión', null, 'El Santo, Gina Romand, Anel, Roberto Cañedo, Sonia Fuentes, Carlos Suárez, Gerardo Zepeda, Carlos Agostí', null, 'Dr. Frankenstein and her assistant, Dr. Yanco, are going to bring one of their experiments to life in Santo Vs. Frankenstein''s Daughter. She intends to use a monster named Ursus to do her evil bidding. Using a youth serum to retain their vitality, the doctors set their sights upon none other than El Santo. They need his super human blood to regenerate a stronger youth serum. They kidnap Santo''s goddaughter, Norma and lure him into Dr. Frankenstein''s lab where he is captured and enslaved. Will Santo make it out alive?', 'Dr. Frankenstein and her assistant, Dr. Yanco, are going to bring one of their experiments to life in Santo Vs. Frankenstein''s Daughter. She intends to use a monster named Ursus to do her evil bidding. Using a youth serum to retain their vitality, the doctors set their sights upon none other than El Santo. They need his super human blood to regenerate a stronger youth serum. They kidnap Santo''s goddaughter, Norma and lure him into Dr. Frankenstein''s lab where he is captured and enslaved. Will Santo make it out alive?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uGwTcVuz8TDJdkHncmz9ebzE64o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3205'),
  ('1013847055509287482', 'Santo vs. Infernal Men', 1961, 'Action, Adventure, Mystery', 'Joselito Rodríguez', null, 'Joaquín Cordero, Jorge Marx, El Santo, Gina Romand, Fernando Osés, Enrique Zambrano', null, 'Agent Joaquin recalls his latest mission while lying wounded in an ambulance: Joaquin has infiltrated into a band of smugglers. When the villains learn the truth about him, they kidnap Jouqin''s fiancee. Santo comes to her rescue and fights the band.', 'Agent Joaquin recalls his latest mission while lying wounded in an ambulance: Joaquin has infiltrated into a band of smugglers. When the villains learn the truth about him, they kidnap Jouqin''s fiancee. Santo comes to her rescue and fights the band.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pjd7UAomKs4Zci8GYDyZK0UuV4B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62909'),
  ('761894633551179933', 'Santo vs. the Diabolical Brain', 1963, 'Action, Adventure, Mystery', 'Federico Curiel, Fernando Colín', 'Federico Curiel, Fernando Osés, Antonio Orellana', 'El Santo, Ana Bertha Lepe, Roberto Ramírez Garza, Celia Viveros, Fernando Casanova', null, 'Investigators Conrado and Fernando take a leave of the absence from the police force to track down Fernando''s girlfriend Virginia. Virginia, a reporter, has left town and is working undercover as a barmaid in order to interview Refugio Canales, a criminal and small town municipal president. Conrado and Fernando soon call their friend Santo for help.', 'Investigators Conrado and Fernando take a leave of the absence from the police force to track down Fernando''s girlfriend Virginia. Virginia, a reporter, has left town and is working undercover as a barmaid in order to interview Refugio Canales, a criminal and small town municipal president. Conrado and Fernando soon call their friend Santo for help.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rIbTRrkcR8uUSO477Dxo134YJC0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:241076'),
  ('1082384152166152977', 'Santo vs. the King of Crime', 1962, 'Action, Drama', 'Federico Curiel, Alberto Mariscal, Fernando Colín', 'Federico Curiel', 'El Santo, Fernando Casanova, Ana Bertha Lepe, Begoña Palacios, Roberto Ramírez Garza, René Cardona, Yolanda Ciani, Augusto Benedico', null, 'El Santo and his loyal friends will try to disarm a dangerous criminal organization.', 'El Santo and his loyal friends will try to disarm a dangerous criminal organization.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uByv0vEFiR6XybHguMjQ8wYXuA3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:241919'),
  ('978536198472247385', 'Santo vs. the Martian Invasion', 1967, 'Action, Science Fiction', 'Alfredo B. Crevenna, Jorge Stahl Jr.', 'Rafael García Travesí', 'El Santo, Wolf Ruvinskis, Ignacio Gómez "El Nazi", Beny Galán, Ham Lee, Eduardo Bonada, Antonio Montoro, Maura Monti', null, 'In this Mexican sci-fi fantasy, big beefy Martians invade the earth. Ostensibly, they have come to warn people about the dangers of nuclear testing and exploring space, but their real mission becomes manifest when they begin using their special powers and gadgets to exploit weak earthlings.', 'In this Mexican sci-fi fantasy, big beefy Martians invade the earth. Ostensibly, they have come to warn people about the dangers of nuclear testing and exploring space, but their real mission becomes manifest when they begin using their special powers and gadgets to exploit weak earthlings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qUjR8YUmnuFozJG2uru3v3nq9Tw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80766'),
  ('758079277490507212', 'Santo vs. the Riders of Terror', 1970, 'Horror, Western', 'René Cardona, Raúl Martínez Solares', 'René Cardona, Jesús "Murciélago" Velázquez', 'El Santo, Armando Silvestre, Julio Aldama, Mary Montiel, Gregorio Casal, Ivonne Govea, Carlos Agostí, Carlos Suárez', null, 'After a group of violent lepers escapes from a sanitarium, - robbing several farms, residents of the town demand the the sheriff - take action. Meanwhile, a local criminal joins forces with the lepers - to commit even more robberies. As the disfigured madmen keep the - entire town indoors with its reign of terror, the sheriff has no - choice but to call on the only man who can help--legendary wrestling - superhero, Santo!', 'After a group of violent lepers escapes from a sanitarium, - robbing several farms, residents of the town demand the the sheriff - take action. Meanwhile, a local criminal joins forces with the lepers - to commit even more robberies. As the disfigured madmen keep the - entire town indoors with its reign of terror, the sheriff has no - choice but to call on the only man who can help--legendary wrestling - superhero, Santo!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jOPLwxVVTJq1q8nIb2aJUAKDExp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92731'),
