  ('766601992334356583', 'Santo vs. the Vampire Women', 1962, 'Action, Horror, Fantasy', 'Alfonso Corona Blake, Ignacio Villareal, José Ortiz Ramos', 'Humberto Gavaldón', 'El Santo, Lorena Velázquez, María Duval, Jaime Fernández, Augusto Benedico, Ofelia Montesco, Xavier Loyá, Fernando Osés', 'NR', 'A professor recruits a professional wrestler to protect his daughter from vampires intent on kidnapping her and marrying her to the devil.', 'A professor recruits a professional wrestler to protect his daughter from vampires intent on kidnapping her and marrying her to the devil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oPD8OgrIix57GY7xrOfH4XqxMXy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29871'),
  ('1039746194562105692', 'Santo vs. the Zombies', 1962, 'Horror, Action, Adventure, Mystery', 'José Ortiz Ramos, Benito Alazraki', null, 'El Santo, Lorena Velázquez, Armando Silvestre, Jaime Fernández, Dagoberto Rodríguez, Irma Serrano, Carlos Agostí, Ramón Bugarini', null, 'Masked luchador "Santo" fights against an evil doctor and his zombie army.', 'Masked luchador "Santo" fights against an evil doctor and his zombie army.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/icll8dHL44zP7LXR2BeATtnZ4LW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:240992'),
  ('692830809030615195', 'Santocielo', 2023, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Francesco Amato, Gherardo Gossi, Pietro Ragazzini', 'Valentino Picone, Salvatore Ficarra, Fabrizio Testini', 'Salvatore Ficarra, Valentino Picone, Barbara Ronchi, Maria Chiara Giannetta, Giovanni Storti, Carlo Luca De Ruggieri, Raffaele Braia, Carmelo Caccamo', null, 'In paradise, a group gathers to discuss why people still act selfishly, even though Jesus sacrificed himself for them 2,000 years ago. As a result, a new Messiah is sent to Earth to address the issue.', 'In paradise, a group gathers to discuss why people still act selfishly, even though Jesus sacrificed himself for them 2,000 years ago. As a result, a new Messiah is sent to Earth to address the issue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bY2FNkToXzo63VfNV0kqBucQfTh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1128668'),
  ('602386960516254646', 'Santos Peregrinos', 2004, 'Comedy', 'Ignacio Prieto, Juan Carlos Carrasco', 'Juan Carlos Carrasco', 'Adal Ramones, Luis Gerardo Méndez, Ernesto Gómez Cruz, Francesca Guillén, Julieta Egurrola, Isaura Espinoza, Paloma Woolrich, Moisés Iván Mora', null, 'When greed comes calling, say goodbye to saintliness. An irresistible comedy about what happens when the residents of a Mexico City apartment building discover that three religious figurines passed down through the decades from Emiliano Zapata are full of solid gold. Tempers fly, libidos flare and no one emerges unscathed, including viewers overcome by a heavenly dose of hilarity in Santos Peregrinos.', 'When greed comes calling, say goodbye to saintliness. An irresistible comedy about what happens when the residents of a Mexico City apartment building discover that three religious figurines passed down through the decades from Emiliano Zapata are full of solid gold. Tempers fly, libidos flare and no one emerges unscathed, including viewers overcome by a heavenly dose of hilarity in Santos Peregrinos.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kvHz4b20ZQRr6ciOHjtHsTQFKY3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73625'),
  ('395011220978570018', 'Santosh', 2024, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Sandhya Suri, Sreyosi Das, Suvendu Dhauri', 'Sandhya Suri', 'Shahana Goswami, Sunita Rajwar, Naval Shukla, Sanjay Bishnoi, Shashi Beniwal, Prashant Kumar, Pratibha Awasthi, Manjul Azad', 'R', 'A government scheme sees newly widowed Santosh inherit her husband’s job as a police constable in the rural badlands of Northern India. When a low-caste girl is found raped and murdered, she is pulled into the investigation under the wing of charismatic feminist inspector Sharma.', 'A government scheme sees newly widowed Santosh inherit her husband’s job as a police constable in the rural badlands of Northern India. When a low-caste girl is found raped and murdered, she is pulled into the investigation under the wing of charismatic feminist inspector Sharma.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fMx9y9DyjhDyKxjSiDvYKcpRnnk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1233208'),
  ('489800211358178761', 'Santosh Subramaniam', 2008, 'Comedy, Romance, Family', 'Mohan Raja, D. Kannan', 'Mohan Raja', 'Ravi Mohan, Genelia D''Souza, Prakash Raj, Sayaji Shinde, Geetha, Santhanam, Premji Amaran, Srinath', null, 'Remake of Bommarillu (2006) Telugu film. Santosh''s life is dictated by his father, who decides everything for him. However, when Santosh falls in love with a girl, he struggles to convince his father to let him marry his girlfriend.', 'Remake of Bommarillu (2006) Telugu film. Santosh''s life is dictated by his father, who decides everything for him. However, when Santosh falls in love with a girl, he struggles to convince his father to let him marry his girlfriend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/op0ojhYFdF78oEJSVVe0exjJQvX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63813'),
  ('669669699947543316', 'São Paulo, Incorporated', 1965, 'Drama', 'Luiz Sérgio Person, Pedro Carlos Rovai, Ricardo Aronovich', 'Luiz Sérgio Person', 'Walmor Chagas, Eva Wilma, Ana Esmeralda, Otelo Zeloni, Darlene Glória, Nadir Fernandes, Osmano Cardoso, Sílvio Rocha', null, 'Carlos is a young man from the São Paulo middle class who works for a big company during a time when foreign automobile industries were settling in Brazil. Shortly after, he accepts a job at a factory that makes automobile parts, where he becomes manager. To a certain extent, he is a family man who works hard, earns well and lives unsatisfied. Without any prospects in his life to change the condition he rejects, his last resort is escaping.', 'Carlos is a young man from the São Paulo middle class who works for a big company during a time when foreign automobile industries were settling in Brazil. Shortly after, he accepts a job at a factory that makes automobile parts, where he becomes manager. To a certain extent, he is a family man who works hard, earns well and lives unsatisfied. Without any prospects in his life to change the condition he rejects, his last resort is escaping.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a2MdFCk56YBS423it1U7HWuxnjT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74360'),
  ('885461552795767290', 'Sapoot', 1996, 'Action, Crime', 'Jagdish A. Sharma', null, 'Akshay Kumar, Suniel Shetty, Karisma Kapoor, Sonali Bendre, Kiran Kumar, Mukesh Rishi, Prem Chopra, Kader Khan', null, 'Singhania big hearten Don who does not like to trade in drugs and other illegal business which does not go well with his rivals Dhaneshwar and Tejeshwar.Singhania''s older son Raj is taking care of his business,While is younger son Prem is a Casanova.Dhaneshwar is killed by Singhania when he attacks on Raj.Kantiilal and Samsher trusted aide of Singhania''s betray him and he gets killed by them and Tejeshwar.', 'Singhania big hearten Don who does not like to trade in drugs and other illegal business which does not go well with his rivals Dhaneshwar and Tejeshwar.Singhania''s older son Raj is taking care of his business,While is younger son Prem is a Casanova.Dhaneshwar is killed by Singhania when he attacks on Raj.Kantiilal and Samsher trusted aide of Singhania''s betray him and he gets killed by them and Tejeshwar.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8ray62qezaV4G5sdMrGBR93l5i1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:305899'),
  ('598184637913510223', 'Sapovnela', 1959, 'Documentary, Music', 'Otar Iosseliani', 'I. Khutsishvili', 'Mikheil Mamulashvili', null, 'Amidst the hills of the ancient city of Mtskheta, an aging man nearing his hundredth year is forced to make way for a new road being paved through the blossoming garden of floral delights that he loves and cares for.', 'Amidst the hills of the ancient city of Mtskheta, an aging man nearing his hundredth year is forced to make way for a new road being paved through the blossoming garden of floral delights that he loves and cares for.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l5glC5CosDm61pkzXp5qmg3ou4Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:216730'),
  ('473239396590243968', 'Sapphire', 1959, 'Mystery, Crime, Thriller', 'Basil Dearden, Harry Waxman, David W. Orton', 'Janet Green', 'Nigel Patrick, Michael Craig, Yvonne Mitchell, Paul Massie, Bernard Miles, Olga Lindo, Earl Cameron, Gordon Heath', 'NR', 'Two Scotland Yard detectives investigate the murder of a young woman of mixed race who had been passing for white. As they interview a spate of suspects -- including the girl''s white boyfriend and his disapproving parents -- the detectives wade through a stubbornly entrenched sludge of racism and bigotry.', 'Two Scotland Yard detectives investigate the murder of a young woman of mixed race who had been passing for white. As they interview a spate of suspects -- including the girl''s white boyfriend and his disapproving parents -- the detectives wade through a stubbornly entrenched sludge of racism and bigotry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hwfJUilhZ6iSuosizjpLYNaFfgV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64291'),
  ('40972710729877680', 'Sapphire Blue', 2014, 'Fantasy, Romance, Drama', 'Felix Fuchssteiner, Katharina Schöde, Sonja Rom', 'Katharina Schöde', 'Maria Ehrich, Jannis Niewöhner, Josefine Preuß, Florian Bartholomäi, Peter Simonischek, Rolf Kanies, Rufus Beck, Laura Berlin', null, 'Gwen has just discovered, that she''s the final member of the secret time-traveling Circle of Twelve. Now she has to juggle with constant trips to the past, her relationships with Gideon and figuring out dark secrets surrounding the Circle.', 'Gwen has just discovered, that she''s the final member of the secret time-traveling Circle of Twelve. Now she has to juggle with constant trips to the past, her relationships with Gideon and figuring out dark secrets surrounding the Circle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kxRqokSkj6HWuwVCbnddPFg73CM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:279229'),
  ('569483003706577170', 'Sappho', 2008, 'Drama, Romance', 'Robert Crombie, Baghir Rafiyev', 'Robert Crombie', 'Avalon Barrie, Todd Soley, Lyudmila Shiryaeva, Bohdan Stupka, Elissaios Vlachos, Vassilis Psychogiopoulos, Oksana Osipova, Sergey Kosenko', 'R', 'On honeymoon on the island of Lesbos, a woman falls for the daughter of a Russian archaeologist.', 'On honeymoon on the island of Lesbos, a woman falls for the daughter of a Russian archaeologist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bR6qld7NylpyKxfs1w8qdL0o2Wa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27283'),
  ('426737239805769633', 'Saps at Sea', 1940, 'Comedy', 'Gordon Douglas', 'Charley Rogers, Felix Adler', 'Stan Laurel, Oliver Hardy, James Finlayson, Richard Cramer, Ben Turpin, Harry Bernard, Eddie Conrad, Charlie Hall', 'G', 'Stan and Ollie work in a horn factory. Ollie starts having violent fits every time he hears a horn. His doctor prescribes a restful sea voyage. Mayhem ensues.', 'Stan and Ollie work in a horn factory. Ollie starts having violent fits every time he hears a horn. His doctor prescribes a restful sea voyage. Mayhem ensues.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6CScczIA4WRnTOxYgMgsdNRvXSL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46260'),
  ('869825135122711823', 'Sapta Sagaradaache Ello – Side A', 2023, 'Romance, Drama', 'Hemanth M. Rao, Gundu Shetty', 'Hemanth M. Rao, Gundu Shetty', 'Rakshit Shetty, Rukmini Vasanth, Sharath Lohitashwa, Ramesh Indira, Pavitra Lokesh, Achyuth Kumar, Avinash, Gopalkrishna Deshpande', null, 'In the heart of ''Sapta Sagaradaache Ello’ resides an ardent love story between Manu and Priya. Set in 2010, the couple hails from a middle-class background. Circumstances land Manu in jail, putting his relationship with Priya in jeopardy.', 'In the heart of ''Sapta Sagaradaache Ello’ resides an ardent love story between Manu and Priya. Set in 2010, the couple hails from a middle-class background. Circumstances land Manu in jail, putting his relationship with Priya in jeopardy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qjvSMN5dhSh7cymjj6if2aJ4ejW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1168104'),
  ('209489379049814754', 'Sara', 1997, 'Action, Romance', 'Maciej Ślesicki', 'Maciej Ślesicki', 'Bogusław Linda, Agnieszka Włodarczyk, Cezary Pazura, Marek Perepeczko, Stanisław Brudny, Sławomir Sulej, Dorota Bierkowska, Hans-Joachim Recknitz', null, 'Sixteen-year-old Sara''s father is a wealthy gangster and has a lot of enemies. Her father makes clear that whoever touches Sara will die and he looks for the right bodyguard to protect her.', 'Sixteen-year-old Sara''s father is a wealthy gangster and has a lot of enemies. Her father makes clear that whoever touches Sara will die and he looks for the right bodyguard to protect her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1ynxFhdoqI1bh1VaZsyMb705ZfQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61999'),
  ('251900903807777114', 'Sara''s Notebook', 2018, 'Thriller', 'Norberto López Amado', 'Jorge Guerricaechevarría', 'Belén Rueda, Marian Álvarez, Manolo Cardona, Iván Mendes, Marta Belaustegui, Enrico Lo Verso, Florin Opritescu, Nick Devlin', null, 'Laura has spent years looking for her sister Sara who went missing in the depths of the jungle in the Congo. Neither the NGO she works for, nor the embassy, have news on her whereabouts until a photo appears of Sara in a mining town. Apparently, Sara is being held captive by The Hawk, the fearsome rebel leader who controls the mafias behind the prized mineral coltan.', 'Laura has spent years looking for her sister Sara who went missing in the depths of the jungle in the Congo. Neither the NGO she works for, nor the embassy, have news on her whereabouts until a photo appears of Sara in a mining town. Apparently, Sara is being held captive by The Hawk, the fearsome rebel leader who controls the mafias behind the prized mineral coltan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m9FODCCEse9e32sqso14Gpe1RZN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:449019'),
  ('1020847033719802912', 'Saraband', 2003, 'TV Movie, Drama', 'Ingmar Bergman, Stefan Eriksson, Jesper Holmström', 'Ingmar Bergman', 'Liv Ullmann, Erland Josephson, Börje Ahlstedt, Julia Dufvenius, Gunnel Fred', 'R', 'Reuniting the characters of Johan and Marianne three decades after "Scenes from a Marriage," "Saraband" follows Marianne’s visit to her reclusive ex-husband, where she finds him locked in a destructive conflict with his troubled son Henrik and Henrik’s musically gifted daughter Karin. Told as an intimate chamber drama, the film explores love, resentment, forgiveness, and the inescapable pull of family bonds.', 'Reuniting the characters of Johan and Marianne three decades after "Scenes from a Marriage," "Saraband" follows Marianne’s visit to her reclusive ex-husband, where she finds him locked in a destructive conflict with his troubled son Henrik and Henrik’s musically gifted daughter Karin. Told as an intimate chamber drama, the film explores love, resentment, forgiveness, and the inescapable pull of family bonds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8Lt35scCMOh3HhnG81Ndc6dhazA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55650'),
  ('183292130632683772', 'Saraband for Dead Lovers', 1948, 'Romance, History, Drama', 'Basil Dearden, Douglas Slocombe', 'John Dighton, Alexander Mackendrick', 'Stewart Granger, Joan Greenwood, Flora Robson, Françoise Rosay, Frederick Valk, Peter Bull, Michael Gough, Megs Jenkins', 'NR', 'Sophie Dorothea is a young woman forced into a loveless marriage with Prince George Louis of Hanover. George Louis is later crowned King George I of England. Despairing of ever experiencing true love, the depressed queen finds life at court no solace. Sophie then falls for a dashing Swedish soldier of fortune, Count Konigsmark.', 'Sophie Dorothea is a young woman forced into a loveless marriage with Prince George Louis of Hanover. George Louis is later crowned King George I of England. Despairing of ever experiencing true love, the depressed queen finds life at court no solace. Sophie then falls for a dashing Swedish soldier of fortune, Count Konigsmark.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vDa6g1hQemvX3P6skVEnRkzc6HX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80216'),
  ('470070809547927058', 'Sarafina!', 1992, 'Music, Drama, Family', 'Darrell James Roodt, Mark Vicente, Graham Hickson', 'William Nicholson, Mbongeni Ngema', 'Leleti Khumalo, Whoopi Goldberg, John Kani, Miriam Makeba, Mary Twala, Dumisani Dlamini, Mbongeni Ngema, Tertius Meintjes', 'PG-13', 'The plot centers on students involved in the Soweto Riots, in opposition to the implementation of Afrikaans as the language of instruction in schools. The stage version presents a school uprising similar to the Soweto uprising on June 16, 1976. A narrator introduces several characters among them the school girl activist Sarafina. Things get out of control when a policeman shoots several pupils in a classroom. Nevertheless, the musical ends with a cheerful farewell show of pupils leaving school, which takes most of act two. In the movie version Sarafina feels shame at her mother''s (played by Miriam Makeba in the film) acceptance of her role as domestic servant in a white household in apartheid South Africa, and inspires her peers to rise up in protest, especially after her inspirational teacher, Mary Masombuka (played by Whoopi Goldberg in the film version) is imprisoned.', 'The plot centers on students involved in the Soweto Riots, in opposition to the implementation of Afrikaans as the language of instruction in schools. The stage version presents a school uprising similar to the Soweto uprising on June 16, 1976. A narrator introduces several characters among them the school girl activist Sarafina. Things get out of control when a policeman shoots several pupils in a classroom. Nevertheless, the musical ends with a cheerful farewell show of pupils leaving school, which takes most of act two. In the movie version Sarafina feels shame at her mother''s (played by Miriam Makeba in the film) acceptance of her role as domestic servant in a white household in apartheid South Africa, and inspires her peers to rise up in protest, especially after her inspirational teacher, Mary Masombuka (played by Whoopi Goldberg in the film version) is imprisoned.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i52368CunnMFEQIgPmGDKSPLcKx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35936'),
  ('457777963714496699', 'Sarah and Son', 1930, 'Drama', 'Dorothy Arzner, Charles Lang', 'Zoë Akins', 'Ruth Chatterton, Fredric March, Fuller Mellish Jr., Gilbert Emery, Doris Lloyd, William Stack, Philippe De Lacy, Edgar Norton', 'NR', 'A ne''er-do-well husband, after years of abusing his wife, disappears with their son, and winds up selling him to a wealthy family. Years later, the wife, now a world-famous opera singer, finally has enough time and money to begin a search for him.', 'A ne''er-do-well husband, after years of abusing his wife, disappears with their son, and winds up selling him to a wealthy family. Years later, the wife, now a world-famous opera singer, finally has enough time and money to begin a search for him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h2t22VvdVQlPxVhnEWjqoEDSyiZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104216'),
  ('201019682961910027', 'Sarah Cooper: Everything''s Fine', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Polly Morgan, Natasha Lyonne', 'Jasmine Pierce, Sarah Cooper, Jordan Black', 'Sarah Cooper, Winona Ryder, Aubrey Plaza, Marisa Tomei, Ben Stiller, Maya Rudolph, Helen Mirren, Jon Hamm', 'R', 'Comedian and Trump lip-synching sensation Sarah Cooper tackles politics, race and other light topics in a sketch special packed with celebrity guests.', 'Comedian and Trump lip-synching sensation Sarah Cooper tackles politics, race and other light topics in a sketch special packed with celebrity guests.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aV3ZOSTmT6sOyds092334USJgCQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:732359'),
  ('262100228803602452', 'Sarah Plays a Werewolf', 2017, 'Drama', 'Silvan Zürcher, Katharina Wyss, Armin Dierolf', 'Katharina Wyss, Josa Sesink', 'Loane Balthasar, Michel Voïta, Manuela Biedermann, Simon Bonvin, Sabine Timoteo, Annina Walt, Monica Budde, Arcadi Radeff', null, '17-year old Sarah, filled with adolescent angst, is an extreme person who in her rehearsals with a theatre group is transformed until she is almost in a trance, and her performances at home or elsewhere verge on excess. A cold, intellectual father, a timid mother, a younger sister and an older brother who has left home complete the picture: a silent time bomb.', '17-year old Sarah, filled with adolescent angst, is an extreme person who in her rehearsals with a theatre group is transformed until she is almost in a trance, and her performances at home or elsewhere verge on excess. A cold, intellectual father, a timid mother, a younger sister and an older brother who has left home complete the picture: a silent time bomb.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5iKWAcJz709psNINu0GVXdVD8lX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:472649'),
  ('622330778544694712', 'Sarah Prefers to Run', 2013, 'Drama', 'Chloé Robichaud, Jessica Lee Gagné', 'Chloé Robichaud', 'Sophie Desmarais, Jean-Sébastien Courchesne, Geneviève Boivin-Roussy, Hélène Florent, Micheline Lanctôt, Ève Duranceau, Pierre-Luc Lafontaine, Benoît Gouin', null, 'When Sarah has a chance to go to a first class university and to join its premiere athletic club, her suburban mother is fearful of the change and refuses to help financially. But Sarah''s roommate knows that they will get a grant if they marry. Sarah agrees but only to discover that her true heart lies elsewhere. Sarah prefers to run.', 'When Sarah has a chance to go to a first class university and to join its premiere athletic club, her suburban mother is fearful of the change and refuses to help financially. But Sarah''s roommate knows that they will get a grant if they marry. Sarah agrees but only to discover that her true heart lies elsewhere. Sarah prefers to run.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t2H08fxb0FSWRW3WwC70JFgq8xL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:186974'),
  ('309206959063026930', 'Sarah Silverman: A Speck of Dust', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Liam Lynch, Seamus Tierney', 'Sarah Silverman', 'Sarah Silverman', null, 'In her first comedy special post-health scare, Sarah Silverman shares a mix of fun facts, sad truths and yeah-she-just-went-there moments.', 'In her first comedy special post-health scare, Sarah Silverman shares a mix of fun facts, sad truths and yeah-she-just-went-there moments.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bvTyPBdS4tiJ4Nv2zPnT9kAjSoD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:459295'),
  ('323891630033690128', 'Sarah Silverman: Jesus Is Magic', 2005, 'Comedy', 'Liam Lynch, Rhet Bear', 'Sarah Silverman', 'Sarah Silverman, Steve Agee, Brian Posehn, Jim Bodma, Jon Cellini, Bob Odenkirk, David Derby, Suzannah Fagan', null, 'Sarah Silverman appears before an audience in Los Angeles with several sketches, taped outside the theater, intercut into the stand-up performance. Themes include race, sex, and religion. Her comic persona is a self-centered hipster, brash and clueless about her political incorrectness. A handful of musical numbers punctuate the performance.', 'Sarah Silverman appears before an audience in Los Angeles with several sketches, taped outside the theater, intercut into the stand-up performance. Themes include race, sex, and religion. Her comic persona is a self-centered hipster, brash and clueless about her political incorrectness. A handful of musical numbers punctuate the performance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uKuAGLz9eUWw3tnuXPRChpK7lYI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16156'),
  ('398183573037578307', 'Sarah Silverman: Someone You Love', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Jonathan Krisel, Rhet Bear', 'Sarah Silverman', 'Sarah Silverman, Grace Mathien, Colleen O''Hara, Jacob Spitzer, Mel Brooks', 'R', 'Emmy-winning comedian, actor, writer and producer Sarah Silverman returns in her second HBO comedy special. Filmed at The Wilbur Theatre in Boston, the show features the New England native showcasing her fearless chutzpah.', 'Emmy-winning comedian, actor, writer and producer Sarah Silverman returns in her second HBO comedy special. Filmed at The Wilbur Theatre in Boston, the show features the New England native showcasing her fearless chutzpah.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tDR5rQi3d6fzoAoh43Tsg4LlFGl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1127846'),
  ('1113192117968571903', 'Sarah T. - Portrait of a Teenage Alcoholic', 1975, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Richard Donner, Gayne Rescher, Murray Schwartz', 'Richard Alan Shapiro, Esther Shapiro', 'Linda Blair, Larry Hagman, Verna Bloom, William Daniels, Michael Lerner, Mark Hamill, M. Emmet Walsh, Eric Olson', null, 'Finding herself unable to cope with the divorce of her parents and the stress of daily life, 15-year-old Sarah Travis starts drinking in secret. At first, alcohol provides comfort and release. Then it sends her life spiraling out of control.', 'Finding herself unable to cope with the divorce of her parents and the stress of daily life, 15-year-old Sarah Travis starts drinking in secret. At first, alcohol provides comfort and release. Then it sends her life spiraling out of control.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tdjsxO65eVOUIcfEw8lnFCJzcKa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:111774'),
  ('155426193682708476', 'Sarah Winchester: Ghost Opera', 2016, 'Music, Horror', 'Bertrand Bonello, Ilan Cohen, Irina Lubtchansky', 'Bertrand Bonello', 'Reda Kateb, Marie-Agnès Gillot, Juliette Vial', null, 'An opera ballet that doesn''t exist. A ghost-like piece, played in Opera Bastille and danced at Opera Garnier. An almost mystical link between both scenes. A musician is testing sounds in Bastille''s pit. The choir are taking their place in the rehearsal studio. Both sides are fine tuning the work in progress of an opera ballet: Sarah Winchester, her grief, her madness, her home and her ghosts.', 'An opera ballet that doesn''t exist. A ghost-like piece, played in Opera Bastille and danced at Opera Garnier. An almost mystical link between both scenes. A musician is testing sounds in Bastille''s pit. The choir are taking their place in the rehearsal studio. Both sides are fine tuning the work in progress of an opera ballet: Sarah Winchester, her grief, her madness, her home and her ghosts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oKqGfmMdVSrwWPWuDS1L4VYz33Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:412702'),
  ('456018792642372897', 'Sarah, Plain and Tall', 1991, 'Drama, Family, Romance, TV Movie', 'Glenn Jordan, Mike Fash', null, 'Glenn Close, Christopher Walken, Lexi Randall, Małgorzata Zajączkowska, Jon DeVries, James Rebhorn, Woody Watson, Betty Laird', 'G', 'Kansas, 1910. Widowed farmer Jacob Witting finds that taking care of both his farm and two children, Anna and Caleb, is too difficult to handle alone. John takes out an ad in a newspaper for a mail-order bride, to which the "plain and tall" Sarah Wheaton answers, soon traveling from Maine to Kansas to become John''s wife. Despite the love that grows between Sarah and the family, Sarah finds herself homesick, and she must ultimately choose whether or not to stay.', 'Kansas, 1910. Widowed farmer Jacob Witting finds that taking care of both his farm and two children, Anna and Caleb, is too difficult to handle alone. John takes out an ad in a newspaper for a mail-order bride, to which the "plain and tall" Sarah Wheaton answers, soon traveling from Maine to Kansas to become John''s wife. Despite the love that grows between Sarah and the family, Sarah finds herself homesick, and she must ultimately choose whether or not to stay.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dNigktllrKYWrvxuBXBi58ZeWqO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15740'),
  ('388221924996291110', 'Sarah, Plain and Tall: Winter''s End', 1999, 'Drama, Family', 'Ralf D. Bode, Glenn Jordan', 'Patricia MacLachlan', 'Glenn Close, Christopher Walken, Jack Palance, Lexi Randall, George Hearn, Emily Osment, Betty Laird, Calen Pick', 'PG', 'The third installment of the Sarah trilogy provides a glorious and touching story of a family drawn together by adversity. On a cold winter day a stranger shows up at the farm. He is slow to reveal his identity. When they find out he is Jacobs father, John Witting, thought long ago dead, hard questions about the past are difficult to get answered.', 'The third installment of the Sarah trilogy provides a glorious and touching story of a family drawn together by adversity. On a cold winter day a stranger shows up at the farm. He is slow to reveal his identity. When they find out he is Jacobs father, John Witting, thought long ago dead, hard questions about the past are difficult to get answered.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iPRM327jqU4v4ueCPvKNJl4larC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58242'),
  ('965700813535263690', 'Sarah''s Key', 2010, 'Drama, War', 'Gilles Paquet-Brenner, Pascal Ridao', 'Serge Joncour, Gilles Paquet-Brenner', 'Kristin Scott Thomas, Mélusine Mayance, Niels Arestrup, Frédéric Pierrot, Michel Duchaussoy, Dominique Frot, Natasha Mashkevich, Gisèle Casadesus', 'PG-13', 'On the night of 16 July 1942, ten year old Sarah and her parents are being arrested and transported to the Velodrome d''Hiver in Paris where thousands of other jews are being sent to get deported. Sarah however managed to lock her little brother in a closet just before the police entered their apartment. Sixty years later, Julia Jarmond, an American journalist in Paris, gets the assignment to write an article about this raid, a black page in the history of France. She starts digging archives and through Sarah''s file discovers a well kept secret about her own in-laws.', 'On the night of 16 July 1942, ten year old Sarah and her parents are being arrested and transported to the Velodrome d''Hiver in Paris where thousands of other jews are being sent to get deported. Sarah however managed to lock her little brother in a closet just before the police entered their apartment. Sixty years later, Julia Jarmond, an American journalist in Paris, gets the assignment to write an article about this raid, a black page in the history of France. She starts digging archives and through Sarah''s file discovers a well kept secret about her own in-laws.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/peGUaf6HrX7jSi1HifX64QJb7pm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53457'),
  ('649628988144567317', 'Sarah''s Oil', 2025, 'Drama', 'Cyrus Nowrasteh, Johnny Derango', 'Cyrus Nowrasteh, Betsy Giffen Nowrasteh', 'Naya Desir-Johnson, Sonequa Martin-Green, Zachary Levi, Garret Dillahunt, Bridget Regan, Kenric Green, Adyan Copes, Stelio Savante', 'PG', 'Sarah Rector, a Black girl born in early 20th-century Oklahoma Indian Territory, believes there is oil beneath the barren land she’s allotted, and her faith proves right. As greedy oil sharks close in, Sarah turns to family, friends, and some Texas wildcatters to maintain control of her oil-rich land, eventually becoming among the nation''s first Black female millionaires—at eleven years old.', 'Sarah Rector, a Black girl born in early 20th-century Oklahoma Indian Territory, believes there is oil beneath the barren land she’s allotted, and her faith proves right. As greedy oil sharks close in, Sarah turns to family, friends, and some Texas wildcatters to maintain control of her oil-rich land, eventually becoming among the nation''s first Black female millionaires—at eleven years old.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Av1CK61z33v2OBFLD1yF5rdRxQ1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1325678'),
  ('914105539307652186', 'Sarajevo', 2014, 'Thriller, History, War, TV Movie', 'Andreas Prochaska', 'Martin Ambrosch', 'Heino Ferch, Melika Foroutan, Friedrich von Thun, Edin Hasanović, Juraj Kukura, Erwin Steinhauer, Martin Leutgeb, Florian Teichtmeister', null, 'The events in Sarajevo in June 1914 are the backdrop for a thriller directed by Andreas Prochaska and written by Martin Ambrosch, focusing on the examining magistrate Dr. Leo Pfeffer (Florian Teichtmeister) investigating the assassination of Archduke Franz Ferdinand. Trying to do his job in a time of lawlessness and violence, intrigues and betrayal, Leo struggles to maintain his integrity and save his love, Marija, and her father, prominent Serbian merchant. But the events of Sarajevo have set into motion an inescapable course of events that will escalate to become … the Great War.', 'The events in Sarajevo in June 1914 are the backdrop for a thriller directed by Andreas Prochaska and written by Martin Ambrosch, focusing on the examining magistrate Dr. Leo Pfeffer (Florian Teichtmeister) investigating the assassination of Archduke Franz Ferdinand. Trying to do his job in a time of lawlessness and violence, intrigues and betrayal, Leo struggles to maintain his integrity and save his love, Marija, and her father, prominent Serbian merchant. But the events of Sarajevo have set into motion an inescapable course of events that will escalate to become … the Great War.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4sNwqUd37oMnObgAg2Q1tQAdHvG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:269198'),
  ('403639789164398692', 'Sarala Subbarao', 2026, 'Family, Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'Manju Swaraj, Pradeep Padma Kumar', 'Manju Swaraj, Trilok Trivikram', 'Ajai Rao, Misha Narang, Rangayana Raghu, Veena Sundar', null, 'Sarala Subbarao is a romantic family drama set in 1970s Mysore. It portrays the journey of Sarala and Subbarao as they balance love, tradition, and aspirations. A heartfelt story that reflects the strength of relationships and enduring values.', 'Sarala Subbarao is a romantic family drama set in 1970s Mysore. It portrays the journey of Sarala and Subbarao as they balance love, tradition, and aspirations. A heartfelt story that reflects the strength of relationships and enduring values.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FqeJydXBGQa9lPRnQ0TGR7y4qXIP.jpg', 'plex:movie:sarala-subbarao'),
  ('600488420461750897', 'Saratoga', 1937, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Jack Conway, Ray June', 'Robert E. Hopkins, Anita Loos', 'Jean Harlow, Clark Gable, Lionel Barrymore, Frank Morgan, Walter Pidgeon, Una Merkel, Hattie McDaniel, George Zucco', 'NR', 'A horse breeder''s granddaughter falls in love with a gambler in Saratoga Springs, N.Y.', 'A horse breeder''s granddaughter falls in love with a gambler in Saratoga Springs, N.Y.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3HKRBWHuxClJUKHovKSQjUV9ua6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45800'),
  ('257439130710929931', 'Saratoga Trunk', 1945, 'Drama, Romance, Western', 'Sam Wood', 'Casey Robinson', 'Gary Cooper, Ingrid Bergman, Flora Robson, Jerry Austin, John Warburton, Florence Bates, Curt Bois, John Abbott', 'NR', 'An opportunistic Texas gambler and the exiled Creole daughter of an aristocratic family join forces to achieve justice from the society that has ostracized them.', 'An opportunistic Texas gambler and the exiled Creole daughter of an aristocratic family join forces to achieve justice from the society that has ostracized them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5FyEqAihmhGBiOWqLOWMvxE0vq2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46563'),
  ('842832905247151164', 'Sarbjit', 2016, 'Drama', 'Omung Kumar, Kiran Deohans', 'Utkarshini Vashishtha', 'Randeep Hooda, Aishwarya Rai Bachchan, Richa Chadha, Darshan Kumaar, Ankita Shrivastav, Ankur Bhatia, Shiwani Saini, Arbaaz Ali Khan', null, 'Sarbjit accidentally crosses the Indo-Pak border in a drunken state and gets arrested by the Pakistani army who falsely accuse him to be an Indian spy. His sister, Dalbir, fights to get justice for her brother and prove his innocence. Based on true events.', 'Sarbjit accidentally crosses the Indo-Pak border in a drunken state and gets arrested by the Pakistani army who falsely accuse him to be an Indian spy. His sister, Dalbir, fights to get justice for her brother and prove his innocence. Based on true events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pJTWc13iJeLD0zWpjRBZMBGZwky.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:393421'),
