  ('208091607278256962', 'Sardar Ka Grandson', 2021, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance, Family', 'Mohd Amin Khatib, Mahendra J. Shetty, Kaashvie Nair', 'Kaashvie Nair, Anuja Chauhan', 'Arjun Kapoor, Neena Gupta, Rakul Preet Singh, Kumud Mishra, Kanwaljit Singh, Soni Razdan, John Abraham, Aditi Rao Hydari', 'NR', 'A devoted grandson''s mission to reunite his ailing grandmother with her ancestral home turns into a complicated, comic cross-border affair.', 'A devoted grandson''s mission to reunite his ailing grandmother with her ancestral home turns into a complicated, comic cross-border affair.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nlQFKybBpJrpKS65wd7lhiSpnkt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:734780'),
  ('768662426967861495', 'Sardar Udham', 2021, 'Crime, Drama, History', 'Avik Mukhopadhyay, Jogi Malang, Shakyra Dowling', 'Shubendu Bhattacharya, Ritesh Shah', 'Vicky Kaushal, Shaun Scott, Stephen Hogan, Amol Parashar, Kirsty Averton, Banita Sandhu, Andrew Havill, Sam Redford', 'R', 'A young Sardar Udham Singh left deeply scarred by the Jallianwala Bagh massacre, escaped into the mountains of Afghanistan, reaching London in 1933-34. Carrying an unhealed wound for 21 years, the revolutionary assassinated Michael O’Dwyer on 13th March, 1940, the man at the helm of affairs in Punjab, April 1919 to avenge the lost lives of his beloved brethren.', 'A young Sardar Udham Singh left deeply scarred by the Jallianwala Bagh massacre, escaped into the mountains of Afghanistan, reaching London in 1933-34. Carrying an unhealed wound for 21 years, the revolutionary assassinated Michael O’Dwyer on 13th March, 1940, the man at the helm of affairs in Punjab, April 1919 to avenge the lost lives of his beloved brethren.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d4fpJXhUNukd5XnzRO1XfWf7v88.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:598826'),
  ('885999789179881988', 'Sardinia Kidnapped', 1968, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Gianfranco Mingozzi, Ugo Piccone, Mimmola Girosi', 'Ugo Pirro, Gianfranco Mingozzi', 'Franco Nero, Charlotte Rampling, Frank Wolff, Ennio Balbo, Pierluigi Aprà, Margarita Lozano, Steffen Zacharias, Enrico Osterman', null, 'Christina Fisher arrives in Sardinia to spend a holiday with her university friend, Francesco. As they are touring the island, they are trapped by mountain terrorists. Francesco is kidnapped, but Christina is permitted to leave. She is determined to contact the police, but is persuaded not to by Francesco''s best friend, Gambino. Together they try to find the kidnappers, but she becomes suspicious of everyone including Gambino. Confused and paranoid, she sets out alone to contact the police.', 'Christina Fisher arrives in Sardinia to spend a holiday with her university friend, Francesco. As they are touring the island, they are trapped by mountain terrorists. Francesco is kidnapped, but Christina is permitted to leave. She is determined to contact the police, but is persuaded not to by Francesco''s best friend, Gambino. Together they try to find the kidnappers, but she becomes suspicious of everyone including Gambino. Confused and paranoid, she sets out alone to contact the police.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5xcMLn03Acp5qGVQBA34AdtBLpz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:261004'),
  ('2065804768837126', 'Sarfarosh', 1999, 'Action, Drama', 'John Mathew Matthan, Vikas Sivaraman', 'John Mathew Matthan', 'Aamir Khan, Naseeruddin Shah, Sonali Bendre, Mukesh Rishi, Akash Khurana, Smita Jaykar, Akhilendra Mishra, Makrand Deshpande', null, 'When terrorists kill a cop''s brother and disable his father, he fights back against the smuggling of guns and drugs which plagues his country.', 'When terrorists kill a cop''s brother and disable his father, he fights back against the smuggling of guns and drugs which plagues his country.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i6XJCzajVcnfh5ljAn7AGub5vih.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31524'),
