  ('633938680713271906', 'Sarkar', 2018, 'Action, Drama', 'A. R. Murugadoss, Girish Gangadharan', 'A. R. Murugadoss', 'Vijay, Keerthy Suresh, Varalaxmi Sarathkumar, Prem, Yogi Babu, Radha Ravi, Tulasi, Rajesh', null, 'NRI corporate Sundar Ramasamy comes to India to vote, only to learn that his vote has already been cast. While he reclaims his right legally, it also sets in motion a chain of events that eventually lead to him entering the political fray, trying to change the system.', 'NRI corporate Sundar Ramasamy comes to India to vote, only to learn that his vote has already been cast. While he reclaims his right legally, it also sets in motion a chain of events that eventually lead to him entering the political fray, trying to change the system.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/plaMZ1r11u7D9JTd4vkmhQJlYfa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:504231'),
  ('517749698077745415', 'Sarkar 3', 2017, 'Crime', 'Ram Gopal Varma, Aparajita Bharadwaj, Dharmendra Bharti', 'Ramkumar Singh, Ram Gopal Varma, P. Jayakumar', 'Amitabh Bachchan, Amit Sadh, Jackie Shroff, Manoj Bajpayee, Yami Gautam Dhar, Ronit Roy, Rohini Hattangadi, Bharat Dabholkar', null, 'Subhash Nagre or Sarkar, the patriarch of the most powerful family of Maharashtra, continues to hold centre-stage because of his immense clout with the masses. In this outing, the Godfather is joined by his grandson Shivaji Nagre who loves and hates his grandfather with equal intensity. Will Shivaji betray Subhash? Or will he become a prey to his grandfather’s machinations?', 'Subhash Nagre or Sarkar, the patriarch of the most powerful family of Maharashtra, continues to hold centre-stage because of his immense clout with the masses. In this outing, the Godfather is joined by his grandson Shivaji Nagre who loves and hates his grandfather with equal intensity. Will Shivaji betray Subhash? Or will he become a prey to his grandfather’s machinations?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bZEEsWvuznU5ZdHd6LUCvOpdNJB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:441868'),
  ('549071508828667197', 'Sarkar Raj', 2008, 'Action, Adventure, Crime, Drama', 'Ram Gopal Varma, Neha Sharma, Sandeep Modi', null, 'Amitabh Bachchan, Abhishek Bachchan, Aishwarya Rai Bachchan, Govind Namdeo, Tanishaa Mukerji, Victor Banerjee, Supriya Pathak, Sayaji Shinde', null, 'When Anita Raja, CEO of Sheppard power plant, brings a power plant proposal to set up in rural Mahrashtra before the Nagres, insightful Shankar is quick to realise the benefits the power plant can bring to the people.', 'When Anita Raja, CEO of Sheppard power plant, brings a power plant proposal to set up in rural Mahrashtra before the Nagres, insightful Shankar is quick to realise the benefits the power plant can bring to the people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1ptl9Dq51jXpUNotg6CwHWZxoaK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14394'),
  ('524826176295596725', 'Sarkaru Vaari Paata', 2022, 'Action, Comedy, Drama', 'Vijaya Ram Prasad, R. Madhi, Parasuram Petla', 'Parasuram Petla', 'Mahesh Babu, Keerthy Suresh, Samuthirakani, Vennela Kishore, Subbaraju, Nadhiya, Posani Krishna Murali, Sowmya Menon', 'NR', 'After being conned by the woman he loves, a finance agent arrives in India from the USA to retrieve his money from her father, a powerful MP and industrialist.', 'After being conned by the woman he loves, a finance agent arrives in India from the USA to retrieve his money from her father, a powerful MP and industrialist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jFwdKKDmgzKjZGFnSJma7I5XMpk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:784696'),
  ('395665174324750285', 'Sarkozy-Gaddafi: The Scandal of All Scandals', 2025, 'Documentary, Crime', 'Yannick Kergoat, Étienne Mommessin', 'Yannick Kergoat, Fabrice Arfi, Michaël Hadjenberg', 'Florence Loiret Caille, Fabrice Arfi, Karl Laske, Julia Cagé, Patrick Haimzadeh, Danièle Klein, François Molins', null, 'A democracy and a dictatorship. A presidential campaign and dirty money. War and death. When Nicolas Sarkozy affirmed in the press that “No one can make sense of it”, he was trying to discredit the investigation into his ties with Muammar Gaddafi, portraying it as a bunch of gibberish. As Sarkozy and his many accomplices go on trial in the Libyan campaign financing affair, here’s the film that will finally explain all of the ins and outs of one of the most remarkable French political scandals in decades.', 'A democracy and a dictatorship. A presidential campaign and dirty money. War and death. When Nicolas Sarkozy affirmed in the press that “No one can make sense of it”, he was trying to discredit the investigation into his ties with Muammar Gaddafi, portraying it as a bunch of gibberish. As Sarkozy and his many accomplices go on trial in the Libyan campaign financing affair, here’s the film that will finally explain all of the ins and outs of one of the most remarkable French political scandals in decades.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ve6cDDumATaPJfsknOTm3tNRZFG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1290465'),
  ('949019389000788867', 'Sarò con te', 2024, 'Documentary', 'Andrea Bosello', 'Andrea Bosello, Andrea Cini', 'Toni Servillo, Silvio Orlando, Marco D''Amore, Paolo Condò, Emanuele Palumbo, Robert Del Naja, Salvatore Esposito, Fabio Cannavaro', null, 'Football offers bitter disappointments, but equally powerful and infinite emotions. Napoli rises again on May 4, 2023, winning the championship with five days to spare, an epochal result destined to remain forever in history. A joy awaited for 33 years and told through the eyes of the players, such as captain Giovanni Di Lorenzo, of personalities from the world of sport, entertainment and journalism, of Napoli''s sporting directors and staff, including coach Luciano Spalletti.', 'Football offers bitter disappointments, but equally powerful and infinite emotions. Napoli rises again on May 4, 2023, winning the championship with five days to spare, an epochal result destined to remain forever in history. A joy awaited for 33 years and told through the eyes of the players, such as captain Giovanni Di Lorenzo, of personalities from the world of sport, entertainment and journalism, of Napoli''s sporting directors and staff, including coach Luciano Spalletti.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yLLijmVau7wmFJezWMrSsWBpOlq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1273576'),
  ('798746161454884415', 'Sarpatta Parambarai', 2021, 'History, Action, Drama', 'Pa. Ranjith, G. Murali, S. Jayakumar', 'Thamizh Prabha, Pa. Ranjith', 'Arya, Pasupathy, Kalaiyarasan, John Vijay, John Kokken, Shabeer Kallarakkal, G. M. Sundar, Dushara Vijayan', null, 'When Sarpatta Parambarai is challenged to a do-or-die match, Kabilan, a young labourer, must choose whether to put on the gloves himself and lead his clan to victory, or be dissuaded by his disapproving mother and dangerous politics.', 'When Sarpatta Parambarai is challenged to a do-or-die match, Kabilan, a young labourer, must choose whether to put on the gloves himself and lead his clan to victory, or be dissuaded by his disapproving mother and dangerous politics.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3f2KrEoOTmQxfDWgeqqLQ1rCYWP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:796011'),
  ('152214791598760881', 'Sars Wars: Bangkok Zombie Crisis', 2004, 'Action, Comedy, Fantasy, Horror', 'Taweewat Wantha, Pipat Jomkoh, Chaluay Srirattana', 'Adirek Watleela, Kuanchun Phemyad, Sommai Lertulan', 'Suthep Pongam, Suppakorn Kitsuwan, Pinsuda Tanpairoh, Lena Christensen, Andrew Biggs, Naowarat Yuktanan, Somlek Sakdikul, Pued Blackcat', null, 'In the wake of a deadly SARS outbreak that''s turned ordinary folks into flesh-eating zombies, Thailand stands alone as the only nation to block the pandemic. That is, until the virus finds its way into a crowded Bangkok apartment complex.', 'In the wake of a deadly SARS outbreak that''s turned ordinary folks into flesh-eating zombies, Thailand stands alone as the only nation to block the pandemic. That is, until the virus finds its way into a crowded Bangkok apartment complex.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tVhap8qkRWRXCypBJyltcn40bol.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50108'),
  ('683013709167772887', 'Sartana in the Valley of Death', 1970, 'Western', 'Roberto Mauri, Sandro Mancori', 'Roberto Mauri', 'William Berger, Wayde Preston, Aldo Berti, Carlo Giordana, Franco De Rosa, Luciano Pigozzi, Jolanda Modio, Pamela Tudor', null, 'Smooth and lethal gunfighter Lee Calloway helps three bandit brothers escape from jail under the condition that they give him fifty percent of the stolen gold they have hidden. Of course, the treacherous sibling trio don''t plan on keeping their end of the deal.', 'Smooth and lethal gunfighter Lee Calloway helps three bandit brothers escape from jail under the condition that they give him fifty percent of the stolen gold they have hidden. Of course, the treacherous sibling trio don''t plan on keeping their end of the deal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dPMCPCeYnKeY6ahsE7vTBUu3cHD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:112567'),
  ('1056277927901783756', 'Sartana Kills Them All', 1970, 'Western', 'Rafael Romero Marchent', 'Mario Alabiso, Rafael Romero Marchent', 'Gianni Garko, Guglielmo Spoletini, María Silva, Andrés Mejuto, Raf Baldassarre, Charly Bravo, Carlos Romero Marchent, Cris Huerta', null, 'A pair of outlaws are on the hunt for some loot they know is missing from a robbery. Outsmarting and killing anyone who tries to foil their plans.', 'A pair of outlaws are on the hunt for some loot they know is missing from a robbery. Outsmarting and killing anyone who tries to foil their plans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gPVxKuc06ZA9RPgs6UkRAGSN0OS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95835'),
  ('785881171981696419', 'Sartana''s Here... Trade Your Pistol for a Coffin', 1970, 'Western', 'Giuliano Carnimeo, Stelvio Massi, Romano Scandariato', 'Tito Carpi', 'George Hilton, Charles Southwood, Erika Blanc, Piero Lulli, Federico Boido, Linda Sini, Nello Pazzafini, Carlo Gaddi', 'NR', 'Sartana, bounty hunter and gunfighter, witnesses the robbery of a shipment of gold. He finds his way into town where he meets with a lot of suspicious stares from the locals. He also meets with Samuel Spencer, who seems to own the company in this company town. The gold shipments are being stolen, so Spencer agrees to hire Sartana to protect the next gold shipment. Numerous dull-witted villains make attempts on Sartana''s life, but he survives. Eventually, Sartana''s nemesis Sabbath (he of the white coat and parasol) rides into town. With a showdown inevitable, Sartana and Sabbath square off to settle the score.', 'Sartana, bounty hunter and gunfighter, witnesses the robbery of a shipment of gold. He finds his way into town where he meets with a lot of suspicious stares from the locals. He also meets with Samuel Spencer, who seems to own the company in this company town. The gold shipments are being stolen, so Spencer agrees to hire Sartana to protect the next gold shipment. Numerous dull-witted villains make attempts on Sartana''s life, but he survives. Eventually, Sartana''s nemesis Sabbath (he of the white coat and parasol) rides into town. With a showdown inevitable, Sartana and Sabbath square off to settle the score.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dQCWCJlAkCaKCZLKqCHmbN56gPc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83140'),
  ('5955113158623560', 'Saru Lock: The Movie', 2010, 'Action, Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Tetsu Maeda, Shuhei Umene, Kojiro Hashimoto', 'Takashi Hasegawa', 'Hayato Ichihara, Manami Higa, Manami Konishi, Sousuke Takaoka, Sei Ashina, Gota Watabe, Soko Wada, Ken Mitsuishi', null, 'Saru is a talented young locksmith who unlocks any kind of lock. He is, however, a complete fool when it comes to women. One day a girl Mayumi asks him to open a safe full of stolen money. Knowing nothing about it, Saru takes the money briefcase with Mayumi and finds himself with yakuza gangsters and also police in hot pursuit.', 'Saru is a talented young locksmith who unlocks any kind of lock. He is, however, a complete fool when it comes to women. One day a girl Mayumi asks him to open a safe full of stolen money. Knowing nothing about it, Saru takes the money briefcase with Mayumi and finds himself with yakuza gangsters and also police in hot pursuit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/piBvOCrqu1HBoAWQT57Hon9tHvN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62423'),
  ('595082241681627817', 'Sarvam Maya', 2025, 'Comedy, Family', 'Akhil Sathyan, Sharan Velayudhan Nair', 'Akhil Sathyan', 'Nivin Pauly, Riya Shibu, Preity Mukhundhan, Aju Varghese, Janardhanan, Madhu Warrier, Raghunath Paleri, Anand Ekarshi', null, 'A man who loses his belief in God meets the spirit of a young woman unable to remember what happened to her.', 'A man who loses his belief in God meets the spirit of a young woman unable to remember what happened to her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mgLY1aQayVX6dQ2DiylLAhjEG8w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1473354'),
  ('25381466410074978', 'Sas', 2019, null, 'Léa Célestine Bernasconi', null, null, null, 'We follow the degenerate walk of a young woman and her obsessional thoughts. This movie is a meeting with people who suffer from an eating disorder and the ones living with them.', 'We follow the degenerate walk of a young woman and her obsessional thoughts. This movie is a meeting with people who suffer from an eating disorder and the ones living with them.', null, 'tmdb:movie:623285'),
  ('636061150989402899', 'SAS: Red Notice', 2021, 'Drama, Action, Thriller', 'Magnus Martens, Anne McCarthy, Kellie Roy', 'Laurence Malkin', 'Sam Heughan, Ruby Rose, Andy Serkis, Tom Wilkinson, Tom Hopper, Hannah John-Kamen, Noel Clarke, Owain Yeoman', null, 'An off-duty SAS soldier, Tom Buckingham, must thwart a terror attack on a train running through the Channel Tunnel. As the action escalates on the train, events transpire in the corridors of power that may make the difference as to whether Buckingham and the civilian passengers make it out of the tunnel alive.', 'An off-duty SAS soldier, Tom Buckingham, must thwart a terror attack on a train running through the Channel Tunnel. As the action escalates on the train, events transpire in the corridors of power that may make the difference as to whether Buckingham and the civilian passengers make it out of the tunnel alive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6Y9fl8tD1xtyUrOHV2MkCYTpzgi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:595743'),
  ('275227791097125151', 'Sasaki and Miyano: Graduation', 2023, 'Animation, Romance', 'Souta Ueno, Shinji Ishihira, Shoji Hata', 'Yoshiko Nakamura', 'Yusuke Shirai, Soma Saito, Yoshitsugu Matsuoka, Yuki Ono, Yuma Uchida, Ryohei Arai, Mitsuhiro Ichiki, Nobunaga Shimazaki', null, 'As Sasaki prepares for his college entrance exams, Miyano tries to make the most of their limited time together while grappling with his own emotions.', 'As Sasaki prepares for his college entrance exams, Miyano tries to make the most of their limited time together while grappling with his own emotions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xjZjNaUVF9mX7ekOL3lvBUi72eQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:998731'),
  ('933687546323734525', 'Sasaki in My Mind', 2020, 'Drama, Romance', 'Hidetoshi Shinomiya, Yukitaka Nakamura, Takuya Uchiyama', 'Gaku Hosokawa, Takuya Uchiyama', 'Kisetsu Fujiwara, Gaku Hosokawa, Minori Hagiwara, Shintaro Yuya, Yusaku Mori, Sakurako Konishi, Yuumi Kawai, Satoru Iguchi', null, 'The story of a would-be actor, his larger-than-life classmate and their friends. Unfolding their past and present, Sasaki in My Mind looks head-on at adolescent sparkle and the pathos of bygone days.', 'The story of a would-be actor, his larger-than-life classmate and their friends. Unfolding their past and present, Sasaki in My Mind looks head-on at adolescent sparkle and the pathos of bygone days.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/icRy7XzphuaS9G4VbtIX6nQkyGG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:747993'),
  ('753842481778864859', 'Sasha', 2011, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Dennis Todorović', 'Dennis Todorović', 'Saša Kekez, Tim Bergmann, Zeljka Preksavec, Predrag Bjelac, Yvonne Yung Hee, Petra Nadolny, Klaus Nierhoff, Özgür Cebe', null, 'While Sasha''s mother is dreaming of her son''s great career as a pianist, Sasha is left speechless for other reasons: his beloved piano teacher Mr. Weber tells him, he is leaving town forever. Sasha is heartbroken, and the only person in whom he can confide his feelings, is his best friend, Jiao. As a son of an Ex-Yugoslav family even in Germany one rarely lives outside the closet, and Sasha is grateful that his homophobic father believes Jiao is his girlfriend. But what begins as a useful lie becomes a large and complicated one, when Sasha''s younger brother, begins an affair with Jiao. All lies get exposed and what appears to be a catastrophe is in fact the revelation of new possibilities in the lives of Sasha''s family.', 'While Sasha''s mother is dreaming of her son''s great career as a pianist, Sasha is left speechless for other reasons: his beloved piano teacher Mr. Weber tells him, he is leaving town forever. Sasha is heartbroken, and the only person in whom he can confide his feelings, is his best friend, Jiao. As a son of an Ex-Yugoslav family even in Germany one rarely lives outside the closet, and Sasha is grateful that his homophobic father believes Jiao is his girlfriend. But what begins as a useful lie becomes a large and complicated one, when Sasha''s younger brother, begins an affair with Jiao. All lies get exposed and what appears to be a catastrophe is in fact the revelation of new possibilities in the lives of Sasha''s family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vkqUiehBqLNAy7yvFURqLsWuGSa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65831'),
  ('99638632428063586', 'Saskatchewan', 1954, 'Western, Adventure', 'Raoul Walsh, John F. Seitz', 'Gil Doud', 'Alan Ladd, Shelley Winters, J. Carrol Naish, Hugh O''Brian, Robert Douglas, George J. Lewis, Richard Long, Jay Silverheels', 'NR', 'Story of blood brothers whose bonds are tested when marauding Sioux Indians cross the border to enlist the peaceful Cree in a battle against the Great White Father.', 'Story of blood brothers whose bonds are tested when marauding Sioux Indians cross the border to enlist the peaceful Cree in a battle against the Great White Father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nvGkHcdEGB40Pmtqx1sLtxU0mt2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:147905'),
  ('243068405509920958', 'Sasori', 2009, 'Action, Adventure, Drama', 'Joe Ma Wai-Ho, Joe Chan Kwong-Hung, Wong Wai-Fai', 'Joe Ma Wai-Ho', 'Miki Mizuno, Dylan Kuo, Emme Wong Yi-Man, Nana Natsume, Sam Lee, Bruce Leung Siu-Lung, Ryo Ishibashi, Lam Suet', null, 'A ruthless pack of thugs force mild-mannered, caught-in-the-middle-of-something-bigger Nami to murder her fiance''s sister, decidedly ruining her pending marriage and landing the poor girl in the most brutal women''s prison ever seen. Inside the hellblocks, she decides to stop being a victim at all costs, and ends up becoming stronger and even more vicious than the craziest inmates in the pen. She eventually escapes in a most unusual way, gets valuable fight training from a mysterious mountain man and returns to the streets in order to make the thugs who ruined her life pay.', 'A ruthless pack of thugs force mild-mannered, caught-in-the-middle-of-something-bigger Nami to murder her fiance''s sister, decidedly ruining her pending marriage and landing the poor girl in the most brutal women''s prison ever seen. Inside the hellblocks, she decides to stop being a victim at all costs, and ends up becoming stronger and even more vicious than the craziest inmates in the pen. She eventually escapes in a most unusual way, gets valuable fight training from a mysterious mountain man and returns to the streets in order to make the thugs who ruined her life pay.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5y1eoGhoRTvzSSECGg50LXatc7x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31680'),
  ('440142694763879709', 'Sasquatch', 2002, 'Horror, Action, Thriller, Adventure', 'Shaun Lawless, Jonas Quastel', 'Chris Lanning, Jonas Quastel', 'Lance Henriksen, Andrea Roth, Russell Ferrier, Philip Granger, Mary Mancini, Taras Kostyuk, Erica Durance, Jeremy Radick', 'R', 'Harlan Knowles, billionaire and president of Bio-Comp Industries heads up a team of experts in a quest to locate a company plane that disappeared over the remote forests of the Pacific Northwest. Knowles is obsessed with finding the plane and rescuing his daughter, who was one of its passengers. The assembled team includes local guide Clayton Tyne, wilderness expert/author Winston Burg and Marla Lawson. Soon, the team begins to suspect that Knowles'' main objective is actually to recover the prototype of a DNA testing machine called the Huxley Project, which his company has spent years and millions of dollars developing.', 'Harlan Knowles, billionaire and president of Bio-Comp Industries heads up a team of experts in a quest to locate a company plane that disappeared over the remote forests of the Pacific Northwest. Knowles is obsessed with finding the plane and rescuing his daughter, who was one of its passengers. The assembled team includes local guide Clayton Tyne, wilderness expert/author Winston Burg and Marla Lawson. Soon, the team begins to suspect that Knowles'' main objective is actually to recover the prototype of a DNA testing machine called the Huxley Project, which his company has spent years and millions of dollars developing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rPHneBW9Gles5QsFzSduoLAZVhy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29883'),
  ('1144532228127124284', 'Sasquatch Mountain', 2006, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Fantasy, Thriller, Mystery', 'Steven R. Monroe, Neil Lisk', 'Michael Worth', 'Lance Henriksen, Cerina Vincent, Michael Worth, Rance Howard, Craig Wasson, Tim Thomerson, Raffaello Degruttola, Karen Kim', 'R', 'A lonely tow-truck driver gets caught in a deadly struggle between a pair of bank robbers with a beautiful hostage, local cops, and a monster that has come down from the Arizona mountains to eat human flesh.', 'A lonely tow-truck driver gets caught in a deadly struggle between a pair of bank robbers with a beautiful hostage, local cops, and a monster that has come down from the Arizona mountains to eat human flesh.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5IdRVswrdk4vD951naavsZRVADt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78561'),
  ('827560854689529719', 'Sasquatch Sunset', 2024, 'Fantasy, Comedy', 'David Zellner, Nathan Zellner, Mike Gioulakis', 'David Zellner', 'Riley Keough, Jesse Eisenberg, Nathan Zellner, Christophe Zajac-Denek', 'R', 'In the misty forests of North America, a family of Sasquatches—possibly the last of their enigmatic kind—embark on an absurdist, epic, hilarious, and ultimately poignant journey over the course of one year. These shaggy and noble giants fight for survival as they find themselves on a collision course with the ever-changing world around them.', 'In the misty forests of North America, a family of Sasquatches—possibly the last of their enigmatic kind—embark on an absurdist, epic, hilarious, and ultimately poignant journey over the course of one year. These shaggy and noble giants fight for survival as they find themselves on a collision course with the ever-changing world around them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9zdqkbwVGrUl0biGCqCOgvbgaM5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1015634'),
  ('234693548544067682', 'Sasquatch, the Legend of Bigfoot', 1976, 'Adventure, Mystery, Horror', 'Ed Ragozzino, John Fabian, Bill Farmer', 'J. English Smith', 'George Lauris, Steve Boergadine, Jim Bradford, Ken Kenzle, William Emmons, Joel Morello, Lou Salerni', 'G', 'Scientists mount an expedition to find a Bigfoot-type creature.', 'Scientists mount an expedition to find a Bigfoot-type creature.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dgLlt3vs1dplnxwUF9H2DKQeBYK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119010'),
  ('408378248980453745', 'Sass', 2001, 'Drama', 'Carlo Rola, Martin Langer', 'Holger Karsten Schmidt, Uwe Wilhelm', 'Ben Becker, Jürgen Vogel, Henry Hübchen, Frank Sieckel, Karin Baal, Otto Sander, Traugott Buhre, Jeanette Hain', null, 'Brothers Franz and Erich Sass grew up poor. Together with his brother Franz, Erich specializes in cracking safes. Erich spends the money with his hands full. In the meantime, the police have also become aware of the brothers. Pursued by Detective Fabich, they get deeper and deeper into criminal circles. A man called Adolf demands that the Sass brothers work for him. He blackmails them and has their father beaten to death. The brothers then agree to work together. However, Adolf plans to have them killed after the coup. The two brothers manage to escape; they are also able to flee from the police, who catch them while they are still breaking into the bank.', 'Brothers Franz and Erich Sass grew up poor. Together with his brother Franz, Erich specializes in cracking safes. Erich spends the money with his hands full. In the meantime, the police have also become aware of the brothers. Pursued by Detective Fabich, they get deeper and deeper into criminal circles. A man called Adolf demands that the Sass brothers work for him. He blackmails them and has their father beaten to death. The brothers then agree to work together. However, Adolf plans to have them killed after the coup. The two brothers manage to escape; they are also able to flee from the police, who catch them while they are still breaking into the bank.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nOeS4lWcCt5nWckDVsVrMGW8EDh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11311'),
  ('1012746916594418687', 'Sassy Sue', 1973, 'Comedy', 'Bethel Buckalew', 'Bethel Buckalew', 'John Tull, Colleen Brennan, Patrick Wright, Tallie Cochrane, Rachel Wolfe, Sandy Carey, Karen Cooknell, Don Coufal', 'NR', 'Pa, a moonshining chicken farmer, is worried that his dim-witted son Junior is becoming way more attracted to their cow Sassy Sue than he should be, so he sets out to gather up all the nubile young farmgirls in the area and get them to show Junior what he''s missing.', 'Pa, a moonshining chicken farmer, is worried that his dim-witted son Junior is becoming way more attracted to their cow Sassy Sue than he should be, so he sets out to gather up all the nubile young farmgirls in the area and get them to show Junior what he''s missing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8NLRncK8VNr4VocR84ihOyJ8ikH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76405'),
  ('205824405133007300', 'Satan', 1974, 'Horror', 'Metin Erksan', 'Yılmaz Tümtürk', 'Canan Perver, Cihan Ünal, Meral Taygun, Agah Hün, Erol Amaç, Ekrem Gökkaya, Ali Taygun, Ahu Tuğba', null, '12 year-old Gul becomes possessed by Satan after experimenting with a Ouija board. A troubled psychiatrist and an experienced exorcist become the girl’s only hope for salvation.', '12 year-old Gul becomes possessed by Satan after experimenting with a Ouija board. A troubled psychiatrist and an experienced exorcist become the girl’s only hope for salvation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/paZggGOsYzPt8CzdqXUKmZqAC5G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:112170'),
  ('184842763486951689', 'Satan', 1991, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Viktor Aristov, A. Bakhrushin, Nikolai Astakhov', 'Viktor Aristov', 'Sergey Kupriyanov, Svetlana Bragarnik, Veniamin Malochevskiy, Armenak Nazikyan, Mikhail Starodubov, Maria Averbach, Valentina Kasyanova, Nikolay Solodilov', null, 'An angelic-looking but selfish and ruthless young man wanders from crime to crime without the slightest remorse. In the Russian film "Satan," the devil is a delicately handsome young man whose murderous opportunism is too easy to understand. While the film registers shock at its protagonist''s absolute amorality, it also presents him as part of a bitterly divided and pessimistic culture. The world of "Satan" is one in which nothing really works, and therefore anything goes.', 'An angelic-looking but selfish and ruthless young man wanders from crime to crime without the slightest remorse. In the Russian film "Satan," the devil is a delicately handsome young man whose murderous opportunism is too easy to understand. While the film registers shock at its protagonist''s absolute amorality, it also presents him as part of a bitterly divided and pessimistic culture. The world of "Satan" is one in which nothing really works, and therefore anything goes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/86wj1YzB8JETlPwT69AXyd3fSh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104869'),
  ('877627297129988002', 'Satan', 2006, 'Comedy, Horror, Thriller', 'Kim Chapiron, Alex Lamarque', 'Christian Chapiron, Kim Chapiron', 'Vincent Cassel, Olivier Barthélémy, Roxane Mesquida, Leïla Bekhti, Julie-Marie Parmentier, Ladj Ly, Nico Le Phat Tan, Gérald Thomassin', null, 'A group of young people leave a disco and bump into a shepherd who is ready to spend his night worshipping Satan.', 'A group of young people leave a disco and bump into a shepherd who is ready to spend his night worshipping Satan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f10fK5ELawYMG3VOLwD2I5MdMEF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13742'),
  ('331853311950718573', 'Satan in High Heels', 1962, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Jerald Intrator, Bernard Hirschenson', null, 'Meg Myles, Grayson Hall, Mike Keene, Robert Yuro, Earl Hammond, Del Tenney, Sabrina', 'NR', 'A married stripper flees to New York and has an affair with her boss and his son.', 'A married stripper flees to New York and has an affair with her boss and his son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7D8WxwXsNJLRFCuubGFcxxUwW4A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117501'),
  ('672611009473551118', 'Satan in Prison', 1907, 'Comedy', 'Georges Méliès', null, 'Georges Méliès', null, 'The title is vital, since the bulk of the action consists of a well-dressed man magically producing a series of items to furnish a bare room, culminating in his summoning up a charming lady to share his meal. Hearing the guards approaching, the man reverses the process, ending with a bare room when the two men enter.', 'The title is vital, since the bulk of the action consists of a well-dressed man magically producing a series of items to furnish a bare room, culminating in his summoning up a charming lady to share his meal. Hearing the guards approaching, the man reverses the process, ending with a bare room when the two men enter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wnLrImMCuTMFxLeoGaQgCaDV5zn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:196538'),
  ('610622985238844572', 'Satan Met a Lady', 1936, 'Comedy, Mystery, Crime', 'William Dieterle, Arthur Edeson, Leo F. Forbstein', 'Brown Holmes', 'Bette Davis, Warren William, Alison Skipworth, Arthur Treacher, Marie Wilson, Wini Shaw, Porter Hall, Olin Howland', 'NR', 'In the second screen version of The Maltese Falcon, a detective is caught between a lying seductress and a lady jewel thief.', 'In the second screen version of The Maltese Falcon, a detective is caught between a lying seductress and a lady jewel thief.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wuwkuzYxdoQqiuwrDfazINCxYHA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28256'),
  ('411862392675027360', 'Satan Never Sleeps', 1962, 'Drama', 'Leo McCarey, John Hoesli, Jim Morahan', 'Claude Binyon, Leo McCarey', 'William Holden, Clifton Webb, France Nuyen, Athene Seyler, Martin Benson, Edith Sharpe, Robert Lee, Marie Yang', 'NR', 'A priest arrives at a mission-post in China accompanied by a young native girl who has joined him along the way. His job is to relieve the existing priest, who is now too old and weak to continue with the upkeep of the church. However, Communist soldiers arrive at the mission and seize it as a command post. Their leader rapes the native girl and impregnates her, only later to realize that Communism is no good for him. In the end, the foursome flee to the border, but are pursued by Communist forces along the way.', 'A priest arrives at a mission-post in China accompanied by a young native girl who has joined him along the way. His job is to relieve the existing priest, who is now too old and weak to continue with the upkeep of the church. However, Communist soldiers arrive at the mission and seize it as a command post. Their leader rapes the native girl and impregnates her, only later to realize that Communism is no good for him. In the end, the foursome flee to the border, but are pursued by Communist forces along the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2O7Y9pRERM3FusTrVaE6xHefqne.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:144326'),
  ('717364597517933190', 'Satan Returns', 1996, 'Horror, Action, Thriller', 'Lam Wai-Lun, Cheng Siu-Keung, Lo Po-Shan', 'Wong Jing', 'Donnie Yen, Chingmy Yau Suk-Ching, Kingdom Yuen King-Tan, Francis Ng Chun-Yu, Dayo Wong Chi-Wah, Cheung Lau, Ivy Leung Si-Man, Spencer Lam Seung-Yi', null, 'Women born on the 6th June are being killed around Hong Kong. There is a lunatic on the loose. Ching, a police psychologist, looks to be the next victim. She is suffering from terrifying dreams involving the devil himself. All becomes clear when the killer is revealed as Satan''s disciple, his body possessed, searching for the reincarnation of Satan''s daughter on Earth.', 'Women born on the 6th June are being killed around Hong Kong. There is a lunatic on the loose. Ching, a police psychologist, looks to be the next victim. She is suffering from terrifying dreams involving the devil himself. All becomes clear when the killer is revealed as Satan''s disciple, his body possessed, searching for the reincarnation of Satan''s daughter on Earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a0qB0WtBjNbAtPuKmeKEUYELh7T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72408'),
  ('14616646014946296', 'Satan''s Baby Doll', 1982, 'Horror', 'Mario Bianchi, Spartaco Antonucci, Franco Villa', 'Piero Regnoli, Gabriele Crisanti', 'Marina Hedman, Mariangela Giordano, Aldo Sambrell, Giancarlo Del Duca, Jaqueline Dupré, Alfonso Gaita, Giuseppe Carbone', null, 'In the crypt of the remote castle of the Aguilars lies the recently-deceased body of Maria. Her husband Antonio is a jealous bully, his mute brother Ignazio is in a wheelchair peeping on his caretaker Sol, a novice. Also present are Miria, the couple''s virginal daughter, and Isidro, a factotum who fears Satan''s power. A frequent visitor is Juan Suarez, a doctor who wants Miria in a sanatorium for a month. She doesn''t want to go. Isidro tries to exorcize the castle''s evil spirits. Bodies pile up. Is Miria''s mother truly dead, and who is Satan''s tool?', 'In the crypt of the remote castle of the Aguilars lies the recently-deceased body of Maria. Her husband Antonio is a jealous bully, his mute brother Ignazio is in a wheelchair peeping on his caretaker Sol, a novice. Also present are Miria, the couple''s virginal daughter, and Isidro, a factotum who fears Satan''s power. A frequent visitor is Juan Suarez, a doctor who wants Miria in a sanatorium for a month. She doesn''t want to go. Isidro tries to exorcize the castle''s evil spirits. Bodies pile up. Is Miria''s mother truly dead, and who is Satan''s tool?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u6KrICrOsmILyN5Sgd2u6SqAh33.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77086'),
  ('524026629306275011', 'Satan''s Black Wedding', 1976, 'Mystery, Horror', 'Nick Millard', 'Nick Millard', 'Greg Braddock, Ray Myles, Lisa Milano, Barrett Cooper, Zarrah Whiting, Lisa Pons, Osa Danam, Georgia LeMaster', null, 'A man travels to another city for his sister''s funeral to try to find out why she killed herself. He discovers that she is actually a vampire and returns from the dead to take revenge on her family.', 'A man travels to another city for his sister''s funeral to try to find out why she killed herself. He discovers that she is actually a vampire and returns from the dead to take revenge on her family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hyzi2rDsQB1xcDzy6GlX26fEy7H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:187546'),
  ('1056646966132013550', 'Satan''s Blade', 1984, 'Horror', 'L. Scott Castillo Jr., Terry Kempf', 'Thomas Cue', 'Tom Bongiorno, Stephanie Leigh Steel, Thomas Cue, Elisa R. Malinovitz, Janeen Lowe, Ramona Andrada, Diane Taylor, Susan Bennett', 'R', 'At a mountain resort, a local resident is possessed by the evil spirit of an ancient mountain man, and terrorizes a ski lodge.', 'At a mountain resort, a local resident is possessed by the evil spirit of an ancient mountain man, and terrorizes a ski lodge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jPJ3AzO79mcx63mKuqckQTfAqlF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84995'),
  ('1138531953298321439', 'Satan''s Blood', 1978, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Carlos Puerto, Andrés Berenguer', 'Carlos Puerto', 'Ángel Aranda, Sandra Alberti, Mariana Karr, José María Guillén, Manuel Pereiro, Luis Barboo, José Pagán, Isidro Luengo', 'R', 'After a chance encounter with a mysterious couple claiming to be old friends, Andrés and Ana are invited to spend the evening at a beautiful, secluded old villa. As the night winds down, they begin to sense that there are some rather strange things going on around them and, after agreeing to sleep over, find themselves unwittingly pulled into a series of bizarre sexual encounters which they slowly discover are part of a horrifying Satanic ritual designed to make them slaves to the Prince of Darkness!', 'After a chance encounter with a mysterious couple claiming to be old friends, Andrés and Ana are invited to spend the evening at a beautiful, secluded old villa. As the night winds down, they begin to sense that there are some rather strange things going on around them and, after agreeing to sleep over, find themselves unwittingly pulled into a series of bizarre sexual encounters which they slowly discover are part of a horrifying Satanic ritual designed to make them slaves to the Prince of Darkness!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hmCV5MRwJL8VwHJDmZnp8Velw3Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28485'),
  ('565181160323680502', 'Satan’s Brew', 1976, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Rainer Werner Fassbinder, Michael Ballhaus, Jürgen Jürges', 'Rainer Werner Fassbinder', 'Kurt Raab, Margit Carstensen, Helen Vita, Volker Spengler, Ingrid Caven, Y Sa Lo, Ulli Lommel, Brigitte Mira', null, 'A famous poet who hasn''t written a word in two years unconsciously plagiarizes the work of Stefan George, while dealing with several mistresses, his dimwitted brother, and a murder investigation.', 'A famous poet who hasn''t written a word in two years unconsciously plagiarizes the work of Stefan George, while dealing with several mistresses, his dimwitted brother, and a murder investigation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/75p0IKwHpSqxPUnDmOq7HdhHYyT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37512'),
  ('379263405345537770', 'Satan''s Cheerleaders', 1977, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Dean Cundey, Greydon Clark', 'Greydon Clark, Alvin L. Fast', 'John Ireland, Yvonne De Carlo, Jack Kruschen, John Carradine, Sydney Chaplin, Jacqulin Cole, Kerry Sherman, Sherry Marks', 'R', 'The janitor at a local high school is actually the scout for a coven of Satanists on the lookout for a virgin to sacrifice. One day he kidnaps the cheerleading squad to use for their rituals. However, unbeknownst to the devil-worshipers, one of the cheerleaders is actually a witch, and has plans of her own for the Satanists.', 'The janitor at a local high school is actually the scout for a coven of Satanists on the lookout for a virgin to sacrifice. One day he kidnaps the cheerleading squad to use for their rituals. However, unbeknownst to the devil-worshipers, one of the cheerleaders is actually a witch, and has plans of her own for the Satanists.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fJ1pXNo6bjGZdO5vWY7gIxg8A7C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29114'),
  ('319151165278090871', 'Satan''s Children', 1975, 'Horror', 'Joe Wiezycki, John Makinen', 'Gary Garrett, Ron Levitt, Joe Wiezycki', 'Stephen White, Eldon Mecham, Joyce Molloy, Kathleen Marie Archer, Rosemary Orlando, Bob Barbour, Robert C. Ray II, John Edwards', 'R', 'Bobby is a troubled teen with problems. After deflecting his father’s insults and his stepsister’s come-ons, Bobby unknowingly ends up at a gay bar. Before long, he’s assaulted by four guys in the back seat of a car. With nowhere else to turn, Bobby joins a cult of Satanists to enact his murderous revenge, but his presence leads to conflicts within Satan''s Children, especially after a lesbian member is damned to Hell. But Bobby proves to be one sick puppy, which he demonstrates in ways that would even make the devil smile. So hilarious, and just plain insane, you''d think Lucifer himself was personally involved!', 'Bobby is a troubled teen with problems. After deflecting his father’s insults and his stepsister’s come-ons, Bobby unknowingly ends up at a gay bar. Before long, he’s assaulted by four guys in the back seat of a car. With nowhere else to turn, Bobby joins a cult of Satanists to enact his murderous revenge, but his presence leads to conflicts within Satan''s Children, especially after a lesbian member is damned to Hell. But Bobby proves to be one sick puppy, which he demonstrates in ways that would even make the devil smile. So hilarious, and just plain insane, you''d think Lucifer himself was personally involved!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mmdFfFa7hnMw4vj3UsrhzCJc71K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54124'),
  ('1080187418160317781', 'Satan''s Little Helper', 2005, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Jeff Lieberman, Dejan Georgevich', 'Jeff Lieberman', 'Alexander Brickel, Katheryn Winnick, Stephen Graham, Amanda Plummer, Wass Stevens, Dan Ziskie, Melisa McGregor, Joshua Annex', 'R', 'A naïve young boy unknowingly becomes the pawn of a serial killer.', 'A naïve young boy unknowingly becomes the pawn of a serial killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/osugwBXcbXZ2IYmzR4rCkrJxiQa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9976'),
  ('985059309889875318', 'Satan''s Mistress', 1982, 'Horror', 'James Polakof, James L. Carter', 'James Polakof, Beverly Johnson', 'Britt Ekland, Lana Wood, Kabir Bedi, Don Galloway, John Carradine, Sherry Scott, Elise-Anne, Tom Hallick', 'R', 'A woman in an unhappy marriage finds sexual fulfillment in her relationship with a ghostly, speechless presence who, obviously, doesn''t quite say who he is.', 'A woman in an unhappy marriage finds sexual fulfillment in her relationship with a ghostly, speechless presence who, obviously, doesn''t quite say who he is.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fjeRvVElEUW9oDMXNfKXvtmypQi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125138'),
  ('807099039693156885', 'Satan''s Rhapsody', 1917, 'Mystery, Drama, Fantasy, Horror, Romance', 'Nino Oxilia, Giorgio Ricci', 'Alberto Fassini', 'Lyda Borelli, Andrea Habay, Ugo Bazzini, Giovanni Cini, Alberto Nepoti, Giulio Bazzini, Giulio Bazzini', null, 'A Faustian tale about an old woman who makes a pact with Mephisto to regain her youth, but in return she must stay away from love. After making the deal, she meets two brothers who fall in love with her.', 'A Faustian tale about an old woman who makes a pact with Mephisto to regain her youth, but in return she must stay away from love. After making the deal, she meets two brothers who fall in love with her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pkE7y47jbxkuXFumXsQQG2s0Yiz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:135551'),
  ('174325182694864653', 'Satan''s Sadists', 1969, 'Drama, Action, Thriller', 'Al Adamson, Gary Graver', 'Greydon Clark', 'Russ Tamblyn, John "Bud" Cardos, Regina Carrol, Scott Brady, Robert Dix, Gary Kent, Greydon Clark, Kent Taylor', 'R', 'The "Satans" are a very cruel biker gang led by Anchor. The gang goes to a diner in the middle of nowhere in the California desert where they begin to terrorize Lew and his patrons and his waitress, Tracy. After a little killing, one of the patrons named Johnny manages to escape from the bikers into the desert. They need to reach a town before the Satans catch up to them and kill them.', 'The "Satans" are a very cruel biker gang led by Anchor. The gang goes to a diner in the middle of nowhere in the California desert where they begin to terrorize Lew and his patrons and his waitress, Tracy. After a little killing, one of the patrons named Johnny manages to escape from the bikers into the desert. They need to reach a town before the Satans catch up to them and kill them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3926XccZ9uUC54UrpD7jVQEzj9C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37042'),
  ('595608437738732730', 'Satan''s School for Girls', 1973, 'Mystery, Horror, TV Movie', 'David Lowell Rich, Tim Southcott', 'Arthur A. Ross', 'Pamela Franklin, Kate Jackson, Lloyd Bochner, Jamie Smith-Jackson, Roy Thinnes, Jo Van Fleet, Cheryl Ladd, Frank Marth', 'R', 'Within the grim walls of Fallbridge College for Girls is Elizabeth Sayers, a new student who, under an assumed name, hopes to learn the truth behind her younger sister''s apparent suicide. Our heroine soon learns that the school is in the clutches of a coven of witches called ''The Five'' — and that she herself has the right satanic qualities to enable The Five to take over the world!', 'Within the grim walls of Fallbridge College for Girls is Elizabeth Sayers, a new student who, under an assumed name, hopes to learn the truth behind her younger sister''s apparent suicide. Our heroine soon learns that the school is in the clutches of a coven of witches called ''The Five'' — and that she herself has the right satanic qualities to enable The Five to take over the world!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vSaIh8f9smY33viUG1WtDpJM4Dh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33543'),
  ('1068413287776335511', 'Satan''s Slave', 1976, 'Horror', 'Denis Balkin, John Metcalfe, Norman J. Warren', 'David McGillivray', 'Michael Gough, Martin Potter, Candace Glendenning, Barbara Kellerman, Michael Craze, Gloria Maley, James Bree, Celia Hewitt', 'R', 'A young girl is caught up in a devil cult run by her wicked uncle and cousin. She can trust no one and even those she thought were dead return to haunt her.', 'A young girl is caught up in a devil cult run by her wicked uncle and cousin. She can trust no one and even those she thought were dead return to haunt her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ke6j0ndC1HX2tRjMNopaBgHBove.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30788'),
