  ('844085214580095260', 'Satan''s Slaves', 2017, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Melisa Hana Kristianty, Rizky Ramadhan, Elvin Martunus', 'Joko Anwar', 'Tara Basro, Bront Palarae, Endy Arfian, Nasar Anuz, M. Adhiyat, Ayu Laksmi, Elly D. Luthan, Arswendy Bening Swara', null, 'After dying from a strange illness that she suffered for three years, a mother returns home to pick up her children.', 'After dying from a strange illness that she suffered for three years, a mother returns home to pick up her children.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k16xOaI9x5fqepxVwBwUJAozsW8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:467012'),
