  ('842459424583919159', 'Satan''s Sword', 1960, 'Action', 'Kenji Misumi, Hiroshi Imai', 'Teinosuke Kinugasa', 'Raizō Ichikawa, Kōjirō Hongō, Tamao Nakamura, Fujiko Yamamoto, Kenji Sugawara, Jun Negami, Chishū Ryū, Michiko Ai', null, 'The Dai-bosatsu toge trilogy is based on Kaizan Nakazato''s unfinished long series of novels (41 books, written from 1913 to 1941). Set in the last period of the Tokugawa Shogunate, Daibosatsu Toge tells the story of Ryunosuke Tsukue, a nihilistic swordmaster who doesn''t hesitate to kill anyone, bad or good.', 'The Dai-bosatsu toge trilogy is based on Kaizan Nakazato''s unfinished long series of novels (41 books, written from 1913 to 1941). Set in the last period of the Tokugawa Shogunate, Daibosatsu Toge tells the story of Ryunosuke Tsukue, a nihilistic swordmaster who doesn''t hesitate to kill anyone, bad or good.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vU5XcrP9sdI32PlrUvVc1YKyRaY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:294709'),
  ('235533819088057759', 'Satan''s Sword III: The Final Chapter', 1961, 'Drama, Action', 'Kazuo Mori', 'Teinosuke Kinugasa', 'Raizō Ichikawa, Tamao Nakamura, Katsuhiko Kobayashi, Kōjirō Hongō, Hajime Mitamura, Saburo Niwamata, Ryūzō Shimada, Matasaburô Niwa', null, 'Disguised as a beggar monk, Ryunosuke is harassed along the road by the rowdy members of a country dojo or fencing school malingering outside their fencing hall. The third film in the Satan''s Sword trilogy.', 'Disguised as a beggar monk, Ryunosuke is harassed along the road by the rowdy members of a country dojo or fencing school malingering outside their fencing hall. The third film in the Satan''s Sword trilogy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fX7YyS53rrqKOyo6CfmQinArcs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:329740'),
