  ('898811408863791704', 'Satan''s Triangle', 1975, 'TV Movie, Mystery, Horror', 'Sutton Roley, Leonard J. South', 'William Read Woodfield', 'Kim Novak, Doug McClure, Alejandro Rey, Ed Lauter, Jim Davis, Michael Conrad, Titos Vandis, Zitto Kazann', null, 'The female survivor of a shipwreck and two Coast Guard helicopter pilots sent to rescue her find themselves trapped in a mysterious part of the ocean known as Satan''s Triangle.', 'The female survivor of a shipwreck and two Coast Guard helicopter pilots sent to rescue her find themselves trapped in a mysterious part of the ocean known as Satan''s Triangle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nzrBT5JrxA2bgljMxtlFdfu24fc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87895'),
  ('294383580755367307', 'Satan''s Waitin''', 1954, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Friz Freleng, Carl W. Stalling', null, 'Mel Blanc', null, 'Sylvester''s carnivorous pursuit of Tweety Bird continues, winding up the cat''s spirit in Hell, where he meets a satanic bulldog.', 'Sylvester''s carnivorous pursuit of Tweety Bird continues, winding up the cat''s spirit in Hell, where he meets a satanic bulldog.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6P4unEU5BwF1O34tsq8IcgvhUJx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:235804'),
  ('38876382646961534', 'Satanás - Profile of a Killer', 2007, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Andrés Baiz, Mauricio Vidal, Martín Torres', 'Andrés Baiz', 'Damián Alcázar, Blas Jaramillo, Marcela Mar, Marcela Valencia, Isabel Gaona, Teresa Gutiérrez, María Cecilia Sánchez, Hernán Méndez', 'R', 'Based on the Mario Mendoza''s book and inspired by true events, tells three interconnected stories happening in the eve of the infamous Pozzetto Massacre.', 'Based on the Mario Mendoza''s book and inspired by true events, tells three interconnected stories happening in the eve of the infamous Pozzetto Massacre.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ruw3QrxGpHLlCr9lcgmncSvYpXT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33817'),
  ('394881789480436371', 'Satanic', 2016, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Jeffrey G. Hunt', 'Anthony Jaswinski', 'Sarah Hyland, Clara Mamet, Steven Krueger, Justin Chon, Sophie Dalah, Anthony Carrigan, Devanny Pinn, Marc Barnes', 'R', 'Four friends on their way to Coachella stop off in Los Angeles to tour true-crime occult sites, only to encounter a mysterious young runaway who puts them on a terrifying path to ultimate horror.', 'Four friends on their way to Coachella stop off in Los Angeles to tour true-crime occult sites, only to encounter a mysterious young runaway who puts them on a terrifying path to ultimate horror.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/me74BRzuDvzD5LuAPU4EZOJtsyU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:400411'),
  ('798443952388941830', 'Satanic Hispanics', 2022, 'Horror, Thriller, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Demián Rugna, Mike Mendez, Alejandro Brugués', 'Lino K. Villa, Alejandro Mendez, Demián Rugna', 'Efren Ramirez, Greg Grunberg, Sonya Eddy, Lombardo Boyar, Jessica Cameron, Demián Salomón, Victoria Maurette, Hemky Madera', 'R', 'When police raid a house in El Paso, they find it full of dead Latinos, and only one survivor. He’s known as The Traveler, and when they take him to the station for questioning, he tells them those lands are full of magic and talks about the horrors he’s encountered in his long time on this earth, about portals to other worlds, mythical creatures, demons and the undead. Stories about Latin American legends.', 'When police raid a house in El Paso, they find it full of dead Latinos, and only one survivor. He’s known as The Traveler, and when they take him to the station for questioning, he tells them those lands are full of magic and talks about the horrors he’s encountered in his long time on this earth, about portals to other worlds, mythical creatures, demons and the undead. Stories about Latin American legends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8oRsWDVKBiLE7laQLH6uwgmKioE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1015080'),
  ('297864571737502960', 'Satanic Pandemonium', 1975, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Gilberto Martínez Solares, Jorge Stahl Jr.', 'Gilberto Martínez Solares', 'Cecilia Pezet, Enrique Rocha, Delia Magaña, Clemencia Colin, Veronika Con K., Daniel Albertos, Laura Montalvo, Yayoi Tokawa', null, 'Sister Maria is known in the convent for her good works and charity, but, in the secret depths of her sexual fantasies, she is tormented by visions of another world - a world where her forbidden passions are allowed to run free. In this world Satan is her master. As her acts of violence and blasphemy mount, Maria realizes that she has been chosen by the Devil to destroy the convent and lead her sister nuns into hell!', 'Sister Maria is known in the convent for her good works and charity, but, in the secret depths of her sexual fantasies, she is tormented by visions of another world - a world where her forbidden passions are allowed to run free. In this world Satan is her master. As her acts of violence and blasphemy mount, Maria realizes that she has been chosen by the Devil to destroy the convent and lead her sister nuns into hell!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k6LZn3greNmaYhySVnwUkkDmlpo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57084'),
  ('194168694458942565', 'Satanic Panic', 2019, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Chelsea Stardust, Mark Evans', 'Grady Hendrix', 'Hayley Griffith, Rebecca Romijn, Arden Myrin, Ruby Modine, AJ Bowen, Jordan Ladd, Jeff Daniel Phillips, Jerry O''Connell', null, 'A pizza delivery girl is suddenly in for the fight of her young life when encountering a group of Satanists in need of a virgin to ritually sacrifice.', 'A pizza delivery girl is suddenly in for the fight of her young life when encountering a group of Satanists in need of a virgin to ritually sacrifice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qnxAGrRwBynkQXCs4Dh6zpEVajN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:539364'),
  ('229601694373535850', 'Satanik', 1968, 'Science Fiction, Thriller, Crime', 'Piero Vivarelli, Pupi Avati, Silvano Ippoliti', 'Eduardo Manzanos, Piero Vivarelli', 'Magda Konopka, Julio Peña, Umberto Raho, Luigi Montini, Armando Calvo, Mimma Ippoliti, Isarco Ravaioli, Nerio Bernardi', null, 'A youth potion transforms an old crone into a ravishing beauty. Unfortunately, her new-found gorgeousness forces the heroine to form a pact with the Devil.', 'A youth potion transforms an old crone into a ravishing beauty. Unfortunately, her new-found gorgeousness forces the heroine to form a pact with the Devil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nF6XJ4OqreTaTlTuxmEqTzsXxLG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29351'),
  ('131614126480721892', 'Satanis: The Devil''s Mass', 1970, 'Documentary', 'Ray Laurent, Richard Eisman, Carlon Tanner', null, 'Isaac Bonewits, Anton LaVey, Diane LaVey, Togare', null, 'The film is a study of Anton Szandor LaVey, leader of a cult of devil worshipers in San Francisco. He and his Church of Satan are shown performing a black mass, in which a nude woman serves as an altar and a boa constrictor wraps itself around a naked witch. Newsreel footage is included in which LaVey''s neighbors are interviewed about the lion which he kept in his house until complaints resulted in the animal''s removal to a zoo. The ideology of the Church of Satan is discussed--guilt rejection, sexual freedom, and self-indulgence.', 'The film is a study of Anton Szandor LaVey, leader of a cult of devil worshipers in San Francisco. He and his Church of Satan are shown performing a black mass, in which a nude woman serves as an altar and a boa constrictor wraps itself around a naked witch. Newsreel footage is included in which LaVey''s neighbors are interviewed about the lion which he kept in his house until complaints resulted in the animal''s removal to a zoo. The ideology of the Church of Satan is discussed--guilt rejection, sexual freedom, and self-indulgence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Zi9oh13UVd0mZdJv7LzaHDqAmA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:99536'),
  ('284223831917018034', 'Satellite in the Sky', 1956, 'Drama, Science Fiction', 'Paul Dickson, James Wilson, Georges Périnal', 'John C. Mather, J.T. McIntosh, Edith Dell', 'Kieron Moore, Lois Maxwell, Donald Wolfit, Bryan Forbes, Jimmy Hanley, Barry Keegan, Walter Hudd, Donald Gray', 'NR', 'A bomb dooms the first space satellite, manned by a selfless crew, a stowaway reporter (Lois Maxwell) and a mad scientist (Donald Wolfit).', 'A bomb dooms the first space satellite, manned by a selfless crew, a stowaway reporter (Lois Maxwell) and a mad scientist (Donald Wolfit).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3V42gaTtInYMbKFQAeuFoCUb8DG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31984'),
  ('757876865027244151', 'Sathi Leelavathi', 1995, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Balu Mahendra, Balu Mahendra', 'Balu Mahendra, Kamal Haasan', 'Ramesh Aravind, Heera Rajgopal, Kalpana, Kamal Haasan, Kovai Sarala, Chokkalinga Bhagavathar, Raja, Ra. Sankaran', null, 'Arun, a married man, has an affair with Priya as he dislikes his wife Leelavathi, who is plain-looking and overweight. When she discovers Arun''s affair, she plots with Dr. Sakthivel to win Arun back.', 'Arun, a married man, has an affair with Priya as he dislikes his wife Leelavathi, who is plain-looking and overweight. When she discovers Arun''s affair, she plots with Dr. Sakthivel to win Arun back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gJjxDw7uogiHuDtvkxk3GKD9UGu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66352'),
  ('729623412404552555', 'Satiemania', 1978, 'Animation', 'Zdenko Gašparović', 'Zdenko Gašparović', null, null, 'The fauna of the megalopolis, the jungle of the supermarket, the bedlam of brothels and bars, the effect of the bars in the fog, the swaying ears of corn, the swaying of men hanging from the gallows, the ripple of water – seen by the eye of the animator…', 'The fauna of the megalopolis, the jungle of the supermarket, the bedlam of brothels and bars, the effect of the bars in the fog, the swaying ears of corn, the swaying of men hanging from the gallows, the ripple of water – seen by the eye of the animator…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aDdVvTHt2FfFPaf3h2cI62RDEyI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:129339'),
  ('1053830488194989157', 'Satin Rouge', 2002, 'Music, Drama', 'Raja Amari, Diane Baratier', 'Raja Amari', 'Hiam Abbass, Hend El Fahem, Maher Kamoun, Monia Hichri, Faouzia Badr, Nadra Lamloum, Abou Moez El Fazaa, Salah Miled', null, 'After the death of her husband, Lilia''s life revolves solely around her teenage daughter, Salma. Whilst looking for Salma late one night, Lilia stumbles upon a belly dance cabaret and though initially reserved and taken aback by the culture of the place, Lilia gets consistently drawn back to it. She befriends one of the belly dancers and is encouraged into dancing for the audience. Lilia also starts a romance with one of the cabaret''s musicians, who unbeknown to both of them, is also romancing Salma.', 'After the death of her husband, Lilia''s life revolves solely around her teenage daughter, Salma. Whilst looking for Salma late one night, Lilia stumbles upon a belly dance cabaret and though initially reserved and taken aback by the culture of the place, Lilia gets consistently drawn back to it. She befriends one of the belly dancers and is encouraged into dancing for the audience. Lilia also starts a romance with one of the cabaret''s musicians, who unbeknown to both of them, is also romancing Salma.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xtg4Ms8oeot4hScuYbAGJfAQSle.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:97447'),
  ('947800739475123885', 'Satiricosissimo', 1970, 'Comedy', 'Tino Santoni, Alessandro Metz, Mariano Laurenti', 'Roberto Gianviti, Dino Verde', 'Franco Franchi, Ciccio Ingrassia, Edwige Fenech, Giancarlo Badessi, Arturo Dominici, Karin Schubert, Pino Ferrara, Linda Sini', null, 'Ciccio loves very much the novel Satyricon of Petronius Arbiter, although his friend Franco does not understand him.', 'Ciccio loves very much the novel Satyricon of Petronius Arbiter, although his friend Franco does not understand him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cznXhQbVp3eX7Nv0svG1lxwns7J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:316110'),
  ('1134159352267929059', 'Satisfaction', 1988, 'Comedy, Music, Romance', 'Thomas Del Ruth, Joan Freeman', 'Charles Purpura', 'Justine Bateman, Liam Neeson, Trini Alvarado, Scott Coffey, Britta Phillips, Julia Roberts, Debbie Harry, Chris Nash', 'PG-13', 'When a young rock group called The Mystery gets its first gig at a club, it''s an opportunity to see what life is all about. Fresh out of high school, the rockers are hired by an exclusive beach resort thanks to a faded ''60s songwriter. There, they meet with romance and adventure. But street-smart lead singer Jennie Lee faces a dilemma: pursue her budding career or finish high school.', 'When a young rock group called The Mystery gets its first gig at a club, it''s an opportunity to see what life is all about. Fresh out of high school, the rockers are hired by an exclusive beach resort thanks to a faded ''60s songwriter. There, they meet with romance and adventure. But street-smart lead singer Jennie Lee faces a dilemma: pursue her budding career or finish high school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yvLIYS4lDfsQL4khLly73cDczaM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17126'),
