  ('365478005121520326', 'Satoshi Kon: The Illusionist', 2021, 'Documentary', 'Pascal-Alex Vincent, Gordon Spooner, Toshiyuki Kiyomura', 'Pascal-Alex Vincent', 'Mamoru Hosoda, Rodney Rothman, Mamoru Oshii, Megumi Hayashibara, Marc Caro, Jérémy Clapin, Junko Iwao, Masao Maruyama', null, 'A subtle portrait of Japanese director Satoshi Kon by the specialist of Japanese cinema Pascal-Alex Vincent and a dive into a rich work. With interviews of the greatest Japanese, French and American directors inspired by his work.', 'A subtle portrait of Japanese director Satoshi Kon by the specialist of Japanese cinema Pascal-Alex Vincent and a dive into a rich work. With interviews of the greatest Japanese, French and American directors inspired by his work.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7cNUArMeqerwOwy2NDYRnh5PrVW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:809488'),
  ('611372612975246442', 'Satte Pe Satta', 1982, 'Comedy', 'Raj N. Sippy, Anwar Siraj', 'Satish Bhatnagar, Jyoti Swaroop, Kader Khan', 'Amitabh Bachchan, Hema Malini, Amjad Khan, Shakti Kapoor, Sachin Pilgaonkar, Ranjeeta Kaur, Kanwarjeet Paintal, Sudhir', null, 'After the passing away of their parents, Ravi Anand, the eldest of seven brothers, takes it upon himself to raise them - albeit a little wild and kinda animal-like. The brothers all sport long beards, hate taking showers/baths, and above all hate Ravi bossing them around. rest of the story is about how a look a like Ravi comes in to there life', 'After the passing away of their parents, Ravi Anand, the eldest of seven brothers, takes it upon himself to raise them - albeit a little wild and kinda animal-like. The brothers all sport long beards, hate taking showers/baths, and above all hate Ravi bossing them around. rest of the story is about how a look a like Ravi comes in to there life', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xBBHP0BUdu4RT1VTmQCsQ1csYmT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33145'),
