  ('66333564072386082', 'Saturday Afternoon', 1926, 'Comedy', 'Harry Edwards', null, 'Harry Langdon, Alice Ward, Vernon Dent, Ruth Hiatt, Peggy Montgomery, Leo Willis, Anna Dodge, Roger Moore', null, 'Harry and his friend have planned to go out for an afternoon of fun. But first, Harry must figure out how to slip away from his domineering wife with some money to spend...', 'Harry and his friend have planned to go out for an afternoon of fun. But first, Harry must figure out how to slip away from his domineering wife with some money to spend...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xEaoJH7zbsKUGs3XX4GBiiZsmsF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:189634'),
