  ('937327592680744168', 'Saturday Fiction', 2021, 'Action, Drama', 'Lou Ye, Zeng Jian', 'Ma Yingli', 'Gong Li, Mark Chao You-Ting, Joe Odagiri, Pascal Greggory, Tom Wlaschiha, Huang Xiangli, Ayumu Nakajima, Wang Chuanjun', null, 'Iconic actress Jean Yu returns to Japanese-occupied China to star in a play directed by her former lover. However, her undercover work for the Allies soon places her life in grave danger.', 'Iconic actress Jean Yu returns to Japanese-occupied China to star in a play directed by her former lover. However, her undercover work for the Allies soon places her life in grave danger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jZKoIzhJn6HKLVYev3XEjDkMHwh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:497834'),
  ('440310138092030219', 'Saturday Night', 2024, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Eric Steelberg, Ashley Fidalgo Fogleman, Drew Monahan', 'Gil Kenan, Jason Reitman', 'Gabriel LaBelle, Rachel Sennott, Cory Michael Smith, Ella Hunt, Dylan O''Brien, Emily Fairn, Matt Wood, Lamorne Morris', 'R', 'At 11:30pm on October 11, 1975, a ferocious troupe of young comedians and writers changed television forever. This is the story of what happened behind the scenes in the 90 minutes leading up to the first broadcast of Saturday Night Live.', 'At 11:30pm on October 11, 1975, a ferocious troupe of young comedians and writers changed television forever. This is the story of what happened behind the scenes in the 90 minutes leading up to the first broadcast of Saturday Night Live.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oCf5O6uxooTvRwKVnLHwGqZUifq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1120911'),
  ('938986422350969991', 'Saturday Night and Sunday Morning', 1960, 'Drama, Romance', 'Karel Reisz, Freddie Francis, Tom Pevsner', 'Alan Sillitoe', 'Albert Finney, Shirley Anne Field, Rachel Roberts, Hylda Baker, Norman Rossington, Bryan Pringle, Robert Cawdron, Avis Bunnage', null, 'A 22-year-old factory worker lets loose on the weekends: drinking, brawling, and dating two women, one of whom is older and married.', 'A 22-year-old factory worker lets loose on the weekends: drinking, brawling, and dating two women, one of whom is older and married.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ifhjfo8lZoJ9dvDQiWcnc3GeFK4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37230'),
  ('152413528499621138', 'Saturday Night at the Baths', 1975, 'Drama, Romance', 'David Buckley, Ralf D. Bode', 'Franklin Khedouri, David Buckley', 'Robert Aberdeen, Ellen Sheppard, Don Scotti, Steve Ostrow, Phillip Owens, Jane Olivor, R. Douglas Brautingham, Paul Ott', 'R', 'When struggling pianist Michael lands a job at the legendary Continental Baths in NYC, his wife Tracy encourages him, emphasizing how special the institution is. Michael, however, struggles with his own homophobia, yet at the same time, starts developing feelings for his confident and sexually free co-worker, Scotti.', 'When struggling pianist Michael lands a job at the legendary Continental Baths in NYC, his wife Tracy encourages him, emphasizing how special the institution is. Michael, however, struggles with his own homophobia, yet at the same time, starts developing feelings for his confident and sexually free co-worker, Scotti.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2w4Sf8EqkfsyrLAIJ7S5gHyIp1G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47677'),
  ('439028699178417009', 'Saturday Night Fever', 1977, 'Music, Romance', 'John Badham, Ralf D. Bode, Joseph Ray', 'Norman Wexler', 'John Travolta, Karen Lynn Gorney, Barry Miller, Joseph Cali, Paul Pape, Donna Pescow, Bruce Ornstein, Julie Bovasso', 'R', 'Tony spends his Saturdays at a disco where his stylish moves raise his popularity among the patrons. But his life outside the disco is not easy and things change when he gets attracted to Stephanie.', 'Tony spends his Saturdays at a disco where his stylish moves raise his popularity among the patrons. But his life outside the disco is not easy and things change when he gets attracted to Stephanie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ylA7E5Md21aqgzxbwa2dFxX8LKV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11009'),
  ('131627415592003640', 'Saturday Night''s Main Event XXXVII', 2024, 'Action', null, null, 'Cody Rhodes, Kevin Steen, Chelsea Cardona, Kimberly Benson, Stephanie Hym Lee, Walter Hahn, Fergal Devitt, Luis Martinez', null, 'Undisputed WWE Champion Cody Rhodes will go head-to-head with Kevin Owens as Saturday Night''s Main Event returns to NBC. Plus World Tag Team Champion Finn Bálor will face "The Ring General" Gunther for the World Heavyweight Title. The Women''s World Championship will be on the line when Liv Morgan defends her title against IYO SKY.', 'Undisputed WWE Champion Cody Rhodes will go head-to-head with Kevin Owens as Saturday Night''s Main Event returns to NBC. Plus World Tag Team Champion Finn Bálor will face "The Ring General" Gunther for the World Heavyweight Title. The Women''s World Championship will be on the line when Liv Morgan defends her title against IYO SKY.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4wVEOOX8VEGWwEuuIWuN3XT1Avq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1397347'),
  ('1121630155562527887', 'Saturday the 14th', 1981, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Horror', 'Daniel Lacambre, Howard R. Cohen', 'Howard R. Cohen', 'Richard Benjamin, Paula Prentiss, Jeffrey Tambor, Severn Darden, Kari Michaelsen, Kevin Brando, Rosemary DeCamp, Carole Androsky', 'PG', 'After his family moves to a new house, a young boy discovers a mysterious book that details a curse hanging over the date of Saturday the 14th. Opening the book releases a band of monsters into the house and the family must join together to save themselves and their neighborhood.', 'After his family moves to a new house, a young boy discovers a mysterious book that details a curse hanging over the date of Saturday the 14th. Opening the book releases a band of monsters into the house and the family must join together to save themselves and their neighborhood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e7FmmDumVkPxr9urQABScaOSEAQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20472'),
  ('69763824877634201', 'Saturday the 14th Strikes Back', 1988, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Horror', 'Howard R. Cohen, Levie Isaacks', 'Howard R. Cohen', 'Ray Walston, Avery Schreiber, Patty McCormack, Jason Presson, Julianne McNamara, Rhonda Aldrich, Daniel Will-Harris, Pamela Stonebrook', 'PG', 'Eddie and his family have just inherited a spooky wreck of a house. What they do not know about the house is that it was built over an evil passage way, but they are soon to discover the wacky evil it releases.', 'Eddie and his family have just inherited a spooky wreck of a house. What they do not know about the house is that it was built over an evil passage way, but they are soon to discover the wacky evil it releases.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AljNJqhUl2cpQRyMRbjIENDzijr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45880'),
  ('913209116948250274', 'Saturday, Sunday & Monday', 2004, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Pasquale Mari, Mario Amura, Paolo Sorrentino', null, 'Anna Bonaiuto, Alessandra D''Elia, Toni Servillo, Roberto De Francesco, Enrico Ianniello, Gigio Morra, Monica Nappo, Betti Pedrazzi', null, 'Although this sounds like a weekend like many others, in the Prior house the atmosphere is rather tense because of some nervousness on the part of individual members of the family, especially the father, Peppino, who gets angry with anyone who happens to shoot: with their children, Juliana and Roberto, and his sister, aunt Meme. Meanwhile, his wife Rosa is dedicated to the preparation of the sauce, which she will serve for Sunday''s lunch, to which she invited the neighbors, the accountant Ianniello and his wife.', 'Although this sounds like a weekend like many others, in the Prior house the atmosphere is rather tense because of some nervousness on the part of individual members of the family, especially the father, Peppino, who gets angry with anyone who happens to shoot: with their children, Juliana and Roberto, and his sister, aunt Meme. Meanwhile, his wife Rosa is dedicated to the preparation of the sauce, which she will serve for Sunday''s lunch, to which she invited the neighbors, the accountant Ianniello and his wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/diGbBC2Nnk1ekaB1V30R0pUbQf3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:386138'),
  ('299218825371802848', 'Saturday, Sunday and Friday', 1979, 'Comedy', 'Castellano, Sergio Martino, Pipolo', 'Castellano, Pipolo, José Vicente Puente', 'Edwige Fenech, Barbara Bouchet, Adriano Celentano, Lino Banfi, Milena Vukotić, Daniele Vargas, Lory Del Santo, Gino Pagnani', null, 'SABATO (first episode): A company receives the visit of a very very important person. This person works for a biggest Japanese society, and this encounter is decisive for the small Italian company. DOMENICA (second episode): After a hard day of job, a man returns in it''s house for sleep. But a series of facts hinder this, and the poor man does not succeed to sleep. VENERDI (third episode): A famous and rich creator of sexy ballets have various problems with a dancer. She want to leave the theater and marry a Mafia man.', 'SABATO (first episode): A company receives the visit of a very very important person. This person works for a biggest Japanese society, and this encounter is decisive for the small Italian company. DOMENICA (second episode): After a hard day of job, a man returns in it''s house for sleep. But a series of facts hinder this, and the poor man does not succeed to sleep. VENERDI (third episode): A famous and rich creator of sexy ballets have various problems with a dancer. She want to leave the theater and marry a Mafia man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kssWVVBgHv6yBr7T605ICNfdvJ4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67180'),
  ('144202477690031822', 'Saturday, Sunday and Monday', 1990, 'Comedy', 'Lina Wertmüller, Carlo Tafani', 'Raffaele La Capria, Lina Wertmüller', 'Sophia Loren, Luca De Filippo, Luciano De Crescenzo, Alessandra Mussolini, Jérôme Anger, Isabelle Illiers, Nuccia Fumo, Ester Carloni', null, 'Rosa, a mature mother of several children, is concerned that her beloved husband Don Peppino is losing interest in her, and does his best to provoke some jealousy in him. She is a masterful cook, and if her romantic charms are fading, her culinary skills are not. By one means and another, and after some amusing confrontations, she succeeds in keeping her husband from taking her for granted and harmony is restored.', 'Rosa, a mature mother of several children, is concerned that her beloved husband Don Peppino is losing interest in her, and does his best to provoke some jealousy in him. She is a masterful cook, and if her romantic charms are fading, her culinary skills are not. By one means and another, and after some amusing confrontations, she succeeds in keeping her husband from taking her for granted and harmony is restored.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yj9J3pSPtsYQ7SVJ4XEgYz46vEk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2814'),
  ('1151188197884223966', 'Saturn 3', 1980, 'Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Stanley Donen, Billy Williams', 'Martin Amis', 'Farrah Fawcett, Kirk Douglas, Harvey Keitel, Ed Bishop, Roy Dotrice, Stephanie English, Jill Goldston, Vera Goulet', 'R', 'In the future, Earth is overcrowded and the population relies on distant bases to be fed. In the Saturn 3 station, Major Adam and the scientist Alex, who is also his lover and has never been on Earth, have been researching hydroponics for three years in the base alone with their dog Sally. Captain Benson arrives Saturn 3 with Hector, incapable to controlling his emotions he transfers his homicidal tendency and insanity to Hector. Now Major Adam and Alex are trapped in the station with a dangerous psychopath robot.', 'In the future, Earth is overcrowded and the population relies on distant bases to be fed. In the Saturn 3 station, Major Adam and the scientist Alex, who is also his lover and has never been on Earth, have been researching hydroponics for three years in the base alone with their dog Sally. Captain Benson arrives Saturn 3 with Hector, incapable to controlling his emotions he transfers his homicidal tendency and insanity to Hector. Now Major Adam and Alex are trapped in the station with a dangerous psychopath robot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zAoLR1azwd8QbglnjWpOwJ4PI6C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19761'),
  ('243227911150667441', 'Saturn Bowling', 2022, 'Drama, Thriller, Crime', 'Patricia Mazuy, Simon Beaufils, Antoinette Boulat', 'Patricia Mazuy, Yves Thomas', 'Arieh Worthalter, Achille Reggiani, Y Lan Lucas, Leïla Muse, Olivier Faliez, Frédéric van den Driessche, Elisa Hartel, Emmanuel Matte', null, 'In a family-owned bowling alley, tension arises between two brothers following their father''s death. Meanwhile one of them, a cop, is investigating a series of disturbing murders. Both brothers soon find themselves trapped in a looming darkness.', 'In a family-owned bowling alley, tension arises between two brothers following their father''s death. Meanwhile one of them, a cop, is investigating a series of disturbing murders. Both brothers soon find themselves trapped in a looming darkness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ltXkE4Dgeo2MQDcHoziKQJ1LHZY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:848950'),
  ('1114786957035644869', 'Saturn in Opposition', 2007, 'Drama', 'Ferzan Özpetek, Gianluca Mazzella, Alberto Caviglia', 'Ferzan Özpetek, Gianni Romoli', 'Pierfrancesco Favino, Stefano Accorsi, Margherita Buy, Serra Yılmaz, Ennio Fantastichini, Ambra Angiolini, Luca Argentero, Filippo Timi', null, 'This film focuses on contemporary 30- and 40-somethings trying to make sense of their lives in an age in which the old certainties have disappeared. Lorenzo and Davide make their lives together within a circle that includes Antonio and Angelica, married with children; Nerval and her policeman husband.', 'This film focuses on contemporary 30- and 40-somethings trying to make sense of their lives in an age in which the old certainties have disappeared. Lorenzo and Davide make their lives together within a circle that includes Antonio and Angelica, married with children; Nerval and her policeman husband.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qpzR06PrVDaJGBaSngEMUhVhhw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22373'),
  ('1147859858943947190', 'Saturn Return', 2024, 'Drama, Music', 'Isaki Lacuesta, Pol Rodríguez, Takuro Takeuchi', 'Fernando Navarro, Isaki Lacuesta', 'Daniel Ibáñez, Cristalino, Stéphanie Magnin, Eduardo Rejón, Mafo, Chesco Ruiz, Julen Clarke, Jan Caplin', null, 'A rock band has to record their third LP, which will either propel them to stardom or fade into oblivion. Despite executives’ reservations, their idea is to have the recording take place in New York. But everything complicates, and the creative process turns into a hellish ordeal. A love triangle with all its consequences unfolds, band members desert, romantic relationships shatter, rehearsals become rampant with drugs and alcohol, and the unbearable pressure from the record label leads to endless fights and arguments only interrupted by fleeting moments of happiness. Meanwhile, unknowingly, they will be composing an album that will leave a mark on an entire generation.', 'A rock band has to record their third LP, which will either propel them to stardom or fade into oblivion. Despite executives’ reservations, their idea is to have the recording take place in New York. But everything complicates, and the creative process turns into a hellish ordeal. A love triangle with all its consequences unfolds, band members desert, romantic relationships shatter, rehearsals become rampant with drugs and alcohol, and the unbearable pressure from the record label leads to endless fights and arguments only interrupted by fleeting moments of happiness. Meanwhile, unknowingly, they will be composing an album that will leave a mark on an entire generation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4NtkEJNctcf2MztNBA6RX4RS9Iw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:977548'),
  ('480247105287939155', 'Saturnin', 1994, 'Comedy', 'Jiří Věrčák, Josef Špelda, Magdalena Čechová', 'Jiří Věrčák, Magdalena Wagnerová', 'Ondřej Havelka, Lucie Zedníčková, Oldřich Vízner, Milan Lasica, Lubomír Lipský, Jana Synková, Petr Vacek, Jitka Molavcová', null, 'Saturnin is a servant who becomes his master''s master. A young man of good social standing and upbringing, somewhat conservative, acquires, through no fault of his own, a servant named Saturnin. Saturnin effectively becomes his employer''s master and causes a series of surprising twists and situations in his previously peaceful life. Without Saturnin, these would be difficult to manage. If only because without him, they would probably never have happened.', 'Saturnin is a servant who becomes his master''s master. A young man of good social standing and upbringing, somewhat conservative, acquires, through no fault of his own, a servant named Saturnin. Saturnin effectively becomes his employer''s master and causes a series of surprising twists and situations in his previously peaceful life. Without Saturnin, these would be difficult to manage. If only because without him, they would probably never have happened.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xbfxrDU1PO9EaLyPzMqXo0eEK9I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48641'),
  ('1088473079177753141', 'Satya', 1998, 'Crime, Drama', 'Ram Gopal Varma, Gerard Hooper, Mazhar Kamran', 'Anurag Kashyap, Saurabh Shukla', 'J. D. Chakravarthi, Manoj Bajpayee, Urmila Matondkar, Shefali Shah, Saurabh Shukla, Govind Namdeo, Makrand Deshpande, Paresh Rawal', null, 'A young man named Satya comes to Mumbai from South India in search of a job. Jailed for something he did not do, the once-honest young man meets an underworld boss, Bhiku Mhatre in jail and joins his gang.', 'A young man named Satya comes to Mumbai from South India in search of a job. Jailed for something he did not do, the once-honest young man meets an underworld boss, Bhiku Mhatre in jail and joins his gang.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wwgpEEGU5RVu5hM7AZa6oiivcln.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21502'),
  ('321895816525507470', 'Satyagraha', 2013, 'Drama', 'Prakash Jha, Sachin K. Krishn', 'Prakash Jha, Anjum Rajabali', 'Amitabh Bachchan, Ajay Devgn, Kareena Kapoor Khan, Arjun Rampal, Amrita Rao, Manoj Bajpayee, Vipin Sharma', null, 'A corporate go-getter sees his priorities shift when a personal tragedy brings him face-to-face with political corruption.', 'A corporate go-getter sees his priorities shift when a personal tragedy brings him face-to-face with political corruption.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wJQh5a8KsnwajTqGzd4gt2akmQO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:217446'),
  ('881704203568414696', 'Satyam Shivam Sundaram', 1978, 'Drama, Romance, Music', 'Raj Kapoor, Allauddin Khan Qureshi, Radhu Karmakar', 'Jainendra Jain', 'Shashi Kapoor, Zeenat Aman, Kanhaiyalal Chaturvedi, A.K. Hangal, David Abraham Cheulkar, Hari Shivdasani, Leela Chitnis, Sheetal', null, 'Rajeev falls in love with Roopa, a beautiful singer who hides the fact that half her face is disfigured. However, he soon discovers her secret after marriage and begins to ignore her.', 'Rajeev falls in love with Roopa, a beautiful singer who hides the fact that half her face is disfigured. However, he soon discovers her secret after marriage and begins to ignore her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5k5owbottAeIk7gPjFnnkmO94wQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:143975'),
  ('741652062000805767', 'Satyameva Jayate', 2018, 'Action, Thriller', 'Milap Zaveri, Nigam Bomzan', 'Milap Zaveri', 'John Abraham, Manoj Bajpayee, Aisha Sharma, Amruta Khanvilkar, Tota Roy Chowdhury, Chetan Pandit, Nora Fatehi, Uday Nene', null, 'DCP Shivansh has been tasked to catch Vir, the man behind police killings in the city. Both are eventually against the same enemy but divided by a fine line, the law.', 'DCP Shivansh has been tasked to catch Vir, the man behind police killings in the city. Both are eventually against the same enemy but divided by a fine line, the law.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8YCos8rd6QzGvhDp0oBS8achffk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:531597'),
  ('919579457322341375', 'Satyameva Jayate 2', 2021, 'Action, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Kavish Sinha, Ajay Thakur, Mohd Amin Khatib', 'Milap Zaveri', 'John Abraham, Divya Khossla, Nora Fatehi, Gautami Kapoor, Anup Soni, Harsh Chhaya, Shaad Randhawa, Rajendra Gupta', null, 'Satya Azad, an upright Home Minister wants to cleanse the country of corruption with his Anti-Corruption Bill. However, it fails to get enough ‘Ayes’, not only from his allies, but also from his wife Vidya a member of the Opposition, who votes ‘Nay’ in the Vidhan Sabha. When a couple of gruesome killings take place in the city, ACP Jay Azad is brought in to nab the murderer, never mind his motive.', 'Satya Azad, an upright Home Minister wants to cleanse the country of corruption with his Anti-Corruption Bill. However, it fails to get enough ‘Ayes’, not only from his allies, but also from his wife Vidya a member of the Opposition, who votes ‘Nay’ in the Vidhan Sabha. When a couple of gruesome killings take place in the city, ACP Jay Azad is brought in to nab the murderer, never mind his motive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y1ebOObyi97slwBTljIifE67PR5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:695973'),
  ('142192673522252502', 'Satyaprem Ki Katha', 2023, 'Drama, Romance', 'Sameer Vidwans, Ayananka Bose, Mukesh Chhabra', 'Karan Shrikant Sharma', 'Kartik Aaryan, Kiara Advani, Gajraj Rao, Supriya Pathak, Siddharth Randeria, Shikha Talsania, Rajpal Yadav, Anuradha Patel', null, 'A middle-class boy in Ahmedabad, Satyaprem falling in one-sided love with Katha, who is coping with her breakup with Tapan. Through the journey, they discover each other''s life and complement in accomplishing what was left halfway.', 'A middle-class boy in Ahmedabad, Satyaprem falling in one-sided love with Katha, who is coping with her breakup with Tapan. Through the journey, they discover each other''s life and complement in accomplishing what was left halfway.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/99DkKzMm7SrNw8p6jozCkKmOnTy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1020376'),
  ('247107425552733820', 'Satyricon', 1969, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Federico Fellini, Giuseppe Rotunno, Liliana Betti', 'Brunello Rondi', 'Martin Potter, Hiram Keller, Max Born, Salvo Randone, Mario Romagnoli, Magali Noël, Capucine, Fanfulla', 'R', 'After his young lover, Gitone, leaves him for another man, Encolpio decides to kill himself, but a sudden earthquake destroys his home before he has a chance to do so. Now wandering around Rome in the time of Nero, Encolpio encounters one bizarre and surreal scene after another.', 'After his young lover, Gitone, leaves him for another man, Encolpio decides to kill himself, but a sudden earthquake destroys his home before he has a chance to do so. Now wandering around Rome in the time of Nero, Encolpio encounters one bizarre and surreal scene after another.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/83urUMl04GtwuuGIFpezqzi7n6m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11163'),
  ('752572348803062168', 'Saudagar', 1991, 'Drama', 'Subhash Ghai, Ashok Mehta', 'Subhash Ghai, Kamlesh Pandey, Sachin Bhowmick', 'Dilip Kumar, Raaj Kumar, Vivek Mushran, Manisha Koirala, Amrish Puri, Anupam Kher, Deepti Naval, Mukesh Khanna', null, 'Two childhood friends have become bitter enemies. So much so, in fact, that they have divided their territories and sworn to kill anyone who crosses the boundary. Against this backdrop, their grandchildren fall in love and when their romance surfaces, the rivalry between is rekindled. The two young lovers are told never to see each other again, on pain of death ... when they get together, it''s too late for their grand family ..', 'Two childhood friends have become bitter enemies. So much so, in fact, that they have divided their territories and sworn to kill anyone who crosses the boundary. Against this backdrop, their grandchildren fall in love and when their romance surfaces, the rivalry between is rekindled. The two young lovers are told never to see each other again, on pain of death ... when they get together, it''s too late for their grand family ..', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yHK8wCbRiIrpQslQ0G1kni8MbJx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:166017'),
  ('638171785333596689', 'Sauerkrautkoma', 2018, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Ed Herzog, Sebastian Edschmid, Kati Sohler', 'Ed Herzog, Stefan Betz', 'Sebastian Bezzel, Simon Schwarz, Lisa Maria Potthoff, Enzi Fuchs, Eisi Gulp, Gerhard Wittmann, Nora Waldstätten, Gedeon Burkhard', null, 'When a hilariously dull policeman moves in with his best buddy in Munich, he has to deal with scandals, a corpse — and potential marriage.', 'When a hilariously dull policeman moves in with his best buddy in Munich, he has to deal with scandals, a corpse — and potential marriage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xzpxIv0r2B51EMXiufrYOKo7kxu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:526997'),
